  ('009f5ed2-1117-5ee6-bd50-39ff4a7b6c54'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'REPEAT_SENTENCE', E'REPEAT_SENTENCE', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '009f5ed2-1117-5ee6-bd50-39ff4a7b6c54'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'RS', NULL, 'aa166b1b-6370-5681-8320-7d37d683d023'::uuid, NULL, E'She went to the bank to apply for a mortgage for her house.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('00a2adb0-646d-564e-a85a-b022e2b55ee1'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'SELECT_MISSING_WORD', E'SELECT_MISSING_WORD', E'LISTENING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '00a2adb0-646d-564e-a85a-b022e2b55ee1'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Bullet Journaling', E'So for me the act of bullet journaling is an act of thinking, it’s an act of unplugging and actually processing the information, and in my community I’ve found that that’s also provided significant value to people who get caught up in the rush of everyday life. It’s a moment that you can take back. It’s a moment where you can really have the luxury of sitting down and starting to digest the things that you otherwise can easily be overwhelmed by. I think one thing that we often kind of forget is just because something is convenient does not make it efficient. So a lot of times data entry, if you type for example, happens a lot faster but in that process, a lot gets lost because you’re just kind of parroting the source and I think that it’s really important to actually hear what’s being said than just simply kind of spitting it back out onto paper. So when you’re writing a lot of the time what you want to do is reduce the amount of information that you’re capturing only down to...\n\nAt the end of the recording the lost word or group of words has been replaced by a beep. Select the correct option to complete the recording.', '48f47178-c006-5ec0-b3d5-319e9f9160bd'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'what truly matters', NULL, NULL),
  ('00a33a95-094f-5b9d-8f69-92693afe9589'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'REPEAT_SENTENCE', E'REPEAT_SENTENCE', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '00a33a95-094f-5b9d-8f69-92693afe9589'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'RS', NULL, '36282d2d-d671-57d8-98d7-63183d30f95a'::uuid, NULL, E'Now most of the young people are unable to do manual labor.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('00a78d9a-6fee-5fe5-b0fd-71da5873ff64'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DROPDOWN', E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DROPDOWN', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '00a78d9a-6fee-5fe5-b0fd-71da5873ff64'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Essay', E'Essays are used as an assessment tool to {{1}} your ability to research a topic and construct an {{2}} , as well as your understanding of subject content. This does not mean that essays are a ''regurgitation'' of everything your lecturer has said {{3}} the course. Essays are your opportunity to explore in greater {{4}} of the course - theories, issues, texts, etc. and in some cases relate these aspects to a {{5}} context. It is your opportunity to articulate your ideas, but in a {{6}} way: using formal academic style.', NULL, NULL, NULL, E'1.evaluate, 2.argument, 3.throughout, 4.depth, 5.particular, 6.certain', NULL, NULL),
  ('00b73fd3-e784-5981-9a1b-2f991099c809'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'READ_ALOUD', E'READ_ALOUD', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '00b73fd3-e784-5981-9a1b-2f991099c809'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Secondary Health Effects', E'According to a recent study, the occurrence of non-communicable diseases such as hypertension, hyperlipidemia, diabetes, and mental illnesses has risen following the Fukushima disaster and the COVID-19 pandemic. This highlights the need to enhance health promotion strategies and recommendations in the aftermath of such disasters.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('00b7ad73-e161-53a0-b5ed-1aa5d595d562'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DROPDOWN', E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DROPDOWN', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '00b7ad73-e161-53a0-b5ed-1aa5d595d562'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'UK Drivers', E'In the UK, it is recommended that drivers should turn off their car engines when they expect to be stationary for more than 1 minute. To encourage drivers {{1}} off their engines while waiting at rail crossings, the Kent city council placed a permanent sign at the crossing asking drivers to "please switch off your engine when barriers are down to help improve air quality." On {{2}} , drivers had to wait between 2 and 3 minutes to cross after the barrier had gone down. However, the sign didn''t seem to be convincing the {{3}} of drivers to switch off their engines. " {{4}} some research suggests that signs {{5}} can change behavior, the message on this sign was designed simply to be an informational request and was not guided by any particular behavioral theory," the researchers explain. So the research team, led by Rose Mellady of the University of East Anglia, designed an intervention study.', NULL, NULL, NULL, E'1.to turn, 2.average, 3.majority, 4.Although, 5.alone', NULL, NULL),
  ('00c288a7-3ca9-5463-aaca-1a42c78b073c'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'SUMMARIZE_WRITTEN_TEXT', E'SUMMARIZE_WRITTEN_TEXT', E'WRITING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '00c288a7-3ca9-5463-aaca-1a42c78b073c'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Strategic Management', E'Strategic management is a youthful discipline Its origins date back to the 1960s, with its roots to be found mainly in the seminal publications by Chandler, Ansoff and Andrews. Since then, it has evolved significantly, becoming an ever more mature and consolidated field within the realm of management. has evolved significantly, becoming an ever more mature and consolidated field within the realm of management\nThe discipline''s progress toward maturity has been accompanied by several factors. First, there has been a marked increase in the range of topics addressed. a marked increase in the range of topics addressed The study of “best practices” in the 1960s has given way to an analysis of such varied topics as internationalization, cooperation between firms, strategies and competition in the markets for products and factors, strategic leadership, and the relationship between a firm''s strategy and its corporate social responsibility, to mention just a few.\nSecond, there has been significant growth in the range of research methods used, with these becoming steadily more sophisticated. significant growth in the range of research methods used, with these becoming steadily more sophisticated In-depth case studies have been largely replaced by the use of quantitative tools based on complex econometric techniques, multilevel analysis and, more recently, hybrid methodologies, whereby a single study combines quantitative and qualitative techniques, with each being adapted to the nature of the problem to be analyzed.\nThird, and finally, the academic community interested in strategy research has been growing steadily, not just in terms of the number of scholars dedicated to this field but also their international nature as well as the linkages among them. the academic community interested in strategy research has been growing steadily, not just in terms of the number of scholars dedicated to this field but also their international nature as well as the linkages among them If we take our yardstick to be the publication Strategic Management Journal, we can see how cooperation has been increasing between scholars from both an inter-institutional as well as an international perspective. Furthermore, the Strategic Management Society currently has almost 3000 members from more than 80 countries.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 5, 75),
