  ('035ea20c-eba3-5dac-8426-ca02718fb0eb'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'LISTENING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '035ea20c-eba3-5dac-8426-ca02718fb0eb'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'WFD', NULL, '982cd08e-7198-5754-9c9f-df7b7e05b128'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'The best thing about this cheap phone isn''t obvious at first.', NULL, NULL),
  ('036107a1-6b48-572a-992b-f455a01fbd12'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'MC_READING_MULTIPLE', E'MC_READING_MULTIPLE', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '036107a1-6b48-572a-992b-f455a01fbd12'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'MCM-R', E'The cinema did not emerge as a form of mass consumption until its technology evolved from the initial "peepshow" format to the point where images were projected on a screen in a darkened theater. In the peepshow format, a film was viewed through a small opening in a machine that was created for that purpose. Thomas Edison''s peepshow device, the Kinetoscope, was introduced to the public in 1894. It was designed for use in Kinetoscope parlors, or arcades, which contained only a few individual machines and permitted only one customer to view a short, 50-foot film at any one time. The first Kinetoscope parlors contained five machines. For the price of 25 cents (or 5 cents per machine), customers moved from machine to machine to watch five different films (or, in the case of famous prizefights, successive rounds of a single fight).\n\nAccording to paragraph, which of the followings are true of viewing films in Kinetoscope parlors:', NULL, NULL, NULL, E'One individual at a time viewed a film.\nEach film was short.', NULL, NULL),
  ('0361e18b-dc2b-589d-ad24-f15d97d03b39'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'LISTENING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '0361e18b-dc2b-589d-ad24-f15d97d03b39'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'WFD', NULL, '4b6d5027-486a-50ce-9fe6-e41b2dd37570'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'It''s tough but important to work on keeping our planet healthy.', NULL, NULL),
  ('03691b7b-3933-5ab9-8b5b-8358294884ac'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'LISTENING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '03691b7b-3933-5ab9-8b5b-8358294884ac'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'WFD', NULL, '41d57a24-972f-5d21-96e6-13d72bc58cd7'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'We aim to help disabled students to live and study independently.', NULL, NULL),
  ('036f23b7-de99-5400-97f0-a7558f573649'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'RE_TELL_LECTURE', E'RE_TELL_LECTURE', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '036f23b7-de99-5400-97f0-a7558f573649'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Wildlife Adaptation', NULL, '077e5f8b-f2b6-5a5f-917f-79b50abd3f5e'::uuid, NULL, E'Rising temperatures and seas, massive droughts, changing landscapes. Successfully adapting to climate change is growing increasingly important. For humans, this means using our technological advancement to find solutions, like smarter cities and better water management. But for some plants and animals, adapting to these global changes involves the most ancient solution of all: evolution. Evolutionary adaptation usually occurs along time scales of thousands to hundreds of thousands of years. But in cases where species are under especially strong selective conditions, like those caused by rapidly changing climates, adaptive evolution can happen more quickly. In recent decades, we’ve seen many plants, animals, and insects relocating themselves and undergoing changes to their body sizes, and the dates they flower or breed. But many of these are plastic, or nonheritable changes to an individual’s physical traits. And there are limits to how much an organism can change its own physiology to meet environmental requirements. That’s why scientists are seeking examples of evolutionary changes coded in species’ DNA that are heritable, long-lasting, and may provide a key to their future.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('03721b33-0f04-5feb-9c44-0b7a2823467c'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'REPEAT_SENTENCE', E'REPEAT_SENTENCE', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '03721b33-0f04-5feb-9c44-0b7a2823467c'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'RS', NULL, 'cffcd447-899e-5996-947b-5df5281b6fb7'::uuid, NULL, E'The internet provides unique opportunities for students to engage with current events.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
