  ('0a30093f-bb03-5e4b-ada3-4c7927f9d222'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'REPEAT_SENTENCE', E'REPEAT_SENTENCE', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '0a30093f-bb03-5e4b-ada3-4c7927f9d222'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'RS', NULL, '7348357e-65cd-53c6-b7ae-6fea6d34d7ee'::uuid, NULL, E'Extra seminars will be scheduled to assist you with revision.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('0a3316f1-f55d-54d0-aba9-531b773c3bea'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'ANSWER_SHORT_QUESTION', E'ANSWER_SHORT_QUESTION', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '0a3316f1-f55d-54d0-aba9-531b773c3bea'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'ASQ', E'If a couple have a boy and a girl, how many children do they have.', 'e4528e40-aabb-5ac5-8bdf-7ef2d9d15aac'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'2', NULL, NULL),
  ('0a348e69-93dc-5a32-949b-7f93c7f6679c'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DROPDOWN', E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DROPDOWN', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '0a348e69-93dc-5a32-949b-7f93c7f6679c'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Crime', E'Crime is an integral part of everyday life. It is a prominent {{1}} in the news and is a popular subject for fictional portrayal. Most students commencing legal studies will have some experience of crime, whether directly, as a victim of crime or indirectly through exposure to media coverage. This means that most offenses {{2}} on the syllabus, such as murder, theft and rape will be familiar terms. This tends to give students the impression that they know more about criminal law than they do about other subjects on the syllabus. This can be a real disadvantage {{3}} the academic study of criminal law because it tends to lead students to rely on preconceived notion of the nature and scope of the offenses and to reach instinctive, but often legally inaccurate, conclusions. It is absolutely {{4}} to success in criminal law that you put aside any prior knowledge of the offenses and focus on the principles of law derived from statutes and cases. {{5}} doing this, you will soon appreciate just how much difference there is between everyday conceptions of crime and its actuality.', NULL, NULL, NULL, E'1.feature, 2.covered, 3.in terms of, 4.essential, 5.By', NULL, NULL),
  ('0a394f5d-c24e-5169-84e1-01006f4914fa'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'REPEAT_SENTENCE', E'REPEAT_SENTENCE', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '0a394f5d-c24e-5169-84e1-01006f4914fa'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'RS', NULL, '13b73612-4114-5ec0-bc28-35ad9b2ada8b'::uuid, NULL, E'She was making a play for the sales manager''s job.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('0a39907b-1204-52be-a5b8-c3b13a8cce64'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DROPDOWN', E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DROPDOWN', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '0a39907b-1204-52be-a5b8-c3b13a8cce64'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Kiwi', E'A Massey ecologist has teamed up with a leading wildlife photographer to produce the definitive book on New Zealand''s national bird, the kiwi. Kiwi: A Natural History was written by Dr Isabel Castro and {{1}} photographs by Rod Morris. Dr Castro has been working with kiwi {{2}} 1999, with a focus on their behaviour. ''I''ve specifically been looking at the sense of smell that kiwi uses when foraging, but {{3}} in their interactions with their environment and other kiwi,'' she says. The book covers all aspects of kiwi, from their evolution, prehistory and closest relatives to their feeding and breeding behaviour and current conservation issues, {{4}} this the perfect introduction for anyone with an interest in these fascinating birds. The book is the second title in a new {{5}} on New Zealand''s wildlife, targeted at a family readership.', NULL, NULL, NULL, E'1.features, 2.since, 3.also, 4.making, 5.series', NULL, NULL),
  ('0a39ed8d-f58b-5d5c-9987-63452963bffe'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DROPDOWN', E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DROPDOWN', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '0a39ed8d-f58b-5d5c-9987-63452963bffe'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Urban Growth', E'One of the most significant impacts of urbanization is the change in community structures. Traditional, tight-knit communities often give way to more anonymous, individualized urban lives, where social bonds can be more {{1}} and less reliable. The density of urban living conditions can foster a sense of isolation, {{2}} amid crowds, leading to what sociologists term the "urban paradox." Moreover, urbanization often exacerbates socioeconomic inequalities, with {{3}} neighborhoods starkly contrasted against underprivileged areas. This segregation can hinder social cohesion and contribute to increased rates of crime, poverty, and social unrest in cities. Environmental concerns also accompany urban growth, including pollution, waste management issues, and the loss of green spaces. These challenges not only degrade quality of life but also {{4}} questions about the sustainability of urban living models.', NULL, NULL, NULL, E'1.fluid, 2.ironically, 3.affluent, 4.raise', NULL, NULL),
  ('0a3bc3f4-13ae-5833-8fd1-1977fbb10d54'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'READ_ALOUD', E'READ_ALOUD', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '0a3bc3f4-13ae-5833-8fd1-1977fbb10d54'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Smell and Memory', E'When you take a deep whiff of your morning coffee, the smell of those fresh-roasted beans darts into parts of the brain responsible for emotional and memory processing, but our other senses don’t work in the same way. That’s why smell can trigger a happy memory more quickly than touching the hot coffee mug or tasting that first sip.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('0a3c8f37-e25c-5b9b-b048-306e6e3d4317'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'REPEAT_SENTENCE', E'REPEAT_SENTENCE', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '0a3c8f37-e25c-5b9b-b048-306e6e3d4317'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'RS', NULL, '68a3e762-ff4f-50f5-94ad-3b9edb898dc6'::uuid, NULL, E'Our degree is built to prepare you for your career at sea.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('0a3f3563-9642-5c76-9b24-aea7945106a8'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'SUMMARIZE_WRITTEN_TEXT', E'SUMMARIZE_WRITTEN_TEXT', E'WRITING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '0a3f3563-9642-5c76-9b24-aea7945106a8'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Assessment', E'Assessment is a central process in education. If students learned what they were taught, we would never need to assess; we could instead just keep records of what we had taught. But as every teacher knows, many students do not learn what they are taught. Indeed, when we look at their work, it is sometimes hard to believe that they were in the classroom. In fact, it is impossible to predict with any certainty what students will learn as the result of a particular sequence of classroom activities. And because we cannot teach well without finding out where our students are starting from, we have to assess. Even if all our students started out at the same point (a highly unlikely situation), each of them will have reached different understandings of the material being studied within a very short period of time. That is why assessment is the bridge between teaching and learning — it is only through assessment that we can find out whether what has happened in the classroom has produced the learning we intended.\nOf course, assessment is also used for other purposes in education, which makes the picture much more complicated. In all countries, assessments of the performance of individual students are used to determine which students are, and which students are not, qualified for subsequent phases of education, and also to decide which kinds of education students should receive.', NULL, NULL, E'Assessment is a central process in education, as it is impossible to predict with any certainty what students will learn as the result of a particular sequence of classroom activities, so it is only through assessment that we can find out whether what has happened in the classroom has produced the learning we intended, and assessment is also used for other purposes in education.', NULL, 5, 75),
  ('0a475033-3f15-55e0-95c9-851f271bf50c'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'LISTENING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '0a475033-3f15-55e0-95c9-851f271bf50c'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'WFD', NULL, 'f8121cd3-f5d1-5166-8b47-95937581b2b4'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'Service animals have become a common feature of modern society.', NULL, NULL),
  ('0a489f02-0279-55a2-b246-c082ea367059'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'ANSWER_SHORT_QUESTION', E'ANSWER_SHORT_QUESTION', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '0a489f02-0279-55a2-b246-c082ea367059'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'ASQ', E'What is the term for a severe mental disorder in which thoughts and emotions are so impaired that contact is lost with external reality?', 'da72cdc0-e1d9-5bb6-ad3f-221ff677c0e4'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'Schizophrenia', NULL, NULL),
  ('0a49264c-75b2-5cfd-9938-e8552860a07e'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DRAG_AND_DROP', E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DRAG_AND_DROP', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '0a49264c-75b2-5cfd-9938-e8552860a07e'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'New Curricula', E'Though states have moved to replace poorly rated curricula or ban weak instructional approaches, {{1}} out exactly what schools should do instead is harder. Politicians have falsely {{2}} that experts know what science-backed alternatives teachers should use, and education companies have rushed to {{3}} the demand for new materials, {{4}} school districts their own questionable curricula and teacher trainings.', NULL, NULL, NULL, E'1.figuring, 2.declared, 3.meet, 4.selling', NULL, NULL),
  ('0a51c530-7361-5928-8de1-e0ebeea69800'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'REPEAT_SENTENCE', E'REPEAT_SENTENCE', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '0a51c530-7361-5928-8de1-e0ebeea69800'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'RS', NULL, '5ff7a1e2-d91c-5d10-a245-cae2bcf306c7'::uuid, NULL, E'The quality is needed by a successful business manager similar to those of the school.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
