  ('0c53d1ec-3e16-50df-9778-05602ac24d28'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DROPDOWN', E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DROPDOWN', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '0c53d1ec-3e16-50df-9778-05602ac24d28'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Freud''s Theory', E'Freud''s psychosexual theory, leaving questions about its validity, is necessary to be tested scientifically. {{1}} , he never did experiments. Another concern is that the theory is based on case studies versus research. Some have issues with Freud''s theory being focused more on male psychosexual development, {{2}} very little insight into females. It also refers to homosexual preferences as a deviation of normal psychosexual development, though many psychologists {{3}} feel that sexual orientation is more biological in nature and Freud''s theory is {{4}} .', NULL, NULL, NULL, E'1.However, 2.offering, 3.now, 4.one-sided', NULL, NULL),
  ('0c5b3071-5e86-5e41-b8a3-84de908b68f1'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'LISTENING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '0c5b3071-5e86-5e41-b8a3-84de908b68f1'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'WFD', NULL, 'ba6c08d0-53e6-5705-8400-2889455203f7'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'There is no fixed career path for a qualified journalist.', NULL, NULL),
  ('0c5bd6db-fb4d-5d4b-a621-a858b20b43df'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DROPDOWN', E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DROPDOWN', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '0c5bd6db-fb4d-5d4b-a621-a858b20b43df'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Death Sentence', E'You are more likely to be {{1}} to death if you are a member of a minority group within a state that executes defendants. The death penalty disproportionately affects members of racial, ethnic and religious minorities, as well as those living in poverty. In the US, there''s extensive evidence of racial {{2}} on death row. The race of the victim remains the single most reliable factor in {{3}} whether a defendant will be given a death sentence. African American defendants are three times more likely to receive the death penalty than white defendants, where the victims are white. Serious mental health issues are also common in defendants sent to death row. At least one in ten prisoners {{4}} in the US between 1977 and 2007 had experienced severe mental health problems that meant they were literally unable to comprehend the crime they were {{5}} to have committed, and unable to understand the terms of their sentence and imminent execution.', NULL, NULL, NULL, E'1.sentenced, 2.bias, 3.determining, 4.executed, 5.alleged', NULL, NULL),
  ('0c5c4ba7-5c1b-589f-9732-572a5458e30b'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'REPEAT_SENTENCE', E'REPEAT_SENTENCE', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '0c5c4ba7-5c1b-589f-9732-572a5458e30b'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'RS', NULL, 'ecc09277-6b80-55f5-acca-a178fbc62f0a'::uuid, NULL, E'It is argued that students can learn more by collaborating rather than as individuals.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('0c5ec629-c4b0-54d1-8f61-5a8f6bbd889f'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'REPEAT_SENTENCE', E'REPEAT_SENTENCE', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '0c5ec629-c4b0-54d1-8f61-5a8f6bbd889f'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'RS', NULL, '7090d1ee-907b-5afc-9dae-25b3b9e3e9d7'::uuid, NULL, E'The young girl is very knowledgeable about plants diseases and the causes.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('0c6096ed-a9f1-57bf-8fa5-b51edcb591f7'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'RE_TELL_LECTURE', E'RE_TELL_LECTURE', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '0c6096ed-a9f1-57bf-8fa5-b51edcb591f7'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Impact of News', NULL, 'c0cbd502-e8a8-56e3-b730-204fe04c41bb'::uuid, NULL, E'In this era of information, the news media is the pulse of our global society. It''s a powerful entity that shapes perceptions, informs conversations, and can influence public opinion. The integrity of news is vital, as it holds the mirror to the events that shape our times and the stories that stir our collective consciousness. Moreover, the news is not just about conveying information; it''s about context and understanding. As consumers of media, we must be discerning, seeking out sources that prioritize accuracy and depth over sensationalism. As we engage with the world around us, let''s recognize the news media as both a reflection of our reality and a construct that can be shaped for the better. Informed citizens are the bedrock of a dynamic society, and it is our duty to stay informed and be critical thinkers in the age of information. Let''s commit to consuming news that not only informs but also enlightens.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('0c6ba67c-db45-54d9-82ac-475193e4d086'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'ANSWER_SHORT_QUESTION', E'ANSWER_SHORT_QUESTION', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '0c6ba67c-db45-54d9-82ac-475193e4d086'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'ASQ', E'What do we call the sport in which two teams compete to score goals using a spherical ball on a rectangular field with goalposts at each end?', '0e58ff04-4036-5987-a0d7-4fb0034aed80'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'Soccer / Football', NULL, NULL),
  ('0c6cbbf8-b39b-555b-8f80-808770f000aa'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DROPDOWN', E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DROPDOWN', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '0c6cbbf8-b39b-555b-8f80-808770f000aa'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Globalization', E'As a result of globalization, nations with limited resources can access goods and knowledge that help to {{1}} their standards of living. Trade treaties, such as USMCA and the European Union (EU), lower or {{2}} tariffs that restrict the flow of products across borders. Nations with rare resources or specific skills are able to focus on their particular business or commercial strengths and sell their goods to a global market. The Economist magazine has reported that one billion people have been lifted out of poverty thanks to freer trade policies. On the downside, outsourcing allows businesses to {{3}} people as sources of cheap labor required to work under substandard conditions. There is also a trend toward the {{4}} of businesses in many industries, hurting locally owned businesses and damaging local economies.', NULL, NULL, NULL, E'1.raise, 2.abolish, 3.exploit, 4.consolidation', NULL, NULL),
  ('0c6dfd01-0a58-52cf-bc03-497b78fce8c2'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'LISTENING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '0c6dfd01-0a58-52cf-bc03-497b78fce8c2'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'WFD', NULL, '3c3a5da3-2cf7-5a40-8e15-5cfb8a2e9e89'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'Designing a curriculum for a public university presents a moral difficulty.', NULL, NULL),
