  ('0e04a94b-1d19-5d69-84ce-69ebd9da1421'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'LISTENING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '0e04a94b-1d19-5d69-84ce-69ebd9da1421'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'WFD', NULL, 'bd847aac-0f22-5442-85a0-8c6c206a38ea'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'You should include these two pictures from the lecture in your assignment.', NULL, NULL),
  ('0e05807e-348a-5cf7-a5ab-79055167d3e5'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'LISTENING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '0e05807e-348a-5cf7-a5ab-79055167d3e5'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'WFD', NULL, '7f9b8bda-1b5c-5b96-848a-82206c697b4c'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'Protective clothing must always be worn in the laboratory.', NULL, NULL),
  ('0e0b0795-72aa-564e-bd5a-7fe5a45f7934'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'READ_ALOUD', E'READ_ALOUD', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '0e0b0795-72aa-564e-bd5a-7fe5a45f7934'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Wellness', E'Within “wellness” paradigm of care, there would still be a place for use of medications that help people feel differently, at least for a time: sedatives, tranquilizers, and so forth. And you would still want to fund science that seeks to better understand the many pathways to debilitating mood states and to “psychosis” and yes, whatever biological vulnerabilities that may be present.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('0e1b3e43-49c0-5398-8bfe-c5858d2de01d'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'ANSWER_SHORT_QUESTION', E'ANSWER_SHORT_QUESTION', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '0e1b3e43-49c0-5398-8bfe-c5858d2de01d'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'ASQ', E'What do we call a doctor who can sell prescribed medicines?', '3336e785-389d-59d2-b951-4667481d6b30'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'Pharmacist / chemist', NULL, NULL),
  ('0e1cb506-469f-59a1-88b6-4af39e2a2217'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DROPDOWN', E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DROPDOWN', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '0e1cb506-469f-59a1-88b6-4af39e2a2217'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Significance of Instinct', E'What is the significance of instinct in business? Does a reliable gut feeling separate winners from losers? And is it the most valuable emotional tool any entrepreneur can possess? My {{2}} of successful company owners lead me to believe that a highly analytical attitude can be a drawback. At critical junctures in commercial life, risk-taking is more an {{5}} of faith than a carefully balanced choice. Frequently, such moments require {{3}} and absolute conviction above all else. There is simply no time to wait for all the facts, or room for doubt. A computer program cannot tell you how to invent and launch a new product. That {{4}} involves too many unknowns, too much luck — and too much sheer intuition, rather than the infallible {{6}} that machines deliver so well. As Chekhov said: "An artist’s flair is sometimes worth a scientist''s brains" — entrepreneurs need right-brain thinking. When I have been considering whether to buy a company and what price to offer, I have been {{1}} too often by reams of due diligence from the accountants and lawyers. Usually it pays to stand back from such mountains of grey data and weigh up the really important issues-and decide how you feel about the opportunity.', NULL, NULL, NULL, E'1.observations, 2.act, 3.decisiveness, 4.journey, 5.logic, 6.blinded', NULL, NULL),
  ('0e1fb069-b885-5f9d-b7d0-d7883a5125e0'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'READ_ALOUD', E'READ_ALOUD', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '0e1fb069-b885-5f9d-b7d0-d7883a5125e0'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Odor Molecules', E'In fact, a lot of what we perceive as flavor comes from odor molecules that float up to our smell receptors through our mouths. And as with taste, studies have shown the visual cues we get from color help us identify smells more quickly and accurately. In fact, one study found that the source of a smell doesn''t have to be the corresponding color.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('0e202932-aecf-51ab-92d0-1868fc0053fb'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'READ_ALOUD', E'READ_ALOUD', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '0e202932-aecf-51ab-92d0-1868fc0053fb'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Changes in Meaning', E'Most words have experienced several changes in meaning throughout their history, so that it is impossible to say which stage in their meaning is the "true" meaning. And if we attempt to go back to "the beginning", we find it is impossible, for the origins of many words are difficult to trace back.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('0e2301bc-6d80-5c74-82d4-7aeac94c2afd'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'ANSWER_SHORT_QUESTION', E'ANSWER_SHORT_QUESTION', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '0e2301bc-6d80-5c74-82d4-7aeac94c2afd'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'ASQ', E'What do we call a river that flows into a larger river?', '2bbcfcf7-9d89-5b5c-a8bb-deef3b2205c9'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'Tributary', NULL, NULL),
  ('0e2675c0-1b28-573e-bfc3-e0bb89f49b9f'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'READ_ALOUD', E'READ_ALOUD', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '0e2675c0-1b28-573e-bfc3-e0bb89f49b9f'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Natural Processes', E'Sometimes, natural processes can help preserve materials. For example, sediments from floods or volcanic eruptions can encase materials and preserve them. In one case, the chill of an Alpine glacier preserved the body of a man for more than five thousand years.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
