  ('10409f8d-f1a2-5a4f-8916-f8baf38086ed'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DRAG_AND_DROP', E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DRAG_AND_DROP', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '10409f8d-f1a2-5a4f-8916-f8baf38086ed'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Emotional Intelligence', E'The {{1}} to control emotions is crucial to success. In 1990, two scholars {{2}} the term "emotional intelligence". Years later, Daniel Goleman, in the Harvard business {{3}} , was {{4}} why leaders must cultivate this ability. Since then, the concept has influenced the community''s emphasis on integrity and cooperation.', NULL, NULL, NULL, E'1.ability, 2.coined, 3.Review, 4.telling', NULL, NULL),
  ('104311ef-e918-5eb2-b82b-36a52335e704'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DROPDOWN', E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DROPDOWN', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '104311ef-e918-5eb2-b82b-36a52335e704'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Student-run Restaurant', E'The rest of Taylor''s restaurant is student-run. Students in quantity food production and service management {{1}} make the articulate and detailed dishes. "We teach students to understand where a product comes from and to respect that product," Garmy said. Skeptics might doubt the {{2}} of a student-run restaurant, but one visit to Taylor''s will immediately change their outlook. Dishes such as orecchiette and butternut squash, pappardelle with duck and bistro chicken will please any appetite while imparting the need to {{3}} for a second taste. Students are taught to use ratios and proportions rather than recipes when creating dishes. "Understanding ratios and proportions when creating dishes instead of recipes makes students think and {{4}} teaches them how to cook, rather than just reading a recipe and not learning from it," Garmy said. Garmy said he believes in using all aspects of a product, which Taylor''s {{5}} reflects.', NULL, NULL, NULL, E'1.classes, 2.quality, 3.return, 4.actually, 5.menu', NULL, NULL),
