  ('117f24e4-8798-5019-8945-76fe451b8cfc'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DROPDOWN', E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DROPDOWN', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '117f24e4-8798-5019-8945-76fe451b8cfc'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Work and Pleasure', E'To be really happy and really safe, one {{1}} to have at least two or three hobbies, and they must all be real. It is no use starting late in life to say: "I will take an interest in this or that." Such an attempt only {{2}} the strain of mental effort. A man may {{3}} great knowledge of topics unconnected with his daily work, and yet hardly get any benefit or relief. It is no use doing what you like; you have got to like what you do. {{4}} speaking, human being may be divided into three classes: those who are toiled to death, those who are worried to death, and those who are bored to death.', NULL, NULL, NULL, E'1.ought, 2.aggravates, 3.acquire, 4.Broadly', NULL, NULL),
