  ('14315471-25e2-5d7f-986b-0fb9e7002f25'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'LISTENING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '14315471-25e2-5d7f-986b-0fb9e7002f25'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'WFD', NULL, '21a1d2c9-ed9e-58f2-914d-540017f9c4d0'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'The most striking thing about this budget smartphone cannot be seen on its face.', NULL, NULL),
  ('143fdac8-41c7-5ba7-a245-dc1af5e302e0'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'REPEAT_SENTENCE', E'REPEAT_SENTENCE', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '143fdac8-41c7-5ba7-a245-dc1af5e302e0'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'RS', NULL, 'cc15d8a6-4cc7-5c25-9529-cf9b2671a243'::uuid, NULL, E'If you want to receive the reimbursement, you must submit the original receipts.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('14437029-d575-5600-869a-138019868318'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'WRITE_ESSAY', E'WRITE_ESSAY', E'WRITING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '14437029-d575-5600-869a-138019868318'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Foreign Language', E'Children should begin learning a foreign language as soon as they start school. To what extent do you agree with this statement?', NULL, NULL, E'The debate over whether children should begin learning a foreign language as soon as they start school has been ongoing for years. While some people believe that early language learning is beneficial, I believe that it is more important to focus on developing a strong foundation in the native language before introducing a foreign language. This essay will argue that early language learning may hinder overall development and compromise the native language.\nEarly language learning may put excessive pressure on young children and hinder their overall development. Children at a young age need time to develop their cognitive and social skills, and introducing a foreign language may add unnecessary stress and workload. Furthermore, early language learning may take away from other important subjects, such as math and science, that are crucial for future success.\nLanguage learning requires a solid foundation in the native language, which may be compromised if too much focus is placed on learning a foreign language at a young age. Children need to develop strong literacy skills in their native language before they can effectively learn a foreign language. If too much focus is placed on foreign language learning at an early age, it may take away from developing these important foundational skills.\nIn conclusion, I believe that children should not begin learning a foreign language as soon as they start school. While some may argue that early language learning is beneficial, it may actually hinder overall development and compromise the native language. Children need to develop strong foundational skills in their native language before they can effectively learn a foreign language. By focusing on developing these foundational skills first, children will be better equipped to learn a foreign language later in their education.', NULL, 200, 300),
  ('1445bef1-64a8-541e-8382-cdb3a13b890a'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'LISTENING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '1445bef1-64a8-541e-8382-cdb3a13b890a'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'WFD', NULL, '31d26de5-f62a-54f0-b414-c4c4f07b5738'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'Some students have failed to complete a high school education.', NULL, NULL),
  ('14479fff-89ea-550a-a2ac-ac4865e31c46'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'RE_ORDER_PARAGRAPHS', E'RE_ORDER_PARAGRAPHS', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '14479fff-89ea-550a-a2ac-ac4865e31c46'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Carbon Sink', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, E'1, 2, 4, 3', NULL, NULL),
  ('144ed6bf-3c45-5f5b-8db8-c961ac965160'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'SUMMARIZE_WRITTEN_TEXT', E'SUMMARIZE_WRITTEN_TEXT', E'WRITING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '144ed6bf-3c45-5f5b-8db8-c961ac965160'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Sleeping and Napping', E'Could midday napping save your life? If the experience of Greek men is any guide, the answer just may be yes. In a study released yesterday, researchers at the Harvard School of Public Health and in Athens reported that Greeks who took regular 30-minute napping were 37% less likely to die of heart disease over a six-year period than those who never napped. The scientists tracked more than 23,000 adults, finding that the benefits of napping were most pronounced for working men. Researchers have long recognized that Mediterranean adults die of heart disease at a rate lower than Americans and Northern Europeans. Diets rich in olive oil and other heart-healthy foods have received some of the credit, but scientists have been intrigued by the potential role of napping.\nThe study concluded that napping was more likely than diet or physical activity to lower the incidence of heart attacks and other like-ending heart ailments. Specialists not involved with the study said there are sound biochemical reasons to believe that a nap may help protect against heart disease. Essentially, they said, sleep at any time of day acts like a valve to release the stress of everyday life.', NULL, NULL, E'The benefits of napping were most pronounced for working men, while diets rich in olive oil and other heart-healthy foods have received some of the credit, and napping was more likely than diet or physical activity to lower the incidence of heart attacks and other like-ending heart ailments, as sleep at any time of day acts like a valve to release the stress of everyday life.', NULL, 5, 75),
  ('14512d95-35dd-5bce-9f3c-ab0bc9cd13ca'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'LISTENING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '14512d95-35dd-5bce-9f3c-ab0bc9cd13ca'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'WFD', NULL, '07163f3b-15cc-5a72-a13b-98c98a71df8e'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'The college operates a system of continuous assessment.', NULL, NULL),
  ('14588a87-9046-588d-a0eb-0dc563fb39af'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'REPEAT_SENTENCE', E'REPEAT_SENTENCE', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '14588a87-9046-588d-a0eb-0dc563fb39af'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'RS', NULL, 'a4df8064-5023-5033-a86b-e335578b32b4'::uuid, NULL, E'Often, the point of the advertisements is to raise awareness rather than give information.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('14588ebc-5500-5301-9ac7-27c14ac3430c'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'ANSWER_SHORT_QUESTION', E'ANSWER_SHORT_QUESTION', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '14588ebc-5500-5301-9ac7-27c14ac3430c'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'ASQ', E'What is the process of water changing into a gas?', '9cd99673-3d26-550a-8c66-3fa8d0c78c36'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'Evaporation', NULL, NULL),
  ('146039cf-6896-5d33-b20c-e4c5358efe65'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'ANSWER_SHORT_QUESTION', E'ANSWER_SHORT_QUESTION', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '146039cf-6896-5d33-b20c-e4c5358efe65'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'ASQ', E'What is the name of the process where a patient''s blood is purified by a machine, used when kidneys fail?', 'b63588cf-e3ce-5974-bd1e-201d1b775e60'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'Dialysis', NULL, NULL),
  ('1464594c-93af-54ac-a46f-dea7dae1906a'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'RE_TELL_LECTURE', E'RE_TELL_LECTURE', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '1464594c-93af-54ac-a46f-dea7dae1906a'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Batteries', NULL, 'afbe1cfb-63f3-5d2c-a9a9-b4b47bd27c2f'::uuid, NULL, E'Big plants are steady, but they’re not very flexible. – Generally, to power something, you have these huge base load gas plants. – And these are running kind of all the time no matter what, and they’re pretty slow, and you can’t really adjust how much energy they’re creating. – When demand is too low, these big slow plants actually lose money. And when demand is too high, quicker, dirtier plants called peaker plants have to switch on to keep up. And they’re pretty wasteful. – So you kind of get dinged on both sides. You get dinged when you don’t have enough load and then when you have too much, you also get dinged inefficiently. – So, traditional plants aren’t super efficient, but they’re consistent and therefore predictable. Renewable energy can be another story. Solar and wind power is cheap and clean and plentiful, but only when the sun is shining or the wind is blowing. – So, inconsistency is the big worry, that, you know, it’ll be a cloudy day or it’ll be a still day and then all of the sudden, your appliances won’t work, and that’s something that no one really wants. – What makes batteries so promising is that they can solve all of these problems. When paired with big power plants, they can supply energy during peak times without polluting the way that peaker plants do And when paired with renewables, they can jump in when clouds roll over a solar farm. Energy storage really is the missing piece of the puzzle for renewable energy. But when we say storage, we don’t just necessarily mean these. On a super broad level, a battery is like a bank for energy. You deposit energy into it when you don’t need it, and withdraw it when you do. We use electrical energy on the grid, but we can store it as any kind of energy.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('14660faf-c069-51a5-a164-725abc5243e4'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'SUMMARIZE_WRITTEN_TEXT', E'SUMMARIZE_WRITTEN_TEXT', E'WRITING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '14660faf-c069-51a5-a164-725abc5243e4'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Marketing Objective', E'A marketing objective is a marketing target or goal that an organization hopes to achieve such as to boost market share from 9 to 12 per cent within 2 years. Marketing objectives steer the direction of the business. Operating a business without knowing your objectives is like driving a car without knowing where you want to go. Some businesses achieve a degree of success without setting marketing objectives, stumbling across a successful business model by accident. But why should anyone rely on chance? If firms set marketing objectives, the probability of success increases because decision making will be more focused. Marketing objectives must be compatible with the overall objectives of the company. They cannot be set in isolation by the marketing department. Achieving the marketing objective of boosting share from 9 to 12 per cent will help realize a corporate objective of growth. To be effective, marketing objectives should be quantifiable and measurable. Targets should also be set within a time frame. An example of a marketing objective that Nestle might set is "to achieve a 9 per cent increase in the sales of KitKat by the end of next year". A car manufacturer, such as BMW, could set the following marketing objective: "to increase the number of BMW 3 Series cars sold in China from 250,000 to 400,000 over the next 12 months". Setting sales volume targets can be particularly important in industries such as car manufacturing because of the high fixed costs associated with operating in this market. If sales volume can be increased, the high fixed costs of operating will be spread across a greater number of units of output, reducing fixed costs per unit.', NULL, NULL, E'A marketing objective is a marketing target or goal that an organization hopes to achieve, which steers the direction of the business, so if firms set marketing objectives, the probability of success increases because decision making will be more focused, but marketing objectives must be compatible with the overall objectives of the company, while marketing objectives should be quantifiable and measurable, and targets should also be set within a time frame.', NULL, 5, 75),
  ('1470c63d-fbce-5519-adf5-81b6c6dd7e3f'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'ANSWER_SHORT_QUESTION', E'ANSWER_SHORT_QUESTION', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '1470c63d-fbce-5519-adf5-81b6c6dd7e3f'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'ASQ', E'What do you call the strap that circles a person in a car or an airplane?', 'fb320786-7bca-5daa-a560-e13ad8d6c706'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'Seatbelt / safety belt', NULL, NULL),
