  ('1507b8f1-2c61-5960-b04c-0280ce8d6358'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DRAG_AND_DROP', E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DRAG_AND_DROP', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '1507b8f1-2c61-5960-b04c-0280ce8d6358'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'New Zealand', E'The slow process of global warming may have a different {{1}} on various regions. For New Zealand, the emission of carbon dioxide only {{2}} for 0.5% of the world’s total, which has met the governmental standard. However, New Zealand’s effort counts only a tip of the {{3}} . So far, global warming has been a world issue that still hangs in an {{4}} future.', NULL, NULL, NULL, E'1.impact, 2.accounts, 3.iceberg, 4.ambiguous', NULL, NULL),
  ('150977e2-e42c-5727-9fac-8eb4e6583a66'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'SELECT_MISSING_WORD', E'SELECT_MISSING_WORD', E'LISTENING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '150977e2-e42c-5727-9fac-8eb4e6583a66'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Greenhouse Gas', E'How much the Earth''s climate will change in the future depends, among other things, on how quickly and to what extent the concentration of greenhouse gases in the atmosphere increases. If we take no action to limit future greenhouse gas emissions, it is estimated that there will be a rise in temperature of 0.2 to 0.3°C every ten years. This is a far greater rate of warming than anything that has occurred over the past ten thousand years.\nOne set of predictions claims that some regions of the world will warm more quickly than others, and rainfall will also increase in some areas and decrease in others. These changes will affect the sea level, which could rise by 50cm over the next century. All this will affect humans through the effects it has on water resources ...\n\nAt the end of the recording the lost word or group of words has been replaced by a beep. Select the correct option to complete the recording.', '02be7320-6032-567e-8412-f523b0499f3e'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'food production and health', NULL, NULL),
  ('150ed81e-0ad7-5f77-ade8-57414c0e66ab'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DRAG_AND_DROP', E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DRAG_AND_DROP', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '150ed81e-0ad7-5f77-ade8-57414c0e66ab'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Group Dynamics', E'Group dynamics plays a pivotal role in understanding how individuals interact in social settings. This area of sociology examines the patterns of interaction between {{1}} within a group, including the roles they {{2}} , the norms that govern their behavior, and the influence they {{3}} on one another. Understanding group dynamics is crucial for comprehending various social {{4}} , from the formation of social identities to the spread of beliefs and attitudes.', NULL, NULL, NULL, E'1.members, 2.assume, 3.exert, 4.phenomena', NULL, NULL),
  ('150f01e1-094b-50a9-b6e0-f17708c1ba8e'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DROPDOWN', E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DROPDOWN', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '150f01e1-094b-50a9-b6e0-f17708c1ba8e'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Victorian', E'As a historian who''s always {{1}} for the text or the image that makes us re-evaluate the past, I''ve become preoccupied with looking for {{2}} that show our Victorian ancestors smiling. I''ve found quite a few, and — since I started posting them on Twitter — they have been causing quite a {{3}} . People have been surprised to see {{4}} that Victorians had fun and could, and did, laugh. They are noting that the Victorians suddenly seem to become more human as the hundred-or-so years that separate us {{5}} away through our common experience of laughter.', NULL, NULL, NULL, E'1.searching, 2.photographs, 3.stir, 4.evidence, 5.fade', NULL, NULL),
  ('15111537-417f-5d10-b672-ea9d620405c5'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'ANSWER_SHORT_QUESTION', E'ANSWER_SHORT_QUESTION', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '15111537-417f-5d10-b672-ea9d620405c5'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'ASQ', E'What is the study of the distribution and patterns of health and disease conditions in defined populations?', 'ff48a735-73f0-5e5a-bcfd-0f973963d70f'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'Epidemiology', NULL, NULL),
  ('1519dffd-96bb-51e4-88f3-a0af8a6c8640'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'RE_ORDER_PARAGRAPHS', E'RE_ORDER_PARAGRAPHS', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '1519dffd-96bb-51e4-88f3-a0af8a6c8640'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Tourism Industry', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, E'4, 3, 2, 1', NULL, NULL),
  ('152048e8-d2ec-5212-aace-c82095396ed1'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'SELECT_MISSING_WORD', E'SELECT_MISSING_WORD', E'LISTENING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '152048e8-d2ec-5212-aace-c82095396ed1'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Road Rage', E'I don’t understand road rage. It is a problem that is getting worse all over the world. People are turning into monsters when they get behind the wheel of a car. They think the road belongs to them. They think they don’t have to follow speed limits or consider other drivers. I wonder why this is. What is it about cars and driving that turns normal people into maniacs? Some people simply hoot and shake their fists. The funny thing is that they also do the same things to make other drivers angry. Serious road rage happens when someone gets out of their car and gets angry. They can punch the other diver and sometimes even kill them. Why would you want to kill someone because they overtook you?\n\nAt the end of the recording the lost word or group of words has been replaced by a beep. Select the correct option to complete the recording.', 'e7fe82cb-c3db-5711-a4f0-22f5ef2dfafe'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'Crazy', NULL, NULL),
  ('1528913f-cbac-5816-bd1d-82dc9269b1bc'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'SUMMARIZE_WRITTEN_TEXT', E'SUMMARIZE_WRITTEN_TEXT', E'WRITING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '1528913f-cbac-5816-bd1d-82dc9269b1bc'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Journey Through Words', E'Literature is a timeless treasure trove of human expression and imagination. Through the written word, authors have crafted stories, poems, and plays that transport readers to different worlds, evoke emotions, and challenge perspectives. Let''s embark on a journey to explore the rich tapestry of literary works that have left an indelible mark on our hearts and minds. One of the most celebrated literary works is "To Kill a Mockingbird" by Harper Lee. This novel, set in the American South during the 1930s, delves into issues of racism, justice, and morality through the eyes of young Scout Finch. With its powerful themes and memorable characters, "To Kill a Mockingbird" continues to be a thought-provoking and influential work. In the realm of poetry, the works of Emily Dickinson stand out. Her concise yet profound poems explore themes of nature, love, and the human experience. Dickinson''s unique style and use of imagery have made her one of the most beloved and studied poets in American literature. Shakespeare''s plays, including "Romeo and Juliet," "Hamlet," and "Macbeth," remain timeless classics. His mastery of language, intricate plots, and exploration of universal themes like love, ambition, and power have ensured his enduring legacy in the world of literature. Contemporary literature has also produced remarkable works. Arundhati Roy''s "The God of Small Things" is a modern masterpiece that weaves a complex narrative of family, love, and societal norms in India. The novel''s lyrical prose and evocative storytelling have earned it critical acclaim and a dedicated readership. Literary works have the power to transcend time and place, offering readers a window into the human condition. Each work carries its own unique voice and perspective, inviting us to reflect on our own lives and the world around us. As we delve into the pages of these literary treasures, we embark on a journey of discovery, empathy, and enlightenment, finding solace and inspiration in the beauty of words.', NULL, NULL, E'Literature is a timeless treasure trove of human expression and imagination, through which authors have crafted stories and plays that transport readers to different worlds, and literary works have the power to transcend time and place, each of which carries its own unique voice and perspective, so as we delve into the pages of these literary treasures, we embark on a journey of discovery, empathy, and enlightenment.', NULL, 5, 75),
  ('152d4b08-c6ca-571f-b6d0-2b3824658040'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'LISTENING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '152d4b08-c6ca-571f-b6d0-2b3824658040'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'WFD', NULL, '9563c449-fe0d-518e-ad74-be7a6208f8e0'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'These students will become the greatest scientists at all times.', NULL, NULL),
  ('15389b18-f28f-5254-afdf-52f1ca4618ad'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'SELECT_MISSING_WORD', E'SELECT_MISSING_WORD', E'LISTENING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '15389b18-f28f-5254-afdf-52f1ca4618ad'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'SMW', E'The interior of a cave is divided into three zones. The entrance zone may serve as a place of shelter for animals or people. Prehistoric humans used entrance zones of caves as shelters and burial grounds. Therefore, such zones are of interest to archaeologists as they provide clues to the habitat of early human beings. The next zone is called the twilight zone. The twilight zone is sheltered from direct sunlight and his home to a large, diverse population of animals, such as salamanders, bats, and during severe winters bears the third zone. The dark zone is the true cave environment, perpetually dark, it has only slight seasonal changes in.\n\nAt the end of the recording the lost word or group of words has been replaced by a beep. Select the correct option to complete the recording.', '83c60dc4-ae9f-52f1-a325-0805795425ab'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'in temperature', NULL, NULL),
  ('153d09b7-e800-5b7d-b96c-92d8daf2fc2d'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'READ_ALOUD', E'READ_ALOUD', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '153d09b7-e800-5b7d-b96c-92d8daf2fc2d'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Twitter', E'Twitter, a social network, will reportedly join forces with Bloomberg, a media company, to produce a 24-hour video news service. Twitter has made strides in adding users in recent quarters, but not in boosting profits. Jack Dorsey, a co-founder who recently returned as CEO, introduced limited live video broadcasts at the site, which were seen by 45m unique viewers in the first quarter of 2017.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('153ea940-aa5d-5f3d-9717-c424f13d6b47'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DROPDOWN', E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DROPDOWN', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '153ea940-aa5d-5f3d-9717-c424f13d6b47'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Saving and Investing', E'Let’s be honest: saving and investing may be necessary, but they often can feel like a {{1}} . Both become a lot more rewarding, however, when you think of them as more than just spreading your money across different investment categories, such as stocks and bonds, to {{2}} a seemingly far-off, no-guarantees future. Benz encourages everyone to focus on what she calls your “time on earth” allocation. That is, think about what is important to you and what you really want to spend more of your time doing -- not just in retirement but today and in the foreseeable future. Setting up your finances to support that goal can {{3}} saving and investing from fulfilling an obligation to creating a financial freedom fund for yourself. Here are three key ways to get started: Figure out how you are {{4}} your income between spending and investing. “How are you deploying your income stream? Are you making smart decisions to deploy that capital across your financial opportunities?” Benz said.', NULL, NULL, NULL, E'1.chore, 2.fund, 3.transform, 4.allocating', NULL, NULL),
  ('1542f5fc-ddc0-5acd-a59e-005ff7980ff0'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'ANSWER_SHORT_QUESTION', E'ANSWER_SHORT_QUESTION', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '1542f5fc-ddc0-5acd-a59e-005ff7980ff0'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'ASQ', E'What is the natural satellite of Earth?', 'e408a794-d2be-5e6b-ba93-39fd84ac265a'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'Moon', NULL, NULL),
  ('1546b038-8da1-5d34-8544-c8055ef10ccf'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'REPEAT_SENTENCE', E'REPEAT_SENTENCE', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '1546b038-8da1-5d34-8544-c8055ef10ccf'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'RS', NULL, '13ab10ab-8e1b-57ca-8f01-c7f134e37312'::uuid, NULL, E'His tone tonight was nothing short of jealousy.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
