  ('19e421fc-4825-5443-8d0e-602bf15b7440'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DRAG_AND_DROP', E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DRAG_AND_DROP', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '19e421fc-4825-5443-8d0e-602bf15b7440'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Computer Science', E'While computer science focuses on the theoretical underpinnings of computing, information technology {{1}} these principles to solve real-world problems. By studying computer science, you {{2}} insights into the development of algorithms and software, while a focus on information technology {{3}} you with the skills to implement and manage computer systems in a business environment. Whether you want to create new applications or improve existing systems, you will {{4}} from combining computer science and information technology.', NULL, NULL, NULL, E'1.applies, 2.gain, 3.equips, 4.benefit', NULL, NULL),
  ('19e6ea97-179c-5908-80a1-35996d43738d'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DROPDOWN', E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DROPDOWN', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '19e6ea97-179c-5908-80a1-35996d43738d'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'ClearFarm', E'ClearFarm will be the first platform to provide non-stop, real-time information on animal welfare. Consumers and producers will be able to view information from every single animal on the farm, every single day of the year. The approach {{1}} on precision livestock farming, or PLF, which involves using modern tools like sensors, AI data processing, and automation to gather data and optimize farm output. The idea is to strap wearable sensors to the animals that {{2}} collect data on activity, diet, and overall health. Not only will farmers be able to {{3}} quickly and more responsibly when the system detects a health problem in one of their livestock, but the system will also open a window into the real-time comfort, emotional state, and behavior of these animals. Although precision livestock farming is, for the moment, a very niche approach, it is expanding fast and could conceivably become the norm {{4}} by surging labor costs and growing demand for protein and dairy products.', NULL, NULL, NULL, E'1.hinges, 2.continuously, 3.intervene, 4.driven', NULL, NULL),
  ('19ea6294-fd04-5b31-9088-b8ee3c24f7a9'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'REPEAT_SENTENCE', E'REPEAT_SENTENCE', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '19ea6294-fd04-5b31-9088-b8ee3c24f7a9'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'RS', NULL, '33cc6921-5dd4-5b4b-86da-4a75321d6dc8'::uuid, NULL, E'Now, universities compete for excellence in environmental conservation and sustainability efforts.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('19eb1f2d-1ef6-5875-af22-cee00c01efbe'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'READ_ALOUD', E'READ_ALOUD', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '19eb1f2d-1ef6-5875-af22-cee00c01efbe'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Exercise', E'Exercise can reverse damage to sedentary, aging hearts and help prevent risk of future heart failure -- if it''s enough exercise, and if it''s begun in time, according to a new study by cardiologists.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('19eb5a49-125f-547b-ad21-f2d82d39a41d'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'RE_TELL_LECTURE', E'RE_TELL_LECTURE', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '19eb5a49-125f-547b-ad21-f2d82d39a41d'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Earth v.s. Mars', NULL, '0a71583e-c0ba-56af-bcea-ee98d71c7491'::uuid, NULL, E'Scientists often compare the conditions on the Earth and Mars to evaluate the habitability of Mars. There are some similarities between Earth and Mars. Both planets have polar caps, atmospheres, and evidence of a water‐related climate. The lecture also describes different forms of water on Earth and Mars. On Earth, it exists as oceans, while on Mars, water is present in the form of ice. Despite these similarities, however, there are still lots of differences between the two worlds. Even the most inhabitable areas on the earth are way different from those on Mars. In preparing for the Phoenix Mission, scientists have conducted Antarctica trial runs. During these tests, researchers dug trenches, collected samples, and examined the ice‐soil boundary. These Antarctic experiments serve as practical simulations, helping scientists get ready for investigations on Mars.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('19ef7618-192c-5b0b-bae6-995b35e34035'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'RE_TELL_LECTURE', E'RE_TELL_LECTURE', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '19ef7618-192c-5b0b-bae6-995b35e34035'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Solar Power', NULL, '84056972-d1e1-5dfd-95be-0ed4063a4ba9'::uuid, NULL, E'So then begs the question, what if we cover the entire desert with solar panels? How much energy would we actually be able to produce and how would this change our planet? Let’s take a deep dive. For starters, let’s begin here. This is the where’s that solar power station in Morocco, the world’s largest concentrated solar power plant currently in existence in a marvel of modern engineering. Once fully completed and operational, the plant will take up an area of 25 square kilometers and be capable of producing 582 megawatts of electricity. It will even be capable of storing solar energy in the form of superheated molten salt, which allows for further production of electricity even into the night. After investing more than 9 billion dollars into their solar energy objective, Morocco aims to create 4 additional plants similar to this one in the Sahara that will collectively create more than 2000 megawatts of electricity production which will be enough to provide for roughly 38% of all of Morocco’s annual electricity needs. This project will transform Morocco into the world’s leading solar energy state, and as the only African country that currently has a power cable linked to Europe, much of this energy will be exported for profit to the countries of the European Union. But all of this energy is created from just five relatively small plants.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('19f09d47-5edd-56c3-b3e7-009750fa0393'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'ANSWER_SHORT_QUESTION', E'ANSWER_SHORT_QUESTION', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '19f09d47-5edd-56c3-b3e7-009750fa0393'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'ASQ', E'What do we call the type of energy that uses uranium to generate electricity?', '765cc541-9dd1-5d50-8136-fedf1ffe4d05'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'Nuclear energy / Nuclear power', NULL, NULL),
  ('19f0bbb2-2c2d-5abd-be1c-810867406756'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DROPDOWN', E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DROPDOWN', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '19f0bbb2-2c2d-5abd-be1c-810867406756'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Speaking Tone', E'To watch your tone and use it to your advantage, you need to practice managing your voice and taking note of how you sound. You also need to be {{1}} the impact your tone of voice has on your listener. A soft tone of voice can suggest lack of confidence, while a loud tone of voice can seem aggressive. A high-pitched tone of voice can indicate immaturity and defensiveness, {{2}} a low-pitched tone of voice can make you seem authoritative and serious. A slow pace can help your listener understand and {{3}} your message, while a fast pace can make you seem nervous and unclear. A modulated tone of voice can express your emotion and personality, while a monotone tone of voice can bore your listener. Your tone of voice in communication is a powerful tool that can help you get what you want in relationships, your career and your life. By {{4}} your tone and using it wisely, you can communicate more effectively and authentically with others.', NULL, NULL, NULL, E'1.aware of, 2.whereas, 3.absorb, 4.watching', NULL, NULL),
  ('19fc216b-ed69-57ee-81b6-09f63b0096c7'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'REPEAT_SENTENCE', E'REPEAT_SENTENCE', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '19fc216b-ed69-57ee-81b6-09f63b0096c7'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'RS', NULL, '76bf1555-fe43-5c14-88b3-45ef3e8b1910'::uuid, NULL, E'Please save questions related to the topic for the end of the discussion.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
