  ('1a8479c5-2993-5a7f-9e07-46736e00bb06'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'REPEAT_SENTENCE', E'REPEAT_SENTENCE', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '1a8479c5-2993-5a7f-9e07-46736e00bb06'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'RS', NULL, 'f2a842f6-6a3a-59d5-9275-9d18e0fd0767'::uuid, NULL, E'The lecture tomorrow will discuss the educational policies in the United States.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('1a863915-3b2f-5938-993f-91a8e62fcad3'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'LISTENING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '1a863915-3b2f-5938-993f-91a8e62fcad3'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'WFD', NULL, '7ba8976e-d6ed-5593-9278-884f622cc35f'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'The posters are on display in the larger lecture theater.', NULL, NULL),
  ('1a86ffc6-5736-5ca9-8422-f5d1281307c2'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'READ_ALOUD', E'READ_ALOUD', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '1a86ffc6-5736-5ca9-8422-f5d1281307c2'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Arctic Ocean', E'It may not be very well known, but the Arctic Ocean leaks enormous amounts of the potent greenhouse gas methane. These leaks have been ongoing for thousands of years but could be intensified by a future warmer ocean. The potential for this gas to escape the ocean, and contribute to the greenhouse gas budget in the atmosphere, is an important mystery that scientists are trying to solve.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('1a8d4544-1ef4-54bd-86cf-5ee322cf30bc'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'ANSWER_SHORT_QUESTION', E'ANSWER_SHORT_QUESTION', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '1a8d4544-1ef4-54bd-86cf-5ee322cf30bc'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'ASQ', E'What is the last game in a sports competition that decides the champion called?', 'eb90228d-e4a3-5959-a649-50e1f15d6243'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'Final', NULL, NULL),
  ('1a8f61cc-3ace-5064-b8cf-a258f389359a'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'ANSWER_SHORT_QUESTION', E'ANSWER_SHORT_QUESTION', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '1a8f61cc-3ace-5064-b8cf-a258f389359a'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'ASQ', E'What is the term for a self-operating machine, often programmable by a computer, capable of carrying out a complex series of actions?', '97f6bbaf-badd-51ac-a7b1-1fdd9714d1c9'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'Robot', NULL, NULL),
  ('1a9b3a24-23a1-5953-a66b-cbc710c41d46'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'READ_ALOUD', E'READ_ALOUD', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '1a9b3a24-23a1-5953-a66b-cbc710c41d46'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Films', E'Since their emergence, films have played a significant role in the lives of people around the world. Movies have the power to share new ideas and teach lessons about the past or future. Sometimes, films only exist to entertain us. Just like there are many different styles of art, there are many different styles of film.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('1a9d29fd-05d3-5c36-8c2e-0967fa1be09a'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'LISTENING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '1a9d29fd-05d3-5c36-8c2e-0967fa1be09a'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'WFD', NULL, '9ca3f22e-cf8a-5123-9ad4-097a62024feb'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'You must change your password every month.', NULL, NULL),
  ('1aa87eb9-1c01-5412-b7cd-c4fea2f5185e'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'RE_TELL_LECTURE', E'RE_TELL_LECTURE', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '1aa87eb9-1c01-5412-b7cd-c4fea2f5185e'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Best Thoughts', NULL, 'f34444b1-6a3f-5dce-97e7-fadf33c5ea7d'::uuid, NULL, E'The primary obstacle to good thinking is not a cramped desk or an uninteresting horizon. It is, first and foremost, anxiety. Often the most profound thoughts we need to grapple with have a potentially disturbing character. As these potential implications start to come vaguely into view, our inner censor, motivated by a desire for calm rather than growth, gets alarmed. A vigilant part of the self gets agitated; it distracts us, it makes us feel tired or gives us a strong need to go online. Skillfully, it confuses and muddles our train of thought. It blocks the progress we were starting to make towards ideas that – though important and interesting – also presented marked threats to short-term inner peace. It’s in this context that the shower emerges as so helpful to the way our minds work and earns the right to be honored as one of the best places on earth in which to do any kind of serious reflection. Amidst the crashing water and the steam and with a few minutes of respite before the day starts, the mind is no longer on guard. We’re not supposed to be doing much inside our heads; we’re mainly occupied with trying to soap our backs and properly rinse our hair. The ideas that have been half-forming at the back of our minds, ideas about what the true purpose of our lives might be and what we should do next, keep up their steady inward pressure – but now there is a lot less to stop them reaching full consciousness. We’re not meant to be thinking and so – at last – we can think freely and courageously.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('1aaa7d22-0259-54c9-b996-2b60cd234f78'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'READ_ALOUD', E'READ_ALOUD', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '1aaa7d22-0259-54c9-b996-2b60cd234f78'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Genetically Modified Cotton', E'Cotton plants native to Mexico may all look the same — unkempt and untamed bushes with flowers that shift from pale yellow to violet as pollinators visit them. But genes from genetically modified cotton crops have made some of these native plants fundamentally different, changing their biology and the way they interact with insects.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('1ab476ed-84e8-5d8f-a77b-3791e90b1e89'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'LISTENING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '1ab476ed-84e8-5d8f-a77b-3791e90b1e89'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'WFD', NULL, 'cbd02cca-56a3-5338-a5bf-7bb663804498'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'Students often conduct research to enhance their knowledge.', NULL, NULL),
  ('1ab95c49-5377-59a7-afc1-ef2e922359e2'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'MC_LISTENING_SINGLE', E'MC_LISTENING_SINGLE', E'LISTENING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '1ab95c49-5377-59a7-afc1-ef2e922359e2'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'MCS-L', E'Art therapy can be defined as a form of psychotherapy which uses art as its main means of communication, Patients needn''t have any particular talent in art, since the art therapist is not concerned with making an assessment of what the patient produces. The principle aim of this kind of therapy is to facilitate the patient''s well-being in order to bring change and growth on a personal level through the use of art materials. Obviously, as always, the relationship between the therapist and the patient is important but art therapy differs from other psychological therapies because it''s a process between the patient, the therapist and the art. So, what we''ve found is. the expressive nature of this therapy is particularly successful with those who have difficulty expressing themselves verbally.\n\nWhat is an important rationale for art therapy?', 'ce7a5acf-0035-57b7-8c68-8e9be1ca799b'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'It is suitable for less orally communicative patients.', NULL, NULL),
  ('1ac2b692-fa90-58c6-9117-ee6dff4a03ea'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'READ_ALOUD', E'READ_ALOUD', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '1ac2b692-fa90-58c6-9117-ee6dff4a03ea'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Organelles', E'Organelles are the biggest difference between bacteria and cells that make up the human body Organelles. You are a eukaryote. Your cells are eukaryotic. Eukaryotic cells contain membrane-bound organelles, including a nucleus. Eukaryotes can be single-celled or multi-celled, such as you, me, plants, fungi, and insects.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('1ac38ccb-9e1e-51ad-8ed7-6a8f70a70094'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'WRITE_ESSAY', E'WRITE_ESSAY', E'WRITING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '1ac38ccb-9e1e-51ad-8ed7-6a8f70a70094'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Physical and Mental', E'What is the relationship between physical exercise and mental health?', NULL, NULL, E'Physical exercise plays a pivotal role in shaping mental health, with its positive impact extending beyond physical well-being. The relationship between physical exercise and mental health is profound, with exercise catalyzing enhancing mood, cognition, and emotional well-being.\nOne of the key mechanisms through which physical exercise influences mental health is the release of endorphins. Exercise triggers the production of endorphins, often referred to as "feel-good" hormones, which have a direct impact on mood regulation and stress reduction. The surge of endorphins during and after exercise creates a sense of euphoria, boosts overall mood, and helps alleviate stress and anxiety, contributing to improved mental well-being.\nRegular physical exercise is associated with enhanced cognitive function, improved memory retention, and overall mental well-being. Engaging in physical activity stimulates brain activity, promotes neural growth, and enhances cognitive abilities, leading to sharper focus, better memory recall, and a more resilient mind. Additionally, physical activity plays a crucial role in reducing symptoms of anxiety and depression by promoting the release of neurotransmitters such as serotonin and dopamine. These neurotransmitters are known to improve mood, reduce feelings of anxiety and depression, and foster a sense of well-being.\nIn conclusion, the relationship between physical exercise and mental health is undeniable, with exercise serving as a powerful tool for enhancing mood, cognition, and emotional well-being. The release of endorphins enhanced cognitive function, and reduction of anxiety and depression are key mechanisms through which physical exercise positively impacts mental health. Embracing a physically active lifestyle is not only beneficial for physical health but also essential for nurturing a healthy mind and promoting overall well-being.', NULL, 200, 300),
  ('1accc429-a65b-56f0-9dc9-47fe566da6c9'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'ANSWER_SHORT_QUESTION', E'ANSWER_SHORT_QUESTION', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '1accc429-a65b-56f0-9dc9-47fe566da6c9'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'ASQ', E'What do you call a number that cannot be divided by two without leaving a remainder?', '6276a95a-030f-59ce-aba2-6b42b3db077b'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'Odd', NULL, NULL),
  ('1acd88b5-3ff5-5a16-a951-2937c9fc9fd8'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'REPEAT_SENTENCE', E'REPEAT_SENTENCE', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '1acd88b5-3ff5-5a16-a951-2937c9fc9fd8'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'RS', NULL, 'b73a0038-e5ef-5b5d-9be8-6a4fd64968e2'::uuid, NULL, E'The price of oil should remain stable for the rest of the year.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('1acfd606-bfe8-5205-96b9-6e549aff465f'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DROPDOWN', E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DROPDOWN', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '1acfd606-bfe8-5205-96b9-6e549aff465f'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Flexibility', E'Engineers would love to embed flexible {{1}} into things like paper, or surgical gloves or conventional clothing. But the wiring usually gets twisted and damaged. Now M.I.T. {{2}} have found inspiration in an {{3}} place—the annoying air pockets that pop up in parking pass stickers on car windows.\nThose bubbles arise because the thin sticker film expands at a different rate than the window glass when they both heat up. And the opposite is also true—the material can compress differently than the glass until it separates and blisters form.\nThe scientists were {{4}} this kind of wrinkling behavior. They developed a model that predicted the formation, size and evolution of the bubbles that depends on three things: the elasticity of the film and the glass, and the strength of the bond between them.\nThen they realized that carefully controlled delamination could be applied to make elastic electronics. Wires in the bubbly elastic material would start out only partially attached to a surface. So there''d be some slack allowing for safe stretching and {{5}} . The work appears in the Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences, and shows that a different {{6}} can make a tough problem less sticky.', NULL, NULL, NULL, E'1.electronics, 2.researchers, 3.unlikely, 4.studying, 5.twisting, 6.approach', NULL, NULL),
  ('1ad08369-7b02-52f4-adb2-f323565a2134'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'REPEAT_SENTENCE', E'REPEAT_SENTENCE', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '1ad08369-7b02-52f4-adb2-f323565a2134'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'RS', NULL, 'e9369d4c-20b7-5dd4-a86c-9735d8ff070b'::uuid, NULL, E'This activity will consider children of different ages and stages.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('1ad448de-d6d5-5e57-95fb-72f2a7cb560f'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'REPEAT_SENTENCE', E'REPEAT_SENTENCE', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '1ad448de-d6d5-5e57-95fb-72f2a7cb560f'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'RS', NULL, '8ee28863-4c7c-51bb-9bab-10cf1acca59c'::uuid, NULL, E'Mental health is important at every stage of life, from childhood through adulthood.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('1ad50a13-f9d4-562b-9c3c-86df3758855c'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DRAG_AND_DROP', E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DRAG_AND_DROP', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '1ad50a13-f9d4-562b-9c3c-86df3758855c'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Long-Lost Paint', E'The technique used to find long-lost paint on sculptures is known as visible-induced luminescence imaging. The process uses infrared light that finds microscopic {{1}} of paint that the eye cannot see. By {{2}} the sculptures with the red light, a pigment known as “Egyptian blue” absorbs the light and appears on camera as a {{3}} white.', NULL, NULL, NULL, E'1.traces, 2.illuminating, 3.glowing', NULL, NULL),
  ('1ad90aad-60f0-5424-b8f4-ff6438191e1d'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'RE_TELL_LECTURE', E'RE_TELL_LECTURE', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '1ad90aad-60f0-5424-b8f4-ff6438191e1d'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Good Listeners', NULL, '3a2c5b9a-c6a4-5d48-81d1-2fcd4bd3436d'::uuid, NULL, E'So, what can we do to become better listeners? At its core, listening in a one-on-one conversation is about taking an interest in another person and making them feel understood. There’s no universally agreed upon definition of high-quality listening, but some recurring features include: attentiveness, conveying understanding, and showing a positive intention towards the speaker. This doesn’t mean you can simply go through the motions. Researchers have found that merely smiling and nodding at set intervals doesn’t quite work. However, there is something slightly performative about listening in that it’s important to show you’re doing it. So, in addition to actively attending to a speaker’s words, good listeners also use questions and body language that indicate their understanding and their desire to understand. This might feel awkward at first, and what’s most effective might depend on your relationship with the speaker. But with time and practice you can internalize these basic behaviors.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('1ae1dc2f-e437-580a-90ca-a73960401bd3'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'REPEAT_SENTENCE', E'REPEAT_SENTENCE', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '1ae1dc2f-e437-580a-90ca-a73960401bd3'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'RS', NULL, '1955a082-88e2-5041-8afe-02771437c40c'::uuid, NULL, E'Fungi are important in the process of decay, which returns ingredients to the soil, enhances soil fertility, and decomposes animal debris.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('1aecc075-5885-5960-8486-473c9ae4dc7d'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'SUMMARIZE_WRITTEN_TEXT', E'SUMMARIZE_WRITTEN_TEXT', E'WRITING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '1aecc075-5885-5960-8486-473c9ae4dc7d'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Giant Panda', E'According to the report, formally known as the Fourth National Giant Panda Survey, the geographic range of pandas throughout China also increased. The total area inhabited by wild giant pandas in China now equals 2,577,000 hectares, an expansion of 11.8% since 2003. "These results are a testament to the conservation achievements of the Chinese government," said Xiaohai Liu, executive director of programs, WWF-China. "A lot of good work is being done around wild giant panda conservation, and the government has done well to integrate these efforts and partner with conservation organizations including WWF. The report, the fourth in a series of decadal (10-year) surveys conducted by the State Forestry Administration of China, began in 2011 with financial and technical support from WWF. Much of the success in increasing the panda population comes as a result of conservation policies implemented by the Chinese government, including the Natural Forest Protection Project and Grain for Green. The report found that 1,246 wild giant pandas live within nature reserves, accounting for 66.8% of the total wild population, and the habitat within nature reserves accounts for 53.8% of the total habitat area. There are currently 67 panda nature reserves in China, an increase of 27 since the last report. "WWF is pleased to witness this significant conservation achievement — the increase of both the wild giant panda population size and habitat area over last ten years," said Liu. "The survey result demonstrates the effectiveness of nature reserves in boosting wild giant panda numbers."', NULL, NULL, E'The geographic range of pandas throughout China increased, which is a testament to the conservation achievements of the Chinese government and the effectiveness of nature reserves in boosting wild giant panda numbers, with 1,246 wild giant pandas living within nature reserves, accounting for 66.8% of the total wild population, and the habitat within nature reserves accounting for 53.8% of the total habitat area.', NULL, 5, 75),
  ('1af33e05-e8b0-5163-8ba3-3c36c011e275'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'READ_ALOUD', E'READ_ALOUD', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '1af33e05-e8b0-5163-8ba3-3c36c011e275'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Selective History', E'History is selective. What history books tell us about the past is not everything that happened, but what historians have selected. They cannot put in everything: choices have to be made. Choices must similarly be made about which aspects of the past should be formally taught to the next generation in the shape of school history lessons.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
