  ('1af8ded6-7bba-5f17-9d5b-025be4add21c'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'REPEAT_SENTENCE', E'REPEAT_SENTENCE', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '1af8ded6-7bba-5f17-9d5b-025be4add21c'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'RS', NULL, 'b5d5c7e0-29f4-5851-ab09-c945251ac656'::uuid, NULL, E'The new drug will be tested in North America.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('1b027b58-4ade-5962-93fe-882f9e766cec'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DROPDOWN', E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DROPDOWN', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '1b027b58-4ade-5962-93fe-882f9e766cec'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'HK Marine', E'Understanding the number of species we have in our marine environment is a {{1}} need if we are to protect and conserve our biodiversity. {{2}} is vital in today''s rapidly changing world, not just here in Hong Kong, but especially in Southeast Asia which holds the world''s most diverse marine habitats. SWIMS is playing a major role in trying to measure and conserve these important resources, both within Hong Kong but also, together with its regional collaborators, in Southeast Asia." said Professor Gray A. Williams, the leader of this study and the Director of HKU SWIMS. The enormous array of marine life in Hong Kong, however, has yet to receive its desirable level of conservation as currently only less than 2% of Hong Kong''s marine area {{3}} as marine parks or reserves as compared with approximately 40% of our terrestrial area. The Government has committed to designate more new marine parks in the coming years. The Brothers Marine Park in the northern Lantau waters {{4}} soon, which will bring Hong Kong''s total protected marine area to more than 2%. The research team welcomed the initiative of the new marine park {{5}} also urging the Hong Kong government to move towards the global target of at least 10% marine protected area by the year 2020 under United Nation''s Convention on Biological Diversity (CBD).', NULL, NULL, NULL, E'1.basic, 2.This, 3.is protected, 4.will be launched, 5.while', NULL, NULL),
  ('1b13297a-938c-5f4a-a84f-544c27679d83'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'REPEAT_SENTENCE', E'REPEAT_SENTENCE', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '1b13297a-938c-5f4a-a84f-544c27679d83'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'RS', NULL, '6af68671-cfb0-5be3-93ba-370c9fe9665c'::uuid, NULL, E'There is only one conclusion to this line of thought.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('1b1aaa84-8761-5360-b3b8-85d9e13cf4d8'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'SUMMARIZE_WRITTEN_TEXT', E'SUMMARIZE_WRITTEN_TEXT', E'WRITING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '1b1aaa84-8761-5360-b3b8-85d9e13cf4d8'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Anti-inflammatory Food', E'Research hasn’t looked specifically at the anti-inflammatory benefits of eating foods that are in season. "But it’s generally accepted that eating what’s in season is likely to be fresher and obviously there are other benefits, including those for the environment," says Natalie McCormick, a research fellow in medicine at Harvard Medical School. Eating foods that are in season may also help your grocery bill. When it comes to anti-inflammatory foods, the goal should be to incorporate as many as you can into your overall diet. "Our emphasis now is on eating patterns, because it seems that interactions between foods and their combinations have a greater effect than individual foods," says McCormick. Three diets in particular, she says, contain the right mix of elements: The Mediterranean diet, the DASH diet, and the Alternative Healthy Eating Index. These diets are similar in that they put the emphasis on foods that are also known to be anti-inflammatory. But just as importantly, these diets also eliminate foods that can decrease levels of inflammatory markers inside the body, including a substance called C-reactive protein. Mixing and matching different foods from these diets can help you tailor an anti-inflammatory approach that fits your personal tastes, as you can choose the freshest in-season offerings. Whole grains, legumes, and heart-healthy oils can be year-round staples, but mix and match your fruits and vegetables for more variety.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 5, 75),
  ('1b1b787c-81e2-530b-a826-d173d7f5ff70'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'READ_ALOUD', E'READ_ALOUD', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '1b1b787c-81e2-530b-a826-d173d7f5ff70'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Dreams', E'Dreams are the landscapes where our deepest desires take flight. They are the whispers of our subconscious, revealing hidden aspirations and fears. Dreams can be elusive, slipping through our fingers like sand, or they can be powerful motivators that propel us forward. They are the canvases on which we paint our hopes and aspirations.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('1b21e156-f1a3-5e06-81e4-131957593c71'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DROPDOWN', E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DROPDOWN', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '1b21e156-f1a3-5e06-81e4-131957593c71'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Social Reforms', E'Social reforms are normally {{1}} as a result of statistical analyses of factors such as crime rates and poverty levels etc. Large-scale population can result from projections devised by statisticians. Manufacturers can provide better products at lower costs by {{2}} statistical control tools, {{3}} as control charts. Diseases are controlled through analyses designed to anticipate epidemics. Endangered species of fish and other wildlife are protected through regulations and laws that react to statistical estimates of changing population sizes. {{4}} statistical analysis of fatality rates, legislators can better justify laws, such as those governing air pollution, auto inspections, seat belt and airbag use, and drunk driving.', NULL, NULL, NULL, E'1.initiated, 2.using, 3.such, 4.Through', NULL, NULL),
  ('1b28c12a-a184-51ec-8c77-f1b0923d01eb'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'WRITE_ESSAY', E'WRITE_ESSAY', E'WRITING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '1b28c12a-a184-51ec-8c77-f1b0923d01eb'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Digital Influence', E'Young people''s reading and writing skills can be influenced by the increasing use of computers and mobiles. Do you agree with it? Why?', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 200, 300),
