  ('1b8172a7-1ea6-5d7a-abd5-a784d99a1872'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DROPDOWN', E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DROPDOWN', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '1b8172a7-1ea6-5d7a-abd5-a784d99a1872'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Economic Development', E'Although economic development is not a linear phenomenon, most industrialized countries have seen sustained economic growth in recent years, which is {{1}} with an increase of income per capita. {{2}} telephones, televisions and computers by people has increased. People read more and more newspapers. Infrastructure of transport has been {{3}} , and the number of cars has increased. Less economically developed countries usually {{4}} be agricultural countries, which are based on agriculture.', NULL, NULL, NULL, E'1.marked, 2.The use of, 3.better developed, 4.tend to', NULL, NULL),
