  ('1bde49d4-8dea-53b7-b43e-a5a71574dad9'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'REPEAT_SENTENCE', E'REPEAT_SENTENCE', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '1bde49d4-8dea-53b7-b43e-a5a71574dad9'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'RS', NULL, '1be41191-69b1-5a7c-a5f7-2b8753f135e8'::uuid, NULL, E'In just twelve years, the global population rose from six to seven billion.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('1be0b46f-79e5-5a92-a942-9a0247eb4c39'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'LISTENING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '1be0b46f-79e5-5a92-a942-9a0247eb4c39'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'WFD', NULL, 'b1d8339b-6c28-5140-a76b-dd027c27cfa7'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'Studying medicine allows for a wide range of career opportunities.', NULL, NULL),
  ('1be988e1-d433-5b8a-85ef-75f64892da41'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'REPEAT_SENTENCE', E'REPEAT_SENTENCE', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '1be988e1-d433-5b8a-85ef-75f64892da41'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'RS', NULL, '8f588059-8177-5645-9983-a524dfd27a5d'::uuid, NULL, E'Campus parking is still tough, even with a valid permit.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('1beba9d7-37dd-529b-9e50-d7c238b7e72a'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DROPDOWN', E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DROPDOWN', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '1beba9d7-37dd-529b-9e50-d7c238b7e72a'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Big Buildings', E'The desire to build big is nothing new. Big buildings have been used to show off power and wealth; to honor leaders or religious beliefs; to stretch the limits of what''s possible; and even as simple {{1}} among owners, families, architects, and builders. Some of the most {{2}} buildings of the past include the pyramids in Egypt, the skinny towers stretching towards the sky in Italian hill towns, and the gothic cathedrals of France. While these types of buildings may look very different from each other, they all have one thing in {{3}} . They were built with masonry or stone walls supporting most of the weight (so-called load-bearing walls), including that of the floors, the people, and everything the rooms contained. Because of this, the height of these buildings was limited by how massive and heavy they had to be at the base. Two {{4}} in the 19th century paved the way for a whole new type of building: the skyscraper. The first was the development of a safe elevator. Primitive elevators of various designs had been used for centuries, and starting in the mid 19th century, steam-operated elevators were used to move materials in factories, mines, and warehouses. But these elevators were not {{5}} safe for people; if the cable broke, they would plummet to the bottom of the elevator shaft.', NULL, NULL, NULL, E'1.competition, 2.dramatic, 3.common, 4.developments, 5.considered', NULL, NULL),
  ('1bf04628-9047-536e-956c-a9f5410583e1'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DRAG_AND_DROP', E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DRAG_AND_DROP', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '1bf04628-9047-536e-956c-a9f5410583e1'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Kalahari Desert', E'The Kalahari Desert, {{1}} over 900,000 square kilometers, is a vast semi-arid savannah in southern Africa. It stretches across Botswana, Namibia, and South Africa, encompassing an {{2}} of ecosystems from dry riverbeds to wetlands. This expansive terrain is {{3}} to diverse wildlife, including the iconic Kalahari lion, meerkats, and various antelope species. The Kalahari''s red sands give it a unique beauty, {{4}} visitors who seek to experience its serene and unspoiled {{5}} .', NULL, NULL, NULL, E'1.extending, 2.array, 3.home, 4.drawing, 5.landscapes', NULL, NULL),
  ('1bf1249b-b045-57fd-8194-3f137d074cd1'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'LISTENING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '1bf1249b-b045-57fd-8194-3f137d074cd1'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'WFD', NULL, 'd09d3468-be30-5458-860d-4652b6e43345'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'The curriculum is described in the course syllabus.', NULL, NULL),
  ('1bf321da-b1e8-513f-ac66-a364afda0bd3'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'LISTENING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '1bf321da-b1e8-513f-ac66-a364afda0bd3'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'WFD', NULL, 'b888c25d-f4b5-5236-8dfa-503093860a28'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'There is a fire exit on each floor of the building.', NULL, NULL),
  ('1bf507fd-e77d-58bf-be38-9d4341097789'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'REPEAT_SENTENCE', E'REPEAT_SENTENCE', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '1bf507fd-e77d-58bf-be38-9d4341097789'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'RS', NULL, '0541e96e-8f27-50d4-ac2b-1566b3c2eff6'::uuid, NULL, E'Privacy issues surrounding mobile computers are becoming complex.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('1bf60e38-3a4a-576e-9634-840a81c5fbce'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DROPDOWN', E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DROPDOWN', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '1bf60e38-3a4a-576e-9634-840a81c5fbce'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Colour Preference', E'Many tests have shown that, in a very broad way, peoples in most parts of the world have similar color preferences. Blue is the most preferred and popular hue, followed in order by red, green, purple, yellow and orange. Overlaying this basic order of color preference, {{1}} , are the responses of individuals, which of course vary {{2}} and may also be very powerful. Children are likely to have strong {{3}} for some colors and aversions to others, but sometimes will not admit to them, since outside {{4}} may be influential in determining both color preferences and the way that they are expressed or suppressed. Current fashions in clothes and accessories, gender-stereotyping and peer-group pressure may all play a significant part. Boys in particular may be reluctant to admit to any strong preferences for colors {{5}} those of favorite football teams, because color awareness may be regarded by their peer-group as feminine.', NULL, NULL, NULL, E'1.however, 2.widely, 3.preferences, 4.factors, 5.other than', NULL, NULL),
  ('1bf9a95c-9234-5051-8980-de283029e04c'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'LISTENING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '1bf9a95c-9234-5051-8980-de283029e04c'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'WFD', NULL, 'ca818fac-741c-58a3-b1ff-96bd29bf1892'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'Meeting project deadlines is essential for academic and professional success.', NULL, NULL),
  ('1c0f91ed-a927-565f-aead-1b85d66f80b0'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'RE_ORDER_PARAGRAPHS', E'RE_ORDER_PARAGRAPHS', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '1c0f91ed-a927-565f-aead-1b85d66f80b0'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Online Tutoring', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, E'2, 5, 3, 4, 1', NULL, NULL),
  ('1c11448e-0a49-5c92-83af-1f20f80bcbab'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'READ_ALOUD', E'READ_ALOUD', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '1c11448e-0a49-5c92-83af-1f20f80bcbab'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'First Satellite', E'Since the Soviet Union successfully launched the first man-made satellite, Sputnik 1, in 1957, about 5,000 more satellites have been put into orbit around the Earth. About 2,000 of these are active and although the rest are now dysfunctional, they remain in orbit, together with parts from all the rockets that carried them there. These remnants are often referred to as space junk, space trash or orbital debris.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('1c17e32d-ad4f-5d5a-856c-172983ce1790'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'REPEAT_SENTENCE', E'REPEAT_SENTENCE', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '1c17e32d-ad4f-5d5a-856c-172983ce1790'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'RS', NULL, 'add86f67-7465-529e-97aa-83818ee90577'::uuid, NULL, E'The topic next week will be colonialism and nuclear disarmament.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('1c199f05-3b63-5974-af08-e1738eb72be4'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'RE_TELL_LECTURE', E'RE_TELL_LECTURE', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '1c199f05-3b63-5974-af08-e1738eb72be4'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'European Educational Expenditure', NULL, '80494479-7a5b-5933-bfdb-99416561dd57'::uuid, NULL, E'Today, I wanna talk about an important aspect of education which is the education expenditure of the UK, compared with other European countries. Based on a recent paper published in the economist journal, UK is among the bottom five countries with the least funding for education sector, and it has only spent 1% of its total GDP on tertiary education, which is insufficient and lower than the OECD countries average line 4.6%. For instance, the expenditure of Spain is close to the UK in some cases in 2007 and this survey conducted among 50 major cities around the country. However, Denmark and Finland spent much more than the other European countries. So, if we decide to compare the education expenditure of the UK with various developing countries, we will find mind-boggling figures.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('1c1b51a2-4345-57e1-8417-a2fc986bad1d'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'MC_LISTENING_SINGLE', E'MC_LISTENING_SINGLE', E'LISTENING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '1c1b51a2-4345-57e1-8417-a2fc986bad1d'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Washington', E'Washington is a monumental city, a showcase capital with iconic views. And that''s because most planned public projects go through the Commission of Fine Arts, a presidentially appointed panel established by Congress in 1910. The idea was to really lift the image of the city as an important international capital, and to really push that idea of dignity and beauty and all these things that you know really contribute to the image of the city.\n\nFor what purpose was the Commission of Fine Arts established in the first place?', '8897dbdb-d144-52a8-8b69-72aa9cdf97c6'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'To provide suggestions and guidance about how to lift the image of Washington.', NULL, NULL),
  ('1c1c9bd7-9dad-51af-9653-34b1f50c6142'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'READ_ALOUD', E'READ_ALOUD', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '1c1c9bd7-9dad-51af-9653-34b1f50c6142'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Being Scared', E'Being scared to death boils down to our autonomic response to a strong emotion, such as fear. For fear-induced deaths, the demise starts with our fight-or-flight response, which is the body’s physical response to a perceived threat. This response is characterized by an increased heart rate, anxiety, perspiration, and increased blood glucose levels.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('1c1cf82e-ba8b-5102-b412-a996796485a3'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'READ_ALOUD', E'READ_ALOUD', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '1c1cf82e-ba8b-5102-b412-a996796485a3'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Climate Effects', E'Changes in climate affect, for example, the plant and animal life of a given area. The presence of coal beds in North America and Europe along with evidence of glaciation in these same areas indicates that they must have experienced alternately warmer and colder climates than they now possess.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
