  ('1cddaccc-2ac5-5f36-b8e9-e2974672a37c'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'READ_ALOUD', E'READ_ALOUD', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '1cddaccc-2ac5-5f36-b8e9-e2974672a37c'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Rare Marine Amoeba', E'Scientists have recently rediscovered and managed to cultivate Rhabdamoeba marina, a rare marine amoeba that has been documented in only two instances over the past hundred years. By studying this cultured strain, they conducted a thorough examination of its genetic sequence, unveiling the amoeba''s phylogenetic position for the first time.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('1ce26d28-66cf-534e-b4ac-44b13f7bc6e2'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'WRITE_ESSAY', E'WRITE_ESSAY', E'WRITING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '1ce26d28-66cf-534e-b4ac-44b13f7bc6e2'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Building Effects', E'Do you think the design of buildings affects, either positively or negatively, where people live and work?', NULL, NULL, E'The design of buildings plays a pivotal role in influencing the quality of life for individuals in both residential and work settings. It has the potential to significantly impact people''s well-being, productivity, and overall satisfaction. This essay will explore the positive effects of building design on living and working environments, focusing on aesthetics and functionality.\nTo begin with, well-designed buildings contribute positively to the aesthetics of the surroundings, creating visually pleasing and harmonious spaces. Architecture that incorporates elements of beauty and creativity can uplift moods, reduce stress, and enhance the overall atmosphere. For instance, modern office spaces that incorporate open layouts, natural lighting, and vibrant colors have been shown to boost employee morale and creativity. Such thoughtfully designed environments stimulate positive emotions and contribute to a more enjoyable living and working experience.\nFurthermore, functionality is a key aspect of building design that positively impacts where people live and work. Practical layouts, efficient space utilization, and well-considered amenities enhance the convenience and comfort of these spaces. Homes with well-designed kitchens, storage solutions, and comfortable living areas create a sense of coziness and functionality. Similarly, workplaces that incorporate ergonomic furniture, collaborative spaces, and advanced technology enable employees to work more efficiently and productively.\nIn conclusion, the design of buildings has a positive influence on where people live and work. As individuals spend a significant portion of their lives in these spaces, investing in thoughtful and innovative building design ultimately enhances their overall quality of life.', NULL, 200, 300),
