  ('1f2882a4-e3ba-5027-81cd-9322a8eed1b6'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'READ_ALOUD', E'READ_ALOUD', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '1f2882a4-e3ba-5027-81cd-9322a8eed1b6'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Tsunami', E'The tsunamis could provide crucial information about the habitability of ancient Mars. The first one occurred when the planet must have been relatively warm and amenable for life, because it carved out backwash channels as it returned to the sea. By contrast, the planet had become much cooler by the time the second tsunami hit.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('1f2c6933-6e0f-58a7-877b-dff10162710c'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DRAG_AND_DROP', E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DRAG_AND_DROP', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '1f2c6933-6e0f-58a7-877b-dff10162710c'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Multivitamin', E'Taking a daily multivitamin and mineral tablet may slow the {{1}} cognitive decline that happens naturally as we get older. The benefits of taking multivitamin pills have been {{2}} among doctors. They were once widely {{3}} as an “insurance policy” for people with poor diets, based on studies that found those who take them {{4}} to have better health. But these studies weren’t randomised, placebo-controlled trials and when such trials were done, they found no benefit from taking supplements for most healthy people.', NULL, NULL, NULL, E'1.gradual, 2.debated, 3.recommended, 4.tend', NULL, NULL),
  ('1f3dc748-1c1e-513a-8943-cc979681a313'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DRAG_AND_DROP', E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DRAG_AND_DROP', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '1f3dc748-1c1e-513a-8943-cc979681a313'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Questionnaires', E'Using questionnaires to gather information from people is a well-used quantitative research method. It is considered to be an easy {{1}} , but in reality it is actually very difficult to design a good questionnaire. Question type, clarity of language, length of questionnaire and layout are just some of the many {{2}} , which all need to be carefully considered when designing the questionnaire. Another issue, which {{3}} some deliberation, is how to ensure a high response {{4}} .', NULL, NULL, NULL, E'1.option, 2.factors, 3.requires, 4.rate', NULL, NULL),
