  ('20d4c292-13e3-5f9a-9d7e-17ca499e827c'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'MC_READING_SINGLE', E'MC_READING_SINGLE', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '20d4c292-13e3-5f9a-9d7e-17ca499e827c'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'NASA''s Curiosity', E'Four Earth-years ago, NASA''s Curiosity rover successfully touched ground on Mars'' dusty surface, after surviving a nail-biting descent through the red planet’s thin atmosphere. Since its triumphant arrival, the car-size "laboratory on wheels" has travelled more than 13.5 kilometers, taking pictures, collecting samples, and analyzing rocks along the way. Recent software upgrades even let Curiosity autonomously choose which rocks it examines—and shoots with laser beams. Curiosity has spent more than 1,421 sols, or Martian days, exploring Gale Crater, a low-lying region that may have held past life, if it existed. While the rover has yet to confirm whether Mars once hosted living things, it has found evidence of an ancient freshwater lake in the sediments of Yellowknife Bay, the lowest point of the crater, offering tantalizing insight into the planet’s past habitability. Since September 2014, Curiosity has been examining Mount Sharp, a mountain of layered rocks towering more than five kilometres high in the middle of Gale Crater.\n\nChoose the correct sentence that best summarizes the text.', NULL, NULL, NULL, E'Over the last four years, NASA''s rover, Curiosity, has collected samples and taken photographs of Mars’ surface which have revealed evidence of water but has not confirmed evidence of life.', NULL, NULL),
  ('20d96343-d264-5fdd-82a6-fcec6235350e'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'LISTENING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '20d96343-d264-5fdd-82a6-fcec6235350e'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'WFD', NULL, 'd50f7589-6cb7-5b90-a4c6-f73e296f47ee'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'Acceptance by their peer group is important to most youngsters.', NULL, NULL),
  ('20dd1637-d6ce-5688-a780-68ed2c2e315a'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'READ_ALOUD', E'READ_ALOUD', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '20dd1637-d6ce-5688-a780-68ed2c2e315a'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Parents', E'Parents can demonstrate while the child is still very young that TV is a medium to be used selectively. They can point children in the direction of informative, educational programs. There are some remarkable things for preschoolers to see and enjoy on television. Parents should remember that while television does provide preschoolers with considerable useful information, it doesn''t make them smarter.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
