  ('2161106f-2815-58d9-a982-2323386cb069'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DRAG_AND_DROP', E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DRAG_AND_DROP', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '2161106f-2815-58d9-a982-2323386cb069'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Economic Depression', E'As the economic depression deepened in the early 30s, and as farmers had less and less money to spend in town, banks began to fail at {{1}} rates. During the 20s, there was an average of 70 banks failing each year nationally. After the crash during the first 10 months of 1930, 744 banks closed down _ 10 times as many. In all, 9,000 banks failed during the {{2}} of the 30s. By 1933, depositors saw $140 billion {{3}} through bank failures.', NULL, NULL, NULL, E'1.alarming, 2.decade, 3.disappear', NULL, NULL),
  ('21622da2-4356-58ac-ae1d-56d23c8ac4f5'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DROPDOWN', E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DROPDOWN', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '21622da2-4356-58ac-ae1d-56d23c8ac4f5'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Dancing and Brain', E'Not all of us have what it takes to be a dancing queen. But whether you are a politician with two left feet or a Strictly Come Dancing wannabe, if you like to dance you are in luck. Ballet, ballroom or break-dancing, it doesn’t matter: getting into the groove does {{1}} for you. And it’s not just the joy of moving to music. Dancing is good for the brain too. It can change the way you think and even keep your mind {{2}} as you age. “People are born to move. They are born to move rhythmically,” says dance psychologist Peter Lovatt at the University of Hertfordshire, UK. Admittedly, we are not all blessed with the same degree of {{3}} for it, but dancing is ingrained in human nature. People across almost all cultures have done it for as long as we know. Indeed, a sense of rhythm seems to be {{4}} . Telltale brain activity in newborn babies reveals that even they can spot when a drummer skips a beat.', NULL, NULL, NULL, E'1.wonders, 2.sharp, 3.talent, 4.innate', NULL, NULL),
  ('2169c922-4757-57ab-97c2-07d8fcb7907e'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'REPEAT_SENTENCE', E'REPEAT_SENTENCE', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '2169c922-4757-57ab-97c2-07d8fcb7907e'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'RS', NULL, 'cf7e6f54-c695-5939-815b-ed454f7af02a'::uuid, NULL, E'Ecologists have recently learned more about diseases that have killed millions of frogs.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('216b7313-28c0-58ea-bb5c-cae30f367b3b'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DRAG_AND_DROP', E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DRAG_AND_DROP', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '216b7313-28c0-58ea-bb5c-cae30f367b3b'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Bioluminescent Organisms', E'Bioluminescent organisms are nature''s living light shows. Predominantly found in ocean {{1}} , these species produce light through a chemical reaction within specialized cells called photocytes. This luminescence serves various purposes, from attracting prey to {{2}} and even communication. The spectacle of a deep-sea creature {{3}} the watery darkness with a burst of light is a rare and remarkable {{4}} for human explorers.', NULL, NULL, NULL, E'1.depths, 2.camouflaging, 3.illuminating, 4.sight', NULL, NULL),
  ('216b8e86-2fc7-57e4-a304-4d4b7dffa051'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'LISTENING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '216b8e86-2fc7-57e4-a304-4d4b7dffa051'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'WFD', NULL, '061c0b0b-6fad-5ee2-a59d-8efeed630064'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'Governments have promised to free up more resources for education.', NULL, NULL),
  ('2172d591-ffe5-51f6-ba51-a952b420c306'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DROPDOWN', E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DROPDOWN', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '2172d591-ffe5-51f6-ba51-a952b420c306'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Participatory Frameworks', E'Shifting focus to the experiment itself, changes were introduced in two subsections of the engineering team to transform the review structure. {{1}} than intensive inspection of individual contributors by managers, engineers were empowered with more autonomy. The revised system emphasized high-level guidance from senior managers who oversaw collaborative group processes. Additionally, professional development coaching emphasized collective brainstorming {{2}} singular decision-making by individual contributors. Applying these skills in a pilot, leaders redesigned working sessions as participatory forums for engineers across subgroups to share ideas {{3}} . Quantitative and qualitative data was gathered to {{4}} outcomes relating to productivity, job satisfaction, and innovation criteria. For reference, these implemented changes designed to enable collaborative ideation across the test divisions {{5}} the “co-creation approach” during analysis. If effective, similar participatory frameworks and coaching could scale across other divisions in the organization.', NULL, NULL, NULL, E'1.Rather, 2.versus, 3.openly, 4.assess, 5.constituted', NULL, NULL),
  ('2177543e-632c-50c1-9496-97e762dbac34'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'READ_ALOUD', E'READ_ALOUD', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '2177543e-632c-50c1-9496-97e762dbac34'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Effective Regulations', E'There is every reason to believe that effective regulations are not merely a luxury that only the rich can afford, but an important foundation for a thriving private sector and economic growth. But the broad pattern of the past five years has been that the main reform efforts are taking place in rich countries.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
