  ('225582c4-1e64-5651-ba49-5ccf834516b9'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'REPEAT_SENTENCE', E'REPEAT_SENTENCE', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '225582c4-1e64-5651-ba49-5ccf834516b9'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'RS', NULL, '68617c9a-f06e-54ce-bc29-d280098e35ef'::uuid, NULL, E'Students can choose graduate certificate, graduate diploma and master course.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('225bd6b4-0bbc-5716-a359-0b4fc64d6047'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'RE_TELL_LECTURE', E'RE_TELL_LECTURE', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '225bd6b4-0bbc-5716-a359-0b4fc64d6047'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Sugar', NULL, 'ccf3198d-c0db-5f59-9806-61a693f71202'::uuid, NULL, E'The major currency of our reward system is dopamine, an important chemical or neurotransmitter. There are many dopamine receptors in the forebrain, but they’re not evenly distributed. Certain areas contain dense clusters of receptors, and these dopamine hot spots are a part of our reward system. Drugs like alcohol, nicotine, or heroin send dopamine into overdrive, leading some people to constantly seek that high, in other words, to be addicted. Sugar also causes dopamine to be released, though not as violently as drugs. And sugar is rare among dopamine-inducing foods. Broccoli, for example, has no effect, which probably explains why it’s so hard to get kids to eat their veggies. Speaking of healthy foods, let’s say you’re hungry and decide to eat a balanced meal. You do, and dopamine levels spike in the reward system hot spots. But if you eat that same dish many days in a row, dopamine levels will spike less and less, eventually leveling out. That’s because when it comes to food, the brain evolved to pay special attention to new or different tastes.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('226105cc-8d51-575a-8d08-2feb903aa944'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'ANSWER_SHORT_QUESTION', E'ANSWER_SHORT_QUESTION', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '226105cc-8d51-575a-8d08-2feb903aa944'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'ASQ', E'What is the term for the change of a substance from a solid directly to a gas?', '9afece59-1e5a-5296-be23-99c6702fefb2'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'Sublimation', NULL, NULL),
  ('22626aba-93d3-521d-a10f-d0fd2a57c6dd'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'ANSWER_SHORT_QUESTION', E'ANSWER_SHORT_QUESTION', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '22626aba-93d3-521d-a10f-d0fd2a57c6dd'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'ASQ', E'What do we call the money that is paid to the school or university by its students?', 'e0a07f15-f799-54d3-a5a3-33268246217c'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'Tuition', NULL, NULL),
  ('22663f69-f541-5599-82ff-3d5c6bf9f11b'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DROPDOWN', E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DROPDOWN', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '22663f69-f541-5599-82ff-3d5c6bf9f11b'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Study of Objects', E'The study of objects constitutes a relatively new field of academic enquiry, commonly {{1}} as material culture studies. Students of material culture seek to understand societies, both past and present, through careful study and {{2}} of the physical or material objects generated by those societies. The source material for study is exceptionally wide, {{3}} not just human-made artefacts but also natural objects and even preserved body parts (as you saw in the film ''Encountering a body'').\nSome specialists in the field of material culture have made bold claims for its pre-eminence. In certain disciplines, it reigns {{4}} . It plays a critical role in archaeology, for example, especially in circumstances where written evidence is either patchy or non-existent. {{5}} , objects are all scholars have to rely on in forming an understanding of ancient peoples.\nEven where written documents survive, the physical remains of literate cultures often help to provide new and interesting insights into how people once lived and thought, {{6}} the case of medieval and post-medieval archaeology. In analyzing the physical remains of societies, both past and present, historians, archaeologists, anthropologists and others have been careful to remind us that objects mean different things to different people.', NULL, NULL, NULL, E'1.referred to, 2.observation, 3.including, 4.supreme, 5.In such cases, 6.as in', NULL, NULL),
  ('22759415-10de-5198-b439-efc79fd5eb16'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'ANSWER_SHORT_QUESTION', E'ANSWER_SHORT_QUESTION', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '22759415-10de-5198-b439-efc79fd5eb16'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'ASQ', E'What do we call a company that pays the cost of an event in order to advertise?', 'd8754004-8080-5006-b35c-cc36cc6c31d1'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'Sponsor', NULL, NULL),
  ('22791456-a758-5ece-8c10-02d779dfebcd'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DRAG_AND_DROP', E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DRAG_AND_DROP', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '22791456-a758-5ece-8c10-02d779dfebcd'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Work-ready International Students', E'Work-ready international students are providing greater options for local employers who are having difficulties {{1}} local staff due to {{2}} employment rates and ongoing labour shortages. International students in accounting and information technology take part in a year-long program {{3}} of classroom work and practical experience, which provides them with {{4}} skills, industry contacts and a working {{5}} of Australian workplace.', NULL, NULL, NULL, E'1.finding, 2.high, 3.consisting, 4.valuable, 5.knowledge', NULL, NULL),
  ('227a149f-c516-5bb9-bec3-c00f7e19c3c1'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'ANSWER_SHORT_QUESTION', E'ANSWER_SHORT_QUESTION', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '227a149f-c516-5bb9-bec3-c00f7e19c3c1'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'ASQ', E'What do you pay when you park in a wrong place?', '509b6e05-7a41-56f4-95a9-dcc3ff740ab8'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'Fine / parking fine', NULL, NULL),
  ('2282018b-ea8e-58b8-9f39-7ff8196bce80'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'REPEAT_SENTENCE', E'REPEAT_SENTENCE', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '2282018b-ea8e-58b8-9f39-7ff8196bce80'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'RS', NULL, 'b71a5588-782c-5685-a64f-ab8d9f4c8ba4'::uuid, NULL, E'You can find your enrollment details, results, and fees online.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('228b214a-ce46-5509-b0b8-4e84e5872025'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'READ_ALOUD', E'READ_ALOUD', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '228b214a-ce46-5509-b0b8-4e84e5872025'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Impact of Psychology', E'Psychology is both an applied and academic field that benefits both individuals and society as a whole. A large part of psychology is devoted to the diagnosis and treatment of mental health issues, but that is just the tip of the iceberg when it comes to the impact of psychology.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('228f1d79-756a-5da4-9ce9-6bfad5207313'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'READ_ALOUD', E'READ_ALOUD', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '228f1d79-756a-5da4-9ce9-6bfad5207313'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Greenhouse Gases', E'Human beings most certainly contribute to climate change by adding greenhouse gases to the atmosphere, but this is only part of the equation. Earth’s climate can change over time not only because of changes in the atmosphere but also because of interactions between the atmosphere and various geologic, chemical, biological, and geographic factors.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('22967251-11b8-5fe9-889a-94f9ffa9dbf7'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'ANSWER_SHORT_QUESTION', E'ANSWER_SHORT_QUESTION', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '22967251-11b8-5fe9-889a-94f9ffa9dbf7'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'ASQ', E'Does a scapegoat receive or give a crime?', 'cdbf7089-2139-58d9-95d1-82dc42604d11'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'Receive', NULL, NULL);
