  ('235fbd6d-464e-578f-8df7-a83cfd4dd3c2'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DROPDOWN', E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DROPDOWN', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '235fbd6d-464e-578f-8df7-a83cfd4dd3c2'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Space Exploration', E'In the realm of space exploration, human curiosity has led to {{1}} achievements and profound scientific discoveries. The exploration of our solar system and beyond has deepened our understanding of the universe. Yet, it has also revealed the {{2}} challenges and complexities of venturing into the unknown. One of the remarkable {{3}} of space exploration is the ability to send robotic missions to distant planets and celestial bodies. These missions have provided us with invaluable data and insights into the nature of our universe, often exceeding our {{4}} expectations. However, human exploration of space remains a compelling endeavor. The dream of sending astronauts to Mars or establishing a presence on the Moon is a testament to our {{5}} to conquer new frontiers and expand our horizons.', NULL, NULL, NULL, E'1.monumental, 2.daunting, 3.achievements, 4.considerable, 5.resolve', NULL, NULL),
