  ('272fccdd-8cc0-58ff-af13-900e8cedc514'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'READ_ALOUD', E'READ_ALOUD', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '272fccdd-8cc0-58ff-af13-900e8cedc514'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Community Gardening', E'We bring together people, resources, and education to benefit lives and neighborhoods through community gardening. From our beginnings, American Community Gardening Association has encouraged networking among members to share community gardening information, experience, and best practices. We also offer formal educational opportunities, such as local and regional workshops, webinars, publications, and online resources.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('27378185-75b1-59dd-b02d-51de2f0f3918'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'ANSWER_SHORT_QUESTION', E'ANSWER_SHORT_QUESTION', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '27378185-75b1-59dd-b02d-51de2f0f3918'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'ASQ', E'What do we call a political institution or body that is responsible for a country?', '0c1bc16d-a3e5-5132-ad48-d123c594d066'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'Government', NULL, NULL),
  ('273874ce-8d53-5bad-ba9d-775845cc36a7'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'LISTENING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '273874ce-8d53-5bad-ba9d-775845cc36a7'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'WFD', NULL, '9cd52bd8-d734-5b3e-8a05-c65d85ee0e4c'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'Peer group pressure has a significant effect on young people.', NULL, NULL),
  ('2739249f-b3e9-599c-a696-c25c8669881d'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'MC_READING_MULTIPLE', E'MC_READING_MULTIPLE', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '2739249f-b3e9-599c-a696-c25c8669881d'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Ancient Whale', E'An even more exciting find was reported in 1994, also from Pakistan. The now extinct whale Ambulocetus natans ("the walking whale that swam") lived in the Tethys Sea 49 million years ago. It lived around 3 million years after Pakicetus but 9 million before Basilosaurus. The fossil luckily includes a good portion of the hind legs. The legs were strong and ended in long feet very much like those of a modern pinniped. The legs were certainly functional both on land and at sea. The whale retained a tail and lacked a fluke, the major means of locomotion in modern cetaceans. The structure of the backbone shows, however, that Ambulocetus swam like modern whales by moving the rear portion of its body up and down, even though a fluke was missing. The large hind legs were used for propulsion in water. On land, where it probably bred and gave birth, Ambulocetus may have moved around very much like a modern sea lion. It was undoubtedly a whale that linked life on land with life at sea.\n\nWhy does the author use the word "luckily" in mentioning that the Ambulocetus natans fossil included hind legs?', NULL, NULL, NULL, E'The legs provided important information about the evolution of cetaceans.\nThe discovery allowed scientists to reconstruct a complete evolution of the whale.', NULL, NULL),
  ('273cd731-289f-5e0b-90a7-cb854f9f06af'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'LISTENING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '273cd731-289f-5e0b-90a7-cb854f9f06af'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'WFD', NULL, '86044063-42bc-5b8a-a2fb-63ced8537bd2'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'Students are encouraged to think carefully about their accommodation needs.', NULL, NULL),
  ('27472328-72cb-5370-b6d1-9b57cbe4ed24'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'LISTENING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '27472328-72cb-5370-b6d1-9b57cbe4ed24'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'WFD', NULL, '140ae328-d2d8-5c8a-bebf-529761bcdbc0'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'Eating regularly during the week has its health benefits.', NULL, NULL),
  ('27504a61-ef4c-5bcd-90d5-0ac8ece3af97'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'WRITE_ESSAY', E'WRITE_ESSAY', E'WRITING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '27504a61-ef4c-5bcd-90d5-0ac8ece3af97'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Values and Ethics', E'Is education as important to learn life values and ethics as to learn practical skills for future development?', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 200, 300),
  ('2752e3d3-cb7c-5f5b-94d9-a1c80c2bea71'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'READ_ALOUD', E'READ_ALOUD', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '2752e3d3-cb7c-5f5b-94d9-a1c80c2bea71'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Living Room', E'Living room is the most used part that withholds most of the traffic coming in and out of the house. It is highly recommended that the flooring should be strong enough that it can endure all such amendments done with your furniture or to the increasing and decreasing ratio of visitors. For this purpose, you can opt for hardwood flooring.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('27556383-0a8b-5658-9e04-ed17acea9b47'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'HIGHLIGHT_CORRECT_SUMMARY', E'HIGHLIGHT_CORRECT_SUMMARY', E'LISTENING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '27556383-0a8b-5658-9e04-ed17acea9b47'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Urban Development', E'Urban development is the first thing I wanted to talk about here in Perth. Urban development is going on at a great pace and the standard approach here in Western Australia is for suburban development to happen at the outer edges of the city. You have suburbs slowly spreading out into areas that are cleared. and this is eating into both areas of native bushland and land that used to be used for farming, for agricultural purposes.\nThe debate here is that on one side there''s the idea that we need more housing. We have a housing shortage in Western Australia, and suburban expansion is essential. Suburban expansion on the edges of the city is cheaper and easier to do than building more homes within the city even though it''s recognized it creates lots of problems with infrastructure and so on. On the other side of the debate, people say that urban sprawl is destroying bush and consequently the natural wildlife that exists there, and that it''s too easy for developers to ignore these facts.\n\nClick on the paragraph that best relates to the recording.', '69ed0b1c-67ea-52d0-bd53-77a57a27089a'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'Cities like Perth in Western Australia are experiencing a rapid growth in urban development. and the current trend is to expand into surrounding regions. Although some people think this is more cost-effective than building within cities, others believe it''s having a harmful effect on the environment in these areas.', NULL, NULL),
  ('275cbc70-65bc-5826-b0c6-37cf2494be01'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'REPEAT_SENTENCE', E'REPEAT_SENTENCE', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '275cbc70-65bc-5826-b0c6-37cf2494be01'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'RS', NULL, '2e28411c-016a-59ac-a03f-acba036aa0d7'::uuid, NULL, E'You need to prepare your boarding pass and passport in front of the gate.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('27654305-25c7-5f90-b89c-15f7dedd3cc2'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'LISTENING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '27654305-25c7-5f90-b89c-15f7dedd3cc2'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'WFD', NULL, '1b1c8d99-1135-5cad-ae75-a240c4c7d896'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'If finance is a cause of concern, scholarships may be available.', NULL, NULL),
  ('2768fba6-4196-5fee-8396-2fa32b3fc793'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DROPDOWN', E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DROPDOWN', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '2768fba6-4196-5fee-8396-2fa32b3fc793'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Video Conference', E'Never has the carbon footprint of multi-national corporations been under such intense scrutiny. Inter-city train journeys and long-haul flights to {{1}} face-to-face business meetings contribute significantly to greenhouse gases and the resulting {{2}} on the environment. The Anglo-US company Teliris has introduced a new video-conferencing technology and partnered with the Carbon Neutral Company, enabling corporate outfits to become more environmentally responsible. The innovation allows simulated face-to-face meetings to be held across continents without the time {{3}} or environmental burden of international travel. Previous designs have enabled video-conferencing on a point-to-point, dual-location basis. The firm''s VirtuaLive technology, however, can bring people together from up to five {{4}} locations anywhere in the world - with {{5}} transmission quality.', NULL, NULL, NULL, E'1.conduct, 2.strain, 3.pressure, 4.separate, 5.unrivaled', NULL, NULL),
  ('2775a3e7-4f05-5003-a383-1a391c0d4eac'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'RE_TELL_LECTURE', E'RE_TELL_LECTURE', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '2775a3e7-4f05-5003-a383-1a391c0d4eac'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Comas', NULL, 'fa31ce65-bfb9-5066-bbaa-4f26080a29ec'::uuid, NULL, E'But what exactly happens to your body when you’re in a coma? First we have to be clear that comas are very different from sleep. Despite the fact that the origin of the word comes from the Greek for Koma, or deep sleep, comas are not sleep however and are instead various forms of unconsciousness that render a person unable to respond to any external stimuli. You can play the loudest, heaviest death metal in the world right next to someone who’s comatose, and you won’t succeed in doing anything except really annoying the neighbors. Likewise you can even physically hurt people in a coma and they will remain completely oblivious and unresponsive. In times not too distant past, this was sometimes used as treating, with doctors trying to shock their victims back into consciousness. Everything was tried from exposing parts of the body to open flames to severely dropping the body’s temperature with ice, to even bloodletting from the head directly. One treatment even included wholly emptying the stomach, we guess because the doctors thought that if a patient got hungry enough, the body would force them to wake up. Or maybe they really were just throwing everything including the kitchen sink at the problem, which we’re sure was also tried. Comas can occur as a result of serious trauma or as a deliberate medical treatment by doctors. They are typically brought on by traumatic head injury, and it’s believed that it’s the brain’s way of shutting down so it can focus on repairing itself. They can also however be brought on by a stroke, a brain tumor, drug or alcohol abuse, or an illness such as diabetes or an infection. Most of the time a coma only lasts a few weeks though, but past this period the patient can enter a persistent vegetative state that severely lessens their chances of ever coming back out of one.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('27779a18-42c8-597d-89c9-b110b9ff1826'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'LISTENING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '27779a18-42c8-597d-89c9-b110b9ff1826'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'WFD', NULL, '133a75f5-e86d-592c-a682-3a751558049d'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'The shops in central London keep open late on Thursday evenings.', NULL, NULL),
