  ('288458cc-5522-52ea-9168-c3f02e77d478'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'REPEAT_SENTENCE', E'REPEAT_SENTENCE', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '288458cc-5522-52ea-9168-c3f02e77d478'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'RS', NULL, 'df1ad766-f518-5f75-b7de-7b3b799fb936'::uuid, NULL, E'The football team was disciplined by an experienced trainer.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('28887924-1d3e-571a-a85b-31895ec84f02'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'REPEAT_SENTENCE', E'REPEAT_SENTENCE', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '28887924-1d3e-571a-a85b-31895ec84f02'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'RS', NULL, '296fdfcf-7e7b-5162-8e6f-43b690360f02'::uuid, NULL, E'Alcohol can influence not only our brain but also our liver.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('28922284-d56d-54a7-88fa-295580e1c8e3'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'WRITE_ESSAY', E'WRITE_ESSAY', E'WRITING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '28922284-d56d-54a7-88fa-295580e1c8e3'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Inventions', E'In the past 100 years, there have been many inventions such as antibiotics, airplanes and computers. What do you think is the most important one? Why?', NULL, NULL, E'Nowadays, what is the most important invention in the past 100 years has fueled heated discussions. Proponents claim that antibiotics and airplanes are the most remarkable inventions of the past century whereas opponents contend that computers are the most significant creation in the recent 100 years. From my perspective, I am convinced that computers rank as the most important invention over the last 100 years because of work productivity and convenience services.\nTo begin with, computers are the most important invention because they enhance efficiency in all practical aspects. For example, computers can quickly process data and generate reports, greatly improving work efficiency. In addition to this, with computers, we can send emails, make video calls and share screens, making global communication easy. Other than that, using computers to search online, read news and download e-books makes accessing knowledge easier than ever. It is thus shown that computers stand as the most significant innovation in the past century.\nBesides, I also believe that computers make life more vibrant and colorful. On top of that, computers let us play video games and video chat with friends, making leisure time more fun. Moreover, with computers, we can shop online, order food delivery and book rides, reducing the need for physical trips. Recently, I have examined an article arguing that computers make healthcare easier by letting you book appointments online, check test results, and get medicine delivered. This clearly proves that computers count as the most vital invention over the past 100 years.\nTo conclude, there is no doubt that communication effectiveness and smart living are essential in today''s world. While some might disagree, the evidence strongly supports that computers should be viewed as the most important creation in the past hundred years.', NULL, 200, 300),
  ('289308ad-3c87-5d06-aa36-2d275e4abb23'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DRAG_AND_DROP', E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DRAG_AND_DROP', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '289308ad-3c87-5d06-aa36-2d275e4abb23'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'National Portrait Gallery (B)', E'The National Portrait Gallery''s Conservation Department performs one of the Gallery''s {{2}} functions, the long-term preservation of all Collection items, to make them {{1}} now and in future. The Collection {{3}} from the 8th century to the present day, and {{5}} of portraits in a variety of media, so the Gallery employs Conservators with {{4}} in a range of disciplines, including Framing, Painting, Paper, Sculpture and Photography.', NULL, NULL, NULL, E'1.core, 2.accessible, 3.dates, 4.consists, 5.expertise', NULL, NULL),
