  ('28aa2ada-9aae-5d2a-96cf-54fbf149ec11'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'SELECT_MISSING_WORD', E'SELECT_MISSING_WORD', E'LISTENING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '28aa2ada-9aae-5d2a-96cf-54fbf149ec11'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Problem of Youth', E'People are always talking about ''the problem of youth''. If there is one-which I take leave to doubt-then it is older people who create it, not the young themselves. Let us get down to fundamentals and agree that the young are after all human beings-people just like their elders. There is only one difference between an old man and a young one: the young man has a glorious future before him and the old one has a splendid future behind him: and maybe that is where the rub is.\nWhen I was a teenager, I felt that I was just young and uncertain-that I was a new boy in a huge school, and I would have been very pleased to be regarded as something so interesting as a problem. For one thing, being a problem gives you a certain identity, and that is one of the things the young are busily engaged in...\n\nAt the end of the recording the lost word or group of words has been replaced by a beep. Select the correct option to complete the recording.', '9f7f90e3-4640-5d78-b153-259a051bb537'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'seeking', NULL, NULL),
  ('28acacdc-1007-5520-a56b-03faf8783be7'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'LISTENING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '28acacdc-1007-5520-a56b-03faf8783be7'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'WFD', NULL, '06bea831-b8c5-5511-82aa-0bc9ce3a2f27'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'Sleeping too much might not be as good as you think.', NULL, NULL),
  ('28b110da-6433-54fc-9f29-596556d71c55'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DROPDOWN', E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DROPDOWN', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '28b110da-6433-54fc-9f29-596556d71c55'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Air Pollution and Risk', E'Studies have found that {{1}} to air pollution is linked to a greater risk of depression and suicide. While the effects on the body from breathing dirty air are well-established, an emerging body of research has suggested pollution may also affect mental health. Isobel Braithwaite at University College London and her colleagues looked in {{2}} at 25 studies published up to late 2017, for a meta-analysis on the links between the two. They found that someone living for at least six months in an area with twice the World Health Organization’s recommended limit for fine particulate matter, PM2.5, would have roughly a 10 percent increased risk of developing depression as a person living in an area that met the limit. The WHO’s guideline is that PM2.5s shouldn’t {{3}} 10 micrograms per cubic metre of air (μg/m3) on average over a year. This is the average level in the UK. In London the average figure is higher at 13.3μg/m3, and in Delhi it is around 133μg/m3.', NULL, NULL, NULL, E'1.exposure, 2.detail, 3.exceed', NULL, NULL),
  ('28b2d91a-d3e5-5e46-afa4-85b113ab4670'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'LISTENING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '28b2d91a-d3e5-5e46-afa4-85b113ab4670'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'WFD', NULL, '8df91e71-92fc-5d92-9aa8-156715316842'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'This class will look at the structure of the essay.', NULL, NULL),
  ('28b8aa28-ebde-5414-a182-19f8a8f66748'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'ANSWER_SHORT_QUESTION', E'ANSWER_SHORT_QUESTION', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '28b8aa28-ebde-5414-a182-19f8a8f66748'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'ASQ', E'What is the low land between two hills or mountains?', '5e806d9b-e521-5a8b-92d6-157b0575598d'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'Valley / canyon / trough', NULL, NULL),
  ('28bb526d-d292-5c98-982e-b28958800e05'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'RESPOND_TO_A_SITUATION', E'RESPOND_TO_A_SITUATION', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '28bb526d-d292-5c98-982e-b28958800e05'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Wall Painting', E'You''ve been living in your apartment for a few years and feel that a fresh coat of paint would brighten up the space. You want to ask your landlord for permission to paint the walls yourself. How do you approach this conversation and what specific points do you bring up to get a positive response?', '51a10113-1870-5726-9e34-216d4377f5d8'::uuid, NULL, E'Respected landlord, I hope you are doing well.\nI would like to discuss an issue we have encountered with my apartment.\nIt appears that I have lived in this apartment for several years, and repainting the walls can brighten the space. I hope to get your permission to paint the walls by myself, and I will keep the wall color appropriate and restore it when moving out.\nI would appreciate your opinion on this matter. Thank you for your consideration.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('28bc890e-6002-51ec-ba59-41bc33f59d68'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'LISTENING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '28bc890e-6002-51ec-ba59-41bc33f59d68'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'WFD', NULL, '370df697-a82f-52d9-af5c-1bb5aa83dbd5'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'Schools regularly bring children to the museum for history lessons.', NULL, NULL),
  ('28c3dd16-5150-513e-b781-e131b7775432'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'LISTENING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '28c3dd16-5150-513e-b781-e131b7775432'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'WFD', NULL, 'b33a1f04-c254-517e-869c-8bbf7f24fb30'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'Geography courses often consider field trips as indispensable learning experiences.', NULL, NULL),
  ('28c4b395-8be7-5b78-90de-8550bcaff2d5'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'ANSWER_SHORT_QUESTION', E'ANSWER_SHORT_QUESTION', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '28c4b395-8be7-5b78-90de-8550bcaff2d5'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'ASQ', E'What is the yearly recurrence of the date of a past event?', '7f33f966-59db-59ac-a4ad-e4178e3928cf'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'Anniversary', NULL, NULL),
  ('28c62eac-3852-5c3f-9044-5ad980a3ead3'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DRAG_AND_DROP', E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DRAG_AND_DROP', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '28c62eac-3852-5c3f-9044-5ad980a3ead3'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'COVID-19 Vaccines', E'COVID-19 vaccines train our immune systems to make antibodies using synthetic {{1}} of the virus'' spike protein. If a vaccinated person later encounters the virus, the antibodies recognize it and bind to the spike protein to prevent {{2}} .The first dose of an mRNA vaccine prepares the cells to make antibodies, and the second dose matures and {{3}} those antibodies to bind even more strongly to the spike protein.', NULL, NULL, NULL, E'1.versions, 2.infection, 3.enhances', NULL, NULL),
  ('28c97259-398e-5b26-93ff-d123395cb944'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'RE_TELL_LECTURE', E'RE_TELL_LECTURE', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '28c97259-398e-5b26-93ff-d123395cb944'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Anti-Aging Products', NULL, '678a38dd-1531-5c44-b8a1-9da2fc4028eb'::uuid, NULL, E'Mahto: We are currently living in a society that is so focused on outwards aesthetics. So I think there is also a driving need for people more interested in things like laser surgery or injectables like Botox or filler from a much, much younger age than we’ve seen before.\nNarrator: So despite the lure of magical remedies and luxurious concoctions, avoiding skin damage and combating the signs of aging don’t need to be so expensive.\nMahto: Budget products can be equally as effective as their more expensive counterparts. The focus shouldn’t be on the cost of the product. Wearing a good-quality sunscreen, SPF minimum 30, ideally 50, throughout the year. The reason for that is that 80% to 90% of the signs that we associate with skin aging occur directly because of sunlight. So we’re talking fine lines, wrinkles, pigmentation. No. 2 is the use of a vitamin-A-based product or a retinoid. One doesn’t need to spend a fortune, and, probably, once you’re spending beyond more than 25, 30 pounds on a product, it’s probably unnecessary.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('28ce0adf-bc1d-510a-b1cc-de0a5d6936d6'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DRAG_AND_DROP', E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DRAG_AND_DROP', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '28ce0adf-bc1d-510a-b1cc-de0a5d6936d6'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Cargo Ship Munchen', E'Two weeks before Christmas in 1978, the cargo ship MS München {{1}} a fierce storm in the North Atlantic. Although the captain couldn''t evade it, the {{2}} waves and winds should have posed no {{3}} to the 261-meter-long ship. The West German vessel and its 28-person crew vanished, leaving behind just four lifeboats, three shipping containers, and a handful of {{4}} devices.', NULL, NULL, NULL, E'1.encountered, 2.forecasted, 3.threat, 4.flotation', NULL, NULL),
  ('28cec260-e7cc-5b94-8ad4-8f5258dfb9e9'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'REPEAT_SENTENCE', E'REPEAT_SENTENCE', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '28cec260-e7cc-5b94-8ad4-8f5258dfb9e9'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'RS', NULL, 'c0439864-8e9d-5445-a98b-1d11dd898f42'::uuid, NULL, E'Each group should submit a rough outline of their project to their tutor.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('28d69be0-7925-5f3f-9416-553944650709'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'REPEAT_SENTENCE', E'REPEAT_SENTENCE', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '28d69be0-7925-5f3f-9416-553944650709'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'RS', NULL, '7456ca38-246b-5b6f-91cc-3c7df63716a9'::uuid, NULL, E'Financial support can be offered to help pay your fees and other costs.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('28e352d7-649c-5123-b203-7fa59e4f9ea5'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'REPEAT_SENTENCE', E'REPEAT_SENTENCE', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '28e352d7-649c-5123-b203-7fa59e4f9ea5'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'RS', NULL, '4e5d712b-2629-594b-8a04-6a52e856adcb'::uuid, NULL, E'If a computer user fails to log off, the system is accessible to all.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('28e85107-a823-5cdb-b04a-551839c7f9c7'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'REPEAT_SENTENCE', E'REPEAT_SENTENCE', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '28e85107-a823-5cdb-b04a-551839c7f9c7'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'RS', NULL, '3f09b294-e787-55f0-ac0a-ea77a0b3a39a'::uuid, NULL, E'Early next year there''s a major auction of his work.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('28f18185-1182-5ede-bcc3-dc4d1cf91280'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'ANSWER_SHORT_QUESTION', E'ANSWER_SHORT_QUESTION', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '28f18185-1182-5ede-bcc3-dc4d1cf91280'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'ASQ', E'What do we call the upper layer of the Earth''s mantle, where rocks are rigid and brittle?', '901c07ad-06b4-5c7f-86ba-124dd621cdf3'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'Lithosphere', NULL, NULL),
  ('28f57861-5ec7-56fb-b789-4840ba01fff5'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DROPDOWN', E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DROPDOWN', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '28f57861-5ec7-56fb-b789-4840ba01fff5'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Electric Vehicles', E'The world needs to dramatically reduce its greenhouse gas emissions, if there''s any hope of preventing worse and more frequent extreme weather events. That means {{1}} to renewable sources of energy — and, importantly, decarbonizing transportation, a sector that is now responsible for about a quarter of the world''s carbon dioxide emissions. But the path to that cleaner future is {{2}} , clogged with political and societal roadblocks, as well as scientific {{3}} . Perhaps that''s one reason why the electric vehicle — already on the road, already navigating many of these roadblocks — swerved so dramatically into the climate solutions spotlight in 2021. Just a few years ago, many automakers thought electric vehicles (EVs) might be a passing {{4}} , says Gil Tal, director of the Plug-in Hybrid & Electric Vehicle Research Center at the University of California.', NULL, NULL, NULL, E'1.shifting, 2.daunting, 3.obstacles, 4.fad', NULL, NULL),
  ('28f63ef4-54c1-5985-9779-7f9f969614bf'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'REPEAT_SENTENCE', E'REPEAT_SENTENCE', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '28f63ef4-54c1-5985-9779-7f9f969614bf'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'RS', NULL, '7fefa27d-bed0-5025-9364-ff7ae53746aa'::uuid, NULL, E'Two months before his exams, he suddenly plunged into his studies.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('28fc2662-2f90-552c-8ee4-2bf14c776e3e'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'READ_ALOUD', E'READ_ALOUD', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '28fc2662-2f90-552c-8ee4-2bf14c776e3e'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Tea Ceremony (B)', E'Many non-Japanese know a thing or two about traditional tea ceremony, its history, intricacies and religious origins. However, few people outside Japan have a deep understanding of the esoteric meaning of the practice. Indeed, even in Japan, the secret meaning of tea ceremony is little understood except by those who have devoted their lives to the discipline.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('28ffe463-2853-569e-874b-3e2f12f86959'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'REPEAT_SENTENCE', E'REPEAT_SENTENCE', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '28ffe463-2853-569e-874b-3e2f12f86959'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'RS', NULL, '9393a5c9-93e0-5cc9-872b-d37a0083e46d'::uuid, NULL, E'There is considerable disagreement about the main cause of the revolution.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('2901d4af-4817-58c3-8ae9-6f5cb19696d9'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'RE_TELL_LECTURE', E'RE_TELL_LECTURE', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '2901d4af-4817-58c3-8ae9-6f5cb19696d9'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Drug Interaction', NULL, 'af8740b3-5b5d-5ebe-91d1-8abbc5da9906'::uuid, NULL, E'Drug interactions happen when the combination of a drug with another substance causes different effects than either would individually. Foods, herbal supplements, legal drugs, and illicit substances can all cause drug interactions. Most drug interactions fall into two categories. Some take place when two substances’ effects influence each other directly. In other cases, one substance effects how the body processes another, like how it is absorbed, metabolized, or transported around the body. Blood thinners and aspirin, for example, have similar effects that become dangerous when combined. Both prevent blood clots from forming— blood thinners by preventing the formation of the clotting factors that hold clots together, and aspirin by preventing blood cells from clumping into groups that become clots. Individually, these effects are usually safe, but taken together, they can prevent blood clotting to a dangerous extent, possibly causing internal bleeding. While blood thinners and aspirin are generally harmless when taken individually, interactions where one substance exacerbates the effects of another can also take place between drugs that are independently harmful.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('2903a86d-dc69-5316-b7bc-a7f4b2ab4dde'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'READ_ALOUD', E'READ_ALOUD', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '2903a86d-dc69-5316-b7bc-a7f4b2ab4dde'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'High-protein Diet', E'A 10-week muscle-building and dietary program involving 50 middle-aged adults found no evidence that eating a high-protein diet increased strength or muscle mass more than consuming a moderate amount of protein while training. The intervention involved a standard strength-training protocol with sessions three times per week. None of the participants had previous weightlifting experience.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('2907e467-dd96-572b-bcbc-8681707d374d'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'RE_TELL_LECTURE', E'RE_TELL_LECTURE', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '2907e467-dd96-572b-bcbc-8681707d374d'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Invention', NULL, 'a123fa8e-8bbf-5c65-aac2-f0506ed37108'::uuid, NULL, E'All of my research, and, that I conducted was my 60 plus graduate students, was motivated by their need to learn, so that we can teach. Of course, um, some inventions happened along the way but I''ve always considered the end, the result. And I always consider these inventions to be byproduct, byproducts of the learning process. The end product for me was always better understanding or when one really succeeded in unifying theory that can help us in teaching the subject. I''ve also looked at teaching as a vehicle to try new ideas, of new ways to doing things on an intelligent group of learners. That is as the vehicle for the teaching research results. And in my experience, this kind of teaching is the most stimulating and motivating to students. I''ve also uncovered many interesting research problems in the course of teaching assumption. It is this unity of research and teaching, their close connection, and the benefits garnered by exercising and the interplay that to me characterizes the successful professor.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('29104d45-6842-5879-bcdb-312dbcb54919'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'LISTENING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '29104d45-6842-5879-bcdb-312dbcb54919'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'WFD', NULL, '7aaa7492-6a8d-562c-9c16-ca87fb6e60f4'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'The nearest automatic teller is in front of the anatomy labs.', NULL, NULL),
  ('29124ebc-ff36-586a-bdec-27ece0d7dd77'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'HIGHLIGHT_CORRECT_SUMMARY', E'HIGHLIGHT_CORRECT_SUMMARY', E'LISTENING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '29124ebc-ff36-586a-bdec-27ece0d7dd77'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Saving Money', E'We’ve run a few different studies and found that the number one purchase people say they regret, after bank fees, is eating out. It’s a frequent purchase we make almost everyday, and it’s death by a thousand cuts. A coffee here, a burrito there. It adds up and decreases our ability to save. Back when I lived in New York City, I looked at my expenses and saw that I spent over 2,000 dollars on ride-sharing apps. It was more than my New York City rent. I vowed to make a change. And the next month, I spent 2,000 dollars again — no change, because the information alone didn’t change my behavior. I didn’t change my environment. So now that I was 4,000 dollars in the hole, I did two things. The first is that I unlinked my credit card from my car-sharing apps. Instead, I linked a debit card that only had 300 dollars a month. If I needed more, I had to go through the whole process of adding a new card, and we know that every click, every barrier, changes our behavior. We aren’t machines. We don’t carry around an abacus every day, adding up what we’re spending, in comparison to what we wanted. But what our brains are very good at is counting up the number of times we''ve done something. So I gave myself a limit. I can only use ride-sharing apps three times a week. It forced me to ration my travels. I got a handle on my car-sharing expenses to the benefit of my husband, because of the environmental changes that I did. So get a handle on whatever that purchase is for you, and change your environment to make it harder to do so.\n\nClick on the paragraph that best relates to the recording.', '381a9d5e-115e-5968-bd6f-40473868b0de'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'To save money, a crucial step is to change our environment. The environmental changes can make it harder for us to make a purchase, and thus help us to save money.', NULL, NULL),
  ('29161660-c179-546b-9e14-4ac3c489aee5'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'REPEAT_SENTENCE', E'REPEAT_SENTENCE', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '29161660-c179-546b-9e14-4ac3c489aee5'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'RS', NULL, '9594f2bb-4696-5a31-a815-23a90190b9aa'::uuid, NULL, E'Spending quality time together is important for most families but unfortunately, it''s not always possible to do so.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('291a6a07-300e-5352-901a-3e76234ac80d'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'LISTENING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '291a6a07-300e-5352-901a-3e76234ac80d'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'WFD', NULL, '3568c616-415f-570b-aa59-96314dcb7a3b'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'The majority of our decisions are not rational.', NULL, NULL),
  ('291acbae-1dc3-53a0-ac6a-ddf7d7cd9314'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DROPDOWN', E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DROPDOWN', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '291acbae-1dc3-53a0-ac6a-ddf7d7cd9314'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Bioelectronic Materials', E'Bioelectronic materials are a groundbreaking invention in medical technology. These materials allow electronic devices to connect safely with the human body. For example, devices like the one Neuralink is developing could be a game-changer for treating brain-related conditions. They use tiny, biocompatible materials that can {{1}} with the brain and then be naturally absorbed by the body, avoiding the need for any {{2}} surgery to remove them. {{3}} these, natural biomaterials are being used more and more. These include things like chitosan, which comes from shellfish, and are used to make new types of medical materials that are safe and effective. For example, scientists have made a special injectable gel for treating brain diseases like Parkinson''s. There''s also exciting work being done with "bioinks" for 3D printing organs. This could lead to big changes in how we treat {{4}} , like creating more realistic models of organs for doctors to study or even developing new ways to {{5}} organs. All these developments in bioelectronic materials and related technologies are not just scientifically impressive; they have the potential to significantly improve medical treatments and patient care.', NULL, NULL, NULL, E'1.interact, 2.additional, 3.Alongside, 4.patients, 5.transplant', NULL, NULL),
  ('2926130b-5942-5356-9590-ec3b365a5e85'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DROPDOWN', E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DROPDOWN', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '2926130b-5942-5356-9590-ec3b365a5e85'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Debt, Poverty and Development', E'Books and articles highlighting intractable debt, poverty and development abound in both the academic and popular literature. This addition to the debate is both timely and interesting {{1}} it subsumes the economic debate to the broader social, political, environmental and institutional context of debt in developing countries. Debt-for-Development Exchanges: History and New Applications {{2}} for a wide audience including: academics from a range of disciplines (including accounting and finance); non-Government organizations (NGOs); civil society groups; and, both debtor and creditor governments and public sector organization. Professor Ross Buckley, author and editor, {{3}} an international profile in the area of debt relief and this book is the outcome of an Australian Research Council (ARC) Discovery grant to explore debt-for development mechanisms that relieve debt, improve development outcomes {{4}} aid, are practically and politically attractive to creditors and {{5}} to regional security.', NULL, NULL, NULL, E'1.as, 2.is intended, 3.has developed, 4.from, 5.contribute', NULL, NULL),
  ('2930dc01-8ddb-54c2-b717-5f2e740a5776'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'ANSWER_SHORT_QUESTION', E'ANSWER_SHORT_QUESTION', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '2930dc01-8ddb-54c2-b717-5f2e740a5776'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'ASQ', E'What plan shows how much money is available and how it will be spent?', 'b52eebeb-7031-556f-a71a-1bf05f960ec2'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'Budget', NULL, NULL),
  ('29324ae8-a413-52d4-b65d-bacd11cd028a'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'MC_READING_SINGLE', E'MC_READING_SINGLE', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '29324ae8-a413-52d4-b65d-bacd11cd028a'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Writing in College', E'One of the first things you’ll discover as a college students is that writing in college is different from writing in high school. Certainly a lot of what your high school writing teachers taught you will be useful to you as you approach writing in college you will want to write clearly, to have an interesting and arguable thesis, to construct paragraphs that are coherent and focused, and so on.\nStill, many students enter college relying on writing strategies that served them well in high school but that won’t serve them well here. Old formulae, such as the five-paragraph theme, aren’t sophisticated or flexible enough to provide a sound structure for a college paper. And many of the old tricks – such as using elevated language, or repeating yourself so that you might meet a ten-page requirement – will fail you now.\n\nAccording to the writer, a student might repeat himself to _____ .', NULL, NULL, NULL, E'increase the length of essay', NULL, NULL),
  ('29333ab0-b499-5710-bfb8-d1562a88b219'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DROPDOWN', E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DROPDOWN', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '29333ab0-b499-5710-bfb8-d1562a88b219'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Debtor', E'There isn’t a financial director around who wouldn’t like to {{1}} cash flow by reducing debtor days- in other words, get customers to pay up faster. In Europe’s top 1,000 quoted companies, nearly one quarter of all invoices are unpaid at any {{2}} in time, according to recent research carried out by the ASF organization. This means they are sitting on a total of 274 billion EUD overdue debt. Most of this is caused by poor collection practices. According to Jan Porter, ASF’s Managing Director, “You can set up all the systems you want, you can insist on {{3}} contracts and payment terms, the government can even introduce late payment legislation, but there are always some debtors who {{4}} to pay on time. Once a payment is overdue, your first step is to talk to your debtor. You should let them know the payment is late and try to find out if there is a dispute about the work, or if your debtor has financial problems. {{5}} , but Tim Vainio, a chartered accountant, believes that too many companies are afraid of losing a relationship, and that, before {{6}} any action, the focus should be on recovering as much money as possible, rather than on preserving a relationship.', NULL, NULL, NULL, E'1.accelerate, 2.point, 3.watertight, 4.fail, 5.This is OK, 6.undertaking', NULL, NULL),
