  ('2a2fa59c-f208-5c12-b209-fda7081ea021'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DRAG_AND_DROP', E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DRAG_AND_DROP', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '2a2fa59c-f208-5c12-b209-fda7081ea021'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Gas Drilling', E'Gas drilling on the Indonesian of java has {{1}} a '' mud volcano'' that has killed 13 people and may render four square miles (ten square kilometers) of countryside uninhabitable for years. In a report released on January 23, a team of British researchers says the deadly {{2}} began when an exploratory gas well punched through a layer of rock 9300 feet (2800 meters) below the surface, {{3}} hot, high pressure water to {{4}} .The water carried mud to the surface, where it has {{5}} across a region 2.5 miles (4 kilometers) in diameter in the eight months since the eruption began. The mud volcano is similar to a gusher or blowout, which occur in oil drilling when oil or gas squirt to the surface, team says. This upwelling, however, spews out a volume of mud equivalent to a dozen Olympic swimming pools each day. Although the eruption isn''t as violent as a {{6}} volcano, more than a dozen people died when a natural gas pipeline ruptured. The research team, who published their findings in the February issue of GSA Today, also estimate that the volcano, called Lusi, will leave more than 11,000 people permanently displaced.', NULL, NULL, NULL, E'1.triggered, 2.upwelling, 3.allowing, 4.escape, 5.spread, 6.conventional', NULL, NULL),
  ('2a33b7cc-8d47-5b76-ae57-6c7810aea635'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DRAG_AND_DROP', E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DRAG_AND_DROP', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '2a33b7cc-8d47-5b76-ae57-6c7810aea635'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Noise', E'We don''t have any databases on this sort of information. As well as that, these records of sound levels take no account of the fact that people vary in their {{1}} of noise-so someone like me with years of working in acoustics might be very different from you in that regard. But anyway, even though these noise maps are fairly {{2}} they''ve been useful in providing information and {{3}} awareness. That noise matters. We need to deal with it and so it''s a political matter. And that''s important-we need rules and {{4}} , because noise can cause all sort of problems. Those of you who are city-dwellers know that things go on 24 hours a day.', NULL, NULL, NULL, E'1.perceptions, 2.crude, 3.raising, 4.regulations', NULL, NULL),
  ('2a357291-c8f1-58f6-8c26-74db631e7d17'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'LISTENING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '2a357291-c8f1-58f6-8c26-74db631e7d17'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'WFD', NULL, 'c2c5aef5-db8c-5099-ace2-268c1ebfcd3d'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'A group of economists believe our financial system has critical flaws.', NULL, NULL),
