  ('2a694ba5-8251-5e54-91a7-70387515aca9'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DRAG_AND_DROP', E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DRAG_AND_DROP', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '2a694ba5-8251-5e54-91a7-70387515aca9'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Deep-sea Fish', E'The world of science has witnessed countless breakthroughs. Last month, a research team {{1}} a new species of deep-sea fish during an expedition. These creatures, living in the darkest depths, were hidden from human sight until now. The scientists didn''t just {{2}} across them casually; they used advanced sonar technology and spent hours analyzing data. Back in the lab, the team worked with biologists who {{3}} extensive knowledge of marine genetics. Their combined expertise enabled them to study the fish''s unique DNA structure. Soon after, their findings were published, and the scientific community {{4}} it a significant discovery, opening new doors for ocean research.', NULL, NULL, NULL, E'1.discovered, 2.stumble, 3.possessed, 4.hailed', NULL, NULL),
