  ('2f188f45-9876-5503-9738-3592a25a6a8a'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'REPEAT_SENTENCE', E'REPEAT_SENTENCE', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '2f188f45-9876-5503-9738-3592a25a6a8a'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'RS', NULL, 'bb59a9cd-4923-5d89-9c3a-c082eb47c771'::uuid, NULL, E'Email usage raises the risk of miscommunication significantly in correspondence.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('2f1a8258-87aa-54e1-94cb-d10a70d5751e'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'RE_TELL_LECTURE', E'RE_TELL_LECTURE', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '2f1a8258-87aa-54e1-94cb-d10a70d5751e'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Bees', NULL, '649329ac-3f5a-50e4-af4d-df10f0d45a6a'::uuid, NULL, E'Today, let''s delve into the fascinating world of bees, vital pollinators that play a critical role in our ecosystems and economies. The symbiosis between bees and biodiversity is profound. By pollinating, bees not only facilitate the production of fruits and seeds but also ensure genetic diversity necessary for plants to adapt to changing environments. Another dimension to consider is the economic impact. The work of bees is estimated to contribute to a significant portion of the global agricultural economy by enhancing crop yields and quality. This natural process is a cornerstone of food security and agricultural sustainability, underscoring the need for sustainable beekeeping practices. In acknowledging the humble bee''s contribution to our lives, we gain insight into the complex interdependence of nature and human enterprise. As we continue our academic journey, let us be mindful of the delicate balance that sustains our world.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('2f1b8664-220a-5334-b9ca-a0fa6d0f46e9'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DRAG_AND_DROP', E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DRAG_AND_DROP', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '2f1b8664-220a-5334-b9ca-a0fa6d0f46e9'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Truffles', E'There are evidences that truffles have been around for over 150 million years, but {{1}} being around for so long, they’ve remained {{2}} – some species were only discovered in the past 20 years, and other species haven’t even been discovered. Truffles are notoriously difficult to grow and are seasonal, so the amount of time {{3}} in growing truffles, their {{4}} production, the labor-intensive extraction process, and short shelf life are what make truffles so expensive.', NULL, NULL, NULL, E'1.despite, 2.elusive, 3.invested, 4.limited', NULL, NULL),
  ('2f1ddcb9-1efb-56d7-b810-693800317564'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'RE_ORDER_PARAGRAPHS', E'RE_ORDER_PARAGRAPHS', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '2f1ddcb9-1efb-56d7-b810-693800317564'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Universal Healthcare', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, E'2, 3, 4, 1', NULL, NULL),
  ('2f212d6e-5499-5b2c-8bc6-79bc74cf6871'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'READ_ALOUD', E'READ_ALOUD', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '2f212d6e-5499-5b2c-8bc6-79bc74cf6871'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Intermittent Fasting', E'Intermittent fasting is a popular dietary trend that involves alternating periods of fasting and eating. Proponents claim that it can lead to weight loss, improved insulin sensitivity, and other health benefits. However, there are also potential risks such as nutrient deficiencies and eating disorders. It is important to consult with a healthcare professional before starting any fasting regimen.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('2f2fb492-90b9-556c-b4cf-5f91fa94f0b7'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'READ_ALOUD', E'READ_ALOUD', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '2f2fb492-90b9-556c-b4cf-5f91fa94f0b7'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'War on Women', E'While the Republican field is packed with male candidates, so far, some of the sharpest Clinton critics have come from women. Democrats successfully campaigned on an alleged GOP perpetrated "war on women" in twenty twelve, but faltered in 2014 when they tried the same tactic. With Hillary Clinton as the likely Democratic nominee, the fight for women voters will be a central part of the twenty sixteen campaign.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('2f305e74-10bf-5670-a853-8b31dd8faaab'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'REPEAT_SENTENCE', E'REPEAT_SENTENCE', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '2f305e74-10bf-5670-a853-8b31dd8faaab'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'RS', NULL, '8b4db640-3bc2-5a2f-b4cb-5c5d8271e580'::uuid, NULL, E'The information on the internet is becoming more reliable.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('2f32ac9b-1c0c-560d-8a0a-6cd6c6031ec2'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'REPEAT_SENTENCE', E'REPEAT_SENTENCE', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '2f32ac9b-1c0c-560d-8a0a-6cd6c6031ec2'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'RS', NULL, 'b4ee5ce7-037b-5a72-8da6-2aeb0b22e2e9'::uuid, NULL, E'There is a vegetarian alternative on the menu every Tuesday.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('2f380e99-9039-5d86-9251-20bb1a6ad393'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'LISTENING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '2f380e99-9039-5d86-9251-20bb1a6ad393'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'WFD', NULL, 'ee71fc78-7138-5442-a7e5-bbc12203aa74'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'You need to work harder to pass the final test.', NULL, NULL),
  ('2f3cfe10-3f56-5696-9d7f-67b140ff3e73'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'RE_TELL_LECTURE', E'RE_TELL_LECTURE', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '2f3cfe10-3f56-5696-9d7f-67b140ff3e73'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Listening to Employees', NULL, 'f78f3be6-8893-554b-bd29-0be6d3bd538e'::uuid, NULL, E'People wanna work at places that give ’em free food, and swag, and it’s a prestigious organization, or I have a prestigious title, where I can make a best friend at work— the things that we are told over and over again go into making a good work culture. In reality, those are some of the least prioritized things for the majority of workers in America today. To the extent that leaderships of companies are under these illusions, they will continue to incentivize and design environments that are no longer a very good fit to the true trade-off priorities of the workforce. What people want is work to be a positive part of the rest of their life. They wanna be trusted to be able to make decisions about how they do their work, and they are expecting more meaning and purpose in their work. The thing that will hold us back from a good life, rather than just working to work, are these illusions that keep pulling us back to conformity to something for which the group no longer actually values. We all don’t have to quit our job and go somewhere else to find fulfillment. That it is closer than we think, and a lot of it is just subtle changes particularly, around giving more control to employees, trusting them more, listening to the things they care about.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('2f423624-e7b2-5ede-935d-d01c0d51fcdc'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'ANSWER_SHORT_QUESTION', E'ANSWER_SHORT_QUESTION', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '2f423624-e7b2-5ede-935d-d01c0d51fcdc'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'ASQ', E'What do we call a person who can speak several languages?', 'f87b4855-f053-5c01-a076-61066684183d'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'Multilingual / polyglot', NULL, NULL),
