  ('2f76aa74-4909-5a2d-9ff7-8422d25a7437'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'LISTENING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '2f76aa74-4909-5a2d-9ff7-8422d25a7437'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'WFD', NULL, '8918d6ae-eebe-53c4-8c64-0f828cbfcff0'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'You will need more information to back up your opinion.', NULL, NULL),
  ('2f779a3e-5b48-5821-b824-a78d1d4d4ac3'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DROPDOWN', E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DROPDOWN', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '2f779a3e-5b48-5821-b824-a78d1d4d4ac3'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Global Heating', E'Three degrees does not sound like much but it {{1}} a rise in temperature compatible with the global heating that occurred between the last ice age, some 15,000 years ago, and the warmth of the eighteenth century. When Earth was cold, giant glaciers sometimes extended from the polar-regions as far south as St Louis in the US and the Alps in Europe. Later this century when it is three degree hotter glaciers everywhere will be melting in a climate of often {{2}} heat and drought, punctuated with storms and floods. The {{3}} for humanity could be truly horrific; if we fail to act swiftly, the full impact of global heating could cull us along with vast populations of the plant and animals with whom we share Earth. In a worst-case scenario, there might - in the 22nd century - be only a remnant of humanity eking out a {{4}} existence in the polar-regions and the few remaining oases left on a hot and arid Earth.', NULL, NULL, NULL, E'1.represents, 2.unbearable, 3.consequences, 4.diminished', NULL, NULL),
  ('2f7a7731-54ec-5f94-b4bb-5ef2c1fc2c55'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'REPEAT_SENTENCE', E'REPEAT_SENTENCE', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '2f7a7731-54ec-5f94-b4bb-5ef2c1fc2c55'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'RS', NULL, '2477f0eb-0ca5-5216-9da1-f89305a6d1a1'::uuid, NULL, E'All essays and seminar papers submitted must be emailed to your tutor.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('2f7d352c-7abe-57cd-a9f2-d331ca192728'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'MC_READING_SINGLE', E'MC_READING_SINGLE', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '2f7d352c-7abe-57cd-a9f2-d331ca192728'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Advertising', E'Advertisers tend to think big and perhaps this is why they’re always coming in for criticism. Their critics seem to resent them because they have a flair for self-promotion and they have so much money to throw around. But people have to pay a great deal more if advertising didn’t create mass markets for products. It is precisely because of the heavy advertising that consumer goods are so cheap. We get the wrong idea if we think the only purpose of advertising is to sell goods. Another equally important function is to inform. A great deal of the knowledge we have about household goods derives largely from the advertisements we read.\n\nWhat is another use of advertisement except selling goods?', NULL, NULL, NULL, E'To give information.', NULL, NULL),
  ('2f812d04-d2bd-5a19-9153-9f5a4c345e14'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DROPDOWN', E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DROPDOWN', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '2f812d04-d2bd-5a19-9153-9f5a4c345e14'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'AI', E'A survey of 2700 AI researchers who have recently published work at six of the top AI conferences revealed that many of them see the possible future development of superhuman AI as having a non-trivial chance of causing human extinction or other extremely bad AI-related outcomes. Almost 58 per cent of researchers said they considered that there is a 5 per cent chance of such {{1}} . The survey also asked participants to share their thoughts on possible timelines for future AI technological milestones, {{2}} the good or bad societal consequences of those achievements. The surveyed researchers predicted that within the next decade, AI systems have a 50 per cent or higher chance of successfully {{3}} most of 39 sample tasks, including writing new songs or coding an entire website from {{4}} . The possible development of AI that can outperform humans on every task was given 50 per cent {{5}} of happening by 2047, whereas the possibility of all human jobs becoming fully automatable was given 50 per cent chance to occur by 2116.', NULL, NULL, NULL, E'1.scenarios, 2.as well as, 3.tackling, 4.scratch, 5.odds', NULL, NULL),
  ('2f85ba1d-2ea1-5569-8bb9-ef4306510dc4'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'READ_ALOUD', E'READ_ALOUD', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '2f85ba1d-2ea1-5569-8bb9-ef4306510dc4'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Exploring the City', E'The city is full of life and energy. Tall buildings tower over busy streets, while the sound of horns and chatter echoes through the air. The scent of street food wafts through the alleys, luring people to stop and take a bite of the locals'' favorite street snacks. As day turns to night, the city lights up with neon signs and twinkling stars in the sky.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('2f88715b-94c0-561a-9ea3-45b1b4da947c'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'RE_ORDER_PARAGRAPHS', E'RE_ORDER_PARAGRAPHS', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '2f88715b-94c0-561a-9ea3-45b1b4da947c'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Self-sufficiency', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, E'4, 1, 3, 2', NULL, NULL),
  ('2f89bc6f-6194-5081-924c-fb7a4b4919b9'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'SUMMARIZE_WRITTEN_TEXT', E'SUMMARIZE_WRITTEN_TEXT', E'WRITING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '2f89bc6f-6194-5081-924c-fb7a4b4919b9'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Fostering a Sense', E'A thriving campus community is essential for the holistic development and success of students. It goes beyond academics and encompasses a sense of belonging, support, and engagement that plays a pivotal role in their educational journey.\nOne of the fundamental aspects of a vibrant campus community is the opportunity for students to connect with their peers. Friendships forged in college often last a lifetime and contribute to personal growth and well-being. These connections provide a support system that helps students navigate the challenges of academic life and transition into adulthood.\nFurthermore, an active and inclusive campus community fosters a sense of belonging. When students feel like they belong, they are more likely to be motivated, engaged, and committed to their studies. A sense of belonging reduces feelings of isolation and can improve mental health and overall happiness.\nStudent organizations, clubs, and extracurricular activities play a significant role in building this sense of community. They offer students opportunities to pursue their interests, discover new passions, and connect with like-minded individuals. These activities provide a platform for leadership development, teamwork, and personal growth outside the classroom.\nMoreover, a strong campus community enhances the overall college experience. It encourages students to attend events, lectures, and cultural activities, enriching their education beyond textbooks and lectures. It also promotes diversity and inclusion, exposing students to different perspectives and backgrounds.\nIn conclusion, a thriving campus community is not just a complement to education; it is an integral part of it. Fostering connections, a sense of belonging, and active engagement is essential for student success, personal growth, and the overall vitality of higher education institutions. Building a strong sense of community on campus should remain a priority for universities and colleges worldwide.', NULL, NULL, E'A thriving campus community, crucial for holistic student development, fosters lasting connections, a sense of belonging, and engagement through student organizations and extracurricular activities, significantly enhancing the college experience, contributing to personal growth, academic motivation, mental health, and preparing students for successful transitions into adulthood.', NULL, 5, 75),
  ('2f8b39e0-83bd-56a0-9622-00f103cf6980'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'LISTENING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '2f8b39e0-83bd-56a0-9622-00f103cf6980'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'WFD', NULL, 'cd82f51b-18da-5e32-9b47-9af3e7c1156c'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'The modern inventions have greatly facilitated housework.', NULL, NULL),
  ('2f8bf73a-1ac6-54bf-b061-93539d25c478'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'REPEAT_SENTENCE', E'REPEAT_SENTENCE', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '2f8bf73a-1ac6-54bf-b061-93539d25c478'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'RS', NULL, 'bc9e8c49-7bc7-5ccd-b4ee-9e1e67cd37dd'::uuid, NULL, E'We don’t teach the same way as we used to.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('2f8d5415-ca75-5381-bdcd-19c6e9db1ddd'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'REPEAT_SENTENCE', E'REPEAT_SENTENCE', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '2f8d5415-ca75-5381-bdcd-19c6e9db1ddd'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'RS', NULL, 'e97061ec-9723-5431-b23b-810d459c1766'::uuid, NULL, E'The ability to get straight to the core of a problem is very important.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('2f8d6ee6-8df4-5f1f-8edf-047a5745ebc9'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'SUMMARIZE_WRITTEN_TEXT', E'SUMMARIZE_WRITTEN_TEXT', E'WRITING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '2f8d6ee6-8df4-5f1f-8edf-047a5745ebc9'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Flora and Fauna', E'No matter where we go on the planet, there are stunning plants, flowers, and animals that catch our attention. They are two very important aspects of any ecosystem. Of all the living organisms on the planet, the most commonly seen by us are the plant life and the animal life. Apart from these two, more forms of life abound in the earth, but are harder to see with the naked eye. This is why the flora and fauna i.e. plant and wildlife of the earth are fascinating to observe and study. Flora and fauna are words originating from Latin. Flora in Latin means the goddess of the flower. Flora is also derived from the word floral, which means relating to flowers. Therefore flora is a group of indigenous plants in an ecosystem of a geographical region. The origin of the word fauna is a bit shrouded in mystery. According to Roman mythology, Fauna refers to the goddess of fertility. Fauna is sometimes referred to as Fauns, meaning forest spirits. By definition, fauna is a group of indigenous animals of any geographical region. So, the term flora and fauna was coined by biologists to refer to a collection of plant and animal specifies in a given geographic location. This is why you hear phrases like flora and fauna of India, flora, and fauna of Indonesia and so on.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 5, 75),
  ('2f90db2b-1f5e-56c2-894e-b6efb4d0d93c'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'READ_ALOUD', E'READ_ALOUD', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '2f90db2b-1f5e-56c2-894e-b6efb4d0d93c'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Modern Technology', E'Modern technology has impacted every area of our lives and become a crucial factor in no time. We even reached a point where everything we use in our daily life is directly or indirectly related to the technological advancement of some form. So, modern technology cannot be avoided even if we intentionally wanted to.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('2f98e8c9-6e82-5adf-b8af-246a10dfbd3c'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'RE_ORDER_PARAGRAPHS', E'RE_ORDER_PARAGRAPHS', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '2f98e8c9-6e82-5adf-b8af-246a10dfbd3c'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Miss Brill', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, E'3, 5, 4, 1, 2', NULL, NULL),
  ('2f9ba2df-1ca9-5720-8ae0-5483fd1a97ff'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'LISTENING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '2f9ba2df-1ca9-5720-8ae0-5483fd1a97ff'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'WFD', NULL, '84ac8fd6-ef49-5877-a9d3-296801a1267a'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'The motive power of trains is usually steam or electricity.', NULL, NULL),
  ('2f9ce7fe-88c3-5187-9d9d-fb7971f05351'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'WRITE_ESSAY', E'WRITE_ESSAY', E'WRITING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '2f9ce7fe-88c3-5187-9d9d-fb7971f05351'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'International Travel', E'Do you agree that international travel broadens one''s perspective?', NULL, NULL, E'International travel is a transformative experience that has the power to broaden one''s perspective in numerous ways. I firmly believe that traveling to different countries opens doors to new cultures, fosters empathy, and facilitates personal growth.\nOne compelling reason why I support the idea that international travel broadens one''s perspective is that it exposes individuals to diverse cultures and customs. Immersing oneself in a new culture allows for a deeper understanding of traditions, beliefs, and ways of life different from one''s own. Experiencing firsthand the richness of cultural diversity enhances empathy and appreciation for the uniqueness of each society. It enables travelers to break free from ethnocentrism and embrace the beauty of global unity through shared human experiences.\nFurthermore, international travel fosters understanding and tolerance towards people from different backgrounds. Interacting with individuals from diverse cultures promotes empathy, breaks down stereotypes, and encourages acceptance of diversity, ultimately fostering a more inclusive and harmonious society. Moreover, the challenges and adventures encountered during travel contribute to personal growth and self-discovery. Stepping out of one''s comfort zone, facing uncertainties, and adapting to unfamiliar environments cultivate resilience, adaptability, and a broader perspective on life.\nIn conclusion, the benefits of international travel in broadening one''s perspective are undeniable. By experiencing diverse cultures, fostering understanding and tolerance, and embarking on a journey of personal growth and self-discovery, individuals can gain invaluable insights and enrich their lives in ways that are truly transformative.', NULL, 200, 300),
  ('2fa6124b-5d69-5055-94ed-cda75adf7673'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'LISTENING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '2fa6124b-5d69-5055-94ed-cda75adf7673'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'WFD', NULL, '764733e4-5a97-5ff5-b8e3-406b12568723'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'The cooperators use ongoing assessments as their ways of checking work.', NULL, NULL),
  ('2fa837ba-8fe0-5d3e-a1bf-9c74de474a65'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'RE_ORDER_PARAGRAPHS', E'RE_ORDER_PARAGRAPHS', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '2fa837ba-8fe0-5d3e-a1bf-9c74de474a65'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Living Standards', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, E'3, 2, 4, 1', NULL, NULL),
  ('2fa9a0dd-566a-5584-a260-78a95509890c'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'MC_READING_SINGLE', E'MC_READING_SINGLE', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '2fa9a0dd-566a-5584-a260-78a95509890c'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Tax', E'Excise taxes are governmental levies on specific goods produced and consumed inside a country. They differ from tariffs, which usually apply only to foreign-made goods, and from sales taxes, which typically apply to all commodities other than those specifically exempted. In their modern farm, excise taxes were first developed by Holland in the 17th century, and established by law in England in 1643. Introduced into the Dutch colonies in America, the system spread to other colonies. Such taxes were first used by the federal government in 1791 and aroused great opposition. They were repealed (1802) in Thomas Jefferson''s administration. During the War of 1812 comprehensive excise taxes were levied again but were repealed in 1817.\n\nAccording to this text, how do excise taxes usually differ from tariffs?', NULL, NULL, NULL, E'Excise taxes are levied on goods produced and consumed in one country, while tariffs apply to imports.', NULL, NULL),
  ('2fbbf32e-8c77-5ed3-8792-0ab1a2c762cf'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DROPDOWN', E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DROPDOWN', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '2fbbf32e-8c77-5ed3-8792-0ab1a2c762cf'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Life Science', E'The Life Science Institute at the University of Michigan achieves excellence in biomedical research by bringing together the world''s {{1}} scientists from a variety of life science disciplines to accelerate {{2}} and discoveries that will improve human health. With close to 400 scientific staff members, the LSI is exploiting the power of a collaborative and interdisciplinary {{3}} to biomedical research in an open-laboratory {{4}} .', NULL, NULL, NULL, E'1.leading, 2.breakthroughs, 3.approach, 4.facility', NULL, NULL),
  ('2fbeed4c-5e8d-5a40-837f-c0f6e453bcfa'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'REPEAT_SENTENCE', E'REPEAT_SENTENCE', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '2fbeed4c-5e8d-5a40-837f-c0f6e453bcfa'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'RS', NULL, 'ddac5649-e76b-56dd-ad46-a4fc2d299016'::uuid, NULL, E'Your wages will be put into your bank account on Thursday.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('2fbf9624-cb21-5447-a101-7a7f5d8b1e08'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'READ_ALOUD', E'READ_ALOUD', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '2fbf9624-cb21-5447-a101-7a7f5d8b1e08'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Sad Truth', E'The sad truth is that happy sounds are infectious. Now comes research that at least partly explains why. It was published this week in the journal of Neuroscience. A British research team played various sounds including laughter to people who are having their brain scanned by a functional MRI machine. All the sounds activated the premotor cortical region of the brain — an area preparing facial muscles to move.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('2fc15693-7ad5-5d67-99d9-c1ef91b2707e'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'REPEAT_SENTENCE', E'REPEAT_SENTENCE', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '2fc15693-7ad5-5d67-99d9-c1ef91b2707e'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'RS', NULL, '20a9dbf6-f94f-5322-bb2b-736421853932'::uuid, NULL, E'An engine has many parts, each performing a different function.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('2fc485c9-05f2-5d97-adf2-2b08b52a42fd'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'RESPOND_TO_A_SITUATION', E'RESPOND_TO_A_SITUATION', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '2fc485c9-05f2-5d97-adf2-2b08b52a42fd'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Overwhelmed with Work', E'You''ve been feeling overwhelmed with work and personal commitments lately, realizing you need a better balance. You decide to speak with your manager about adjusting your workload or finding a more flexible working arrangement to manage stress and maintain productivity without compromising the quality of your work. What would you say to your boss?', '51fd681c-9669-57fc-9eef-29d35861f30f'::uuid, NULL, E'Hey boss, lately I''ve been feeling a bit stretched thin between work and my personal life, and I''m concerned about burning out. I was hoping we could chat about possibly adjusting my workload or exploring flexible work options. I believe with a slight shift, I can manage my responsibilities more effectively and maintain our standards of quality. I''m committed to my role and want to ensure I''m performing at my best. Could we schedule a time to discuss this further?', NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('2fc995dd-c5e1-5bfb-938a-848d1cfdf82d'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'LISTENING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '2fc995dd-c5e1-5bfb-938a-848d1cfdf82d'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'WFD', NULL, '01517e0d-186f-5cd9-bfcb-0bd60ffafe99'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'He had always obeyed his parents without question.', NULL, NULL),
  ('2fcb9981-9cff-560a-b845-fd6e9faaa9c2'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'WRITE_ESSAY', E'WRITE_ESSAY', E'WRITING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '2fcb9981-9cff-560a-b845-fd6e9faaa9c2'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Voting in Democratic Society', E'If Voting is compulsory in democratic society, what conclusions can we draw about Nature of democracy?', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 200, 300),
  ('2fd57165-67ae-5ffc-9148-4860d3b6ebff'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'SUMMARIZE_WRITTEN_TEXT', E'SUMMARIZE_WRITTEN_TEXT', E'WRITING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '2fd57165-67ae-5ffc-9148-4860d3b6ebff'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Embracing Simplicity', E'In our fast-paced and increasingly complex world, it''s easy to become overwhelmed by the demands of modern life. However, there is a growing movement that encourages us to embrace simplicity and find joy in the everyday moments.\nSimplicity is not about deprivation or austerity; it''s about focusing on what truly matters and eliminating unnecessary clutter from our lives. It''s about rediscovering the beauty in simplicity, mindfulness, and gratitude.\nOne way to embrace simplicity is by decluttering our physical spaces. Marie Kondo''s KonMari method, for example, advocates for keeping only the possessions that "spark joy." By tidying up and organizing our surroundings, we create a more peaceful and harmonious environment.\nAnother aspect of simplicity is cultivating mindfulness. This means being fully present in the moment, savoring each experience, and appreciating the small pleasures in life. Whether it''s enjoying a cup of tea, taking a leisurely walk in nature, or spending quality time with loved ones, mindfulness allows us to connect with the richness of the present.\nGratitude is also a key element in finding joy in simplicity. Taking time to acknowledge and appreciate the things we often take for granted can shift our perspective and bring greater happiness. Practicing gratitude reminds us of the abundance in our lives, even during challenging times.\nSimplicity does not require a radical overhaul of our lives; it''s about making small, intentional choices that align with our values and priorities. By simplifying our lives, we can reduce stress, enhance our well-being, and create space for the experiences and relationships that truly enrich our lives.\nIn conclusion, embracing simplicity is a powerful antidote to the complexities of modern life. It invites us to declutter, be mindful, and practice gratitude, ultimately allowing us to find greater joy in the everyday moments and appreciate the beauty in life''s simplicity.', NULL, NULL, E'Embracing simplicity in our fast-paced world involves focusing on what truly matters by decluttering our spaces, practicing mindfulness, and cultivating gratitude, leading to a more peaceful and harmonious life that appreciates the beauty of everyday moments and reduces stress for greater overall well-being.', NULL, 5, 75),
  ('2fde3c3e-2f06-5f63-b570-8f50cffd8859'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'REPEAT_SENTENCE', E'REPEAT_SENTENCE', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '2fde3c3e-2f06-5f63-b570-8f50cffd8859'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'RS', NULL, '85b77a8c-6cf1-53d7-bc1f-45274b506055'::uuid, NULL, E'Early findings are interesting but not very important in our study.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
