  ('2ff3829f-623f-588a-8194-f38eb34054f8'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'READ_ALOUD', E'READ_ALOUD', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '2ff3829f-623f-588a-8194-f38eb34054f8'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Second World War', E'For the first two or three years after the Second World War, a new title would often sell out within a few months of publication. However, unless public demand for the book was unusually high, they were rarely able to reprint it. With paper stocks strictly rationed, they could not afford to use up precious paper or tie up their limited capital with a reprint.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('2ff6c300-b906-59cb-9b37-0cd4f975a5bf'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DRAG_AND_DROP', E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DRAG_AND_DROP', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '2ff6c300-b906-59cb-9b37-0cd4f975a5bf'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Canada Gallery', E'An exhibit that brings together for the first {{1}} landscapes painted by French impressionist Pierre-Auguste Renoir {{2}} to the National Gallery of Canada this June. The {{5}} in Ottawa worked with the National Gallery of London and the Philadelphia Museum of Art to {{3}} together the collection of 60 Renoir {{4}} from 45 public and private collections.', NULL, NULL, NULL, E'1.time, 2.comes, 3.gallery, 4.pull, 5.paintings', NULL, NULL),
  ('2ff761c0-8e3b-59a0-ac7f-1d69f14b09cc'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'RE_TELL_LECTURE', E'RE_TELL_LECTURE', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '2ff761c0-8e3b-59a0-ac7f-1d69f14b09cc'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Absolute Zero', NULL, '879eebf5-7adb-5b81-8ffc-1b45909e8d2a'::uuid, NULL, E'Can we never get to absolute zero? What a wonderful question. I wish I had a wonderful answer to go with it. Here is the problem. There is actually a law of physics called the third law of thermodynamics, that says you cannot get to the absolutely zero, but we don''t really know it''s true. But we are pretty sure it is for the following reason: every time you think of some way of cooling something down a little bit, it means you try to get energy out of that thing and make the temperature lower. Well, if you can get energy out, usually there is a way that the energy can go in as well. And that always means there is a competition between taking the energy out and putting the energy in. Now you can try to make it, so you are favoring getting energy out, but you can''t completely stop the energy from going in and that means you might be able to get colder and colder, but you won''t be able to get all the way to absolute zero. Could we go back to my power point, because I think that one of these slides will illustrate that point a little bit better. Yes, here, remember the logarithmic thermometer? There is no zero on this logarithmic thermometer. Just keep it going down, you make it a fact of 10 times colder, you''re not a zero. You make it a fact of 10 times colder, you''re still not a zero. You make it a fact of 10 times colder, you''re still not a zero. So, you start from a millionth of a degree. Now you are 10 millionths of a degree. Now you are a billionth of degree. You never get to zero that way. You get closer and closer, but you never get to zero. So that''s why we cannot get to absolute zero.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('300db2de-b2a3-5981-9313-d9dfa5f53bcf'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DRAG_AND_DROP', E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DRAG_AND_DROP', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '300db2de-b2a3-5981-9313-d9dfa5f53bcf'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Telephone Networks', E'Telephone networks are big and {{1}} because the {{2}} increases, and need to function well in multiple environments. Therefore, we need to {{3}} future development and use the simulation system that is {{4}} in use.', NULL, NULL, NULL, E'1.complex, 2.demand, 3.forecast, 4.greatly', NULL, NULL),
  ('300e7b1d-7220-5566-89fd-4b4b99ba5335'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DROPDOWN', E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DROPDOWN', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '300e7b1d-7220-5566-89fd-4b4b99ba5335'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Complementary Therapies', E'Complementary therapies—such as those {{1}} by naturopaths, chiropractors and acupuncturists—have become increasingly popular in Australia over the last few {{2}} . Interest initially coincided with {{3}} for alternative lifestyles, while immigration and increased contact and trade with China have also had an {{4}} . The status of complementary therapies is being re-visited in a number of areas: legal regulation; the stances of doctors'' associations; their inclusion in medical education; and scientific research into their {{5}} .', NULL, NULL, NULL, E'1.practiced, 2.decades, 3.enthusiasm, 4.influence, 5.efficacy', NULL, NULL),
  ('300f9289-baa6-5aa6-ba58-0947260994c8'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'RESPOND_TO_A_SITUATION', E'RESPOND_TO_A_SITUATION', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '300f9289-baa6-5aa6-ba58-0947260994c8'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Wrong File', E'You have submitted a wrong file to your manager. Please apologize to him for it.', '32d01c1c-6aab-5805-a1f0-87d75b1f9e07'::uuid, NULL, E'Respected manager, I hope you are doing well.\nI would like to discuss an issue we have encountered with my submitted file.\nIt appears that I mistakenly sent you the incorrect file, and I sincerely apologize for this careless mistake.\nI would appreciate your opinion on this matter. Thank you for your consideration.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('30170190-7dc6-5888-a8e5-adfbf5a3bc55'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'ANSWER_SHORT_QUESTION', E'ANSWER_SHORT_QUESTION', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '30170190-7dc6-5888-a8e5-adfbf5a3bc55'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'ASQ', E'What part of a room is over your head?', '80c16f86-2f97-57f2-9822-931647875c6f'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'Ceiling', NULL, NULL),
  ('30170b79-94a9-5248-b622-bd008d472542'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'READ_ALOUD', E'READ_ALOUD', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '30170b79-94a9-5248-b622-bd008d472542'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Actor Training', E'Training to become an actor is an intensive process which requires curiosity, courage and commitment. You’ll learn how to prepare for rehearsal, how to rehearse and how to use independent and proactive processes to achieve your best work possible for stage and screen.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('3018c787-7ca7-5b00-b628-1ad5603d896a'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'ANSWER_SHORT_QUESTION', E'ANSWER_SHORT_QUESTION', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '3018c787-7ca7-5b00-b628-1ad5603d896a'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'ASQ', E'What do we call a member of the same team or group?', '217ba307-0de8-5d5f-879a-d5f11b9b000c'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'Teammate / colleague / group member / peer', NULL, NULL),
  ('301f8b27-052a-58b6-9d45-d83c3f6f3f6f'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'RE_TELL_LECTURE', E'RE_TELL_LECTURE', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '301f8b27-052a-58b6-9d45-d83c3f6f3f6f'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Why We Snore', NULL, '6fd7f32d-9c4c-5880-8e45-3395ad428685'::uuid, NULL, E'Why do we snore? Is there a bigger issue? Well, it’s quite simple really. People snore when they are having a really boring dream. Or when I’m doing my stand-up routine. See! Lights out! I...I’m still working on the jokes. But for real Mayo Clinic defines snoring as “the hoarse or harsh sound that occurs when air flows past relaxed tissues in your throat causing the tissues to vibrate as you breathe. people can snore due to a variety of reasons. Allergies or a cold might do it, as well as alcohol consumption or sleep deprivation. A person’s weight could also play a factor. Even just the anatomy of your mouth and sinuses could play a part! No matter the puzzle pieces that add up to a person snoring it could be a sign of a bigger issue known as obstructive sleep apnea, or OSA. Now, not every snorer has this condition even if their snoring is chronic but OSA can be a serious condition that should be addressed by a medical professional.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('301fe1a5-ff4f-5594-97a8-c3270149000e'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'LISTENING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '301fe1a5-ff4f-5594-97a8-c3270149000e'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'WFD', NULL, '0fa756ff-3874-5a58-b871-935cb221e20d'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'Mature students usually adapt to university life extremely well.', NULL, NULL),
  ('30212d09-10ba-5b73-a822-87ae2a596b0c'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'READ_ALOUD', E'READ_ALOUD', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '30212d09-10ba-5b73-a822-87ae2a596b0c'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'YouTube', E'YouTube has banned videos that show people how to manufacture or modify guns and their accessories. It had already banned videos linked to the sale of guns and accessories. Many firearms enthusiasts noticed that some of their videos had been removed from the video-sharing website and some had their channels suspended.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
