  ('3229e445-4f6f-5e7d-8bb2-51fce5cc31bb'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'LISTENING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '3229e445-4f6f-5e7d-8bb2-51fce5cc31bb'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'WFD', NULL, 'f5c4d218-1c57-57ea-942d-307fa74ab12a'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'Even if you have used cosmetics for years without problems, one or more ingredients can still trigger an allergic reaction.', NULL, NULL),
  ('322b8ae9-4c58-5acb-85ea-5e7f77a5651d'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DROPDOWN', E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DROPDOWN', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '322b8ae9-4c58-5acb-85ea-5e7f77a5651d'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Breath', E'Researchers have proposed a new biometric test that uses human breath as a source of identification. The idea is based on the fact that each person has a unique breathing pattern, which is influenced by the shape and size of their airways, lungs, and diaphragm. When a person {{1}} , they create a distinctive air turbulence, which can be measured by an air pressure sensor. This sensor can then {{2}} the breathing data with an artificial intelligence model that has learned to recognize each person’s breathing pattern from previous samples. The system rejects {{3}} with 97% accuracy, meaning that it could detect when someone else was trying to use another person’s breath to unlock a device. The system also has the advantage of being impossible to pass by a dead person, {{4}} other biometric tests that rely on blood flow or electrical signals. The researchers believe that their system could be used for various applications, such as unlocking smartphones, laptops, or cars, or accessing secure facilities or online accounts. The system could also be used to {{5}} the health and well-being of users, as changes in breathing patterns could indicate stress, fatigue, or illness.', NULL, NULL, NULL, E'1.exhales, 2.compare, 3.impostors, 4.unlike, 5.monitor', NULL, NULL),
  ('322ca655-1e83-5cf5-bfaf-ec6ca608bb87'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'LISTENING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '322ca655-1e83-5cf5-bfaf-ec6ca608bb87'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'WFD', NULL, '80d2e8d7-4667-51ec-a119-3ce10f4bf810'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'A strong beginning is key to any successful presentation''s success.', NULL, NULL),
  ('322cd829-7b7c-5d0f-8797-9743dd8a7875'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'READ_ALOUD', E'READ_ALOUD', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '322cd829-7b7c-5d0f-8797-9743dd8a7875'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Studying Topics', E'In classes, your teachers will talk about topics that you are studying. The information that they provide will be important to know when you take tests. You must be able to take good written notes from what your teachers say.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('3232bd45-39fa-52df-8cbb-03ffb43376c1'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'LISTENING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '3232bd45-39fa-52df-8cbb-03ffb43376c1'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'WFD', NULL, '37335c58-9694-5b8b-8da7-da80795934cb'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'Students will be informed of the services available on this campus.', NULL, NULL),
  ('3239d98a-5c4a-594a-9f05-ded5943fcf2b'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'MC_LISTENING_MULTIPLE', E'MC_LISTENING_MULTIPLE', E'LISTENING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '3239d98a-5c4a-594a-9f05-ded5943fcf2b'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'MCM-L', E'It now seems likely that the earliest printing presses were, in fact, simply the common screw presses used for crushing oil seeds and herbs, or even for doing more domestic chores such as pressing fabrics, adapted for printing. Other large wooden presses, such as those used for crushing the juice from olives and grapes - known as beam presses - had been around for centuries, but proved to be unsuitable for printing due to their size and their necessarily heavy pressure.\nMost presses of this type work on the simple principle of direct vertical pressure, controlled by a central screw at the lower end of which was attached a flat board - what later became known as a platen. We know that many of these earliest printing presses were still in regular use in the 17th century, and the basic design remained almost unchanged until the 19th century, when they were replaced with iron presses.\n\nWhich of the following were the presses adapted for printing originally used for?', '76f1917c-0a24-5f71-8933-0971589cb1a7'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'pressing clothes\ncrushing seeds and herbs', NULL, NULL),
  ('3243432d-78e3-517a-9a20-76c64e73a8db'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'ANSWER_SHORT_QUESTION', E'ANSWER_SHORT_QUESTION', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '3243432d-78e3-517a-9a20-76c64e73a8db'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'ASQ', E'What is the opposite of convex?', 'a1cf01cb-869c-5666-b0f3-43f9aea36f6c'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'Concave', NULL, NULL),
  ('3247e7e0-4116-54c1-9bb9-0be3e401b763'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'ANSWER_SHORT_QUESTION', E'ANSWER_SHORT_QUESTION', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '3247e7e0-4116-54c1-9bb9-0be3e401b763'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'ASQ', E'What is a painting or photo of people especially when it includes someone''s face, head and shoulder?', '657fcc35-8c62-5e2c-8dd6-b96d5791e629'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'Portrait', NULL, NULL),
  ('3248e15e-5481-5f54-8ee5-9c7c7fd02dac'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'REPEAT_SENTENCE', E'REPEAT_SENTENCE', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '3248e15e-5481-5f54-8ee5-9c7c7fd02dac'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'RS', NULL, '04164895-05c9-5270-a8a9-e2c172b44330'::uuid, NULL, E'The problems that science solves far outweigh the problems that it may bring.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('325b70ba-4d42-5939-bad9-39cd10fa6f6f'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'ANSWER_SHORT_QUESTION', E'ANSWER_SHORT_QUESTION', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '325b70ba-4d42-5939-bad9-39cd10fa6f6f'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'ASQ', E'How many wheels does the tricycle have?', '06c1e76b-073a-55f7-a2d0-2b675a624cd0'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'Three', NULL, NULL),
  ('32659cb6-241d-586a-b579-12bf88f036c1'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'READ_ALOUD', E'READ_ALOUD', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '32659cb6-241d-586a-b579-12bf88f036c1'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Arctic Region', E'The Arctic region is one of the most fragile ecosystems on Earth, with melting ice caps and rising temperatures threatening many species that call this region home. Protecting this vital ecosystem will require international cooperation on issues like reducing greenhouse gas emissions and preserving biodiversity.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('326a745e-4a94-5238-81d4-040ed10c0c64'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'READ_ALOUD', E'READ_ALOUD', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '326a745e-4a94-5238-81d4-040ed10c0c64'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Carbon Sink', E'The largest terrestrial carbon sink on Earth is the planet''s soil. One of the big fears is that a warming planet will liberate significant portions of the soil''s carbon, turning it into carbon dioxide (CO2) gas, and so further accelerate the pace of planetary warming.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('326df1f8-5814-55c8-85ed-f47222c4b24e'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'ANSWER_SHORT_QUESTION', E'ANSWER_SHORT_QUESTION', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '326df1f8-5814-55c8-85ed-f47222c4b24e'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'ASQ', E'What do we call the injection given to prevent certain diseases?', '5a7cc022-f27b-5ed1-969a-a701634784e3'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'Vaccine', NULL, NULL),
  ('327818ed-3161-5445-8017-c374b9ce9ffd'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'WRITE_ESSAY', E'WRITE_ESSAY', E'WRITING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '327818ed-3161-5445-8017-c374b9ce9ffd'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Learning Past', E'Learning about the past has no value for those of us living in the present. Do you agree or disagree?', NULL, NULL, E'The statement that learning about the past has no value for those of us living in the present is a misguided perspective. Contrary to this belief, studying history holds immense significance in our lives. This essay will present three compelling reasons why dismissing the value of learning about the past is a flawed viewpoint.\nFirstly, studying history allows us to learn from the mistakes and successes of previous generations. By examining the past, we gain valuable insights into the consequences of certain actions and decisions. This knowledge enables us to make informed choices and avoid repeating past failures. History acts as a guide, providing us with valuable lessons that can shape our present and future endeavors.\nSecondly, understanding history fosters a sense of appreciation for our cultural heritage and societal progress. By delving into the past, we develop a deeper understanding of the struggles, achievements, and contributions of our ancestors. This knowledge instills a sense of pride and identity, allowing us to connect with our roots and appreciate the progress we have made as a society. Ignoring history would mean neglecting the foundation upon which our present circumstances are built.\nIn conclusion, the notion that learning about the past holds no value for those of us living in the present is fundamentally flawed. The study of history equips us with valuable lessons from the past, enabling us to make informed decisions and avoid repeating mistakes. Additionally, understanding our cultural heritage fosters appreciation and identity. Therefore, it is crucial that we embrace the study of history as an essential tool for personal growth, societal progress, and shaping a better future for ourselves and generations to come.', NULL, 200, 300),
  ('32800897-08ac-5686-83ba-f8d666133faa'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'LISTENING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '32800897-08ac-5686-83ba-f8d666133faa'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'WFD', NULL, '34ec1382-57e9-5a67-813a-a284ab08bcfe'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'Safety glasses should be worn while doing experiments in the lab.', NULL, NULL),
  ('32878375-34b1-5017-a0da-3b806349b844'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'LISTENING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '32878375-34b1-5017-a0da-3b806349b844'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'WFD', NULL, 'f57815ae-1b33-5a5c-bd81-66d19e11cf6e'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'Participants recorded their sleep hours in the journals.', NULL, NULL),
  ('3288e43c-e83f-508f-b444-1f22ec1b74f4'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DROPDOWN', E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DROPDOWN', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '3288e43c-e83f-508f-b444-1f22ec1b74f4'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'EE&AVG', E'There has been increased research interest in the use of active video games (in which players physically interact with images onscreen) as a means to {{1}} physical activity in children. The aim of this review was to assess active video games as a means of increasing energy expenditure and physical activity behavior in children. Studies were obtained from computerized searches of multiple electronic bibliographic databases. The last search was conducted in December 2008. Eleven studies focused on the quantification of the energy cost associated with playing active video games, and eight studies focused on the utility of active video games as an {{2}} to increase physical activity in children. Compared with traditional non-active video games, active video games {{3}} greater energy expenditure, which was similar in intensity to mild to moderate intensity physical activity. The intervention studies indicate that active video games may have the potential to increase free-living physical activity and improve body {{4}} in children; however, methodological limitations prevent {{5}} conclusions. Future research should focus on larger, methodologically sound intervention trials to provide definitive answers as to whether this technology is effective in {{6}} long-term physical activity in children.', NULL, NULL, NULL, E'1.promote, 2.intervention, 3.elicited, 4.composition, 5.definitive, 6.promoting', NULL, NULL),
  ('328b4cde-d2cf-57e8-9ff8-b6604cc6cf46'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'REPEAT_SENTENCE', E'REPEAT_SENTENCE', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '328b4cde-d2cf-57e8-9ff8-b6604cc6cf46'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'RS', NULL, '83f112f0-da54-50a6-8aac-44cb23e3b0a0'::uuid, NULL, E'I intend to take full advantage of this trip to buy the things we need.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('328b7e5e-a961-5fcc-b918-0a0346171d57'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'RE_TELL_LECTURE', E'RE_TELL_LECTURE', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '328b7e5e-a961-5fcc-b918-0a0346171d57'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Role of Diet', NULL, '4151fda8-4cea-537d-980e-2c8177a223b1'::uuid, NULL, E'In the midst of our academic pursuits, let us not overlook a fundamental truth: the profound connection between diet and mental health. What we eat fuels not only our bodies but also our minds. Nutritional psychiatry is an emerging field revealing how our dietary choices impact our mood and mental well-being. Foods rich in omega-3 fatty acids, for example, are not merely good for the heart but are also linked to reduced rates of depression. Additionally, the gut-brain axis presents a fascinating narrative of communication between our digestive systems and mental states. The microbiome in our intestines may influence everything from our stress levels to our thought processes, making balanced, mindful eating an essential component of mental fitness. As we navigate the complexities of college life, let us be mindful of the sustenance we choose. A well-nourished body can be the vessel of a well-nourished mind, enabling us to reach the zenith of our intellectual and emotional capacities.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('32a57e5c-f70f-5da3-b7a0-fe209e94b4d5'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'LISTENING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '32a57e5c-f70f-5da3-b7a0-fe209e94b4d5'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'WFD', NULL, 'bf2bdad5-a118-55cb-9e96-8e61b1b554ee'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'Enrolling in a double major will increase your career options.', NULL, NULL),
  ('32ae7ac7-2c83-5cc8-b718-3e9ef79d9d44'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'READ_ALOUD', E'READ_ALOUD', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '32ae7ac7-2c83-5cc8-b718-3e9ef79d9d44'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Nature and Cities', E'To thrive, cities must lean on nature. That means having open green spaces and interconnected waterways to prevent floods, green roofs and walls that reduce temperatures and produce food, and forests planted as green belts to oxygenate urban areas and regenerate ecosystems.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('32aea42d-605f-54d9-9de2-e0309672c46b'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'WRITE_ESSAY', E'WRITE_ESSAY', E'WRITING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '32aea42d-605f-54d9-9de2-e0309672c46b'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Television', E'Nowadays television has become an essential part of life. It is a medium for disseminating news and information, and for some it acts as a companion. What is your opinion about this?', NULL, NULL, E'Television serves many useful functions, and I agree that it helps people to relax and can be seen as a companion for lonely individuals. In today''s fast-paced world, television provides a much-needed escape and entertainment for people of all ages.\nFirstly, television helps people to relax after a long and tiring day. After fulfilling their responsibilities and facing the challenges of life, individuals often seek ways to recharge. Television offers a wide range of programs, such as comedies, dramas, and reality shows, which provide a source of relaxation and amusement. It allows people to immerse themselves in captivating storylines, laugh at humorous situations, or simply enjoy the beauty of nature through documentaries. By engaging with television content, individuals can temporarily forget their worries and find peace in the entertainment it provides.\nAdditionally, television can be seen as a companion for lonely people. In today''s modern society, many individuals experience feelings of isolation and loneliness due to various reasons, such as living alone or being physically distant from loved ones. Television acts as a virtual companion, offering company and a sense of connection. It creates a shared experience as individuals watch their favorite shows or follow ongoing series. Characters on television become familiar faces, providing a sense of comfort and companionship.\nIn conclusion, television serves as a valuable tool for relaxation and companionship. It provides an escape from the stresses of life and offers entertainment that helps individuals relax. Moreover, it acts as a companion for lonely people, providing a sense of connection and shared experiences.', NULL, 200, 300),
  ('32b00cea-3e28-50c8-aee9-1fede757d82d'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'LISTENING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '32b00cea-3e28-50c8-aee9-1fede757d82d'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'WFD', NULL, '4ac94b90-5d8e-57c4-996c-4799d4c0262e'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'Avoid confusing the cause and effect of these changes.', NULL, NULL),
