  ('32e0f5ce-2f14-546b-a67b-e638b3754378'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'LISTENING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '32e0f5ce-2f14-546b-a67b-e638b3754378'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'WFD', NULL, 'ebae80aa-4f11-5ee6-934d-e734bcc892e5'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'The man''s novels have gained in popularity over recent years.', NULL, NULL),
  ('32e2785e-0371-548e-b9ca-1a8e92d96d0f'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'RESPOND_TO_A_SITUATION', E'RESPOND_TO_A_SITUATION', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '32e2785e-0371-548e-b9ca-1a8e92d96d0f'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Renting Bikes', E'You overheard your colleagues discussing renting bikes, which sounds really fun and you are interested in it. Speak to your colleagues to inquire about the details, such as the cost of renting and how and where you can rent a bike.', '39f0bd46-8bd2-541d-aac3-907b3b6d7e46'::uuid, NULL, E'Hey colleagues, I want to talk to you about something.\nWe seem to have a little issue with asking about bike rental.\nIt''s like I overheard you talking about renting bikes, and it sounds really fun. I’m quite interested, so I want to ask some details including the rental cost, the rental methods and the place to rent bikes.\nAnd I''d like to know what you think.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('32f02016-3064-5c5c-904a-b7c13621c3bc'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DROPDOWN', E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DROPDOWN', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '32f02016-3064-5c5c-904a-b7c13621c3bc'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Silent Alarm', E'Firstly, the environmental research community is experiencing a silent alarm, as the pace of ecological degradation is outpacing their projections. The rate of deforestation and habitat loss, especially in the Amazon and Southeast Asian rainforests, is exceeding {{1}} estimates. This is leading to a catastrophic loss of biodiversity and an acceleration in the extinction of numerous species. Concurrently, ocean {{2}} , particularly plastic contamination, is growing more rapidly than anticipated, affecting marine life and coral reefs worldwide. The Great Barrier Reef, for example, is experiencing {{3}} levels of bleaching and may be irreversibly damaged within a decade. The environmental reports and predictions that were {{4}} upon by various governments and organizations are now seen as outdated and overly optimistic. Secondly, one of the most immediate consequences of this environmental crisis will be its impact on human health and livelihoods. As global temperatures continue to rise - a situation that is now inevitable {{5}} existing levels of greenhouse gases - the incidence of health issues related to pollution and heatwaves will increase dramatically. This will disproportionately affect vulnerable populations in developing countries, leading to widespread health crises and exacerbating existing socioeconomic disparities.', NULL, NULL, NULL, E'1.prior, 2.pollution, 3.unprecedented, 4.relied, 5.due to', NULL, NULL),
  ('32f28b23-e1cc-5221-a729-5a5e0bc00f02'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'WRITE_ESSAY', E'WRITE_ESSAY', E'WRITING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '32f28b23-e1cc-5221-a729-5a5e0bc00f02'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Credit Cards', E'In a cashless society, people in more and more situations use credit cards instead of cash. Cashless society seems to be a reality. How realistic do you think it might be? What are the potential benefits or problems of this phenomenon?', NULL, NULL, E'Nowadays, whether a cashless society seems to be a reality has fueled heated discussions. Proponents claim that cashless society has become a reality because of its process efficiency and better money safety, whereas opponents contend that cashless society is not realistic and will bring some problems. From my perspective, I am convinced that a cashless society is highly realistic and beneficial, as it improves convenience and security in daily transactions.\nTo begin with, the shift toward a cashless society offers greater convenience in payments. For example, using credit cards or mobile payments is much faster than handling cash, reducing waiting time in stores and public transport. In addition to this, digital transactions eliminate the need to carry bulky wallets or worry about losing cash. Other than that, online bill payments and subscription services automate regular expenses, saving time on manual transactions. It is thus shown that a society without cash is highly practical and beneficial.\nBesides, I also believe that a cashless society enhances transaction security and generates economic efficiencies. On top of that, cashless payments reduce theft risks since stolen credit cards can be blocked instantly, unlike physical money. Moreover, digital records of transactions help track spending habits and make a more strategic budgeting more effectively than cash receipts. Recently, I have examined an article arguing that many banks and apps offer cashback or rewards for using digital payments, resulting in cumulative savings in the long run. This clearly proves that a cashless society is highly feasible and advantageous.\nTo conclude, there is no doubt that personal convenience and extra earnings are essential in today''s world. While some might disagree, the evidence strongly supports that a society without physical cash is entirely realistic and brings advantages of convenience and security.', NULL, 200, 300),
  ('32f7f7bd-00da-5ac6-aa68-f9b5968e7a4e'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'MC_READING_MULTIPLE', E'MC_READING_MULTIPLE', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '32f7f7bd-00da-5ac6-aa68-f9b5968e7a4e'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Prehistoric Paintings', E'In Southwest France in the 1940''s, playing children discovered Lascaux Grotto, a series of narrow cave chambers that contain huge prehistoric paintings of animals. Many of these beasts are as large as 16 feet (almost 5 meters). Some follow each other in solemn parades, but others swirl about, sideways and upside down. The animals are bulls, wild horses, reindeer, bison, and mammoths outlined with charcoal and painted mostly in reds, yellow, and browns. Scientific analysis reveals that the colors were derived from ocher and other iron oxides ground into a fine powder. Methods of applying color varied: some colors were brushed or smeared on rock surfaces and others were blown or sprayed. It is possible that tubes made from animal bones were used for spraying because hollow bones, some stained with pigment, have been found nearby.\n\nWhat are the bones found in the Lascaux caves believed to indicate?', NULL, NULL, NULL, E'Artists developed special techniques for painting the walls.\nBones were not only relate to food.', NULL, NULL),
  ('32fcce52-c7c3-541f-98d7-3f5efec985e9'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DROPDOWN', E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DROPDOWN', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '32fcce52-c7c3-541f-98d7-3f5efec985e9'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Studying Law', E'It is important to emphasize the need for hard work as an essential part of studying law, because far too many students are tempted to think that they can succeed by relying on what they imagine to be their natural ability, without bothering to add the {{1}} of effort. To take an analogy some people prefer the more or less instant {{2}} which comes from watching television adaptation of a classic novel to the rather more {{3}} process of reading the novel itself. Those who {{4}} watching television to reading the book are less likely to study law successfully, unless they rapidly acquire a {{5}} for text-based materials.', NULL, NULL, NULL, E'1.expenditure, 2.gratification, 3.laborious, 4.prefer, 5.taste', NULL, NULL),
  ('33027199-037f-5c2f-a5ab-47189b7f86e3'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'REPEAT_SENTENCE', E'REPEAT_SENTENCE', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '33027199-037f-5c2f-a5ab-47189b7f86e3'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'RS', NULL, 'fb054bb2-08ca-51a6-bba4-7874e121b82c'::uuid, NULL, E'Students who have completed a placement are more likely to obtain a good job.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
