  ('33a5e9d6-49c2-5c37-a2f3-7461c644847a'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'REPEAT_SENTENCE', E'REPEAT_SENTENCE', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '33a5e9d6-49c2-5c37-a2f3-7461c644847a'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'RS', NULL, '8b8b85e6-d397-560e-ac20-326f8bd2561b'::uuid, NULL, E'During the childhood development, the importance of education is stronger than ever.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('33ac80aa-75d9-5719-ae50-c64d5c7224a2'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'LISTENING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '33ac80aa-75d9-5719-ae50-c64d5c7224a2'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'WFD', NULL, '1209b23d-7758-5425-8ea1-900aabec2b3e'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'People of higher status tend more to travel by private cars.', NULL, NULL),
  ('33b2b144-3fc8-55e4-8569-850c38936a34'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'REPEAT_SENTENCE', E'REPEAT_SENTENCE', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '33b2b144-3fc8-55e4-8569-850c38936a34'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'RS', NULL, '2799ff34-f698-507a-b6c4-012a049302ab'::uuid, NULL, E'The interaction of climate change and soil degradation will probably aggravate conditions.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('33b3f88a-f7c1-5687-93b8-8b265ea5550a'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'MC_LISTENING_SINGLE', E'MC_LISTENING_SINGLE', E'LISTENING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '33b3f88a-f7c1-5687-93b8-8b265ea5550a'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Blues', E'The origins of jazz are as richly textured as the music itself. The term jazz really covers many different kinds of music. In the late nineteenth century, african americans began performing the folk music known as the blues, whose origins lay in the work songs of slavery days. Within the african american community. The blues evolved into popular commercial music. In nineteen fourteen, a black orchestra leader named w c handy wrote the st. Louis blues, adapting the african american folk idiom to european convention of orchestration and harmony. Handy produced a hit song. The st. Louis blues was tremendously influential among black and white musicians, and handy style of music became famous under the name of jazz. Early jazz musicians were active in many cities and towns throughout the southern united states. It was new orleans with its long tradition of african american music that was the home of many fathers of jazz. After world war one, the musicians of new orleans joined the general northward migration of african americans. The first great national center of jazz was chicago. From there, the music entered the mainstream and even gave its name to the decade of the nineteen twenties. Jazz blending african american folk roots with elements of popular music and european classical traditions has been called america''s classical music.\n\nWhat does the instructor imply about the style of music known as the blues?', 'd7ca1cd3-b30e-5c66-8880-07e2be1b79ce'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'It changed and developed over time.', NULL, NULL),
  ('33b7bd24-808b-5a6b-a17d-764eff10eca3'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'WRITE_ESSAY', E'WRITE_ESSAY', E'WRITING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '33b7bd24-808b-5a6b-a17d-764eff10eca3'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Games', E'Games are as important for adults as they are for children. To what extent do you agree with this statement?', NULL, NULL, E'The question of whether games are as important for adults as they are for children is a complex one. While some argue that games are a waste of time, I believe that games are just as important for adults as they are for children because they can provide stress relief, improve cognitive function, and be a fun way to connect with others.\nGames can provide stress relief for adults. With the pressures of work, family, and other responsibilities, adults often experience high levels of stress. Playing games can provide a fun and engaging way to reduce stress and improve mental health. Research has shown that playing games can increase levels of dopamine in the brain, which can improve mood and reduce stress. Additionally, playing games can provide a sense of control and accomplishment, which can improve self-esteem and reduce feelings of anxiety.\nGames can improve cognitive function and be a fun way to connect with others. Many games require problem-solving skills, strategic thinking, and quick decision-making, which can improve cognitive function and brain health. For example, puzzle games like Sudoku or strategy games like chess have been shown to improve memory and problem-solving skills. Additionally, playing games can be a fun and social way to connect with others and build relationships. Multiplayer games like World of Warcraft or Fortnite have become popular ways for people to connect with others from around the world and build friendships based on shared interests.\nIn conclusion, I believe that games are just as important for adults as they are for children. Games can provide stress relief, improve cognitive function, and be a fun way to connect with others. While some may argue that games are a waste of time, it is important to recognize the many benefits that games can provide. By incorporating games into their lives, adults can lead more balanced and fulfilling lives. Whether it''s playing a quick game of Candy Crush during a break at work or joining an online gaming community, games can provide a valuable source of entertainment and enrichment for adults of all ages.', NULL, 200, 300),
  ('33bc0f80-2f70-5630-99f2-e0d2339efaa0'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DROPDOWN', E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DROPDOWN', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '33bc0f80-2f70-5630-99f2-e0d2339efaa0'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Eco-anxiety', E'Eco-anxiety is already causing people to lose sleep over climate change. Now, a global study has found that a warming planet is also affecting how long people sleep, and the problem will get significantly worse this century even if humanity manages to {{1}} in its carbon emissions. Our measurements of the impact of above-average night temperatures on sleep have previously been limited by being {{2}} to single countries, lab studies or notoriously unreliable self-reporting of sleep. To glean a better real-world picture, Kelton Minor at the University of Copenhagen, Denmark, took data from sleep-tracking wristbands used by 48,000 people in 68 countries between 2015 and 2017. He and his colleagues then {{3}} the sleep data with local weather data, revealing that unusually hot nights are causing people to fall asleep later, rise earlier and sleep less.', NULL, NULL, NULL, E'1.rein, 2.confined, 3.paired', NULL, NULL),
  ('33c02e04-e2a0-5554-8839-2effc0172406'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'LISTENING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '33c02e04-e2a0-5554-8839-2effc0172406'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'WFD', NULL, 'f0ba81dc-b336-5ae2-a3ab-26493698c873'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'University graduates have opportunities for career advancement and personal growth.', NULL, NULL),
