  ('3417ffc0-9081-5a79-90fb-7aa312c17d30'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'REPEAT_SENTENCE', E'REPEAT_SENTENCE', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '3417ffc0-9081-5a79-90fb-7aa312c17d30'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'RS', NULL, 'a728d5c2-c3c5-5fa3-a635-c26d5ca15f2c'::uuid, NULL, E'Improving the quality of air and water is important to human beings.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('341c0a7d-843c-5e08-8fdc-49921eb55cfe'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DROPDOWN', E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DROPDOWN', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '341c0a7d-843c-5e08-8fdc-49921eb55cfe'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Deception', E'Deception refers to the act of {{1}} people to believe information that is not true. Lying is a common form of deception, stating something known to be untrue with the intent to deceive. While most people are generally honest, even those who {{2}} to honesty engage in deception sometimes. Studies show that the average person lies several times a day. Some of those lies are big (‘I’ve never cheated on you!’) but more often, they are little white lies (‘That dress looks fine’) deployed to {{3}} uncomfortable situations or spare someone''s feelings.\nTrust is the bedrock of social life at all levels, from romance and parenting to national government. Deception always {{4}} it. Because truth is so essential to the human enterprise, which relies on a shared view of reality, the default assumption most people have is that others are truthful in their communications and dealings. Most cultures have powerful social {{5}} against lying.', NULL, NULL, NULL, E'1.encouraging, 2.subscribe, 3.avoid, 4.undermines, 5.sanctions', NULL, NULL),
  ('3420d96f-af17-5815-90b6-2464c34191b0'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'LISTENING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '3420d96f-af17-5815-90b6-2464c34191b0'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'WFD', NULL, 'a4f3187d-3cb3-5f64-8fda-a5225086abe9'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'An architect requires problem-solving skills and an eye for design.', NULL, NULL),
  ('3421406f-8cd6-57e1-aded-5a66ae8e1a63'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DROPDOWN', E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DROPDOWN', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '3421406f-8cd6-57e1-aded-5a66ae8e1a63'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Employee Stress Levels', E'The reality is that stress is a part of life. Attempting to remove all stress would not be {{1}} , and chances are that it would not be healthy, either. An appropriate level of stress may actually be an essential part of a healthy environment. Stress may be an inherent part of the opportunity to achieve difficult and {{2}} goals that bring fulfillment. If there is no challenge or difficulty, there may be little to no {{3}} or sense of achievement either. One approach to dealing with stress in the workplace is to train employees to manage their stress. Programs and resources for stress management can be helpful, but if stress levels are {{4}} high, organizations need to do more than try to help employees manage stress. Instead, they need to focus on changing the basic system and the forces in their organization that are causing those unhealthy levels of stress.', NULL, NULL, NULL, E'1.realistic, 2.worthwhile, 3.satisfaction, 4.unreasonably', NULL, NULL),
  ('3423edf5-75ad-5333-919c-eb5a6b4b0c89'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'WRITE_ESSAY', E'WRITE_ESSAY', E'WRITING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '3423edf5-75ad-5333-919c-eb5a6b4b0c89'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Gap Year', E'Nowadays, many students choose to take a gap year before starting their college. What are the advantages and disadvantages of it?', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 200, 300),
  ('34285807-33cd-56ac-a709-88386bd1c9a7'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'RE_TELL_LECTURE', E'RE_TELL_LECTURE', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '34285807-33cd-56ac-a709-88386bd1c9a7'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Mental Health Awareness', NULL, '644c99fd-6d5d-50a4-90e1-be9bec012a3b'::uuid, NULL, E'I''d like to illuminate a topic that resonates with each of us, yet often dwells in the shadows of our bustling lives: Mental Health Awareness. In our pursuit of academic and professional excellence, we frequently sideline the very engine of our aspirations — our mental well-being. A study from the American Psychological Association revealed that one in three college students experience significant difficulty due to depression, and over 40% feel overwhelming anxiety. These aren''t just numbers; they''re a reflection of silenced struggles that many among us endure. Moreover, the veil of stigma that shrouds mental health issues can lead to isolation. By fostering open conversations, we dismantle this stigma. We empower those grappling with mental challenges to seek support, be it through counseling, peer discussions, or mindfulness practices. After all, the strength of a community is gauged by how it uplifts its most vulnerable members. As we stand on the cusp of our futures, let us pledge to prioritize mental health with the same vigor we apply to our academic endeavors. For in nurturing our minds, we don''t just better ourselves — we create a ripple effect that enriches our entire community.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('3437481e-5981-5a0d-9371-1cff35bc696f'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DROPDOWN', E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DROPDOWN', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '3437481e-5981-5a0d-9371-1cff35bc696f'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Technology Calendar', E'According to BT''s futurologist, Ian Pearson, these are among the developments scheduled for the first few decades of the new millennium (a period of 1,000 years), when supercomputers will dramatically accelerate progress in all areas of life. Pearson has {{1}} together the work of hundreds of researchers around the world to produce a {{2}} millennium technology calendar that gives the latest dates when we can expect hundreds of key {{3}} and discoveries to take place. Some of the biggest developments will be in medicine, including an {{4}} life expectancy and dozens of artificial organs {{5}} into use between now and 2040.', NULL, NULL, NULL, E'1.pieced, 2.unique, 3.breakthroughs, 4.extended, 5.coming', NULL, NULL),
  ('3437ac2c-314e-5745-a4cb-7b1033dd04e7'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'LISTENING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '3437ac2c-314e-5745-a4cb-7b1033dd04e7'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'WFD', NULL, 'dc4d0445-841e-5014-8bb8-eeca77605a29'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'Preparation is important to avoid mishaps in the lab.', NULL, NULL),
  ('34430f03-137b-5efe-b168-4dc6d645756b'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DROPDOWN', E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DROPDOWN', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '34430f03-137b-5efe-b168-4dc6d645756b'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Business Schools', E'In an attempt to {{1}} new students, leading business schools — including Harvard, Stanford, the University of Chicago and Wharton – have moved away from the unofficial admissions {{2}} of four years’ work experience and {{3}} have set their sights on recent college graduates and so-called ‘early career {{4}} with only a couple years of work under the {{5}} .', NULL, NULL, NULL, E'1.lure, 2.pre-requisite, 3.instead, 4.professionals, 5.belt', NULL, NULL),
  ('34466040-1008-56f2-8231-6cce7cbbe817'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DROPDOWN', E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DROPDOWN', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '34466040-1008-56f2-8231-6cce7cbbe817'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Federal Government System', E'A federal government system is a form of political organization in which power is divided between a central authority and constituent political units, such as states or provinces. This system allows for a balance of power, enabling the central government to {{1}} national-level responsibilities like defense, foreign policy, and monetary regulation, {{2}} the smaller units manage more localized affairs, such as education, transportation, and public health. The division of powers is constitutionally established, ensuring that each level of government has a degree of {{3}} and can make decisions within its jurisdiction. This setup aims to combine the strengths of a unified nation with the flexibility and cultural responsiveness of more localized governance, allowing for diverse regions within a country to maintain a degree of self-rule while contributing to the {{4}} unity and function of the nation. The United States, Canada, and Australia are examples of countries with federal systems, each with its unique way of balancing powers between the national and state or provincial governments.', NULL, NULL, NULL, E'1.handle, 2.while, 3.autonomy, 4.overall', NULL, NULL),
  ('34476c0b-88dc-5850-9772-87625c19fa96'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'LISTENING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '34476c0b-88dc-5850-9772-87625c19fa96'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'WFD', NULL, 'f1b6932d-0c60-5c6f-8f25-8441aa677686'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'The history of our university is both extensive and fascinating.', NULL, NULL),
  ('344bbf97-b975-5289-a1ec-40f2feb161b3'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DROPDOWN', E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DROPDOWN', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '344bbf97-b975-5289-a1ec-40f2feb161b3'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Ancient Egypt Music', E'Music was as important to the ancient Egyptians as it is in our modern society. Although it is thought that music played a {{6}} throughout the history of Egypt, those that {{4}} the Egyptian writings have discovered that music {{1}} to become more important in what is called the ''pharaonic'' {{5}} of their history. This was the {{7}} when the Egyptian dynasties of the pharaohs were {{3}} (around 3100 BCE) and music was {{2}} many parts of everyday Egyptian life.', NULL, NULL, NULL, E'1.role, 2.study, 3.seemed, 4.period, 5.time, 6.established, 7.found in', NULL, NULL),
  ('344bf076-580d-516c-87bf-9678167383fb'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'LISTENING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '344bf076-580d-516c-87bf-9678167383fb'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'WFD', NULL, '2b794a9b-7f96-5bd9-9a98-fe60535ccbd9'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'Before writing down your notes, check the accuracy of your data.', NULL, NULL),
  ('3456464e-a15f-5e5c-892d-56c8cf130d5a'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'LISTENING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '3456464e-a15f-5e5c-892d-56c8cf130d5a'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'WFD', NULL, '05226f69-afd3-50d7-bcc2-cce22988e718'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'You need to make sure that all your essays are handed in on time.', NULL, NULL),
  ('34571afd-84f4-5a30-a014-a0463b2cb44f'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'MC_READING_MULTIPLE', E'MC_READING_MULTIPLE', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '34571afd-84f4-5a30-a014-a0463b2cb44f'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Wooden Sculptures', E'Much has been written on the wooden sculptures of West Africa. Especially Nigeria, which was pre-eminent in the art, for unlike other crafts, wood-carving has long been acknowledged in the West as an art form.\nYet, compared with stone or bronze, wood is not a very durable material in tropical conditions and the oldest carvings in Nigeria are probably no more than two hundred and fifty years old. Many of the earliest. maybe the finest of the wood carvings may also have been destroyed by termites. When one is attacked in this way, no attempt is made to preserve it; a new one is made to replace it, for the creativity of making it is valued above the object per se. The finest sculptures were made for religious or ceremonial purposes, and the art of creation was itself a religious act.\n\nWhat has led to there being no very old wood carvings in West Africa?', NULL, NULL, NULL, E'the nature of the climate there\nproblems caused by insects', NULL, NULL),
  ('345a1b24-4e79-5bd2-9778-b5ba7af6f875'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'LISTENING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '345a1b24-4e79-5bd2-9778-b5ba7af6f875'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'WFD', NULL, '95d15b74-1471-5fdf-9af6-3e0c4a85210e'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'The island is located at the south end of the bay.', NULL, NULL),
