  ('37b1ab17-6874-5a52-9b39-1bb951a187b2'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'LISTENING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '37b1ab17-6874-5a52-9b39-1bb951a187b2'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'WFD', NULL, 'ac2a9265-acbe-5bed-9d60-ed20ef355ec0'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'Please cite several sources in your work.', NULL, NULL),
  ('37b81ff2-1937-524c-b06d-13bc15a8c3e9'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'RE_TELL_LECTURE', E'RE_TELL_LECTURE', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '37b81ff2-1937-524c-b06d-13bc15a8c3e9'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Ship', NULL, '0a8ae796-fad0-54bb-be7d-834fc60b3040'::uuid, NULL, E'Our civilization, which subsumes most of its predecessors, is a great ship steaming at speed into the future. It travels faster, further, and more laden than any before. We may not be able to foresee every reef and hazard, but by reading her compass bearing and headway, by understanding her design, her safety record, and the abilities of her crew, we can, I think, plot a wise course between the narrows and bergs looming ahead. And I believe we must do this without delay, because there are too many shipwrecks behind us. The vessel we are now aboard is not merely the biggest of all time; it is also the only one left. The future of everything we have accomplished since our intelligence evolved will depend on the wisdom of our actions over the next few years. Like all creatures, humans have made their way in the world so far by trial and error; unlike other creatures, we have a presence so colossal that error is a luxury we can no longer afford. The world has grown too small to forgive us any big mistakes.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('37bcd475-613a-510b-9453-b0ff4a7d8c16'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DRAG_AND_DROP', E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DRAG_AND_DROP', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '37bcd475-613a-510b-9453-b0ff4a7d8c16'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Ancient Fossils', E'Fossilized human {{1}} found in New Mexico’s White Sands National Park were almost certainly made more than 20,000 years ago, during the height of the last ice {{2}} , according to new research. The study, published on Thursday in Science, {{3}} decades of thinking about when humans arrived in North America.', NULL, NULL, NULL, E'1.footprints, 2.age, 3.overthrows', NULL, NULL),
  ('37c0197c-9921-5e29-a343-e2b0cce37b23'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'MC_LISTENING_SINGLE', E'MC_LISTENING_SINGLE', E'LISTENING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '37c0197c-9921-5e29-a343-e2b0cce37b23'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Volcano', E'A volcano is event in the earth, which erupts when hot liquefied rock or magma moves to the earth''s surface, pouring out as lava. The latter may flow out as a liquid, or it may explode from the vent as solid or liquid particles accompanied by superheated gases. Ash and cinders form a cone around the vent. There are several types of volcanoes. The most fluid magnus erupt quietly and flow from the vent to form gently sloping shield volcanoes. The name shield volcano comes from their resemblance to the shields of early germanic warriors. The lava flows from shield volcanoes are usually only one to ten meters thick, but may extend for great distances from the vent. The volcanoes of hawaii and iceland are typical volcanoes of this type. Cinder cone. Volcanoes are formed when magnus, with high gas contents and high viscosity are blown high into the air. During an eruption, the magma falls as volcanic bombs, which accumulate around the vent and form steep sided cones called errors. Large basin, like depressions, are formed when a violent eruption blows the top off of an existing cone, or when the center of a volcano collapses. One famous called era covers much of yellowstone national park. Six hundred thousand years ago, there was a huge volcanic explosion which devastated the landscape. At the center, there remained only a smouldering caldera, a collapsed crater more than forty miles wide. Yellow stones, famous geysers and hot springs lie within this giant basin.\n\nWhich type of volcano is associated with the geysers in Yellowstone National Park?', '659a975e-ec3f-5c69-bce6-6620b24f960f'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'Caldera', NULL, NULL),
  ('37d42f3d-6507-528c-8ff2-64411aed66c3'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'LISTENING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '37d42f3d-6507-528c-8ff2-64411aed66c3'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'WFD', NULL, '47e7cb3c-ba8a-5300-8c0b-31cf5e2bb81d'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'Tomorrow''s lecture will look closely at educational policies in America.', NULL, NULL),
  ('37d91697-bbd2-528d-8f11-688f780b4e42'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DRAG_AND_DROP', E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DRAG_AND_DROP', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '37d91697-bbd2-528d-8f11-688f780b4e42'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Quantum Computing', E'With quantum computing, processing power will reach new heights, opening up new possibilities for various fields that could {{1}} the world. These advanced systems utilize the principles of quantum mechanics to perform calculations at speeds {{2}} by traditional computers. The capability to process {{3}} amounts of data simultaneously could {{4}} to breakthroughs in cryptography, materials science, and complex system modeling.', NULL, NULL, NULL, E'1.transform, 2.unattainable, 3.vast, 4.lead', NULL, NULL),
  ('37e7c08e-744a-5edb-b508-7ca98190dbf4'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DROPDOWN', E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DROPDOWN', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '37e7c08e-744a-5edb-b508-7ca98190dbf4'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Driver License', E'New B.C. residents will only be required to provide their driver licence history — proof of insurance is no longer required. However, their premiums will be adjusted for the first three years {{1}} driving in B.C. {{2}} the increased risks associated with driving in a new area. Each year you remain crash-free, your discount increases. ICBC {{3}} you with up to 15 years of driving experience (up from eight years) upon receipt of a driver''s abstract {{4}} the original date that you received your licence. When obtaining your B.C. licence, you can provide your original driver''s abstract in person at a driver licensing office.', NULL, NULL, NULL, E'1.of, 2.due to, 3.will credit, 4.showing', NULL, NULL),
