  ('3ccbb265-7652-5e1e-af69-6043090bbc9b'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'LISTENING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '3ccbb265-7652-5e1e-af69-6043090bbc9b'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'WFD', NULL, '926f11c0-c015-51b0-843e-4e74cf0ab075'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'Despite the protest, the chemistry department was closed down.', NULL, NULL),
  ('3cce6d51-9160-5e2e-85bd-7c9283337bbd'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'READ_ALOUD', E'READ_ALOUD', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '3cce6d51-9160-5e2e-85bd-7c9283337bbd'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Immune System', E'Whether flu or coronavirus, it can take several days for the body to ramp up an effective response to a viral infection. New research describes how different cells in the immune system work together, communicate, and - in the case of cells called neutrophils - bring about their own death to help fight off infections. The findings could have important implications for the development of vaccines and anti-viral therapies.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('3cd3dc4f-ff70-5543-b916-281cae2ece25'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'LISTENING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '3cd3dc4f-ff70-5543-b916-281cae2ece25'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'WFD', NULL, '413a0f89-88db-57d7-8fed-fed4e6e1fb99'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'The new lab is located at the north end of the campus.', NULL, NULL),
  ('3cd6ee83-8524-573e-87d8-fc2a4ba114db'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DRAG_AND_DROP', E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DRAG_AND_DROP', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '3cd6ee83-8524-573e-87d8-fc2a4ba114db'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Program', E'Our program will develop your {{1}} knowledge of Computer Science and your problem-solving and {{2}} skills, while enabling you to achieve the {{3}} qualification for the IT professional. The program structure is extremely {{4}} , enabling you to personalize your MSc through a wide range of electives.', NULL, NULL, NULL, E'1.theoretical, 2.analytical, 3.ultimate, 4.flexible', NULL, NULL),
  ('3cda28d4-7011-5e78-9b17-43c16d5c7d8d'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'ANSWER_SHORT_QUESTION', E'ANSWER_SHORT_QUESTION', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '3cda28d4-7011-5e78-9b17-43c16d5c7d8d'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'ASQ', E'What is the summary at the beginning of an academic paper called?', '38a2e917-45c3-5666-a6c0-7474cdd896c9'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'Abstract', NULL, NULL),
  ('3ce17ca0-65e4-5877-85ce-96fcf70cb1ee'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DROPDOWN', E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DROPDOWN', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '3ce17ca0-65e4-5877-85ce-96fcf70cb1ee'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'History Books', E'What history books tell us about the past is not everything that happened, but what historians {{1}} .They cannot put in everything: choices have to be made. Choices must similarly be made about which aspects of the past should be formally taught to the next generation in the shape of school history lessons. So, {{2}} ,when a national school curriculum for England and Wales was first discussed at the end of the 1980s, the history curriculum was the subject of considerable public and media {{3}} . Politicians argued about it; people wrote letters to the press about it; the Prime Minister of the time, Margaret Thatcher, {{4}} in the debate. Let us think first about the question of content. There were two main camps on this issue: those who thought the history of Britain should take pride of {{5}} , and those who favored what was referred to as ''world history''.', NULL, NULL, NULL, E'1.have selected, 2.for example, 3.interest, 4.intervened, 5.place', NULL, NULL),
  ('3ce6e2fc-531b-5c98-b408-cf8155d5e9cb'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'LISTENING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '3ce6e2fc-531b-5c98-b408-cf8155d5e9cb'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'WFD', NULL, '8188603a-f643-5d34-847a-f8fe541ab0b3'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'The National Center of Excellence is currently being built.', NULL, NULL),
  ('3cedc063-e310-5800-956f-807ac5df0b45'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'ANSWER_SHORT_QUESTION', E'ANSWER_SHORT_QUESTION', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '3cedc063-e310-5800-956f-807ac5df0b45'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'ASQ', E'What is the three-dimensional shape of circle?', '1d3a0779-addb-5bf3-9053-fdafb154ef51'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'Sphere / globe', NULL, NULL),
  ('3cee5bf7-b941-55d5-a265-3dd6db91d790'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'RE_TELL_LECTURE', E'RE_TELL_LECTURE', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '3cee5bf7-b941-55d5-a265-3dd6db91d790'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Reef', NULL, '6866648d-7fa4-507f-bb34-f809f0ebb414'::uuid, NULL, E'Now, I am thrilled to take you on a journey to explore the Great Barrier Reef, one of the most stunning and important natural wonders of our world. This vibrant underwater ecosystem is not just a spectacle of beauty but also plays a crucial role in the environmental health of our planet. The Great Barrier Reef, located off the coast of Australia, is the largest coral reef system in the world. It is home to an incredible diversity of marine life, including thousands of species of fish, corals, and other sea creatures. This biodiversity makes it a critical habitat for conservation and a natural laboratory for scientists studying marine ecology. However, the Great Barrier Reef faces significant threats, primarily from climate change. Rising sea temperatures have led to coral bleaching, endangering this vibrant ecosystem. The Reef''s health is a crucial indicator of the overall health of our oceans and the planet. The Great Barrier Reef is more than just a beautiful destination; it''s a vital part of our global ecosystem. Its preservation is essential not only for the marine life that depends on it but also for maintaining the natural balance of our environment.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('3cf74d53-3886-5519-b463-8d228163e4f7'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'SUMMARIZE_WRITTEN_TEXT', E'SUMMARIZE_WRITTEN_TEXT', E'WRITING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '3cf74d53-3886-5519-b463-8d228163e4f7'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Takeoff Speed', E'The data showed that as the temperature increased, air density decreased, causing takeoff speeds to slow down. Over time, this has had a clear effect on air travel. For the Q400 turboprop aircraft at Chios airport, the researchers charted that the average takeoff distance is 328 feet (100 meters) longer now than it was in 1974. This can present real problems for terminals that use shorter runways.\nGuy Gratton, associate professor of aviation and the environment at England''s Cranfield University and one of the authors of the 2020 study, asserts that many air traffic controllers may not have been aware of this effect. "I don''t think that most are noticing the trends of climate change because their job is to plan each day''s flights based upon the latest observations and forecasts. You really need to observe changes over at least a decade, as we did with our paper, before the average impacts become noticeable and significant."\nAside from lengthening runways, air travel experts have to drop vehicle weights to fight the air density problem. This likely means reducing the number of passengers and the amount of cargo allowed on an aircraft. The 2020 study found that at Chios, the maximum allowable takeoff mass was reduced from about 165,350 pounds (75,000 kilograms) in 1974, to 152,000 pounds (69,000 kilograms) in 2017. That''s an 8 percent drop in carrying capacity over time. In the case of heatwaves, we''ve already seen airlines have to cancel tickets or ground flights entirely as a result of the hot air.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 5, 75),
  ('3cf7eec7-d1fc-5637-99d8-8e0e0067b1da'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'LISTENING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '3cf7eec7-d1fc-5637-99d8-8e0e0067b1da'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'WFD', NULL, 'c3b70b81-954c-5352-8ea3-ab176284377a'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'Efforts are being made to reduce harmful emissions.', NULL, NULL),
  ('3cf9fe23-280d-534b-89fe-b8430df4f52c'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'READ_ALOUD', E'READ_ALOUD', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '3cf9fe23-280d-534b-89fe-b8430df4f52c'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Agreement', E'Such an agreement would include recognition that the world must aim as soon as possible to hold global warming to 1.5-degree Celsius; a long-term low-carbon future; 5-year updated action plans that recognize the developing climate reality; and aid to those countries that did little to cause climate change but are most at risk from it.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('3cfd29dd-2806-5d20-a93b-ae821176069b'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'REPEAT_SENTENCE', E'REPEAT_SENTENCE', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '3cfd29dd-2806-5d20-a93b-ae821176069b'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'RS', NULL, 'd048f47f-884b-50f2-9b92-47a6638cd25f'::uuid, NULL, E'Those students have to retake the module if their marks are too low.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('3cff242e-a27f-5db1-9c09-17be948361ea'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'ANSWER_SHORT_QUESTION', E'ANSWER_SHORT_QUESTION', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '3cff242e-a27f-5db1-9c09-17be948361ea'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'ASQ', E'What is the name of the device that measures body weight?', '7c0e496e-43b6-583e-a5d1-0064fc1416d8'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'Scale', NULL, NULL),
  ('3cfffc64-73ff-54f1-8eb4-b4731c00fda8'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'ANSWER_SHORT_QUESTION', E'ANSWER_SHORT_QUESTION', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '3cfffc64-73ff-54f1-8eb4-b4731c00fda8'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'ASQ', E'What do we call a person who plays a sport, especially as a professional?', '42ef7f56-fc69-5610-ab4d-91ac79010e79'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'Athlete', NULL, NULL),
  ('3d00130e-a276-530d-9a45-9ac193b19bab'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'LISTENING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '3d00130e-a276-530d-9a45-9ac193b19bab'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'WFD', NULL, '4c8a8a27-b9c0-5a5e-8c61-6c18401b4312'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'Critical thinking is crucial for mathematics.', NULL, NULL),
  ('3d00593d-08d8-5d9a-bf80-03f864ee3317'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DRAG_AND_DROP', E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DRAG_AND_DROP', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '3d00593d-08d8-5d9a-bf80-03f864ee3317'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Melting Ice', E'At the end of the last ice age, the melting ice disrupted the ocean currents in the North Atlantic and {{1}} a drop in temperature of almost 5 degrees. Even {{2}} the rest of the planet was warming {{3}} ,the North Atlantic region remained in a cold period for 1300 years. The same thing happened {{4}} 8000 years ago, when the cooling lasted about a hundred years, and it {{5}} happen again today. Even a short period of cooling in the North Atlantic could have a dramatic effect on the wildlife, and the human populations, living there.', NULL, NULL, NULL, E'1.caused, 2.though, 3.up, 4.around, 5.could', NULL, NULL),
  ('3d03b3ca-4022-531a-86e5-f636ad402973'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'LISTENING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '3d03b3ca-4022-531a-86e5-f636ad402973'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'WFD', NULL, 'fd37418f-135f-57dd-a4cd-03a01787b95b'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'Technological advancements are responsible for businesses'' having to constantly change.', NULL, NULL),
  ('3d0404ab-f6c3-58bf-adeb-46b7ffd2b27f'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'RE_TELL_LECTURE', E'RE_TELL_LECTURE', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '3d0404ab-f6c3-58bf-adeb-46b7ffd2b27f'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Learning Motivation', NULL, '91e96b01-f755-55bc-a926-f929868ba5d0'::uuid, NULL, E'But if I were to ask you a similar question: “What percentage of the population do you think is capable of truly mastering calculus, or understanding organic chemistry, or...or being able to contribute to ..to cancer research?” A lot of you might say, “Well, with a great education system, maybe 20, 30 percent.” But what if that estimate is just based on your own experience in a non-mastery framework, your own experience with yourself or observing your peers, where you’re being pushed at this set pace through classes, accumulating all these gaps? Even when you got that the a ... 95 percent, what was that five percent you missed? And it keeps accumulating—all the way you get to an advanced class, all of a sudden you hit a wall and say, “I’m not meant to be a cancer researcher; not meant to be a physicist; not meant to be a mathematician.” I suspect that that actually is the case, but if you were allowed to be operating in a mastery framework, if you were allowed to really take agency over your learning, and when you get something wrong, embrace it — view that failure as a moment of learning — that number of, of, the percent that could really master calculus or understand organic chemistry, is actually a lot closer to 100 percent. And this isn’t even just a “nice to have.” I think it’s a social imperative.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('3d05802e-41dc-567a-b9fe-1911a03cafd2'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'READ_ALOUD', E'READ_ALOUD', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '3d05802e-41dc-567a-b9fe-1911a03cafd2'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Grandmother''s Garden', E'As a child, I used to spend hours playing in my grandmother''s garden. She had an array of colorful flowers and herbs growing throughout the yard, and she would teach me about each one. She had a particular love of lavender, and I remember her telling me stories about how she used to dry it and make sachets to put in her drawers.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
