  ('3e90e6ff-16cf-5304-91d4-1c1634af575f'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'READ_ALOUD', E'READ_ALOUD', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '3e90e6ff-16cf-5304-91d4-1c1634af575f'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Charitable Giving', E'Charitable giving has the power to transform lives and communities, providing support for those in need and promoting social justice. Donating time, money, or resources to charitable organizations can make a significant difference in the lives of others, while also promoting a sense of purpose and fulfillment.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('3e9982f6-fed3-5a81-9868-73b3909cf084'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'RE_ORDER_PARAGRAPHS', E'RE_ORDER_PARAGRAPHS', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '3e9982f6-fed3-5a81-9868-73b3909cf084'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Hand-axe', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, E'5, 2, 4, 3, 1', NULL, NULL),
  ('3ea5c716-cc79-5e94-a486-be9b6f207e4d'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DRAG_AND_DROP', E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DRAG_AND_DROP', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '3ea5c716-cc79-5e94-a486-be9b6f207e4d'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Bias', E'One of the questions we need to ask ourselves is: How much of the news is biased? Can we recognize bias? The fact is, despite the journalistic ideal of ''objectivity'', every news story is {{1}} by the attitudes and background of its interviewers, writers, journalists, photographers and editors. That is not to say that all bias is {{2}} , but it does exist. So how can we, as readers or viewers, {{3}} bias? Well, in the case of newspapers, it manifests itself in a number of ways, such as what events are selected for inclusion or omission. The placement of the article, meaning its proximity to the front or back pages, is significant. The use of headlines, photographs and languages is {{4}} examples.', NULL, NULL, NULL, E'1.influenced, 2.deliberate, 3.determine, 4.further', NULL, NULL),
  ('3ea845bd-3af2-55e1-8029-0c633f1eb8b7'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'REPEAT_SENTENCE', E'REPEAT_SENTENCE', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '3ea845bd-3af2-55e1-8029-0c633f1eb8b7'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'RS', NULL, '1ed2dd18-fd06-52b0-8016-9135e8649be6'::uuid, NULL, E'The school has developed a creative partnership with parents.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('3eada161-77cf-5b53-a2a2-0b3f8ee00244'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DRAG_AND_DROP', E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DRAG_AND_DROP', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '3eada161-77cf-5b53-a2a2-0b3f8ee00244'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Millennial Workforce', E'Millennials (those born between the early 1980s and the early 1990s) {{1}} up a huge part of our workforce but they seem to lack {{2}} to the companies and the leaders they work for. Multinational companies are noticing larger turnover {{3}} of millennials as employee retention rates {{4}} .', NULL, NULL, NULL, E'1.make, 2.loyalty, 3.rates, 4.fall', NULL, NULL),
  ('3eaf76b9-c3f9-512d-8623-852434b2a112'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DRAG_AND_DROP', E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DRAG_AND_DROP', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '3eaf76b9-c3f9-512d-8623-852434b2a112'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Folklore', E'Folklore, a modern term for the {{1}} of traditional customs, superstitions, stories, dances, and songs that have been adopted and maintained within a given {{2}} by processes of repetition is not reliant on the written {{3}} . Along with folk songs and folktales, this broad {{4}} of cultural forms embraces all kinds of legends, riddles, jokes, proverbs, games, charms, omens, spells, and rituals, especially those of pre-literate societies or social classes. Those forms of verbal expression that are handed on from one generation or locality to the next by word of mouth are said to constitute an oral {{5}} .', NULL, NULL, NULL, E'1.body, 2.community, 3.word, 4.category, 5.tradition', NULL, NULL),
  ('3eb01bd7-0772-53cd-a2d6-9f614407054c'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'READ_ALOUD', E'READ_ALOUD', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '3eb01bd7-0772-53cd-a2d6-9f614407054c'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Air Filters', E'Air filters are a vital part of the engine and help keep it running smoothly. A clogged air filter can be the cause of many problems with the car, including decreased gas mileage and increased emissions. Air filters protect the engine by capturing dirt particles that may enter through the air intake.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('3eb11208-88df-5939-9bee-8ebe4fbbb321'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'READ_ALOUD', E'READ_ALOUD', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '3eb11208-88df-5939-9bee-8ebe4fbbb321'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'The Next Food Revolution', E'Today’s global food system is responsible for around a third of greenhouse-gas emissions and meat production is one of the biggest culprits. Despite this environmental impact, meat-eating is on the rise. Plant-based and lab-grown alternatives can convert carnivores away from conventional meat and reduce emissions.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('3eb45f28-e6b3-50e9-b83b-1faaa3e4622a'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'RE_ORDER_PARAGRAPHS', E'RE_ORDER_PARAGRAPHS', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '3eb45f28-e6b3-50e9-b83b-1faaa3e4622a'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Mindfulness Meditation', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, E'2, 4, 1, 3', NULL, NULL),
  ('3eb506ce-9387-5f3d-a7a7-74cb10d7202d'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'READ_ALOUD', E'READ_ALOUD', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '3eb506ce-9387-5f3d-a7a7-74cb10d7202d'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Disaster by Climate Change', E'Flooding is already the most common natural disaster in the United States, occurring in every state and killing more people each year than hurricanes, tornadoes or lightning. As warming drives sea levels higher and intensifies hurricanes, more residents should expect to deal with flooding.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('3eb75654-7f1b-598e-bfab-04dc77ca7d88'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'READ_ALOUD', E'READ_ALOUD', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '3eb75654-7f1b-598e-bfab-04dc77ca7d88'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Projected Temperature', E'It’s projected that, over the next hundred years, temperatures on Earth could rise an average of nearly five degrees Celsius. While some animals might be able to migrate north to escape the brunt of the heat, plants can’t uproot themselves quite so easily. Researchers wondered whether the creatures that disperse plant seeds might be able to help.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('3eba34e5-c965-51c2-83aa-7a7ece3c08e7'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'SUMMARIZE_WRITTEN_TEXT', E'SUMMARIZE_WRITTEN_TEXT', E'WRITING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '3eba34e5-c965-51c2-83aa-7a7ece3c08e7'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Bull Market', E'When assets are steadily rising over a period of time, it is known as a "bull market." The Securities and Exchange Control Commission defines a bear market as a period of at least two months when a broad market falls by 20 percent or more. When it rises by 20 percent or more over two months or more, it is a bull market.\nA milder form of a bear market is "correction." During a correction, prices drop by 10 to 20 percent from the previous peak. There have been fewer bull markets: 24 since 1928. They tend to last a lot longer, though, often for multiple years.\nA bear market may signal a recession is coming, though it''s not a perfect correlation. Since World War II, there have been three bear markets out of a total of 12 that didn''t precede a recession.\nBut a bear market is bad news for anyone who invests in stocks. The impact is particularly hard on recent retirees, who are seeing their nest eggs shrink just as they need to start withdrawing income from them.\nIn addition, entering a bear market can have a psychological impact on investors, creating a self-fulfilling cycle. Just perceiving a bear market tends to prompt investors to sell even more, thus pushing stock prices down further and prolonging the pain.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 5, 75),
  ('3ebb6e92-67b1-5d77-9006-352f6282e3ec'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'REPEAT_SENTENCE', E'REPEAT_SENTENCE', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '3ebb6e92-67b1-5d77-9006-352f6282e3ec'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'RS', NULL, 'd7d125ef-b2e7-52cb-8408-aa9ced3f1d90'::uuid, NULL, E'The company hopes the cost can be cut through reducing employment.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
