  ('40283e67-a5ba-5baf-ae9b-eabbad7f2e8f'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DRAG_AND_DROP', E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DRAG_AND_DROP', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '40283e67-a5ba-5baf-ae9b-eabbad7f2e8f'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Infant Sleep', E'Parents lose the most sleep during the first three months with a new baby, with mothers losing about an hour of sleep each night, and fathers losing a {{1}} 13 minutes. This {{2}} in sleep quality and quantity for adults {{3}} until the child is about six years old.', NULL, NULL, NULL, E'1.disproportionate, 2.decline, 3.persists', NULL, NULL),
  ('402dd451-01c4-548d-9008-d3a8c32d2f2d'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'WRITE_ESSAY', E'WRITE_ESSAY', E'WRITING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '402dd451-01c4-548d-9008-d3a8c32d2f2d'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Financial Learning', E'As dealing with money is such an important skill, all children should be taught financial management at school. Do you agree with it or not?', NULL, NULL, E'In today''s society, financial management is an essential skill that every individual needs to have. As such, many people believe that teaching financial management in schools should be mandatory. In my opinion, teaching financial management in schools has several benefits that can greatly help students.\nFirstly, teaching financial management in schools can help students develop important life skills such as budgeting, saving, and investing. These skills can be applied throughout their lives and can help them make informed financial decisions. By learning these skills in school, students can be better prepared for the financial challenges they may face in the future.\nSecondly, financial management education in schools can help students avoid common financial mistakes such as overspending, debt accumulation, and poor credit management. By learning about financial management, students can develop an understanding of the consequences of poor financial decisions and learn how to make better choices.\nIn conclusion, teaching financial management in schools is a crucial step towards preparing students for the future. By providing students with the skills and knowledge they need to manage their finances effectively, we can help them avoid common financial mistakes and make informed decisions about their financial future. It is important for educators to recognize the value of financial management education and work towards integrating it into the curriculum. Ultimately, by teaching financial management in schools, we can help students build a solid foundation for their financial well-being.', NULL, 200, 300),
  ('402ea88e-ea05-55c8-a202-224c38f1137a'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'LISTENING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '402ea88e-ea05-55c8-a202-224c38f1137a'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'WFD', NULL, '5b7b0db0-fd6f-5523-bf93-7b81d3436353'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'Everyone in this room needs to follow the rules.', NULL, NULL),
  ('403268fa-607d-50e5-9164-86ad64b5a177'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DROPDOWN', E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DROPDOWN', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '403268fa-607d-50e5-9164-86ad64b5a177'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Tax Credits', E'As the new year begins, a {{1}} of popular electric vehicles, specifically some Tesla and General Motors models, could be eligible for $7,500 worth of tax credits they weren’t eligible for in 2022. That’s because limitations on new tax credits {{2}} in August as part of the Inflation Reduction Act won’t be put into force all at once, the Treasury Department announced this week. That means the rules will, temporarily, be more generous, allowing higher tax credits on more electric vehicles, for the first few months of the new year. Essentially, the tax rules are designed to {{3}} automakers to make their electric vehicles and all the parts of those vehicles, as much as possible, in the United States, or in countries with which the US has trade agreements. They’re also designed so tax credits don’t go to wealthy Americans buying expensive luxury vehicles. The latest announcement, which will temporarily open up more tax credit money, is likely mostly a good thing for consumers.', NULL, NULL, NULL, E'1.number, 2.enacted, 3.incentivize', NULL, NULL),
  ('40382387-1674-5789-b1a6-e3ebaede43cd'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'ANSWER_SHORT_QUESTION', E'ANSWER_SHORT_QUESTION', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '40382387-1674-5789-b1a6-e3ebaede43cd'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'ASQ', E'What do we call a person who serves drinks in a bar?', '41aca160-d830-5175-a87f-d1e1659145aa'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'Bartender', NULL, NULL),
  ('403e447f-1074-5a54-913f-e12326d50980'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'RE_ORDER_PARAGRAPHS', E'RE_ORDER_PARAGRAPHS', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '403e447f-1074-5a54-913f-e12326d50980'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Introductory Paragraph', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, E'5, 2, 4, 1, 3', NULL, NULL),
  ('40403fb4-01fd-5f7f-b734-240fb9430e20'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'MC_READING_SINGLE', E'MC_READING_SINGLE', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '40403fb4-01fd-5f7f-b734-240fb9430e20'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'MCS-R', E'Since the Hawaiian Islands have never been connected to other land masses, the great variety of plants in Hawaii must be a result of the long-distance dispersal of seeds, a process that requires both a method of transport and an equivalence between the ecology of the source area and that of the recipient area. There is some dispute about the method of transport involved. Some biologists argue that ocean and air currents are responsible for the transport of plant seeds to Hawaii. Yet the results of flotation experiments and the low temperatures of air currents cast doubt on these hypotheses. More probable is bird transport, either externally, by accidental attachment of the seeds to feathers, or internally, by the swallowing of fruit and subsequent excretion of the seeds. While it is likely that fewer varieties of plant seeds have reached Hawaii externally than internally, more varieties are known to be adapted to external than to internal transport.\n\nThe author of the passage is primarily concerned with', NULL, NULL, NULL, E'discussing different theories about the transport of plant seeds to Hawaii', NULL, NULL),
