  ('418722b4-a2d3-57a4-a05f-1a407f6575fd'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'ANSWER_SHORT_QUESTION', E'ANSWER_SHORT_QUESTION', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '418722b4-a2d3-57a4-a05f-1a407f6575fd'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'ASQ', E'What do we call the part of a building that is completely or partly below the ground?', '06f1b262-2401-585d-9084-f13903e172ab'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'Basement', NULL, NULL),
  ('41891c6e-89a1-5f05-9f2e-31de04c0229e'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'READ_ALOUD', E'READ_ALOUD', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '41891c6e-89a1-5f05-9f2e-31de04c0229e'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Industrial Revolution', E'As to the Industrial Revolution, one cannot dispute today the fact that it has succeeded in inaugurating in a number of countries a level of mass prosperity which was undreamt of in the days preceding the Industrial Revolution. But, on the immediate impact of the Industrial Revolution, there were substantial divergences among writers.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('41907d2d-ff25-57ee-88f7-57d9470362d1'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'MC_READING_MULTIPLE', E'MC_READING_MULTIPLE', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '41907d2d-ff25-57ee-88f7-57d9470362d1'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'MCM-R', E'These Kinetoscope arcades were modeled on phonograph parlors, which had proven successful for Edison several years earlier. In the phonograph parlors, customers listened to recordings through individual ear tubes, moving from one machine to the next to hear different recorded speeches or pieces of music. The Kinetoscope parlors functioned in a similar way. Edison was more interested in the sale of Kinetoscopes (for roughly $1,000 apiece) to these parlors than in the films that would be run in them (which cost approximately $10 to $15 each). He refused to develop projection technology, reasoning that if he made and sold projectors, then exhibitors would purchase only one machine-a projector-from him instead of several.\n\nThe author discusses phonograph parlors in the paragraph in order to', NULL, NULL, NULL, E'describe the model used to design Kinetoscope parlors\ncontrast their operational modes and commercial focuses with those of Kinetoscope parlors', NULL, NULL),
  ('41a3d859-b176-541c-bc2f-18eab6581ac8'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'WRITE_ESSAY', E'WRITE_ESSAY', E'WRITING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '41a3d859-b176-541c-bc2f-18eab6581ac8'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Mindfulness', E'Do you believe that mindfulness and meditation can significantly improve quality of life?', NULL, NULL, E'I firmly believe that mindfulness and meditation play a significant role in enhancing the quality of life. These practices have the potential to reduce stress, enhance focus, and cultivate self-awareness, ultimately leading to improved mental well-being and emotional balance.\nMindfulness and meditation are powerful tools for reducing stress and promoting mental well-being and emotional balance. By incorporating these practices into daily routines, individuals can enhance their ability to manage stressors effectively, leading to a calmer and more balanced state of mind. This heightened sense of emotional well-being allows individuals to navigate challenges with greater resilience and emotional stability.\nFurthermore, practicing mindfulness enhances focus and concentration, resulting in improved productivity and decision-making. By training the mind to be present and attentive, individuals can enhance their cognitive abilities and make more informed choices. This increased focus not only boosts productivity in daily tasks but also fosters clarity of thought, enabling individuals to approach challenges with a clear and focused mindset.\nIn conclusion, regular meditation fosters self-awareness and emotional regulation, leading to better relationships and overall well-being. By engaging in mindfulness and meditation practices, individuals can develop a deeper understanding of their emotions, improve their ability to regulate responses, and cultivate healthier relationships with themselves and others. The transformative power of mindfulness and meditation in promoting mental well-being, enhancing focus, and fostering self-awareness highlights their significant impact on improving the quality of life.', NULL, 200, 300),
  ('41a46673-3c01-5904-b799-eaf11b1ef860'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'REPEAT_SENTENCE', E'REPEAT_SENTENCE', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '41a46673-3c01-5904-b799-eaf11b1ef860'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'RS', NULL, '495890b5-7f9b-5473-9de2-7d2cc2bb578a'::uuid, NULL, E'You must wear a hard hat on the construction site.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('41a52530-ee85-5544-99fc-dee5a4aa5772'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'ANSWER_SHORT_QUESTION', E'ANSWER_SHORT_QUESTION', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '41a52530-ee85-5544-99fc-dee5a4aa5772'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'ASQ', E'What do we call the alcoholic drink that is made from the juice of grapes?', '2909fd46-17e4-5d9f-8bfa-944078a36b40'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'Wine', NULL, NULL),
  ('41a74abf-0b88-51ed-bf6e-c13c62b7e3e2'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'LISTENING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '41a74abf-0b88-51ed-bf6e-c13c62b7e3e2'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'WFD', NULL, 'd6f975a2-3f29-5275-8637-aabad6a9f146'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'Gold is a metal that appears naturally in a pure state.', NULL, NULL),
  ('41aa155b-2c94-5e86-8348-446940e99463'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'ANSWER_SHORT_QUESTION', E'ANSWER_SHORT_QUESTION', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '41aa155b-2c94-5e86-8348-446940e99463'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'ASQ', E'What''s the name of the annoying sound that people sometimes make when they breathe while sleeping?', '70234f41-2aae-5694-8c9c-b693c10b7307'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'Snoring / snore', NULL, NULL),
  ('41ad043f-cc9a-5481-b2b1-46cf8bae5cf3'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'READ_ALOUD', E'READ_ALOUD', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '41ad043f-cc9a-5481-b2b1-46cf8bae5cf3'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Emerald', E'Emerald is defined by its green color. To be an emerald, a specimen must have a distinctly green color that falls in the range from bluish green to green to slightly yellowish green. To be an emerald, the specimen must also have a rich color. Stones with weak saturation or light tone should be called "green beryl." If it is greenish yellow it is "heliodor."', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('41b0268e-d99b-534c-b459-eed46a4b5305'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'REPEAT_SENTENCE', E'REPEAT_SENTENCE', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '41b0268e-d99b-534c-b459-eed46a4b5305'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'RS', NULL, '04ccebd2-1792-5a28-b029-6c10ea91ada7'::uuid, NULL, E'My profession had an important influence on the formation of my character.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('41b2438b-a15c-5027-a71f-f6292ccb66e3'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'RE_TELL_LECTURE', E'RE_TELL_LECTURE', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '41b2438b-a15c-5027-a71f-f6292ccb66e3'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Fatherhood', NULL, 'e4442146-a5bb-56ce-a41a-fb549618eda3'::uuid, NULL, E'The role of a father is an important part of parenting and has a significant influence on children’s development. Fatherhood is not only about providing support and protection, but also about helping children build confidence and develop important qualities for their future lives. A father can create a sense of security and help children feel safe when they explore the world around them. With this support, children become more willing to take risks, try new experiences, and learn from challenges. These experiences allow them to develop confidence and gradually build their own abilities. In addition, a father’s guidance can help children develop independence and autonomy. Instead of controlling every decision, supportive fathers encourage children to think independently and solve problems by themselves. This process helps children become more mature as they grow up. Ultimately, good fatherhood contributes to raising responsible and compassionate citizens. Through emotional support, encouragement, and guidance, fathers play a key role in helping children become confident individuals who can positively contribute to society.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('41b3eeca-1045-54a0-ae33-d04f86966fb4'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DROPDOWN', E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DROPDOWN', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '41b3eeca-1045-54a0-ae33-d04f86966fb4'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Transparent Solar Cells', E'No matter how sustainable, eco-friendly, and clean sources of energy they are, conventional solar panels require a large setup area and heavy initial investment. Due to these {{1}} , it’s hard to introduce them in urban areas especially neighborhoods with lots of apartment blocks or shops. But now researchers have created transparent solar panels which they claim could be used as power-generating windows in our homes. In order to generate power from sunlight, solar cells {{2}} on a solar panel are required to absorb radiation from the sun. Therefore, they cannot allow sunlight to completely pass through them. Transparent luminescent solar concentrators are capable of selectively absorbing invisible solar radiation including infrared and UV lights, and letting the rest of the visible rays pass through them. In other words, these devices are transparent to the human eye but still absorb a {{3}} of the solar light which they can then convert into electricity.', NULL, NULL, NULL, E'1.limitations, 2.embedded, 3.fraction', NULL, NULL),
  ('41beca57-fc66-52e1-b498-46ba54177905'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'MC_READING_SINGLE', E'MC_READING_SINGLE', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '41beca57-fc66-52e1-b498-46ba54177905'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Anxious Dog', E'It’s well established that sudden loud noises, such as fireworks or thunderstorms, commonly trigger a dog’s anxiety, a new study finds even common noises, such as a vacuum or microwave, can be a trigger. The research found that high-frequency, intermittent noises such as the battery warning of a smoke detector are more likely to cause a dog anxiety, rather than low-frequency, continuous noise. Because dogs have a wider range of hearing, some noises could also be potentially painful to a dog’s ears, such as very loud or high-frequency sounds. We can change batteries more frequently in smoke detectors or remove a dog from a room where loud noises might occur.\n\nAccording to the study, noises ___.', NULL, NULL, NULL, E'with high-frequency and intermittence make dogs uneasier', NULL, NULL),
  ('41bfada1-ba3a-5f77-a3d2-e712fb23d724'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'WRITE_ESSAY', E'WRITE_ESSAY', E'WRITING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '41bfada1-ba3a-5f77-a3d2-e712fb23d724'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Necessary Education', E'What is your opinion on the necessity of college education for success in life?', NULL, NULL, E'The ongoing discourse on the importance of college education for success in life underscores the transformative impact of higher learning. In my perspective, college education serves as a cornerstone for individuals seeking to navigate the complexities of the modern world, offering a pathway to personal growth, critical thinking, and professional success.\nHigher education not only provides valuable knowledge and skills for career advancement but also catalyzes the fostering of critical thinking abilities. Through rigorous academic pursuits, students are challenged to analyze information critically, evaluate diverse perspectives, and develop sound reasoning skills. This cultivation of critical thinking lays a strong foundation for making informed decisions, solving complex problems, and adapting to evolving challenges in the professional realm.\nMoreover, the impact of higher education extends beyond job opportunities and earning potential to encompass personal growth essential for success. Engaging in higher education environments encourages individuals to explore their interests, expand their horizons, and cultivate a sense of self-awareness and resilience. The transformative nature of higher education nurtures personal growth, instills confidence, and equips individuals with the adaptability and perseverance needed to thrive in diverse personal and professional contexts.\nIn essence, the value of college education transcends mere academic achievement; it nurtures holistic development by fostering critical thinking, nurturing personal growth, and expanding career opportunities. By embracing the transformative power of higher education, individuals can embark on a journey of self-discovery, empowerment, and success, laying the foundation for a fulfilling and prosperous future.', NULL, 200, 300),
  ('41c13e68-f5fc-51ce-813c-ada46d6973b3'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DROPDOWN', E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DROPDOWN', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '41c13e68-f5fc-51ce-813c-ada46d6973b3'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Seatbelt', E'I am a cyclist and a motorist. I fasten my seatbelt when I drive and wear a helmet on my bike to reduce the risk of injury. I am convinced that these are prudent safety measures. I have persuaded many friends to wear helmets on the grounds that transplant surgeons call those without helmets, "donors on wheels". But a book on ‘Risk'' by my colleague John Adams has made me re-examine my deeply held {{1}} . Adams has completely {{2}} my confidence in these apparently sensible precautions. What he has persuasively argued, particularly in relation to seat belts, is that the evidence that they do what they are supposed to do is very suspect. This is {{3}} numerous claims that seat belts save many thousands of lives every year.\nThere is remarkable data on the years 1970 and 1978 in which countries where seat belts are {{4}} have had on average about 5 per cent more road accident deaths following the introduction of the law. In the UK, road deaths have decreased steadily from about 7,000 a year in 1972 to just over 4,000 in 1989. There is no evidence in the trend for any effect of the seat belt law that was introduced in 1983. Moreover, there is evidence that the number of cyclists and pedestrians killed actually increased by about 10 per cent.', NULL, NULL, NULL, E'1.convictions, 2.undermined, 3.in spite of, 4.compulsory', NULL, NULL),
  ('41cef366-eb96-5bb4-947c-b8b4c928eee5'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'REPEAT_SENTENCE', E'REPEAT_SENTENCE', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '41cef366-eb96-5bb4-947c-b8b4c928eee5'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'RS', NULL, '80a3a834-ed56-56d6-a496-c87363593f66'::uuid, NULL, E'The program is designed to select and store the most frequently used data.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('41d919cd-1a75-5004-acf5-fa8e80c03bd9'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'LISTENING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '41d919cd-1a75-5004-acf5-fa8e80c03bd9'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'WFD', NULL, '3d5269cd-54e6-51e3-a118-297bdfe6333a'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'People in this kind of job tend to work long hours.', NULL, NULL),
  ('41dcc652-9201-538e-b9f2-492f100b26fe'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'READ_ALOUD', E'READ_ALOUD', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '41dcc652-9201-538e-b9f2-492f100b26fe'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Insects', E'Most insects aren''t pests. Of the 1million-ish insect species we know of, only around 1 percent of them are classified as pests. Insects pollinate our gardens, break down waste in the soil and sometimes eat the insects we want to discourage hanging out in our vegetable and flower beds.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('41e12aec-b831-53f8-b2ac-7c59c7a4f279'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DRAG_AND_DROP', E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DRAG_AND_DROP', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '41e12aec-b831-53f8-b2ac-7c59c7a4f279'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Fireworks', E'Of ancient Chinese origin, fireworks evidently developed out of military rockets and explosive missiles, and they were used in {{1}} combinations for celebrations. During the Middle Ages, fireworks {{2}} the spread of military explosives westward, and in Europe the military fireworks expert was pressed into {{3}} to conduct pyrotechnic celebrations of victory and {{4}} . In the 19th century the introduction of new ingredients such as magnesium greatly heightened the {{5}} of such displays.', NULL, NULL, NULL, E'1.elaborate, 2.accompanied, 3.service, 4.peace, 5.brilliance', NULL, NULL),
  ('41e842c8-e353-54b2-b536-dd266aa11449'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'REPEAT_SENTENCE', E'REPEAT_SENTENCE', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '41e842c8-e353-54b2-b536-dd266aa11449'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'RS', NULL, '7d74ddcc-40e3-5515-a4ef-bfb64554f149'::uuid, NULL, E'Students are afraid of writing an essay because they have not learned how to do it.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('41e8e2cc-163d-5721-84bd-e85010f57cdd'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'ANSWER_SHORT_QUESTION', E'ANSWER_SHORT_QUESTION', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '41e8e2cc-163d-5721-84bd-e85010f57cdd'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'ASQ', E'What is the opposite of "dangerous"?', '5ead8558-5c9f-5cb6-9286-cd0eb6f4e7d4'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'Safe', NULL, NULL),
  ('41ed2611-10e4-5419-955c-7184b4e62e12'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'LISTENING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '41ed2611-10e4-5419-955c-7184b4e62e12'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'WFD', NULL, '3c1bac56-a988-5019-b27b-31e81d59f7d7'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'The lecture is intended to promote serious thoughts and discussions.', NULL, NULL),
  ('41ef82ff-10a2-5da2-bf57-fd5f4da58242'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'WRITE_ESSAY', E'WRITE_ESSAY', E'WRITING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '41ef82ff-10a2-5da2-bf57-fd5f4da58242'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'WE 论点翻译 2', E'句子翻译(仅翻译句子,无字数要求):如果每个人都为保护环境做贡献,世界会变得更加美好。', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 200, 300),
  ('41f03fc1-6201-5238-9f78-7da18a660eda'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'REPEAT_SENTENCE', E'REPEAT_SENTENCE', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '41f03fc1-6201-5238-9f78-7da18a660eda'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'RS', NULL, 'ac773111-76ac-5c0a-a631-0bbf8f798f8a'::uuid, NULL, E'There has been a growing need for qualified teachers of English literature.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('41fb18b7-2208-5264-b770-7f447178c0cf'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DRAG_AND_DROP', E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DRAG_AND_DROP', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '41fb18b7-2208-5264-b770-7f447178c0cf'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Shipwrecks', E'The few people who live in Alaska''s the Aleutian Islands have long been accustomed to shipwrecks. They have been part of local consciousness since a Japanese whaling ship ran {{1}} near the western end of the 1,100-mile (1,800-km) volcanic {{2}} in 1780, inadvertently naming what is now Rat Island when the ship''s infestation {{3}} ashore and made itself at home. Since then, there have been at least 190 shipwrecks in the islands.', NULL, NULL, NULL, E'1.aground, 2.archipelago, 3.scurried', NULL, NULL),
  ('4201074b-5521-5da1-b01a-4c14bd2579be'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'SUMMARIZE_WRITTEN_TEXT', E'SUMMARIZE_WRITTEN_TEXT', E'WRITING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '4201074b-5521-5da1-b01a-4c14bd2579be'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Triangulation', E'While multi-method research is experiencing a surge of popularity, there are reasons to worry about whether multi-method applications are producing more grounded, justified, and persuasive inferences than single-method studies. These concerns arise from the ''triangulation'' framework as prototypical research design for multi-method social science. Simply put, triangulation designs involve asking the same causal inference question using two different methods, checking the same substantive conclusions. The metaphor is to the geometric technique of estimating distance by measuring the angle of sight toward an object from two different vantage points.\nTriangulation in social sciences has major flaws. One is well-known and widely discussed: what conclusion should be drawn when the two methods produce different findings? Unfortunately, the list of intellectually plausible responses to such an outcome is all but unbounded.\nFor example, a scholar could reasonably conclude that both findings are correct but capture different aspects of the phenomenon of interest; that one method or the other displayed fundamental limitations in the analysis; that the divergence provides evidence against the credibility of the assumptions involved in both methods; that the outcome involves a contrast in terms of scope or relevant populations for the two methods; or that the failure to triangulate simply leaves the inference in a state of uncertainty. In decades of writing about triangulation, no definitive guidance has yet emerged about how to respond to divergent findings between the multiple methods in a study.', NULL, NULL, E'There are reasons to worry about whether multi-method applications are producing more grounded, justified, and persuasive inferences, which arise from the ''triangulation'' framework, and triangulation in social sciences has major flaws, but the list of intellectually plausible responses to such an outcome is all but unbounded, so no definitive guidance has yet emerged about how to respond to divergent findings between the multiple methods in a study.', NULL, 5, 75),
  ('4205feac-b2c7-5541-aeb1-4042b1157b7b'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DROPDOWN', E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DROPDOWN', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '4205feac-b2c7-5541-aeb1-4042b1157b7b'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Bach', E'Those were his halcyon days when his music was constantly heard in Venice, and his influence {{1}} Europe. He spent much of his time on the road , {{2}} and overseeing productions of his music. In Germany, Bach studied Vivaldi''s scores, copied them for performance and {{3}} some for other instruments .', NULL, NULL, NULL, E'1.blanketed, 2.performing, 3.arranged', NULL, NULL),
  ('4211da3c-4751-57e9-a55f-0fe05db29a83'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'SUMMARIZE_WRITTEN_TEXT', E'SUMMARIZE_WRITTEN_TEXT', E'WRITING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '4211da3c-4751-57e9-a55f-0fe05db29a83'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Green Spaces', E'The healing power of nature in enhancing mental health is an area of increasing interest and study in psychological and medical research. The presence of green spaces, such as parks, forests, and gardens, has been shown to have a significant positive impact on mental well-being, offering a natural, accessible remedy to the stresses of modern life.\nExposure to nature can lead to reductions in symptoms associated with anxiety, depression, and stress. Natural environments promote relaxation and rejuvenation, partly by reducing the levels of cortisol, a stress hormone, in the body. Being in nature also encourages physical activity, which further contributes to mental health improvements.\nFurthermore, green spaces provide an opportunity for social interaction, which is vital for mental health. Whether it''s a casual conversation with a fellow hiker or participating in a community gardening project, these interactions can foster a sense of community and belonging.\nNature also plays a critical role in cognitive function. Studies have shown that spending time in natural settings can improve attention, memory, and creativity. For children, regular exposure to nature has been linked to enhanced learning abilities and reduced symptoms of Attention Deficit Hyperactivity Disorder (ADHD).\nUrban planning that incorporates green spaces is increasingly recognized as essential for public health. Access to natural environments in urban areas can help mitigate the mental health challenges posed by city living.\nIn conclusion, the psychological benefits of nature are vast and varied. From reducing stress and improving mood to enhancing cognitive function and fostering social connections, the importance of green spaces in mental health cannot be overstated. Embracing and preserving natural environments is not only beneficial for ecological health but is also crucial for the mental well-being of individuals and communities.', NULL, NULL, E'The presence of green spaces significantly benefits mental health, reducing symptoms of anxiety, depression, and stress, enhancing cognitive functions, and fostering social interactions, highlighting the importance of integrating nature into urban planning for the well-being of individuals and communities.', NULL, 5, 75),
  ('42131e5f-c535-594c-8d3c-fa9b35a9afdf'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'WRITE_ESSAY', E'WRITE_ESSAY', E'WRITING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '42131e5f-c535-594c-8d3c-fa9b35a9afdf'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Real Life', E'Media make people lose contact with real life, do you agree or disagree.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 200, 300),
  ('42136bb7-c9b2-56af-99a6-6af05609e464'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'RE_TELL_LECTURE', E'RE_TELL_LECTURE', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '42136bb7-c9b2-56af-99a6-6af05609e464'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Rice', NULL, '008c6bcb-228c-58c8-8f4a-b4d05b2f5fe9'::uuid, NULL, E'In 1943, what became known as the Green Revolution began when Mexico, unable to feed its growing population, shouted for help. Within a few years, the Ford and Rockefeller Foundations founded the International Rice Research Institute in Asia, and by 1962, a new strain of rice called IR8 was feeding people all over the world. IR8 was the first really big modified crop to make a real impact on world hunger. In 1962 the technology did not yet exist to directly manipulate the genes of plants, and so IR8 was created by carefully crossing existing varieties: selecting the best from each generation, further modifying them, and finally finding the best. Here is the power of modified crops: IR8, with no fertilizer, straight out of the box, produced five times the yield of traditional rice varieties. In optimal conditions with nitrogen, it produced ten times the yield of traditional varieties. By 1980, IR36 resisted pests and grew fast enough to allow two crops a year instead of just one, doubling the yield. And by 1990, using more advanced genetic manipulation techniques, IR72 was outperforming even IR36. The Green Revolution saw worldwide crop yields explode from 1960 through 2000.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
