  ('422c8fd8-a5fb-530b-b967-e380e06c1ed1'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DRAG_AND_DROP', E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DRAG_AND_DROP', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '422c8fd8-a5fb-530b-b967-e380e06c1ed1'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Photosynthesis in Plants', E'Photosynthesis in plants is an extraordinary biological process. Through specialized cells containing chlorophyll, plants {{1}} sunlight into chemical energy, releasing oxygen as a byproduct. This process is the foundation of life on Earth, providing the oxygen we {{2}} and the basis of the food chain. Plants'' ability to harness solar energy is a remarkable adaptation that has enabled a diverse array of life forms to {{3}} on our planet.', NULL, NULL, NULL, E'1.convert, 2.breathe, 3.thrive', NULL, NULL),
