  ('46089e7a-a85d-5fb5-87f1-8d7d9e920fc7'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DRAG_AND_DROP', E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DRAG_AND_DROP', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '46089e7a-a85d-5fb5-87f1-8d7d9e920fc7'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Global Economy', E'The global economy is {{1}} to shrink by almost 3.2% this year, according to the IMF, which would be the largest {{2}} in economic activity since the Great Depression. In 2020 alone, millions of people could be {{3}} into extreme poverty, reversing the declining global trend of the last twenty-plus years.', NULL, NULL, NULL, E'1.expected, 2.contraction, 3.pushed', NULL, NULL),
  ('460c3d58-8250-57dd-8ea8-c60349bd5cc4'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DROPDOWN', E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DROPDOWN', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '460c3d58-8250-57dd-8ea8-c60349bd5cc4'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Public Archaeology', E'The aim of this book is to give the reader an overview of study and practice in the field of public archaeology. It offers a series of snapshots of important ideas and areas of work brought together as an introduction, {{1}} an inevitably brief and incomplete one, to one of the most challenging and rewarding parts of the wider archaeological discipline. Read the book from cover to cover and you will have a good working understanding of public archaeology {{2}} a complicated, rich and diverse field, {{3}} knowledge of some of the most significant and iconic examples {{4}} public archaeology in action. Dip into a specific chapter and you will find a concise and insightful introduction to one aspect of public archaeology with case studies and a list of readings to develop your understanding. {{5}} you use this book I am confident that you will emerge with a better understanding of what public archaeology is, why it matters and what you can do about it. First, it is necessary and useful, drawing on the quotes above, to ask what we mean by public archaeology, and to examine some of the different ways it has been defined.', NULL, NULL, NULL, E'1.albeit, 2.as, 3.as well as, 4.of, 5.However', NULL, NULL),
