  ('49c31d09-c543-57a2-9471-f3c648531fec'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'RE_ORDER_PARAGRAPHS', E'RE_ORDER_PARAGRAPHS', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '49c31d09-c543-57a2-9471-f3c648531fec'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'EU Fishing', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, E'5, 3, 2, 1, 4', NULL, NULL),
  ('49c3a852-c396-5c10-8aee-fdd363ba95e4'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'LISTENING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '49c3a852-c396-5c10-8aee-fdd363ba95e4'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'WFD', NULL, '4654a583-eac2-50ce-96b7-56ac1daa8f95'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'They have notably developed writing skills after two years of study.', NULL, NULL),
  ('49c431cf-0cd5-5b96-a9f6-44d3496b5e7e'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'REPEAT_SENTENCE', E'REPEAT_SENTENCE', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '49c431cf-0cd5-5b96-a9f6-44d3496b5e7e'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'RS', NULL, '74260da8-7376-5f95-a607-219bfbb9851a'::uuid, NULL, E'A talk will be given by a leading expert from the local government.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('49c5213f-f8e9-52cd-845f-6feefa2c7f48'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DRAG_AND_DROP', E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DRAG_AND_DROP', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '49c5213f-f8e9-52cd-845f-6feefa2c7f48'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Hans Christian Andersen', E'Fans of biographical criticism have a {{1}} source in the works of Hans Christian Andersen. Like Lewis Carroll (and, to a lesser extent, Kenneth Grahame), Andersen was near-pathologically uncomfortable in the {{2}} of adults. Of course, all three had to work and interact with adults, but all three really {{3}} well to children and their simpler worlds. Andersen, for a time, ran a puppet theater and was incredibly {{4}} with children, and, of course, he wrote an impressive {{5}} of fairy tales which have been produced in thousands of editions since the 19th century.', NULL, NULL, NULL, E'1.luxurious, 2.company, 3.related, 4.popular, 5.body', NULL, NULL),
  ('49c83a86-4974-5508-a72a-59bcc7a31a5e'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'RE_TELL_LECTURE', E'RE_TELL_LECTURE', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '49c83a86-4974-5508-a72a-59bcc7a31a5e'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Advertising for Tobacco', NULL, '6381f653-934c-54a2-9207-c1a72915eec7'::uuid, NULL, E'Over the past few months, the government has been pushing to remove all advertising outlets for the tobacco industry, and in particular pushing for plain packaging. The tobacco industry, however, are against this and they in particular argue that the cigarette box is not a form of advertising. Michaela has been doing her PhD looking at cigarette advertising and how it''s changed over the last 50 years.\nBasically, I''ve accessed advertising from the tobacco industry since the 1950s and just analyze the images and looked at the use of the cigarette box within the adverts. In the very early adverts, the cigarette box is a very small part of the adverts and they focus much more on the social aspects of smoking. However, as you move through the decades and get closer to the present day, the cigarette box became more and more of a focal point in the adverts.\nMy argument is that the cigarette box has actually become iconic to each brand. So when a smoker takes a box out of their pocket, they are actually advertising that brand.\nSo what we hope will come out of this is that the government will introduce plain packaging. And like Australia who have already introduced its policy and Ireland who are again beginning to introduce its policy, we hope that the UK will stop cigarette companies from using their box as a form of advertising.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('49cd9d48-c8b8-50e0-9fe1-eb5ca34747f5'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'READ_ALOUD', E'READ_ALOUD', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '49cd9d48-c8b8-50e0-9fe1-eb5ca34747f5'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Video clip', E'A video clip of a bloodied passenger being forcibly removed from a United Airlines flight to make room for airline staff turned into a PR disaster. People used social media to complain that United should be beating the competition, not customers. United’s boss, Oscar Munoz, apologized—eventually. Lawyers for the passenger, David Dao, filed a petition to seize evidence related to the incident.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('49ce3b7c-44ee-59ba-9488-caeb86c689eb'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DROPDOWN', E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DROPDOWN', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '49ce3b7c-44ee-59ba-9488-caeb86c689eb'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Population Decline', E'There are soon to be 8 billion of us and counting. Yet while the world’s population is still growing fast overall, in many countries, the numbers are {{1}} or will do soon. The population of China will begin to fall soon and could halve by 2100. India’s will peak around 2050. And the US population would fall from the 2030s if not for immigration. So there are two {{2}} issues to deal with: rapid population growth in some nations and population declines in others. Many see limiting population growth as vital for tackling various environmental catastrophes {{3}} around the world, as we report on in our article “What will a population of 8 billion people mean for us and the planet?” Yet for wealthy Westerners to call for lower-income countries to control their populations simply in the name of protecting nature is hypocritical in the extreme, given that the rich have vastly larger environmental footprints. What’s more, there is often more than a {{4}} of racism to such calls.', NULL, NULL, NULL, E'1.declining, 2.distinct, 3.unfolding, 4.whiff', NULL, NULL),
  ('49d2262e-b8b8-5c05-a8cb-d6c73ad9d532'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'LISTENING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '49d2262e-b8b8-5c05-a8cb-d6c73ad9d532'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'WFD', NULL, '5a1019e1-daf1-5d72-80f4-52863342f6aa'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'Money and how it is paid can affect the motivations to work.', NULL, NULL),
  ('49d32ad6-9df2-560c-87f5-6f31a0f0a2c6'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'LISTENING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '49d32ad6-9df2-560c-87f5-6f31a0f0a2c6'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'WFD', NULL, 'bbced53f-065a-596d-b9ec-e48dfc94ebff'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'I think it''s one of the best things I''ve done really.', NULL, NULL),
  ('49d66212-0551-5a57-b2d4-88ebf738e57a'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'ANSWER_SHORT_QUESTION', E'ANSWER_SHORT_QUESTION', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '49d66212-0551-5a57-b2d4-88ebf738e57a'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'ASQ', E'What do you call the scientific study of very small living things, such as bacteria?', '3ab3d162-24a9-51b4-92b3-91623442cee9'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'Microbiology', NULL, NULL),
  ('49d6de71-121f-578b-aa61-c9f65e6eb290'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'REPEAT_SENTENCE', E'REPEAT_SENTENCE', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '49d6de71-121f-578b-aa61-c9f65e6eb290'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'RS', NULL, '54348ed2-0381-5ba4-b1d8-75a2861b0caa'::uuid, NULL, E'The conference is expected to attract a larger crowd compared to last year.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('49db627e-57af-5223-b6af-43a85e064715'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'MC_READING_SINGLE', E'MC_READING_SINGLE', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '49db627e-57af-5223-b6af-43a85e064715'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Symbiotic Association', E'Mycorrhizal fungi infect more plants than do any other fungi and are necessary for many plants to thrive, but they have escaped widespread investigation until recently for two reasons. First, the symbiotic association is so well-balanced that the roots of host plants show no damage even when densely infected. Second, the fungi cannot as yet be cultivated in the absence of a living root. Despite these difficulties, there has been important new work that suggests that this symbiotic association can be harnessed to achieve more economical use of costly superphosphate fertilizer and to permit better exploitation of cheaper, less soluble rock phosphate. Mycorrhizal benefits are not limited to improved phosphate uptake in host plants. In legumes, mycorrhizal inoculation has increased nitrogen fixation beyond levels achieved by adding phosphate fertilizer alone. Certain symbiotic associations also increase the host plant''s resistance to harmful root fungi. Whether this resistance results from exclusion of harmful fungi through competition for sites, from metabolic change involving antibiotic production, or from increased vigor is undetermined.\n\nIt can be inferred from the passage that which of the following has been a factor influencing the extent to which research on mycorrhizal fungi has progressed?', NULL, NULL, NULL, E'Difficulties surrounding laboratory production of specimens for study', NULL, NULL),
  ('49dc1c84-39d6-5a9b-b37d-c908ddbd834c'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'ANSWER_SHORT_QUESTION', E'ANSWER_SHORT_QUESTION', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '49dc1c84-39d6-5a9b-b37d-c908ddbd834c'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'ASQ', E'Which tool is not considered to be the modern general transport tool, bus, carriage or tram?', '3f89b543-3f92-5442-8f22-18be4fe632a1'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'carriage', NULL, NULL),
  ('49dcbd17-d338-5d88-a696-52154cb1d1dd'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'ANSWER_SHORT_QUESTION', E'ANSWER_SHORT_QUESTION', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '49dcbd17-d338-5d88-a696-52154cb1d1dd'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'ASQ', E'What does ASAP mean?', '48621ef8-2659-5967-b032-a80dc4d44a19'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'As soon as possible', NULL, NULL),
