  ('4bfe2841-63f2-54b7-9fd1-6fd24e36c32d'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'REPEAT_SENTENCE', E'REPEAT_SENTENCE', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '4bfe2841-63f2-54b7-9fd1-6fd24e36c32d'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'RS', NULL, '3ed1455e-2104-5d25-a0b4-819f5920a11c'::uuid, NULL, E'Acupuncture is a technique involved in traditional Chinese medicine.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('4c0978d5-cd4b-5fba-906a-3742cb2872b5'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DROPDOWN', E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DROPDOWN', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '4c0978d5-cd4b-5fba-906a-3742cb2872b5'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Long Informative Messages', E'The situational context of a message is key to its success. Some messages will be {{1}} for internal employees with a specific call to action to use the text provided to {{2}} a marketing effort. Others work as a means of communicating with customers and would-be customers to {{3}} apparent negative comments from competitors. Others may bring an array of products and services together conceptually for greater understanding for the targeted audience. Still others will {{4}} lengthy product feature details in a casual, friendly and unassuming manner.', NULL, NULL, NULL, E'1.targeted, 2.expand, 3.rebut, 4.deliver', NULL, NULL),
  ('4c0a35d6-4f08-5a59-8bd7-7a6975fd490d'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DROPDOWN', E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DROPDOWN', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '4c0a35d6-4f08-5a59-8bd7-7a6975fd490d'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Libraries', E'Libraries today are so different from what they used to be. It''s not just about books on shelves anymore. With the internet and digital media, libraries have had to change a lot. Now, they''re like community centers where you can access all {{1}} of digital resources. You can find eBooks, use computers, and sometimes even attend events or workshops. But changing into this new digital role hasn''t been easy. Libraries have to {{2}} out how to stay relevant when so much information is available online. And they have to do this while still being a place people want to come to for books and other traditional resources. It''s a tough balance. Despite these challenges, libraries are still really important. They offer free access to information, {{3}} is super important, especially in communities where not everyone can {{4}} their own books or internet. And they''re still places where people can come together, learn new things, and find a quiet {{5}} to study or read. It''s interesting to see how libraries are adapting and what role they''ll play in our communities in the future.', NULL, NULL, NULL, E'1.sorts, 2.figure, 3.which, 4.afford, 5.spot', NULL, NULL),
  ('4c1582c9-14d5-5451-98de-9ca1c632ecdd'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'READ_ALOUD', E'READ_ALOUD', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '4c1582c9-14d5-5451-98de-9ca1c632ecdd'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Health Check-ups', E'Regular health check-ups are essential for maintaining good health and preventing chronic diseases. They allow us to detect potential health issues early on and take steps to prevent them from worsening. By scheduling regular check-ups with our healthcare provider, we can ensure that we are taking proactive steps to protect our health.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
