  ('4c4d5544-27b6-591c-bdd7-644685b33263'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'ANSWER_SHORT_QUESTION', E'ANSWER_SHORT_QUESTION', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '4c4d5544-27b6-591c-bdd7-644685b33263'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'ASQ', E'What do we call a small portion of cake or pizza?', '4f36d476-803f-5eb8-b952-662345a27dee'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'Slice', NULL, NULL),
  ('4c5af37d-727a-5c93-bbd6-ea33cb9871e8'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'READ_ALOUD', E'READ_ALOUD', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '4c5af37d-727a-5c93-bbd6-ea33cb9871e8'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Political Problems', E'The course considers the ways in which thinkers have responded to the particular political problems of their day and the ways in which they contribute to a broader conversation about human goods and needs, justice, democracy, and the proper relationship of the individual to the state.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('4c60051f-191c-59c0-910d-200cda184627'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'ANSWER_SHORT_QUESTION', E'ANSWER_SHORT_QUESTION', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '4c60051f-191c-59c0-910d-200cda184627'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'ASQ', E'What do we call the jewelry worn around your wrist?', 'aa92c6ef-ca52-5fde-9874-99f533b05b57'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'Bracelet', NULL, NULL),
  ('4c6f58bb-1013-5400-8498-1e8f88308663'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'SUMMARIZE_WRITTEN_TEXT', E'SUMMARIZE_WRITTEN_TEXT', E'WRITING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '4c6f58bb-1013-5400-8498-1e8f88308663'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Psychotherapy', E'Psychotherapy, sometimes called talk therapy, is a treatment that involves a talking relationship between a therapist and patient. It can be used to treat a broad variety of mental disorders and emotional difficulties. The goal of psychotherapy is to eliminate or control disabling or troubling symptoms so the patient can function better. Depending on the extent of the problem, treatment may take just a few sessions over a week or two or may take many sessions over a period of years. Psychotherapy can be done individually, as a couple, with a family, or in a group.\nThere are many forms of psychotherapy. There are psychotherapies that help patients change behaviors or thought patterns, psychotherapies that help patients explore the effect of past relationships and experiences on present behaviors, and psychotherapies that are tailored to help solve other problems in specific ways. Cognitive behavior therapy is a goal-oriented therapy focusing on problem solving. Psychoanalysis is an intensive form of individual psychotherapy which requires frequent sessions over several years.\nMost medications are used by psychiatrists in much the same way that medications are used to treat high blood pressure or diabetes. After completing thorough evaluations, psychiatrists can prescribe medications to help treat mental disorders. While the precise mechanism of action of psychiatric medications is not fully understood, they may beneficially modulate chemical signaling and communication within the brain, which may reduce some symptoms of psychiatric disorders. Patients on long-term medication treatment will need to meet with their psychiatrist periodically to monitor the effectiveness of the medication and any potential side effects.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 5, 75),
  ('4c741647-2e47-5abf-802d-7c3ba4ad6984'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'ANSWER_SHORT_QUESTION', E'ANSWER_SHORT_QUESTION', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '4c741647-2e47-5abf-802d-7c3ba4ad6984'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'ASQ', E'What kind of forms are tragedy and comedy?', '2835df9b-a82c-54e2-b2f2-67cd2659c672'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'Drama', NULL, NULL),
  ('4c79687a-2870-5382-85a0-da631a791118'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'WRITE_ESSAY', E'WRITE_ESSAY', E'WRITING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '4c79687a-2870-5382-85a0-da631a791118'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Lifestyle', E'Do you agree that the modern lifestyle is too fast-paced for good mental health?', NULL, NULL, E'I wholeheartedly agree that the modern lifestyle is too fast-paced for good mental health. The relentless speed of contemporary living can exact a toll on mental well-being, leading to increased stress, challenges in maintaining work-life balance, and strained relationships. In a world that values speed and productivity, the detrimental effects of a fast-paced lifestyle on mental health cannot be ignored.\nThe fast-paced modern lifestyle often results in heightened levels of stress and burnout. The constant pressure to keep up with the demands of work, social engagements, and personal responsibilities can overwhelm individuals, leading to chronic stress that impacts mental health. The relentless pace of life leaves little room for relaxation and rejuvenation, contributing to feelings of anxiety and exhaustion.\nBalancing work, personal life, and self-care becomes increasingly challenging in a fast-paced environment. The emphasis on productivity and achievement may overshadow the importance of self-care and downtime, creating a cycle of perpetual business that hinders mental well-being. The lack of adequate time for relaxation can disrupt the equilibrium between work and personal life, further exacerbating stress and impacting mental health.\nIn conclusion, the modern lifestyle''s fast-paced nature poses significant challenges to good mental health, manifesting in increased stress, compromised work-life balance, and strained relationships. As individuals navigate the demands of a rapidly changing world, it is essential to prioritize self-care, set boundaries, and seek support to mitigate the negative effects of a fast-paced lifestyle on mental well-being. By recognizing the impact of speed and adopting strategies to cultivate mindfulness, balance, and meaningful connections, individuals can strive for a healthier relationship with the modern pace of life and safeguard their mental health in the process.', NULL, 200, 300),
  ('4c7c77b5-a004-5db5-ad73-3b3c069dc539'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'RE_TELL_LECTURE', E'RE_TELL_LECTURE', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '4c7c77b5-a004-5db5-ad73-3b3c069dc539'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Gross National Happiness', NULL, 'bc1df943-2afa-5c0f-8e97-778afb10d511'::uuid, NULL, E'Back in the 1970s, our fourth king famously pronounced that for Bhutan, Gross National Happiness is more important than Gross National Product. Ever since, all development in Bhutan is driven by GNH, a pioneering vision that aims to improve the happiness and well-being of our people. But that’s easier said than done, especially when you are one of the smallest economies in the world. Our entire GDP is less than two billion dollars. I know that some of you here are worth more — individually than the entire economy of my country. So our economy is small, but here is where it gets interesting. Education is completely free. All citizens are guaranteed free school education, and those that work hard are given free college education. Healthcare is also completely free. Medical consultation, medical treatment, medicines: they are all provided by the state. We manage this because we use our limited resources very carefully, and because we stay faithful to the core mission of GNH, which is development with values. Our economy is small, and we must strengthen it. Economic growth is important, but that economic growth must not come from undermining our unique culture or our pristine environment.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('4c7d0e13-8148-5a0b-b0c2-c409a20e8126'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'ANSWER_SHORT_QUESTION', E'ANSWER_SHORT_QUESTION', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '4c7d0e13-8148-5a0b-b0c2-c409a20e8126'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'ASQ', E'What is the job title of a person who paints pictures for a living?', '674fb4b4-82e8-50a9-86b0-34caed043f06'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'Painter', NULL, NULL),
