  ('4fcbb636-01c9-596f-a219-f3f8ef987c10'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'LISTENING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '4fcbb636-01c9-596f-a219-f3f8ef987c10'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'WFD', NULL, 'c72426d4-80f2-5401-a979-57edff99820e'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'Few employment opportunities exist within this particular job sector.', NULL, NULL),
  ('4fcfca31-59a9-53d8-917d-35b77fb40887'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'READ_ALOUD', E'READ_ALOUD', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '4fcfca31-59a9-53d8-917d-35b77fb40887'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Vegetative Cover', E'The root systems of vegetative cover hold soils in place and prevent wind and water erosion. It also ensures its supply of organic matter from dead leaves and the dropping of animal waste. The vegetative cover also shelters the soils from excessive heat from the sun. It helps to reduce evaporation and retain soil moisture needed for the breakdown of organic matter.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('4fd6d945-ab1a-5f2f-ac27-733226c964cc'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'ANSWER_SHORT_QUESTION', E'ANSWER_SHORT_QUESTION', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '4fd6d945-ab1a-5f2f-ac27-733226c964cc'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'ASQ', E'What do we call the two rows of metal or plastic teeth that you can pull together to fasten clothes or bags?', '55a4f70c-51bd-5c46-9971-6a9140dc6384'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'Zip / zipper', NULL, NULL),
  ('4fd888c3-a7ce-5e2a-a911-870b481e06b3'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'LISTENING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '4fd888c3-a7ce-5e2a-a911-870b481e06b3'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'WFD', NULL, 'b58e7adb-f69d-53ab-a385-d2e2308f5524'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'The tests have been designed to detect the disease early.', NULL, NULL),
  ('4fdc1e19-77f2-525c-9571-d5fd08439703'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'LISTENING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '4fdc1e19-77f2-525c-9571-d5fd08439703'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'WFD', NULL, '95ad96b0-0d6d-5507-92ba-12c2b1a873da'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'Our cultural values are dependent on the choices we made.', NULL, NULL),
  ('4fe08392-6f37-5bfc-8151-39b3bb457427'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'MC_LISTENING_SINGLE', E'MC_LISTENING_SINGLE', E'LISTENING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '4fe08392-6f37-5bfc-8151-39b3bb457427'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Chair', E'Listen to a discussion in a business class. The computerized workplace can be hazardous to your health. If you don''t take preventative measures today, we''ll go over what some of these hazards are, and more importantly, what can be done about them. One major complaint may be the biggest complaint of people who spend time at the computer is eyestrain. To help ease the strain on the eyes, the computer screen should be about two feet from your eyes. The entire screen should be in focus. The brightness and contrast should be adjusted for best readability. A good way to relieve eyestrain is to look away from the screen, frequently focus your eyes on objects that are far away, like something outside the building across the street, or the tree in the parking lot. But what if your office doesn''t have a window? I mean, I''ve worked in lots of places where there''s no window, then in that case you need to get up and walk around. You should never sit for more than thirty minutes at a time. Anyway, this is important for the rest of your body as well. Namely your back neck and back pain are a big problem for computer people always make sure your screen, keyboard, and chair are the right height for you.\n\nAccording to the discussion, why is it important to have the right chair?', '1ac49317-a414-521d-8c3f-6582adf642a5'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'The right chair can help you avoid back pain.', NULL, NULL),
  ('4fe8f619-d57b-5665-a945-b6d0f841aaee'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'LISTENING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '4fe8f619-d57b-5665-a945-b6d0f841aaee'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'WFD', NULL, '63f94434-e214-5fb7-ba90-c29964f81d94'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'The visitor used to be the lecturer of this department.', NULL, NULL),
  ('4febc4d2-026c-5f4f-b25d-aaf4607c9b82'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'WRITE_ESSAY', E'WRITE_ESSAY', E'WRITING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '4febc4d2-026c-5f4f-b25d-aaf4607c9b82'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Information Revolution', E'The information revolution brought about by modern mass communications has both positive and negative consequences for individuals and society. To what extent do you agree with this statement? Give the reason with your own experience.', NULL, NULL, E'Nowadays, the impacts of the information revolution brought about by modern mass communications have fueled heated discussions. Proponents claim that the information revolution enables instant information access, whereas opponents contend that it has triggered real-life chaos. From my perspective, I am convinced that the information revolution brought about by modern mass communications has both positive and negative consequences for individuals and society.\nTo begin with, while easing information access, digital tools spread misinformation and foster unhealthy addictions. For example, social media speeds up information finding, but also strains our brains and reduces productivity. In addition to this, online platforms help people share different views, but their recommendation systems trap users in information bubbles. Other than that, digital entertainment offers abundant leisure options, yet addiction to short videos and online games impairs time management. It is thus shown that the information revolution driven by modern mass communications generates beneficial impacts on individuals and society.\nBesides, I also believe that the internet has reshaped the way we live, but at the cost of emotional distance, uncontrolled spending, and work-life imbalance. On top of that, instant messaging helps people stay connected remotely, but cuts down real-life meetups, weakening relationships and worsening loneliness. Moreover, online shopping makes purchases easier, but personalized pricing and impulse buying can deplete your budget. Recently, I have examined an article arguing that modern communication tools enable flexible remote work, but excessive connectivity blurs work-life boundaries. This clearly proves that the information revolution ushered in by contemporary mass communications brings about detrimental outcomes.\nTo conclude, there is no doubt that information overload and reality disorder are essential in today''s world. While some might disagree, the evidence strongly supports that the information revolution driven by modern mass communications has both beneficial and harmful impacts on individuals and society.', NULL, 200, 300),
  ('4fee82ef-ab92-599f-9af0-c23ca4953632'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'REPEAT_SENTENCE', E'REPEAT_SENTENCE', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '4fee82ef-ab92-599f-9af0-c23ca4953632'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'RS', NULL, '0c0da227-5275-5a90-9562-a4f4c4bdd1ae'::uuid, NULL, E'The final year will consist of four taught courses and one project.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('4ff091f3-06eb-53f8-bab5-1d9702f14ce2'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'RE_TELL_LECTURE', E'RE_TELL_LECTURE', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '4ff091f3-06eb-53f8-bab5-1d9702f14ce2'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Superman', NULL, '26f77b7d-afb2-5688-be90-efe191f67395'::uuid, NULL, E'Today we''re going to recount heroic tales of superhuman feats of strength, when in the face of disaster, some people are said to have summoned up incredible physical power to lift a car off of an accident victim, move giant rocks, or like Big John of song, single-handedly hold up a collapsing beam to let the other miners escape. Are such stories true? There are many anecdotes supporting the idea, but we''re going to take a fact-based look at whether or not it truly is possible for an adrenalin-charged person to temporarily gain massive strength. In proper terminology, such a temporary boost of physical power would be called hysterical strength. The stories are almost always in the form of one person lifting a car off of another. In each of these cases, some aspect of leverage or buoyancy probably played some role in reducing the magnitude of the feat to something more believable. And even lifting many cars by several inches still leaves most of its weight supported by the suspension springs. But our purpose today is not to "debunk" any of the specific stories. The majority of them are anecdotal, and interestingly not repeatable; in many cases, the person who summoned the superstrength later tried it again only to find that they couldn''t do it. Basically, what we have is a respectably large body of anecdotal evidence that suggests that in times of crisis, danger, or fear, some people have the ability to temporarily exercise superhuman strength.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('4ff388ae-f46b-5bb8-903c-e9f43d2146ef'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'LISTENING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '4ff388ae-f46b-5bb8-903c-e9f43d2146ef'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'WFD', NULL, 'af7c5e5e-82fd-523c-a302-bb6ac3b5cb76'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'The placement test of mathematics and statistics is offered every semester.', NULL, NULL),
  ('500be7b9-af3d-58a7-8fb9-fb291d38c62a'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'MC_LISTENING_SINGLE', E'MC_LISTENING_SINGLE', E'LISTENING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '500be7b9-af3d-58a7-8fb9-fb291d38c62a'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Second Sun', E'Have you ever wondered what it would be like to have two Suns in our sky? Seeing two suns during a sunset would be a spectacular sight indeed. And actually, it isn’t such a rare occurrence. It is currently estimated that a third of star systems have two or more stars. Which made me wonder, how much would a having second star impact us here on Earth? How hot would Earth get? What would the day and night cycle be like? Would it be possible for life as we know it to survive in a multi-star system? Well, it depends.\n\nWhich of the following correspond to what the speaker said?', 'd8a1eef2-ceb7-5d9c-8d13-0cfcbf61470d'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'In fact, about 33% of the star systems have two or more stars.', NULL, NULL),
  ('500db59e-a3d5-56c8-bbaf-b87cf20735ab'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'LISTENING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '500db59e-a3d5-56c8-bbaf-b87cf20735ab'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'WFD', NULL, 'a1a92dec-ffa7-572d-9a66-e6cc5d945d1e'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'The urban geography degree includes the study of demography.', NULL, NULL),
  ('5010319e-e635-54c8-a8fe-a408c74e5fdc'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'LISTENING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '5010319e-e635-54c8-a8fe-a408c74e5fdc'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'WFD', NULL, 'a608eb4f-791e-54dd-8962-8960c5f94f9f'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'The architectural parameters vary in that experiment.', NULL, NULL),
  ('5014f8ee-c828-5afa-9f72-f3a7ad454e23'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'HIGHLIGHT_CORRECT_SUMMARY', E'HIGHLIGHT_CORRECT_SUMMARY', E'LISTENING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '5014f8ee-c828-5afa-9f72-f3a7ad454e23'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Sodium', E'Sodium is an essential nutrient that plays a key role in regulating fluid balance, transmitting nerve signals, and enabling muscle contractions. In the human body, the majority of sodium is located in the bloodstream and in the fluid surrounding cells. Keeping sodium levels within a healthy range is vital, since both too much and too little can lead to serious health issues.\nThe kidneys serve as the main regulators of sodium concentration. When blood sodium rises, they promote its elimination in urine; when levels drop, they conserve sodium by limiting its excretion. This regulation relies on intricate processes of filtration and reabsorption, guided by hormonal control—most notably aldosterone, which directs the kidneys to retain sodium.\nProper sodium regulation helps sustain normal blood pressure, prevents dehydration, and supports the smooth operation of many essential bodily functions.\n\nClick on the paragraph that best relates to the recording.', '7367c986-61c9-513b-a480-c4053bd30b82'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'Sodium is an essential mineral, and the kidney uses filtration, reabsorption, and hormones to maintain body sodium balance.', NULL, NULL),
  ('501569fc-7786-5960-a9db-8f8a14060f21'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'REPEAT_SENTENCE', E'REPEAT_SENTENCE', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '501569fc-7786-5960-a9db-8f8a14060f21'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'RS', NULL, '623f9b16-272b-5bde-84c6-495530d6a6cc'::uuid, NULL, E'Test the new hypothesis through a controlled experiment for verification.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('5018a622-8d69-537c-a9c7-935f774bcb7f'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DRAG_AND_DROP', E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DRAG_AND_DROP', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '5018a622-8d69-537c-a9c7-935f774bcb7f'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Monsoon Rains', E'Torrential monsoon rains {{1}} the most severe flooding in Pakistan’s recent history, washing away villages and leaving almost 10 million children in need of immediate, lifesaving support, and at increased risk of {{2}} diseases, drowning and malnutrition. As the floodwaters have receded, the crisis has become an {{3}} child survival crisis.', NULL, NULL, NULL, E'1.triggered, 2.waterborne, 3.acute', NULL, NULL),
