  ('5068b111-1878-5b2d-819f-cb84251d641c'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'WRITE_ESSAY', E'WRITE_ESSAY', E'WRITING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '5068b111-1878-5b2d-819f-cb84251d641c'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Adult Decision', E'Parents or other adult relatives should make important decisions for their teenage children. Do you agree with that?', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 200, 300),
  ('507415b0-b1a9-5edf-8b1b-7db998721864'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'LISTENING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '507415b0-b1a9-5edf-8b1b-7db998721864'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'WFD', NULL, '9fe4bbc5-2476-5624-9184-f2d5b940eb50'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'You will find an academic pathway suitable for you here.', NULL, NULL),
  ('50749e87-0c48-533e-bdb1-9c19fd2da247'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'READ_ALOUD', E'READ_ALOUD', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '50749e87-0c48-533e-bdb1-9c19fd2da247'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Communication Networks', E'A recent study has revealed the significance of communication and expertise in organizations and their impact on group performance. The researchers investigated the process of individuals joining communication networks and how selection procedures affect group performance. The findings indicate that individuals who communicate more during training are more likely to be selected as a central member of the network.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('5082c135-5dd0-5aae-841f-67ad8d840de7'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'HIGHLIGHT_CORRECT_SUMMARY', E'HIGHLIGHT_CORRECT_SUMMARY', E'LISTENING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '5082c135-5dd0-5aae-841f-67ad8d840de7'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Mental Health', E'One of the great contributing factors to mental illness is the idea that we should at all costs and at all times be well. We suffer far more than we should because of how long it can take many of us until we allow ourselves to fall properly and usefully ill. In a crisis, our chances of getting better rely to a significant extent on having the right relationship to our illness: an attitude which is relatively unfrightened by our distress, which isn’t overly in love with the idea of seeming at all times ‘normal’, which can allow us to be deranged for a while in order one day to reach a more authentic kind of sanity. It will help us immensely in this quest if the images of mental illness we can draw on at this time do not narrowly imply that our ailment is merely a freakish and pitiable possibility, if we can appeal to images that tease out the universal and dignified themes of our state, so that we do not – on top of everything else – have to fear and hate ourselves for being unwell.\n\nClick on the paragraph that best relates to the recording.', '064d8240-2fb8-5acb-aa78-d054db658b0b'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'There is no need that we should feel well all the time: we can feel disappointed or upset sometimes. We need to find the right relationship with our illness so that it does not cause us too much concern. So we don’t necessarily fear or hate it when we feel unwell.', NULL, NULL),
  ('50841603-da49-519e-bf62-ae58c903e7e2'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'LISTENING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '50841603-da49-519e-bf62-ae58c903e7e2'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'WFD', NULL, '2e77d459-90aa-5d09-ad5a-5d984f924064'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'The students will meet their new teachers after the summer vacation.', NULL, NULL),
  ('5085542d-f658-5c20-8db4-b10685cbbc08'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'REPEAT_SENTENCE', E'REPEAT_SENTENCE', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '5085542d-f658-5c20-8db4-b10685cbbc08'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'RS', NULL, '68cbb731-77bd-5b8b-9368-02ddfb2979e3'::uuid, NULL, E'Essays with few or no citations will raise the concern of the lecturers.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('508629d9-294a-5026-a12f-d6eec046ca98'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'REPEAT_SENTENCE', E'REPEAT_SENTENCE', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '508629d9-294a-5026-a12f-d6eec046ca98'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'RS', NULL, 'bf5398f0-6a1d-53ca-b335-f5536cfc3ccd'::uuid, NULL, E'I''m glad you discovered what you were looking for and feel satisfied.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('509090cb-5357-5ad1-b4b3-0eea9c9807b6'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'RE_ORDER_PARAGRAPHS', E'RE_ORDER_PARAGRAPHS', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '509090cb-5357-5ad1-b4b3-0eea9c9807b6'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Cup', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, E'1, 2, 4, 3', NULL, NULL),
  ('5091424a-e6a4-5a99-b0fd-fbddefb12dea'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'RE_TELL_LECTURE', E'RE_TELL_LECTURE', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '5091424a-e6a4-5a99-b0fd-fbddefb12dea'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Preservatives', NULL, 'a0aa8596-56e8-5d5c-825f-02a478c12ad2'::uuid, NULL, E'There are two major factors that cause food to go bad: microbes and oxidation. Microbes like bacteria and fungi invade food and feed off its nutrients. Some of these can cause diseases, like listeria and botulism. Others just turn edibles into a smelly, slimy, moldy mess. Meanwhile, oxidation is a chemical change in the food’s molecules caused by enzymes or free radicals which turn fats rancid and brown produce, like apples and potatoes. Preservatives can prevent both types of deterioration. Before the invention of artificial refrigeration, fungi and bacteria could run rampant in food. So we found ways to create an inhospitable environment for microbes. For example, making the food more acidic unravels enzymes that microbes need to survive. And some types of bacteria can actually help. For thousands of years, people preserved food using bacteria that produce lactic acid. The acid turns perishable vegetables and milk into longer lasting foods, like sauerkraut in Europe, kimchi in Korea, and yogurt in the Middle East. These cultured foods also populate your digestive track with beneficial microbes. Many synthetic preservatives are also acids. Benzoic acid in salad dressing, sorbic acid in cheese, and propionic acid in baked goods.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('50970180-3c4d-573f-ab21-4611dc889c13'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'ANSWER_SHORT_QUESTION', E'ANSWER_SHORT_QUESTION', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '50970180-3c4d-573f-ab21-4611dc889c13'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'ASQ', E'What do you use to test the body temperature?', '202352ae-6149-56fe-8ade-fafc5198acfb'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'Thermometer', NULL, NULL),
  ('50a023b5-07d8-5d95-9137-1193f8da7321'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'LISTENING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '50a023b5-07d8-5d95-9137-1193f8da7321'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'WFD', NULL, 'ee05b902-5637-5ae5-b93a-5cf750e826a8'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'Comprehensive theory and practical training are necessities in medical specializations.', NULL, NULL),
  ('50a070fe-85d9-5fff-aeef-034e795aa1d5'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'LISTENING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '50a070fe-85d9-5fff-aeef-034e795aa1d5'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'WFD', NULL, '98e6fa71-b3de-5b7c-a78a-e7c9251e4b6b'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'Most of their economic policies serve the interests of big business.', NULL, NULL),
  ('50a1f671-f34c-5f21-8e25-4012b42635ea'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'REPEAT_SENTENCE', E'REPEAT_SENTENCE', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '50a1f671-f34c-5f21-8e25-4012b42635ea'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'RS', NULL, '8c45f4c0-4b6b-5a19-a51a-bdd21fc16df7'::uuid, NULL, E'The swimming pool is drained and cleaned every winter.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('50a558c8-fc2a-5c6d-8989-b943b08103e4'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'REPEAT_SENTENCE', E'REPEAT_SENTENCE', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '50a558c8-fc2a-5c6d-8989-b943b08103e4'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'RS', NULL, '60f9023f-3adb-504a-a151-c16868e7258d'::uuid, NULL, E'If your student number is forgotten, reach out to Jenny Brice for assistance.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('50a73552-44ed-54bd-af2e-a8208176f3e0'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'READ_ALOUD', E'READ_ALOUD', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '50a73552-44ed-54bd-af2e-a8208176f3e0'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Chronic Disease', E'If you have a chronic disease such as heart disease, diabetes, asthma, or back or joint pain, exercise can have important health benefits. However, it is important to talk to your doctor before starting an exercise routine. He or she might have advice on what exercises are safe and any precautions you might need to take while exercising.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('50be23b1-e533-5ac9-a2ee-10f6cbb9ba86'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'REPEAT_SENTENCE', E'REPEAT_SENTENCE', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '50be23b1-e533-5ac9-a2ee-10f6cbb9ba86'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'RS', NULL, '2b44ed9c-c7b6-5935-9a4d-b06ad54febb3'::uuid, NULL, E'Students can get access to computers on a daily basis.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('50cb6686-f157-5f25-93e5-66c161c08d83'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'SUMMARIZE_WRITTEN_TEXT', E'SUMMARIZE_WRITTEN_TEXT', E'WRITING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '50cb6686-f157-5f25-93e5-66c161c08d83'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Title Loan', E'A title loan is a form of a secured loan that you can get with your car as collateral. Though it comes with high interest rates, you can get approved in minutes. With over 2 million people using their vehicles to secure a loan every year, title loans continue to be popular. Before taking one, you should understand its pros and cons to avoid getting your car repossessed.\nA title loan provider won’t run a credit check when you ask them for the loan. This ensures that you can get the quick financial assistance you need if you’re struggling to build your credit score and looking. Title loans have a pretty quick approval process that makes them convenient to borrowers. Once you fill out an application form for the loan, the lender will process the money on the same day. You’ll also receive the cash in your bank account instantly or within a few days, depending on your banking provider.\nUnlike other short-term loans, title loans have shorter repayment terms (ranging from 15 to 30 days). You may lose ownership of your vehicle if you cannot repay the loan in the specified time. The lender will also charge you more fees and interest on top of the loan amount.\nThough title loans can help you get out of a tricky financial situation, you need to review the loan terms. You should also take them if your income can cover the high interest fees and rates.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 5, 75),
  ('50de3932-6237-53b2-acf6-e3a8774faf81'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DROPDOWN', E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DROPDOWN', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '50de3932-6237-53b2-acf6-e3a8774faf81'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Architectural Evolution', E'Cities are living museums, displaying centuries of architectural evolution side by side. The styles of buildings reflect the era and technology of their construction, from medieval stone to modern steel and glass. Recently, there''s been a focus on {{1}} older buildings more energy-efficient, retrofitting them with technologies like solar panels. This trend represents a balance between preserving historical aesthetics and {{2}} today’s environmental standards. Architecture, fundamentally, is a record of human society, showing changes in tastes, technologies, and social structures over time. The challenge of integrating modern amenities {{3}} compromising the integrity of historical sites has sparked creative solutions. As cities expand, the pressure to {{4}} the new with the old while accommodating growth and sustainability concerns shapes the future of urban planning.', NULL, NULL, NULL, E'1.making, 2.meeting, 3.without, 4.blend', NULL, NULL),
  ('50e613a2-7c1f-55f5-b573-c842996cbc49'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'READ_ALOUD', E'READ_ALOUD', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '50e613a2-7c1f-55f5-b573-c842996cbc49'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'How the Eye Works', E'In a normal eye, the light rays come to a sharp focusing point on the retina. The retina functions much like the film in a camera. It is responsible for capturing all of the light rays, processing them into light impulses through millions of tiny nerve endings, then sending these light impulses through over a million nerve fibers to the optic nerve.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('50e6f761-1653-5d03-9780-3c0770e3419a'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DRAG_AND_DROP', E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DRAG_AND_DROP', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '50e6f761-1653-5d03-9780-3c0770e3419a'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Parent Characteristics', E'Parents'' developmental histories, or their experiences as children, also affect their parenting {{1}} . Parents may learn parenting practices from their own parents. Fathers whose own parents provided monitoring, {{2}} and age-appropriate discipline, and warmth were more likely to provide this constructive parenting to their own children. However, parents who are {{3}} with their own parents'' approach may be more likely to change their parenting methods with their own children.', NULL, NULL, NULL, E'1.strategies, 2.consistent, 3.dissatisfied', NULL, NULL),
  ('50e82956-f811-53eb-9653-d0145258b29e'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'REPEAT_SENTENCE', E'REPEAT_SENTENCE', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '50e82956-f811-53eb-9653-d0145258b29e'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'RS', NULL, '15c01161-5351-5ca1-83a3-581b32517bbc'::uuid, NULL, E'The sea rose, changing the land and moving the coastline in.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('50eef608-e347-5a2a-82fa-2c56cc2e923a'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'REPEAT_SENTENCE', E'REPEAT_SENTENCE', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '50eef608-e347-5a2a-82fa-2c56cc2e923a'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'RS', NULL, 'a4c1ad75-7920-5039-9660-9dc74600c371'::uuid, NULL, E'Exam results will be available next week from the course office.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('50f0bdb3-9bc0-5e50-8ece-41b39cd5e487'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'SUMMARIZE_WRITTEN_TEXT', E'SUMMARIZE_WRITTEN_TEXT', E'WRITING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '50f0bdb3-9bc0-5e50-8ece-41b39cd5e487'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'American Employees', E'A company in the USA is paying its employees to sleep more. Staff at the insurance company Aetna will get $300 a year added to their salary if they get at least seven hours of sleep a night. That works out to just over an extra dollar for each night the employee sleeps over seven hours. The idea behind this scheme is employee performance. Human resources officials say employees will work better if they have slept well. They add that a workforce that is more awake and alert will mean the company will perform better. Staff can either record their sleep automatically using a wrist monitor that connects to Aetna''s computers, or manually record how long they have slept every night.\nThere are a number of studies that warn that not sleeping enough can affect our ability to do our job. The American Academy of Sleep Medicine said that the average worker in the USA loses 11.3 working days of productivity a year because of not getting enough sleep. This costs companies about $2,280 for one worker. It estimates that the US economy loses $63.2 billion a year because workers do not sleep more than seven hours a night. A 2015 study in Europe by the Rand Corporation found that staff who slept less than seven hours per night were far less productive than workers who had eight or more hours of sleep. The staff at Aetna also receive extra cash if they do exercise.', NULL, NULL, E'American employees are paid $300 a year to sleep more than seven hours per night and they can record their sleep manually or through an automatic wrist monitor, as sleeping affects daytime performance by influencing employees’ alertness, which diminishes productivity and leads to financial loss accumulated to $63.2 billion a year, and similar policies are adopted to encourage people taking exercise.', NULL, 5, 75),
