  ('5107955a-7108-5eb2-b151-572cbed66192'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DRAG_AND_DROP', E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DRAG_AND_DROP', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '5107955a-7108-5eb2-b151-572cbed66192'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Transport Problem', E'Despite transport problems being a topic of frequent dinner table conversation, comprehensive {{1}} of policy directions for transport has been the subject of remarkably little academic analysis. This chapter introduces the scope of the book, which is intended to help redress this {{2}} . The primary focus is on {{3}} transport policy, with the emphasis being on policy analysis rather than analysis of the policy process. Importantly, the chapter sets out some key propositions that have been important in shaping the authors'' approach to the particular matters that are considered in subsequent chapters.', NULL, NULL, NULL, E'1.assessment, 2.shortcoming, 3.urban', NULL, NULL),
  ('510c7346-fcba-500a-ad14-b76dedad8d3e'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DRAG_AND_DROP', E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DRAG_AND_DROP', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '510c7346-fcba-500a-ad14-b76dedad8d3e'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Machine Learning', E'One of the foundational mechanisms for the burgeoning field of artificial intelligence is machine learning, which {{1}} AI systems to refine their algorithms based on {{2}} data. Although the concept of an artificial "neural network" {{3}} back decades, recent advances in computational power and data availability have propelled AI development forward at an {{4}} pace. Consequently, artificial intelligence {{5}} much of its current success and advancement to machine learning.', NULL, NULL, NULL, E'1.empowers, 2.accumulated, 3.dates, 4.unprecedented, 5.owes', NULL, NULL),
  ('510d3572-a5b3-56d7-8bc4-cc20499b83a3'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DROPDOWN', E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DROPDOWN', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '510d3572-a5b3-56d7-8bc4-cc20499b83a3'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Democracy', E'Democracy is a system of government in which laws, policies, leadership, and major {{1}} of a state or other polity are directly or indirectly decided by the ''people'', a group historically constituted by only a minority of the population (e.g., all free adult males in ancient Athens or all sufficiently propertied adult males in 19th-century Britain) but generally understood {{2}} the mid-20th century to include all (or nearly all) adult citizens. By and large, states with democratic governments prevent rule by autocrats, {{3}} fundamental individual rights, allow {{4}} a relatively high level of political equality, and rarely make war on each other. As compared with nondemocratic states, they also better foster human development as {{5}} by indicators such as health and education, provide more prosperity for their citizens, and ensure a {{6}} range of personal freedoms.', NULL, NULL, NULL, E'1.undertakings, 2.since, 3.guarantee, 4.for, 5.measured, 6.broader', NULL, NULL),
  ('510edcf6-a0b7-54a5-9dee-de51d3ee9c68'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'READ_ALOUD', E'READ_ALOUD', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '510edcf6-a0b7-54a5-9dee-de51d3ee9c68'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Good Stress', E'It is important to note that even "good" stress can lead to spikes in blood sugar levels. Mental and physical stress, such as worrying about your job or getting sick, can create negative stress. But even positive or exciting events, like riding on a roller coaster or winning an award, can create stress on your mind and body.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('5111b731-c24b-5fb2-8ba6-61ae1b93b4da'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'RE_TELL_LECTURE', E'RE_TELL_LECTURE', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '5111b731-c24b-5fb2-8ba6-61ae1b93b4da'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Latin', NULL, '4850969b-f7d4-5498-ae06-d37d7f581bb7'::uuid, NULL, E'So the idea I’d like to propose today is this: one of the most effective ways of building strong fundamentals in students and preparing them for the future, ironically enough is by looking to the past through the teaching of Latin. Latin will help students think more logically, communicate more effectively and have a more comprehensive understanding of the world around them, no matter how technologically advanced that world may become. To begin with, let’s address a common misconception that Latin is a dead language spoken by ancient European 2000 years ago, holding no relevance whatsoever for people living in the 21st century. There’s even an old poem that expresses the point of view. Latin is a language, as dead as dead can be. First it killed the Romans and now it’s killing me. Now students may feel this way sometimes but the ... this simply is not true, the reality is that Latin never died, and never came to a crashing end with a death of a single tragic figure. It’s simply evolved gradually over time and developed into the other languages. Moreover classic Latin is still very much alive and well in government, art, religion, literature, medicine, law and science. It’s not a dead language. It’s an eternal language.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('5117e033-f253-5558-a2e7-7d6ceaeda815'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'RE_ORDER_PARAGRAPHS', E'RE_ORDER_PARAGRAPHS', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '5117e033-f253-5558-a2e7-7d6ceaeda815'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Earthquake Instrument', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, E'5, 1, 2, 4, 3', NULL, NULL),
  ('511bccb7-afce-544b-9a5b-2dd00a231159'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'SUMMARIZE_WRITTEN_TEXT', E'SUMMARIZE_WRITTEN_TEXT', E'WRITING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '511bccb7-afce-544b-9a5b-2dd00a231159'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Electric Cars', E'Although we tend to think of electric cars as being something completely modern, they were in fact some of the earliest types of motorized vehicle.\nAt the beginning of the twentieth century electric cars were actually more popular than cars with an internal combustion engine as they were more comfortable to ride in. However, as cars fueled by petrol increased in importance, electric cars declined. The situation became such that electric vehicles were only used for certain specific purposes — as fork-lift trucks, ambulances and urban delivery vehicles, for example.\nAlthough electricity declined in use in road vehicles, it steadily grew in importance as a means of powering trains. Switzerland, for example, was quick to develop an electrified train system, encouraged in this no doubt by the fact that it had no coal or oil resources of its own.\nNowadays there is renewed interest in electricity as a means of powering road vehicles. Why is this the case? Well, undoubtedly economic reasons are of considerable importance. The cost of oil has risen so sharply that there is a strong financial imperative to look for an alternative. However, there are also environmental motivations. Emissions from cars are blamed in large part for - among other things – the destruction of the ozone layer and the resultant rise in temperatures in the polar regions. A desire not to let things get any worse is also encouraging research into designing effective electric transport.', NULL, NULL, E'Electric cars were in fact some of the earliest types of motorized vehicle, but as cars fueled by petrol increased in importance, electric cars declined, and electricity steadily grew in importance as a means of powering trains, so nowadays there is renewed interest in electricity as a means of powering road vehicles, because of economic reasons and environmental motivations.', NULL, 5, 75),
  ('5126d57d-5cdc-51e8-baa4-aaff31fa232a'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'RE_ORDER_PARAGRAPHS', E'RE_ORDER_PARAGRAPHS', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '5126d57d-5cdc-51e8-baa4-aaff31fa232a'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Future of Books', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, E'4, 1, 3, 2', NULL, NULL),
