  ('518057eb-3ad5-5829-92c1-414776e63677'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'READ_ALOUD', E'READ_ALOUD', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '518057eb-3ad5-5829-92c1-414776e63677'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Carbon Footprint', E'The blame for over-consumption should not and cannot be placed solely on individuals. Companies and corporations have a vested interest in making you buy more stuff because if they don’t, they go bankrupt. This is why they slap green labels onto their products and advertise everywhere. Indeed, the whole idea of a personal carbon footprint is a propaganda campaign created by a fossil fuel giant.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('51809ff4-88ae-562f-bea4-acadacbfecd6'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'LISTENING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '51809ff4-88ae-562f-bea4-acadacbfecd6'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'WFD', NULL, '69b6fa71-9568-5c96-8ae2-131f09c1bb23'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'Working shifts can make it hard to have a good family life.', NULL, NULL),
  ('5183e1be-f426-5634-b9d0-7a066abde7f9'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DROPDOWN', E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DROPDOWN', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '5183e1be-f426-5634-b9d0-7a066abde7f9'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Milkshake', E'The company hired an outside researcher to help the company understand what they might be missing about milkshakes. This researcher spent time in a restaurant observing and {{1}} milkshake sales, as well as talking to milkshake buyers about why they had made their product choice. A couple of key insights {{2}} about milkshake buyers. First and somewhat surprising, 40 percent of milkshake sales took place early in the morning, and the buyers were commuters on their way to work. Second, the ideal milkshake for these customers was thick and {{3}} but easy to consume during a commute. Third, another key buyer audience was parents purchasing a {{4}} for children, but the ideal milkshake for them was a thinner product children can drink quickly with a straw.', NULL, NULL, NULL, E'1.documenting, 2.emerged, 3.substantial, 4.treat', NULL, NULL),
  ('5192e80e-5d66-51e4-9bd5-719f4bd3031e'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'REPEAT_SENTENCE', E'REPEAT_SENTENCE', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '5192e80e-5d66-51e4-9bd5-719f4bd3031e'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'RS', NULL, '56ba489d-930d-50ac-971b-94724d14550d'::uuid, NULL, E'Tomorrow''s lecture has been canceled due to the power cut.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('5193d641-b2d1-57e9-8ed6-f07a52f1feca'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'READ_ALOUD', E'READ_ALOUD', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '5193d641-b2d1-57e9-8ed6-f07a52f1feca'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Stripes and Spots', E'According to Benjamin Alessio, an undergraduate researcher in the Department of Chemical and Biological Engineering, many biological inquiries share a common theme of exploring how complex patterns and shapes develop from a spherical cluster of cells. The study employs a basic physical and chemical mechanism to account for a complex biological phenomenon.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('5195a6a1-e9b7-5b3e-9e58-8c6ef4d4c4a0'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DRAG_AND_DROP', E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DRAG_AND_DROP', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '5195a6a1-e9b7-5b3e-9e58-8c6ef4d4c4a0'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Weddell Seals', E'A healthy adult Weddell seal can stay underwater for 20 minutes, and some of them even have the power to {{1}} for over 1 hour. However, after giving birth, the mother seals have to {{2}} some of their own iron stock by transferring iron from their livers to the milk they {{3}} their pups so that their offspring can become better divers. This direct transfer of iron {{4}} in reduced diving time for the mothers.', NULL, NULL, NULL, E'1.dive, 2.sacrifice, 3.feed, 4.results', NULL, NULL),
