  ('51a6e08d-839e-5cfd-9272-d96152a5be74'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'LISTENING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '51a6e08d-839e-5cfd-9272-d96152a5be74'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'WFD', NULL, 'ffcb978d-11ea-5bfa-91e5-3dfcdb7623c3'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'The eventual winners will be the graduates that adapt best.', NULL, NULL),
  ('51adabe5-f4c6-5cb3-af2f-edd658c05a0c'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'SELECT_MISSING_WORD', E'SELECT_MISSING_WORD', E'LISTENING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '51adabe5-f4c6-5cb3-af2f-edd658c05a0c'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Splitting', E'In families, workplace, community, there is people you can realize, oh yeah, they are doing that. They’re seducing this person and attacking that person. And then they divide the community by doing that. They get other people that agree with them to attack the people they’re attacking. And in mental health terms, it’s called splitting. For you split people into all good and all bad. And splitting is associated with borderline and narcissistic personality disorders. People honestly see the world in these all-good, all-bad ways. But it’s contagious. And so they tell half the people, you’re wonderful, and half people, you’re terrible. And those people start fighting each other. And while they’re fighting each other, the high-conflict person gets to dominate the community. So I’m calling this the community. It could be the family. It could be the workplace. It could be a neighborhood. We see this in all areas of life, when there’s...\n\nAt the end of the recording the lost word or group of words has been replaced by a beep. Select the correct option to complete the recording.', '6a0640f7-73fb-5e8d-8397-e61645635df7'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'a high-conflict person', NULL, NULL),
  ('51ae30f1-22f8-5b82-9ee5-3ae02f6ac2c5'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'REPEAT_SENTENCE', E'REPEAT_SENTENCE', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '51ae30f1-22f8-5b82-9ee5-3ae02f6ac2c5'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'RS', NULL, 'c01f6bcf-0f32-5f33-b324-e775608e7ecb'::uuid, NULL, E'Global warming is a threat to economic growth.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('51b2e80e-f540-5e21-ace1-0fa2420a481a'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'READ_ALOUD', E'READ_ALOUD', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '51b2e80e-f540-5e21-ace1-0fa2420a481a'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Children''s Motor Skills', E'Residential density is related to children''s motor skills, engagement in outdoor play and organized sports. Finnish children living in the countryside spent more time outdoors and had better motor skills than their age peers in the metropolitan area. On the other hand, children living in the metropolitan area participated the most in organized sports.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
