  ('55645460-6018-5a95-aff8-77137102da89'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'RESPOND_TO_A_SITUATION', E'RESPOND_TO_A_SITUATION', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '55645460-6018-5a95-aff8-77137102da89'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Deadline Extension', E'During a team meeting on Tuesday, your supervisor asks if you can complete and submit a comprehensive project update for a client by Friday. However, you''re waiting on essential feedback from a key team member who''s out of the office until Thursday. What would you say to your supervisor?', '2cbec77b-6a18-5b16-a4cf-0804c0ad6018'::uuid, NULL, E'Actually, I might need a bit more time to get that project update ready for the client. The thing is, I''m waiting on some important feedback from one of our team members who''s out until Thursday. It''s really cutting it close for me to compile everything and make sure it''s all good by Friday. I was hoping we could maybe push the deadline to Monday? This way, I can make sure everything''s on point. Really appreciate your understanding on this!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
