  ('5791d5d9-c1ea-580e-a596-f86ec5effe20'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DROPDOWN', E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DROPDOWN', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '5791d5d9-c1ea-580e-a596-f86ec5effe20'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Cannabis Edibles', E'In just five years, the number of small children in the US {{1}} to cannabis after accidentally eating cannabis edibles rose 1,375%, a new study says. A 2022 study showed that people in US states that {{2}} recreational cannabis use it 20% more frequently than in states that didn''t legalize it. Research has found that the packaging of some edible products, especially those available on the black market, looks nearly {{3}} to the real thing. Some packages also have child-friendly cartoon characters. Even if the packaging warns that the product contains cannabis or THC, it''s often in small print, and many young children can’t read in the first place. A child''s exposure to cannabis can have serious {{4}} . They can become very sick and have problems walking, sitting or breathing, according to the US Centers for Disease Control and Prevention.', NULL, NULL, NULL, E'1.exposed, 2.legalized, 3.identical, 4.consequences', NULL, NULL),
  ('57954666-3170-5598-8054-0dca53a077d3'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'MC_READING_SINGLE', E'MC_READING_SINGLE', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '57954666-3170-5598-8054-0dca53a077d3'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'MCS-R', E'Biologists have long maintained that two groups of pinnipeds, sea lions and walruses, are descended from a terrestrial bearlike animal, whereas the remaining group, seals, shares an ancestor with weasels. But the recent discovery of detailed similarities in the skeletal structure of the flippers in all three groups undermines the attempt to explain away superficial resemblance as due to convergent evolution—the independent development of similarities between unrelated groups in response to similar environmental pressures. Flippers may indeed be a necessary response to aquatic life; turtles, whales, and dugongs also have them. But the common detailed design found among the pinnipeds probably indicates a common ancestor. Moreover, walruses and seals drive themselves through the water with thrusts of their hind flippers, but sea lions use their front flippers. If anatomical similarity in the flippers resulted from similar environmental pressures, as posited by the convergent evolution theory, one would expect walruses and seals, but not seals and sea lions, to have similar flippers.\n\nAccording to the passage, it has been recently discovered that', NULL, NULL, NULL, E'there are detailed skeletal similarities in the flippers of pinnipeds', NULL, NULL),
  ('5795a7c7-cf82-53a0-8b4d-8177239f6cb2'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'READ_ALOUD', E'READ_ALOUD', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '5795a7c7-cf82-53a0-8b4d-8177239f6cb2'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Sushi', E'The origins of sushi can be traced back to ancient China, where the preservation of fish was a necessity. During the second century A.D., the Chinese began fermenting fish by wrapping it in rice and allowing it to ferment over time. The rice was discarded, and the fish was consumed. Sushi made its way to Japan in the 8th century, introduced by Buddhist monks who used fermentation techniques to preserve fish.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('579a334b-ab7c-5725-947d-ce16fbd4f88b'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'READ_ALOUD', E'READ_ALOUD', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '579a334b-ab7c-5725-947d-ce16fbd4f88b'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Department Stores', E'In this course, we will explore how such things as department stores, nationally advertised brand-name goods, mass produced cars and suburbs transformed the American economy, society and politics. The course is organized both thematically and chronologically. Each period deals with a new development in the history of consumer culture.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('57a0ecfa-69d5-5f11-af8b-df9425a78266'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'RE_ORDER_PARAGRAPHS', E'RE_ORDER_PARAGRAPHS', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '57a0ecfa-69d5-5f11-af8b-df9425a78266'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Doctor-patient Relationship', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, E'1, 4, 3, 2', NULL, NULL),
  ('57a6f96b-b0af-5efc-8780-3aa72a2812cc'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DRAG_AND_DROP', E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DRAG_AND_DROP', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '57a6f96b-b0af-5efc-8780-3aa72a2812cc'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Business Ethics', E'Ethics is {{1}} as principles of conduct or moral behavior. Business ethics is ethics as it relates to the conduct or behavior of the members of a business organization. The need for ethics in business is {{2}} .First, it {{3}} the external constituents of an organization (i.e., the public, other organizations, and the environment) from being harmed. Second, it benefits the organization internally by helping to {{4}} its success.', NULL, NULL, NULL, E'1.defined, 2.twofold, 3.prevents, 4.ensure', NULL, NULL),
  ('57a82483-a7a6-55c7-a9e0-9e3f6d861e84'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'REPEAT_SENTENCE', E'REPEAT_SENTENCE', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '57a82483-a7a6-55c7-a9e0-9e3f6d861e84'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'RS', NULL, 'c994e28a-2f4b-58e3-8e6f-a67bf2f52b7d'::uuid, NULL, E'Each child was asked to participate in extracurricular activities at school.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('57b41cdb-8bfd-5ecc-bd42-b8033f03800d'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'LISTENING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '57b41cdb-8bfd-5ecc-bd42-b8033f03800d'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'WFD', NULL, '00c4f920-1a02-5d4a-9ec6-9fbea906ff5d'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'The subject is complex and difficult to explain.', NULL, NULL),
  ('57b96d81-4cdd-59c3-851a-8eb87158bf6e'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'READ_ALOUD', E'READ_ALOUD', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '57b96d81-4cdd-59c3-851a-8eb87158bf6e'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Black Death', E'The Second Plague Pandemic of the mid-14th century, also known as the Black Death, killed 30-60 percent of the European population and profoundly changed the course of European history. New research suggests that this plague, potentially through resulting changes in diet and hygiene, may also be associated with a shift in the composition of the human oral microbiome toward one that contributes to chronic diseases in modern-day humans.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('57bd5443-2958-5b76-9cc8-93d5f1185316'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'LISTENING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '57bd5443-2958-5b76-9cc8-93d5f1185316'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'WFD', NULL, '5c64aab2-435c-524b-a3be-6b8023fb53e2'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'The effect of advertising is open to much debate.', NULL, NULL),
  ('57bf9c5e-9702-518a-84c5-80e5553a6b7b'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'SUMMARIZE_WRITTEN_TEXT', E'SUMMARIZE_WRITTEN_TEXT', E'WRITING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '57bf9c5e-9702-518a-84c5-80e5553a6b7b'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Origin of Species', E'In 1837, at the age of 28, Darwin wrote "Species Change" in one of his notebooks, which was the earliest record of his evolutionary ideas. Prior to this, he had sailed around the world for 5 years on the HMS Beagle, observing numerous signs that species were not fixed in South America, Oceania, and other places. After returning to England, he wrote "Cuidado" (meaning "be careful" in Spanish) in another notebook, realizing that the theory of evolution was a radical and dangerous view, and that there was insufficient evidence to make it public at that time.\nOver the next 20 years, Darwin continuously accumulated a vast amount of data and first presented his views to a small circle of scientists. It was not until 1859, when "On the Origin of Species" was published, that his ideas became accessible to the general readership, causing a great sensation. The first edition of 1,250 copies sold out on the day of publication, and the circulation reached 4,250 copies within a year, receiving both praise from the scientific community and fierce criticism from the religious community and conservative forces.\nTo this day, "On the Origin of Species" remains one of the most important works in human history, and one of the few works that still has scientific value more than 150 years after its publication. Darwin was well aware that his work was only the beginning. He wrote in the book: "In the distant future, I see open fields for far more important research."', NULL, NULL, E'In 1837, Darwin wrote "Species Change", which was the earliest record of his evolutionary ideas, but he then realized that the theory of evolution was a radical and dangerous view, and in 1859 his ideas became accessible to the general readership, receiving both praise from the scientific community and fierce criticism from the religious community and conservative forces, so "On the Origin of Species" remains one of the most important works in human history.', NULL, 5, 75),
  ('57c1aa3f-b890-5758-8e80-374c7189bc16'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'WRITE_ESSAY', E'WRITE_ESSAY', E'WRITING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '57c1aa3f-b890-5758-8e80-374c7189bc16'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Household Task', E'Children should be required to help with household tasks as soon as they are able to do so. What is your opinion?', NULL, NULL, E'In today''s fast-paced society, many parents struggle to balance work and family responsibilities. One way to alleviate this burden and teach valuable life skills is to require children to help with household tasks as soon as they are able to do so. I firmly believe that involving children in household chores is beneficial for their development and well-being. In this essay, I will discuss the benefits of children helping with household tasks.\nFirstly, involving children in household tasks teaches them important life skills. By participating in chores such as cooking, cleaning, and laundry, children learn valuable skills that will benefit them in adulthood. For example, they learn how to manage their time effectively, organize their belongings, and work collaboratively with others. These skills are essential for success in both personal and professional life.\nSecondly, involving children in household tasks instills a sense of responsibility and accomplishment. When children complete tasks such as making their bed or washing dishes, they feel a sense of pride and ownership. This feeling of accomplishment boosts their self-esteem and confidence, which can positively impact other areas of their lives. Additionally, when children feel responsible for contributing to the household, they develop a sense of belonging and connection to their family.\nIn conclusion, requiring children to help with household tasks is a positive practice that benefits both parents and children. By participating in chores, children learn valuable life skills, develop a sense of responsibility and accomplishment, and feel connected to their family. Parents should encourage their children to contribute to the household from a young age, as it will set them up for success in the future.', NULL, 200, 300),
  ('57c2768c-fb11-5a54-9b50-bca336d5c5cf'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DROPDOWN', E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DROPDOWN', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '57c2768c-fb11-5a54-9b50-bca336d5c5cf'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Pandemic', E'The COVID-19 pandemic has fundamentally altered the concept of work, accelerating trends like remote working and digital collaboration. Companies across various {{1}} have had to adapt to this new normal, with many employees working from home. This shift has benefits, including increased flexibility and reduced commuting time, but also challenges such as {{2}} the lines between work and personal life and the potential for increased isolation. The long-term impact of these changes on corporate culture and employee well-being is yet {{3}} fully understood. Furthermore, the pandemic has highlighted the digital divide, with access to reliable internet and technology becoming a {{4}} for many jobs. As the world slowly recovers, it''s likely that some of these changes will persist, leading to a more hybrid model of work {{5}} both remote and in-office elements.', NULL, NULL, NULL, E'1.sectors, 2.blurring, 3.to be, 4.prerequisite, 5.combining', NULL, NULL),
  ('57d7ff74-25e8-59ce-a56b-038563788317'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'REPEAT_SENTENCE', E'REPEAT_SENTENCE', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '57d7ff74-25e8-59ce-a56b-038563788317'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'RS', NULL, 'd59fbf87-140a-5689-a351-4792c54d1fb5'::uuid, NULL, E'There is not enough space for me in the car.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
