  ('584fcf3f-76e9-5d65-be1d-f7fe53c1d709'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'ANSWER_SHORT_QUESTION', E'ANSWER_SHORT_QUESTION', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '584fcf3f-76e9-5d65-be1d-f7fe53c1d709'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'ASQ', E'What does the sun do during dusk?', '1d2e7240-3725-5cfd-813e-e44a6e4dc8ca'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'Sunsets / Sunset', NULL, NULL),
  ('585549ac-d776-514f-b954-50e66b2df8ee'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'READ_ALOUD', E'READ_ALOUD', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '585549ac-d776-514f-b954-50e66b2df8ee'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Banking and Bank', E'In 1994, Microsoft''s founder, Bill Gates, said that although banking is necessary, banks are really not! At a time when many traditional institutions and ways of doing things are changing, banking is changing too. There are now new ways of accessing loans and lending money. Thanks to the rise of alternative finance, people can raise and invest money outside the traditional banking system.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('58554c5c-2267-519a-bc78-14e5e7170382'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'ANSWER_SHORT_QUESTION', E'ANSWER_SHORT_QUESTION', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '58554c5c-2267-519a-bc78-14e5e7170382'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'ASQ', E'Which ocean is located at the Earth''s southernmost point?', 'b3f1a2e5-7d96-5c9f-affd-27de74e0a74e'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'Southern Ocean', NULL, NULL),
  ('585a64d5-736a-5553-9b6e-64daa24e9bac'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'RE_TELL_LECTURE', E'RE_TELL_LECTURE', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '585a64d5-736a-5553-9b6e-64daa24e9bac'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Hans Krebs', NULL, '08b21410-e2b2-51a1-bc06-eac0c6969967'::uuid, NULL, E'This is Hans Krebs, who in 1937 published a paper showing the sequence of chemical reactions, by which energy is released in individual cells. It is called the Krebs cycle, which some of you may remember from your chemistry course in your high school. Krebs is a wonderful example to me of how a scientist who is determined can overcome all kinds of human obstacles. Krebs’ father constantly discouraged him and told him that he had just mediocre intelligence whenever to anything important in his life, as a teenager. What Krebs remembers in his memoir, his father said to him "you can''t make a silk purse out of a sow''s ear". And later on, when Krebs studied with the great biochemist Otto Warburg, Warburg also told him the same thing. Not the same quote but that he had only mediocre ability and would never be a great scientist. And we all hear about how important it is for parents to encourage their children, but sometimes the children will go on to do great things no matter what we say to them.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('585d2e00-7b2c-5ecc-b226-64012a6fcaf6'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'READ_ALOUD', E'READ_ALOUD', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '585d2e00-7b2c-5ecc-b226-64012a6fcaf6'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Moderate Drinking', E'Now a growing body of research says any alcohol raises the chance of premature death from a variety of causes. About half of cases of liver disease are attributed to drinking. Alcohol is also a potent carcinogen. It can cause cancer because it breaks down in the body to form a compound called acetaldehyde, which damages DNA. That damage can lead to at least seven types of cancer.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('585f4e7b-0f56-5332-9489-e94b97ee55d6'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DRAG_AND_DROP', E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DRAG_AND_DROP', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '585f4e7b-0f56-5332-9489-e94b97ee55d6'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Accounting', E'While accounting focuses on the day-to-day management of financial {{1}} and records across the business world, finance uses this same information to project future growth and to {{2}} expenditure in order to strategize company finances. So finance degree students will likely be more interested in financial {{3}} and control, while accounting degree students will be more focused on professional {{4}} and processes, used in order to manage numbers rather than {{5}} them.', NULL, NULL, NULL, E'1.reports, 2.analyze, 3.strategy, 4.principles, 5.influence', NULL, NULL),
