  ('590d4cf2-1820-52cf-b5cd-0773ade6399f'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'READ_ALOUD', E'READ_ALOUD', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '590d4cf2-1820-52cf-b5cd-0773ade6399f'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Hottest Month', E'The Earth just had the hottest month in recorded history, and it’s even worse than normal. The record comes in a run of unprecedentedly hot months. Not only does it break through the all-time record set a year before, it also continues a now 10-month long streak of months that are the hottest ever according to NASA data. The National Oceanic and Atmospheric Administration calculates temperatures slightly different.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('5910a0e6-9f55-5e52-bf5e-9210cb6a086e'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'RE_ORDER_PARAGRAPHS', E'RE_ORDER_PARAGRAPHS', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '5910a0e6-9f55-5e52-bf5e-9210cb6a086e'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Mutations', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, E'2, 3, 4, 1', NULL, NULL),
  ('591577e3-1f91-598c-85c4-c58a22e49dfd'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'RESPOND_TO_A_SITUATION', E'RESPOND_TO_A_SITUATION', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '591577e3-1f91-598c-85c4-c58a22e49dfd'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'New Classroom', E'The computer in the classroom broke down, so the professor moved the class to another room. However, you don''t know how to get to the new classroom and you are already late. How should you call your classmate and ask for help?', '9cdb62ca-7ac9-5661-aee3-602c06e4cfe9'::uuid, NULL, E'Hey mate, I want to talk to you about something.\nWe seem to have a little issue with the classroom.\nIt''s like the computer in the classroom broke down, the professor moved the class to another room. I don''t know how to get to the new classroom and I am already late, can you tell me the way?\nAnd I''d like to know what you think.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('5915ea52-380d-57cb-abcd-fb9d4a5826a6'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'LISTENING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '5915ea52-380d-57cb-abcd-fb9d4a5826a6'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'WFD', NULL, '4ef13abb-0043-5e89-aa54-169250878a5d'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'We have been seeking to protect the quality of teaching and learning.', NULL, NULL),
  ('591c3c20-3cc8-5d20-89f2-95f78247da30'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DROPDOWN', E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DROPDOWN', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '591c3c20-3cc8-5d20-89f2-95f78247da30'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'World Cup in Qatar', E'Qatar, a tiny country smaller than Connecticut, has been at the center of world attention over the last few weeks because of the World Cup. But its hosting of the World Cup has also shone a {{1}} on its human rights record. According to government estimates, over 30,000 foreign laborers, mostly men from south Asian countries like India, Pakistan, Nepal and Bangladesh, were brought in to build stadiums. The Gulf state also {{2}} its airport and constructed new hotels, rail and highways. “However good the football has often been, the {{3}} has come at a heavy cost for hundreds of thousands of workers who have paid illegal recruitment fees, had wages stolen or even lost their lives,” Amnesty International’s head of economic and social justice Steve Cockburn said. FIFA president Gianni Infantino on Friday {{4}} organizers and volunteers for staging the “best World Cup ever” -- but critics have said his comment ignored the sacrifices of migrant workers, often subjected to harsh and squalid living and working conditions.', NULL, NULL, NULL, E'1.spotlight, 2.expanded, 3.tournament, 4.praised', NULL, NULL),
