  ('5d92355c-2586-5796-aea3-24b201ca4417'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DRAG_AND_DROP', E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DRAG_AND_DROP', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '5d92355c-2586-5796-aea3-24b201ca4417'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Marion Dorset', E'Marion Dorset (1872-1935) was an influential American biochemist. He began working as a {{1}} for the U.S. Department of Agriculture in 1894, and worked his way up to become chief of the biochemical {{2}} in 1904. He made important discoveries in bacterial toxins and animal diseases, and he conducted pioneering work in the {{3}} of meat products. He co-discovered the virus that causes hog cholera and subsequently developed a {{4}} to prevent it.', NULL, NULL, NULL, E'1.researcher, 2.division, 3.inspection, 4.serum', NULL, NULL),
  ('5d975e93-5318-5fe6-b34d-d07de5750884'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'LISTENING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '5d975e93-5318-5fe6-b34d-d07de5750884'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'WFD', NULL, '2c686eac-f6a6-5c35-beda-b59ffa9d7242'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'Globalization often puts more pressure on national economic policies.', NULL, NULL),
  ('5d98d0cc-dadb-533c-b323-0938a3e4a812'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DROPDOWN', E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DROPDOWN', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '5d98d0cc-dadb-533c-b323-0938a3e4a812'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Props for Films', E'Snaps, crackles, pops and other unwanted sounds can be a bane to media producers but a boon for clever designers who create a wide {{1}} of quiet props for use in films and TV shows. Experienced production teams are great at finding workarounds and clever solutions when budget {{2}} kick in, so there are also a lot of do-it-yourself hacks for those who can’t afford higher-end options. And, of course, a lot of work goes into post-filming sound design, too. Sound is one factor {{3}} these decisions, but there is also safety to consider, hence a wide range of plastic and rubber props made to look like wood or metal (for use in fight scenes and the like). And when something needs to look real but break, there are props for that, too.', NULL, NULL, NULL, E'1.range, 2.constraints, 3.driving', NULL, NULL),
  ('5d9d5101-fd0c-5a7e-8772-51883bb9ccf9'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DROPDOWN', E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DROPDOWN', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '5d9d5101-fd0c-5a7e-8772-51883bb9ccf9'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Fire', E'In the early chapters of human history, nestled under giant trees and beneath the vast sky, humans {{1}} on the edge of a major change. The discovery of fire was like a spark that set off a huge shift in how early humans lived, thought, and evolved. This {{2}} over a wild element of nature marked a new chapter, lighting up the dark corners of existence and bringing warmth to the chilly, uncertain world our ancestors walked through. Before fire came into the picture, nightfall meant danger and {{3}} . It was when predators with sharp eyes roamed, and fear filled human hearts. Life was ruled by daylight, and the disappearance of the sun meant hiding away in whatever {{4}} was available. But learning to create and control fire changed all that. Campfires turned into safe spots and gathering places, where stories took shape, traditions were born, and the first communities were formed.', NULL, NULL, NULL, E'1.stood, 2.control, 3.fear, 4.shelter', NULL, NULL),
  ('5d9e0ff3-0de9-5fa3-a9e8-b5b455faa93b'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'REPEAT_SENTENCE', E'REPEAT_SENTENCE', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '5d9e0ff3-0de9-5fa3-a9e8-b5b455faa93b'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'RS', NULL, 'e362971f-e3ce-5ff8-902c-684a4ff55305'::uuid, NULL, E'Good research provides many benefits to people.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
