  ('5fdfc1e0-6713-5a8b-b3ee-a74a826cee2e'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'LISTENING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '5fdfc1e0-6713-5a8b-b3ee-a74a826cee2e'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'WFD', NULL, 'c629dbb3-4559-57a2-a9a6-1c4332da435c'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'The course has been updated to reflect the current situation.', NULL, NULL),
  ('5fe16709-45a4-582e-8439-075b289bea2c'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'SELECT_MISSING_WORD', E'SELECT_MISSING_WORD', E'LISTENING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '5fe16709-45a4-582e-8439-075b289bea2c'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Pain Management', E'There have been several influential studies in pain management, some of the most interesting of these study, endorphins, the body''s own natural painkillers, for example. We now know that exercise stimulates the production of endorphins. Lack of exercise, on the other hand, not only shuts down endorphin production, but can also lead to muscle deterioration. This is why you see a lot of pain specialist prescribing exercise for patients with chronic pain. Another interesting area involves the power of the placebo effect. We''ve known for some time that a sugar pill or other inactive placebo can sometimes make a sick person feel better. Somehow the power of suggestion or faith in the doctor for the drug will start a process of healing. We now think a neural chemical component, what may actually happen is the placebo effect allow some people to sort of tap into the supply of endorphins.\n\nAt the end of the recording the lost word or group of words has been replaced by a beep. Select the correct option to complete the recording.', 'a42b3961-1909-5f05-8a16-c427b0eb794b'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'in their own brains', NULL, NULL),
  ('5fe20009-8d0d-5514-baa3-3aa65ba26a98'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'READ_ALOUD', E'READ_ALOUD', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '5fe20009-8d0d-5514-baa3-3aa65ba26a98'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Team Working Ability', E'The ability to work in a team is one that is prized by employers and educationalists. It is often requested in job advertisements and displayed on CVs. When employers list their most important skills for promotion, 86% of people list team working skills. These days, the willingness and ability to work with a group of people towards a single target has become increasingly important.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
