  ('60f4d82d-9d2c-5519-8c51-9715f69bf807'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DRAG_AND_DROP', E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DRAG_AND_DROP', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '60f4d82d-9d2c-5519-8c51-9715f69bf807'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'The Press', E'Throughout its history, one of the strengths of the Press has been the diversity of the Press''s list. The Press has also distinguished itself with its strong list in social work, publishing texts that have been {{1}} adopted in courses and are used by professionals in the field. Through its European Perspectives {{2}} and the publication of the Wellek Library Lectures, the Press has published a range of innovative and {{3}} scholars. Other notable lecture series published by Columbia University Press include The Leonard Hastings Schoff Memorial Lectures and The Bampton Lectures in America.', NULL, NULL, NULL, E'1.widely, 2.series, 3.leading', NULL, NULL),
  ('60f5b779-b874-556b-8f33-ee7847814207'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DRAG_AND_DROP', E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DRAG_AND_DROP', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '60f5b779-b874-556b-8f33-ee7847814207'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Complementary Foods', E'Around the age of 6 months, an infant''s need for energy and nutrients starts to {{1}} what is provided by breast milk, and complementary foods are necessary to {{2}} those needs. An infant of this age is also developmentally ready for other foods. This transition is {{3}} to as complementary feeding. If complementary foods are not introduced around the age of 6 months, or if they are given inappropriately, an infant’s growth may {{4}} .', NULL, NULL, NULL, E'1.exceed, 2.meet, 3.referred, 4.falter', NULL, NULL),
  ('60f7a458-0f07-5242-b16b-700cb77b8ce9'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'LISTENING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '60f7a458-0f07-5242-b16b-700cb77b8ce9'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'WFD', NULL, '95cb11b4-6ae9-56c8-9446-d38ab81c2035'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'Over a long period of time, a new team was built.', NULL, NULL),
  ('60f83ad4-0c8b-5a09-ac75-d8517ad7ed62'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'LISTENING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '60f83ad4-0c8b-5a09-ac75-d8517ad7ed62'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'WFD', NULL, '21472947-e2d8-50fb-9bc2-52d84546178a'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'All of our centers would provide information on technology and training.', NULL, NULL),
  ('6104ba87-04f5-5a3a-ac05-7ec0e99f410d'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'READ_ALOUD', E'READ_ALOUD', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '6104ba87-04f5-5a3a-ac05-7ec0e99f410d'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Environmental Justice', E'Environmental justice seeks to address inequities in environmental protection by ensuring that all communities have access to clean air, water, and land regardless of race or socioeconomic status. It requires collaboration between environmental advocates, policymakers, and affected communities. Environmental justice also recognizes that certain communities are disproportionately affected by environmental hazards like pollution and climate change, and seeks to redress these imbalances through targeted policies and interventions.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('610959e3-f08b-50c1-a8ec-a8958e95cb29'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'SUMMARIZE_WRITTEN_TEXT', E'SUMMARIZE_WRITTEN_TEXT', E'WRITING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '610959e3-f08b-50c1-a8ec-a8958e95cb29'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Hydrogen-powered Flight', E'Last month, Airbus announced plans to overhaul an A380 airliner by adding an additional hydrogen-combustion engine to the outside of the plane and installing monitoring equipment. With the changes, the company will be able to test hydrogen-powered flight in real-world conditions. The move is part of a broader industry goal to reach net-zero carbon emissions by 2050. Passenger air travel is a growing contributor to climate change, making up about three percent of carbon emissions worldwide in 2021. While flying less and investing in more efficient planes can help reduce emissions, new technologies will likely be needed to reach net zero.\nOther solutions, like battery-powered air taxis and sustainable aviation fuels, may help cut emissions, but hydrogen in particular might be one of the major paths forward to net zero because it could be used widely in the industry, from shorter regional hops to longer flights with larger planes.\nUnderstanding emissions from hydrogen combustion in real-air conditions is one of the major goals of this testing program, Simpson says. While burning liquid hydrogen doesn’t produce CO2, the most abundant greenhouse gas, researchers are still eager to learn more about emissions from hydrogen-powered flight. Hydrogen engines will still produce some nitro-oxides, which are common pollutants, as well as water vapor, which acts as a greenhouse gas in the atmosphere.\nThe test engine will also allow Airbus to learn more about how to run hydrogen combustion in flight. Researchers can change the operating conditions of the engine, like the fuel-to-air ratio it burns and the temperature it runs at, to learn more about how to most efficiently power a hydrogen-powered plane.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 5, 75),
  ('610ba8cb-1d4b-5ffb-8826-98eeaece5677'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'REPEAT_SENTENCE', E'REPEAT_SENTENCE', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '610ba8cb-1d4b-5ffb-8826-98eeaece5677'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'RS', NULL, 'f6ff1220-be73-50f5-8def-927ce085f396'::uuid, NULL, E'The social security system has been accused of producing a culture of dependency.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('610e3c09-e1ce-5780-bc93-4c109992c23d'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'ANSWER_SHORT_QUESTION', E'ANSWER_SHORT_QUESTION', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '610e3c09-e1ce-5780-bc93-4c109992c23d'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'ASQ', E'What do we call the physical and chemical processes that occur within a living organism in order to maintain life?', '95f07ee9-1acd-5d88-829d-4c4721a46e95'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'Metabolism', NULL, NULL),
  ('6114a1e9-5d7b-5263-a002-72b6d0664a4d'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'ANSWER_SHORT_QUESTION', E'ANSWER_SHORT_QUESTION', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '6114a1e9-5d7b-5263-a002-72b6d0664a4d'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'ASQ', E'What is the process where the color becomes lighter and lighter when exposed to sunlight for a long time?', '2263812b-5830-50b6-b407-5bcb932fc72b'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'Fade', NULL, NULL),
  ('611ce259-bc93-5899-b6e8-d29b87f9bde5'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'RE_TELL_LECTURE', E'RE_TELL_LECTURE', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '611ce259-bc93-5899-b6e8-d29b87f9bde5'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Spotify', NULL, '409bdf88-b6a1-5e07-a1e2-101a6ae33279'::uuid, NULL, E'When Daniel was 13 around 1994, he had recognized the potential of creating websites for the fledgling internet. So he started a small home business, making websites for clients. He charged his first client a hundred dollars, but then charged the next client two hundred dollars. The price was still below the industry average. So as demand for internet websites began to explode, soon Daniel could charge five thousand dollars per website. To help expand the business, Daniel recruited students from his computing class. He successfully bribed them with the promise of video games. His earnings would eventually reach 50,000 dollars per month. And by age 18, he was managing a team of 25. His parents only noticed his earnings when he started bringing home those large TVs. As time progressed, the internet began to see the growth of downloading music illegally. Since then, the world has changed for the Goliaths of the record industry, Sony, Universal and others. The record companies say they will lose billions in sales because fans are getting their music for free. And they want banning stopped. Observing the trend, Daniel realized something. Later in an interview, he states his realization. Quote: You can never legislate away piracy. Laws can definitely help, but it doesn’t take away the problem. The only way to solve the problem was to create a service that’s better than piracy and at the same time compensates the music industry. This idea was the basis for Spotify.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('61220ec4-f2ac-5654-81e1-4e621ea08dee'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DRAG_AND_DROP', E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DRAG_AND_DROP', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '61220ec4-f2ac-5654-81e1-4e621ea08dee'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Mirror', E'To look back in time at the cosmos’ infancy and {{1}} the first stars flicker on, you must first grind a mirror as big as a house. Its surface must be so {{2}} that it can collect and focus the {{3}} light coming from the farthest galaxies in the sky.', NULL, NULL, NULL, E'1.witness, 2.smooth, 3.faint', NULL, NULL),
  ('6122d6f1-79aa-5f92-ad00-75121431cb2f'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'RE_ORDER_PARAGRAPHS', E'RE_ORDER_PARAGRAPHS', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '6122d6f1-79aa-5f92-ad00-75121431cb2f'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Green Architecture', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, E'2, 3, 4, 1', NULL, NULL),
