  ('64028981-a2e0-518d-8b74-e08e7ffa7126'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DRAG_AND_DROP', E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DRAG_AND_DROP', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '64028981-a2e0-518d-8b74-e08e7ffa7126'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Solar Farms', E'With over a billion panels {{1}} globally, solar energy has become the world''s harnessing power. This dominance, however, comes at a {{2}} . There are now fewer landscapes {{3}} by solar farms compared with several decades ago. Who''s ready to invest in solar stocks? Better hurry, as the market''s burgeoning {{4}} shows no signs of waning.', NULL, NULL, NULL, E'1.installed, 2.cost, 3.untouched, 4.growth', NULL, NULL),
  ('6404d7ce-ec51-5ae5-b750-fe7d74ff145a'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DROPDOWN', E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DROPDOWN', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '6404d7ce-ec51-5ae5-b750-fe7d74ff145a'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Wind Moving', E'Wind is air moving around. Some winds can move {{3}} fast as a racing car, over 100 miles an {{1}} . Winds can travel around the world. Wind can make you feel cold because you lose heat from your body {{4}} when it is windy. Weather forecasters need to {{2}} the speed and direction of the wind. The strength of wind is measured using the Beaufort scale from wind force when there is no wind, to wind force 12 which can damage houses and buildings and is called hurricane force.', NULL, NULL, NULL, E'1.as, 2.hour, 3.faster, 4.know', NULL, NULL),
  ('64059a6f-31cb-5219-af04-ba207cc505ee'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'ANSWER_SHORT_QUESTION', E'ANSWER_SHORT_QUESTION', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '64059a6f-31cb-5219-af04-ba207cc505ee'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'ASQ', E'What do we call a person whose job is cutting up and selling meat?', '222a8d56-183d-5ad5-aba9-7b07ebfb806b'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'Butcher', NULL, NULL),
  ('640c5b59-e971-5446-9200-4c6a6863d51b'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'WRITE_ESSAY', E'WRITE_ESSAY', E'WRITING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '640c5b59-e971-5446-9200-4c6a6863d51b'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Class Attendance', E'Some people believe that university students should be required to attend classes. Others believe that going to classes should be optional for students. Which point of view do you agree with?', NULL, NULL, E'University education is a critical phase of academic and personal growth, and attending classes is an essential component of this experience. In this essay, I will argue that mandatory attendance in university classes is necessary for students'' academic success and personal development.\nMandatory attendance provides discipline, which is essential for students'' academic success. When students are required to attend classes, they are more likely to stay on track with their studies and complete assignments on time. This discipline help students develop good study habits that will benefit them throughout their academic and professional careers.\nIn-class discussions and interactions with professors and peers enhance the learning experience and promote critical thinking skills. When students attend classes, they have the opportunity to engage in discussions, ask questions, and receive feedback from their professors and peers. These interactions help students develop critical thinking skills and gain a deeper understanding of the course material.\nIn conclusion, mandatory attendance in university classes is necessary for students'' academic success and personal development. It provides structure and discipline, enhances the learning experience, and promotes critical thinking skills. While some may argue that attendance policies can be strict and punitive, the benefits of mandatory attendance far outweigh the potential downsides. Let us all strive to attend our classes regularly and make the most of our university education.', NULL, 200, 300),
  ('640ee020-2d2f-5396-9c0e-b476e7e83fda'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'READ_ALOUD', E'READ_ALOUD', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '640ee020-2d2f-5396-9c0e-b476e7e83fda'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Writers', E'Writers may make the mistake of making all their sentences too compact. Some have made this accusation against the prose of Gibbon. An occasional loose sentence prevents the style from becoming too formal and allows the reader to relax slightly. Loose sentences are common in easy, unforced writing, but it is a fault when there are too many of them.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('640ef34a-ddf6-59d2-8ef6-1c579310d944'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'HIGHLIGHT_CORRECT_SUMMARY', E'HIGHLIGHT_CORRECT_SUMMARY', E'LISTENING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '640ef34a-ddf6-59d2-8ef6-1c579310d944'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Advertising', E'For years, tv advertisements and print advertisements dominated the advertising industry. Yes, tv commercials and newspaper and magazine ads were expensive, but for most advertisers, the money they spent was worth it. People were watching television and reading newspapers and magazines, but times are changing. Television is still the biggest segment for advertisers, but that won''t last for much longer. Instead, the internet will overtake both tv and print marketing very soon. There are several reasons for this. First is the internet growing popularity. Today, the number of people who surf the internet is enormous. In the nineteen eighties, few people own personal computers. Nowadays, most households have at least one pc, and more people are using the world wide web. Every year. People are also getting their news from the internet that''s making print newspapers and magazines less popular. People are even watching tv programs on the internet. So as you can see, there''s a growing audience available to internet advertisers. Another important reason is cost making an airing. A television commercial can cost a huge amount of money for local tv, it might be thousands of dollars, but for national tv, it can cost hundreds of thousands of dollars. In some cases, advertisers spend millions of dollars to run thirty second commercials and highly rated tv shows or sports broadcasts, but it''s much less expensive to advertise on the internet. Internet advertisements are typically cheap to make many times, they merely provide a link to a company''s website. And they don''t cost that much either. Some internet advertisements cost a few hundred dollars or even less to place on another website. The most expensive ads rarely require more than several thousand dollars. Finally, companies can advertise to specific groups on the internet. All sorts of people watch tv or read newspapers and magazines. So an advertisement for uh, baby products might not appeal to most of the audience or readers. However, a company advertising baby products on the internet can buy ad space on websites that parents with babies often visit. This lets the advertisers get more value from its money.\n\nClick on the paragraph that best relates to the recording.', 'db96480b-edc0-51ae-8e90-dbb006e53d54'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'Television will no longer be the largest marketing segment and more people are getting their news from the internet nowadays. While TV commercials can cost millions of dollars to make and air, it is possible to advertise to specific groups of people on the Internet.', NULL, NULL),
  ('6413084a-786b-5718-914f-567ff256d7ed'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'ANSWER_SHORT_QUESTION', E'ANSWER_SHORT_QUESTION', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '6413084a-786b-5718-914f-567ff256d7ed'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'ASQ', E'What do we call the person who writes plays for the theater?', '5ec224b4-9220-5575-954f-0d925210891d'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'Playwright', NULL, NULL),
  ('642849a2-d757-5b2d-bc29-49068d4aa1c9'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'READ_ALOUD', E'READ_ALOUD', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '642849a2-d757-5b2d-bc29-49068d4aa1c9'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Heart Disease', E'Heart disease is the leading cause of death for both men and women in the United States. While often thought of as one illness, heart disease is actually an umbrella term that covers a range of heart conditions. It includes diseases of the blood vessels, including coronary artery disease and peripheral artery disease and so on.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
