  ('646553ad-1600-5559-8c41-d0c1e424d107'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'REPEAT_SENTENCE', E'REPEAT_SENTENCE', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '646553ad-1600-5559-8c41-d0c1e424d107'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'RS', NULL, '960b3b2a-f7d1-5081-9ab0-443b064f98b8'::uuid, NULL, E'Show your passport and boarding pass at the gate.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('6466f307-c37c-5c2b-b79c-b5d7899f85c4'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DROPDOWN', E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DROPDOWN', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '6466f307-c37c-5c2b-b79c-b5d7899f85c4'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Plastic Packaging', E'In the last decade, the use of plastic packaging has soared, {{1}} by the global surge in online shopping and convenience food. A 2020 report highlighted that global plastic packaging production reached an astonishing 150 million tonnes. On the surface, this growth signals a {{2}} industry, crucial for protecting goods and aiding in transportation. However, delving deeper reveals a complex environmental quandary. While the economic benefits are clear – with the industry {{3}} at billions – the environmental costs are staggering. Pollution, non-biodegradability, and detrimental effects on marine life form the darker side of this narrative. As an environmental study pointed out, for every tonne of plastic produced, {{4}} is an accompanying cost of $700 in environmental degradation, not reflected in the market price. Furthermore, recycling initiatives are only partially effective, with a significant {{5}} of plastic ending up in landfills or oceans. The key takeaway is the need for sustainable alternatives to plastic, which can fulfill economic roles without imposing heavy environmental costs.', NULL, NULL, NULL, E'1.driven, 2.thriving, 3.valued, 4.there, 5.portion', NULL, NULL),
  ('646dfc30-5a11-55f6-90dc-a03fa2908487'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'LISTENING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '646dfc30-5a11-55f6-90dc-a03fa2908487'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'WFD', NULL, 'd5a621a1-48ab-5c83-a1da-cd20a93a7197'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'The media world''s evolution is the focus of student reports.', NULL, NULL),
  ('6475197e-efa2-5e99-9c1a-be1b22abbd8e'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'RE_ORDER_PARAGRAPHS', E'RE_ORDER_PARAGRAPHS', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '6475197e-efa2-5e99-9c1a-be1b22abbd8e'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Child Stars', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, E'2, 1, 4, 3', NULL, NULL),
  ('647d9361-5025-5d6b-b6d0-79527d347704'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DROPDOWN', E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DROPDOWN', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '647d9361-5025-5d6b-b6d0-79527d347704'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Push-pull Factors', E'In geographical terms, the push-pull factors are those that drive people away from a place and {{1}} people to a new location. A combination of push-pull factors helps determine migration or immigration of particular populations from one land to another. Push factors are often forceful, {{2}} that a certain person or group of people leave one country for another, or at least giving that person or people strong reasons to want to move — either because of a threat of violence or the loss of financial security. Pull factors, on the other hand, are often the positive aspects of a different country that encourage people to immigrate in order to seek a better life. While it may seem that push and pull factors are diametrically {{3}} , they both come into play when a population or person is considering migrating to a new location.', NULL, NULL, NULL, E'1.draw, 2.demanding, 3.opposed', NULL, NULL),
  ('647ee61d-a267-5f3f-a60d-88a7141f3518'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'RE_ORDER_PARAGRAPHS', E'RE_ORDER_PARAGRAPHS', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '647ee61d-a267-5f3f-a60d-88a7141f3518'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Internet', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, E'4, 2, 1, 3', NULL, NULL),
  ('648440c4-c8e5-569e-9bb4-6c7b9abbc531'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'REPEAT_SENTENCE', E'REPEAT_SENTENCE', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '648440c4-c8e5-569e-9bb4-6c7b9abbc531'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'RS', NULL, 'ba56bb8f-02c2-52fd-8ca9-c3bd8052e3b0'::uuid, NULL, E'The company plans to sponsor television programs as part of its marketing strategy.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('64859385-caaf-5d55-95ef-6a14482615a0'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'READ_ALOUD', E'READ_ALOUD', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '64859385-caaf-5d55-95ef-6a14482615a0'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'New Year', E'For many, the start of a new year represents a moment of transition. It''s an opportunity to reflect on the past and to look ahead to what the future might hold. Whether it was the best year of our lives or one we''d rather forget, the hope is that better days are ahead.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('64890e71-9049-523c-b1ab-453d0f52fb0c'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'REPEAT_SENTENCE', E'REPEAT_SENTENCE', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '64890e71-9049-523c-b1ab-453d0f52fb0c'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'RS', NULL, '4ac534f9-a996-5c82-97eb-2391c14da658'::uuid, NULL, E'Students will not be given credits for assignments submitted after the due date.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('648985fc-7d69-523b-bbde-29d503c1cfee'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'MC_READING_MULTIPLE', E'MC_READING_MULTIPLE', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '648985fc-7d69-523b-bbde-29d503c1cfee'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Forgiveness', E'A recent study suggests that teaching children to understand other people''s perspectives could make it easier for them to learn how to forgive other people.\n"Forgiveness is important in children and adults for restoring relationships and limiting future conflicts," says Kelly Lynn Mulvey, lead author of the study. "But we didn''t know much about what makes children more likely to forgive others, particularly from early childhood to adolescence."\nTo that end, Mulvey and her collaborators enlisted 185 children, between the ages of 5 and 14, in the study. Researchers conducted in an in-depth interview with each child that collected background information and assessed the child''s "theory of mind" skills.\nResearchers then led each child through a series of scenarios involving other children who are "in group" and "out group." Specifically, each study participant was told they were part of a group, such as the green team. During interviews, researchers described some children in the scenarios as also being on the green team, while other children in the scenarios were on the yellow team. In each scenario, interviewers asked study participants whether they were willing to forgive a group that left them out of a game or activity.\nThere were three main findings. First, children are more likely to forgive someone if they have apologized. Second, children are more likely to forgive people who are "in group." Third, the more advanced a child''s Theory of Mind skills are, the more likely they are to forgive others.\n\nWhat did the study find?', NULL, NULL, NULL, E'Children are more likely to forgive those who are "in the group".\nChildren are more likely to forgive the person who apologizes.', NULL, NULL),
  ('64938fb0-f549-501c-9041-e91ca8d5069d'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'LISTENING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '64938fb0-f549-501c-9041-e91ca8d5069d'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'WFD', NULL, 'b40a574e-62fc-5187-a4e8-edacfb89e49d'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'Students must attend the safety course before entering the engineering workshop.', NULL, NULL),
  ('6494e6c1-1f09-5a1c-acce-335606faf284'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'LISTENING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '6494e6c1-1f09-5a1c-acce-335606faf284'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'WFD', NULL, '7d39450f-87e5-5abb-bd17-3e01a6ab8a78'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'All lectures and learning materials can be found on the internet.', NULL, NULL),
  ('6497462d-e866-59b8-9820-632338e104f3'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'ANSWER_SHORT_QUESTION', E'ANSWER_SHORT_QUESTION', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '6497462d-e866-59b8-9820-632338e104f3'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'ASQ', E'What do we call the area where the weather is dry and hot and there is a lot of sand?', '250d1df0-a33e-52fb-a54a-9d195e368b18'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'Desert', NULL, NULL),
  ('64979385-7d0d-5040-b305-568c9c5a863c'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'REPEAT_SENTENCE', E'REPEAT_SENTENCE', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '64979385-7d0d-5040-b305-568c9c5a863c'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'RS', NULL, '332f373e-dbf2-53fc-acfe-6f6fff71ea57'::uuid, NULL, E'The team has made some minor changes to the new program.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('649e4528-e8bc-56d4-9b46-f40e5ed1b1f5'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'LISTENING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '649e4528-e8bc-56d4-9b46-f40e5ed1b1f5'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'WFD', NULL, 'f26f14cb-7318-5623-9657-23b6b9e55aa9'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'He used to examine the security of accounting information systems.', NULL, NULL),
  ('649febdb-9e55-5dbb-af46-fb03a96ec847'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'REPEAT_SENTENCE', E'REPEAT_SENTENCE', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '649febdb-9e55-5dbb-af46-fb03a96ec847'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'RS', NULL, '319e2ea8-5266-5322-b8f0-74aeada183d2'::uuid, NULL, E'Our university has campuses in the three district regions of Texas.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('64a03677-541c-5b58-9318-2dfa61f7e379'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'RE_TELL_LECTURE', E'RE_TELL_LECTURE', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '64a03677-541c-5b58-9318-2dfa61f7e379'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Jane Goodall', NULL, 'ee37f6a4-92b4-537f-bb86-164e58587f8e'::uuid, NULL, E'In today''s lecture, I''m thrilled to share the inspiring story of Jane Goodall, a name synonymous with groundbreaking primate research and unwavering dedication to conservation. Her journey is a testament to the power of passion and perseverance. Jane Goodall''s venture into the Gombe Stream National Park in Tanzania revolutionized our understanding of chimpanzees. Her patient, immersive observation methods led to astonishing discoveries, such as the use of tools by chimps, previously believed to be a unique human trait. This challenged the scientific community''s perception of the animal kingdom and emphasized our close connection to these primates. Goodall''s work extends beyond research. Her advocacy for environmental conservation and animal rights has inspired countless individuals to respect and protect the natural world. She demonstrates that one person''s commitment can ignite global awareness and action. Jane Goodall''s life journey highlights the incredible impact of following one''s passion and the significant role we can all play in understanding and preserving our planet.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('64ac3d8f-f935-51c7-8d76-96f194a4d14e'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'LISTENING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '64ac3d8f-f935-51c7-8d76-96f194a4d14e'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'WFD', NULL, 'b1c6aa0a-b341-5727-81c7-33d018f7ade6'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'Our view is that all the educational reforms have been inadequately implemented.', NULL, NULL),
  ('64bd70cb-f562-594e-9bc3-9e0cd070a269'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'REPEAT_SENTENCE', E'REPEAT_SENTENCE', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '64bd70cb-f562-594e-9bc3-9e0cd070a269'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'RS', NULL, '9af8813c-5637-5c13-9a3c-0adec828bcb8'::uuid, NULL, E'People tend to be least happy in middle age.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('64bec788-d63a-5f13-97c5-b20294ad866d'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'ANSWER_SHORT_QUESTION', E'ANSWER_SHORT_QUESTION', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '64bec788-d63a-5f13-97c5-b20294ad866d'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'ASQ', E'What do we call the vegetable that has been preserved in salt water and has a strong flavor?', '70803aee-109b-5931-b65c-b5da0ce96f1c'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'Pickle', NULL, NULL),
  ('64cf9e5f-8cf3-5e27-8c14-a3b8d098d6d9'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'RE_TELL_LECTURE', E'RE_TELL_LECTURE', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '64cf9e5f-8cf3-5e27-8c14-a3b8d098d6d9'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Voices', NULL, '502ffc77-9c33-5da9-a5dc-675af15cd1d0'::uuid, NULL, E'I’m a researcher at the MIT Media Lab, part of the Opera of the Future group, and my research focuses on the relationship people have with their own voice and with the voices of others. I study what we can learn from listening to voices, from the various fields, from neurology to biology, cognitive sciences, linguistics. In our group we create tools and experiences to help people gain a better applied understanding of their voice in order to reduce the biases, to become better listeners, to create more healthy relationship or just to understand themselves better. And this really has to come with a holistic approach on the voice. Because think about all the applications and implications that the voice may have, as we discover more about it. Your voice is a very complex phenomenon. It requires a synchronization of more than 100 muscles in your body. And by listening to the voice, we can understand possible failures of what happens inside. For example: listening to very specific types of turbulences and nonlinearity of the voice can help predict very early stages of Parkinson’s, just through a phone call. Listening to the breathness of the voice can help detect heart disease. And we also know that the changes of tempo inside individual words is a very good marker of depression.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('64d5f7fc-cb98-593b-a9a7-eb4b60baec7d'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'RE_TELL_LECTURE', E'RE_TELL_LECTURE', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '64d5f7fc-cb98-593b-a9a7-eb4b60baec7d'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'BSI', NULL, 'e83b53b4-ac6c-5b4c-b5f0-914fda04251f'::uuid, NULL, E'With over 40 years unrivaled experience and a worldwide reputation, BSI leads the way in testing and certification of fire safety products. Based on our dedicated labs in Hemel Hempstead, our team provides BSI kitemark and CE testing and certification for a broad range of products, including fire extinguishers, hoses, alarm panels, and heat and smoke detectors. We help clients to gain access into the European market by ensuring that products meet all the CE mark requirements. And we are familiar with the market access regulations of most countries across the world, enabling customers to enter markets globally. The BSI kitemark is categorized as a British super brand and acknowledged the world over as a symbol of trust, integrity, and quality. It provides the reassurance that vital product safety and performance requirements have been met. Our team subject each product to a rigorous set of tests along with robust production control audits designed specifically to ensure that they perform two required standards of safety and quality. We test for compatibility of fire detection and fire alarm system components to ensure that they''re compatible and connectable. This service meets the growing requirement of European regulatory authorities to meet national installation guidelines. We also perform tests on individual detection components. Fire suppression products such as fire extinguishers are subjected to rigorous tests designed to ensure that they''re effective, safe and capable of performing in environments and conditions in which they''re stored and used. The symbols for BSI kitemark and CE certification represent quality, safety, and trust. For specifiers, they demonstrate a commitment to best practice procurement. And for the public, they provide the reassurance that fire safety products are effective and reliable.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('64dc42af-eafe-5fd9-a006-57baf1a3400c'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'RE_ORDER_PARAGRAPHS', E'RE_ORDER_PARAGRAPHS', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '64dc42af-eafe-5fd9-a006-57baf1a3400c'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Mass Transportation', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, E'1, 5, 4, 3, 2', NULL, NULL),
  ('64e0c3bd-073a-59b2-8481-e0fd1e601e66'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'REPEAT_SENTENCE', E'REPEAT_SENTENCE', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '64e0c3bd-073a-59b2-8481-e0fd1e601e66'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'RS', NULL, '77f9afe4-fc4b-55ff-9fbf-815057e59f51'::uuid, NULL, E'We had accidentally strayed into the war zone.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('64ea680f-3add-54e7-9074-38c2cfb86296'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'ANSWER_SHORT_QUESTION', E'ANSWER_SHORT_QUESTION', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '64ea680f-3add-54e7-9074-38c2cfb86296'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'ASQ', E'How do we call the flat surface at the front of a television or computer, on which we can see pictures?', '44b970da-f17b-50f7-9fcb-7589ac9fe58a'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'Screen', NULL, NULL),
  ('64ee4f92-c76f-5320-b377-05c7846bfcdc'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'HIGHLIGHT_CORRECT_SUMMARY', E'HIGHLIGHT_CORRECT_SUMMARY', E'LISTENING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '64ee4f92-c76f-5320-b377-05c7846bfcdc'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Wagner', E'Doctor tony wagner believes there are seven skills that young people need to have in order for them to find and keep a good job in today''s economy. But he thinks our schools are focusing too much on tests on academic performance and aren''t doing enough to teach those skills. Let me give you an example. One of organ as an and skills is the ability to work in an international team. This is because little team work is carried out in one building anymore. When most global companies have a problem, they create teams of people from all over the world to solve it. And these people meet online in virtual meeting rooms. To succeed in this kind of environment, you need to be a good communicator and understand different cultures. Teams also need good leaders who lead by influencing others. But wagner and the business people he interviewed say that young people today are unprepared for teamwork and leadership. Because of this. Wagner thinks that people involved in teaching and learning must rethink the way that they educate people in schools, so that these young people have the skills they need to achieve a successful career in the twenty first century.\n\nClick on the paragraph that best relates to the recording.', '9a2b5f42-7228-57ee-8963-1c16edb52b58'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'People who are involved in education need to think about the way they teach. It is important that young people leave school with the key skills they need to succeed in the workplace but they do not have these skills today.', NULL, NULL),
  ('64f042e6-815d-5e6e-a4d1-65ccd8878e18'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'READ_ALOUD', E'READ_ALOUD', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '64f042e6-815d-5e6e-a4d1-65ccd8878e18'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Oberto', E'After a century of making sausage, the Oberto family is selling their namesake business to a large Canadian food conglomerate. But the local management says Oberto’s employees, manufacturing plant and sponsored hydroplanes with the red-white-and-green livery will see few changes. Premium Brand Holdings, which is based in Richmond, B.C., and owns dozens of food manufacturers and distributors, is set to buy “substantially all” of Oberto Brands’ assets.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('64f0e331-954d-5c70-8b46-9865c94270b8'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'MC_LISTENING_MULTIPLE', E'MC_LISTENING_MULTIPLE', E'LISTENING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '64f0e331-954d-5c70-8b46-9865c94270b8'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Improvisation', E'Five. Listen to a discussion in a music history class. The class is studying improvisation. Every jazz player knows what he or she means by improvisation. And all writers know what they mean by improvisation. The result, of course, is a lot of confusion and disagreement about what improvisation really is. We hear about the different types of improvisation, free improvisation, and controlled improvisation and collective improvisation. What does it all mean? Yes, mary. My dictionary says improvise means to compose a recite without preparation. That''s true, but it tells us only part of the story. As we know, musicians learn how to play their instruments before they could improvise. So they do have some preparation. Yes, arthur. Maybe a better definition is composing and performing at the same time. That tells us another part of the story. Let''s try to understand it more by looking at history.\n\nWhy is improvisation difficult to define?', '30bf1fb4-f1bb-5129-85f3-3b68ad78d2f6'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'There are several kinds of improvisation.\nPeople disagree about what improvisation is.', NULL, NULL),
  ('64f12e51-3f19-5e40-a21e-f0a76b60b7f7'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'WRITE_ESSAY', E'WRITE_ESSAY', E'WRITING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '64f12e51-3f19-5e40-a21e-f0a76b60b7f7'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Experience v.s. Degree', E'University experience is more important than a university’s degree. Some people argue that university life is much more important than an educational degree in job market. Do you agree or disagree?', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 200, 300),
  ('64f2f410-f33c-5838-a657-3901b30017a7'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'ANSWER_SHORT_QUESTION', E'ANSWER_SHORT_QUESTION', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '64f2f410-f33c-5838-a657-3901b30017a7'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'ASQ', E'What is the opposite of major?', '6b2c99f0-e029-5921-8799-0659d0bd7aa7'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'Minor', NULL, NULL),
  ('64f89c75-7db3-5bbc-a6cd-232010e685f5'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'ANSWER_SHORT_QUESTION', E'ANSWER_SHORT_QUESTION', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '64f89c75-7db3-5bbc-a6cd-232010e685f5'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'ASQ', E'Would a person suffering problems with their vision consult a biologist or an optometrist?', 'd3a3de1f-e795-5929-bfa8-69f884deb02e'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'An optometrist / optometrist', NULL, NULL),
  ('64f93654-4642-5c73-b4d5-f2b7893c3d3c'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'LISTENING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '64f93654-4642-5c73-b4d5-f2b7893c3d3c'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'WFD', NULL, 'be570104-37d7-589f-acc0-7e6bec5ee7bc'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'Employment figures will decrease in the next few years.', NULL, NULL),
  ('64fbc4cd-e75b-5092-9c99-691661639e3f'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'READ_ALOUD', E'READ_ALOUD', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '64fbc4cd-e75b-5092-9c99-691661639e3f'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Arms Races', E'Arms races may involve a more general competitive acquisition of military capability. This is often measured by military expenditure, although the link between military expenditure and capability is often quite weak. Such more general arms races are often observed among countries engaged in enduring rivalries, which may sometimes appear to follow each other’s military spending levels.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('64ff188c-4598-53fc-a687-9a34900762a4'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'MC_READING_SINGLE', E'MC_READING_SINGLE', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '64ff188c-4598-53fc-a687-9a34900762a4'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'MCS-R', E'The Food and Drug Administration has recently proposed severe restrictions on the use of antibiotics to promote the health and growth of meat animals. Medications added to feeds kill many microorganisms but also encourage the appearance of bacterial strains that are resistant to anti-infective drugs. Already, for example, penicillin and the tetracyclines are not as effective therapeutically as they once were. The drug resistance is chiefly conferred by tiny circlets of genes, called plasmids, that can be exchanged between different strains and even different species of bacteria. Plasmids are also one of the two kinds of vehicles (the other being viruses) that molecular biologists depend on when performing gene transplant experiments. Even present guidelines forbid the laboratory use of plasmids bearing genes for resistance to antibiotics. Yet, while congressional debate rages over whether or not to toughen these restrictions on scientists in their laboratories, little congressional attention has been focused on an ill-advised agricultural practice that produces known deleterious effects.\n\nAccording to the passage, the exchange of plasmids between different bacteria can results in which of the following?', NULL, NULL, NULL, E'Microorganisms resistant to drugs', NULL, NULL),
  ('64ff6616-2051-531b-90f3-54adad0f321b'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'ANSWER_SHORT_QUESTION', E'ANSWER_SHORT_QUESTION', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '64ff6616-2051-531b-90f3-54adad0f321b'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'ASQ', E'The sense of hearing will allow you to hear. Then what sense will allow you to see?', 'a0c2e743-9c80-5874-9a89-84888e683cb2'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'Sight', NULL, NULL),
