  ('651873c6-1891-5687-ad11-7d11bd602020'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DRAG_AND_DROP', E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DRAG_AND_DROP', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '651873c6-1891-5687-ad11-7d11bd602020'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Sleep', E'In the realm of health and {{1}} , sleep stands out as a critical component often ignored or {{2}} by modern society. While many focus on diet and exercise, sleep is the {{3}} of physical and mental health. It''s not just about the hours {{4}} in bed but the quality of sleep achieved. Experts in sleep science are advocating for educating the public about the benefits of a good night''s sleep and the dangers of chronic sleep {{5}} .', NULL, NULL, NULL, E'1.well-being, 2.underestimated, 3.foundation, 4.spent, 5.deprivation', NULL, NULL),
  ('651e4069-45c0-51e1-b2b3-2e0ee96c801b'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'ANSWER_SHORT_QUESTION', E'ANSWER_SHORT_QUESTION', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '651e4069-45c0-51e1-b2b3-2e0ee96c801b'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'ASQ', E'What do we call a person who sets fire to a house?', '3e89e421-be3f-5403-b66d-db6abaa12f0a'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'Arsonist / fire-raiser', NULL, NULL),
  ('65207281-c2e4-50d7-b171-96aaa9b7216d'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'READ_ALOUD', E'READ_ALOUD', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '65207281-c2e4-50d7-b171-96aaa9b7216d'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Possession of Arms', E'Unlike the United Kingdom, which has taken a relatively restrictive approach to the possession of arms, the United States has taken a more lenient approach. In the United States, three models have evolved regarding the interpretation of the meaning of the right to bear and keep arms as delineated in the Second Amendment.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('6527e481-dfa1-5bd1-9a1d-67fa0d2ecc1a'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'READ_ALOUD', E'READ_ALOUD', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '6527e481-dfa1-5bd1-9a1d-67fa0d2ecc1a'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Creativity', E'In the creative condition, the students were told to think of a friend who did something special and think of them as their "creative friend" who could help them solve any problem. This type of creativity training is called perspective-shifting, in which the kids look at a problem through the eyes of someone else.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('652908a1-fb2b-58fd-9f9e-522476eae81f'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'ANSWER_SHORT_QUESTION', E'ANSWER_SHORT_QUESTION', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '652908a1-fb2b-58fd-9f9e-522476eae81f'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'ASQ', E'What is the term for someone who designs buildings and often supervises their construction?', '10c56078-94d8-5201-8053-892be7676180'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'Architect', NULL, NULL),
  ('65300e4e-87f9-5aab-bbb9-71baffad39aa'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'LISTENING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '65300e4e-87f9-5aab-bbb9-71baffad39aa'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'WFD', NULL, '11f15363-8a7d-50c7-bc0b-42c0312b2641'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'The government is focusing on the economic growth of developing countries.', NULL, NULL),
  ('65385181-0cd9-542b-8d69-d7c570894d4f'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DROPDOWN', E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DROPDOWN', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '65385181-0cd9-542b-8d69-d7c570894d4f'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Communication Climate', E'Do you feel organized, or confined, in a clean workspace? Are you more productive when the sun is shining than when it’s gray and cloudy outside? Just as factors like weather and physical space {{1}} us, communication climate influences our interpersonal interactions. Communication climate is the “overall feeling or emotional mood between people”. If you {{2}} going to visit your family during the holidays because of {{3}} between you and your sister, or you look forward to dinner with a particular set of friends because they make you laugh, you are {{4}} to the communication climate — the overall mood that is created because of the people involved and the type of communication they bring to the interaction. Let’s look at two different types of communication climates: Confirming and Disconfirming climates.', NULL, NULL, NULL, E'1.impact, 2.dread, 3.tension, 4.responding', NULL, NULL),
  ('653e4a9f-dabd-5b63-a9b1-f4c9f8f07b65'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DRAG_AND_DROP', E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DRAG_AND_DROP', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '653e4a9f-dabd-5b63-a9b1-f4c9f8f07b65'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Lyrebirds', E'Lyrebirds, a common bird in rainforest areas of Australia, have an incredible repertoire of sounds that they are able to {{1}} from their environment, including over 20 other bird calls as well as sophisticated mechanical sounds. They have been known to {{2}} the sounds of chainsaws and pneumatic drills. The male lyrebird sings a medley of mimicry to impress females — and the more detailed and varied his {{3}} is, the more interesting it seems to potential mates. Like females of other bird species, female lyrebirds do not take place in the imitating, but simply judge the competing males’ symphonies. Once learned, it seems a lyrebird rarely forgets a call, and the sounds are passed down through the {{4}} . There are some lyrebirds in Australia, that still recreate the sounds of axes, saws and old-fashioned cameras which have not been used in the area for years', NULL, NULL, NULL, E'1.mimic, 2.replicate, 3.repertoire, 4.generations', NULL, NULL),
  ('6540dd64-b5b9-5ba3-bba0-a4ae57d00347'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DRAG_AND_DROP', E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DRAG_AND_DROP', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '6540dd64-b5b9-5ba3-bba0-a4ae57d00347'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Ocean''s Abyss', E'The Ocean''s Abyss program, led by marine biologist Dr. Eliza Kemp, has {{1}} astonishing findings from the depths of the Pacific. The latest expedition {{2}} into the Mariana Trench, {{3}} footage of species that defy the extremes of pressure and darkness. Dr. Kemp''s research into these {{4}} life forms could unlock secrets of survival in hostile environments, with implications {{5}} from biotechnology to space colonization.', NULL, NULL, NULL, E'1.revealed, 2.ventured, 3.capturing, 4.resilient, 5.stretching', NULL, NULL),
