  ('670e7756-2cb9-59c7-967f-afac1cbfc248'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'MC_LISTENING_SINGLE', E'MC_LISTENING_SINGLE', E'LISTENING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '670e7756-2cb9-59c7-967f-afac1cbfc248'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Parking Permits', E'The place to go for parking permits is the safety and security office. On the first floor of the university services building. Parking permits are required for all on campus parking. Special permits are available for students who carpool. You can also get passes for the fourth avenue, garage bus passes and maps there. The hours are eight a m to seven p m monday to thursday, and eight to four on fridays. Safety and security also provides special services twenty four hours a day. These include escort service to and from your car, criminal incident reporting and investigation lost and found and battery jumper service.\n\nWhat is the talk mainly about?', '1d9d6ac2-0a8c-5b64-ae92-768d65fc1ae3'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'Services of the Safety and Security Office', NULL, NULL),
