  ('6753eb0a-3349-5b07-a792-76d918386deb'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'REPEAT_SENTENCE', E'REPEAT_SENTENCE', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '6753eb0a-3349-5b07-a792-76d918386deb'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'RS', NULL, '28cf84fe-de5c-5c4f-8d69-d436ca64c030'::uuid, NULL, E'Meteorology is the detailed study of the Earth''s atmosphere.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('675b9c5e-b58f-5309-9771-ff7d69a3c59a'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'READ_ALOUD', E'READ_ALOUD', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '675b9c5e-b58f-5309-9771-ff7d69a3c59a'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Abstract Preparation', E'The preparation of abstracts is an intellectual effort, requiring general familiarity with the subject. To bring out the salient points of an author''s argument calls for skill and experience. Consequently, a considerable amount of qualified manpower that could be used to advantage in other ways must be diverted to the task of facilitating access to information.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('675c3e0d-c88c-5495-bb88-15bfd0537551'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'RE_ORDER_PARAGRAPHS', E'RE_ORDER_PARAGRAPHS', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '675c3e0d-c88c-5495-bb88-15bfd0537551'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'O''Keeffe', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, E'1, 4, 2, 3', NULL, NULL),
  ('675c4933-075b-5c19-a885-8c44aa579ae4'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'SUMMARIZE_WRITTEN_TEXT', E'SUMMARIZE_WRITTEN_TEXT', E'WRITING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '675c4933-075b-5c19-a885-8c44aa579ae4'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Protein Molecules', E'About 120,000 types of protein molecule have yielded up their structures to science. That sounds a lot, but it isn''t. The techniques, such as X-ray crystallography and nuclear-magnetic resonance (NMR), which are used to elucidate such structures do not work on all proteins. Some types are hard to produce or purify in the volumes required. Others do not seem to crystallise at all — a prerequisite for probing them with X-rays. As a consequence, those structures that have been determined include representatives of less than a third of the 16,000 known protein families. Researchers can build reasonable computer models for around another third, because the structures of these resemble ones already known. For the remainder, however, there is nothing to go on.\nIn addition to this lack of information about protein families, there is also a lack of information about those from the species of most interest to researchers: Homo Sapiens. Only a quarter of known protein structures are human. A majority of the rest come from bacteria. This paucity is a problem, for in proteins form and function are intimately related. A protein is a chain of smaller molecules, called amino acids, that is often hundreds or thousands of links long. By a process not well understood, this chain folds up, after it has been made, into a specific and complex three-dimensional shape. That shape determines what the protein does: acting as a channel, say, to admit a chemical into a cell; or as an enzyme to accelerate a chemical reaction; or as a receptor, to receive chemical signals and pass them on to a cell’s molecular machinery.', NULL, NULL, E'About 120,000 types of protein molecule have yielded up their structures to science, but the determined structures include representatives of less than a third of the known protein families; researchers can build reasonable computer models for around another third, while for the remainder, there is nothing to go on, because in addition to this lack of information about protein families, there is also a lack of information about Homo Sapiens.', NULL, 5, 75),
  ('675f7c3b-bce9-56e3-bc06-2f49283f0423'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'REPEAT_SENTENCE', E'REPEAT_SENTENCE', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '675f7c3b-bce9-56e3-bc06-2f49283f0423'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'RS', NULL, 'fb33b4c2-6197-59c5-bb01-f9b678012a38'::uuid, NULL, E'In the upcoming lecture, we''ll discuss the following pair of images.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('6764360d-1b03-5051-b893-d3e8fc91f3ea'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DRAG_AND_DROP', E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DRAG_AND_DROP', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '6764360d-1b03-5051-b893-d3e8fc91f3ea'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Mount El’brus', E'People mainly travel to Mount El’brus for skiing and hiking. Reaching the {{1}} of El’brus is highly challenging and should only be {{2}} at certain times of year. However, out of the Seven Summits, El’brus is considered one of the easiest to climb thanks to a cable car system that carries climbers up to an {{3}} of 3,658 meters.', NULL, NULL, NULL, E'1.summit, 2.attempted, 3.elevation', NULL, NULL),
  ('676e4290-64ff-5c76-86b8-aa8ee23bfada'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'REPEAT_SENTENCE', E'REPEAT_SENTENCE', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '676e4290-64ff-5c76-86b8-aa8ee23bfada'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'RS', NULL, 'ab566e05-86de-54cb-87ae-06bfbf3c3f7e'::uuid, NULL, E'All faculty members contribute to the discovery and dissemination of new knowledge.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('676eb710-d25f-5a33-9cc2-8bc2f39b6c85'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'ANSWER_SHORT_QUESTION', E'ANSWER_SHORT_QUESTION', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '676eb710-d25f-5a33-9cc2-8bc2f39b6c85'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'ASQ', E'When you want to find a specific book quickly, who should you turn to for help, the librarian, your teacher, or your classmates?', '0218c018-5759-5a24-8611-9c719c6b5e82'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'Librarian', NULL, NULL),
  ('6770005f-3f48-5445-81a6-32c192ffb982'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DRAG_AND_DROP', E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DRAG_AND_DROP', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '6770005f-3f48-5445-81a6-32c192ffb982'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Shock Absorption', E'Spacecraft and launch pad equipment undergo extreme {{1}} due to vibration during rocket launches. To make sure that they {{2}} functional in space, shock absorption technology was designed to protect the spacecraft. During earthquakes, buildings and bridges {{3}} similar stress. That is why the same shock absorption technology used for spacecraft is now used to {{4}} buildings and bridges in earthquake-prone regions.', NULL, NULL, NULL, E'1.stress, 2.remain, 3.undergo, 4.strengthen', NULL, NULL),
  ('6774cf55-a927-5b6a-83ba-1636d06b16fe'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'REPEAT_SENTENCE', E'REPEAT_SENTENCE', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '6774cf55-a927-5b6a-83ba-1636d06b16fe'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'RS', NULL, 'cd27e286-ea6b-53d2-af17-3879e1cf4d85'::uuid, NULL, E'When applying for a visa, you must clearly and simply explain why you need it.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('67861c8a-a065-5ddb-8813-cb7d2ecf4ed0'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DRAG_AND_DROP', E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DRAG_AND_DROP', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '67861c8a-a065-5ddb-8813-cb7d2ecf4ed0'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Denial', E'Denial is often the first reaction to {{1}} or unimaginable news. Denial, or disbelief or shock, protects us by allowing such news to enter slowly and to give us time to come to {{2}} with what is taking place. The person who receives positive test results for life-threatening conditions may question the results, seek second opinions, or may simply feel a sense of disbelief {{3}} even though they know that the results are true.', NULL, NULL, NULL, E'1.overwhelming, 2.grips, 3.psychologically', NULL, NULL),
  ('6788bea7-4f84-5877-9d43-13d9c4b214e7'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DROPDOWN', E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DROPDOWN', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '6788bea7-4f84-5877-9d43-13d9c4b214e7'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Credibility and Pride', E'Moreover, for Professor David Phoenix, the dean of the faculty of science and technology, the return of single-honors chemistry is a {{1}} of credibility and pride. "If you say you''re a science faculty, you have to have all the core sciences, and this course will mean we attract a new supply of potential Masters and PhD students in chemistry." Phoenix is adamant that the new course will teach solid chemistry, but he thinks that an attraction for students will be a teaching approach that {{2}} significantly from his days as an undergraduate. This takes real-life issues as the starting point of lectures and modules, such as how drugs are made or the science behind green issues. Out of this study, he says, students will be exposed to the same core chemistry unchanged over decades, but they will be doing it in a way that is more {{3}} and more likely to lead to more fundamental learning. It is an approach that {{4}} chemistry'' s recent success story: moving with the times, while holding fast to the subject''s essential role as a building block of science and technological advance.', NULL, NULL, NULL, E'1.matter, 2.differs, 3.engaging, 4.symbolizes', NULL, NULL),
  ('678f497c-fac4-52f9-9d92-20fa8959f038'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'READ_ALOUD', E'READ_ALOUD', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '678f497c-fac4-52f9-9d92-20fa8959f038'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'WiFi', E'A group of researchers have put forward a new approach that allows for high-quality imaging of stationary objects using only WiFi signals. Their technique involves using the Geometrical Theory of Diffraction along with Keller cones to track the edges of the objects. This method has also made it possible to read the English alphabet through walls using WiFi signals.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('679377a4-6ddc-5734-878f-42a496611b62'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'READ_ALOUD', E'READ_ALOUD', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '679377a4-6ddc-5734-878f-42a496611b62'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Psychology', E'Psychology is the scientific study of human behavior and mental processes. Understanding the complexities of the human mind allows psychologists to develop effective interventions and treatments for a wide range of mental health challenges, which can improve the quality of life for individuals and communities alike.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
