  ('69317e21-2392-56d0-bcf8-6da8bb5f436b'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'READ_ALOUD', E'READ_ALOUD', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '69317e21-2392-56d0-bcf8-6da8bb5f436b'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Cup Village', E'The government is still not sure whether its alternative idea for the Auckland''s America''s Cup Village is viable, a week out from the start of the planning approval process. Auckland Council is seeking approval to build eight bases across three wharves, but the government was in favour of focusing on the semi-industrial Wynyard Point, to lessen the extension of wharves.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
