  ('6b03630f-126c-50bf-9c79-7efe5b3d0538'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DRAG_AND_DROP', E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DRAG_AND_DROP', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '6b03630f-126c-50bf-9c79-7efe5b3d0538'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Students away from Home', E'For lots of first-year students, the University may be their first {{1}} living away from home for an extended period. It is a {{2}} break from home. In my point of view, this is the best thing that you can do. I know you have to {{3}} for yourself, cook and clean after yourself, {{4}} look after yourself without your parents but the truth is some time in your life you are going to have to part with lovely mummy and daddy.', NULL, NULL, NULL, E'1.experience, 2.definite, 3.fend, 4.basically', NULL, NULL),
  ('6b083d33-7cdf-53d4-b9b2-69af962a092f'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'LISTENING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '6b083d33-7cdf-53d4-b9b2-69af962a092f'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'WFD', NULL, 'd2702263-f006-5401-b34c-45b3c7d52ad4'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'We can add up numbers perfectly without making mistakes using calculators.', NULL, NULL),
  ('6b17b54d-e7d7-5508-9331-26750d907328'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'ANSWER_SHORT_QUESTION', E'ANSWER_SHORT_QUESTION', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '6b17b54d-e7d7-5508-9331-26750d907328'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'ASQ', E'What can bring astronauts to space?', 'd35968ff-8522-51f4-a027-e971e9669ce9'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'Spacecraft', NULL, NULL),
  ('6b17f775-5ad1-5270-a6d9-f81b8cbe7901'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'READ_ALOUD', E'READ_ALOUD', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '6b17f775-5ad1-5270-a6d9-f81b8cbe7901'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Heart Health', E'A study from UCL and the University of Sydney shows that substituting just a few minutes of daily sitting with moderate exercise can greatly benefit heart health. It also showed the benefit of light activity, standing, and sleeping compared with sitting. This finding, part of research involving more than 15,000 individuals, underscores the significant health impact of even small changes in daily physical activity.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('6b1b6fe6-59e8-54bb-8a05-a1e9396393dd'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'RE_TELL_LECTURE', E'RE_TELL_LECTURE', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '6b1b6fe6-59e8-54bb-8a05-a1e9396393dd'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Sustainable Farming', NULL, '57f62516-6290-52e1-8e5d-ee991bb30175'::uuid, NULL, E'As the world''s population grows, ensuring everyone has access to sufficient, nutritious food is a critical challenge. Sustainable farming practices offer a promising solution to this challenge. Firstly, sustainable farming involves methods that are environmentally friendly, such as reducing chemical use, conserving water, and promoting biodiversity. These practices are not only crucial for protecting our environment but also for ensuring long-term agricultural productivity. Healthy ecosystems are more resilient and can provide the resources needed for continuous food production. Secondly, sustainable farming includes a focus on local production and distribution. By supporting local food systems, we can reduce the carbon footprint associated with long-distance transportation of food. Additionally, local farming empowers communities, supports the local economy, and ensures fresher, more nutritious food reaches consumers. However, transitioning to sustainable farming requires effort and collaboration from various stakeholders, including governments, farmers, and consumers. It involves embracing new technologies, investing in education, and creating policies that support sustainable practices. In conclusion, sustainable farming is not just an environmentally responsible choice; it''s a necessary step towards global food security and a healthier planet. By adopting these practices, we can ensure that future generations have access to the food they need to thrive.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('6b2f9bd1-d03e-5d01-a1b1-53464f657d07'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'LISTENING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '6b2f9bd1-d03e-5d01-a1b1-53464f657d07'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'WFD', NULL, 'ed7c0c4c-cf62-55cf-ac7c-1b5094c51231'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'This program begins in the fall of each school year.', NULL, NULL),
  ('6b2fde84-c60d-537f-847a-3d90a9264d3a'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'ANSWER_SHORT_QUESTION', E'ANSWER_SHORT_QUESTION', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '6b2fde84-c60d-537f-847a-3d90a9264d3a'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'ASQ', E'Which one has more academic articles, magazines or journals?', 'fc7ba663-14e1-5a07-8285-b566883910be'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'journals', NULL, NULL),
  ('6b301ce2-1e1a-57e1-96e2-53aa7846466f'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DROPDOWN', E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DROPDOWN', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '6b301ce2-1e1a-57e1-96e2-53aa7846466f'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Elder Academy', E'The Elder Academy scheme, an education and social inclusion initiative, was {{1}} in early 2007 by The Labour and Welfare Bureau and the Elderly Commission. The activities provide {{2}} to learning opportunities in schools and university campuses and are aimed primarily at older people who have had little or no education. The scheme optimizes the use of existing {{3}} facilities and has been successful in promoting both lifelong and initial learning for older people, encouraging participation and helping to maintain {{4}} and mental wellbeing. School and university students are engaged in the scheme, thereby also promoting civic education and intergenerational understanding. Currently, some 125 elder academies in various districts and seven tertiary institutions offer a wide variety of courses.', NULL, NULL, NULL, E'1.launched, 2.access, 3.educational, 4.physical', NULL, NULL),
  ('6b32f0ad-d230-5d85-94aa-df0bfa12bde9'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'RE_TELL_LECTURE', E'RE_TELL_LECTURE', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '6b32f0ad-d230-5d85-94aa-df0bfa12bde9'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Green Economy', NULL, 'c4091af1-9ead-5ae7-b0c4-d2b2d80a5243'::uuid, NULL, E'The green economy could easily be the next Industrial Revolution. I mean energy is... you know, we all need energy. We do an annual report which studies how much oil is left in the world and demand for oil. And with China, India, South America, Africa even, growing at the rate they''re now growing, you know, we think that four or five years from now the demand for fuel will exceed supply. That could push prices, you know, through the roof. For that reason you know, forget global warming for one minute just for that reason alone, we should be hurrying up, you know, saving on energy and creating alternative sources of energy. And I think those people who invest in this sector, hopefully, you know, will get their thanks, and get the right; get their just returns.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
