  ('6d9cf6cb-5418-5ef0-8f34-41c543dde5ca'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'READ_ALOUD', E'READ_ALOUD', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '6d9cf6cb-5418-5ef0-8f34-41c543dde5ca'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Credit cards', E'Credit Cards are a ubiquitous form of payment that have revolutionized the way we conduct transactions. With a credit card, individuals can make purchases without having to carry cash or worry about the availability of funds. Credit cards also offer a range of benefits such as cashback rewards, travel points, and purchase protection.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
