  ('6ea0f724-6c15-5584-8571-8c633510445a'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'REPEAT_SENTENCE', E'REPEAT_SENTENCE', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '6ea0f724-6c15-5584-8571-8c633510445a'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'RS', NULL, '7eb17935-6381-568c-baff-72386dc9778a'::uuid, NULL, E'Care needs to be taken for vulnerable groups in times of infection.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('6ea5d8de-953e-5ab6-8f62-59716cfb390b'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DROPDOWN', E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DROPDOWN', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '6ea5d8de-953e-5ab6-8f62-59716cfb390b'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Recruitment Tool', E'The six programs represented here report that word of mouth is by far their most effective recruitment tool, particularly because it typically yields candidates who are similar to previously successful candidates. Moreover, satisfied candidates and school systems are likely to {{1}} the word without any special {{2}} on the part of their program. Other less personal advertising approaches, such as radio and television spots and local newspaper advertisements, have also proven fruitful, {{3}} for newer programs. New York uses a print advertising campaign to inspire dissatisfied professionals to become teachers. Subway posters send provocative {{4}} to burned-out or disillusioned professionals. "Tired of diminishing returns? Invest in NYC kids" was just one of many Madison Avenue-inspired invitations. News coverage has also proven to be a {{5}} to alternative programs. When the New York Times, for example, ran a story about the district''s alternative route program, 2,100 applications flooded in over the next six weeks.', NULL, NULL, NULL, E'1.spread, 2.effort, 3.especially, 4.messages, 5.boon', NULL, NULL),
  ('6ea6f1db-dc2d-5fea-a172-030b56b22832'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'ANSWER_SHORT_QUESTION', E'ANSWER_SHORT_QUESTION', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '6ea6f1db-dc2d-5fea-a172-030b56b22832'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'ASQ', E'When a runner runs, what is this state of breathing?', '5a1ae6f9-d0b1-5010-bc9e-4ca9496818c2'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'Gasp / pant', NULL, NULL),
  ('6eaa388b-7e10-55d5-b033-7b3e53851a19'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'LISTENING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '6eaa388b-7e10-55d5-b033-7b3e53851a19'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'WFD', NULL, '173fd0c3-45f7-5787-905f-fdd3ec9cbf54'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'Science is found in society all around the world.', NULL, NULL),
  ('6eaa762b-7b94-5b6b-8fdd-da5a533209c5'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'LISTENING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '6eaa762b-7b94-5b6b-8fdd-da5a533209c5'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'WFD', NULL, '40492f44-75aa-5532-a7c1-101c2e685e77'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'The school''s garden becomes a beautiful spot to relax during summertime.', NULL, NULL),
  ('6eaad664-2c11-5477-9529-a80e2c91579d'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'LISTENING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '6eaad664-2c11-5477-9529-a80e2c91579d'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'WFD', NULL, 'a1e78b09-1759-5042-9e1d-edef4b863d0f'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'Vocational high schools do not prepare students for university entrance exams.', NULL, NULL),
  ('6eb15aad-2bea-54d9-b6d5-e3588018d65b'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'ANSWER_SHORT_QUESTION', E'ANSWER_SHORT_QUESTION', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '6eb15aad-2bea-54d9-b6d5-e3588018d65b'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'ASQ', E'If someone tells you the truth, what is the opposite?', '25c8d6ed-102a-52d2-9457-1059b5072570'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'Falsity / falseness / untruth', NULL, NULL),
  ('6eb3c319-0f8a-528f-b041-9ea217ad98a2'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'SUMMARIZE_WRITTEN_TEXT', E'SUMMARIZE_WRITTEN_TEXT', E'WRITING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '6eb3c319-0f8a-528f-b041-9ea217ad98a2'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Locust Management', E'There''s a slate of international institutions that coordinates locust management and response. The primary effort is conducted by the United Nations Food and Agriculture Organization, which runs the Desert Locust Watch to track locust migration patterns and oversee regional response efforts.\nIn individual nations, a lack of cash, competing priorities and domestic challenges make it hard to mount a long-range pest management strategy. Because locust numbers ebb and flow, it''s been difficult for countries — such as Kenya, which hasn''t seen an infestation in 70 years — to build up intermediate and long-term infrastructure to address outbreaks proactively. That''s why so many governments are now scrambling to come up with solutions.\n"It''s hard to maintain funding and political will and knowledge and capacity building when you have these unpredictable boom and bust cycles that could play out over years or decades," a pest expert Overson says. "If you wait until it''s reactive and forget about it until it happens again, we''re going to be in this situation forever."\nRight now, the most effective way to fight locust outbreaks involves mass aerial sprays of pesticides to kill locusts. Overson says that''s not ideal, given the adverse effect such chemicals have on biodiversity and human health. But emerging technologies may hold promise for the future. For example, the National Oceanic and Atmospheric Administration recently partnered with the United Nations to repurpose technology used to track smoke plumes from fires to predict the migrations of locusts, the Scientific American reported. And in terms of locust extermination, Overson says biopesticides have untapped potential — although lots of research and development is still needed in the area.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 5, 75),
  ('6ebd7e8c-8fb9-56c5-a1a2-5cd3406130dc'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'LISTENING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '6ebd7e8c-8fb9-56c5-a1a2-5cd3406130dc'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'WFD', NULL, '5fecd08e-6831-5d98-91b3-936c90d73517'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'It was four more years before the theory was fully developed.', NULL, NULL),
  ('6ec17ffb-5a05-5923-bb39-f7c0094e6836'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'LISTENING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '6ec17ffb-5a05-5923-bb39-f7c0094e6836'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'WFD', NULL, '7d2528ae-bf12-5683-b237-18713a560d50'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'Many toxins originate from plants or animals.', NULL, NULL),
  ('6ec5f934-3107-5937-8890-c3762ab08832'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'RE_TELL_LECTURE', E'RE_TELL_LECTURE', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '6ec5f934-3107-5937-8890-c3762ab08832'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Doing Team-related Sports', NULL, '14e861db-a87e-5b4f-8aac-f997d2576a29'::uuid, NULL, E'It turns out that if you can find a sport and a team you like, studies show that there are all sorts of benefits that go beyond the physical and mental benefits of exercise alone. Some of the most significant are psychological benefits, both in the short and long term. Some of those come from the communal experience of being on a team, for instance, learning to trust and depend on others, to accept help, to give help, and to work together towards a common goal. In addition, commitment to a team and doing something fun can also make it easier to establish a regular habit of exercise. School sport participation has also been shown to reduce the risk of suffering from depression for up to four years. Meanwhile, your self-esteem and confidence can get a big boost. There are a few reasons for that. One is found in training. Just by working and working at skills, especially with a good coach, you reinforce a growth mindset within yourself. That’s when you say, “Even if I can’t do something today, I can improve myself through practice and achieve it eventually.” That mindset is useful in all walks of life. And then there’s learning through failure, one of the most transformative, long-term benefits of playing sports. The experience of coming to terms with defeat can build the resilience and self-awareness necessary to manage academic, social, and physical hurdles.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('6ec74558-194c-5930-8529-280ec46ac6fd'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'READ_ALOUD', E'READ_ALOUD', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '6ec74558-194c-5930-8529-280ec46ac6fd'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Insults and Criticism', E'The insults and criticism were not unexpected. What was surprising was people''s enthusiasm about the competition. Thousands have participated in the discussion.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('6ece8547-c7c1-5c74-ac85-1a903e994440'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'RE_ORDER_PARAGRAPHS', E'RE_ORDER_PARAGRAPHS', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '6ece8547-c7c1-5c74-ac85-1a903e994440'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Johannes Gutenberg', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, E'1, 4, 2, 3', NULL, NULL),
  ('6ecf33c2-21d9-544a-8348-b2e42e42ab75'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DRAG_AND_DROP', E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DRAG_AND_DROP', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '6ecf33c2-21d9-544a-8348-b2e42e42ab75'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Spacewalk', E'The original solar arrays on the space station are still functioning, but they have been supplying power for more than 20 years and are showing signs of {{1}} after long-term exposure to the space environment. The arrays were {{2}} designed to last 15 years. The new solar arrays are being placed in front of the original ones, which will {{3}} parts of the planned Gateway lunar outpost.', NULL, NULL, NULL, E'1.wear, 2.originally, 3.power', NULL, NULL),
  ('6ecf9bbd-9220-53e1-884c-8050a4376c10'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DROPDOWN', E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DROPDOWN', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '6ecf9bbd-9220-53e1-884c-8050a4376c10'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Poverty and Disease', E'At the Gates Foundation, we believe it’s possible, and {{1}} , to invest in long-term, sustainable action, especially after two years of conflict, pandemic and polarization. This is an extremely fragile moment for the world. Some of the poorest countries face external debt distress. Rising inflation has affected virtually every nation, reducing countries’ spending power and forcing tough financial trade-offs. An {{2}} number of people, particularly women, are hungry worldwide. Many countries are pulling back on development aid that helps strengthen health and food systems over the long term in low and middle income countries. Some have {{3}} funds from these priorities to address crises at home. Humanitarian aid is critical. Yet if short-term funding means {{4}} long-term investment, health emergencies and food shortages will become even more frequent -- and more intense. Hunger, disease and inequity are problems without borders, and every sector has a role to play in solving them. Solutions can come from everywhere: from the most advanced labs and the most remote communities.', NULL, NULL, NULL, E'1.imperative, 2.alarming, 3.redirected, 4.neglecting', NULL, NULL),
  ('6ed0fd9b-0fc6-5dcd-8401-9c82133fc430'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'LISTENING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '6ed0fd9b-0fc6-5dcd-8401-9c82133fc430'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'WFD', NULL, '7616f6eb-5003-577e-ac98-2a0f98544a13'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'The university''s theater group plans to perform at the concert hall.', NULL, NULL),
  ('6ed1f463-1a09-574e-b3e9-5f04509328b2'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'READ_ALOUD', E'READ_ALOUD', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '6ed1f463-1a09-574e-b3e9-5f04509328b2'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Delta', E'As the Delta variant of coronavirus sweeps the U.S. businesses, universities and cities such as New York and San Francisco have introduced vaccine mandates to boost uptake of jabs, but vaccine hesitancy remains high and a cottage industry for bogus inoculation cards has emerged to help people get around the rules.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('6ed24d9a-ff73-5ee8-96fa-1f9daeccd203'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'REPEAT_SENTENCE', E'REPEAT_SENTENCE', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '6ed24d9a-ff73-5ee8-96fa-1f9daeccd203'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'RS', NULL, 'aa6aa4b5-225e-5310-b69b-ec14d296038d'::uuid, NULL, E'Students can borrow books and other materials from the library for free.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('6ed4e5fd-7b81-5769-a89a-48c1e8eb18f3'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DROPDOWN', E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DROPDOWN', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '6ed4e5fd-7b81-5769-a89a-48c1e8eb18f3'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Spain’s Law', E'Cigarette butts are the poster child of pollution and litter, and now, Spain is taking action to {{1}} this serious problem. On Friday, a new law came into effect that requires tobacco companies to pay for the clean-up of millions of cigarette butts {{2}} in public places. The law is part of a larger environmental bill that also aims to reduce single-use plastic pollution by banning items such as cutlery, plates, straws, polystyrene cups, and cotton buds. As such, the impacts of cigarette litter go beyond being a simple {{3}} in urban environments. Wildlife can mistake cigarette butts for food, leading to injury or death. In addition, the chemicals present in cigarette butts can leach into soil and water, {{4}} contaminating these resources and hurting us all. Spain’s new law is a step in the right direction, but it will be important to closely monitor its {{5}} and effectiveness.', NULL, NULL, NULL, E'1.combat, 2.discarded, 3.eyesore, 4.potentially, 5.implementation', NULL, NULL),
  ('6eda01b5-00aa-520b-a94d-7c16ee71a38f'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DRAG_AND_DROP', E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DRAG_AND_DROP', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '6eda01b5-00aa-520b-a94d-7c16ee71a38f'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Dance', E'Dance has played an important role in many musicals. In some {{1}} dance numbers are included as an excuse to add to the color and spectacle of the show, but dance is more effective when it forms an integral part of the {{2}} . An early example is Richard Rodgers On Your Toes(1936) in which the story about classical ballet meeting the world of jazz enabled dance to be introduced in a way that {{3}} , rather than interrupted, the drama.', NULL, NULL, NULL, E'1.cases, 2.plot, 3.enhanced', NULL, NULL),
  ('6edbdd39-66b4-59fb-8a49-a460390a5a04'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'LISTENING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '6edbdd39-66b4-59fb-8a49-a460390a5a04'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'WFD', NULL, 'ed14face-0313-5ff1-a83d-f4fd723c759c'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'Too much information may be avoided by good research design.', NULL, NULL),
