  ('7129c7dd-3780-5fcc-8ef7-d0a010eb4421'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'READ_ALOUD', E'READ_ALOUD', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '7129c7dd-3780-5fcc-8ef7-d0a010eb4421'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Christmas', E'People love celebrating Christmas for plenty of reasons, but one of the best things about the holiday is getting together with loved ones to do fun Christmas activities. Telling the newest Christmas jokes, sharing funny Christmas memes and even solving clever Christmas riddles bring out the holiday humor. You’re busting a gut before you know it!', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('712b0619-dd0b-5009-b589-c2c3a53a72ac'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'REPEAT_SENTENCE', E'REPEAT_SENTENCE', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '712b0619-dd0b-5009-b589-c2c3a53a72ac'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'RS', NULL, '98a14e76-5a3f-5f93-93d9-d734c86c1059'::uuid, NULL, E'In Europe, the political pressure regarding globalization is similar.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('712f0cb0-e3ba-53c2-b8f6-a287bc1728b6'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'RE_TELL_LECTURE', E'RE_TELL_LECTURE', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '712f0cb0-e3ba-53c2-b8f6-a287bc1728b6'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Workbook', NULL, '27d79635-aa4d-58ed-8066-26cfac9085ef'::uuid, NULL, E'Before we start our first lab, I''d like to tell you a little bit about the workbook we''ll be using. The first thing I''d like to point out is that the workbook contains a very large amount of material, far more than you could ever handle in a single semester. What you''re supposed to do is choose the experiments and activities that you want to do—within a certain framework, of course. Part of my job is to help you make your choices. Next, I''d like to mention that in each workbook chapter, there are usually two subsections. The first is called "Experiments" and the second is called "Activities." In the "Experiments" section, the workbook gives full instructions for all the experiments, including alternate procedures. Choose the procedure you wish—there''s plenty of equipment available. In the "Activities" section, you will find suggestions for projects that you can do on your own time. You''ll see that there are usually no detailed instructions for the activities—you''re supposed to do them your own way. If there are no questions, let''s turn to Chapter One now.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('713118d5-2628-5e2d-b7ef-b624a8fa275e'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'REPEAT_SENTENCE', E'REPEAT_SENTENCE', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '713118d5-2628-5e2d-b7ef-b624a8fa275e'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'RS', NULL, '453a65a4-9ed3-5ceb-afbd-b2bd60249ce4'::uuid, NULL, E'Winter can be harsh, but it won''t be an issue since there is a heater.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('714305a7-a4b5-5d5d-b829-0bb195031860'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'RE_ORDER_PARAGRAPHS', E'RE_ORDER_PARAGRAPHS', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '714305a7-a4b5-5d5d-b829-0bb195031860'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Latin American Literature', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, E'4, 5, 1, 3, 2', NULL, NULL),
  ('7143a646-dcf8-5177-9c27-b2de524c2e86'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'ANSWER_SHORT_QUESTION', E'ANSWER_SHORT_QUESTION', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '7143a646-dcf8-5177-9c27-b2de524c2e86'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'ASQ', E'Where would you go to watch a film ? an art gallery or a cinema?', 'e5415f6f-5e21-5010-bbca-d37449b2a2a8'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'Cinema', NULL, NULL),
  ('71503b4d-6afd-59db-8e58-19bc6840aedc'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DROPDOWN', E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DROPDOWN', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '71503b4d-6afd-59db-8e58-19bc6840aedc'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Wrinkle Cure', E'Barrie Finning''s, a professor at Monash University''s college of pharmacy in Melbourne, and PhD student Anita Schneider, recently tested a new wrinkle cure. Twice daily, 20 male and female volunteers applied a liquid containing Myoxinol, a patented {{1}} of okra (Hibiscus esculentus) seed, to one side of their faces. On the other side they applied a similar liquid without Myoxinol. Every week for a month their wrinkles were tested by self-assessment, photography and the size of depressions made in silicon moulds. The results were impressive. After a month the {{2}} and number of wrinkles on the Myoxinol-treated side were reduced by approximately 27 per cent. But Finnin''s research, commissioned by a cosmetics company, is unlikely to be published in a scientific {{3}} . It''s hard to even find studies that show the active ingredients in cosmetics penetrate the skin, let alone more comprehensive research on their effects. Even when {{4}} studies are commissioned, companies usually control whether the work is published in the traditional scientific literature.', NULL, NULL, NULL, E'1.extract, 2.depth, 3.publication, 4.rigorous', NULL, NULL),
  ('7153983d-ae76-5a00-b17b-91d0df6ff5bf'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DROPDOWN', E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DROPDOWN', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '7153983d-ae76-5a00-b17b-91d0df6ff5bf'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'FIB', E'Finally, science has something you can give people that really does help them lose weight: money. Rewarding dieters with a few hundred dollars is effective for promoting at least {{1}} weight loss. That''s {{2}} to a study in the December 10th issue of the Journal of the American Medical Association.\nThe researchers tried two approaches. In one, study {{3}} got paid if they lost 16 pounds in 16 weeks. In the other, participants {{4}} their own money, which they lost if they didn''t make that same goal. A control group just tried to lose weight without any economic {{5}} . And the losers are:\nDieters who got paid for losing—53 percent of them met the target. {{6}} by those who risked their own money—47 percent of them lost the 16 pounds. And the regular old dieters, for whom losing weight was its own reward? Only 10.5 percent of them got to their goal. And that group {{7}} just a four-pound loss, compared with 14 pounds for the paid dieters.\nSo, what do you do with the money you win by losing weight? That''s easy: pizza!', NULL, NULL, NULL, E'1.short-term, 2.according, 3.subjects, 4.invested, 5.incentive, 6.Followed, 7.averaged', NULL, NULL),
  ('71541d06-ab76-5055-afc9-ca4af886d4b9'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'REPEAT_SENTENCE', E'REPEAT_SENTENCE', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '71541d06-ab76-5055-afc9-ca4af886d4b9'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'RS', NULL, '54af94d2-db48-5f0a-9937-90ddcd87b331'::uuid, NULL, E'Sleep plays a vital role in maintaining a healthy lifestyle.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('715f0f64-c39e-58bc-9b5c-108cb906db4e'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'REPEAT_SENTENCE', E'REPEAT_SENTENCE', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '715f0f64-c39e-58bc-9b5c-108cb906db4e'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'RS', NULL, 'd574eb68-0d70-5df9-b1ae-ed0b2c318bb7'::uuid, NULL, E'These developments are discussed in more depth in Chapter Nine.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('71629b1e-5523-5cab-bec5-f7faafb558e9'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'LISTENING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '71629b1e-5523-5cab-bec5-f7faafb558e9'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'WFD', NULL, '806a5c43-c7d3-578d-8f32-a819b418efbe'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'The article discusses a wide array of innovative experimental approaches.', NULL, NULL),
  ('716460f6-ee73-5c8e-b87d-bfb5bcf37a25'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DROPDOWN', E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DROPDOWN', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '716460f6-ee73-5c8e-b87d-bfb5bcf37a25'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'David Lynch', E'David Lynch is professor and head of education at Charles Darwin University. {{1}} to this he was sub dean in the Faculty of Education and Creative Arts at Central Queensland University and foundation head of the University’s Noosa {{2}} . David’s career in education began as a primary school teacher in Queensland in the early 1980’s and {{3}} to four principal positions before {{4}} higher education. David’s research interests predominate in teacher education with particular interest in building teacher capability to meet a changed world.', NULL, NULL, NULL, E'1.Prior, 2.campus, 3.progressed, 4.entering', NULL, NULL),
  ('716a4999-bfcb-546e-bdc6-955a028dcad1'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'SUMMARIZE_WRITTEN_TEXT', E'SUMMARIZE_WRITTEN_TEXT', E'WRITING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '716a4999-bfcb-546e-bdc6-955a028dcad1'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Interpersonal Relationships', E'Interpersonal relationships are a fundamental aspect of human life, influencing our happiness, mental health, and overall well-being. Cultivating strong and healthy relationships with others is a skill that can significantly enrich our lives. Effective communication is the cornerstone of successful interpersonal relationships. It involves active listening, empathy, and open and honest expression of thoughts and feelings. By understanding and validating the perspectives of others, we can establish trust and rapport. Empathy is another crucial element. Putting ourselves in someone else''s shoes and recognizing their emotions allows us to connect on a deeper level. Empathy fosters compassion and helps resolve conflicts by addressing the needs and concerns of all parties involved. Mutual respect is essential for maintaining healthy relationships. Respecting each other''s boundaries, values, and individuality builds trust and appreciation. It''s important to recognize that differences in opinions and perspectives are natural and can lead to growth and learning. Conflict resolution skills are vital for addressing disagreements and misunderstandings. Healthy conflict resolution involves active listening, staying calm, and finding mutually agreeable solutions. Avoiding blame and focusing on the issue at hand promotes productive discussions. Setting clear and realistic expectations is also essential. Unrealistic expectations can lead to disappointment and frustration. Openly discussing each other''s needs and goals can help align expectations and foster a more satisfying relationship. Additionally, quality time spent together strengthens bonds. Sharing experiences, making memories, and engaging in meaningful activities promote connection and intimacy. It''s important to prioritize spending time with loved ones and nurturing those relationships. In conclusion, building strong and healthy interpersonal relationships requires effective communication, empathy, mutual respect, conflict resolution skills, clear expectations, and quality time together. These skills are valuable assets that contribute to our emotional well-being and enrich our lives with meaningful connections and fulfilling relationships.', NULL, NULL, E'Building strong and healthy interpersonal relationships is founded on effective communication, empathy, mutual respect, conflict resolution skills, clear expectations, and quality time spent together, ultimately enhancing our emotional well-being and enriching our lives with meaningful connections and fulfilling relationships.', NULL, 5, 75),
  ('716ed9da-8565-50d4-b1fc-ea8c24d9c945'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'ANSWER_SHORT_QUESTION', E'ANSWER_SHORT_QUESTION', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '716ed9da-8565-50d4-b1fc-ea8c24d9c945'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'ASQ', E'What do we call the ship that can travel below the surface of sea?', 'e4fc2792-76ce-52d4-bd99-de6cf25a9846'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'Submarine', NULL, NULL),
  ('7173e9c1-b619-5b46-a843-4cfbc4654eed'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'READ_ALOUD', E'READ_ALOUD', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '7173e9c1-b619-5b46-a843-4cfbc4654eed'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Jellyfish', E'Even without a central brain, jellyfish can learn from past experiences like humans, mice, and flies, scientists report for the first time. They trained Caribbean box jellyfish (Tripedalia cystophora) to learn to spot and dodge obstacles. The study challenges previous notions that advanced learning requires a centralized brain and sheds light on the evolutionary roots of learning and memory.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('7174c3ad-cb94-5067-8ac9-c6d0ebe763f0'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'REPEAT_SENTENCE', E'REPEAT_SENTENCE', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '7174c3ad-cb94-5067-8ac9-c6d0ebe763f0'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'RS', NULL, '570d7a71-672d-50aa-b606-f20a8d2dcc1d'::uuid, NULL, E'Her designer clothes were from the pages of a fashion magazine.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('71793acc-e1c6-53bc-bd6e-e95971be3290'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'RESPOND_TO_A_SITUATION', E'RESPOND_TO_A_SITUATION', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '71793acc-e1c6-53bc-bd6e-e95971be3290'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Soccer Team', E'You''re the coach of a youth soccer team and you''ve just watched them lose a game because of a lack of teamwork and coordination. You want to address the situation in a way that motivates them to improve their teamwork for the next game without discouraging them. What would you say to your soccer team?', '60deab9e-92df-5abe-8961-190ac8f7418d'::uuid, NULL, E'Hey guys, today’s game was rough. But it’s not the end. We''ve all seen what we can do when we click together, right? So, here''s the plan: we''re going to zero in on teamwork at practice. I''m talking about drills that get us talking, moving, and playing as one unit. Soccer''s a team sport, and our strength is in our unity. Let''s take this as a push to level up together.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('7179f27d-1e47-5563-b9b8-06f1f552c9f4'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'REPEAT_SENTENCE', E'REPEAT_SENTENCE', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '7179f27d-1e47-5563-b9b8-06f1f552c9f4'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'RS', NULL, '9cfe5f7f-52c9-536f-8256-c80ada00fad1'::uuid, NULL, E'The worker had absented himself from the office for the day.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
