  ('7363abcc-5766-5db4-98b1-dedca7af77a5'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'READ_ALOUD', E'READ_ALOUD', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '7363abcc-5766-5db4-98b1-dedca7af77a5'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Oxygen on Moon', E'Oxygen can be found in many of the minerals in the ground around us, and the Moon is mostly made of the same rocks you’ll find on Earth. Minerals such as silica and magnesium oxides dominate the Moon’s landscape. All of these minerals contain oxygen, but not in a form our lungs can access.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
