  ('73bdf2ba-4702-51d7-9f59-828ae0b6f340'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'READ_ALOUD', E'READ_ALOUD', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '73bdf2ba-4702-51d7-9f59-828ae0b6f340'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Undergraduates Education', E'Undergraduates may choose to major in any one of 125 academic majors. The university''s distinguished faculty includes internationally known scientists, authors and teachers who are committed to continuing the university''s tradition in providing one of the highest quality undergraduate educations available.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('73be1473-7b45-5a82-80a7-7017d0b69fd2'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DRAG_AND_DROP', E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DRAG_AND_DROP', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '73be1473-7b45-5a82-80a7-7017d0b69fd2'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Age of Exploration', E'The Age of Exploration was a pivotal period in human history, {{1}} by seafaring voyages that expanded global trade routes and cultural exchanges. Navigators like Columbus and Magellan {{2}} on perilous journeys, reshaping the world''s geographical understanding and {{3}} new connections between distant lands. Therefore, the Age of Exploration is considered a major {{4}} point in world history, as it opened up new horizons, opportunities, and challenges for humanity.', NULL, NULL, NULL, E'1.marked, 2.embarked, 3.forging, 4.turning', NULL, NULL),
  ('73c0bcc9-df39-50e1-93ea-daf985112da2'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'LISTENING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '73c0bcc9-df39-50e1-93ea-daf985112da2'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'WFD', NULL, 'b38f4f86-efea-5502-8f32-04175901f2b2'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'The due date for the initial assignment is September fourteenth.', NULL, NULL),
  ('73c2198e-c630-5c4c-afd7-0d029bb15104'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'LISTENING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '73c2198e-c630-5c4c-afd7-0d029bb15104'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'WFD', NULL, 'a413eb23-883d-5e8b-8c47-50d9df679185'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'The museum is closed on the third Monday of every month.', NULL, NULL),
  ('73c3e98a-2296-53d1-8208-aabd749e7b4d'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'MC_LISTENING_SINGLE', E'MC_LISTENING_SINGLE', E'LISTENING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '73c3e98a-2296-53d1-8208-aabd749e7b4d'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Bats', E'To the beginning of the talk now that the warmer weather and longer days are here, we are the only ones spending more time outdoors. This is an active time for bats as well. Migratory bats are now returning to the area, and young bats are starting to explore their environment. Young bats go off course, and this is when most people come into contact with them. Bats are a normal part of our environment and can even be a good thing. That''s help keep down the insect population, especially mosquitoes. Normal bad activity includes sleeping during the daytime and becoming active and flying around in search of food at night, starting at dusk. It''s unusual to see a bat during the day. Normal bats don''t fly around in the daytime or lie or crawl on the ground. So if you encounter about like that, you should call the health department immediately. If you have bats in your attic or house contact a pest control agency, they do not kill the bats, but make recommendations on how to get the bats out of your home. You want to create a one way valve from your house to outside so they can get out, but can''t come in to avoid having bats in your house altogether. Find all possible entry points into the house and close them by caulking or screening the gap. Bats can squeeze through a gap of one half inch. Bats are the most likely carriers of rabies in our area, and almost one hundred percent of rabies cases are fatal. Make sure your dogs and cats are vaccinated against rabies. If you should come in physical contact with a bat, it''s important to get in touch with the health department or a doctor immediately. If possible, catch the bat so it can be tested for rabies number seven.\n\nHow can you prevent bats from entering your house?', '56016292-dfd7-553b-9ece-0a5a42c3263f'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'By blocking every opening', NULL, NULL),
  ('73c47401-5939-526b-8ca3-830115db1ba3'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'ANSWER_SHORT_QUESTION', E'ANSWER_SHORT_QUESTION', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '73c47401-5939-526b-8ca3-830115db1ba3'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'ASQ', E'What is the Spanish dance known for its energetic and passionate movements?', 'c3aaa523-d7fc-5ea6-a5d3-8bbe33536926'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'Flamenco', NULL, NULL),
  ('73ca2ea0-00b6-54ae-97a4-915823f98ddd'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DROPDOWN', E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DROPDOWN', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '73ca2ea0-00b6-54ae-97a4-915823f98ddd'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Vertical Farming', E'The Babylonians are the innovators behind the most well-known example of early advanced agriculture systems. Built nearly 2,500 years ago, their hanging gardens are thought to be the earliest {{1}} of a vertical farm (vertical refers to the practice of growing the plants upward to maximize growing space).\nBeyond this ancient Wonder of the World, there are myriad examples of how civilizations have worked to {{2}} their environments to make farming easier or more {{3}} . One thousand years ago, the Mesoamerican Aztec society {{4}} a form of hydroponics (hydroponics is the science of growing plants without soil in a nutrient-rich solution). The Aztecs grew plants on marshy ''rafts'' suspended in rivers and shallow lake beds. The remnants of these small, rectangular areas of fertile, arable land, known as chinampas, can still be seen in Mexico City today.', NULL, NULL, NULL, E'1.prototype, 2.manipulate, 3.productive, 4.pioneered', NULL, NULL),
  ('73ce2a8e-428a-5225-af72-f8a9a8be9974'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DRAG_AND_DROP', E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DRAG_AND_DROP', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '73ce2a8e-428a-5225-af72-f8a9a8be9974'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Cultural Change', E'Changing a firm’s culture is hard, and many {{1}} fail. CEOs have lost their jobs because they tried and failed. It {{2}} takes years and may require replacing people. College administrators joke that their ideas for OER (open educational resources) {{3}} slowly: one retirement at a time, but change is possible with the right approach.', NULL, NULL, NULL, E'1.attempts, 2.generally, 3.advance', NULL, NULL),
  ('73cee99e-c03d-580a-9417-05c26fce1c85'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'REPEAT_SENTENCE', E'REPEAT_SENTENCE', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '73cee99e-c03d-580a-9417-05c26fce1c85'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'RS', NULL, '7b7f27c8-ca27-5453-8a1f-e7fbc4066523'::uuid, NULL, E'Banks will check your identification before allowing you to withdraw money.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('73d03edf-498a-5f8f-a539-52f7570f3247'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'REPEAT_SENTENCE', E'REPEAT_SENTENCE', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '73d03edf-498a-5f8f-a539-52f7570f3247'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'RS', NULL, '6efb860a-4e5f-5159-973d-4ebf1803005e'::uuid, NULL, E'The university will introduce several new courses in the coming year.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('73d32108-150c-5f21-8bf5-0f7a94f900a8'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'ANSWER_SHORT_QUESTION', E'ANSWER_SHORT_QUESTION', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '73d32108-150c-5f21-8bf5-0f7a94f900a8'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'ASQ', E'What is the subject studying the nature of society?', '09a7c375-140d-5378-b586-763a1e937bf6'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'Sociology', NULL, NULL),
  ('73d4121b-8989-57c2-a1b4-69620f195618'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'HIGHLIGHT_CORRECT_SUMMARY', E'HIGHLIGHT_CORRECT_SUMMARY', E'LISTENING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '73d4121b-8989-57c2-a1b4-69620f195618'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Cliche', E'A cliche, as you know, is an overused and worn out phrase - and ... um ... these are to be avoided like the plague in your essays. Indeed, someone once said, I quote, "there is no greater danger to either education or thinking than the popular phrase". Let me digress a little further; originally a cliche was a printer''s term, back in the days when letters were set one by one, for a ready-made block of type of frequently used phrases, usually in the newspaper business. So ... there you are ... um ... cliches were also known as stereotypes.\nNow, if you think of graphic design as a language with its own vocabulary, grammar, and so on, it too must have its cliches. Obvious examples would be, um, the twin Greek masks of comedy and tragedy that symbolize the theater and, more popularly known, the heart as a symbol of love, especially on Valentine cards, and so on. Far from being a terrible fault - as it would be in literature - the visual cliche is essential in the world of graphic communication. This is certainly true when it comes to advertising and propaganda. The visual cliche can give immediate life to an idea and a clear meaning to what could be a mere abstraction.\n\nClick on the paragraph that best relates to the recording.', '29a90db9-6a12-55a6-872e-4949236d8013'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'While cliches in writing reveal lazy thinking and are to be avoided at all costs, in the graphic arts they become essential, helping to get the message across quickly, clearly and with emotional force. This is especially true of advertising and propaganda where the impact must be immediate.', NULL, NULL),
  ('73d510c1-86b1-578d-821c-96a256c424a7'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'READ_ALOUD', E'READ_ALOUD', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '73d510c1-86b1-578d-821c-96a256c424a7'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Impaired Brain Function', E'Scientists have achieved the restoration of impaired brain function in mice models of stroke by utilizing small molecules, which may hold promise as a potential therapy for stroke recovery in the future. Tadeusz Wieloch, explains that the treatment has demonstrated the ability to partially restore communication between nerve cells in significant areas of the brain that are affected by stroke.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('73dca232-bd16-5fb3-8019-a1340cf32d58'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'LISTENING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '73dca232-bd16-5fb3-8019-a1340cf32d58'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'WFD', NULL, '3430fbe4-c563-5c77-bdb8-1a41408f11f8'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'Most university clubs and societies meet in the Student Union Building.', NULL, NULL),
  ('73e26a46-795f-550d-8f91-32376b8aa3b7'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'READ_ALOUD', E'READ_ALOUD', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '73e26a46-795f-550d-8f91-32376b8aa3b7'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Black Bears', E'Whereas black bears climb trees throughout their lives, brown bears stop doing this when they grow up. The two species are crafty omnivores who''ll eat a wide range of plant and animal matter. Sometimes this means competing for the same resources; British Columbian salmon are hunted by black and brown bears alike.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('73e29023-33f2-55ba-b9c6-30b4e2c28ecf'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'REPEAT_SENTENCE', E'REPEAT_SENTENCE', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '73e29023-33f2-55ba-b9c6-30b4e2c28ecf'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'RS', NULL, '7137e322-8833-56ee-95ba-6a92da0b3d37'::uuid, NULL, E'Most teaching staff make their lecture notes available online.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('73e7c2f5-71da-5a66-a35b-470720290066'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'REPEAT_SENTENCE', E'REPEAT_SENTENCE', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '73e7c2f5-71da-5a66-a35b-470720290066'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'RS', NULL, 'e0a23605-bdbb-5fe7-a821-a12a550e2a86'::uuid, NULL, E'Will those happy days ever be forgotten by you?', NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('73ee074c-4cbd-51e8-b75b-910cd1cbd5fe'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'READ_ALOUD', E'READ_ALOUD', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '73ee074c-4cbd-51e8-b75b-910cd1cbd5fe'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Pronunciation', E'Pronunciation is the way in which a word or a language is spoken. This may refer to generally agreed-upon sequences of sounds used in speaking a given word or language in a specific dialect ("correct pronunciation") or simply the way a particular individual speaks a word or language.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('73ee43a7-8241-5f9d-b56e-bebdd9faf9c5'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DRAG_AND_DROP', E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DRAG_AND_DROP', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '73ee43a7-8241-5f9d-b56e-bebdd9faf9c5'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Writing', E'Writing has been a {{1}} of civilization since its inception in ancient Sumeria, where it was initially used for record-keeping. As societies evolved, so did the {{2}} of writing, which came to be employed for codifying laws, preserving literature, and {{3}} history. The transition from pictographs to alphabets marked a pivotal development in cultural exchange and education, enabling the {{4}} of ideas and knowledge across civilizations.', NULL, NULL, NULL, E'1.cornerstone, 2.function, 3.documenting, 4.spread', NULL, NULL),
  ('73ef5263-8e88-510f-b484-68814e16ac2c'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'RE_ORDER_PARAGRAPHS', E'RE_ORDER_PARAGRAPHS', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '73ef5263-8e88-510f-b484-68814e16ac2c'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Center of Health(国际健康中心)', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, E'4, 1, 2, 3', NULL, NULL),
  ('73f3afbd-fee6-5996-aeab-7d357119fdd3'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DRAG_AND_DROP', E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DRAG_AND_DROP', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '73f3afbd-fee6-5996-aeab-7d357119fdd3'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'The Wholeness of Thought', E'The writer-or, for that matter, the speaker conceives his thought whole, as a unity, but must express it in a line of words; the reader — or listener — must take this line of symbols and from it {{1}} the original wholeness of thought. There is {{2}} difficulty in conversation, because the listener receives innumerable cues from the physical expressions of the speaker; there is a dialogue, and the listener can {{3}} in at any time. The advantage of group discussion is that people can overcome linear sequence of words by {{4}} on ideas from different directions; which makes for wholeness of thought. But the reader is confronted by line upon line of printed symbols, without benefits of physical {{5}} and emphasis or the possibility of dialogue or discussion.', NULL, NULL, NULL, E'1.reconstruct, 2.little, 3.cut, 4.converging, 5.tone', NULL, NULL),
  ('73f96c2d-c412-5a55-a7a5-12e2175d4cc9'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DRAG_AND_DROP', E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DRAG_AND_DROP', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '73f96c2d-c412-5a55-a7a5-12e2175d4cc9'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Decision Paralysis', E'Decision paralysis is a state of over-analyzing a situation or decision up to the point where it actually {{1}} you from taking a decision, or it influences you significantly. This phenomenon typically {{2}} through inaction, indecision, and an excessive tendency to {{3}} the options and consequences you have at hand before making up your mind. This experience can be {{4}} and dangerous, and it can affect your professional and even personal life.', NULL, NULL, NULL, E'1.prevents, 2.manifests, 3.weigh, 4.frustrating', NULL, NULL),
  ('74071a0b-2b99-5b7a-875f-33f1e0b8592d'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'ANSWER_SHORT_QUESTION', E'ANSWER_SHORT_QUESTION', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '74071a0b-2b99-5b7a-875f-33f1e0b8592d'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'ASQ', E'What is the opposite of ''deforestation''?', 'e200521d-ef8e-5bc4-8335-0ed16432e7f1'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'Afforestation', NULL, NULL),
