  ('76dd9efb-51f1-5ab4-b2ac-c182c1c18631'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'ANSWER_SHORT_QUESTION', E'ANSWER_SHORT_QUESTION', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '76dd9efb-51f1-5ab4-b2ac-c182c1c18631'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'ASQ', E'What do we call a period of seven days?', '1c9e308c-59f3-5e4e-a54f-3ad5af13c71f'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'Week', NULL, NULL),
  ('76e0a33f-2b25-50e7-a951-78a4d6983be4'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DROPDOWN', E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DROPDOWN', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '76e0a33f-2b25-50e7-a951-78a4d6983be4'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Eating Healthily', E'Eating healthily can be less expensive than the unhealthy diet many Australians currently live on. A study compared the cost of the recommended Australian Dietary Guidelines to {{1}} an average Australian family buys and eats a fortnight. It found that the healthy diet can save $150 at the checkout a fortnight, or $3,900 a year. The study also highlighted the health benefits of {{2}} the guidelines, which include eating more fruit and vegetables, wholegrains, lean meats, and dairy products, and avoiding processed foods, sweetened drinks, desserts, and alcohol. The researchers said that diets {{3}} in fruit and vegetables can protect against high blood pressure, heart disease, stroke, Type 2 diabetes, and some cancers, as well as {{4}} mood and mental wellbeing. They suggested that families can start making small changes, planning meals with their kids, and trying to make healthy versions of takeaway meals at home.', NULL, NULL, NULL, E'1.what, 2.following, 3.rich, 4.boost', NULL, NULL),
  ('76e635d6-e5ce-5ceb-a5ef-a9f2c6a63be3'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DRAG_AND_DROP', E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DRAG_AND_DROP', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '76e635d6-e5ce-5ceb-a5ef-a9f2c6a63be3'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Peaceful Environment', E'A peaceful environment plays a critical role in fostering a positive and productive atmosphere for education. When learners are surrounded by a {{1}} environment, they feel safe and secure, which enhances their ability to {{2}} on their studies. A lack of distractions and {{3}} also ensures that both teachers and students can engage meaningfully in the learning process. Furthermore, a calm and respectful {{4}} among classmates promotes cooperation and mutual support, which are vital for {{5}} development. Thus, achieving a peaceful setting is essential for attaining educational excellence.', NULL, NULL, NULL, E'1.supportive, 2.concentrate, 3.disturbances, 4.atmosphere, 5.personal', NULL, NULL),
  ('76e7b16f-9335-54db-a357-837e25805f42'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'MC_LISTENING_MULTIPLE', E'MC_LISTENING_MULTIPLE', E'LISTENING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '76e7b16f-9335-54db-a357-837e25805f42'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Dialogue', E'At number seventy nine. Please. Hi there. That''s me. I''m number seventy nine. How can I help you? I''d like to register for a course in this department, but I''m in med school. Ah that explains why you don''t look familiar. I think I know all the faces and engineering which course are you interested in engineering science one mac two twenty one we don''t get many students from outside the department interested in that course, especially from the medical angle. I''m interested in Cybernetic organisms. You know, no like that old television show where the hero is half human and half mechanical. It''s just advanced prosthetics. Really see? Well, you probably saw in the course description that there are several prerequisites and a co requisite course. A lot of math and physics. Right? Well, I was wondering if there can be any exceptions on that. Can I get permission to take the course without having taken those other courses? And I suppose it may be possible, but as it''s a compulsory course, it''s usually quite full. And the fact we don''t want unprepared students slowing the class down. Have you considered ordering the course? You could ordered the course. And if you feel confident enough, maybe you could challenge the exam. Well, I hadn''t thought of that. I don''t actually need the credit. So that might work for me. I''ll go get a coffee and think about it. Thanks. You''re welcome. I''ll see you later.\n\nWhich of the following are true?', '3d4e9d89-7e39-5850-8367-b10baa30f2e0'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'The student has not taken the required math and physics courses.\nThe student is not majoring in engineering.', NULL, NULL),
  ('76ed04f1-9277-57d1-bcd9-6693537196a0'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'READ_ALOUD', E'READ_ALOUD', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '76ed04f1-9277-57d1-bcd9-6693537196a0'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Elephants', E'When a male African savanna elephant folds his ears while simultaneously waving them, he’s ready for a fight. When a female folds her ears and accompanies the action with an ear flap, that means she’s also issuing a serious threat. But when elephants come together and fold their ears, the animals are expressing a warm greeting.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('76ef9e8f-cdbf-5aae-951f-5b55e59fe6b6'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DRAG_AND_DROP', E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DRAG_AND_DROP', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '76ef9e8f-cdbf-5aae-951f-5b55e59fe6b6'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Mathematics', E'Mathematicians and computer scientists had an exciting year of {{1}} in set theory, topology and artificial intelligence, in addition to preserving {{2}} knowledge and revisiting old questions. They made new progress on fundamental questions in the field, and saw the links between mathematics and other disciplines grow. But many results were only partial answers, and some promising {{3}} of exploration turned out to be dead ends, leaving work for future {{4}} .', NULL, NULL, NULL, E'1.breakthroughs, 2.fading, 3.avenues, 4.generations', NULL, NULL),
  ('76f18151-53d5-59e4-b617-b84215228c29'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DROPDOWN', E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DROPDOWN', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '76f18151-53d5-59e4-b617-b84215228c29'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Greenhouse Gas', E'Climate change is impacting human lives and health in a variety of ways. It threatens the essential {{1}} of good health – clean air, safe drinking water, nutritious food supply and safe shelter – and has the potential to {{2}} decades of progress in global health. Between 2030 and 2050, climate change is expected to cause approximately 250,000 additional deaths per year from malnutrition, malaria, diarrhoea and heat stress alone. Areas with weak health infrastructure – mostly in developing countries – will be the least able to {{3}} without assistance to prepare and respond. Greenhouse gas emissions that result from the extraction and burning of fossil fuels are major {{4}} to both climate change and air pollution. Many policies and individual measures have the potential to reduce greenhouse gas emissions and produce major health co-benefits, particularly by abating air pollution. The phase out of polluting energy system could both lower carbon emissions and cut the {{5}} of household and ambient air pollution.', NULL, NULL, NULL, E'1.ingredients, 2.undermine, 3.cope, 4.contributors, 5.burden', NULL, NULL),
  ('76f867d4-557a-58e3-b397-f9ac5edcdc1c'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DRAG_AND_DROP', E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DRAG_AND_DROP', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '76f867d4-557a-58e3-b397-f9ac5edcdc1c'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Ideas', E'Ideas as well as people can take {{1}} stage at the right time and the right place. If new ideas are to have a wide-ranging {{2}} , they had better occur at the right time - usually when old theories are worn out or have reached a dead {{3}} . Then they make people think along new lines and in ways that may {{4}} in unexpected directions. These ideas needn''t be new in themselves. They can be older, half-forgotten ideas brought back to life, or new combinations of {{5}} ones presented in a new light.', NULL, NULL, NULL, E'1.center, 2.effect, 3.end, 4.lead, 5.familiar', NULL, NULL),
  ('76fa420c-c140-5668-bfc6-36e3e6ac2977'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'READ_ALOUD', E'READ_ALOUD', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '76fa420c-c140-5668-bfc6-36e3e6ac2977'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Statistical Information', E'The provision of accurate and authoritative statistical information strengthens modern societies. It provides a basis for decisions to be made on such things as where to open schools and hospitals, how much money to spend on welfare payments and even which football players to replace at half-time.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
