  ('7ecf73a2-179a-508b-8632-c687f285ee44'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DROPDOWN', E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DROPDOWN', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '7ecf73a2-179a-508b-8632-c687f285ee44'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Diversity', E'In practice, diversity can be understood as a {{1}} of human characteristics that differ from our own or from those of the groups we belong to. Points of difference can include a range of demographic and psychographic factors, both of {{2}} are traditionally used by marketers, researchers, and influencers to target segments of a larger population. Demographic factors describe the “who,” including {{3}} such as age, education, gender, ethnicity, religion, income and profession, and marital or family status. Psychographic factors are considered the “why” (how we’re wired) and {{4}} our behavior, beliefs, lifestyles, and values. Other important aspects of diversity include disabilities, sexual orientation and cognitive styles. A key point to note is that there are many more possible points of difference than there are categories legally protected from {{5}} .', NULL, NULL, NULL, E'1.range, 2.which, 3.traits, 4.reflect, 5.discrimination', NULL, NULL),
  ('7ecfa58a-4134-5b35-9fc9-093229d8ee30'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DROPDOWN', E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DROPDOWN', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '7ecfa58a-4134-5b35-9fc9-093229d8ee30'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Technological Innovation', E'Technological innovation has been integral to human progress, but it also brings unintended consequences. While recent advances have improved standards of living around the world, technology has produced new challenges that {{1}} global solutions. Issues like online privacy, automation’s impact on jobs, and the environmental toll of emerging energy sources must be addressed through policy and governance informed by shared ethical {{2}} . With conscientious development and oversight, technology can uplift humanity. But without guidance, its effects may be {{3}} . The responsible design and application of technology must consider humanity’s shared interests {{4}} commercial or geopolitical interests alone. If we work together globally with wisdom and care, technology can be developed and applied for the benefit of humanity. But we must be vigilant and think {{5}} term.', NULL, NULL, NULL, E'1.demand, 2.values, 3.detrimental, 4.above, 5.long', NULL, NULL),
