  ('81fa8150-941d-5ceb-a0ab-7d5fb75c6353'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'READ_ALOUD', E'READ_ALOUD', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '81fa8150-941d-5ceb-a0ab-7d5fb75c6353'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Quantum Computers', E'Quantum physicists show that imperfect timekeeping places a fundamental limit to quantum computers and their applications. The team claims that even tiny timing errors add up to place a significant impact on any large-scale algorithm, posing another problem that must eventually be solved if quantum computers are to fulfill the lofty aspirations that society has for them.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('81fe2dc5-8b7b-5b50-bc57-1100ce32b094'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DRAG_AND_DROP', E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DRAG_AND_DROP', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '81fe2dc5-8b7b-5b50-bc57-1100ce32b094'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Adolescence', E'During adolescence, girls and boys begin to {{1}} with the world in new ways: taking chances experiencing unfamiliar emotions. They venture beyond their families to form powerful {{2}} with peers. Today’s generation of young people is larger than ever before, but far too many are not getting what they need to realize their full {{3}} of rights because of poverty and {{4}} .', NULL, NULL, NULL, E'1.interact, 2.connections, 3.range, 4.deprivation', NULL, NULL),
  ('81ff2df0-7868-5e92-92ac-c10b28a58b76'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'LISTENING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '81ff2df0-7868-5e92-92ac-c10b28a58b76'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'WFD', NULL, 'f80e8c1e-c283-559b-92c5-b94db81fd9a0'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'The timetable for the next term will be available next week.', NULL, NULL),
  ('8202cc5b-be67-5de9-a408-23838c62dda9'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'READ_ALOUD', E'READ_ALOUD', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '8202cc5b-be67-5de9-a408-23838c62dda9'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Medical Digitalization', E'In medicine, the application of information technology means the digitalization of medical records and the establishment of an intelligent network for sharing those records. Other benefits flow from these technological changes. In the past medicine has taken a paternalistic stance, with the all-knowing physician dispensing wisdom, but that is becoming increasingly untenable.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('8203304a-9940-5308-ab5e-dd314ef5f03a'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'LISTENING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '8203304a-9940-5308-ab5e-dd314ef5f03a'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'WFD', NULL, '10b9fef0-b51a-5330-9d04-d1778431fe69'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'The chemistry building is located near the entrance of the campus.', NULL, NULL),
  ('82067dfd-845a-575f-bdbe-5ffb631b9c1b'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'WRITE_ESSAY', E'WRITE_ESSAY', E'WRITING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '82067dfd-845a-575f-bdbe-5ffb631b9c1b'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Factory Nearby', E'If a company plans to open a factory near your home, what are the advantages or disadvantages of it, and will you support it or not?', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 200, 300),
  ('82071e2d-a927-5f96-b98c-e44999246ee8'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'SUMMARIZE_WRITTEN_TEXT', E'SUMMARIZE_WRITTEN_TEXT', E'WRITING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '82071e2d-a927-5f96-b98c-e44999246ee8'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Goosebumps', E'Goosebumps are the result of piloerection, a temporary raising of the hairs on the surface of the skin that occurs when the piloerector muscles contract. These tiny muscles are attached to the individual follicles from which each hair arises. Piloerection is a voluntary response directed by the sympathetic nervous system (the one that triggers the "fight or flight" response), and is elicited by cold, fear or a startling experience. Goosebumps have two functions that serve little purpose to less hairy, modern-day humans. "One is to keep us warm, which they don''t do a very good job at on humans because we''re not furry," Roach, a physician from Canada says. For example, cold weather can trigger piloerection in mammals — as well as birds — causing their hair (or sometimes their feathers) to stand up and then reset. This action can create a layer of air underneath the animal''s fur that helps insulate their bodies from the cold temperatures. Piloerection also occurs when animals perceive a threat is near. In this situation, when the piloerector muscles contract and cause the hair to rise, it creates a "fluffed up" appearance that makes the animal seem larger and may help deter an attack by other animals. As a result, goosebumps serve no real purpose in humans since we evolved to less hairy creatures.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 5, 75),
  ('8213f9db-5342-568d-a5c1-0eb8b7d14f79'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DRAG_AND_DROP', E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DRAG_AND_DROP', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '8213f9db-5342-568d-a5c1-0eb8b7d14f79'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Intellectual Challenge', E'So some of the time an intellectual challenge is to assimilate how similar we can be to other species. In other cases the challenge is to appreciate how, though human physiology {{1}} that of other species, we use the physiology in novel ways. We activate the classical physiology of vigilance while watching a scary movie. We activate a {{2}} response when thinking about mortality. We secrete hormones related to nurturing and social bonding, but in response to an adorable baby panda. And this certainly {{3}} to aggression — we use the same muscles as does a male chimp attacking a sexual competitor, but we use them to harm someone because of their ideology.', NULL, NULL, NULL, E'1.resembles, 2.stress, 3.applies', NULL, NULL),
  ('82165f2e-8413-5b81-8033-0ad0d3d4b29a'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'READ_ALOUD', E'READ_ALOUD', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '82165f2e-8413-5b81-8033-0ad0d3d4b29a'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Busy People', E'Someone who looks extremely active, whose diary is filled from morning till night, who is always running to answer messages and meet clients may appear the opposite of lazy, but secretly, there may be a lot of avoidance going on beneath the outward frenzy. Busy people can evade a different order of undertaking.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('821a497b-ff89-5707-979f-b5c7fc997b1d'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'LISTENING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '821a497b-ff89-5707-979f-b5c7fc997b1d'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'WFD', NULL, '817e5e1e-11d9-5105-a668-be6ced6dcb08'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'Banks are trying to make money from markets that are growing fast.', NULL, NULL),
  ('82224c28-beb5-54a0-a2cb-e92dc5eff578'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DRAG_AND_DROP', E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DRAG_AND_DROP', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '82224c28-beb5-54a0-a2cb-e92dc5eff578'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Energy Market', E'With the aim of liberalizing and de-monopolizing the energy market, and the natural gas market along with it, special companies {{1}} with energy were introduced. These companies {{2}} the job of traders and suppliers of individual market categories with the usage of the aforementioned technological infrastructure. In such conditions, it is necessary to {{3}} special rules of behavior for all the {{4}} in the energy sector.', NULL, NULL, NULL, E'1.dealing, 2.perform, 3.define, 4.participants', NULL, NULL),
  ('82231f01-fafe-5477-8d6d-a78c4c934f8a'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'LISTENING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '82231f01-fafe-5477-8d6d-a78c4c934f8a'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'WFD', NULL, 'cfeadfca-b964-5281-b1cf-4300d41633b9'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'Courses are assessed by group work and individual assignments.', NULL, NULL),
  ('82239b15-1278-5487-b0ba-ba678c598321'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'ANSWER_SHORT_QUESTION', E'ANSWER_SHORT_QUESTION', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '82239b15-1278-5487-b0ba-ba678c598321'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'ASQ', E'Who wrote "The Republic"?', 'd93575d3-e44e-5183-973a-5b47801ed8e7'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'Plato', NULL, NULL),
  ('822cffa5-f844-5d01-b34b-1760f83af5fc'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DROPDOWN', E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DROPDOWN', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '822cffa5-f844-5d01-b34b-1760f83af5fc'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Climate Change Matters', E'Changes in the Earth’s climate can affect ecosystems by altering the water cycle, habitats, animal {{1}} – such as nesting and migration patterns – and the timing of natural processes such as flower blooms. Changes that {{2}} the functioning of ecosystems may increase the risk of harm or even extinction for some species. While wildfires occur naturally, more frequent and more intense fires can significantly disrupt ecosystems, damage property, put people and communities at {{3}} , and create air pollution problems even far away from the source. While plants and animals have adapted to environmental change for millions of years, the climate changes being experienced now could require adaptation on larger and faster scales than current species have successfully achieved in the past, thus {{4}} the risk of extinction or severe disruption for many species.', NULL, NULL, NULL, E'1.behavior, 2.disrupt, 3.risk, 4.increasing', NULL, NULL),
  ('823003cf-3912-50cd-8663-8f09be683a5c'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'LISTENING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '823003cf-3912-50cd-8663-8f09be683a5c'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'WFD', NULL, 'cd7521da-2b16-5a64-abae-b4175119404a'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'The dining hall will undergo renovations during the fall break.', NULL, NULL),
