  ('831bbb54-8237-5cd6-b60a-029723270b49'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'READ_ALOUD', E'READ_ALOUD', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '831bbb54-8237-5cd6-b60a-029723270b49'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Animals', E'Many animals use different modes of communication simultaneously, just as humans use body language and gestures while talking. Any actions made immediately before, during, or after uttering sounds could provide important context for understanding what an animal is trying to convey. Traditionally, researchers have cataloged these behaviors in a list known as an ethogram.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
