  ('8326e733-0b87-5038-9937-f7143855b1a4'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DRAG_AND_DROP', E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DRAG_AND_DROP', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '8326e733-0b87-5038-9937-f7143855b1a4'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Funeral', E'An Australian sheep farmer paid his own unique {{1}} to his beloved aunt. Due to pandemic {{2}} , Ben Jackson was unable to attend his aunt Deb_s funeral that took place 400 kilometers away. He {{3}} grain in the shape of a heart in a field, so that thousands of sheep would come into the field and fill up the vast shape. Like many families {{4}} during the pandemic, Jackson wasn''t able to say goodbye to a loved one, and he felt hopeless.', NULL, NULL, NULL, E'1.tribute, 2.restrictions, 3.scattered, 4.separated', NULL, NULL),
