  ('85790ed1-9ca2-5e9e-a77d-b019dc890f08'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'RE_ORDER_PARAGRAPHS', E'RE_ORDER_PARAGRAPHS', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '85790ed1-9ca2-5e9e-a77d-b019dc890f08'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Effective Communication', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, E'2, 4, 3, 1', NULL, NULL),
  ('857db2c2-c798-5e3a-8d3d-5e575241ee58'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'RE_ORDER_PARAGRAPHS', E'RE_ORDER_PARAGRAPHS', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '857db2c2-c798-5e3a-8d3d-5e575241ee58'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Bugs (B)', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, E'3, 1, 2, 4', NULL, NULL),
  ('857f43a2-d2ff-57ec-889f-f5ca8f65c17f'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DROPDOWN', E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DROPDOWN', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '857f43a2-d2ff-57ec-889f-f5ca8f65c17f'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'B2B Emphasis', E'The tools of marketing are available to both Business-to-Business (B2B) and Business-to-Consumer (B2C) organizations, but some {{1}} tend to be more effective than others in each type of marketing. B2B marketers use more personal selling, in which a sales force builds personal relationships with individuals in decision-making roles to {{2}} sales within the organizations they target. Professional conferences and trade shows provide opportunities for meeting and networking with a B2B marketer’s target customers. Company Web sites are a primary way for B2B organizations to share information and promote their offerings. Since they usually target a narrow, specialized {{3}} of the population, B2B marketers have little need for mass advertising. Because B2B sales {{4}} to be higher-priced, larger-ticket items, marketing tactics often include extensive adjustments in factors such as the selling price, product features, terms of delivery, and so forth.', NULL, NULL, NULL, E'1.tactics, 2.facilitate, 3.sliver, 4.tend', NULL, NULL),
  ('8583f943-5115-551b-8030-6be4f8bbeec4'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DRAG_AND_DROP', E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DRAG_AND_DROP', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '8583f943-5115-551b-8030-6be4f8bbeec4'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Biological Systems', E'Since biological systems with signs of {{1}} engineering are unlikely to have arisen from accidents or coincidences, their {{2}} must come from natural selection, and hence should have {{3}} useful for survival and reproduction in the environments in which humans evolved.', NULL, NULL, NULL, E'1.complex, 2.organization, 3.functions', NULL, NULL),
  ('858588da-716d-5b03-a4b0-e7c18b8b0c89'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'SUMMARIZE_WRITTEN_TEXT', E'SUMMARIZE_WRITTEN_TEXT', E'WRITING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '858588da-716d-5b03-a4b0-e7c18b8b0c89'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Neuroplasticity', E'Neuroplasticity, the brain''s ability to reorganize itself by forming new neural connections throughout life, has become a key concept in understanding mental health and resilience. This remarkable characteristic of the brain is not only fundamental to learning and memory but also plays a crucial role in recovery from brain injury and coping with psychological disorders.\nTraditionally, it was believed that the brain''s structure was relatively fixed after childhood. However, recent research has shown that the brain remains plastic and malleable well into adulthood. This adaptability allows the brain to compensate for injury and adjust to new situations or changes in the environment.\nIn the context of mental health, neuroplasticity offers a hopeful perspective. It suggests that with the right interventions, such as therapy, medication, and lifestyle changes, it is possible to rewire the brain and alleviate symptoms of mental disorders. For instance, cognitive-behavioral therapy (CBT) has been shown to change patterns of thinking and behavior, which is reflected in changes in brain activity.\nFurthermore, practices like mindfulness and meditation have been found to promote neuroplasticity. These activities can lead to structural changes in areas of the brain associated with attention, emotion regulation, and self-awareness, contributing to improved mental health.\nPhysical exercise is another factor that positively influences neuroplasticity. Regular physical activity is known to enhance cognitive function and may even protect against cognitive decline in later life.\nNeuroplasticity also plays a role in resilience, the ability to bounce back from adversity. By understanding and harnessing this adaptability of the brain, individuals can develop coping strategies to overcome challenges and improve their mental well-being.\nIn conclusion, the concept of neuroplasticity is reshaping our understanding of mental health and recovery. It underscores the brain''s capacity for change and adaptation, offering a pathway for healing and resilience in the face of psychological challenges.', NULL, NULL, E'Neuroplasticity, the brain''s ability to form new neural connections, is crucial for mental health and healing, offering hope for recovery from mental disorders through interventions like therapy, mindfulness, and physical exercise, and plays a key role in resilience and adapting to life''s challenges.', NULL, 5, 75),
  ('858a2dcb-64bd-50ef-b3fb-c901fcc29d9a'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'RE_ORDER_PARAGRAPHS', E'RE_ORDER_PARAGRAPHS', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '858a2dcb-64bd-50ef-b3fb-c901fcc29d9a'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Work and Travel', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, E'1, 4, 3, 2', NULL, NULL),
  ('858d72cc-b150-5bc9-a3d6-7fe92a7bd670'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'ANSWER_SHORT_QUESTION', E'ANSWER_SHORT_QUESTION', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '858d72cc-b150-5bc9-a3d6-7fe92a7bd670'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'ASQ', E'What do we call the process of launching a rocket?', 'ca3f986e-ad7e-5f36-b72d-e47813f25583'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'Lift-off / liftoff', NULL, NULL),
  ('858e0a22-f8df-53bd-839e-6754d28320d7'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DRAG_AND_DROP', E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DRAG_AND_DROP', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '858e0a22-f8df-53bd-839e-6754d28320d7'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Chemistry', E'Chemistry is a logical science. You can master the {{1}} concepts in any {{2}} , but it''s probably best to start from the {{3}} and work your way down, since many concepts {{4}} on understanding units, conversion, and how atoms and molecules interact.', NULL, NULL, NULL, E'1.essential, 2.order, 3.top, 4.build', NULL, NULL),
  ('8596cfd6-5eea-5526-8780-e372d8ec62a1'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'SUMMARIZE_WRITTEN_TEXT', E'SUMMARIZE_WRITTEN_TEXT', E'WRITING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '8596cfd6-5eea-5526-8780-e372d8ec62a1'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Frog Amber', E'A miner in the state of Chiapas found a tiny tree frog that has been preserved in amber for 25 million years, a researcher said. If authenticated, the preserved frog would be the first of its kind found in Mexico, according to David Grimaldi, a biologist and curator at the American Museum of Natural History, who was not involved in the find. The chunk of amber containing the frog, less than half an inch long, was uncovered by a miner in Mexico''s southern Chiapas state in 2005 and was bought by a private collector, who loaned it to scientists for study.\nA few other preserved frogs have been found in chunks of amber — a stone formed by ancient tree sap — mostly in the Dominican Republic. Like those, the frog found in Chiapas appears to be of the genus Craugastor, whose descendants still inhabit the region, said biologist Gerardo Carbot of the Chiapas Natural History and Ecology Institute. Carbot announced the discovery this week.\nThe scientist said the frog lived about 25 million years ago, based on the geological strata where the amber was found. Carbot would like to extract a sample from the frog''s remains in hopes of finding DNA that could identify the particular species but doubts the owner would let him drill into the stone.', NULL, NULL, E'A miner found a tiny tree frog that has been preserved in amber for 25 million years, which might be the first of its kind found in Mexico, while a few other preserved frogs have been found in chunks of amber, and the frog lived about 25 million years ago, so Carbot would like to extract a sample from the frog''s remains in hopes of finding DNA that could identify the particular species.', NULL, 5, 75),
  ('8598bc59-8f19-5ec1-b2c8-f9ae838ef4b6'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'LISTENING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '8598bc59-8f19-5ec1-b2c8-f9ae838ef4b6'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'WFD', NULL, 'db1ba2eb-58d7-547a-934f-dbba462cbd0c'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'The course mainly focuses on several different aspects of psychology.', NULL, NULL),
  ('85a11be8-d30f-58bb-bea6-139b5f5530f9'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DRAG_AND_DROP', E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DRAG_AND_DROP', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '85a11be8-d30f-58bb-bea6-139b5f5530f9'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Earth''s Internal Heat', E'Most of Earth’s internal heat is {{1}} over from when our planet formed, about 4.5 billion years ago. Earth and the other planets in the solar system first began to take shape as countless smaller bodies collided and {{2}} together. The energy of those violent collisions {{3}} into heat energy.', NULL, NULL, NULL, E'1.left, 2.clumped, 3.transformed', NULL, NULL),
  ('85a26209-6246-5e80-ac23-d48fbc940719'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'WRITE_ESSAY', E'WRITE_ESSAY', E'WRITING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '85a26209-6246-5e80-ac23-d48fbc940719'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Fund Allocation', E'Which areas of concern should governments allocate funds to? Climate change, education, or public health? Explain your idea with examples.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 200, 300),
  ('85a6d4f6-1c5c-5cbc-9edc-2df624c603e2'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'LISTENING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '85a6d4f6-1c5c-5cbc-9edc-2df624c603e2'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'WFD', NULL, '87e42586-c655-509d-a1d4-ee5febe0d762'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'The study shows the sense of recent technologies.', NULL, NULL),
  ('85ab9479-04c2-5c17-9f5d-aa6f45b771c4'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'RE_ORDER_PARAGRAPHS', E'RE_ORDER_PARAGRAPHS', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '85ab9479-04c2-5c17-9f5d-aa6f45b771c4'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Brain Function', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, E'1, 2, 4, 5, 3', NULL, NULL),
  ('85adb7e0-6ed3-5a68-8ea2-d2b422ce95f7'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'REPEAT_SENTENCE', E'REPEAT_SENTENCE', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '85adb7e0-6ed3-5a68-8ea2-d2b422ce95f7'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'RS', NULL, 'd2f6c543-9812-5a01-971d-c126b6d85244'::uuid, NULL, E'He sold his farm and thus he had enough money for his journey.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('85b0c195-2bb6-5331-9ce9-8429f62b99e5'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'READ_ALOUD', E'READ_ALOUD', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '85b0c195-2bb6-5331-9ce9-8429f62b99e5'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Ecotourism', E'You may have heard of the new fad known as ecotourism. This means tourism which is environmentally friendly, and conscious about conserving the environment. The key is to minimize the physical, social and behavioral impacts of overseas travel. Tour groups will often work with local and indigenous communities to design respectful and memorable programs for visitors.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('85b0de84-e859-50b0-92ab-57a893ad5b84'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'ANSWER_SHORT_QUESTION', E'ANSWER_SHORT_QUESTION', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '85b0de84-e859-50b0-92ab-57a893ad5b84'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'ASQ', E'What is the job title for someone who makes meals in a restaurant?', 'b8a5d9aa-4c5c-5d57-865b-3e7b2aaaa394'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'Chef / cook', NULL, NULL),
  ('85b60e2c-7aec-5dcd-acf5-fe81c908c4a7'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'WRITE_ESSAY', E'WRITE_ESSAY', E'WRITING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '85b60e2c-7aec-5dcd-acf5-fe81c908c4a7'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Success', E'Some people think that earning a lot of money means success, while others believe that having good relationships and enjoying their work is success. What do you think success is? Give examples to support your opinion.', NULL, NULL, E'Success is a subjective concept that can mean different things to different people. While some people believe that success lies in achieving professional and economic targets, I firmly believe that success lies in spending quality time with family and friends. In this essay, I will provide two reasons to support my opinion.\nFirstly, spending quality time with family and friends can lead to stronger relationships. When we invest time in our loved ones, we build trust, create memories, and deepen our connections. This can lead to a more fulfilling life and a sense of belonging. Research has shown that individuals who prioritize their relationships have higher levels of life satisfaction and overall well-being. By nurturing these connections, we can create a support system that uplifts us during challenging times and celebrates our achievements.\nMoreover, spending quality time with family and friends can also improve our well-being. When we prioritize our relationships, we feel happier, less stressed, and more fulfilled. Engaging in activities with loved ones allows us to experience joy, laughter, and a sense of shared purpose. These positive emotions have a direct impact on our mental and physical health. Studies have found that individuals with strong social connections have lower rates of depression, anxiety, and even certain physical illnesses. By investing in our relationships, we are investing in our own well-being.\nIn conclusion, while achieving professional and economic targets can be important, I firmly believe that success ultimately lies in spending quality time with family and friends. By investing in our relationships, we can build stronger connections and improve our well-being. This leads to a more fulfilling life and a deeper sense of purpose.', NULL, 200, 300),
  ('85b99fba-c978-5f28-ac87-f6e49b9d6a01'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DRAG_AND_DROP', E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DRAG_AND_DROP', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '85b99fba-c978-5f28-ac87-f6e49b9d6a01'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Consumption Pattern', E'Differential rates of price change can also shape consumption patterns. To {{1}} their needs and wants, consumers sometimes choose to {{2}} spending on a particular product or service with spending on an alternative product or service in response to a {{3}} price movement of the items.', NULL, NULL, NULL, E'1.satisfy, 2.substitute, 3.relative', NULL, NULL),
  ('85babdee-1954-55ce-a303-9802ccb94a1a'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'READ_ALOUD', E'READ_ALOUD', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '85babdee-1954-55ce-a303-9802ccb94a1a'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Winter Months', E'As the nights draw in and the days turn a little gloomy, the winter months can often have an impact on our mental and physical health. With that in mind, a trip to sunnier climates might be exactly what you need to give your wellbeing a boost.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('85be0a5a-e745-5de1-9a9e-eff33c4f3874'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'ANSWER_SHORT_QUESTION', E'ANSWER_SHORT_QUESTION', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '85be0a5a-e745-5de1-9a9e-eff33c4f3874'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'ASQ', E'What do we call a person from whom you rent a room or a house?', 'dde8234c-6a17-5f9c-8a32-c9181bf090d5'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'Landlord / landlady', NULL, NULL),
  ('85c02bac-7e44-594a-a89f-78eaf1b87e2b'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'ANSWER_SHORT_QUESTION', E'ANSWER_SHORT_QUESTION', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '85c02bac-7e44-594a-a89f-78eaf1b87e2b'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'ASQ', E'In a company, who is responsible for keeping financial accounts?', '1e4cae98-92a6-5ee6-8900-628aa7017d8f'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'Accountant', NULL, NULL),
  ('85c29b32-afb5-5b20-92bb-317ca46ff8f8'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'READ_ALOUD', E'READ_ALOUD', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '85c29b32-afb5-5b20-92bb-317ca46ff8f8'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Recycling', E'The idea behind recycling is simple. By breaking old products down and converting them into something usable again, we conserve natural resources. Sadly it’s not that simple. Recycling is deeply entwined with our economic system, and right now doesn’t make much economic sense. It often costs more to recycle than it does to just throw things away, which is bad news for the environment.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('85cb1130-472e-52fd-918a-f8d81e0c47aa'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'READ_ALOUD', E'READ_ALOUD', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '85cb1130-472e-52fd-918a-f8d81e0c47aa'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Storing Bottled Water', E'If you plan to keep a supply of bottled water at home, you should store it at room temperature or colder, out of direct sunlight and far from any chemicals or solvents. For instance, don''t put it near any gasoline or paint thinners. Your garage is probably not a good storage place for bottled water.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('85cd7ed4-b08e-5358-92de-124a9e42647c'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'RE_ORDER_PARAGRAPHS', E'RE_ORDER_PARAGRAPHS', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '85cd7ed4-b08e-5358-92de-124a9e42647c'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Joints Control', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, E'3, 4, 2, 1', NULL, NULL),
  ('85d229b0-05b7-581e-b8a1-5ed3f63ceecd'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'ANSWER_SHORT_QUESTION', E'ANSWER_SHORT_QUESTION', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '85d229b0-05b7-581e-b8a1-5ed3f63ceecd'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'ASQ', E'What do we call the different forms of money that a country uses?', '13e9f191-dc41-52df-8c0d-ed3389d32d31'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'Currency / Currencies', NULL, NULL),
  ('85d272aa-9869-5de1-be42-752b3ad0a984'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DRAG_AND_DROP', E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DRAG_AND_DROP', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '85d272aa-9869-5de1-be42-752b3ad0a984'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Marriage', E'Marriage is a big step {{1}} anyone''s life and there is an argument to be made {{2}} getting married too early. As any newlywed couple knows, there is a huge amount of financial pressure associated {{3}} marriage. Firstly, the wedding reception and honeymoon cost you an arm and a leg. Then there''s the matter of home loans, rent and energy bills. If you''re looking to start a family, your child''s education is another thing you need to save up {{4}} .Teenagers should probably find a proper job before deciding to tie the {{5}} .', NULL, NULL, NULL, E'1.in, 2.against, 3.with, 4.for, 5.knot', NULL, NULL),
  ('85d2ebc6-42c8-5c14-9231-57933e4da465'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DRAG_AND_DROP', E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DRAG_AND_DROP', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '85d2ebc6-42c8-5c14-9231-57933e4da465'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Vertical Farming', E'In this vertical farming approach, crops grow in stacked layers, often in controlled {{1}} like warehouses or skyscrapers. This method, {{2}} hydroponics and artificial lighting, maximizes space and conserves water. It''s not just a farming method; it''s a visionary step towards sustainable urban living, offering fresher {{3}} with a smaller carbon footprint. As cities grow, vertical farms could be key in feeding burgeoning populations while {{4}} agriculture''s environmental impact.', NULL, NULL, NULL, E'1.environments, 2.harnessing, 3.produce, 4.reducing', NULL, NULL),
  ('85d3dbd9-cfcd-53cb-b583-f083d389eabf'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'RE_TELL_LECTURE', E'RE_TELL_LECTURE', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '85d3dbd9-cfcd-53cb-b583-f083d389eabf'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Suicide', NULL, '054e7663-dc58-54fa-8d44-fdf30b0fa85a'::uuid, NULL, E'Suicide is one of the leading causes of death in our country and actually in the world, and yet it’s largely preventable. It has been trending up in terms of our national rate of suicide over the last decade or so. It had trended down prior to that. So we’re at a place now where we really want to make a difference; we want to use the methods that we know can work to lower the suicide rate and allow those who are struggling to get the help that they need. Mental health problems play a significant role for suicide risk. In fact if you had to pick out one of the many risk factors that tend to come together to create suicide, mental health problems could be called actually a necessary but not significant factor in place. In greater than 90 percent of cases of suicide, as shown in the research, there is a diagnosable mental health condition at play, whether or not it was diagnosed or treated. Now, many other factors then lay on top of that to rise up to create an imminent risk for that sense of desperation, hopelessness but then also the thought and the planning and the ability to act on those suicidal impulses.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('85d4a219-7b97-5564-9cc0-b25fc09ee51b'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'READ_ALOUD', E'READ_ALOUD', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '85d4a219-7b97-5564-9cc0-b25fc09ee51b'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Black Hole', E'According to Einstein’s general theory of relativity, the gravity of a black hole is so intense that nothing can escape it. The more sophisticated understanding of black holes developed by Stephen Hawking and his colleagues did not question this principle. Hawking and others sought to describe matter in and around black holes using quantum theory, but they continued to describe gravity using Einstein’s classical theory.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('85d79091-983e-5e35-8727-1f141556abfd'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'RE_ORDER_PARAGRAPHS', E'RE_ORDER_PARAGRAPHS', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '85d79091-983e-5e35-8727-1f141556abfd'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Online Shopping', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, E'1, 4, 2, 3', NULL, NULL),
  ('85e3b32b-dfcd-50fa-8cb6-b7b54b236160'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'RE_TELL_LECTURE', E'RE_TELL_LECTURE', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '85e3b32b-dfcd-50fa-8cb6-b7b54b236160'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Vitamin E', NULL, '863cb7c1-3d32-5322-bbd0-e348c755f3a8'::uuid, NULL, E'Viatamin E supplementation confirmed as a treatment for liver problems. Hi, I''m Doctor James Meschino. There is a fatty liver condition known as NASH. That is commonly seen in diabetics, pre-diabetics and people who are overweight. NASH stands for non-alcoholic steatohepatitis, a condition where you have an inflamed liver that is not caused by alcohol consumption. It is caused b faulty lifestyle behaviors, lots of fat in the diet in particular. Of course, alcohol consumption can also induce fatty liver problems. But with the obesity epidemic that we have at hand, more and more people are developing fatty liver disease, not from alcohol but from faulty dietary lifestyle patterns and lack of exercise. If it is left unchecked, fatty liver problems can degenerate into cirrhosis. In cirrhosis of the liver, you are getting scar tissue and fibrotic tissue. Nodules start to replace normal liver tissue. With advancing cirrhosis, you can end up with liver failure, requiring a liver transplant. Cirrhosis is the tenth leading cause of death in men in our society. It is the twelfth leading cause of death in women in our society as of 2001. In 2012, new medical guidelines were issued for the management of non-alcoholic steatohepatitis. One of the major recommendations was 800 IUs of vitamin E every day. Why? Well, vitamin E is one of the few agents that has been shown to actually reverse some of the liver damage in people that have this problem. Other studies have also shown recently that vitamin E is linked to prevention of liver cancer in people who are high risk for primary liver cancer. Primary liver cancer is known as hepatocellular carcinoma.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('85e6112e-466e-5c63-9920-90dd96a96898'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'LISTENING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '85e6112e-466e-5c63-9920-90dd96a96898'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'WFD', NULL, 'd1166e33-8cd5-5146-b445-c0d81399e775'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'Online courses allow students to work at their own pace.', NULL, NULL),
  ('85e61152-4397-5b8e-80bc-2eea76883a2a'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'ANSWER_SHORT_QUESTION', E'ANSWER_SHORT_QUESTION', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '85e61152-4397-5b8e-80bc-2eea76883a2a'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'ASQ', E'What do we call a person who believes in the existence of God?', '4a392272-ef31-5894-898f-2077ff2a83bd'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'Theist', NULL, NULL),
  ('85e85cbd-6f3a-5705-9dfb-1e3d9cc9c9c5'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DRAG_AND_DROP', E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DRAG_AND_DROP', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '85e85cbd-6f3a-5705-9dfb-1e3d9cc9c9c5'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Hay-drying Device', E'A novel device for helping farmers to dry out hay more quickly has won a University of Glasgow graduate a prestigious design award.Gavin Armstrong, 23, from Kippen, Stirlingshire {{1}} the Glasgow 1999 Design Medal for his design for a swath inverter -- a {{2}} for flipping over a hay crop to help dry out the damp underside. Dry hay is an essential farmyard food source for sheep and cows.Gavin came up with the design as part of his Product Design Engineering degree course, run in {{3}} with Glasgow School of Art.He built a working prototype of the device which is powered and towed by a tractor and uses a pair of parallel belts to invert the swath. The rollers are driven from one hydraulic motor and are geared so as to spin at the same speed and in opposite directions {{4}} that the touching inner two faces of the belt that perform the inversion move rearwards at the same speed.', NULL, NULL, NULL, E'1.scooped, 2.device, 3.conjunction, 4.ensuring', NULL, NULL),
  ('85eacce0-8b3f-5866-8624-2b222d173672'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'REPEAT_SENTENCE', E'REPEAT_SENTENCE', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '85eacce0-8b3f-5866-8624-2b222d173672'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'RS', NULL, '0b937182-f6c8-56d1-9337-a50f97e507e3'::uuid, NULL, E'It can be a challenge to precisely define this specific word.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
