  ('879853d4-f4d1-5d7e-9091-cf4f41c35335'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DROPDOWN', E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DROPDOWN', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '879853d4-f4d1-5d7e-9091-cf4f41c35335'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Cell Phone Use', E'Ever increasing numbers of people are consuming news via the {{1}} and cell phones. In London last week at the World Conference of Science Journalists, Philip Hilts, the director of the Knight Science Journalism Program at MIT, reviewed the {{4}} state of internet and cell phone use:\n"Internet use, it''s about 1.5 to two billion internet users, {{6}} . And so there''s this discussion about, well, we have it in North America but Africa''s not got it, so we''re on two different planets and so on. That''s true, 5.6 percent in Africa now, 17 percent in Asia, but this is moving very rapidly. In Africa it''s growing 12 times right now. In Asia it''s growing almost six times right now. So the greatest growth is where we''re short in {{7}} .', NULL, NULL, NULL, E'1.internet, 2.worldwide, 3.subscribers, 4.penetration', NULL, NULL),
  ('879e977c-9724-5616-8b1f-73588667a28e'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'RE_ORDER_PARAGRAPHS', E'RE_ORDER_PARAGRAPHS', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '879e977c-9724-5616-8b1f-73588667a28e'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Immigration Policy', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, E'3, 4, 2, 5, 1', NULL, NULL),
  ('87a1232a-f496-57dd-bbe7-1e91882bdaf7'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DROPDOWN', E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DROPDOWN', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '87a1232a-f496-57dd-bbe7-1e91882bdaf7'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Street Photography', E'Imagine weaving through the city''s concrete jungle, camera in hand. You''re not just a tourist catching selfies, you''re a street photographer, hunting for raw moments and telling the city''s story. But this chase comes with its own set of {{1}} . First, there are the legal hoops. Privacy laws and copyright rules can trip you up fast. Asking for permission, especially when emotions run high, requires tact and respect. It''s a constant balance between capturing the real and respecting {{2}} . Tech, while handy, throws its own curveballs. The flood of images online makes standing out tough. Finding your unique voice, cutting through the noise, and making your work {{3}} takes constant reinvention and self-reflection. So, the next time you see a photographer navigating the urban maze, remember the challenges they face. Their lens is a window into the city''s heartbeat, capturing fleeting moments that would {{4}} be lost. Respect their dedication, for they are the storytellers of the streets, preserving the ever-evolving story of life on the streets.', NULL, NULL, NULL, E'1.hurdles, 2.boundaries, 3.matter, 4.otherwise', NULL, NULL),
  ('87a3cd3e-c14d-5d8c-84be-4c97fba8508e'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DROPDOWN', E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DROPDOWN', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '87a3cd3e-c14d-5d8c-84be-4c97fba8508e'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Bones', E'Bones are extremely strong. One of their {{1}} functions is to protect organs. For example, the skull protects the brain; ribs protect {{2}} heart and lungs. There are {{3}} types of joints, including fixed joints, slightly moveable joints, and freely moving joints.', NULL, NULL, NULL, E'1.main, 2.the, 3.three', NULL, NULL),
  ('87acb59e-77be-510c-8934-d1586a71e8f6'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DRAG_AND_DROP', E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DRAG_AND_DROP', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '87acb59e-77be-510c-8934-d1586a71e8f6'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Insects', E'Insects walk on water, snakes {{1}} , and fish swim. Animals move with astounding grace, speed, and versatility: how do they do it, and what can we learn from them? How to Walk on Water and Climb up Walls takes readers on a wondrous journey into the world of animal {{2}} . From basement labs at MIT to the rain forests of Panama, David Hu shows how animals have adapted and evolved to {{3}} their environments, taking advantage of physical laws with results that are startling and ingenious.', NULL, NULL, NULL, E'1.slither, 2.motion, 3.traverse', NULL, NULL),
  ('87afdcd9-c50c-54fc-8deb-28056b6782dc'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'ANSWER_SHORT_QUESTION', E'ANSWER_SHORT_QUESTION', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '87afdcd9-c50c-54fc-8deb-28056b6782dc'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'ASQ', E'What do we call our body''s ability to avoid infection and disease?', '3297c9a6-90e8-5b7e-b97f-ec039ef1c910'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'Immunity', NULL, NULL),
  ('87b3074d-3bba-569d-8232-2024704f319d'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'WRITE_ESSAY', E'WRITE_ESSAY', E'WRITING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '87b3074d-3bba-569d-8232-2024704f319d'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Sport Practice', E'Some young children spend a great amount of their time practicing sports. Discuss the advantages and disadvantages of this.', NULL, NULL, E'Sports have become an increasingly popular activity for young children. While some argue that children should focus more on academic and social development, I believe that spending a great amount of time practicing sports can have many advantages. In this essay, I will discuss the pros and cons of young children spending a great amount of time practicing sports.\nOne major advantage of spending a great amount of time practicing sports is the promotion of physical health and fitness. Regular exercise can help children maintain a healthy weight, reduce the risk of chronic disease, and improve overall physical well-being. Additionally, participating in sports can teach children important life skills such as teamwork, leadership, and perseverance. These skills are essential for success in both personal and professional life.\nHowever, there are also some disadvantages to spending a great amount of time practicing sports. Overemphasis on sports can lead to neglect of academic or social development. Children who focus solely on sports may struggle to keep up with their studies or may miss out on important social experiences. Additionally, overtraining or injuries can have negative effects on physical and mental health. Children who push themselves too hard or experience injuries may suffer from burnout or other negative consequences.\nIn conclusion, spending a great amount of time practicing sports can have both advantages and disadvantages for young children. While it promotes physical health and teaches important life skills, it can also lead to neglect of academics and social development, as well as negative physical and mental health consequences. It is important for parents to find a balance between sports and other activities to ensure their children''s overall well-being.', NULL, 200, 300),
  ('87b7e783-6c72-5376-ab8e-8f428f137489'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'READ_ALOUD', E'READ_ALOUD', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '87b7e783-6c72-5376-ab8e-8f428f137489'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Businiess', E'Business is a dynamic force that shapes economies and societies. It embodies the spirit of entrepreneurship, driving innovation and growth. From startups challenging the status quo to multinational corporations shaping global markets, the business world is a vibrant ecosystem where strategic thinking, risk management, and adaptability are paramount.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('87ba673e-45d0-5e28-bc32-591c55f386ec'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'ANSWER_SHORT_QUESTION', E'ANSWER_SHORT_QUESTION', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '87ba673e-45d0-5e28-bc32-591c55f386ec'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'ASQ', E'There are two main ways to pay for goods bought in a shop, one is by cash, the other is by...?', 'c3678d2d-fe1b-5345-b003-7a20c1857bea'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'Credit card', NULL, NULL),
  ('87c75f4b-b3d2-5110-a1c9-c3e2188bf35b'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'ANSWER_SHORT_QUESTION', E'ANSWER_SHORT_QUESTION', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '87c75f4b-b3d2-5110-a1c9-c3e2188bf35b'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'ASQ', E'What are the people who study history and historical evidence?', '24b46155-f449-53ec-ab75-a5332570fecd'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'Historian', NULL, NULL),
  ('87cfc6c1-987f-5773-8603-0d450949ef71'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'READ_ALOUD', E'READ_ALOUD', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '87cfc6c1-987f-5773-8603-0d450949ef71'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Bone Density', E'The bone density test is painless and quick. It estimates how dense or thick your bones are by using X-rays. The X-rays measure how much calcium and minerals are in a part of your bone. The more minerals you have, the better, which means your bones are stronger, denser, and less likely to break.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('87d3e8f8-fbe2-52ed-8dd5-bee13f5db0dd'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'RE_ORDER_PARAGRAPHS', E'RE_ORDER_PARAGRAPHS', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '87d3e8f8-fbe2-52ed-8dd5-bee13f5db0dd'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Tropical Cyclones', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, E'3, 1, 2, 4', NULL, NULL),
  ('87e1adae-62c4-5329-97f4-71b8c2c2b86e'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'LISTENING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '87e1adae-62c4-5329-97f4-71b8c2c2b86e'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'WFD', NULL, 'e538272c-4905-576b-8cdd-67e7d75991ce'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'The scientists now study a wide variety of atmospheric processes.', NULL, NULL),
  ('87e2be0b-10e0-5756-92d7-aa6da2d14e49'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'ANSWER_SHORT_QUESTION', E'ANSWER_SHORT_QUESTION', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '87e2be0b-10e0-5756-92d7-aa6da2d14e49'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'ASQ', E'What do we call the sudden occurrence of intense high winds, often with rain, snow, or hail?', '860c93b4-c5c1-555d-819d-900f3dc2a530'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'Storm', NULL, NULL),
  ('87e51ac8-191b-5e6c-a215-f65eb595222e'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'RE_TELL_LECTURE', E'RE_TELL_LECTURE', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '87e51ac8-191b-5e6c-a215-f65eb595222e'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Partisan Politics', NULL, 'a10f449b-f158-5e1c-b777-1aa85da86d8d'::uuid, NULL, E'The American people are fed up with partisan politics. In a recent Gallup poll Americans named dissatisfaction with government as the number one problem facing our country today. Americans now believe our government is has more problems from economy, education and terrorism. To change the way our elected officials work for the American people, we must change how they are elected. We need to start with the first round of voting, the primaries. Thanks to gerrymandering and other factors, the primary election is often the only election that matters. In many states, less than 5% of the electorate are actually deciding who represents 100% of that district or state. That means that our elected officials are being chosen by an increasingly tiny, often incredibly partisan slice of the electorate. Today 42% of Americans identify themselves as independents. Most states exclude independent voters from voting in the first round, the primaries. And in states that do allow them to vote in primaries, they are forced to temporarily join a party that they don''t believe in. A Top Two nonpartisan primary eliminates party control in favor of a single, nonpartisan primary open to all voters and all candidates. There is no longer a Democratic primary and a Republican primary, there is one primary open to all voters and all candidates. The top two vote getters, regardless of party, then move forward to the general election. With nonpartisan primaries everyone gets to vote. The winners are more accountable, because they have to speak to all the voters in order to get elected. Elections are more competitive. Legislators are encouraged to work across party lines and focus on issues we care about. Top Two nonpartisan primaries are now used in California, Washington and Nebraska at the state level. You''ve probably already voted using Top Two. Most municipal elections nationwide use this simple, nonpartisan system. Today, activists in all 50 states are working to bring this crucial system change to their state. The movement is growing. Join us and help us create a government that truly is by and for the people.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('87e79c2f-7845-5cc7-941c-66cc40dbaa9e'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'LISTENING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '87e79c2f-7845-5cc7-941c-66cc40dbaa9e'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'WFD', NULL, 'ab87b4bc-802c-5248-be26-97c8ec7deca3'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'Recession triggers exciting creativity, according to public wisdom.', NULL, NULL),
  ('87e7dbc0-0df2-5bef-9315-703640c39886'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'REPEAT_SENTENCE', E'REPEAT_SENTENCE', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '87e7dbc0-0df2-5bef-9315-703640c39886'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'RS', NULL, '0fd44a95-21ae-59cc-b5d0-2ad09a608929'::uuid, NULL, E'Our collections are available digitally in a number of ways.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('87e9c83c-eb5f-51ea-9903-fab4ccedc79e'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'RE_TELL_LECTURE', E'RE_TELL_LECTURE', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '87e9c83c-eb5f-51ea-9903-fab4ccedc79e'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Usable Privacy and Security', NULL, 'feee1d5c-2e13-595d-a972-a8677ef8b37b'::uuid, NULL, E'I''m a computer science and engineering professor here in Carnegie Mellon, and my research focuses on usable privacy. And so my friends like to give me examples of their frustrations with computing systems, especially frustrations related to usable privacy and security. Excuse me, so passwords are somethings that I hear a lot about. A lot of people are frustrated with passwords, and it''s bad enough when you have to have one really good password that you can remember, but nobody else is going to able to guess. But what do you do when you have accounts on a hundred different systems and you''re supposed to have a unique password for each of these systems? It''s tough. At Carnegie Mellon, they used to make it actually pretty easy for us to remember our passwords. The password requirement up through 2009 was just that you had to have a password with at least one character. Pretty easy. But then they changed things, and at the end of 2009, they announced that we were going to have a new policy, and this new policy required passwords that were at least eight characters long, with an uppercase letter, lowercase letter, a digit, a symbol, you couldn''t use the same character more than three times, and it wasn''t allowed to be in a dictionary.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('87ecadd7-428f-5a78-a248-9be4b8751b73'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'ANSWER_SHORT_QUESTION', E'ANSWER_SHORT_QUESTION', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '87ecadd7-428f-5a78-a248-9be4b8751b73'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'ASQ', E'What is the capital of the United Kingdom?', 'dc910ce1-7b10-55f1-8b40-7fa58a05ab9c'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'London', NULL, NULL),
  ('87efe7e4-3dd6-52e2-ac61-6ece61c3e378'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DRAG_AND_DROP', E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DRAG_AND_DROP', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '87efe7e4-3dd6-52e2-ac61-6ece61c3e378'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Humans Locomotion', E'Humans are unique among primates because our {{1}} mode of locomotion is walking fully {{2}} . Unfortunately, the changes made in our pelvis to help us move on two legs, in combination with babies with large brains, makes human childbirth unusually {{3}} compared with the rest of the animal kingdom. Unlike other primates, humans have a lumbar curve in the lower back, leaving us {{4}} to lower back pain and strain.', NULL, NULL, NULL, E'1.chief, 2.upright, 3.dangerous, 4.vulnerable', NULL, NULL),
  ('87f96234-041a-5c20-b037-e0210f659544'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'LISTENING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '87f96234-041a-5c20-b037-e0210f659544'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'WFD', NULL, '91aa5b45-bc49-58b7-b984-6234bbd2b433'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'Many graduates of journalism can get jobs in the communications field.', NULL, NULL),
  ('87fdcada-9367-5ccf-880d-be4097c582dd'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'READ_ALOUD', E'READ_ALOUD', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '87fdcada-9367-5ccf-880d-be4097c582dd'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Hydrogen Stations', E'Stations shutting down for unscheduled maintenance reduces hydrogen fueling availability to consumers and may slow the adoption of these types of fuel cell electric vehicles, the researchers noted. The use of what is known as a prognostic health monitoring model would allow hydrogen stations to reduce these unscheduled events.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('87ffd30e-e976-5c95-9768-df8db4d474ed'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DRAG_AND_DROP', E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DRAG_AND_DROP', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '87ffd30e-e976-5c95-9768-df8db4d474ed'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Music Show', E'Last night, I went to a grand music show at the city hall. The auditorium was filled with excited audiences. Some people, unfortunately, were chatting {{1}} , ignoring the performers onstage, seemingly unaware of the rudeness. {{2}} , I was determined not to let that spoil my mood. I closed my eyes, {{3}} to block out the noise, and still tried my best to focus on the soulful music, {{4}} myself in the wonderful melodies.', NULL, NULL, NULL, E'1.constantly, 2.However, 3.trying, 4.immersing', NULL, NULL),
  ('8814f050-61ad-5c7f-aa0f-759bff63d6e9'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'READ_ALOUD', E'READ_ALOUD', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '8814f050-61ad-5c7f-aa0f-759bff63d6e9'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Grey Whale', E'Eastern North Pacific gray whales are one of the few populations of large whales that have recovered to what may be similar numbers that existed prior to commercial whaling. As the population has approached levels close to what their Arctic feeding areas can support, they have likely become more sensitive to environmental conditions due to competition for limited resources.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
