  ('89116c60-8cc3-50ff-93f2-e356228180f5'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DRAG_AND_DROP', E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DRAG_AND_DROP', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '89116c60-8cc3-50ff-93f2-e356228180f5'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Spinal Cord Injury', E'Many organs and tissues in the body can recover after injury without {{1}} .Unfortunately, some cells of the central nervous system are so {{2}} that they cannot divide and create new cells. As a result, recovery from a brain or spinal cord injury is much more difficult. The {{3}} of the central nervous system makes the {{4}} of the right connections between brain and spinal cord cells very difficult.', NULL, NULL, NULL, E'1.intervention, 2.specialized, 3.complexity, 4.formation', NULL, NULL),
  ('8915fdf0-2d12-5e5d-ba5b-eb0124486126'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DRAG_AND_DROP', E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DRAG_AND_DROP', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '8915fdf0-2d12-5e5d-ba5b-eb0124486126'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Secondary School', E'Secondary school can be a lonely place for {{1}} who don''t have a best friend or a group of {{2}} friends. Young people will be more skilled in the art of making genuine friends (and keeping them) if they know how to be {{3}} , are optimistic about life, have some {{4}} social skills and have a relationship with a parent/carer that includes {{5}} talk.', NULL, NULL, NULL, E'1.adolescents, 2.trusted, 3.assertive, 4.basic, 5.honest', NULL, NULL),
  ('89240dcd-9e88-5b0e-af32-9c4b911e182b'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'LISTENING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '89240dcd-9e88-5b0e-af32-9c4b911e182b'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'WFD', NULL, 'db559c61-3bcb-539c-b137-af2bd7504f1f'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'This island marks the southernmost point of the large bay.', NULL, NULL),
  ('8927f398-3bd2-52fa-9cbd-a89bc78fe30d'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'READ_ALOUD', E'READ_ALOUD', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '8927f398-3bd2-52fa-9cbd-a89bc78fe30d'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Astronaut Candidates', E'People who want to become astronauts must be in top physical condition. Each country''s space program has health requirements for its space travelers. They usually assess a candidate''s fitness to withstand some pretty tough conditions. For example, a good candidate must have the ability to endure the rigors of lift-off and to function in weightlessness.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('892da5f3-4b75-5f54-81c6-c873a18d141b'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'ANSWER_SHORT_QUESTION', E'ANSWER_SHORT_QUESTION', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '892da5f3-4b75-5f54-81c6-c873a18d141b'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'ASQ', E'What is the opposite of the word ''public''?', 'f85988b6-a4c7-56f3-9862-079310030bdf'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'Private', NULL, NULL),
  ('8930ded1-f12c-547b-bc56-6595f2ff8b8e'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'ANSWER_SHORT_QUESTION', E'ANSWER_SHORT_QUESTION', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '8930ded1-f12c-547b-bc56-6595f2ff8b8e'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'ASQ', E'What is the quickest way to travel from Hong Kong to Paris?', 'aec1a361-d2e0-5e71-862a-0e464a418c7e'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'Plane / by plane / airplane', NULL, NULL),
  ('8931c9c7-7d28-5b73-8e3f-9a969c02153d'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DROPDOWN', E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DROPDOWN', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '8931c9c7-7d28-5b73-8e3f-9a969c02153d'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Learning', E'Learning to ride a bicycle as an adult can be challenging, especially for a beginner. A trained {{1}} can guide learners through basic techniques and help them feel more {{2}} on the road. The purpose is not to become a professional rider immediately, but to build balance and {{3}} . Even an {{4}} can improve with regular practice. Later, some learners may join outdoor events or friendly {{5}} .', NULL, NULL, NULL, E'1.instructor, 2.comfortable, 3.confidence, 4.amateur, 5.competitions', NULL, NULL),
  ('8934fccc-64cb-53fa-af9f-dc54881046df'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'RE_TELL_LECTURE', E'RE_TELL_LECTURE', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '8934fccc-64cb-53fa-af9f-dc54881046df'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Camel Fat', NULL, '6537e26e-fa81-57f7-9efa-05a2e0d2fb8b'::uuid, NULL, E'You see, camels are one of the only animals in the world that store all their fat in one spot. And that’s useful for keeping cool in a hot climate because heat can escape faster from the rest of their body, which helps them maintain a lower body temperature. Compare that to other mammals, like humans, who store fat all over, making it a lot harder to stay cool. Today, camels still use the fat in their humps as a food reserve, but they’re not the only ones. In extreme circumstances, the Turkana tribe in Kenya, for example will eat camel fat to survive.\nThey suffer a lot from periods of extreme drought, and I have seen these people, they’ve been very, very short on food, and this is difficult to believe, but it’s true, slit open the top of a camel’s hump, take out the fat for their own consumption, and then put the top of the hump back on again.\nBut don’t worry, the camel makes a full recovery and instances are rare. But this practice has started to generate some buzz around camel fat as a new superfood. Turns out, camel fat is loaded with fatty acids, vitamins, and minerals.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('8935f788-a5d2-5015-a22c-889234363b2c'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'REPEAT_SENTENCE', E'REPEAT_SENTENCE', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '8935f788-a5d2-5015-a22c-889234363b2c'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'RS', NULL, 'ebd1025e-d28b-59db-b18a-33986ec17483'::uuid, NULL, E'By logging in, you agree to all terms and conditions regarding your enrollment.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('8937ed28-e002-5a55-b68f-917faa6a2f4a'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DRAG_AND_DROP', E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DRAG_AND_DROP', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '8937ed28-e002-5a55-b68f-917faa6a2f4a'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Desertification', E'The deserts, which already {{1}} approximately a fourth of the Earth''s land surface, have in recent decades been {{2}} at an alarming pace. The expansion of desert-like conditions into areas where they did not {{3}} exist is called desertification. It has been estimated that an additional one-fourth of the Earth''s land surface is {{4}} by this process.', NULL, NULL, NULL, E'1.occupy, 2.increasing, 3.previously, 4.threatened', NULL, NULL),
  ('89387b80-b2a1-5cc2-a997-cb2e40149788'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'REPEAT_SENTENCE', E'REPEAT_SENTENCE', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '89387b80-b2a1-5cc2-a997-cb2e40149788'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'RS', NULL, '1d0d4132-7046-596b-8e7b-ed150b347be5'::uuid, NULL, E'We have been trained to investigate how cultural systems matter in this situation.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('8938a2ca-f209-5740-af70-a7f3944b12f7'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'REPEAT_SENTENCE', E'REPEAT_SENTENCE', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '8938a2ca-f209-5740-af70-a7f3944b12f7'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'RS', NULL, 'cbdb1f14-13b2-5281-9f81-0b8bcaf9f4c5'::uuid, NULL, E'The woman went to a lawyer for some advice on her case.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('893aa179-8b1b-5757-8fc7-b3d3438614f6'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DROPDOWN', E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DROPDOWN', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '893aa179-8b1b-5757-8fc7-b3d3438614f6'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Imposter Syndrome', E'Many people struggle with feeling like frauds, even when they have achieved success and recognition in their fields. This phenomenon, known as imposter syndrome, can {{1}} one’s confidence and prevent one from pursuing new opportunities. Imposter syndrome is not an official diagnosis, but it affects around 25 to 30 percent of high achievers and 70 percent of adults at {{2}} point in their lives. Imposter syndrome is driven by personality traits such as self-efficacy, perfectionism, and neuroticism, as well as {{3}} environments that create pressure and expectations. People with imposter syndrome tend to {{4}} their accomplishments to external or transient factors, such as luck, timing, or effort, rather than their own abilities and talents. They also fear making mistakes and being exposed as incompetent or unintelligent. To overcome imposter syndrome, experts suggest {{5}} one’s expertise and achievements, focusing on one’s own goals and standards, expecting to learn from errors, and seeking support from mentors and peers who have faced similar challenges. By confronting imposter syndrome, one can unlock their full potential and enjoy their success with confidence.', NULL, NULL, NULL, E'1.undermine, 2.some, 3.competitive, 4.attribute, 5.acknowledging', NULL, NULL),
  ('894cd24d-5292-5f35-a822-77d67b1df331'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'LISTENING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '894cd24d-5292-5f35-a822-77d67b1df331'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'WFD', NULL, 'c749093c-fa3b-5786-ad75-1b9e9804cf3c'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'Research and marketing are crucial when introducing a new product.', NULL, NULL),
  ('894cf309-e4b6-5ff4-a8f6-e6e75e3e6d2e'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DRAG_AND_DROP', E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DRAG_AND_DROP', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '894cf309-e4b6-5ff4-a8f6-e6e75e3e6d2e'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Food Choices', E'The food we eat every day keeps us alive, but it can also {{1}} big health and environmental costs — heart disease, carbon emissions, soil {{2}} , and more. A recent study published in Nature Food finds that small {{3}} in the food choices Americans make could have outsized benefits to both health and planet.', NULL, NULL, NULL, E'1.incur, 2.degradation, 3.shifts', NULL, NULL),
  ('894e1bc3-6d50-5ed5-90be-893b42fed3c0'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'RESPOND_TO_A_SITUATION', E'RESPOND_TO_A_SITUATION', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '894e1bc3-6d50-5ed5-90be-893b42fed3c0'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Cafe Job', E'You are interested in applying for a job in the school cafe. You know that the boss is looking for someone with experience, which you are actually currently lacking. However, you are eager to learn and determined to work hard. What do you have to say to get this chance?', '93f6f3a5-d0c5-5ac2-bba4-4182055e9a34'::uuid, NULL, E'Respected boss, I hope you are doing well.\nI would like to discuss an issue we have encountered with my application for the school cafe job.\nIt appears that I’m eager to apply for this position. Though I don’t have relevant work experience now, I am quick to learn and willing to put in lots of effort for the job.\nI would appreciate your opinion on this matter. Thank you for your consideration.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('8959810d-0072-50bb-aac5-0a1b7d63890b'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'READ_ALOUD', E'READ_ALOUD', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '8959810d-0072-50bb-aac5-0a1b7d63890b'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Black Swan', E'Before European explorers had reached Australia, it was believed that all swans were white. Dutch mariner, Antonie Caen, was the first to be amazed at the sight of Australia''s Black swans on the Shark Bay in 1636. Explorer Willem de Vlamingh captured two of these creatures on Australia''s Swan River and returned with them to Europe to prove their existence. From that point on, black swans and Australia have been closely linked.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('895ce55f-cbaf-52ae-8a16-58994d24e0a9'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DROPDOWN', E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DROPDOWN', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '895ce55f-cbaf-52ae-8a16-58994d24e0a9'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Sigmund Freud', E'That Sigmund Freud became a major intellectual presence in twentieth-century culture is not in doubt. {{1}} is there any doubt that at all times there was both fervent enthusiasm over and bitter hostility to his ideas and influence. But the exact means {{2}} Freud became, despite this hostility, a master of intellectual life, on a par, already in the 1920s, with Karl Marx, Albert Einstein, Marie Curie and Bertrand Russell, has not been sufficiently explored. Strikingly, Freud emerged as a twentieth-century icon without the endorsement and support {{3}} an institution or a profession (in contrast to Einstein, Curie and Russell). Where are we to look for the details of this story of an emergent - and new - figure of immense cultural authority? One of the principal aims of this book is to show how this happened in one local, parochial yet privileged, site - Cambridge, then as now a university town stranded in the English Fens with a relatively small {{4}} population.', NULL, NULL, NULL, E'1.Nor, 2.by which, 3.of, 4.fluctuating', NULL, NULL),
  ('89690a1e-6913-55ca-8db3-af7de2899f75'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'REPEAT_SENTENCE', E'REPEAT_SENTENCE', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '89690a1e-6913-55ca-8db3-af7de2899f75'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'RS', NULL, '31d56bc8-dce4-5068-848a-d184dfb1262c'::uuid, NULL, E'She clenched her fists to stop herself from trembling.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
