  ('8c118b7b-951d-55e9-9d80-5780b16c491f'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DRAG_AND_DROP', E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DRAG_AND_DROP', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '8c118b7b-951d-55e9-9d80-5780b16c491f'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Race and Ethnicity', E'The concepts of race and ethnicity can be {{1}} and difficult to untangle, with many different definitions and {{2}} . Race is often used to describe a person’s {{3}} appearance, such as their skin color or facial features. Unlike race, ethnicity is based on shared cultural practices and beliefs, and it is often used to describe the cultural traditions and {{4}} of a particular group of people.', NULL, NULL, NULL, E'1.contentious, 2.interpretations, 3.physical, 4.heritage', NULL, NULL),
  ('8c12063a-7dbb-5298-aa72-63a774cb4e3b'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'READ_ALOUD', E'READ_ALOUD', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '8c12063a-7dbb-5298-aa72-63a774cb4e3b'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Itchy Hands and Feet', E'When your hands and feet itch, the right treatment can bring you some relief. How you treat the itching, though, depends a lot on the cause of the problem. It may just be dry skin, which can be brought on by winter weather or too much scrubbing. But sometimes, itchy hands and feet can signal another health condition.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
