  ('8c1b5cbb-9763-5ac4-bdc3-761c00ba937f'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DRAG_AND_DROP', E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DRAG_AND_DROP', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '8c1b5cbb-9763-5ac4-bdc3-761c00ba937f'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Truth about Intelligence', E'Far from being an indefinable concept, a single measure of intelligence {{1}} our problem-solving, musicality and even creativity and emotional skills. When researchers talk about intelligence, they are {{2}} to a specific set of skills that includes the abilities to reason, learn, plan and solve problems. These skills seem to {{3}} a broad mental capability, which has been dubbed general intelligence.', NULL, NULL, NULL, E'1.underpins, 2.referring, 3.reflect', NULL, NULL),
