  ('8cc7c19b-8cb4-501e-b196-d229800b627a'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'ANSWER_SHORT_QUESTION', E'ANSWER_SHORT_QUESTION', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '8cc7c19b-8cb4-501e-b196-d229800b627a'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'ASQ', E'Which organ does the word “cerebral” relate to?', '9c89cc9e-6ee0-53df-8391-20f817705fbe'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'Brain', NULL, NULL),
  ('8cc84cd7-af41-588d-9f3a-f4d47b5c5af1'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'RE_ORDER_PARAGRAPHS', E'RE_ORDER_PARAGRAPHS', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '8cc84cd7-af41-588d-9f3a-f4d47b5c5af1'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Prime Movers', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, E'2, 4, 3, 1', NULL, NULL),
  ('8cc907c9-5750-58c2-89da-4b471898f96c'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'READ_ALOUD', E'READ_ALOUD', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '8cc907c9-5750-58c2-89da-4b471898f96c'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Technologies', E'Technology strengthens learning and dominates over the conventional methods in too many aspects. Technologies are advancing learning procedure by their multiple formats, variety of resources, numerous delivery channels and not restricted to time, space and place. Social media is a new form of communication that transformed the entire landscape of information access and dissemination online.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('8ccbad86-b325-50f3-b0dc-431f56c5ce13'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DROPDOWN', E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DROPDOWN', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '8ccbad86-b325-50f3-b0dc-431f56c5ce13'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'International Monetary Fund', E'The International Monetary Fund (IMF) is an international financial organization made up of 190 member countries. Headquartered in Washington, D.C., the IMF works to {{1}} global monetary cooperation, secure financial stability, facilitate fair international trade, promote high employment and sustainable economic growth, and reduce poverty around the world. The IMF is both {{2}} to and governed by its near-global membership of 190 countries. The Board of Governors is the highest decision-making body of the IMF. It consists of one governor and one alternate governor from each member country. The governor is {{3}} by the member country and is usually the minister of finance or the head of the central bank. The day-to-day work of the IMF is overseen by its 24-member Executive Board, which {{4}} the entire membership and is supported by IMF staff. The Managing Director is the head of the IMF staff and Chair of the Executive Board and is assisted by four Deputy Managing Directors. The primary functions of the IMF are lending, economic condition surveillance, and technical {{5}} to member countries.', NULL, NULL, NULL, E'1.foster, 2.accountable, 3.appointed, 4.oversees, 5.assistance', NULL, NULL),
  ('8ccf8717-d3a9-563c-8569-e2b414db42be'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'REPEAT_SENTENCE', E'REPEAT_SENTENCE', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '8ccf8717-d3a9-563c-8569-e2b414db42be'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'RS', NULL, '2ca992be-ac7f-512b-b81f-ae1be5a4cc36'::uuid, NULL, E'Their work provides support to numerous projects related to the goals of the departments.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('8cd8321d-5cb2-5982-95c1-260fccc2ad96'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'MC_LISTENING_SINGLE', E'MC_LISTENING_SINGLE', E'LISTENING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '8cd8321d-5cb2-5982-95c1-260fccc2ad96'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Glasses', E'First there was the keyboard, then the touch screen. Some tech companies say a wearable pair of glasses could be the next leap in technology, even if it didn''t work out for Google glass. In the future we won''t be only limited to our smartphones, when it comes to understanding the world around us. So this is our early investment in that future. The US-based company Snap''s investment is this, the Spectacles 3 sunglasses. This third version is smarter than the previous ones. It has two cameras. The corner of the glasses lights up when recording video, and allows the wearer to put 3D objects in the video. Here are some flowers. Users can capture up to a minute of video.\n\nWhich one of the following statements about the Spectacles 3 glasses is true?', 'f1bcd1af-91ae-5942-abd9-a0712d4a5852'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'It is able to make a one-minute long video.', NULL, NULL),
  ('8cdfbc31-22dd-5e9d-a524-1fa2134e8e79'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'SUMMARIZE_WRITTEN_TEXT', E'SUMMARIZE_WRITTEN_TEXT', E'WRITING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '8cdfbc31-22dd-5e9d-a524-1fa2134e8e79'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Pet Ownership', E'Pets, particularly cats and dogs, have long held a special place in the hearts of humans. Their companionship, loyalty, and ability to bring joy into our lives make them cherished members of our families. Cats, known for their independent nature, offer a sense of calm and tranquility. Their purring can be soothing, and their playful antics can brighten even the dullest of days. Cats require relatively low maintenance and are well-suited for people with busy lifestyles. On the other hand, dogs are known for their boundless enthusiasm and loyalty. They thrive on human interaction and make excellent companions for those who enjoy outdoor activities. Dogs provide not only companionship but also a sense of security, as they often form strong protective bonds with their owners. The benefits of pet ownership extend beyond companionship. Studies have shown that having a cat or dog can reduce stress, lower blood pressure, and alleviate symptoms of anxiety and depression. The simple act of petting an animal can release endorphins and promote a sense of well-being. Moreover, pets teach responsibility and empathy, especially in children. Caring for a pet instills a sense of commitment and compassion, as individuals must meet their pet''s needs and provide love and attention. However, pet ownership also comes with responsibilities. Proper care, including feeding, grooming, and regular veterinary visits, is essential for the well-being of these furry friends. Additionally, it''s crucial to consider the time, space, and resources required to provide a happy and healthy life for your pet. In conclusion, cats and dogs bring immeasurable joy and comfort to our lives. They offer companionship, reduce stress, and teach important life lessons. Owning a pet is a rewarding experience that can enrich our lives in countless ways, making them beloved members of our families.', NULL, NULL, E'Cats and dogs, as cherished companions, provide not only joy, loyalty, and therapeutic benefits, but also teach responsibility and empathy, making them beloved members of our families while necessitating proper care and consideration of the responsibilities associated with pet ownership.', NULL, 5, 75),
  ('8ce6b777-5522-5369-bbe3-777faebe8b0c'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'LISTENING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '8ce6b777-5522-5369-bbe3-777faebe8b0c'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'WFD', NULL, '4609cb1f-a566-593a-a495-6500ce665515'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'This study period can be shortened under a strict condition.', NULL, NULL),
