  ('8d089ee2-2d31-56b2-9ecd-77a648b806ec'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'LISTENING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '8d089ee2-2d31-56b2-9ecd-77a648b806ec'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'WFD', NULL, '57ffb7d0-b7bd-531b-b34c-662409c26582'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'There is a point between chemistry and other sides of subjects.', NULL, NULL),
  ('8d0f00bd-9966-53b8-a1a2-81180012d211'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'WRITE_ESSAY', E'WRITE_ESSAY', E'WRITING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '8d0f00bd-9966-53b8-a1a2-81180012d211'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Business Profit', E'Business whether big or small is to maximize profit. Do you agree with that? Give your opinion.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 200, 300),
  ('8d157c6d-4d3c-5881-8e4e-ba8b6c41f0bb'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'RE_TELL_LECTURE', E'RE_TELL_LECTURE', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '8d157c6d-4d3c-5881-8e4e-ba8b6c41f0bb'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Churchill', NULL, '48abffb8-bc60-5910-8020-15dd61d79f4a'::uuid, NULL, E'The Right Honorable Sir Winston Leonard Spencer--Churchill, KG, OM, CH, FRS, PC(November 30, 1874 – January 24, 1965) was a British statesman, best known as prime minister of the United Kingdom during the Second World War. At various times a soldier, journalist, author, and politician, Churchill is generally regarded as one of the most important leaders in British and world history. Considered reactionary on some issues, such as granting independence to Britain''s colonies and at times regarded as a self--promoter who changed political parties to further his career, it was his wartime leadership that earned him iconic status. Some of his peacetime decisions, such as restoring the Gold Standard in 1924, were disastrous as was his World War I decision to land troops on the Dardanelles. However, during 1940, when Britain alone opposed Hitler''s Nazi Germany in the free world, his stirring speeches inspired, motivated, and uplifted a whole people during their darkest hour.Churchill saw himself as a champion of democracy against tyranny, and was profoundly aware of his own role and destiny. Indeed, he believed that God had placed him on earth to carry out heroic deeds for the protection of Christian civilization and human progress. A providential under standing of history would concur with Churchill''s self--understanding. Considered old--fashioned, even reactionary by some people today, he was actually a visionary whose dream was of a united world, beginning with a union of the English--speaking peoples, then embracing all cultures. In his youth, he cut a dashing figure as a cavalry officer as seen in the 1972 film Young Winston (directed by Richard Attenborough), but the images of him that are the most widely remembered are as a rather overweight, determined, even pugnacious looking senior statesman as he is depicted to the right.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('8d185d78-a523-5a7d-a517-5c933f435870'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'LISTENING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '8d185d78-a523-5a7d-a517-5c933f435870'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'WFD', NULL, '8b23c391-dc1b-5dd0-89e6-6d5b85b7f0fa'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'Fast food has become very popular with many students.', NULL, NULL),
  ('8d1b63a4-1aa4-50bd-bf33-c2fddcdf8dba'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'MC_LISTENING_SINGLE', E'MC_LISTENING_SINGLE', E'LISTENING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '8d1b63a4-1aa4-50bd-bf33-c2fddcdf8dba'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Business Management', E'True to listen to part of a talk in a business management class. Management requires a great deal of energy and effort more than most people care to make. One factor that affects managers and inhibits their capacity to provide leadership is stress. Stress has lots of causes, work overload, criticism from workers, and can have negative health effects, including loss of sleep. It''s a fact managers have to deal with stress. Some handle it by making time to be by themselves, must have some favorite place or pastime, a beach to walk on, maybe a stream to fish in or a game to play with the kids. It''s important to have some form of rest and relaxation, creating art, working with your hands, gardening, playing sports. The list goes on. Rest doesn''t always mean inactivity. For some people, exercise is rest.\n\nWhat is the professor''s opinion of rest?', 'b0de263f-15fe-53d9-b9e5-73ffd9543421'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'Activity and exercise are forms of rest.', NULL, NULL),
  ('8d1f3db1-d52d-5a69-99b5-808846db8930'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'REPEAT_SENTENCE', E'REPEAT_SENTENCE', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '8d1f3db1-d52d-5a69-99b5-808846db8930'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'RS', NULL, 'fc3726e1-aebb-57c3-b6d1-9a273b49bf35'::uuid, NULL, E'You can only choose one subject from biology and chemistry.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('8d251039-85ac-5731-8ab5-ebcefc8cf6db'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'WRITE_ESSAY', E'WRITE_ESSAY', E'WRITING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '8d251039-85ac-5731-8ab5-ebcefc8cf6db'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Common Exams', E'Exams are commonly used in most schools and universities. Some people think exams should be replaced by other forms of assessment. Do you agree or disagree?', NULL, NULL, E'Exams have long been a standard form of assessment in most schools and universities. However, some people believe that exams should be replaced by other forms of assessment. In this essay, I will argue in favor of replacing exams with other forms of assessment, including their limitations in measuring practical skills and creativity, the negative impact on students'' mental health, and the need for more inclusive and accessible forms of assessment.\nOne of the most significant limitations of exams is that they fail to measure practical skills and creativity effectively. Exams tend to focus on memorization and recall of information, rather than practical application and creativity. Other forms of assessment, such as projects and presentations, can better assess these skills. For example, a project that requires students to design a solution to a real-world problem can assess their ability to apply knowledge and think creatively.\nAnother reason to replace exams with other forms of assessment is the negative impact they can have on students'' mental health. Exams can create a high-pressure environment that can lead to stress and anxiety. This pressure can be particularly harmful to students who struggle with test-taking or have anxiety disorders. Replacing exams with other forms of assessment, such as essays or projects, can reduce this pressure and create a more positive learning environment.\nIn conclusion, replacing exams with other forms of assessment is essential for measuring practical skills and creativity, reducing the negative impact on students'' mental health, and creating more inclusive and accessible forms of assessment. By using a variety of assessment methods, such as projects, essays, and presentations, educators can better assess students'' abilities and create a more positive and effective learning environment.', NULL, 200, 300),
  ('8d2b4c63-4bf2-51f3-a918-f135f9e60989'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'REPEAT_SENTENCE', E'REPEAT_SENTENCE', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '8d2b4c63-4bf2-51f3-a918-f135f9e60989'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'RS', NULL, 'dc90dc2e-fc6c-557d-a3c8-b10cbd47c54c'::uuid, NULL, E'During an official ceremony, a memorandum of understanding was signed by the academic dean.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
