  ('8dee37f4-4f0e-5b56-adef-55784f95d83b'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DRAG_AND_DROP', E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DRAG_AND_DROP', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '8dee37f4-4f0e-5b56-adef-55784f95d83b'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Meaning of Life', E'The suspicion that life is constantly painful and anxious is one that we largely have to {{1}} in a very lonely way in the philosophies of the West. In those of the East, pessimism is ennobled and {{2}} centre stage: we are {{3}} to feel weary and amply {{4}} every once in a while.', NULL, NULL, NULL, E'1.bear, 2.takes, 3.permitted, 4.dissatisfied', NULL, NULL),
  ('8df1023f-ea31-5f6b-9b37-f2ac56ece681'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'SELECT_MISSING_WORD', E'SELECT_MISSING_WORD', E'LISTENING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '8df1023f-ea31-5f6b-9b37-f2ac56ece681'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Body Function', E'We learn most about ourselves and the way we function, both physically and mentally, when things go wrong. For a long time it was thought that the brain acted as a whole in governing the body''s functions. Then, in 1861, Paul Broca, a French anatomist and anthropologist, discovered that different parts of the brain different functions. After carrying out a postmortem examination on a patient who had had a severe speech impediment, he discovered, as he had expected, damage to a section of the left frontal lobe of the brain. The left side of the brain governs language ability. The patient''s problem had been that he could only utter one syllable, though he fully [BEEP]\n\nAt the end of the recording the lost word or group of words has been replaced by a beep. Select the correct option to complete the recording.', '14765584-db0c-5163-b4df-795b5091a6e0'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'understood spoken language', NULL, NULL),
  ('8df2d88e-4f6d-5420-85e9-53c72387413f'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'ANSWER_SHORT_QUESTION', E'ANSWER_SHORT_QUESTION', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '8df2d88e-4f6d-5420-85e9-53c72387413f'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'ASQ', E'Which one is renewable energy, solar power or fossil fuel?', '9b0cc6a2-0912-5187-bc43-764f11e4e5f1'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'Solar power', NULL, NULL),
