  ('900d73b8-cede-5dbe-948b-6538bf3deb21'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'ANSWER_SHORT_QUESTION', E'ANSWER_SHORT_QUESTION', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '900d73b8-cede-5dbe-948b-6538bf3deb21'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'ASQ', E'What do we call the generator in an air plane?', '8bf96068-8f87-532c-b4df-226ad8062d0f'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'Alternator', NULL, NULL),
  ('90103452-f4d5-5d21-be08-755cbc67924d'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'READ_ALOUD', E'READ_ALOUD', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '90103452-f4d5-5d21-be08-755cbc67924d'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Civil War and Lincoln', E'The southerners did not accept Lincoln as a president because of certain reasons, based on historical grounds. Southerners wished to protect their rights in the government and become more independent from the north. They considered president elections to be unfair. Moreover, they thought that their own rights will be ignored and limited. All this caused the separation of the southern states and marked the beginning of the Civil War.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('90187299-024d-506a-a8f6-cd391263563e'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'REPEAT_SENTENCE', E'REPEAT_SENTENCE', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '90187299-024d-506a-a8f6-cd391263563e'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'RS', NULL, 'a4b37b46-b7f3-50e1-bc35-31655993a2f5'::uuid, NULL, E'He has been appointed to the chair of the sociology department.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('901acb94-bf60-5573-9e54-3d41d2c70718'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'MC_READING_SINGLE', E'MC_READING_SINGLE', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '901acb94-bf60-5573-9e54-3d41d2c70718'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Healthy Lifestyle', E'Ever wondered about changing your life for the better? Maybe you''re interested in losing weight, being more active or just feeling healthier. To live a healthier life you''ll most likely need to make some adjustments in a wide variety of areas. Being "healthy" is based on many things including: your genetics, diet, exercise routine and lifestyle choices. Since you cannot control your genes, making changes to items you have control over can help lead to a healthier lifestyle. Focus on making small changes to your diet, exercise and other lifestyle factors to help make you healthier.\n\nWhat is the main idea of the text?', NULL, NULL, NULL, E'A healthier life requires various small changes to diverse aspects of our life, such as diet, exercise and so on.', NULL, NULL),
  ('901f0076-e546-5889-b4fa-fd2a6bfd5a73'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'MC_READING_SINGLE', E'MC_READING_SINGLE', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '901f0076-e546-5889-b4fa-fd2a6bfd5a73'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'MCS-R', E'Extended debate concerning the exact point of origin of individual folktales told by Afro-American slaves has unfortunately taken precedence over analysis of the tales'' meaning and function. Cultural continuities with Africa were not dependent on importation and perpetuation of specific folktales in their pristine form. It is in the place that tales occupied in the lives of the slaves and in the meaning slaves derived from them that the clearest resemblances to African tradition can be found. Afro-American slaves did not borrow tales indiscriminately from the Whites among whom they lived. Black people were most influenced by those Euro-American tales whose functional meaning and aesthetic appeal had the greatest similarity to the tales with deep roots in their ancestral homeland. Regardless of where slave tales came from, the essential point is that, with respect to language, delivery, details of characterization, and plot, slaves quickly made them their own.\n\nThe author''s main purpose is to __ from one field of study to another', NULL, NULL, NULL, E'change the focus of a field of study', NULL, NULL),
  ('902211a8-2a37-5d24-8ace-09801bf63bf7'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'READ_ALOUD', E'READ_ALOUD', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '902211a8-2a37-5d24-8ace-09801bf63bf7'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Black Hole', E'According to a recent study, a star located near the supermassive black hole at the center of the Milky Way Galaxy has been determined to have originated from outside the Galaxy. This discovery marks the first instance of a star from another galaxy being identified in close proximity to a supermassive black hole.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('90261cb7-3225-57b9-93f8-d654e24ef354'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'REPEAT_SENTENCE', E'REPEAT_SENTENCE', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '90261cb7-3225-57b9-93f8-d654e24ef354'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'RS', NULL, 'df337a24-434d-58bd-9598-f923a94f2f23'::uuid, NULL, E'Telecommunication is based on the array of networks.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('90289e54-d138-5418-bd5e-ac61ddf70b8a'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'LISTENING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '90289e54-d138-5418-bd5e-ac61ddf70b8a'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'WFD', NULL, '22405c33-9500-55d2-b809-315d7b128681'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'Vaccination doesn''t make you completely immune.', NULL, NULL),
  ('902a9113-d938-5da7-a618-e22ae8fe6ce5'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'ANSWER_SHORT_QUESTION', E'ANSWER_SHORT_QUESTION', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '902a9113-d938-5da7-a618-e22ae8fe6ce5'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'ASQ', E'What is the primary function of the heart in the human body?', 'f3e81f6c-d15f-56c4-b641-fd5bfc97751d'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'Pumping blood', NULL, NULL),
  ('902d291a-4d58-57af-9be4-a300d00dc31d'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'READ_ALOUD', E'READ_ALOUD', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '902d291a-4d58-57af-9be4-a300d00dc31d'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Novel Composite', E'A team of researchers has announced the creation of a novel composite material with the ability to alter its properties based on temperature changes, allowing it to execute specific tasks. These materials are expected to be incorporated into the next wave of self-governing robotics that can engage with the surrounding environment.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('902fb0f4-900f-55a7-b1b3-8aed73c55c29'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'ANSWER_SHORT_QUESTION', E'ANSWER_SHORT_QUESTION', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '902fb0f4-900f-55a7-b1b3-8aed73c55c29'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'ASQ', E'What is the verb that means employing someone or renting something?', '5ce1b7bc-994b-5f11-9da1-286338b5d693'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'Hire', NULL, NULL),
  ('903407fe-8fc8-5052-a520-9da12b855191'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'MC_READING_MULTIPLE', E'MC_READING_MULTIPLE', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '903407fe-8fc8-5052-a520-9da12b855191'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'MCM-R', E'It is possible to study the curriculum of an educational institution from a number of different perspectives. In the first instance, we can look at curriculum planning, that is at decision-making, in relation to identifying learners'' needs and purposes; establishing goals and objectives; selecting and grading content; organising appropriate learning arrangements and learner groupings; selecting, adapting or developing appropriate materials, learning tasks and assessment and evaluation tools.\nAlternatively, we can study the curriculum ''in action'', as it were. This second perspective takes us into the classroom itself. Here, we can observe the teaching/learning process and study the ways in which the intentions of the curriculum planners, which were developed during the planning phase, are put into action.\nYet another perspective relates to assessment and evaluation. From this perspective we would try and find out what students had learned and what they had failed to learn, in relation to what had been planned. In addition we might want to find out if they had learned anything which had not been planned.\n\nWhich of these ways of looking at an institution''s curriculum is outlined in the text?', NULL, NULL, NULL, E'observing what happens during lessons\nconsidering what is taken into account when preparing the curriculum', NULL, NULL),
  ('9037c7b4-eb05-56c2-a925-8f032459955b'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'READ_ALOUD', E'READ_ALOUD', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '9037c7b4-eb05-56c2-a925-8f032459955b'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Child-delivering', E'Women who deliver their first child by cesarean section (C-section) are less likely to conceive a second child than those who deliver vaginally, despite being just as likely to plan a subsequent pregnancy, according to researchers. The team followed more than 2,000 women for three years after they delivered their first child.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('903b4e82-4571-55d1-9dc3-f34f40639373'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'ANSWER_SHORT_QUESTION', E'ANSWER_SHORT_QUESTION', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '903b4e82-4571-55d1-9dc3-f34f40639373'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'ASQ', E'What do we call the opening in the face used for speaking and eating?', 'b72b4b6e-2eec-537f-b88a-87163e771f2d'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'Mouth', NULL, NULL),
  ('904013c6-9b68-5dda-9d7d-8fd855691873'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'RE_ORDER_PARAGRAPHS', E'RE_ORDER_PARAGRAPHS', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '904013c6-9b68-5dda-9d7d-8fd855691873'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Creatures'' Competition', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, E'1, 2, 3, 5, 4', NULL, NULL),
  ('9043aedd-0533-5898-80cf-f9952c5b3cc9'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'LISTENING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '9043aedd-0533-5898-80cf-f9952c5b3cc9'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'WFD', NULL, 'e3ad5686-d9ff-513e-ac32-4042838c5cfc'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'The first commercial airport was built on the island relatively recently.', NULL, NULL),
  ('9043d370-0cea-5225-832b-a431e43fcede'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DROPDOWN', E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DROPDOWN', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '9043d370-0cea-5225-832b-a431e43fcede'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Guilt and Responsibility', E'The narrative of law and order is located fundamentally at the level of individual guilt and responsibility. Criminal acts are seen as individual issues of personal responsibility and {{1}} , to which the state responds by way of policing, {{2}} , adjudication and punishment. This is but one level at which crime and criminal justice can be analyzed. The problem is that so often analysis ends there, at the level of individual action, {{3}} in terms of responsibility, guilt, evil. In few other areas of social life does individualism have this hold. To take but one {{4}} , it would be absurd to restrict analysis of obesity, to individual greed.', NULL, NULL, NULL, E'1.culpability, 2.prosecution, 3.characterized, 4.instance', NULL, NULL),
  ('9044f1d6-b7cf-5dab-8540-0db3ac8cd653'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'RE_TELL_LECTURE', E'RE_TELL_LECTURE', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '9044f1d6-b7cf-5dab-8540-0db3ac8cd653'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Learning Styles', NULL, 'f0fadf97-b235-5c99-9974-48af51cb12cc'::uuid, NULL, E'Ultimately, the most important thing for learning is not the way the information is presented but what is happening inside the learner’s head. People learn best when they’re actively thinking about the material, solving problems or imagining what happens if different variables change. I talked about how and why we learn best in my video, “The Science of Thinking”, so check that out. Now, the truth is, there are many evidence-based teaching methods that improve learning. Learning styles is just not one of them. And it is likely, given the prevalence of the learning styles misconception that it actually makes learning worse. I mean, learning styles give teachers unnecessary things to worry about, and they make some students reluctant to engage with certain types of instruction. And all the time and money spent on learning styles and related training could be better spent on interventions that actually improve learning. You are not a visual learner nor an auditory learner nor a kinesthetic learner, or more accurately, you are all these kinds of learner in one. The best learning experiences are those that involve multiple different ways of understanding the same thing. And best of all, this strategy works not just for one subset of people but for everyone.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('9047b4f1-a6a1-5ca7-9f71-eabaf6700443'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'READ_ALOUD', E'READ_ALOUD', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '9047b4f1-a6a1-5ca7-9f71-eabaf6700443'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Canada', E'With a population of only just over 30 million living in the world''s second largest country, Canada is justly renowned for vast tracts of wilderness untroubled by pollution either from industry or from intensive farming methods. A major conservation issue is the battle to stop the logging of virgin forest in northern Ontario and on the west coast.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
