  ('9187add7-5d9f-584d-9b5e-8084b9cbee6c'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'ANSWER_SHORT_QUESTION', E'ANSWER_SHORT_QUESTION', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '9187add7-5d9f-584d-9b5e-8084b9cbee6c'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'ASQ', E'What is the name of the medication used to treat viral infections?', '189db097-ee84-521d-ac6f-8cf1822703de'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'Antiviral / Antiviral drug / Antiviral drugs', NULL, NULL),
  ('918af25c-611f-52a7-a68f-a19ecb9fc0a9'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'REPEAT_SENTENCE', E'REPEAT_SENTENCE', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '918af25c-611f-52a7-a68f-a19ecb9fc0a9'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'RS', NULL, '81ff1135-9fd8-53aa-909a-7b8cba640a91'::uuid, NULL, E'In today''s lecture the focus will be on tax structures within the European Union.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('918b84a2-42b3-536b-9011-fabb8d32e823'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'LISTENING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '918b84a2-42b3-536b-9011-fabb8d32e823'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'WFD', NULL, '726f5ede-3474-51f5-a2d9-c6db06b2335c'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'Coursework gives students the chances to thoroughly explore the subject.', NULL, NULL),
  ('918e2b2b-33a4-5d8a-9260-69c406b79090'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DRAG_AND_DROP', E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DRAG_AND_DROP', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '918e2b2b-33a4-5d8a-9260-69c406b79090'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Gunpowder', E'Gunpowder, also referred to as ''black powder'', was the only {{1}} chemical explosive until the mid-nineteenth century. It {{2}} potassium nitrate, or ''saltpeter'', which is an oxidiser, and a combination of charcoal and sulphur serves as fuel. There is an {{3}} consensus that gunpowder was initially invented in China as early as the ninth century. This {{4}} to its use in fireworks and in gunpowder weapons.', NULL, NULL, NULL, E'1.known, 2.contains, 3.academic, 4.led', NULL, NULL),
  ('919f6f13-ba98-5d93-86f4-713592e734fc'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DROPDOWN', E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DROPDOWN', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '919f6f13-ba98-5d93-86f4-713592e734fc'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Facial Appearance', E'Research demonstrates that facial appearance affects social perceptions. The current research investigates the reverse {{1}} : Can social perceptions influence facial appearance? We examine a social tag that is associated with us early in life — our given name. The hypothesis is that name stereotypes can be manifested in facial appearance, producing a face-name matching effect, {{2}} both a social perceiver and a computer are able to accurately match a person’s name to his or her face. In 8 studies we demonstrate the {{3}} of this effect, as participants examining an unfamiliar face accurately select the person’s true name from a list of several names, significantly above chance level. We replicate the effect in 2 countries and find that it extends {{4}} the limits of socioeconomic cues. We also find the effect using a computer-based paradigm and 94,000 faces. In our exploration of the underlying mechanism, we show that existing name stereotypes produce the effect, as its occurrence is culture-dependent. A self-fulfilling {{5}} seems to be at work, as initial evidence shows that facial appearance regions that are controlled by the individual (e.g., hairstyle) are {{6}} to produce the effect, and socially using one''s given name is necessary to generate the effect. Together, these studies suggest that facial appearance represents social expectations of how a person with a specific name should look. In this way a social tag may influence one''s facial appearance.', NULL, NULL, NULL, E'1.possibility, 2.whereby, 3.existence, 4.beyond, 5.prophecy, 6.sufficient', NULL, NULL),
  ('91a27825-4f0e-5632-8376-0b7c69379ce7'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'LISTENING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '91a27825-4f0e-5632-8376-0b7c69379ce7'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'WFD', NULL, '4e1102a6-a086-568c-bd64-20d10a22bacb'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'A party is thrown in the small meeting room.', NULL, NULL),
  ('91a7e89f-4d92-5a3f-93ae-9809c3344808'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'SUMMARIZE_WRITTEN_TEXT', E'SUMMARIZE_WRITTEN_TEXT', E'WRITING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '91a7e89f-4d92-5a3f-93ae-9809c3344808'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Standard of Living', E'A country''s standard of living generally depends on the size of its national income. Standards of living are measured by such things as the number of cars, televisions, telephones, computers, washing machines, and so on, for every one thousand people. There is, however, no standard international index, which is why national income figures are used as a substitute. But the use of these figures to compare the standard of living between countries needs to be done carefully, because they are, at best, only a rough guide which can be misleading. The main problem here is that it is necessary to have a common unit of measurement if any sort of comparison is to be made at all. It has become the custom to use the dollar, and each country''s currency is converted at its official exchange rate into a national income figure in dollars. Now, since the exchange rate is often set at an artificial level in relation to dollars, you are likely to end up with a figure that is useless for your purposes.', NULL, NULL, E'A country''s standard of living generally depends on the size of its national income, and there is no standard international index, which means that the use of figures to compare the standard of living between countries needs to be done carefully, so it has become the custom to use the dollar.', NULL, 5, 75),
  ('91a86b8a-3c9b-5791-9a88-642ed4a7ae3d'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'ANSWER_SHORT_QUESTION', E'ANSWER_SHORT_QUESTION', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '91a86b8a-3c9b-5791-9a88-642ed4a7ae3d'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'ASQ', E'Who is the main journalist responsible for producing a newspaper or magazine?', 'c0f993fe-0dbf-5596-b405-b29ded3fdf82'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'Editor', NULL, NULL),
  ('91acebd8-7d37-53d4-a912-9ae12714f4a3'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'REPEAT_SENTENCE', E'REPEAT_SENTENCE', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '91acebd8-7d37-53d4-a912-9ae12714f4a3'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'RS', NULL, '9b1135c9-9a7f-549c-bb77-4237143e4658'::uuid, NULL, E'Mental health resources are available for students who need support.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('91ae6f01-843a-55d0-ab2c-17e7611797c9'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DROPDOWN', E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DROPDOWN', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '91ae6f01-843a-55d0-ab2c-17e7611797c9'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Caterina Sforza', E'Born in 1463 in Milan, Italy, Caterina Sforza was a remarkable woman whose life defied societal norms of her time. She was not only a skilled military strategist but also a formidable political {{1}} in her own right. Often referred to as the "Tigress of Forlì," Caterina was known for her daring and resilience in defending her family''s territories. Her life was marked by turbulent events, including daring sieges, political intrigues, and a fierce {{2}} to protect her family''s honor and legacy. Though her name may not be as widely recognized as some of her {{3}} ,Caterina Sforza''s legacy endures as a symbol of a strong and independent woman who defied the constraints of her era. Caterina''s was also a patron of the arts and played a pivotal role in promoting cultural and artistic endeavors in the cities under her control. Her court was a hub of intellectual activity, where artists and scholars found inspiration and support. Caterina Sforza''s life stands as a remarkable example of the resilience of those who dared to challenge societal norms and {{4}} out their own paths during the vibrant era of the 15th century Renaissance, even in the face of formidable {{5}} and risks.', NULL, NULL, NULL, E'1.figure, 2.determination, 3.contemporaries, 4.carve, 5.obstacles', NULL, NULL),
  ('91b4a11b-c96e-56da-a17d-09da43ed1bd4'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'REPEAT_SENTENCE', E'REPEAT_SENTENCE', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '91b4a11b-c96e-56da-a17d-09da43ed1bd4'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'RS', NULL, 'b1da0b35-4b8a-524f-99f1-faeba44b532f'::uuid, NULL, E'Children today are brought up on a diet of television cartoons and soap operas.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('91bfbb3d-16ac-5347-a101-2bca8103281c'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DROPDOWN', E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DROPDOWN', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '91bfbb3d-16ac-5347-a101-2bca8103281c'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Shanghai International Studies University', E'Upholding the motto of "Integrity, Vision and Academic Excellence", Shanghai International Studies University (SISU) is an internationally recognized, {{1}} academic institution distinctive for its multidisciplinary and multicultural nature, committed to preparing innovative professionals and future global leaders for a wide range of international expertise to address the critical challenges of our times. Drawing on our strengths in multi-language programs and multi-disciplinary resources, {{2}} responding to national and regional strategies, we operate more than 70 research institutes and centers serving as academic think tanks to provide advisory services on language policies, {{3}} diplomatic strategies and global public opinion of China. These academic entities have contributed landmark research and are also dedicated to promoting the development of social sciences in China.\nWe have now established partnerships with more than 330 universities and institutions from 56 countries and regions, and have {{4}} close connection with international organizations, including the United Nations and the European Union.', NULL, NULL, NULL, E'1.prestigious, 2.while, 3.country''s, 4.maintained', NULL, NULL),
  ('91c19ebb-19b6-5ae0-a62a-3e1cbbd0bd10'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'READ_ALOUD', E'READ_ALOUD', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '91c19ebb-19b6-5ae0-a62a-3e1cbbd0bd10'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'World Around Us', E'The world around us can pose a danger, especially as travel and recreational activities become more common. This means that people are now at a greater risk of encountering life-threatening situations. While the human body can adapt to some degree, it is not equipped to handle toxins or long-term exposure to extreme environmental conditions.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
