  ('9230b616-2320-5cb5-bbff-fe1829869fcb'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'READ_ALOUD', E'READ_ALOUD', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '9230b616-2320-5cb5-bbff-fe1829869fcb'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Air Taxi', E'The air taxi market is almost ready for take-off, with companies such as Boeing, Hyundai, Airbus, and Toyota building fleets to have commuters flitting through the sky. Europe and the US have both drafted new rules to pave the way for air taxis to begin operations within the decade, with Australia''s Civil Aviation Safety Authority (CASA) to follow suit.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('9232fa5d-ad74-53c9-aa74-6e1de6db0f5b'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'LISTENING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '9232fa5d-ad74-53c9-aa74-6e1de6db0f5b'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'WFD', NULL, '37338367-4ed6-5dd4-8910-fbb77062816a'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'Protective goggles must be worn in all the university''s laboratories.', NULL, NULL),
  ('924669fd-6211-5a9b-817a-a3d9075bf614'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'READ_ALOUD', E'READ_ALOUD', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '924669fd-6211-5a9b-817a-a3d9075bf614'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Shoppers', E'Shoppers hoping to bag a bargain in the post-Christmas sales are much less likely to go through with their purchases if they are using phones and tablets to buy goods online.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('924a525e-7746-5721-8d86-3657a998798a'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'MC_READING_MULTIPLE', E'MC_READING_MULTIPLE', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '924a525e-7746-5721-8d86-3657a998798a'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Craftsmanship', E'Goods produced by factories were not as finished or elegant as those done by hand, and pride in craftsmanship gave way to the pressure to increase rates of productivity. The new methods of doing business involved a new and stricter sense of time. Factory life necessitated a more regimented schedule, where work began at the sound of a bell and workers kept machines going at a constant pace. At the same time, workers were required to discard old habits, for industrialism demanded a worker who was alert, dependable, and self-disciplined. Absenteeism and lateness hurt productivity and, since work was specialized, disrupted the regular factory routine. Industrialization not only produced a fundamental change in the way work was organized; it transformed the very nature of work. The first generation to experience these changes did not adopt the new attitudes easily. The factory clock became the symbol of the new work rules. One mill worker who finally quit complained revealingly about "obedience to the ding-dong of the bell-just as though we are so many living machines." With the loss of personal freedom also came the loss of standing in the community. Unlike artisan workshops in which apprentices worked closely with the masters supervising them, factories sharply separated workers from management. Few workers rose through the ranks to supervisory positions, and even fewer could achieve the artisan''s dream of setting up one''s own business. Even well-paid workers sensed their decline in status.\n\nIn the paragraph, the author includes the quotation from a mill worker in order to', NULL, NULL, NULL, E'support the idea that it was difficult for workers to adjust to working in factories.\nargue that clocks were more useful in factories than ever before.', NULL, NULL),
  ('924a9031-bd1a-5355-a8b3-69c73b908158'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'RE_TELL_LECTURE', E'RE_TELL_LECTURE', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '924a9031-bd1a-5355-a8b3-69c73b908158'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Dark Skin', NULL, '47af62c1-b5ad-5d5d-924a-e69d751f1918'::uuid, NULL, E'Human populations near the equator have evolved dark skin over many generations because of exposure to the fierce rays of the Sun. A similar phenomenon has also occurred in other parts of the animal kingdom. The African grass mouse is a good example. Most mice are nocturnal, but the African grass mouse is active during daylight hours. This means that it spends its days searching for food in the semidry bush and scrub habitats of eastern and southern Africa. Its fur is striped, like a chipmunk''s, which helps it blend in with its environment. Because it spends a lot of time in the intense tropical sun, the grass mouse has also evolved two separate safeguards against the Sun''s ultraviolet radiation. First, like the populations of humans in this region of the world, the skin of the grass mouse contains lots of melanin, or dark pigment. Second, and quite unusual, this mouse has a layer of melanin-pigmented tissue between its skull and skin. This unique "cap" provides an extra measure of protection for the grass mouse and three other types of African mouse-like rodents that are active during the day. The only other species scientists have identified with the same sort of skull adaptation is the white tent-making bat of the Central American tropics. Although these bats sleep during the day, they do so curled up with their heads exposed to the sun.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('924f9d0d-9cd2-54aa-9893-c3cf1e944f85'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'ANSWER_SHORT_QUESTION', E'ANSWER_SHORT_QUESTION', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '924f9d0d-9cd2-54aa-9893-c3cf1e944f85'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'ASQ', E'What do you call the son of your sister or brother?', '0cdcb480-6be4-54d1-9ec2-044d377485f1'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'Nephew', NULL, NULL),
  ('92504235-02ab-54b0-af08-54118fc3fe90'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'LISTENING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '92504235-02ab-54b0-af08-54118fc3fe90'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'WFD', NULL, 'd1349c71-c975-5a39-8731-c260b0d15cf9'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'Art students have a good chance of getting scholarships these days.', NULL, NULL),
  ('9254dea5-4c26-552b-bb4f-c55c626b7176'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'LISTENING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '9254dea5-4c26-552b-bb4f-c55c626b7176'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'WFD', NULL, '08c368ce-d071-5fe6-8eeb-5a6037430a8f'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'The extent of advertising to children is open to much debate.', NULL, NULL),
  ('925bf56c-a87e-5f98-802d-231821f6ad68'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'ANSWER_SHORT_QUESTION', E'ANSWER_SHORT_QUESTION', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '925bf56c-a87e-5f98-802d-231821f6ad68'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'ASQ', E'What do you say when you think something is very impressive or surprising?', '8a039c98-f092-5528-81be-0392f6998618'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'Wow', NULL, NULL),
  ('925d4d8f-10f1-57f6-a0b5-97ba9d10f9c7'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'SUMMARIZE_WRITTEN_TEXT', E'SUMMARIZE_WRITTEN_TEXT', E'WRITING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '925d4d8f-10f1-57f6-a0b5-97ba9d10f9c7'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Museology', E'What is museology? A simple definition might be that it is the study of museums, their history and underlying philosophy, the various ways in which they have, in the course of time, been established and developed, their avowed or unspoken aims and policies, their educative or political or social role. More broadly conceived, such a study might also embrace the bewildering variety of audiences — visitors, scholars, art lovers, children — at whom the efforts of museum staff are supposedly directed, as well as related topics such as the legal duties and responsibilities placed upon (or incurred by) museums, perhaps even some thought as to their future. Seen in this light, museology might appear at first sight a subject so specialized as to concern only museum professionals, who by virtue of their occupation are more or less obliged to take an interest in it. In reality, since museums are almost, if not quite as old as civilization itself, and since the plethora of present-day museums embraces virtually every field of human endeavor - not just art, or craft, or science, but entertainment, agriculture, rural life, childhood, fisheries, antiquities, automobiles: the list is endless - it is a field of enquiry so broad as to be a matter of concern to almost everybody.', NULL, NULL, E'Museology is the study of museums, their history and underlying philosophy, which might also embrace the bewildering variety of audiences at whom the efforts of museum staff are supposedly directed, since the plethora of present-day museums embraces virtually every field of human endeavor, and it is a field of enquiry so broad as to be a matter of concern to almost everybody.', NULL, 5, 75),
  ('926895f0-cbd9-51aa-ab17-d6447a9967bd'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'ANSWER_SHORT_QUESTION', E'ANSWER_SHORT_QUESTION', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '926895f0-cbd9-51aa-ab17-d6447a9967bd'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'ASQ', E'Which one is the fastest and most convenient way to arrive at the top floor of a skyscraper? Staircases or elevator?', 'd7f133db-6ee0-5f96-891c-5f6b31153d24'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'Elevator', NULL, NULL),
  ('926c4a57-6a5c-50d4-ada1-66b37d7ca3ff'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'REPEAT_SENTENCE', E'REPEAT_SENTENCE', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '926c4a57-6a5c-50d4-ada1-66b37d7ca3ff'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'RS', NULL, '18758386-10fc-594a-8562-2b82bb07f801'::uuid, NULL, E'Thirty nine point five percent of Californian residents do not speak English at home.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('92701056-9df5-5920-961e-cb4f09f70548'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'READ_ALOUD', E'READ_ALOUD', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '92701056-9df5-5920-961e-cb4f09f70548'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Phone Hygiene', E'It''s been estimated that people touch their phone hundreds, if not thousands, of times a day. And while many of us wash our hands regularly after say, going to the bathroom, cooking, cleaning or gardening, we are much less likely to consider washing our hands after touching our phones. But given how disgusting and germ-infested phones can be, maybe it''s time to think more about mobile phone hygiene.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('92725087-0c30-5aa5-8189-421e9e7c58c9'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DRAG_AND_DROP', E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DRAG_AND_DROP', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '92725087-0c30-5aa5-8189-421e9e7c58c9'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Parenting Pressure', E'There is a huge {{1}} of pressure on parents today – from feeding babies the “best organic purees” to {{2}} sure older children get all the developmental opportunities they could possibly need, while of course {{3}} the whole thing on Instagram. There is also no shortage of {{4}} about how to go about this. Just as there is no shortage of debate about the “best way” to parent your child.', NULL, NULL, NULL, E'1.amount, 2.making, 3.documenting, 4.advice', NULL, NULL),
  ('9273bace-8dc2-5322-8416-eb80a5951e2e'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'SUMMARIZE_WRITTEN_TEXT', E'SUMMARIZE_WRITTEN_TEXT', E'WRITING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '9273bace-8dc2-5322-8416-eb80a5951e2e'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'American English', E'American English is, without doubt, the most influential and powerful variety of English in the world today. There are many reasons for this. First, the United States is, at present, the most powerful nation on earth and such power always brings with it influence. Indeed, the distinction between a dialect and a language has frequently been made by reference to power. As has been said, a language is a dialect with an army. Second, America''s political influence is extended through American popular culture, in particular through the international reach of American films (movies, of course) and music. As Kahane has pointed out, the internationally dominant position of a culture results in a forceful expansion of its language. The expansion of language contributes to the prestige of the culture behind it. Third, the international prominence of American English is closely associated with the extraordinarily quick development of communications technology. Microsoft is owned by an American, Bill Gates. This means a computer''s default setting for language is American English, although of course this can be changed to suit one''s own circumstances. In short, the increased influence of American English is caused by political power and the resultant diffusion of American culture and media, technological advance, and the rapid development of communications technology.', NULL, NULL, E'American English is the most influential and powerful variety of English in the world today, because the United States is the most powerful nation on earth and such power always brings with it influence, and America''s political influence is extended through American popular culture, while the international prominence of American English is closely associated with the extraordinarily quick development of communications technology.', NULL, 5, 75),
  ('927442cd-5a1d-56c5-a263-40fd64e8b280'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'LISTENING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '927442cd-5a1d-56c5-a263-40fd64e8b280'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'WFD', NULL, '3b42edc6-ae92-5582-b241-a376e99769f7'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'The new camera can identify your eyes and focus on them.', NULL, NULL),
  ('92793e24-08db-57aa-98b3-1a0eb9898383'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DRAG_AND_DROP', E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DRAG_AND_DROP', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '92793e24-08db-57aa-98b3-1a0eb9898383'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Megadroughts', E'Around the world, severe droughts are {{1}} life for millions of people. Megadroughts have {{2}} a slow-moving disaster, as reservoir levels decline. In the Horn of Africa, the worst drought in 40 years has put more than 7 million people at {{3}} of famine.', NULL, NULL, NULL, E'1.disrupting, 2.created, 3.risk', NULL, NULL),
  ('9279d7b8-2fb0-535f-b2a7-60f983f77eb7'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'LISTENING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '9279d7b8-2fb0-535f-b2a7-60f983f77eb7'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'WFD', NULL, '020d5358-4343-5ba9-bf4b-d25152ebd7be'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'They issued a statement correcting the one they had made earlier.', NULL, NULL),
  ('92801ae1-43d0-5958-ad6f-9c0443cd68e5'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'MC_LISTENING_MULTIPLE', E'MC_LISTENING_MULTIPLE', E'LISTENING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '92801ae1-43d0-5958-ad6f-9c0443cd68e5'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'CPI', E'If you switched on the TV and heard on the news that the CPI in Canada was two point one percent, what does that mean? In a nutshell, It means the Canadian consumers paid two point one percent more than in the previous year for the goods and services included in the CPI basket. In order to tell if an economy is experiencing inflation, deflation, or stagflation, we use the CPI as a gauge of the prices of goods and services. When the department of labor or bureau of labor statistics releases the CPI data monthly, the CPI''s results are widely anticipated and watched. Well, the CPI plays a role for many key financial decision makers, including individual investors, the Bank of Canada in Canada, and the federal reserve in the US. The CPI helps the Bank of Canada forecast the interest rate policy and other decisions of major banks and corporations. I mentioned the CPI basket before. The base year market basket, which makes up the CPI, comes from detailed expenditure information collected from surveys of thousands of families. The basket is divided into eight groups and includes more than two hundred categories. The prices of eighty thousand items in the market basket are collected monthly.\n\nWhat is the lecture mainly about?', 'eac156a4-be7a-52f1-bda8-cc85909f7c23'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'The function of the Consumer Price Index.\nHow to measure the Consumer Price Index.', NULL, NULL),
  ('9286fa8f-a7e6-5ef2-8d92-e5cea2fe0b6b'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'WRITE_ESSAY', E'WRITE_ESSAY', E'WRITING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '9286fa8f-a7e6-5ef2-8d92-e5cea2fe0b6b'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Different Attitudes toward Money', E'Some think it is better to enjoy your money when you earn it, while others think it is better to save it for some time in the future. What is your opinion?', NULL, NULL, E'The question of whether to enjoy money in the present or save it for the future is a common dilemma. While some believe in living in the moment, others prioritize financial security and long-term goals. In my opinion, saving money is the wiser choice.\nOne benefit of saving money is that it provides financial security in case of unexpected events. Life is unpredictable, and having a financial cushion can help alleviate stress and provide peace of mind. Additionally, saving money can help achieve long-term financial goals, such as buying a house or retiring comfortably. By setting aside money on a regular basis, individuals can work towards these goals and ensure a stable financial future.\nAnother benefit of saving money is that it allows for greater opportunities and experiences in the future. While it may be tempting to spend money on immediate pleasures, such as dining out or shopping, these experiences are often fleeting. By saving money, individuals can invest in experiences that provide long-term fulfillment, such as traveling or pursuing higher education. These experiences not only enrich one''s life but also provide a sense of personal growth and satisfaction.\nIn conclusion, while it may be tempting to enjoy money in the present moment, saving money is the wiser choice. By providing financial security and allowing for greater opportunities and experiences in the future, saving money can lead to a more fulfilling and stable life. It is important to find a balance between enjoying life in the present and planning for the future, but ultimately, saving money should be a priority for long-term success and happiness.', NULL, 200, 300),
  ('928a21c0-3a2a-51ec-afdb-514217635cdc'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DROPDOWN', E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DROPDOWN', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '928a21c0-3a2a-51ec-afdb-514217635cdc'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Solid Waste', E'Disposal of solid wastes is a {{1}} and widespread problem in both urban and rural areas in many developed and developing countries. Municipal solid waste (MSW) collection and disposal is one of the major problems of urban environment in most countries worldwide today. MSW management solutions must be financially {{2}} , technically feasible, socially, legally acceptable and environmentally friendly. Solid waste management issue is the biggest challenge to the {{3}} of both small and large cities''. Valorization of food organic waste is one of the important current research areas. The conventional landfill, incineration, composting, and ways of {{4}} solid wastes are common as mature technologies for waste disposal. Traditionally, the most commonly used technologies for the treatment and valorization of the organic fraction of MSW are composting and anaerobic digestion (AD). The generation of organic solid waste (OSW) worldwide is dramatically increasing each year. Most of the OSW''s are {{5}} of agricultural waste, household food waste, human and animal wastes, etc. They are normally handled as animal feed, incinerated or disposed to landfill sites.', NULL, NULL, NULL, E'1.stinging, 2.sustainable, 3.authorities, 4.handling, 5.composed', NULL, NULL);
