  ('92ccc7fa-9db4-5fec-8041-d05c5b583028'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DROPDOWN', E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DROPDOWN', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '92ccc7fa-9db4-5fec-8041-d05c5b583028'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Amazon River', E'The Amazon is undeniably one of the world’s greatest rivers. It is the largest river by {{1}} , and its basin is home to the Amazon Rainforest, the world’s richest and most-varied biological reservoir. The Amazon might also be the world’s longest river — {{2}} on whom you ask. Most scientists believe the South American river is at least 4,000 miles (6,400 km) long — still shorter than the Nile, which is widely held to be the world’s longest river at about 4,132 miles (6,650 km). Others, however, have {{3}} that the Amazon is actually much longer. One would think a definitive measurement would be easy to obtain with modern technology; if its {{4}} online company can deliver cans of unicorn meat by drone, then determining the Amazon’s length shouldn’t be too hard. However, it’s actually proven very difficult.', NULL, NULL, NULL, E'1.volume, 2.depending, 3.asserted, 4.namesake', NULL, NULL),
  ('92d1a72e-717d-5312-b264-c5cf35a4484e'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DRAG_AND_DROP', E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DRAG_AND_DROP', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '92d1a72e-717d-5312-b264-c5cf35a4484e'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'DJIA', E'The Daw Jones Industrial Average (DJIA) reports the average stock price of large, publicly traded US companies. It tends to {{1}} the state of the stock market as a whole. Though its name would {{2}} you to believe the DJIA is made up of only {{3}} companies, the DJIA in fact contains stocks across many "industries," not all of which are industrial. The businesses {{4}} include finance, food, technology, retail, heavy equipment, oil, chemical, pharmaceutical, consumer goods, and entertainment.', NULL, NULL, NULL, E'1.reflect, 2.lead, 3.industrial, 4.represented', NULL, NULL),
