  ('94117acf-983d-5b3b-bc7d-2a958c1c8b20'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'ANSWER_SHORT_QUESTION', E'ANSWER_SHORT_QUESTION', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '94117acf-983d-5b3b-bc7d-2a958c1c8b20'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'ASQ', E'What do we call the process of removing a public official from office?', '34ca3025-5734-5324-b610-c1ef8eb0c67c'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'Impeachment', NULL, NULL),
  ('941ab61d-df56-5532-8028-9fda492983f9'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'ANSWER_SHORT_QUESTION', E'ANSWER_SHORT_QUESTION', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '941ab61d-df56-5532-8028-9fda492983f9'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'ASQ', E'How many continents are there in the world?', '5f3ed1a7-b11e-5c9e-9fee-7c68c131f3b7'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'Seven', NULL, NULL),
  ('942fb6d8-8ac2-5f49-a940-ce6e443970a2'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DRAG_AND_DROP', E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DRAG_AND_DROP', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '942fb6d8-8ac2-5f49-a940-ce6e443970a2'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Language Development', E'Children begin to learn about language from a very early age. In fact, it appears that this is {{1}} even before we are born. Newborns show a {{2}} for their mother’s voice and appear to be able to {{3}} between the language spoken by their mother and other languages.', NULL, NULL, NULL, E'1.occurring, 2.preference, 3.discriminate', NULL, NULL),
  ('943380ad-4efd-5d4a-b1b9-1d87dd863544'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'REPEAT_SENTENCE', E'REPEAT_SENTENCE', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '943380ad-4efd-5d4a-b1b9-1d87dd863544'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'RS', NULL, 'e13d3354-37b6-5692-ad01-4b8f5915291c'::uuid, NULL, E'It is difficult for young people to find jobs around here.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('94349e60-1b8f-5d6c-82f7-8fd6ee602fa4'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'READ_ALOUD', E'READ_ALOUD', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '94349e60-1b8f-5d6c-82f7-8fd6ee602fa4'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Perfect Pitch', E'Early experiences with music play a role in human beings. Most babies have perfect pitch, and this is usually preserved if they are given music lessons at an early age. Speaking a tonal language such as Mandarin—where words can have different meanings depending on tone and pitch—also help to develop perfect pitch.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('9438cce3-de0e-5b12-acab-2397984e5b07'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'SUMMARIZE_WRITTEN_TEXT', E'SUMMARIZE_WRITTEN_TEXT', E'WRITING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '9438cce3-de0e-5b12-acab-2397984e5b07'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'New Year Celebration', E'There have been celebrations to mark the beginning of a new year for thousands of years. Sometimes these were simply an opportunity for people to eat, drink and have fun, but in some places the festivities were connected to the land or astronomical events.\nThe city of Babylon in ancient Mesopotamia was where the first New Year''s celebrations were recorded about 4,000 years ago. The Babylonians held their celebrations on the first new moon after the spring equinox. Statues of the gods were carried through the streets of the city, and in this way the Babylonians believed that their world had been cleaned to prepare for the new year and a new spring.\nIn many cities all over the world, spectacular fireworks displays take place as soon as the clock passes midnight on 31 December. In recent years, Sydney in Australia has been the host to one of the first of these celebrations as New Year arrives there before most other major international cities. Fireworks light up the skies in hundreds of cities as 12 midnight strikes around the globe.\nBesides, there are a number of strange and interesting New Year''s traditions around the world. In Scotland, New Year''s Eve is called Hogmanay and ''first footing'' remains a popular custom with people visiting friends'' and neighbours'' houses just after midnight. The first person who visits your house should bring a gift as this will mean good luck.\nThe new year is also a perfect time to make a change for the better. The tradition of making New Year''s resolutions is more common in the western hemisphere but also exists in the eastern hemisphere. This tradition involves a person making a commitment to change an unwanted habit or behaviour or setting a personal objective. Typical New Year''s resolutions might be to give up smoking, eat healthier food, do more exercise, become more organised or laugh more – but really, a New Year''s resolution can be almost anything.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 5, 75),
  ('943ab92b-46dc-5836-9b5d-2d3da236b47a'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'REPEAT_SENTENCE', E'REPEAT_SENTENCE', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '943ab92b-46dc-5836-9b5d-2d3da236b47a'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'RS', NULL, '80f9da5d-f9f3-5825-a108-38226a95790f'::uuid, NULL, E'That country''s economy is primarily based on tourism.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('9442f70b-4991-5f2f-bc25-67af420ffb12'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'RE_ORDER_PARAGRAPHS', E'RE_ORDER_PARAGRAPHS', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '9442f70b-4991-5f2f-bc25-67af420ffb12'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Advertisements', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, E'1, 3, 4, 2', NULL, NULL),
  ('944d17aa-c4ef-5a91-a4aa-8c6fd854aec7'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'LISTENING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '944d17aa-c4ef-5a91-a4aa-8c6fd854aec7'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'WFD', NULL, 'c02785a6-4cb8-5162-b999-e277dcf5fdc0'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'To graduate, students have to pass some important tests first.', NULL, NULL),
  ('944f781f-722f-567c-9a2b-6675dbb7a037'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'SUMMARIZE_WRITTEN_TEXT', E'SUMMARIZE_WRITTEN_TEXT', E'WRITING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '944f781f-722f-567c-9a2b-6675dbb7a037'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Mental Well-being', E'Mental health is an integral part of overall well-being, influencing how we think, feel, and interact with the world. It is essential to prioritize and nurture our mental health to lead a fulfilling and balanced life. Firstly, self-awareness is key. Take time to reflect on your emotions, thoughts, and behaviors. Understanding your feelings and identifying stressors can help you manage and cope with them effectively. Secondly, establish a support system. Share your thoughts and feelings with trusted friends or family members. Connecting with others can provide emotional support and reduce feelings of isolation. Practicing mindfulness and relaxation techniques can significantly impact mental health. Techniques like meditation, deep breathing, and yoga can help reduce stress and improve emotional well-being. Setting realistic goals and managing time effectively can reduce feelings of overwhelm. Break tasks into manageable steps and prioritize self-care to maintain a healthy work-life balance. Maintaining a healthy lifestyle is also crucial. Regular exercise, a balanced diet, and adequate sleep contribute to mental well-being. Limiting the consumption of alcohol and avoiding substance abuse are essential for maintaining good mental health. Lastly, seeking professional help when needed is a sign of strength, not weakness. If you''re struggling with mental health issues like depression or anxiety, don''t hesitate to reach out to a mental health professional for guidance and support. In conclusion, nurturing your mental well-being is a continuous journey that involves self-awareness, building a support system, practicing mindfulness, setting realistic goals, maintaining a healthy lifestyle, and seeking professional help when necessary. Prioritizing mental health leads to a happier and more balanced life.', NULL, NULL, E'Prioritizing mental health involves self-awareness, building a support system, practicing mindfulness, setting realistic goals, maintaining a healthy lifestyle, and seeking professional help when needed, all of which contribute to a happier and more balanced life.', NULL, 5, 75),
  ('9450dd35-c5b2-5a5e-9825-c7c5d42a28ce'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'RE_ORDER_PARAGRAPHS', E'RE_ORDER_PARAGRAPHS', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '9450dd35-c5b2-5a5e-9825-c7c5d42a28ce'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Vincent Millay', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, E'4, 2, 1, 3', NULL, NULL),
  ('9455107c-f4b0-57b0-b7d8-6e9b88710a46'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'ANSWER_SHORT_QUESTION', E'ANSWER_SHORT_QUESTION', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '9455107c-f4b0-57b0-b7d8-6e9b88710a46'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'ASQ', E'What do we call the passages between the rows of seats in the theater?', '7c1a945b-71a2-5ef5-b616-cbd8154529ca'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'Aisles', NULL, NULL),
  ('9457da5a-bfa3-56ee-982e-ce629b1dd470'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'MC_READING_SINGLE', E'MC_READING_SINGLE', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '9457da5a-bfa3-56ee-982e-ce629b1dd470'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Social Movements', E'The 1960''s witnessed two profound social movements: the civil rights movement and the movement protesting the war in Vietnam. Although they overlapped in time, they were largely distinct. For a brief moment in 1967, however, it appeared that the two movements might unite under the leadership of Martin Luther King, Jr.King''s role in the antiwar movement appears to require little explanation, since he was the foremost advocate of nonviolence of his time. But King''s stance on the Vietnam War cannot be explained in terms of pacifism alone. After all, he was something of a latecomer to the antiwar movement, even though by 1965 he was convinced that the role of the United States in the war was indefensible. Why then the two years that passed before he translated his private misgivings into public dissent? Perhaps he believed that he could not criticize American foreign policy without endangering the support for civil rights that he had won from the federal government.\n\nWhich of the following best describes the passage?', NULL, NULL, NULL, E'It discusses an apparent inconsistency and suggests a reason for it.', NULL, NULL),
  ('945c3b01-03b6-5904-b70b-cc4e704867db'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'ANSWER_SHORT_QUESTION', E'ANSWER_SHORT_QUESTION', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '945c3b01-03b6-5904-b70b-cc4e704867db'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'ASQ', E'What do we call the list of steps that tell you how to put something together?', '66fd50eb-1062-5b0a-a739-d8a706599e8d'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'Instructions / directions / specifications / manual', NULL, NULL),
  ('945dac72-f86f-5429-b921-97763e531c02'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'WRITE_ESSAY', E'WRITE_ESSAY', E'WRITING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '945dac72-f86f-5429-b921-97763e531c02'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Human and Earth', E'Some people believe that the Earth is being harmed by human activity. Others feel that human activity makes the Earth a better place to live. What is your opinion?', NULL, NULL, E'The question of whether human activity is harming or helping the Earth is a contentious issue. While some believe that human activity has led to advancements in technology and improved our quality of life, I believe that the negative impact of human activity on the environment far outweighs any benefits. Human activity has led to pollution, deforestation, and other environmental issues that harm the planet.\nOne major negative impact of human activity on the Earth is pollution. From air pollution caused by factories and transportation to water pollution caused by agricultural runoff and waste disposal, human activity has created a significant amount of pollution that harms the environment and human health. Pollution can lead to respiratory problems, cancer, and other health issues, as well as harm wildlife and ecosystems.\nAnother negative impact of human activity on the Earth is climate change. Human activity, particularly the burning of fossil fuels, has led to an increase in greenhouse gas emissions that trap heat in the atmosphere and lead to global warming. This has far-reaching consequences for the planet, including rising sea levels, more frequent natural disasters, and changes in weather patterns that can harm agriculture and food production.\nIn conclusion, while some may argue that human activity has made the Earth a better place to live, the negative impact of human activity on the environment cannot be ignored. Pollution and climate change are just two examples of the harm caused by human activity. It is important for individuals and society as a whole to take action to reduce our impact on the environment and protect the planet for future generations.', NULL, 200, 300),
  ('94601052-4317-5926-8f67-f1e9e58ec7e0'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'REPEAT_SENTENCE', E'REPEAT_SENTENCE', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '94601052-4317-5926-8f67-f1e9e58ec7e0'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'RS', NULL, 'e0f71aa3-f895-51ca-86e0-4a509bd66929'::uuid, NULL, E'We will discuss these two pictures in the next lecture.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
