  ('95c112a7-f540-5468-9709-ec38b07c1d9f'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DRAG_AND_DROP', E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DRAG_AND_DROP', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '95c112a7-f540-5468-9709-ec38b07c1d9f'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Divorce', E'If a couple does divorce, there are specific {{1}} they should take into account to help their children {{2}} . Parents should {{3}} their children that both parents will continue to love them and that the divorce is in no way the children''s fault.', NULL, NULL, NULL, E'1.considerations, 2.cope, 3.reassure', NULL, NULL),
  ('95c49c9e-5f29-56ab-ab3e-8638f4690f55'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'LISTENING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '95c49c9e-5f29-56ab-ab3e-8638f4690f55'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'WFD', NULL, '0c6c3007-f466-5711-b1be-c4d4d85c0516'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'Teachers are trained to stimulate the children''s cognitive development.', NULL, NULL),
  ('95c5d06c-426a-5278-9ac8-dab631e79087'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'ANSWER_SHORT_QUESTION', E'ANSWER_SHORT_QUESTION', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '95c5d06c-426a-5278-9ac8-dab631e79087'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'ASQ', E'What do we call the study of heredity and how traits are passed from one generation to the next?', '2562fab2-155b-5307-99db-2602ce257bcc'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'Genetics', NULL, NULL),
  ('95c9ff54-31fb-5e63-b485-541effbc79f7'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'RE_TELL_LECTURE', E'RE_TELL_LECTURE', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '95c9ff54-31fb-5e63-b485-541effbc79f7'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Doing Hard Things', NULL, '99d8ce23-8623-5019-b1f8-0c28f5486f7c'::uuid, NULL, E'How do I learn to enjoy and embrace difficult things and have it be an integrated part of my life? So there are two things that really helped me do that. Number one is more of a mindset shift and it’s more inner work. And number two is more of a practical, strategic thing that you do to yourself. Okay, so number one is to operate from an abundance mindset rather than a scarcity mindset. If you’re constantly telling yourself, oh, I have to go read books to get smarter. Oh, I have to go read a book now. Obviously you’re not gonna have a good time while you’re doing it. But if you identify as somebody who enjoys reading books, it’s something that you like doing, it’s just a part of who you are, then you’re way more likely to actually follow through with doing it. This next tip is a little bit more practical and a little less theoretical. And that is to utilize habit-bunching. And that is when you pair an already existing habit that you are used to doing with one that you’re trying to work on. So for instance, I’m a sucker for a great cup of coffee. I have one in the morning and one in the early afternoon. I really enjoy the taste of coffee and I look forward to it every single time. Do I have an addiction? Yes, but I can leverage this filthy habit of mine into working on another habit. A great one to pair with a coffee addiction is reading. And that’s exactly how I started reading more books. Every single morning next to my coffee maker, I placed the book that I wanted to read next to it so that when I made my coffee, I knew to pick up the book and I could only drink the coffee if I was reading the book the entire time I was drinking it. Done.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('95d07dd1-04ca-5c19-b35e-f6eaae27bf83'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'READ_ALOUD', E'READ_ALOUD', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '95d07dd1-04ca-5c19-b35e-f6eaae27bf83'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Clean Air Act', E'Over the next couple of decades, Americans became more and more concerned with the chemicals that were being released into the air and the effects they could have on people''s health and the environment. Lawmakers came together from both sides of the aisle, ultimately drafting and unanimously passing the Clean Air Act of 1970.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('95d28130-3c07-53b7-bcca-468bfb897580'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'READ_ALOUD', E'READ_ALOUD', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '95d28130-3c07-53b7-bcca-468bfb897580'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Mental Health', E'The importance of mental health cannot be overstated, as it affects every aspect of our lives from relationships to productivity to physical health. Seeking help when needed from qualified professionals such as therapists or psychiatrists, practicing self-care through activities such as meditation or exercise, and reducing stigma around mental illness are all important steps towards maintaining emotional well-being.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('95dd0d84-4fcf-5016-b98f-1146ae602c5b'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'REPEAT_SENTENCE', E'REPEAT_SENTENCE', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '95dd0d84-4fcf-5016-b98f-1146ae602c5b'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'RS', NULL, '3c79ce8a-bd16-5e1e-a678-5e60a7ddb3ff'::uuid, NULL, E'Aboriginal people have a long tradition of teaching and learning in their own method.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('95e2f520-8f34-5dd0-beaf-bd82155cd302'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'RE_TELL_LECTURE', E'RE_TELL_LECTURE', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '95e2f520-8f34-5dd0-beaf-bd82155cd302'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Bilingual Parents', NULL, '55991bfb-5c28-599d-b352-931d7139e1fa'::uuid, NULL, E'Many parents communicate and educate their children with two languages, probably because they both know more than one language, or they come from different countries.\nMost of these parents think this can benefit their children''s language learning.\nBut actually kids will get confused when their parents use different languages from each other to describe the same object.\nIf one parent sticks to one language, and the other one sticks to another language, their children will not be confused any more.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('95e99618-42cc-58df-9625-a30279a3182d'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'ANSWER_SHORT_QUESTION', E'ANSWER_SHORT_QUESTION', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '95e99618-42cc-58df-9625-a30279a3182d'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'ASQ', E'What do we call a child who will soon be a teenager?', '67300e31-63c8-55a6-ad57-d870251f0cbb'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'Preteen / tween', NULL, NULL),
  ('95f4cdbf-7ec9-5caf-abd8-0d091466e0df'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'READ_ALOUD', E'READ_ALOUD', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '95f4cdbf-7ec9-5caf-abd8-0d091466e0df'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Ear Fluid', E'Normally, if we spin around in an office chair and suddenly stop, we feel like we''re still moving. That''s because fluid in the inner ear responsible for detecting movement continues to whirl around due to inertia, making your brain think it''s still in motion.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
