  ('987c29db-687c-5784-82e7-ba0c00242028'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DROPDOWN', E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DROPDOWN', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '987c29db-687c-5784-82e7-ba0c00242028'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Good Communication', E'Good communication is key in any workplace. It''s like the oil that keeps the engine of a business {{1}} smoothly. When everyone communicates well, things just work better. Managers and team members can share ideas, solve problems faster, and feel more {{2}} to their work. But when communication {{3}} down, it can lead to misunderstandings, mistakes, and frustration. Today, with so many teams working {{4}} or in different parts of the world, good communication is more important than ever. It''s not just about talking or sending emails; it''s about making sure everyone is on the same {{5}} . This means being clear, listening to others, and making sure there''s a good flow of information. Good communication can make a huge difference in how a team performs and how happy everyone is at work.', NULL, NULL, NULL, E'1.running, 2.connected, 3.breaks, 4.remotely, 5.page', NULL, NULL),
  ('98896eb9-e04b-5e5c-91c9-5c0ef3a1642c'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DRAG_AND_DROP', E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DRAG_AND_DROP', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '98896eb9-e04b-5e5c-91c9-5c0ef3a1642c'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Duel', E'A "duel of honour" was a way of settling disputes between gentlemen over some injury or insult. The {{1}} had to be arranged privately because duelling was never {{2}} , but it became common in the 17th century. A social code governed the duel of honour and, as long as the rules were {{3}} to, the survivor could usually escape without being punished by the law. Duels were fought with either pistols or swords, but pistols became the more usual {{4}} after swords went out of fashion at the end of the 18th century.', NULL, NULL, NULL, E'1.fight, 2.legal, 3.kept, 4.weapon', NULL, NULL),
