  ('9bd31559-4ce5-5286-b775-5bf94a76cd16'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'READ_ALOUD', E'READ_ALOUD', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '9bd31559-4ce5-5286-b775-5bf94a76cd16'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Impossible Dream', E'Whether you''re climbing your way up the corporate ladder or overwhelmed with the organizational tasks of home and kids, a luxurious vacation to an exotic paradise may seem like an impossible dream. You can only fantasize about an outdoor massage among fragrant island flowers or a nap after enjoying a brunch ripe with fruits fresh from the vine.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('9bda2571-5eec-5f1e-9ba0-d6f8edd4ea4d'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'ANSWER_SHORT_QUESTION', E'ANSWER_SHORT_QUESTION', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '9bda2571-5eec-5f1e-9ba0-d6f8edd4ea4d'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'ASQ', E'What do we call the area where the sea and the land meet?', 'afe8962b-7b54-51b0-aa7c-45e3fdbae245'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'Coast / coastline', NULL, NULL),
  ('9bde0b6f-7e76-55e3-bf1d-c6f41cbaa706'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'ANSWER_SHORT_QUESTION', E'ANSWER_SHORT_QUESTION', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '9bde0b6f-7e76-55e3-bf1d-c6f41cbaa706'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'ASQ', E'If something is not expensive, what do we say it is?', 'bd7ba402-3f5b-540f-8721-8fee413ad9a5'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'Cheap / inexpensive', NULL, NULL),
  ('9bded45b-c8ae-573a-b4a0-b9d5882c8ba4'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'WRITE_ESSAY', E'WRITE_ESSAY', E'WRITING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '9bded45b-c8ae-573a-b4a0-b9d5882c8ba4'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Ethical Concerns', E'Do you agree that the rise of artificial intelligence raises ethical concerns?', NULL, NULL, E'The rapid advancement of artificial intelligence (AI) has sparked widespread debate regarding the ethical implications of its proliferation. While AI presents promising opportunities, its rise also raises significant ethical concerns that cannot be overlooked.\nOne of the primary ethical concerns associated with AI is the issue of job displacement. As AI technologies become more sophisticated, there is a growing fear that automation will lead to widespread unemployment, particularly in sectors heavily reliant on manual labor. The displacement of human workers by AI systems raises questions about economic inequality, social stability, and the future of work in an increasingly automated world.\nAnother ethical dilemma posed by the rise of AI is the lack of transparency and accountability in AI decision-making processes. AI algorithms often operate as black boxes, making it challenging to understand how decisions are reached. This opacity can result in biased outcomes, discriminatory practices, and the reinforcement of existing societal inequalities. The unchecked power of AI systems to influence critical decisions in areas such as healthcare, criminal justice, and finance raises profound ethical concerns about fairness, accountability, and justice.\nIn conclusion, while AI holds immense potential for innovation and progress, its rapid advancement raises valid ethical concerns that must be addressed. From job displacement to algorithmic bias, the ethical implications of AI require careful consideration and regulation to ensure that its development aligns with ethical principles and values. By acknowledging and addressing these concerns, we can strive towards a future where AI serves as a force for good while upholding ethical standards and societal well-being.', NULL, 200, 300),
  ('9be3007b-74d1-53f2-a4a9-ebaad4f63cf1'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'RE_TELL_LECTURE', E'RE_TELL_LECTURE', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '9be3007b-74d1-53f2-a4a9-ebaad4f63cf1'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Research', NULL, '7f1d2699-55df-5ba4-9f4e-575f78bdb623'::uuid, NULL, E'When writing an academic paper, the main goal of doing research is to support your own idea and provide strong evidence for your arguments. Research helps writers build convincing points and make their opinions more reliable. Using academic sources in your paper is an important part of the research process. However, relying on only one source does not necessarily mean your argument is inaccurate. It can still be acceptable if the source is trustworthy, but you need to be careful when selecting and evaluating the information. To save time and improve the quality of your work, the best approach is to make sure that the materials you use come from reliable and recent researches. Checking the credibility and the publication date of sources can help you avoid outdated or incorrect information. Therefore, effective research is not simply about collecting information. It is about finding high-quality evidence and using it properly to strengthen your own arguments in academic writing.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('9be51540-4f5d-5744-b750-bcd17206f9c3'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DRAG_AND_DROP', E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DRAG_AND_DROP', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '9be51540-4f5d-5744-b750-bcd17206f9c3'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Rain Cycle', E'The water droplets that form clouds are held aloft by atmospheric currents. They are {{1}} as condensed moisture. The droplets that become too heavy to be {{2}} in the air precipitate as rain. This precipitation is a {{3}} part of the water cycle. Rainwater provides necessary hydration to ecosystems and is the primary source of {{4}} water for various forms of life.', NULL, NULL, NULL, E'1.termed, 2.suspended, 3.vital, 4.fresh', NULL, NULL),
  ('9be79276-a969-54ff-8e80-473477e2cf7d'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'LISTENING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '9be79276-a969-54ff-8e80-473477e2cf7d'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'WFD', NULL, '22201c74-417b-5934-86d9-3d1636b147f7'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'His appointment as Minister of Culture was seen as a demotion.', NULL, NULL),
  ('9bf70bb5-0e62-5493-b5db-deacf2f3158f'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'READ_ALOUD', E'READ_ALOUD', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '9bf70bb5-0e62-5493-b5db-deacf2f3158f'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Lunar Observation', E'To observe the rare lunar events on Wednesday night, find a location with an unobstructed view of the sky. The optimal time to view the super blue moon is just after sunset when it is on the horizon and takes on a deep orange color. Binoculars or a telescope can enhance the viewing experience. Don''t miss this chance to witness a rare and awe-inspiring display of celestial beauty.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('9bfad8c6-b724-5af7-ba20-c2d502f56894'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'RE_TELL_LECTURE', E'RE_TELL_LECTURE', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '9bfad8c6-b724-5af7-ba20-c2d502f56894'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Green Economics', NULL, 'adea3074-c793-5a38-9272-e0ab00668a00'::uuid, NULL, E'As we stand at the intersection of ecology and economy, we unveil the concept of ''Green Economics.'' This is the idea that economic growth and environmental integrity are not mutually exclusive, but instead, they can flourish together. Green economics calls for investment in renewable energy, which not only helps in mitigating climate change but also propels technological innovation and job creation in new sectors. Additionally, green economics emphasizes the value of natural capital. By accounting for the economic contributions of healthy ecosystems, such as clean air and water, we pave the way for policies that promote conservation as a cornerstone for sustainable development. Let''s reimagine our economy as a garden where what we sow today dictates the vitality of our tomorrow. By integrating the principles of green economics into our pursuits, we can cultivate a world that thrives economically and is verdant in its natural splendor.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('9c01e8bf-a319-5e22-84f8-a7444c46bf28'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'ANSWER_SHORT_QUESTION', E'ANSWER_SHORT_QUESTION', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '9c01e8bf-a319-5e22-84f8-a7444c46bf28'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'ASQ', E'What do we call a person who is considered for a position in an election?', '2e34e6ac-b52d-5575-890d-db0a961cb1c5'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'Candidate / nominee', NULL, NULL),
  ('9c039c9a-301b-5b68-a193-8f1ee4ceea5c'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'RE_TELL_LECTURE', E'RE_TELL_LECTURE', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '9c039c9a-301b-5b68-a193-8f1ee4ceea5c'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Climate Change', NULL, '47411598-ce22-549f-8e29-72737729c102'::uuid, NULL, E'Well, what I want to focus on now is climate change, more specifically on the fact that climate change is a result of human activities. Now there has been some disagreement regarding the extent to which human activity can be blamed for climate change but I want to argue that there is evidence which clearly demonstrates that our own actions really are causing a genuine threat. The available evidence seems to indicate fairly conclusively that land and sea temperatures started to increase around 200 years ago.\nSo, what''s the significance of this! Well, 200 years ago roughly coincides with the beginning of the industrial revolution in the northern hemisphere. In other words, this was when our production of harmful gases really got going as a result of increased industrialization. Since that time our production of gases has accelerated due to the fact that not only has industry grown in size but it has also now spread to the southern hemisphere, indeed, most parts of the world. So, in the last 200 years, as industry has grown we can see a gradual rise in the temperatures which, to my mind is sufficient proof of the damaging effect of our actions and needless to say it''s an issue which we need to address.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('9c05b4a4-77ad-5aab-a754-3b43525b7839'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'RE_ORDER_PARAGRAPHS', E'RE_ORDER_PARAGRAPHS', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '9c05b4a4-77ad-5aab-a754-3b43525b7839'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Romeo and Juliet', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, E'1, 2, 3, 4', NULL, NULL),
