  ('9c9f2e0c-f3b1-53ab-b030-282cf9372010'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'READ_ALOUD', E'READ_ALOUD', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '9c9f2e0c-f3b1-53ab-b030-282cf9372010'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Sports', E'The stadium erupted with thunderous cheers as the athlete sprinted towards the finish line. With every stride, determination burned in their eyes, fueled by the crowd''s electrifying energy. The race was a display of raw athleticism and unwavering spirit. In that moment, they embodied the essence of sportsmanship – pushing beyond limits, embracing challenges, and inspiring others to chase their dreams.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('9ca524c7-76ed-59ce-8103-6f2979f5369c'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'RE_ORDER_PARAGRAPHS', E'RE_ORDER_PARAGRAPHS', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '9ca524c7-76ed-59ce-8103-6f2979f5369c'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'RO', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, E'4, 1, 2, 3', NULL, NULL),
  ('9ca69a0a-8189-5c5e-9f95-ef6cad68ceb8'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'MC_READING_SINGLE', E'MC_READING_SINGLE', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '9ca69a0a-8189-5c5e-9f95-ef6cad68ceb8'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Traffic Law', E'With regard to driving, the laws of some countries are notoriously lax. So here are a few examples of some the things that might be done. The driving test should be standardized and made far more difficult than it is; all the drivers should be made to take a test every three years or so; the age at which young people are allowed to drive any vehicle should be raised to at least 21; all vehicles should be put through stringent annual tests for safety. Maximum and minimum speed limits should be imposed on all roads. All advertising stressing power and performance should be banned along the highway.\n\nWhat is the main idea of this passage?', NULL, NULL, NULL, E'Giving some suggestions to make stricter driving law.', NULL, NULL),
  ('9cae0dcd-fd12-5a4c-be1d-17b54fbbb416'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'ANSWER_SHORT_QUESTION', E'ANSWER_SHORT_QUESTION', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '9cae0dcd-fd12-5a4c-be1d-17b54fbbb416'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'ASQ', E'What is the term for the large-scale processes that deform Earth''s crust and produce landforms?', '4992eca1-b0a8-519e-a98c-cbcc669fefbc'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'Tectonics', NULL, NULL),
  ('9cb758a9-9e45-5433-9b0e-a1d61adab143'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'READ_ALOUD', E'READ_ALOUD', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '9cb758a9-9e45-5433-9b0e-a1d61adab143'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'English Revolution', E'The English Revolution has been interpreted in several ways by historians: as a fight between the aristocratic Cavaliers, who were open to life, and the serious Puritans; as a battle for power between parliament and the monarchy over the rights of Englishmen that had been going on for centuries; and as a class war similar to the French Revolution, of which it was a forerunner.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
