  ('9df6835e-471f-5b48-8c9b-674cbb309ef3'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DRAG_AND_DROP', E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DRAG_AND_DROP', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '9df6835e-471f-5b48-8c9b-674cbb309ef3'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Standard Response', E'The {{1}} observer does not necessarily recognize the {{2}} in how a teacher, for instance, responds to a thoughtful question from a normally quiet student and how that may be very different from the ''standard response'' to a commonly inquisitive or {{3}} student. Expert teachers are aware of what they are doing; they monitor and adjust their teaching behaviors to bring out the {{4}} in their students.', NULL, NULL, NULL, E'1.casual, 2.skill, 3.talkative, 4.best', NULL, NULL),
  ('9dfc9771-9b16-58f0-9bf9-d17c6265a17d'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DRAG_AND_DROP', E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DRAG_AND_DROP', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '9dfc9771-9b16-58f0-9bf9-d17c6265a17d'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Zika', E'Zika is more pernicious than public health officials anticipated. At present, it is circulating in more than 50 countries. And as of mid-May, seven countries or territories have reported cases of microcephaly or other serious birth {{1}} linked to the virus, which is transmitted by mosquito bite, blood transfusion or sexual contact with an infected human. It can also be passed from mother to fetus during pregnancy. Despite Zika''s vast {{2}} over almost 70 years, there is little genetic difference among the various strains, according to an analysis by researchers at the University of Texas Medical Branch at Galveston. For example, the strain currently in the Americas and another previously detected in French Polynesia are practically indistinguishable from each other (group in white box). If the virus has changed so little over time, why is it rearing its ugly head now? Scientists are not sure yet, but new experimental work in mosquitoes suggests that the virus was capable of {{3}} detrimental health effects and outbreaks all along. Therefore, it is unlikely mutations enabled new abilities. Instead, public health officials probably did not understand Zika''s potential because the virus {{4}} mostly in remote locations until recently .', NULL, NULL, NULL, E'1.defects, 2.range, 3.causing, 4.circulated', NULL, NULL),
  ('9e0315cf-c08e-5126-aef5-e16eb833e67b'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'ANSWER_SHORT_QUESTION', E'ANSWER_SHORT_QUESTION', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '9e0315cf-c08e-5126-aef5-e16eb833e67b'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'ASQ', E'What do we call a woman who is getting married?', 'baa69a2a-66ec-5168-8439-f9e43b59cb62'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'Bride', NULL, NULL),
  ('9e0d13f8-6a96-5ee8-b0cb-c43abf42e436'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'ANSWER_SHORT_QUESTION', E'ANSWER_SHORT_QUESTION', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '9e0d13f8-6a96-5ee8-b0cb-c43abf42e436'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'ASQ', E'What do we call a player who is going to replace another one on the field?', '811f3ba5-92d0-5d36-b651-453cad303466'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'Substitute', NULL, NULL),
  ('9e0e8466-3745-5f31-92ad-798e593db402'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'READ_ALOUD', E'READ_ALOUD', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '9e0e8466-3745-5f31-92ad-798e593db402'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Charles Darwin', E'Darwin published his paper "On the Origin of Species" in 1859. It is one of the most well-known pieces of scientific literature. In the paper, Darwin proposes the theory of natural selection. He states for any generation of any species, there will always be a struggle for survival. Individuals who are better suited to the environment are "fitter", and therefore have a much higher chance of surviving and reproducing.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('9e13b1a4-75a3-58d0-b023-3a9dba81f678'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DRAG_AND_DROP', E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DRAG_AND_DROP', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '9e13b1a4-75a3-58d0-b023-3a9dba81f678'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Australian Business Etiquette', E'Business etiquette in Australia is relatively straightforward for Americans and Europeans. But it {{1}} greatly to the approach taken in the country''s Asian backyard, the {{2}} of an increasing proportion of its trade and investment. To many Asians, Australians'' openness can appear blunt and {{3}} ; their informality confusing and even disrespectful. Even if Australia is less egalitarian than it was, it is less {{4}} than many societies and first names are almost always used, irrespective of rank.', NULL, NULL, NULL, E'1.differs, 2.source, 3.unsubtle, 4.hierarchical', NULL, NULL),
  ('9e176ac2-f932-52b2-bc4f-87d0e5fc7e70'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DRAG_AND_DROP', E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DRAG_AND_DROP', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '9e176ac2-f932-52b2-bc4f-87d0e5fc7e70'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Climate and Coffee', E'Climate change is {{1}} and is putting the future of the entire coffee sector at risk. Researchers estimate that over the course of 30 years, roughly half of the land used to grow coffee will decrease and will no longer be suitable for coffee {{2}} . With effects from climate change rising at an alarming {{3}} , higher temperatures are significantly {{4}} coffee cultivation at lower elevations.', NULL, NULL, NULL, E'1.intensifying, 2.production, 3.pace, 4.impacting', NULL, NULL),
  ('9e17ec62-afa1-5f4e-ac78-ed7508054846'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'RE_ORDER_PARAGRAPHS', E'RE_ORDER_PARAGRAPHS', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '9e17ec62-afa1-5f4e-ac78-ed7508054846'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Stephen Hawking', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, E'4, 3, 1, 2', NULL, NULL),
  ('9e192df6-7218-517a-a9c1-690cd48f641d'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'LISTENING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '9e192df6-7218-517a-a9c1-690cd48f641d'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'WFD', NULL, '12c0d7b2-7c87-529f-b67d-a072d7a8507c'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'We study science to comprehend and value our surrounding world.', NULL, NULL),
  ('9e2319e4-aee4-5814-9249-1438c1b603ba'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'ANSWER_SHORT_QUESTION', E'ANSWER_SHORT_QUESTION', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '9e2319e4-aee4-5814-9249-1438c1b603ba'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'ASQ', E'What is the term used for the sun''s energy?', '3a1cfc1d-24b3-5de2-b154-e27ff34925d8'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'Solar energy', NULL, NULL),
  ('9e23fa26-7049-51ef-9517-cb101cdb7c28'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'SUMMARIZE_WRITTEN_TEXT', E'SUMMARIZE_WRITTEN_TEXT', E'WRITING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '9e23fa26-7049-51ef-9517-cb101cdb7c28'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Germ-Filled Atmosphere', E'‘What you see is that the most outstanding feature of life’s history is a constant domination by bacteria,’ said Stephen Jay Gould in 2009, a famous American geologist. Bacteria occur widely across the Earth’s surface in an incredible range of hostile environments. At the same time, we imagine the atmosphere as a fairly lifeless environment, save for some birds and high flying humans. However, scientists were surprised to find unprecedented densities of bacteria at some high elevations, which may lead to some unexpected effects.\nBacteria are some of the hardiest species on the planet, so it might not be totally surprising to find them airborne. What is an extremely surprising discovery is NASA’s finding that bacterial densities in the Earth’s upper atmosphere, at elevations of around 10 kilometers, actually exceed bacterial concentrations at lower elevations.\nBacteria densities over the Gulf of Mexico accounted for an incredible 20 percent of all matter sampled by scientists involved in a pioneering study of atmospheric composition. The bacteria are believed to be doing a lot more than floating around aimlessly.\nScientists suspect that the atmospheric bacteria might be responsible for partially controlling Earth’s climatic conditions as well. Theories proposed by some experts and scientists include the idea that bacteria serve as a nucleus around which water and ice crystals may condense, influencing cloud formation and rain patterns.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 5, 75),
  ('9e24a9a6-9c22-5a0e-bce6-fd7974ee3324'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'LISTENING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '9e24a9a6-9c22-5a0e-bce6-fd7974ee3324'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'WFD', NULL, 'eb36c299-6961-5396-b3b3-1731606ca76f'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'All stages of the course are available on the website.', NULL, NULL),
  ('9e2e299c-a565-5715-9ddd-eb54e90a24fe'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'LISTENING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', '9e2e299c-a565-5715-9ddd-eb54e90a24fe'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'WFD', NULL, '18bc2c4f-3ad0-5434-94ce-0318d39aef11'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'Both runners had pushed themselves to finish the race.', NULL, NULL),
