  ('a73e3b79-ad52-5688-90fa-664ce0c8117f'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'ANSWER_SHORT_QUESTION', E'ANSWER_SHORT_QUESTION', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'a73e3b79-ad52-5688-90fa-664ce0c8117f'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'ASQ', E'What is the opposite of maximum?', 'f9db6242-57c4-5a4c-bba6-e44fcb9ddd0f'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'Minimum', NULL, NULL),
  ('a74031c2-1e67-5283-ac05-4d822af99f18'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'READ_ALOUD', E'READ_ALOUD', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'a74031c2-1e67-5283-ac05-4d822af99f18'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Greenhouse Gases', E'Current research models indicate that climate change associated with increasing levels of greenhouse gases is likely to lead to the soils in the interiors of the major continents drying out. In response to a drying of cropland, people are likely to seek either new sources of irrigation water or new, wetter areas to farm. If we choose desalination of seawater as a possible solution, large amounts of energy will be required.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('a7462ce7-6617-5052-8016-748b9053280a'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'RE_TELL_LECTURE', E'RE_TELL_LECTURE', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'a7462ce7-6617-5052-8016-748b9053280a'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Entrepreneurship and Technology', NULL, '6ab176c8-1f00-5565-bf8b-3ab5c9331eb1'::uuid, NULL, E'In this era of unprecedented change, the synergy between entrepreneurship and technology stands as a beacon of progress. Entrepreneurship is the engine of growth, driving forward through innovation and adaptation. Technology, its indispensable ally, provides the tools that transform vision into reality. Consider the rise of mobile technology: it has revolutionized the way we do business, obliterating traditional barriers to entry and enabling even the smallest venture to have a global reach. This democratization of business opportunities fosters a more inclusive economy, where anyone with an idea and a smartphone can become a key player. Concurrently, technology thrives on the challenges presented by entrepreneurial endeavors. Each new startup idea prompts technological advances as solutions to real-world problems, further fueling the cycle of innovation. As we look to the future, remember that entrepreneurship coupled with technology holds the power not just to create businesses, but to solve some of humanity''s most pressing issues. Let us harness this partnership to build a world where progress and prosperity are accessible to all.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('a746cdd0-f7e4-51f6-b317-d332a72327d2'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'RE_TELL_LECTURE', E'RE_TELL_LECTURE', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'a746cdd0-f7e4-51f6-b317-d332a72327d2'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Environmental Conservation', NULL, '90ea83b1-b758-559d-bdc0-c39239a602ab'::uuid, NULL, E'I want to focus on the critical role each of us plays in sustainable living and environmental conservation. As global environmental issues like climate change and pollution escalate, individual actions have never been more important. One key area is our daily choices. By opting for environmentally friendly products, reducing waste, and conserving energy, we contribute to a healthier planet. For example, choosing to bike or walk instead of driving reduces carbon emissions, and opting for reusable items over single-use plastics helps decrease pollution. Moreover, awareness and education play a significant role. Understanding the impact of our actions on the environment motivates us to make more sustainable choices. This knowledge can also be spread within our communities, leading to a collective effort towards environmental conservation. Every small action counts in the fight against environmental degradation. By adopting sustainable practices in our daily lives, we can make a significant impact on preserving our planet for future generations.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('a74f8b91-0c87-528c-ba04-cd1f9d2030f7'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'LISTENING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'a74f8b91-0c87-528c-ba04-cd1f9d2030f7'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'WFD', NULL, '7be041cf-906b-5b16-8d28-d51b6fc9cb11'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'Students should take full advantage of the university''s facilities.', NULL, NULL),
  ('a75371aa-94ac-53ff-afae-234874161334'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'REPEAT_SENTENCE', E'REPEAT_SENTENCE', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'a75371aa-94ac-53ff-afae-234874161334'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'RS', NULL, '574c4fcc-1828-55ac-bc0d-9c9801818225'::uuid, NULL, E'I hope to retire early, ideally before reaching sixty years old.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('a75516e6-d1de-5b9a-8239-166ce792fcb6'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'LISTENING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'a75516e6-d1de-5b9a-8239-166ce792fcb6'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'WFD', NULL, 'c0665e1e-5493-5bc9-bec5-67cd2e01d7d8'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'Policies are extremely strict with office workers.', NULL, NULL),
  ('a759666b-a3d7-5893-9ea8-2394e49c0a6f'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'REPEAT_SENTENCE', E'REPEAT_SENTENCE', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'a759666b-a3d7-5893-9ea8-2394e49c0a6f'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'RS', NULL, '424b9d3f-9c3f-5b42-afa2-c3732440e907'::uuid, NULL, E'This can be seen as the starting point of my discussion today.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('a759ed1c-b08e-547d-8ff8-f8137c7fdfa4'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'READ_ALOUD', E'READ_ALOUD', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'a759ed1c-b08e-547d-8ff8-f8137c7fdfa4'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Urban Forests', E'Urban forests play a crucial role in promoting urban sustainability and resilience. They contribute to climate change mitigation by sequestering carbon dioxide through photosynthesis. Urban forests also help manage stormwater runoff by absorbing and filtering rainwater, reducing the risk of flooding. Furthermore, these green spaces provide social and psychological benefits, such as stress reduction and improved mental well-being.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('a7616c68-eb94-5a20-b68c-36ae88934d69'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DRAG_AND_DROP', E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DRAG_AND_DROP', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'a7616c68-eb94-5a20-b68c-36ae88934d69'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Martens'' Diet', E'Studies of pine martens in Scotland have shown that the diet varies {{1}} with small mammals, berries (in late summer/autumn) and small birds being the main foods. Recent work on a plantation has shown that martens {{2}} their home ranges in areas dominated by forests and {{3}} shrubs. Within home ranges, martens utilize areas of grassy vegetation within the forest which are typically associated with Microtus voles, for which a strong selective {{4}} over other small mammals is shown.', NULL, NULL, NULL, E'1.seasonally, 2.establish, 3.dense, 4.preference', NULL, NULL),
  ('a762b7ba-1624-5a44-a53d-a0f1cedaa05c'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DRAG_AND_DROP', E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DRAG_AND_DROP', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'a762b7ba-1624-5a44-a53d-a0f1cedaa05c'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Student-run Restaurant', E'The rest of Taylor''s restaurant is student-run. Students in quantity food production and service management {{1}} make the articulate and detailed dishes. "We teach students to understand where a product comes from and to respect that product," Garmy said. Skeptics might doubt the {{2}} of a student-run restaurant, but one visit to Taylor''s will immediately change their outlook. Dishes such as orecchiette and butternut squash, pappardelle with duck and bistro chicken will please any appetite while imparting the need to {{3}} for a second taste. Students are taught to use ratios and proportions rather than recipes when creating dishes. "Understanding ratios and proportions when creating dishes instead of recipes makes students think and {{4}} teaches them how to cook, rather than just reading a recipe and not learning from it," Garmy said. Garmy said he believes in using all aspects of a product, which Taylor''s {{5}} reflects.', NULL, NULL, NULL, E'1.classes, 2.quality, 3.return, 4.actually, 5.menu', NULL, NULL),
  ('a7666400-72c3-5513-8c9b-cb2aa198a650'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'RE_TELL_LECTURE', E'RE_TELL_LECTURE', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'a7666400-72c3-5513-8c9b-cb2aa198a650'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Evolution of Astronomy', NULL, '25090591-10fe-5264-9647-3e64d19bdf06'::uuid, NULL, E'I am excited to talk about the fascinating evolution of astronomy and how it has expanded our understanding of the cosmos. This field, blending ancient observations with modern technology, continues to intrigue and inspire. Astronomy''s journey from early stargazing to the use of advanced telescopes illustrates the human quest for knowledge. Ancient civilizations used the stars for navigation and timekeeping, laying the groundwork for today''s astronomical achievements. The Hubble Space Telescope, for instance, has allowed us to peer into distant galaxies, reshaping our understanding of the universe. Moreover, the study of astronomy has profound implications for our place in the universe. It challenges us to think beyond our planet, fostering a sense of wonder and curiosity. Discoveries about black holes, distant planets, and the possibility of life beyond Earth continue to captivate and motivate future generations of astronomers. The evolution of astronomy is not just a scientific journey; it is a testament to human curiosity and our relentless pursuit to understand the universe we inhabit. It reminds us that the sky is not the limit, but just the beginning.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('a7762dbc-5d0a-5f8a-897c-79e7b70fd1cd'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'LISTENING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'a7762dbc-5d0a-5f8a-897c-79e7b70fd1cd'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'WFD', NULL, 'fadc710d-000d-5000-8122-10bcc013ebf7'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'We are committed to recruiting candidates from all backgrounds and identities.', NULL, NULL),
  ('a776f6a6-fad5-5982-8092-39f3f2bc7f21'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'REPEAT_SENTENCE', E'REPEAT_SENTENCE', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'a776f6a6-fad5-5982-8092-39f3f2bc7f21'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'RS', NULL, '2af2e8e0-92dc-5028-ad33-46e65f0f005e'::uuid, NULL, E'Some young people seem to be addicted to their cell phones.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('a77768fb-077a-5506-b79c-fe3d43518a7f'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'ANSWER_SHORT_QUESTION', E'ANSWER_SHORT_QUESTION', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'a77768fb-077a-5506-b79c-fe3d43518a7f'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'ASQ', E'What do we call a person who accesses others'' computer systems without permission?', 'ea3c9f1b-6b02-5c5b-88f5-07fef6ac116d'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'Hacker', NULL, NULL),
  ('a77c0bc9-0345-5b8e-9dc9-24362b58599c'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'READ_ALOUD', E'READ_ALOUD', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'a77c0bc9-0345-5b8e-9dc9-24362b58599c'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Supermassive Black Hole', E'Astronomers announced that they have finally assembled an image of the supermassive black hole at the center of our galaxy. This image shows a bright ring surrounding the darkness, the telltale sign of the shadow of the black hole. It reveals the turbulent, twisting region immediately surrounding the black hole in new detail.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('a77e9c9d-e35b-5b5b-8501-6b52668d5ebd'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'LISTENING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'a77e9c9d-e35b-5b5b-8501-6b52668d5ebd'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'WFD', NULL, 'aee7a20c-35cd-5d8b-9709-6173450106a4'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'A good research assistant is not afraid to ask questions.', NULL, NULL),
  ('a78da38e-a284-58d9-8128-15eaae3fb793'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'LISTENING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'a78da38e-a284-58d9-8128-15eaae3fb793'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'WFD', NULL, 'c7581af4-4451-5bc8-9880-752901a15bc5'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'In his lifetime, he composed a large number of works.', NULL, NULL),
  ('a791c6ee-86ee-5660-b710-98711d3ca4cd'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'SUMMARIZE_WRITTEN_TEXT', E'SUMMARIZE_WRITTEN_TEXT', E'WRITING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'a791c6ee-86ee-5660-b710-98711d3ca4cd'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Australia-US Alliance', E'Some "moments" seem more important in hindsight than they were at the time. David Day, for example, looks at John Curtin''s famous "Australia looks to America" statement of December 1941, a moment remembered as embodying a fundamental shift in Australia''s strategic alliance away from Britain towards the US. As Day points out, the shift to the US as our primary ally was a long, drawn-out process which occurred over half a century. Curtin''s statement is iconic - it represents and symbolizes the shift - but in and of itself it made almost no difference. Russell McGregor makes similar arguments with regard to the 1967 referendum, falsely hailed in our memories as a huge advance in Aboriginal rights.\nThere are many other important events which our contributors examine - the campaign to save the Franklin River; the landings at Gallipoli, the discovery of gold in 1851, the disastrous Premiers'' Plan designed to cope with the Great Depression, to name just a few.\nTaken together, our contributors show that narrative approaches to Australian history are not as simple as might be imagined. There is of course the issue of what should be included and what should not be - what, after all, makes a moment or an event sufficiently important to be included in an official narrative? Just as importantly, the moments and events that are included in narrative histories are open to multiple interpretations.\nWe hope this collection will provide an important reminder to those wanting to impose a universal history curriculum for our schoolchildren, and indeed a lesson to all Australians wishing to understand their nation''s past. History is never simple or straightforward, and it always resists attempts to make it so.', NULL, NULL, E'Some "moments" seem more important in hindsight than they were at the time, and there are many other important events which our contributors examine, but narrative approaches to Australian history are not as simple as might be imagined, while the moments and events that are included in narrative histories are open to multiple interpretations, so history is never simple or straightforward, and it always resists attempts to make it so.', NULL, 5, 75),
  ('a795946d-5bf6-5530-87f7-852bac056f67'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'LISTENING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'a795946d-5bf6-5530-87f7-852bac056f67'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'WFD', NULL, 'b85425a7-46ef-5862-8735-a1ee62907826'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'Our students have participated in exchange programs to widen their horizons.', NULL, NULL),
