  ('aa4ff267-18d9-544f-8ff2-3b4bfb90873f'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'REPEAT_SENTENCE', E'REPEAT_SENTENCE', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'aa4ff267-18d9-544f-8ff2-3b4bfb90873f'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'RS', NULL, '289e22ff-95c7-55d5-ad45-49165695b580'::uuid, NULL, E'During conversations, tone, expressions, and gestures play roles in understanding.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('aa50ff6f-aec7-5cff-bfd8-c4916c790312'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'MC_READING_MULTIPLE', E'MC_READING_MULTIPLE', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'aa50ff6f-aec7-5cff-bfd8-c4916c790312'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Carbon Dioxide', E'The current concentration of carbon dioxide in the atmosphere is about 360 parts per million. Human activities are having a major influence on atmospheric carbon dioxide concentrations, which are rising so fast that current predictions are that atmospheric concentrations of carbon dioxide will double in the next 50 to 100 years. The Intergovernmental Panel on Climate Change (IPCC) report in 1992, which represents a consensus of most atmospheric scientists, predicts that a doubling of carbon dioxide concentration would raise global temperatures anywhere between 1.4° C and 4.5°C. The IPCC report issued in 2001 raised the temperature prediction almost twofold. The suggested rise in temperature is greater than the changes that occurred in the past between ice ages. The increase in temperatures would not be uniform, with the smallest changes at the equator and changes two or three times as great at the poles. The local effects of these global changes are difficult to predict, but it is generally agreed that they may include alterations in ocean currents, increased winter flooding in some areas of the Northern Hemisphere, a higher incidence of summer.\n\nAccording to the paragraph, what can be said about the effects of global changes?', NULL, NULL, NULL, E'The effects may occur more conspicuously in certain areas than others\nIt is hard to know exactly what form the local effects will take.', NULL, NULL),
  ('aa52fe33-50ed-5046-9929-94ef3f8f6f1c'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DRAG_AND_DROP', E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DRAG_AND_DROP', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'aa52fe33-50ed-5046-9929-94ef3f8f6f1c'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Linguistic Effects', E'An important corollary of this focus on language as the window to legal epistemology is the central role of {{1}} to law and other sociocultural processes. In particular, the {{2}} that people hold about how language works combine with linguistic structuring to create powerful, often unconscious effects. In recent years, {{3}} anthropologists have made much progress in developing more precisely analytic {{4}} for tracking those effects.', NULL, NULL, NULL, E'1.discourse, 2.ideas, 3.linguistic, 4.tools', NULL, NULL),
  ('aa58a8a6-5148-5c81-b9b0-a94108031073'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'LISTENING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'aa58a8a6-5148-5c81-b9b0-a94108031073'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'WFD', NULL, '0b6e1511-9017-5a83-bf60-6a555800d40f'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'Playing music can help you feel less stressed, experts say.', NULL, NULL),
  ('aa5bfd56-febc-5763-8fd3-62865fdc08e1'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'RE_TELL_LECTURE', E'RE_TELL_LECTURE', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'aa5bfd56-febc-5763-8fd3-62865fdc08e1'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Food Medicine', NULL, '27a9c505-be3f-5941-8264-346941b048b3'::uuid, NULL, E'I was a Complan pharmacist, I do consults, and I got into this cuz I really saw that in my own kids, but my own patients, they were missing the food part. They were missing that nutrition part. And as I corrected the nutrition in them, I’m like, oh my, this changed their whole life. You were taught in pharmacist school “just give her drug, give her drug, give her drug”. Drugs are just band aids. They don’t cure us. If you don’t have good nutrition, that foundation that we were building our body on isn’t there, and so that leads to all sorts of things, you know, depression, leaky gut, you know, your gum disease. People that are constantly having headaches, when they are not growing properly. Our kids don’t grow properly cause of nutrition. So, starts to get foundation. If you have a good, good foundation with nutrition, eat it, what you grow or buy it locally, you gonna be way healthier. So crazy how your diet can affect pretty much everything. It’s hard to put into a sentence how cool and interesting I thought this whole experience was. I’ve always been a firm believer and what you put in your body matters, and the food you put in your body matters. And we are allowing food industries to spray with pesticides, to transport it super far, change its enzymes and nutritional benefits, so that when we are receiving the food, it’s not even giving us the fuel that we need to survive in a healthy way. The body is an incredible piece of equipment, machinery. You put good stuff in, it gets good stuff out. You put bad stuff in, in time, bad stuff will come out. But you can correct it. It just take some, some effort on our part to do what’s right. Who said that – Hippocrates – you are what you eat. Let food be medicine, let medicine be food. He said a lot more elegantly but, yeah, I firmly believe that.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('aa5e7219-7fd5-527a-9562-195a99c879a7'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DRAG_AND_DROP', E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DRAG_AND_DROP', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'aa5e7219-7fd5-527a-9562-195a99c879a7'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Developmental Problems', E'Communication and language development are {{1}} skills for young children''s growth and learning. However, some children may struggle or {{2}} behind in developing these skills. Families with concerns should seek intervention as soon as possible. Early intervention can {{3}} a big difference in helping children {{4}} their difficulties and achieve their full potential.', NULL, NULL, NULL, E'1.key, 2.lag, 3.make, 4.overcome', NULL, NULL),
  ('aa689403-b75e-5623-a87b-57f54a30e76a'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'MC_READING_SINGLE', E'MC_READING_SINGLE', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'aa689403-b75e-5623-a87b-57f54a30e76a'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Stress Levels', E'Teens who have lived in poverty experience physical signs of stress at higher levels than those in more economically secure families. In an ongoing longitudinal study, researchers tested the saliva of 229 17-year-olds, many of whom had lived at or below the poverty level between the ages 10 and 16, for their levels of cortisol — a hormone in the blood. It is one of the commonest metrics for measuring stress. It showed that poverty in children has resulted in stress. Also, researchers examined cortisol levels after participants experienced a social stressor and their cortisol levels typically increase following stress.\n\nThe author develops the passage mainly by ___ .', NULL, NULL, NULL, E'presenting conclusion and supporting evidence.', NULL, NULL),
  ('aa766025-8f38-524c-9132-1f31e630dfd8'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'LISTENING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'aa766025-8f38-524c-9132-1f31e630dfd8'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'WFD', NULL, '8aa76c60-7eaa-51e5-86c5-eb6e00199219'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'The guidelines are due to be updated shortly.', NULL, NULL),
  ('aa7781ce-a6e7-58ed-9576-390bdccf78c3'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'REPEAT_SENTENCE', E'REPEAT_SENTENCE', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'aa7781ce-a6e7-58ed-9576-390bdccf78c3'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'RS', NULL, 'a8efd56d-c59d-5a31-b8ca-c8d24eb489ef'::uuid, NULL, E'Several students raised different examples.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('aa7b9115-a941-5300-99e7-0daf57903107'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DROPDOWN', E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DROPDOWN', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'aa7b9115-a941-5300-99e7-0daf57903107'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Transitions in Britain', E'The transitions which occurred in Britain around 100 BC, and after 43 AD (when the Roman Army {{1}} Britain) represent the key points of socio-economic trend in Britain''s past. During the first century BC, the traditional communal form of life {{2}} rapidly to a world where certain individuals {{3}} more important. During the first century AD, Britain became fully a part of the Roman Empire.', NULL, NULL, NULL, E'1.invaded, 2.shifted, 3.became', NULL, NULL),
  ('aa808d3f-7dda-54ad-87ef-4e5c54769418'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'REPEAT_SENTENCE', E'REPEAT_SENTENCE', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'aa808d3f-7dda-54ad-87ef-4e5c54769418'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'RS', NULL, '4bfe8975-6a1d-588b-8adb-fae4810d0940'::uuid, NULL, E'Tuesday’s lecture on social psychology will now take place in the central hall.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('aa821dfe-2947-53ef-8383-d6c726eb263e'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'WRITE_ESSAY', E'WRITE_ESSAY', E'WRITING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'aa821dfe-2947-53ef-8383-d6c726eb263e'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Tuition', E'Education matters a lot to children, but some families cannot afford to pay the tuition. So, some people have argued that schools should be tuition-free. What is your opinion?', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 200, 300),
  ('aa88efee-6d71-5b4a-94fc-c47196d69d07'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DROPDOWN', E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DROPDOWN', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'aa88efee-6d71-5b4a-94fc-c47196d69d07'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Odorous House Ant', E'A common response to seeing an ant inside your house is to stomp on it. But if you crush a member of the ant species Tapinoma sessile, you might catch a whiff of a strange smell—a smell that reminds some people of blue cheese, rancid butter or rotten coconut. In fact, the smell is so noticeable that the insect''s common name is the "odorous house ant." And many people call it the coconut ant.\nIn an effort to figure out why people have these reactions, {{2}} enlisted {{3}} at an event called the North Carolina BugFest. One-hundred-forty-three volunteers smelled smushed ants and were asked to identify the scent from four choices: blue cheese, rancid butter, rotten coconut or just other.\nAlthough Web sites overwhelmingly call the smell rotten coconut, almost 40 percent of the human judges picked blue cheese and about 25 percent picked rotten coconut. More than 30 percent went with the choice of other.\nThe scientists then analyzed the chemicals {{4}} for the ant odor, as well as the smelly chemicals in blue cheese, fresh coconut and coconut buried underground for three days. It turns out that the chemistry of the ants'' scent is indeed similar to that of blue cheese and rotten coconut. But not to fresh coconut. And the researchers note that the Penicillium {{5}} that turn coconut oil rancid are also {{6}} in the production of blue cheese. The study is in the journal American Entomologist.\nThe researchers also noted that the most common write-in candidate as a description for the ants'' aroma was "cleaning spray." And one little girl told them that the ants "smelled exactly like her doctor."', NULL, NULL, NULL, E'1.researchers, 2.visitors, 3.responsible, 4.microbes, 5.involved', NULL, NULL),
  ('aa94f9c5-4dce-5406-b5c4-cb31af145c19'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'LISTENING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'aa94f9c5-4dce-5406-b5c4-cb31af145c19'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'WFD', NULL, '487c633d-5afc-5c04-b35d-eae4acd1666d'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'Stories often contain messages in our life.', NULL, NULL),
  ('aa987076-1c4a-5a0b-872b-f271769d7427'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DROPDOWN', E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DROPDOWN', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'aa987076-1c4a-5a0b-872b-f271769d7427'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Market for Vegetarian Foods', E'Mintel Consumer Intelligence {{1}} the 2002 market for vegetarian foods, those that directly replace meat or other animal products, to be $1.5 billion. Note that this excludes traditional vegetarian foods such as produce, pasta, and rice. Mintel forecasts the market to nearly double by 2006 to $2.8 billion, with the highest growth coming from soymilk, especially refrigerated brands. The Food and Drug Administration''s 1999 decision to allow manufacturers to include heart-healthy claims on foods that deliver at least 6.25 grams of soy protein per serving and are also low in {{2}} fat and cholesterol has spurred {{3}} interest in soymilk and other soy foods. A representative of manufacturer Food Tech International (Veggie Patch brand) reported that from 1998 to 1999, the percentage of {{4}} willing to try soy products jumped from 32% to 67%. Beliefs about soy''s {{5}} in reducing the symptoms of menopause also attracted new consumers. A 2000 survey conducted by the United Soybean Board showed that the number of people eating soy products once a week or more was up to 27%. Forty-five percent of respondents had tried tofu, 41% had sampled veggie burgers, and 25% had experience with soymilk (Soy foods USA e-mail newsletter). Mintel estimates 2001 sales of frozen and refrigerated meat {{6}} in food stores at nearly $300 million, with soymilk sales nearing $250 million.', NULL, NULL, NULL, E'1.estimates, 2.saturated, 3.tremendous, 4.consumers, 5.effectiveness, 6.alternatives', NULL, NULL),
  ('aa990412-4238-55a2-a78c-51fd0cb26195'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'REPEAT_SENTENCE', E'REPEAT_SENTENCE', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'aa990412-4238-55a2-a78c-51fd0cb26195'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'RS', NULL, 'a5909408-ee88-576c-b624-fd5d86549c03'::uuid, NULL, E'There are lots of opportunities to meet people in this course.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('aa9b20dc-bf1a-5195-bdd6-2ee4fbabdde2'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'ANSWER_SHORT_QUESTION', E'ANSWER_SHORT_QUESTION', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'aa9b20dc-bf1a-5195-bdd6-2ee4fbabdde2'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'ASQ', E'How do we describe something that exists all the time?', 'b60f41e3-8df0-5a5a-9905-cede73a48caf'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'Permanent / lasting / immortal / eternal', NULL, NULL),
  ('aa9d9229-b84a-59d4-bb31-338f7c3a81d3'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'READ_ALOUD', E'READ_ALOUD', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'aa9d9229-b84a-59d4-bb31-338f7c3a81d3'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Burdens of Marriage', E'The financial pressure associated with marriage can be daunting, but with careful planning and communication, couples can navigate these burdens successfully. Prioritizing financial stability, setting a realistic budget for wedding expenses, and making informed decisions about housing options can help alleviate some of the financial stress.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
