  ('ac320714-bc3d-5cd8-bed2-8dc546a1c5bd'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'ANSWER_SHORT_QUESTION', E'ANSWER_SHORT_QUESTION', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'ac320714-bc3d-5cd8-bed2-8dc546a1c5bd'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'ASQ', E'How do we describe a land that is unable to produce good crops?', '8ff3268b-e442-556e-8bdd-2c0208432f1c'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'Barren / infertile', NULL, NULL),
  ('ac3c43e5-ccf8-54bf-ab1b-e243780da8e0'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'READ_ALOUD', E'READ_ALOUD', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'ac3c43e5-ccf8-54bf-ab1b-e243780da8e0'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Car-free Zone', E'To reduce pollution, it is essential that the town center becomes a car-free zone. A ring road should be built so that cars are diverted away from the town center. The main shopping streets could be converted into a pedestrianized area. If trees and flowers are planted, the town center will be transformed into a quiet and green space where residents can enjoy shopping and walking in a healthy environment.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('ac3f5a3b-faa6-5d83-b498-fe0fbaf51960'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'WRITE_ESSAY', E'WRITE_ESSAY', E'WRITING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'ac3f5a3b-faa6-5d83-b498-fe0fbaf51960'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Formal Written Examination', E'Many education systems assess students'' learning using formal written examinations. Those kinds of exams are a valid method. To what extent do you agree or disagree? Give examples with your own experience.', NULL, NULL, E'Nowadays, whether formal written examinations are a valid method has fueled heated discussions. Proponents claim that written exams are objective tests, whereas opponents contend that written exams can lead to oversights of ability. From my perspective, I am convinced that formal written examinations are a partially valid method.\nTo begin with, formal written examinations can ensure the fairness of assessment and effectively test students'' mastery of basic knowledge. For example, students take the same exam, which ensures unbiased assessment and tests their grasp of textbook knowledge. In addition to this, exams have clear scoring standards, making evaluation objective and checking students'' memory of key points. Other than that, written exams can cover multiple knowledge points, testing students'' overall learning and basic skills. It is thus shown that formal written tests provide fair grading.\nBesides, I also believe that formal written examinations have limitations as they cannot fully reflect students'' practical abilities and innovative thinking. On top of that, exams focus on written answers, failing to show students'' hands-on ability, creative thinking, and problem-solving in life. Moreover, fixed exam questions restrict students'' divergent thinking and flexibility in real situations. Recently, I have examined an article arguing that written tests pay little attention to students'' communication skills, which are important in daily interactions and teamwork. This clearly proves that written exams have limits.\nTo conclude, there is no doubt that fair checks and skill gaps are essential in today''s world. While some might disagree, the evidence strongly supports the fact that written tests are somewhat useful for checking students'' progress.', NULL, 200, 300),
  ('ac4b6b9c-c165-511b-8faa-351b7d27daf3'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'READ_ALOUD', E'READ_ALOUD', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'ac4b6b9c-c165-511b-8faa-351b7d27daf3'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Learning English', E'In the past, naming English as a separate subject seemed relatively easy. The textbook selected and graded items of language which were put into content and then practiced intensively. New items were carefully controlled so that students could cope quite easily. Now English is used as a medium of instruction.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('ac50c1be-829a-5524-8183-347ec3d6cd29'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'READ_ALOUD', E'READ_ALOUD', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'ac50c1be-829a-5524-8183-347ec3d6cd29'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Croatian Coast', E'I stood at the edge of the cliff, feeling the wind whip through my hair as I looked out at the vast sea below. The colors of the water ranged from a deep navy blue to a sparkling turquoise. I took a deep breath of the salty sea air and felt a sense of peace wash over me. This was the beauty of the Croatian coast.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('ac5102ab-d41e-51db-916c-5f41b5f31195'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'ANSWER_SHORT_QUESTION', E'ANSWER_SHORT_QUESTION', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'ac5102ab-d41e-51db-916c-5f41b5f31195'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'ASQ', E'How often is a quarterly journal published?', '47ef4d27-e5e2-5d5e-bf6e-67e63e478b7c'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'Every three months / once a quarter', NULL, NULL),
  ('ac551b8a-f23f-5c77-8c74-79d88f22cae2'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'READ_ALOUD', E'READ_ALOUD', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'ac551b8a-f23f-5c77-8c74-79d88f22cae2'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Raccoons', E'Environmental, individual and social traits of free-ranging raccoons influence performance in cognitive testing. Shy raccoons are better learners than bold ones, a result that has implications for our relationship with urban wildlife.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('ac563c30-25b5-5839-b8b3-0426b4c6737e'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DRAG_AND_DROP', E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DRAG_AND_DROP', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'ac563c30-25b5-5839-b8b3-0426b4c6737e'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Gold Coast Zone', E'REIQ Gold Coast Zone chairman John Newlands said some southern suburbs were shaking off a poor reputation and {{1}} gentrification as wealthier residents moved in and displaced people from lower-income groups. "l think suburbs such as Miami have become {{2}} with people who previously would not have gone there," he said. "They have come into their own with new restaurants and markets {{3}} which has also made them more attractive." Developers have {{4}} on to the trend as well, with Sunland launching a $62 million development, Magnoli Residences, in Palm Beach.', NULL, NULL, NULL, E'1.experiencing, 2.popular, 3.opening, 4.cottoned', NULL, NULL),
  ('ac5c8699-3b4d-5d30-aa80-b0396b84efcd'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DRAG_AND_DROP', E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DRAG_AND_DROP', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'ac5c8699-3b4d-5d30-aa80-b0396b84efcd'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Coral Reefs', E'Coral reefs support more marine life than any other ocean ecosystem and are, not {{1}} , a favorite pursuit for many divers. But as well as being physically and biologically spectacular, coral reefs also {{2}} the livelihoods of over half a billion {{3}} . What is more, this number is expected to {{4}} in coming decades while the area of high-quality reef is expected to halve. In combination with the very real threat of climate change, which could lead to increased seawater temperatures and ocean {{5}} , we start to arrive at some quite frightening scenarios.', NULL, NULL, NULL, E'1.surprisingly, 2.sustain, 3.people, 4.double, 5.acidification', NULL, NULL),
  ('ac5c9785-699e-536f-926c-2ed69d759381'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DRAG_AND_DROP', E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DRAG_AND_DROP', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'ac5c9785-699e-536f-926c-2ed69d759381'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Fake News', E'At its core, we are defining ‘fake news’ as those news stories that are false: the story itself is {{1}} , with no verifiable facts, sources or {{2}} . Sometimes these stories may be {{3}} that is intentionally designed to mislead the reader, or may be designed as ‘clickbait’ written for economic {{4}} (the writer profits on the number of people who click on the story).', NULL, NULL, NULL, E'1.fabricated, 2.quotes, 3.propaganda, 4.incentives', NULL, NULL),
  ('ac63410d-1cd0-59c4-b482-99554c4b5063'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'READ_ALOUD', E'READ_ALOUD', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'ac63410d-1cd0-59c4-b482-99554c4b5063'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Corporate Psychopath', E'Around 1% of the adult population are defined as psychopaths, meaning they possess no conscience, shame, guilt, or ability to experience love for or feel empathy towards other people. Dr Boddy will discuss how they appear as potentially effective leaders, how they get to the top and what they do once they have achieved leadership.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('ac6b15f4-d8d0-5156-9500-16b04b9de3b6'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'READ_ALOUD', E'READ_ALOUD', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'ac6b15f4-d8d0-5156-9500-16b04b9de3b6'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'English Colonies', E'English colonies emerged along the eastern seaboard for a variety of reasons. People, primarily men, originally migrated to Virginia to find gold and silver to make a quick profit. After it became evident that there were no precious metals in the area, men came to Virginia to start cultivating cash crops like tobacco.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('ac6cab0e-0c13-51b8-9ff2-3d12dbc2b378'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'ANSWER_SHORT_QUESTION', E'ANSWER_SHORT_QUESTION', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'ac6cab0e-0c13-51b8-9ff2-3d12dbc2b378'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'ASQ', E'In what room do scientists usually do experiments?', '6be518cf-a14e-527a-bf98-6d53faaa4208'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'Laboratory / lab', NULL, NULL),
  ('ac7956ea-4ae0-5593-bc9d-8ca0e5224b47'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'REPEAT_SENTENCE', E'REPEAT_SENTENCE', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'ac7956ea-4ae0-5593-bc9d-8ca0e5224b47'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'RS', NULL, '7b8a0bba-5393-58d0-a30e-84057be8591e'::uuid, NULL, E'Here is only one example but there are lots of others.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('ac7c15f0-bc9c-56d4-aadd-009ca4c779a1'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'LISTENING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'ac7c15f0-bc9c-56d4-aadd-009ca4c779a1'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'WFD', NULL, 'a3b16c52-8992-5edb-95ee-fce4e91dc589'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'The degree provides a comprehensive foundation in environmental resource issues.', NULL, NULL),
  ('ac7c5e5f-73aa-5905-94b6-9af273fc4159'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'REPEAT_SENTENCE', E'REPEAT_SENTENCE', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'ac7c5e5f-73aa-5905-94b6-9af273fc4159'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'RS', NULL, '69406854-f8f6-5312-b113-d4ea1b5a4a18'::uuid, NULL, E'Humans have the ability to mentally process over seven hundred words per minute.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('ac7e8d16-70ff-570e-9c7e-d9aa24ef1081'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'RE_TELL_LECTURE', E'RE_TELL_LECTURE', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'ac7e8d16-70ff-570e-9c7e-d9aa24ef1081'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Microbes and Health', NULL, '51dbe9fb-857d-52cb-bc71-3c68a3a71ba7'::uuid, NULL, E'Today, I''m excited to shed light on the often overlooked yet vital role of microbes in our ecosystem and health. Microorganisms, though invisible to the naked eye, play an essential role in maintaining the balance of life on Earth. Microbes, including bacteria, viruses, and fungi, are everywhere - in soil, water, air, and even within our bodies. In the environment, they are crucial for processes like decomposition and nutrient cycling, essentially recycling life''s essential elements. For instance, soil microbes break down organic matter, releasing nutrients that plants need to grow. In our bodies, microbes contribute significantly to our health. The human microbiome, the collection of all microorganisms living in and on our bodies, is essential for digestion, protecting against pathogens, and even regulating our immune system. Recent studies have shown that a diverse microbiome is linked to better health and can prevent certain diseases. In conclusion, microbes, despite their small size, have a colossal impact on our world and our health. Understanding and appreciating their role helps us realize the intricate connections between all forms of life.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('ac83b16f-9903-577d-a72b-052e2c55c9e7'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'ANSWER_SHORT_QUESTION', E'ANSWER_SHORT_QUESTION', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'ac83b16f-9903-577d-a72b-052e2c55c9e7'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'ASQ', E'What do we call a player who replaces another player in a sports game?', '23605249-b400-50e7-b8cc-bbe4f8b8735f'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'Substitute', NULL, NULL),
