  ('ac98e92a-3c3a-5c72-ad93-3e99b58c3e83'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'REPEAT_SENTENCE', E'REPEAT_SENTENCE', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'ac98e92a-3c3a-5c72-ad93-3e99b58c3e83'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'RS', NULL, '79bf5b75-d9ee-5b8b-b954-5c13eb02bc6a'::uuid, NULL, E'The chief economist has radical ideas for the economy.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('ac9d9d87-dbe1-531f-9041-a3a9d748a022'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DRAG_AND_DROP', E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DRAG_AND_DROP', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'ac9d9d87-dbe1-531f-9041-a3a9d748a022'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Statistical Theory', E'Social reforms are normally {{1}} as a result of statistical analyses of factors such as crime rates and poverty levels etc. Large-scale population can result from projections devised by statisticians. Manufacturers can provide better products at lower costs by {{2}} statistical control tools, {{3}} as control charts. Diseases are controlled through analyses designed to anticipate epidemics. Endangered species of fish and other wildlife are protected through regulations and laws that react to statistical estimates of changing population sizes. And, {{4}} statistical analysis of fatality rates, legislators can better justify laws, such as those governing air pollution, auto inspections, seat belt and airbag use, and drunk driving.', NULL, NULL, NULL, E'1.initiated, 2.using, 3.such, 4.through', NULL, NULL),
  ('aca1f882-2463-56ce-ac60-977e17c046ff'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'READ_ALOUD', E'READ_ALOUD', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'aca1f882-2463-56ce-ac60-977e17c046ff'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Teacher Training', E'We''ve been training fewer teachers in recent years while the population has been increasing and a very large cohort of teachers, the baby boomer teachers, are nearing retirement. So all three of those things have converged to create what I think is going to be an even greater problem in coming years to what it is now, so we''ve got a lot of work to do a very rapid catch-up.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('acb1c75e-e92e-5796-bcfd-dbfc9c51e5a7'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'SELECT_MISSING_WORD', E'SELECT_MISSING_WORD', E'LISTENING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'acb1c75e-e92e-5796-bcfd-dbfc9c51e5a7'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Biology', E'Biology is considered one of the natural sciences. It is the science of life and life''s processes. And like life science is better understood by observing it then by trying to create a precise definition. Over the next fifteen weeks, we will be observing the science of biology. In many ways, biology is the most demanding of all sciences. This is partly because living systems are so complex. Biology is also a multi disciplinary science. It requires knowledge of chemistry, physics, and mathematics. And of all the sciences, biology is the most linked to the social sciences, and ...\n\nAt the end of the recording the lost word or group of words has been replaced by a beep. Select the correct option to complete the recording.', 'a62fc6ac-95a1-50d5-862d-804465037355'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'humanities', NULL, NULL),
  ('acb4b838-5fe2-5fa3-868f-5401cfcca244'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DROPDOWN', E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DROPDOWN', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'acb4b838-5fe2-5fa3-868f-5401cfcca244'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Sleep More', E'Increasing the amount of sleep a person gets has been linked to eating fewer sugary foods, and making better nutritional choices. Wendy Hall, at King’s College London, and her team {{1}} 42 volunteers to help them investigate the link between sleep and diet. Half the participants were given advice on how to get more sleep – such as avoiding caffeine before bed, establishing a relaxing {{2}} , and trying not to go to bed too full or hungry. This advice was intended to help them boost the amount of sleep they each got by 90 minutes a night. The remaining 21 volunteers received no such advice. The team found that, of those who were given the advice, 86 per cent spent more time in bed, and around half slept for longer than they used to. These {{3}} sleep patterns were associated with an average reduction in the intake of free sugars of 10 grams a day. People who were getting more sleep also ate fewer carbohydrates. There were no significant changes in diet in the control group.', NULL, NULL, NULL, E'1.enlisted, 2.routine, 3.extended', NULL, NULL),
  ('acbd33f8-c1b0-55d8-a46f-282d85e676a7'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'LISTENING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'acbd33f8-c1b0-55d8-a46f-282d85e676a7'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'WFD', NULL, '4f6d4c9c-a256-5f94-bd0c-cf0a4a002a99'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'Some teachers prefer to talk with students in the hallway.', NULL, NULL);
