  ('b0796b2b-2f18-51ca-a003-ec33bd09e88a'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'ANSWER_SHORT_QUESTION', E'ANSWER_SHORT_QUESTION', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'b0796b2b-2f18-51ca-a003-ec33bd09e88a'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'ASQ', E'What is the term for a thin slice of meat, typically veal, that is breaded and fried?', 'f0c11641-441f-529f-a1b4-32384ca309f4'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'Schnitzel', NULL, NULL),
  ('b07c535f-b9e7-5b66-b976-a4bb7d824c1d'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'READ_ALOUD', E'READ_ALOUD', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'b07c535f-b9e7-5b66-b976-a4bb7d824c1d'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Healthcare', E'In the fast-changing world of modern healthcare, the job of a doctor is more and more like the job of a chief executive. The people who run hospitals and physicians'' practices don''t just need to know medicine. They must also be able to balance budgets, motivate a large and diverse staff and make difficult marketing and legal decisions.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('b084a995-6c7a-5d18-ace3-9f9a6d23b7de'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'READ_ALOUD', E'READ_ALOUD', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'b084a995-6c7a-5d18-ace3-9f9a6d23b7de'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Lunar Events', E'Three unusual lunar events will coincide on Wednesday night: a blue moon, a super moon and a blood moon. A blue moon signifies two new moons during the same month, because the moon''s orbit does not coincide completely with the calendar. A super moon is when the moon gets the closest to earth. And a blood moon happens when the earth, sun and moon are all lined up, making the moon appear red.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
