  ('b5040816-7d2e-5d43-96bc-a4fbfb40bbfd'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'READ_ALOUD', E'READ_ALOUD', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'b5040816-7d2e-5d43-96bc-a4fbfb40bbfd'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Coffee', E'Coffee is more than just a beverage – it''s a way of life. From the bold aroma to the rich taste, coffee provides a daily boost of energy and happiness. It''s true that some people are sensitive to caffeine, but coffee can still be enjoyed in moderation. And with so many different brewing methods and flavors to choose from, there''s a perfect cup of coffee out there for everyone.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('b504973e-5225-58e7-92ef-5d7e1480e165'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'RE_ORDER_PARAGRAPHS', E'RE_ORDER_PARAGRAPHS', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'b504973e-5225-58e7-92ef-5d7e1480e165'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Remote Planetary Bodies(远程行星体)', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, E'4, 2, 3, 1, 5', NULL, NULL),
  ('b507d3bd-4617-5cf5-a9a0-9fbf3131af4b'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'MC_READING_SINGLE', E'MC_READING_SINGLE', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'b507d3bd-4617-5cf5-a9a0-9fbf3131af4b'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Soda v.s. Powder', E'Baking soda is made from one ingredient – sodium bicarbonate. Sodium bicarbonate is a base (alkaline) that''s activated when it comes in contact with an acid, such as buttermilk, yogurt, brown sugar or vinegar. When baking soda activates, it immediately releases carbon dioxide bubbles that help your baked goods rise and become light and fluffy. On the other hand, baking powder is a combination of baking soda (sodium bicarbonate) and two acids, often monocalcium phosphate and sodium aluminum sulfate. These two additional ingredients work to extend the leavening process. The monocalcium phosphate reacts to the sodium bicarbonate first, when the baking powder is stirred into a wet batter or dough; then the sodium aluminum sulfate reacts to the sodium bicarbonate when it''s both moist and hot.\n\nAccording to the passage, which of the following statement is NOT true?', NULL, NULL, NULL, E'Unlike baking soda which extends the leavening process, baking powder can accelerate the process.', NULL, NULL),
  ('b5097638-f8bc-56f5-ba32-4d744a4f002d'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'REPEAT_SENTENCE', E'REPEAT_SENTENCE', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'b5097638-f8bc-56f5-ba32-4d744a4f002d'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'RS', NULL, 'aedf6194-bbe3-521c-a1e1-a2dad53d8a8f'::uuid, NULL, E'I''m not sure really. Most research is beneficial but some can be unethical or even dangerous.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('b509f347-c415-5a99-8477-9df3556fa17f'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'ANSWER_SHORT_QUESTION', E'ANSWER_SHORT_QUESTION', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'b509f347-c415-5a99-8477-9df3556fa17f'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'ASQ', E'What term do we use to describe something we cannot see through?', '864e5978-118e-5af9-8425-22fe3627f11c'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'Opaque', NULL, NULL),
  ('b50f2717-f1cf-5d51-8234-bb88911c5582'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DRAG_AND_DROP', E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DRAG_AND_DROP', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'b50f2717-f1cf-5d51-8234-bb88911c5582'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Children Breakfast', E'Children who eat breakfast regularly {{1}} more nutrients that are essential for healthy development. As a result, they are more likely to {{2}} both physically and mentally. Studies also show that such children {{3}} to behave better in school and maintain higher levels of concentration.', NULL, NULL, NULL, E'1.consume, 2.thrive, 3.tend', NULL, NULL),
  ('b51d8f17-0c06-52a2-b42f-a1de96acf9d7'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DRAG_AND_DROP', E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DRAG_AND_DROP', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'b51d8f17-0c06-52a2-b42f-a1de96acf9d7'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Tokyo Olympics', E'The Tokyo Olympics ended with a record number of medals for women. Women athletes {{1}} 58% of the total medals for Team USA, and 41% of the total medals for Team GB. Women also {{2}} history by competing in new events, such as skateboarding, surfing, and karate. The Tokyo Olympics also featured the most gender-balanced program ever, with almost {{3}} numbers of male and female participants.', NULL, NULL, NULL, E'1.won, 2.made, 3.equal', NULL, NULL),
  ('b51dbc30-046e-597f-88e7-08952425c89f'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DRAG_AND_DROP', E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DRAG_AND_DROP', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'b51dbc30-046e-597f-88e7-08952425c89f'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Selfies', E'To better understand selfies and how people form their identities online, the researchers combed through 2.5 million selfie posts on Instagram to determine what kinds of identity statements people make by taking and sharing the photos. Nearly 52 percent of all selfies {{1}} the appearance category: pictures of people showing off their make-up, clothes, lips, etc. Pics about looks were two times more popular than the other 14 categories {{2}} . After appearances, social selfies with friends, loved ones, and pets were the most common (14 percent). Then came ethnicity pics (13 percent), travel (7 percent), and health and fitness (5 percent). The researchers noted that the prevalence of ethnicity selfies (selfies about a person’s ethnicity, nationality or country of origin) is an indication that people are proud of their backgrounds. They also found that most selfies are solo pictures, {{3}} than taken with a group. Overall, an overwhelming 57 percent of selfies on Instagram were posted by the 18-35-year-old crowd, something the researchers say isn’t too surprising {{4}} the demographics of the social media platform. The under-18 age group posted about 30 percent of selfies. The older crowd (35+) shared them far less frequently (13 percent). Appearance was most popular among all age groups. Lead author Julia Deeb-Swihart says selfies are an identity performance—meaning that users carefully craft the way they appear online and that selfies are an extension of that. This evokes William Shakespeare’s famous line: “All the world’s a stage, and all the men and women merely players.”', NULL, NULL, NULL, E'1.fell into, 2.combined, 3.rather, 4.considering', NULL, NULL),
  ('b520330a-91c5-5445-b784-7880bb37551f'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'REPEAT_SENTENCE', E'REPEAT_SENTENCE', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'b520330a-91c5-5445-b784-7880bb37551f'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'RS', NULL, 'e86085a2-3cc8-54d2-bff1-bc53fe16e061'::uuid, NULL, E'A periodical is a regular type of publication that comes out consistently.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
