  ('bbb7c74a-2098-5d68-9bab-e9fe1907ff0e'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'LISTENING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'bbb7c74a-2098-5d68-9bab-e9fe1907ff0e'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'WFD', NULL, 'b7bc4587-8e11-5649-8eab-28492e357dd3'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'Each student needs to meet his or her tutors.', NULL, NULL),
  ('bbbf41b9-b5f5-5807-b6c5-9fd9e2e65f83'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'RE_TELL_LECTURE', E'RE_TELL_LECTURE', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'bbbf41b9-b5f5-5807-b6c5-9fd9e2e65f83'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Children''s Literature', NULL, 'ee394fab-3569-5bc7-8e22-40fbf8401cea'::uuid, NULL, E'So today we''re going to talk about children''s literature and the role it plays in society. Throughout history adults have used the power of stories to entertain and amuse their children. But stories are not used merely to entertain youngsters, they have a significant educational purpose. They serve to teach the moral values of their society. In sociological terms, stories are one of the means by which children are socialized.\nHow does this work in practice? Well, it often makes use of heroes, the characters in the stories who the children will admire and want to be like. The heroes of children''s stories, therefore, exemplify the qualities valued by that society - they will typically demonstrate courage in the face of difficulty, honesty, consideration for others, loyalty to their family and friends, a respect for work and so on. You can see this happening from the fables of ancient societies through fairy tales and folk tales right up to modern day children''s stories. For example, the hard-working ant in Aesop''s fable is shown to succeed in comparison with the grasshopper who spends the summer singing and has nothing to eat when winter comes. Similarly, it is Cinderella, the honest, hard-working sister, who wins the Prince rather than her cruel, lazy step-sisters. However, there is still usually something to entertain children, even in the most morally instructive of stories.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('bbc1cb00-523b-5212-9a91-79f3a1247cc3'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'ANSWER_SHORT_QUESTION', E'ANSWER_SHORT_QUESTION', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'bbc1cb00-523b-5212-9a91-79f3a1247cc3'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'ASQ', E'What do we call the act of joining two or more separate companies into one?', '775c8f8a-6c16-5b0d-ab1a-8dcc26f84c98'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'Merger', NULL, NULL),
  ('bbcc3044-63af-506d-aee9-1d47634ee50c'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'REPEAT_SENTENCE', E'REPEAT_SENTENCE', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'bbcc3044-63af-506d-aee9-1d47634ee50c'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'RS', NULL, '4515f9cf-645b-5168-b41c-e0e0515b4542'::uuid, NULL, E'Mobile phone chargers vary enormously from one place to another.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('bbcde047-d016-52df-81f4-cdbb1f0db99b'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DROPDOWN', E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DROPDOWN', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'bbcde047-d016-52df-81f4-cdbb1f0db99b'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Regular Exercise', E'Regular exercise is associated with a lower risk of developing certain cancers, including {{1}} of the head, neck, and lungs. The benefits of exercise extend even to those who have been {{2}} with cancer, as they tend to live longer than those who don’t exercise. The risk reduction is particularly significant for head and neck, breast, and lung cancers. Interestingly, the impact of exercise on cancer risk {{3}} to be dose-dependent, with more exercise leading to a greater reduction in risk. These findings, while based on observational data, paint a nuanced picture of the relationship between exercise and cancer. Despite the inability to establish a cause-and-effect relationship, the data suggests that regular exercise could potentially stave off cancer. Furthermore, individuals who exercise regularly and later develop cancer are still less likely to die of any cause, indicating a {{4}} benefit. These insights provide ample {{5}} to maintain an exercise habit for its potential cancer-preventive effects.', NULL, NULL, NULL, E'1.those, 2.diagnosed, 3.appears, 4.longevity, 5.incentive', NULL, NULL),
  ('bbd073d8-c074-59af-8034-9154de8edae2'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DRAG_AND_DROP', E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DRAG_AND_DROP', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'bbd073d8-c074-59af-8034-9154de8edae2'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Power Plants', E'In power plants, steam is used to drive turbines to {{1}} electricity through a complex {{2}} . Over time, the efficiency of this process decreases, which {{3}} that engineers must work to improve the technology and reduce energy waste.', NULL, NULL, NULL, E'1.produce, 2.process, 3.means', NULL, NULL),
  ('bbd3ac2c-af5d-5d71-af01-773768806c1c'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'ANSWER_SHORT_QUESTION', E'ANSWER_SHORT_QUESTION', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'bbd3ac2c-af5d-5d71-af01-773768806c1c'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'ASQ', E'If you are celebrating a biannual activity, how many years ago did you celebrate it last time?', '3250544c-afca-5ef6-993c-0df90e02e422'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'Half a year', NULL, NULL),
  ('bbd87a2d-12f2-594f-8425-df4448d29f5b'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'REPEAT_SENTENCE', E'REPEAT_SENTENCE', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'bbd87a2d-12f2-594f-8425-df4448d29f5b'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'RS', NULL, '72097429-de9b-5d23-99d6-d9808971e395'::uuid, NULL, E'Essays with few or no citations will be regarded as invalid.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('bbdbc6f6-dd1d-500a-9de6-1c429386cb31'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'RE_TELL_LECTURE', E'RE_TELL_LECTURE', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'bbdbc6f6-dd1d-500a-9de6-1c429386cb31'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Software', NULL, '1e62f6c1-bbb3-55e2-95ac-4c3dd7ed6b87'::uuid, NULL, E'The history of software is of course very very new. And the whole IT industry is really only 67 years old which is extraordinary and to be so close to the birth of a major new technology, a major new discipline is quite remarkable given where we got to in those 67 years. And the progression has been not so much a progression as a stampede because Moore''s Law, the rapid expansion in the power of computing and the rapid fall of the cost of computing and storage and communications has made it feasible for information technology to move into all sorts of areas of life that were never originally envisaged. What has happened is that there has been as I said a stampede for people to pick the low-hanging fruit. And that is what''s guided the development of software and information technology over the past decades and continues to do so with a number of consequences that we will explore.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('bbe097ef-fce2-578d-b8b2-837d4e33d2dd'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'WRITE_ESSAY', E'WRITE_ESSAY', E'WRITING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'bbe097ef-fce2-578d-b8b2-837d4e33d2dd'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Escaping Stress', E'People often feel stressed and have different ways of escaping the stress and difficulties of modern life. When do you feel stressful and how do you release stress?', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 200, 300),
