  ('bbe2a2a3-c1a5-5f90-8bee-eca070100546'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'RE_TELL_LECTURE', E'RE_TELL_LECTURE', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'bbe2a2a3-c1a5-5f90-8bee-eca070100546'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Practice', NULL, '7ce2ef0f-c382-5644-b44d-beaff6be45fa'::uuid, NULL, E'Deliberate practice takes time and people also need to find and solve problems and mistakes during it. To be a high performing solo musician for the violin you also have to spend several thousand hours in solitary practice. That is the basic requirement to become professional, namely the ten-thousand-hour rule. When it comes to other things, for example, if geometry is your weakness in math, you should practice more in geometry. During practice you should identify your weakness, focus on it, and carry out further deliberate practice to demonstrate how important deliberate practice is. Even for talents, they generally need to spend ten years to achieve the high international level of recognition. So there is no need for average people to be ashamed of practicing.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('bbe2e693-275d-57cc-ac8d-af94eabf43a1'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'READ_ALOUD', E'READ_ALOUD', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'bbe2e693-275d-57cc-ac8d-af94eabf43a1'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Scent', E'Scientists suggest that there are a number of reasons that our bodies treat scent differently than other senses. From hunting and gathering food to finding healthy mates, linking smells with memories that stir up desire, happiness, or even fear is biologically useful for humans. Humans have one other thing to consider when scent is at play: context is key.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
