  ('bc2cf3d5-ccef-51bc-b3f3-a7d078509c7e'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DRAG_AND_DROP', E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DRAG_AND_DROP', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'bc2cf3d5-ccef-51bc-b3f3-a7d078509c7e'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Herbs', E'Although they may be nutritious in their own {{1}} , most herbs are too strong tasting to be eaten in large {{2}} . However, these plants provide a very useful service by {{3}} the flavor of other foods. Many people are great fans of the use of herbs, and they may grow a diversity of these plants in their own herb gardens, to {{4}} a fresh supply of these flavorful and aromatic plants.', NULL, NULL, NULL, E'1.right, 2.quantities, 3.enhancing, 4.ensure', NULL, NULL),
  ('bc2f97fa-fc6b-57b6-9fb9-f6ea74453f09'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'LISTENING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'bc2f97fa-fc6b-57b6-9fb9-f6ea74453f09'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'WFD', NULL, '622ad513-191a-5f00-90b5-2c94437dcdb0'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'This book is concerned with the professional development of university staff.', NULL, NULL),
  ('bc3cc140-b438-5d8b-9321-94d14c5ee33d'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'READ_ALOUD', E'READ_ALOUD', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'bc3cc140-b438-5d8b-9321-94d14c5ee33d'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'TV Advertising', E'From a child''s point of view, what is the purpose of TV advertising? Is advertising on TV done to give actors the opportunity to take a rest or practice their lines ? Or is it done to make people buy things? Furthermore, is the main difference between programs and commercials that commercials are for real, whereas programs are not, or that programs are for kids and commercials for adults?', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('bc3f9e44-800b-5d09-bf4d-aeacf8a578c1'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'WRITE_ESSAY', E'WRITE_ESSAY', E'WRITING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'bc3f9e44-800b-5d09-bf4d-aeacf8a578c1'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Separate Schools', E'Girls and boys should attend separate schools. Do you agree or disagree with the statement?', NULL, NULL, E'The debate over whether girls and boys should attend separate schools has been ongoing for years. While some people believe that separate schools are necessary to provide a focused and tailored education, I believe that co-education is more beneficial. This essay will argue that co-education promotes social interaction, diversity, and gender equality.\nCo-education promotes social interaction and communication skills, preparing students for the real world. In mixed schools, boys and girls are able to learn from one another and develop social skills that are essential for success in life. Additionally, co-education can help to break down gender stereotypes and promote mutual respect and understanding between boys and girls.\nMixed schools provide a diverse learning environment, allowing for exposure to different perspectives and cultures. In a co-educational setting, boys and girls can learn from one another and gain a greater understanding of different viewpoints. This exposure can lead to increased empathy and understanding, as well as a more well-rounded education.\nIn conclusion, I believe that girls and boys should not attend separate schools due to the benefits of co-education. Co-education promotes social interaction, diversity, and gender equality, providing a more well-rounded education that prepares students for success in the real world. While some may argue that separate schools provide a more focused education, the benefits of co-education outweigh any potential drawbacks. Co-education is an essential component of modern education that promotes a more inclusive and diverse society.', NULL, 200, 300),
  ('bc4cb987-7bbc-5cdd-8917-bd3611c3ecc6'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DROPDOWN', E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DROPDOWN', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'bc4cb987-7bbc-5cdd-8917-bd3611c3ecc6'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Crop Losses', E'As demand for food and competition for land rises, it is vital that crop losses are {{1}} . Chemical protection has provided effective control of crop losses in recent years. Alongside chemical fertilizers and improved crop genetics, it has helped to increase crop yields dramatically over the last six decades. {{2}} , there is now a need to develop complementary alternatives, and researchers from the Rural Economy and Land Use Program have been exploring the potential of -- and barriers to -- alternative pest management approaches. ''Alternatives to chemical pesticides are {{3}} because overuse of them leads to pesticide resistance and affects biodiversity and water quality,'' says Dr Alastair Bailey. ''Heightened EU regulations are also leading to the withdrawal of many pesticide products. {{4}} , complementary approaches are required to reduce use and preserve the efficacy of those valuable pesticides that are still available to sustain food production systems.''', NULL, NULL, NULL, E'1.limited, 2.However, 3.needed, 4.Hence', NULL, NULL),
  ('bc4cbb30-b323-5acf-8a5b-64ca08399f7b'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'ANSWER_SHORT_QUESTION', E'ANSWER_SHORT_QUESTION', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'bc4cbb30-b323-5acf-8a5b-64ca08399f7b'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'ASQ', E'What do we call the action of a ball that immediately moves upwards from the ground after hitting it?', 'e4863015-cb74-5806-b5fb-1fa73b0f8ac4'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'Bounce / bouncing', NULL, NULL),
  ('bc51c862-1e26-5d88-aec8-d986f6d334c4'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'ANSWER_SHORT_QUESTION', E'ANSWER_SHORT_QUESTION', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'bc51c862-1e26-5d88-aec8-d986f6d334c4'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'ASQ', E'What city is famous for its historic canals, gondolas, and waterways?', '0f93c1bd-771e-5a7b-a9d5-a835573d8dbf'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'Venice', NULL, NULL),
  ('bc52b35d-f24e-5786-9b13-23b98110dbf4'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'LISTENING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'bc52b35d-f24e-5786-9b13-23b98110dbf4'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'WFD', NULL, 'fb34eae3-6dd8-59bd-a27d-ee95c6846eb7'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'Today we have a guest speaker who is visiting from Canada.', NULL, NULL),
  ('bc53c7ad-70f9-5b3f-a701-5bb8a7bd0363'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'READ_ALOUD', E'READ_ALOUD', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'bc53c7ad-70f9-5b3f-a701-5bb8a7bd0363'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Botswana', E'Although Botswana''s economic outlook remains strong, the devastation that AIDS has caused threatens to destroy the country''s future. In 2001, Botswana had the highest rate of HIV infection in the world. With the help of international donors it launched an ambitious national campaign that provided free antiviral drugs to anyone who needed them, and by March 2004, Botswana''s infection rate had dropped significantly.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('bc5da77e-0d5f-5016-9544-76658856a6c2'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'RE_TELL_LECTURE', E'RE_TELL_LECTURE', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'bc5da77e-0d5f-5016-9544-76658856a6c2'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'TV Screens', NULL, 'bfe5f143-0138-5592-b43c-f2228a9a7177'::uuid, NULL, E'You know, back in the 40s and 50s, the original standard television had a 4 to 3 width to height ratio. That shape was chosen to be a slight rectangle, but still mostly square, thus having the maximal screen area for the given dimensions. And that’s still the ratio on many TVs and computer monitors in today’s homes. The problem is, hardly anybody today treats video content in a 4 to 3 ratio. See, this whole problem started when people wanted to watch movies from the theater in the comfort of their own homes. Movie screens are considerably larger than our home television. More important, the screen is completely different rectangle, and can’t mathematically fit on our TV screens without manipulation. A typical TV is one and a third times wider than it is tall. Some movie screens could be up to three times as wide as it is tall. So what’re we gonna do to make it fit? Well, we have all kinds of options. Well, we could squeeze and stretch and mangle everything on to the screen, to make it all fill up, and everyone would look ridiculously thin and compressed. The good news is the sound would be just fine. Although I don’t think people would be too happy about that option, particularly the actors in the movie. We could just cut a chunk of the original movie like a cookie cutter and just see that frame of the movie. The problem with that would be that people and objects would be speaking from off the screen, or even worse, they might be cut in half. Some movie editors use what’s called the ‘pan and scan’ technique to allow the full height of the TV screen to be used, but pick and choose what section of the original movie should be shown on your screen thus eliminating the annoying cutting of people.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('bc629dd3-96c9-5910-ab09-53e4bbe954b2'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'ANSWER_SHORT_QUESTION', E'ANSWER_SHORT_QUESTION', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'bc629dd3-96c9-5910-ab09-53e4bbe954b2'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'ASQ', E'What do we call a person whose age is thirteen or fifteen?', '99e27b99-367f-5029-a4a2-b4674f2412a4'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'Teenager / adolescent', NULL, NULL),
