  ('bea38710-2fe7-5659-9c93-c61d0472fed0'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DRAG_AND_DROP', E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DRAG_AND_DROP', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'bea38710-2fe7-5659-9c93-c61d0472fed0'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Adolescence', E'Adolescence is a time when people become independent individuals, {{1}} new relationships, develop social skills and learn behaviours that will {{2}} the rest of their lives. It can also be one of the most challenging periods. In this turbocharged neurological, physical, and emotional {{3}} from childhood to adulthood, young people face a {{4}} of health risks.', NULL, NULL, NULL, E'1.forge, 2.last, 3.transition, 4.range', NULL, NULL),
  ('bea40d01-20ca-5451-8bdd-1fcf9f031da3'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'READ_ALOUD', E'READ_ALOUD', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'bea40d01-20ca-5451-8bdd-1fcf9f031da3'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Bananas and Potassium', E'Bananas are rich in the mineral potassium. Potassium helps maintain fluid levels in the body and regulates the movement of nutrients and waste products in and out of cells. Potassium also helps muscles to contract and nerve cells to respond. It keeps the heart beating regularly and can reduce the effect of sodium on blood pressure. Potassium may reduce the risk of kidney stones forming as people age.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('bea4c75e-7a0c-5ea8-9655-3e9f92e0ee2c'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DROPDOWN', E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DROPDOWN', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'bea4c75e-7a0c-5ea8-9655-3e9f92e0ee2c'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Extroversion', E'Another unsurprising personality trait that is commonly associated with leadership is being an extrovert. Leaders tend to be {{1}} and social in their personalities, which helps them take the lead and act with initiative. It also helps them with the important aspect of connecting to and {{2}} others through relationships. Though many leaders are extroverts, there are certainly examples of successful leaders who are not. Sometimes other strengths are sufficient to {{3}} for not being an extrovert, or sometimes a leader who is not naturally an extrovert is able to train themselves to be more outgoing in behavior when needed, though this still does not generally change the leader’s basic personality. Bill Gates of Microsoft and Mark Zuckerberg of Facebook are two {{4}} examples of extremely successful leaders who are introverts by personality.', NULL, NULL, NULL, E'1.outgoing, 2.inspiring, 3.compensate, 4.prominent', NULL, NULL),
  ('bea88664-d243-5a38-b87b-98aaab9c38ed'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'LISTENING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'bea88664-d243-5a38-b87b-98aaab9c38ed'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'WFD', NULL, '4102e1c4-bcb6-5c20-92c6-d5f407d3676d'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'They joined us to spend the rest of the school holiday.', NULL, NULL),
