  ('beadd83f-eabd-5ab9-bfcd-c0aa714f3ec6'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DRAG_AND_DROP', E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DRAG_AND_DROP', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'beadd83f-eabd-5ab9-bfcd-c0aa714f3ec6'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Buddhism', E'Buddhism {{1}} in South Asia around the 5th century, and over the next millennia it spread across Asia. Buddhists believe that human life is a cycle of suffering and rebirth, but that if one achieves a {{2}} of enlightenment, it is possible to escape this cycle forever. Buddhists do not believe in any kind of deity or god, although there are {{3}} figures who can help or hinder people on the path towards enlightenment.', NULL, NULL, NULL, E'1.originated, 2.state, 3.supernatural', NULL, NULL),
  ('beade934-83b5-5c84-9a33-52d01d1fc457'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'LISTENING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'beade934-83b5-5c84-9a33-52d01d1fc457'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'WFD', NULL, '7cb29950-7a8f-5067-b886-c7e4640302a9'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'The coming scientific research requires time and dedication.', NULL, NULL),
  ('beb4ca9f-c9fe-5111-96cd-8d34ace00e50'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'REPEAT_SENTENCE', E'REPEAT_SENTENCE', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'beb4ca9f-c9fe-5111-96cd-8d34ace00e50'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'RS', NULL, 'a0f5ce86-2ff9-5b6d-8757-8b109cffc97c'::uuid, NULL, E'He has a strong interest in exploring new and exciting art movements.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('beb6f6e0-7304-5686-b395-19ddffaf3568'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'REPEAT_SENTENCE', E'REPEAT_SENTENCE', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'beb6f6e0-7304-5686-b395-19ddffaf3568'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'RS', NULL, '20ca28f6-e837-5163-a04f-27c5b9a9e4a9'::uuid, NULL, E'This website can help users to tackle a typical domestic issue.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('beb756d9-2709-5a7d-9cee-8c1ff4134822'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'SELECT_MISSING_WORD', E'SELECT_MISSING_WORD', E'LISTENING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'beb756d9-2709-5a7d-9cee-8c1ff4134822'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'SMW', E'In nineteenth century Britain - and indeed in the first half of the twentieth century - many of the urban poor lived in extremely cramped conditions. Overcrowding, damp, and poor sanitation affected the daily lives of the majority of the population, with serious implications for their own and their children''s health. Novelists have a major role to play in reflecting their times to their readers who may otherwise ignore social problems, and the portrayal of the wretched living conditions of the impoverished by such writers as Charles Dickens in the nineteenth century and George Orwell in the twentieth was instrumental in - - - .\n\nAt the end of the recording the lost word or group of words has been replaced by a beep. Select the correct option to complete the recording.', '910f9d52-70af-5c3e-8636-b69edf4fbe35'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'bringing the situation to the attention of the public', NULL, NULL),
  ('bec5dd17-3326-5696-af84-0e0223f3203b'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'SUMMARIZE_WRITTEN_TEXT', E'SUMMARIZE_WRITTEN_TEXT', E'WRITING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'bec5dd17-3326-5696-af84-0e0223f3203b'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Investment Markets', E'Investment markets can be a labyrinth of opportunities and risks. Whether you''re a seasoned investor or a newcomer, understanding the dynamics of these markets is essential for making informed financial decisions.\nOne of the critical aspects of the investment market is diversification. Spreading your investments across various asset classes can help reduce risk. A well-balanced portfolio may include stocks, bonds, real estate, and alternative investments. Diversification can cushion the impact of market volatility and enhance the potential for long-term returns.\nMarket research is another key component. Staying informed about economic trends, geopolitical events, and company performance is vital. Many investors rely on financial news, reports, and expert analysis to make informed decisions.\nRisk management is also paramount. Assessing your risk tolerance and setting clear investment goals are essential steps. Risk tolerance varies from person to person, and understanding your comfort level can help you determine the appropriate mix of assets in your portfolio.\nMoreover, patience is a virtue in investment markets. Markets can fluctuate, and short-term fluctuations are common. Long-term investors often benefit from riding out market volatility and staying committed to their investment strategies.\nFurthermore, it''s crucial to stay vigilant about fees and costs associated with investments. High fees can erode your returns over time. Understanding the fees associated with various investment options can help you make cost-effective choices.\nLastly, consider seeking professional advice. Financial advisors can provide valuable insights and help you create an investment strategy tailored to your financial goals and risk tolerance.\nIn conclusion, investment markets can be complex, but with the right knowledge and approach, they offer opportunities for wealth accumulation and financial growth. Diversification, research, risk management, patience, cost awareness, and professional guidance are essential elements for navigating the intricacies of investment markets successfully.', NULL, NULL, E'Navigating investment markets requires diversification to mitigate risks, informed decision-making through market research, understanding personal risk tolerance, patience during market fluctuations, awareness of investment fees, and potentially seeking professional advice, all essential for achieving long-term financial growth and wealth accumulation.', NULL, 5, 75),
  ('bec8ad83-5e8f-563b-8811-60c97216e694'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'REPEAT_SENTENCE', E'REPEAT_SENTENCE', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'bec8ad83-5e8f-563b-8811-60c97216e694'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'RS', NULL, '7b423d2e-eaea-5f8c-a4f2-150c286f1248'::uuid, NULL, E'The school should be spending all of that money to construct a new science library.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('bec96be8-a900-56de-9f49-5c757cfd1c41'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'LISTENING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'bec96be8-a900-56de-9f49-5c757cfd1c41'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'WFD', NULL, '86007f58-dc60-5fb8-8777-34a85cd846af'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'Popular culture is now a significant focus of academic research.', NULL, NULL),
  ('bed5c716-8b2f-5646-8659-376d141f0ff2'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'RE_TELL_LECTURE', E'RE_TELL_LECTURE', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'bed5c716-8b2f-5646-8659-376d141f0ff2'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Loggerhead Turtle', NULL, '61594393-ffc4-5f29-bd40-f7b87c36bc18'::uuid, NULL, E'The loggerhead turtle is one of the world’s largest turtle species, and a species that’s nearly distinct in the United States. These remarkable creatures are easy to recognize thanks to their large, robust heads and relatively short necks, traits that set them apart from other sea turtle species.\nA key part of the loggerhead turtle’s life cycle is migration, which they undertake specifically to lay their eggs. To learn more about this migration, scientists conducted an important study back in September 1986. They attached a tracker to a loggerhead turtle’s shell and used satellite technology to closely monitor and locate its migration route—this was a groundbreaking way to map the turtle’s movements in real time.\nWhat did the study reveal? The turtle traveled to different locations at different times throughout its journey. It took just one month for the turtle to swim south, and the entire migration—from South Florida all the way north—spanned three months in total. To visualize this path, a map of the U.S. East Coast was created, and on it, both the turtle’s exact migration route and the year of the study (1986) are clearly marked.\nThis research not only confirmed the loggerhead’s impressive migration abilities but also provided valuable data that helps protect these unique turtles and their habitats.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('bed8c185-55f6-5990-8c7f-412a4977e8bb'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'READ_ALOUD', E'READ_ALOUD', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'bed8c185-55f6-5990-8c7f-412a4977e8bb'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'History', E'History rubs shoulders and often overlaps with many other areas of research, from myths and epics to the social sciences, including economics, politics, biography, demography, and much else besides. Some histories are almost pure narratives, while others go in for detailed, tightly-focused analyses of, for example, the parish records of a Cornish village in the 16th century.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('bedc6284-bae3-5e3d-a036-4dd9325e629b'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'RE_TELL_LECTURE', E'RE_TELL_LECTURE', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'bedc6284-bae3-5e3d-a036-4dd9325e629b'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Innovation & Invention', NULL, '2af1dcfe-594d-52dd-9ef7-e0c5add73002'::uuid, NULL, E'He says innovation equals invention. Let me just stop here. Innovation equals invention often people mistake these two things for the same thing. Innovation equals invention, they are not. Innovation is something that generates value for the world. It makes something faster, better, cheaper. It gives someone some great satisfaction. An invention is an idea, a technology, a patent. In and of itself, it does not generate value. So these two are not the same thing. And sometimes you see them interchange. And that''s not correct. So innovation equals invention times commercialization. So and when we look at this equation of innovation something of value, it requires a new idea and then it requires someone or some organization that is going to commercialize that idea, and to make it a value to the world.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('bee424e2-1439-590b-b402-fc24f4056d15'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'READ_ALOUD', E'READ_ALOUD', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'bee424e2-1439-590b-b402-fc24f4056d15'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Affordable Childcare', E'Over the longer term, higher educational institutions are supported to either provide on-campus nursery space or work with established local nurseries to provide affordable childcare for students and staff. This should be a standard for all universities and should be supported by the government to help universities and students and staff cover the costs.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
