  ('bf6ec376-a36e-567a-bdc1-23f2d9d04cb1'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'READ_ALOUD', E'READ_ALOUD', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'bf6ec376-a36e-567a-bdc1-23f2d9d04cb1'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Returning Book', E'When returning a borrowed book, if there are missing pages, experts say transparency is key. Librarians and etiquette coaches note a recent rise in damaged-book disputes, often caused by silent returns or unreported defects. "If something goes wrong, acknowledge it," says one Toronto librarian. "A simple apology and an offer to make it right prevents a small mistake from becoming a big misunderstanding."', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('bf6fab65-1785-5f21-bab2-d59d08a301f3'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DRAG_AND_DROP', E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DRAG_AND_DROP', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'bf6fab65-1785-5f21-bab2-d59d08a301f3'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Revision', E'Just as the right time for revision is crucial, so is the method of studying. Students often find that their concentration and {{1}} of material vary throughout the day. Discovering the {{2}} time and method, {{3}} through group study, flashcards, or quiet reading, can significantly enhance learning {{4}} . Like revision, where timing matters, choosing the right study technique is essential for {{5}} success.', NULL, NULL, NULL, E'1.retention, 2.optimal, 3.whether, 4.efficiency, 5.academic', NULL, NULL),
