  ('c0c10e25-88ae-5477-bd39-8461b831ed92'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DRAG_AND_DROP', E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DRAG_AND_DROP', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'c0c10e25-88ae-5477-bd39-8461b831ed92'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Trinity Sport and Fitness', E'Whether you want to exercise and stay {{1}} , train professionally with like-minded people, or indulge your competitive streak, Trinity Sport and Fitness {{2}} it covered.\nWe''ve got a dedicated support development team on campus to support every student taking part in sports.\nYou might want to participate in sports competitions, volunteer with a local sports class or simply play for {{3}} with our social sport program.\nTrinity fitness members of our public-facing sports facility will also {{4}} you to discounts when you are booking a sports facility and fitness class. You will also get an opportunity to {{5}} from tailored personal training, free activities events, and lots more.', NULL, NULL, NULL, E'1.fit, 2.has, 3.fun, 4.entitle, 5.benefit', NULL, NULL),
  ('c0d9423e-590a-5f81-89f5-f29f93ec6d07'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'LISTENING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'c0d9423e-590a-5f81-89f5-f29f93ec6d07'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'WFD', NULL, '3416b529-71b7-56af-b889-2352349409a2'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'Gravity is extraordinarily weak and nearly impossible to study directly at a quantum level.', NULL, NULL),
  ('c0daacdc-6469-5e3e-a7eb-b838af8d2409'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'MC_LISTENING_MULTIPLE', E'MC_LISTENING_MULTIPLE', E'LISTENING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'c0daacdc-6469-5e3e-a7eb-b838af8d2409'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'MCM-L', E'Technological change has had a profound effect on the way music is made and how it sounds, as well as on the way we listen to it. New technologies - and I mean this in the broadest sense, not just electronic devices - can alter the sound of music and, in the case of electronic recording systems, affect the economics and distribution of music. For example, the innovation of the valve trumpet in the 19th century changed the sound of the orchestra. Now everyone has easy access to a wide variety of music, but it is arguable whether this has increased our understanding of it. Before radio and recorded music, those who could afford it would have pianos or pianolas - mechanical pianos that played a roll of sheet music - so the basic ability to read notes off a page was more widespread. However, these days, regardless of whether or not we are musical experts, there is no doubt that music enhances life, and with the Internet, sites to download music from, file-sharing, and so on, we have access to more music than ever before - and a lot of it for free.\n\nWhich of the following technological advances have had an effect on the economics and distribution of music?', '19ea23aa-c685-5665-984f-e50c7d49f7bd'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'electronic recording systems\nthe Internet\nthe ability to download music', NULL, NULL),
  ('c0dc6d8e-ab61-56a2-960d-6826d6d256a8'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'RE_TELL_LECTURE', E'RE_TELL_LECTURE', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'c0dc6d8e-ab61-56a2-960d-6826d6d256a8'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Underwater Detectors', NULL, 'dad4033a-d449-52bf-aa62-4e96b7ec2e3a'::uuid, NULL, E'Science lets us know what is going on.\nUnderwater remote detector, which is called Antares, is a kind of camera installed underwater in cages for fish monitoring in the industry of marine aquaculture.\nIt is an advanced system of remote technology, by which researchers can remotely monitor fish on their computers in their universities.\nThe camera can detect surrounding environments as well as fish. This helps people find out what they eat, what they don''t eat, and how much they eat.\nThus people can stop feeding them if necessary in some situation to save time and labor.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('c0dedd78-a0ae-50d0-a44c-fd7344d2bfc7'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'REPEAT_SENTENCE', E'REPEAT_SENTENCE', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'c0dedd78-a0ae-50d0-a44c-fd7344d2bfc7'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'RS', NULL, '97d5755f-c4cd-5436-9f2c-db5614dba63c'::uuid, NULL, E'The board of this university is discussing the list of the qualified candidates.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('c0e269d2-d5cc-5c22-98b9-8c8755a77161'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'READ_ALOUD', E'READ_ALOUD', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'c0e269d2-d5cc-5c22-98b9-8c8755a77161'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Free Trade', E'Free trade is an economic policy under which the government does not interfere with trade. No tariffs are applied to imports or exports, and people are allowed to trade goods and services as they please. Supply and demand dictates the prices for which goods and services sell and are the only factors that determine how resources are allocated in society.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('c0e2dc50-87a7-5751-afb9-c03831fe518e'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'RE_ORDER_PARAGRAPHS', E'RE_ORDER_PARAGRAPHS', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'c0e2dc50-87a7-5751-afb9-c03831fe518e'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Feeding Preferences', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, E'5, 1, 2, 4, 3', NULL, NULL),
  ('c0e84c58-54bc-569c-88ea-5c962bda0611'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'ANSWER_SHORT_QUESTION', E'ANSWER_SHORT_QUESTION', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'c0e84c58-54bc-569c-88ea-5c962bda0611'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'ASQ', E'Which number does the root ''O c t'' indicate?', '39e64152-e139-5bd8-b6fa-eadac10da903'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'Eight', NULL, NULL),
  ('c0eb1837-9870-5d0f-94c1-4217aa554ff0'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'ANSWER_SHORT_QUESTION', E'ANSWER_SHORT_QUESTION', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'c0eb1837-9870-5d0f-94c1-4217aa554ff0'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'ASQ', E'What is the name of the hormone that regulates the level of glucose in the blood?', '153ee924-28c7-58f9-8edc-e13f82e6d3b2'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'Insulin', NULL, NULL),
  ('c0ee56ab-3da8-501f-9095-869c6de6649f'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DRAG_AND_DROP', E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DRAG_AND_DROP', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'c0ee56ab-3da8-501f-9095-869c6de6649f'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Glass', E'An observant eye will notice that the glass panes in a church, over the course of hundreds of years, appear to have thickened {{1}} the bottom of their frames while {{2}} in thickness towards the top. This {{3}} phenomenon has given rise to an enduring myth: the idea that glass is actually a liquid, just one that {{4}} very slowly.', NULL, NULL, NULL, E'1.at, 2.diminishing, 3.intriguing, 4.flows', NULL, NULL),
  ('c0f0596c-9647-5b08-baa1-bd110e829cf8'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'ANSWER_SHORT_QUESTION', E'ANSWER_SHORT_QUESTION', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'c0f0596c-9647-5b08-baa1-bd110e829cf8'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'ASQ', E'Where do you pay in a supermarket?', 'be020743-12cd-564b-b240-eb4392eea23d'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'Checkout / cash desk', NULL, NULL),
  ('c0f0a4f8-a83b-5885-8aed-e482af2b4097'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'SELECT_MISSING_WORD', E'SELECT_MISSING_WORD', E'LISTENING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'c0f0a4f8-a83b-5885-8aed-e482af2b4097'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Triggers', E'They see triggers all over the world. What are triggers? Triggers are cases where you take a part of your nervous system and you say, if someone says that word they can control my nervous system and make me afraid and anxious. That’s a terrible idea. We should not be teaching our kids to see the world as being full of triggers. We should teach them to live in a world that is physically quite safe but full of offensive statements and ideas especially on the Internet. A sad commentary on the state of the business world now is that Google is being sued from both sides, from women who say that they’re victims of a hostile climate, and from conservatives and white men, who say that conservatives and white men are discriminated against. So in our current era, everybody feels they’re...\n\nAt the end of the recording the lost word or group of words has been replaced by a beep. Select the correct option to complete the recording.', '353cb503-c2d4-5ccb-b445-997d7ae6d691'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'a victim', NULL, NULL),
  ('c0f18afc-b698-5ac2-a03b-91e1c74d7ee2'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'LISTENING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'c0f18afc-b698-5ac2-a03b-91e1c74d7ee2'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'WFD', NULL, '2e66b9fd-46eb-5da5-a5c9-588516944f2c'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'The book on the shelf is a carefully documented biography.', NULL, NULL),
  ('c1048e01-1544-5f7e-bb8e-13683fb3d362'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DROPDOWN', E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DROPDOWN', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'c1048e01-1544-5f7e-bb8e-13683fb3d362'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Higher Education Funding', E'Financing of Australian higher education has undergone dramatic {{1}} since the early 1970s. Although the Australian Government provided regular funding for universities from the late 1950s, in 1974 it {{2}} full responsibility for funding higher education — abolishing tuition fees with the intention of making university education affordable to all Australians who had the ability and who wished to participate in higher education.\nSince the late 1980s, there has been a move towards greater private contributions, {{3}} student fees. In 1989, the Australian Government introduced the Higher Education Contribution Scheme (HECS) which included a loans scheme to help students finance their contributions. This enabled university to remain {{4}} to students by delaying their payments until they could afford to pay off their loans. In 2002, the Australian Government {{5}} a scheme similar to HECS for postgraduate students - the Postgraduate Education Loan Scheme (PELS). Funding for higher education comes from various sources. This article examines the three main sources - Australian Government funding, student fees and charges, and HECS. While the proportion of total {{6}} raised through HECS is relatively small, HECS payments are a significant component of students'' university costs, with many students carrying a HECS debt for several years after leaving university. This article also focuses on characteristics of university students based on their HECS liability status, and the level of accumulated HECS debt.', NULL, NULL, NULL, E'1.change, 2.assumed, 3.particularly, 4.accessible, 5.introduced, 6.revenue', NULL, NULL),
  ('c1069daa-e78a-589d-93b8-2a0654404652'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'REPEAT_SENTENCE', E'REPEAT_SENTENCE', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'c1069daa-e78a-589d-93b8-2a0654404652'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'RS', NULL, '457eb89a-0ca2-5339-ab17-37adef12051d'::uuid, NULL, E'Fire has caused severe damage to the contents of the building.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('c107dad3-322f-5c36-8d55-241e124413fe'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DRAG_AND_DROP', E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DRAG_AND_DROP', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'c107dad3-322f-5c36-8d55-241e124413fe'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Paleontology', E'Paleontology, the study of ancient life, reveals Earth''s prehistoric wonders. Fossils, the preserved remnants of organisms from {{1}} eras, provide {{2}} insights into evolution and extinct species. Unearthing fossils like Tyrannosaurus rex bones sparks a {{3}} of wonder about the planet''s deep history. Furthermore, {{4}} in technology, such as high-resolution imaging and DNA analysis of ancient specimens, continue to unravel mysteries of the past, rewriting the narrative of our {{5}} history.', NULL, NULL, NULL, E'1.bygone, 2.invaluable, 3.sense, 4.advancements, 5.evolutionary', NULL, NULL),
  ('c109d04b-bb2c-57ee-adf0-53cfc7591b2e'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DROPDOWN', E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DROPDOWN', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'c109d04b-bb2c-57ee-adf0-53cfc7591b2e'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Business', E'One distinguishing feature of business is its economic character. In the world of business, we interact with each other not as family members, friends, or neighbors, but as buyers and {{1}} , employers and employees, and the like. Trading, for example, is often {{2}} by hard bargaining, in which both sides conceal their full hand and perhaps {{3}} in some bluffing. And a skilled salesperson is well- {{4}} in the art of arousing a customer''s attention (sometimes by a bit of puffery) to {{5}} the sale. Still, there is an "ethics of trading" that prohibits the use of false or deceptive claims and tricks such as "bait-and-switch" advertising.', NULL, NULL, NULL, E'1.sellers, 2.accompanied, 3.engage, 4.versed, 5.clinch', NULL, NULL),
  ('c116d9de-fdb5-5df4-81d6-3951a714b3a0'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'ANSWER_SHORT_QUESTION', E'ANSWER_SHORT_QUESTION', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'c116d9de-fdb5-5df4-81d6-3951a714b3a0'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'ASQ', E'What do we call the ground forces of a military organization?', '141a981d-eeca-57d1-9b27-11814af30f7d'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'Army', NULL, NULL),
  ('c11a57c1-c595-594a-8ae6-576d4a8c0792'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DRAG_AND_DROP', E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DRAG_AND_DROP', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'c11a57c1-c595-594a-8ae6-576d4a8c0792'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Australia and NZ', E'Australia and New Zealand, while {{1}} nations, share a profound and enduring connection. This bond is rooted in a shared history, common cultural values, and geographic {{2}} . Their relationship is characterized by close cooperation in various {{3}} , including trade, defense, and environmental conservation. This kinship reflects the strength of cultural and historical ties in shaping {{4}} international relationships.', NULL, NULL, NULL, E'1.distinct, 2.proximity, 3.domains, 4.robust', NULL, NULL),
  ('c11e6d37-27ab-5bb8-8470-76c7f210f8e4'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DROPDOWN', E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DROPDOWN', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'c11e6d37-27ab-5bb8-8470-76c7f210f8e4'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Deadly Mosquitoes', E'While most mosquitoes are merely annoying, buzzing nuisances, there are some species that carry deadly pathogens, turning them into silent assassins. The most {{1}} among these is the female Anopheles mosquito, the primary vector for malaria, a disease that claims the lives of hundreds of thousands of people each year, {{2}} in sub-Saharan Africa. But malaria is just the tip of the iceberg. Mosquitoes are also {{3}} for spreading a host of other deadly diseases, including dengue fever, Zika virus, West Nile virus, and yellow fever, to {{4}} just a few. With each blood meal, they unwittingly transmit these pathogens from host to host, perpetuating a cycle of disease and death. And it''s not just humans that fall victim to the mosquito''s deadly embrace. Wildlife, livestock, and even beloved household pets are all susceptible to the diseases {{5}} by these tiny terrors. From birds to elephants, no creature is safe from their insidious reach.', NULL, NULL, NULL, E'1.notorious, 2.predominantly, 3.responsible, 4.name, 5.carried', NULL, NULL),
  ('c1242910-d341-515a-9ceb-7f4208fd73df'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'READ_ALOUD', E'READ_ALOUD', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'c1242910-d341-515a-9ceb-7f4208fd73df'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Winter Wheat', E'Although typically grown as a cash grain, winter wheat can provide most of the cover crop benefits of other cereal crops, as well as a grazing option prior to spring tiller elongation. Wheat also is slower to mature than some cereals, so there is no rush to kill it early in spring and risk compacting soil in wet conditions.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('c1246c64-2ef4-507d-98d2-2095b24bb764'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'RE_ORDER_PARAGRAPHS', E'RE_ORDER_PARAGRAPHS', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'c1246c64-2ef4-507d-98d2-2095b24bb764'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Geodetic Data', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, E'1, 3, 2, 4', NULL, NULL),
  ('c12498ca-3901-510d-bb6b-0aa1a75966c2'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'READ_ALOUD', E'READ_ALOUD', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'c12498ca-3901-510d-bb6b-0aa1a75966c2'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Health', E'Your body is at war; your immune system is in endless battle against a host of enemies including bacteria, viruses, parasites and, more often than you would like or are aware, cancer cells. Thankfully, your white blood cells are "cut-throat killer cells" patrolling the body, ready to engulf, entrap or dissolve unwanted visitors.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('c1265dee-8f26-5281-ac8e-5a367a230fd6'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'LISTENING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'c1265dee-8f26-5281-ac8e-5a367a230fd6'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'WFD', NULL, '8d3ef365-69b9-5397-8d44-dddfc0fef779'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'The college''s aim is to help students to achieve their aspirations.', NULL, NULL),
  ('c129da39-dc0b-53fe-bb3d-67563f784c21'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'LISTENING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'c129da39-dc0b-53fe-bb3d-67563f784c21'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'WFD', NULL, '48a9cd8d-cc23-5630-b166-84c1b11bc458'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'Hundreds of scientific papers have been published on global warming.', NULL, NULL),
  ('c12a485c-734c-5fe2-9280-6a9227365ec5'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'LISTENING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'c12a485c-734c-5fe2-9280-6a9227365ec5'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'WFD', NULL, '35cd42f8-29af-5039-b306-cacf7c58dd4b'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'Remember to take all your belongings when you leave the lab.', NULL, NULL),
  ('c12e8af3-0f31-568c-99d1-0e85ef13fa49'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'LISTENING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'c12e8af3-0f31-568c-99d1-0e85ef13fa49'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'WFD', NULL, 'a9701816-04a6-5bb3-b567-7d2b5e86e369'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'The best presenting student at the seminar was awarded a prize.', NULL, NULL),
  ('c13345ff-8186-51ed-a5b0-b66dbc1bd806'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DRAG_AND_DROP', E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DRAG_AND_DROP', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'c13345ff-8186-51ed-a5b0-b66dbc1bd806'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Expectations around Food', E'The way we think about food can powerfully influence our {{1}} long after we have finished eating, and thanks to the mind-body connection, it can even shape our hormonal responses and the meal’s passage {{2}} the gut. As a result, our expectations around food can determine whether we will experience greater hunger {{3}} afterwards and find it harder to resist snacking later in the day.', NULL, NULL, NULL, E'1.satiety, 2.through, 3.pangs', NULL, NULL),
  ('c1383f4d-3836-560a-aaf9-903f7c45ade9'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'LISTENING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'c1383f4d-3836-560a-aaf9-903f7c45ade9'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'WFD', NULL, '909bedcf-4978-5217-bb8b-06e9cdf2f9c6'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'The present system does little to deter corporate crime.', NULL, NULL),
  ('c138fa04-efe2-5d05-84d0-09bcc61619eb'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DROPDOWN', E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DROPDOWN', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'c138fa04-efe2-5d05-84d0-09bcc61619eb'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Stressors', E'Research has suggested that major stressors in our lives are life {{1}} , for example, moving house, marriage or relationship breakdown. Work-related factors, {{2}} unemployment and boredom, are also common {{3}} of stress. Differences in personality may also {{4}} a part.', NULL, NULL, NULL, E'1.changes, 2.including, 3.causes, 4.play', NULL, NULL),
  ('c142485a-08bd-544c-b5c7-660d8c7b30ab'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'SUMMARIZE_WRITTEN_TEXT', E'SUMMARIZE_WRITTEN_TEXT', E'WRITING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'c142485a-08bd-544c-b5c7-660d8c7b30ab'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Children Allowance', E'Many people who have written on the subject of allowances say it is not a good idea to pay your child for work around the home. These jobs are a normal part of family life. Paying children to do extra work around the house, however, can be useful. It can even provide an understanding of how a business works. Allowances give children a chance to experience the things they can do with money. They can share it in the form of gifts or giving to a good cause. They can spend it by buying things they want. Or they can save and maybe even invest it. Saving helps children understand that costly goals require sacrifice: you have to cut costs and plan for the future. Requiring children to save part of their allowance can also open the door to future saving and investing. Many banks offer services to help children and teenagers learn about personal finance. A savings account is an excellent way to learn about the power of compound interest. Compounding works by paying interest on interest. So, for example, one dollar invested at two percent interest for two years will earn two cents in the first year. The second year, the money will earn two percent of one dollar and two cents, and so on. That may not seem like a lot. But over time it adds up.', NULL, NULL, E'Paying children to do extra work around the house can be useful, because it can even provide an understanding of how a business works, while allowances give children a chance to experience the things they can do with money, and saving helps children understand that costly goals require sacrifice, so many banks offer services to help children and teenagers learn about personal finance.', NULL, 5, 75),
  ('c143ade4-3d1b-5594-9042-2b73550632d9'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'REPEAT_SENTENCE', E'REPEAT_SENTENCE', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'c143ade4-3d1b-5594-9042-2b73550632d9'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'RS', NULL, '275d1c9e-9eee-5acd-9535-9d35388313a6'::uuid, NULL, E'He went to the university as a student of philosophy last year.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
