  ('c21fb87a-62b8-5021-9f45-8f114a4804de'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DRAG_AND_DROP', E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DRAG_AND_DROP', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'c21fb87a-62b8-5021-9f45-8f114a4804de'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Fear of Job', E'The fear of jobs being automated and traditional skills {{1}} obsolete has led to a growing focus on reskilling and upskilling programs. Governments and businesses are recognizing the importance of {{2}} in workforce development to {{3}} individuals with the skills needed in the evolving job landscape. To {{4}} the skills gap caused by this technological shift, it''s crucial to prioritize workforce development and retraining.', NULL, NULL, NULL, E'1.becoming, 2.investing, 3.equip, 4.bridge', NULL, NULL),
  ('c222bfc3-3934-5881-ad09-68ef770e65e5'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'READ_ALOUD', E'READ_ALOUD', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'c222bfc3-3934-5881-ad09-68ef770e65e5'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Copyright', E'Anyone who creates something artistic, such as fashion photos on the shoe, automatically has copyright to them. It consists of a financial right that is possible to license or sell, and a non-profit right that cannot be agreed away. The latter means that you always have the right to be mentioned in connection with your work being used.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('c224f0f4-000f-59f6-bab9-8e06ce44032f'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'WRITE_ESSAY', E'WRITE_ESSAY', E'WRITING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'c224f0f4-000f-59f6-bab9-8e06ce44032f'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Employers and Employees', E'Some employers take the opinions of their employees when determining the areas to invest in. Please explain whether it will bring advantages or disadvantages.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 200, 300),
  ('c2268fbf-44c4-5567-ace4-883087d293b1'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'ANSWER_SHORT_QUESTION', E'ANSWER_SHORT_QUESTION', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'c2268fbf-44c4-5567-ace4-883087d293b1'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'ASQ', E'In the animal kingdom, is the purpose of camouflage to attract a mate, to find food or to hide?', 'a109e086-64c7-55b3-a22f-2e037774d238'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'Hide', NULL, NULL),
  ('c22a0c08-36a6-58b5-9136-afdc19b6cd23'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'SUMMARIZE_WRITTEN_TEXT', E'SUMMARIZE_WRITTEN_TEXT', E'WRITING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'c22a0c08-36a6-58b5-9136-afdc19b6cd23'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Process Essay', E'As the name suggests, the process essay explains a process of making or breaking something. These essays are often written in chronological order, or in numerical order to show step-by-step processes. They are written in descriptive or prescriptive modes. Although it is not a technical communication, it sounds like having all the qualities of a technical document. The only difference is that it is often written in descriptive mode, while a technical document is mostly in imperative mode. As process essay provides step-by-step approach of doing something, they have typical transition words. These transition words make readers understand what has been done and what will follow next. Some of the specific transition words could be immediately, initially, in the end, in the future, in the meanwhile, later, next, soon, eventually, finally or firstly, and secondly. Here’s an example: “In any community, there are several and varying ways in which residents fulfill a sense of community: participating in intramural sports, attending farmers’ markets, walking with neighbors, attending political meetings, helping the elderly, visiting the library, and volunteering for youth groups.” A process essay gives reader a sense of complete how-to-do process of making or creating some objects or things. Readers, after going through the essay, are able to create and make things. Although it is not like imperative instructions, it gives full details in a descriptive or prescriptive mode. It is because its major objective is not to present trite and dry instructions, but lively language to make readers read it with interest and do the act with enthusiasm.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 5, 75),
  ('c22b86e3-162b-5499-9248-f3bff47bf408'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'LISTENING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'c22b86e3-162b-5499-9248-f3bff47bf408'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'WFD', NULL, '981374dd-63c4-58fc-b825-ef40493d2c87'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'The reception staff can give information of lending and printing.', NULL, NULL),
  ('c22c84e7-3345-53e0-add7-30d222c097b9'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DRAG_AND_DROP', E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DRAG_AND_DROP', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'c22c84e7-3345-53e0-add7-30d222c097b9'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Fall of Smallpox', E'The fall of smallpox began with the realization that {{1}} of the disease were immune for the rest of their lives. This led to the practice of variolation- a process of exposing a healthy person to infected material from a person with smallpox in the hopes of producing a mild disease that {{2}} immunity from further infection. The first written account of variolation describes a Buddhist nun practicing around 1022 to 1063 AD. By the 1700s, this method of variolation was {{3}} practice in China, India, and Turkey. In the late 1700s European physicians used this and other methods of variolation, but reported “devastating” results in some cases. Overall, 2% to 3% of people who were variolated died of smallpox, but this practice decreased the total number of smallpox {{4}} by 10-fold.', NULL, NULL, NULL, E'1.survivors, 2.provided, 3.common, 4.fatalities', NULL, NULL),
