  ('c4ab3d1f-eaa7-5617-99c4-f19beb0b1c4a'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DRAG_AND_DROP', E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DRAG_AND_DROP', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'c4ab3d1f-eaa7-5617-99c4-f19beb0b1c4a'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Organization of Bee', E'Recent studies have shed light on the remarkably efficient organization of bee colonies. Researchers observed the movement of bees within a hive, finding that {{1}} the high density of the population, bees {{2}} to navigate without causing ''traffic jams.'' This efficiency is attributed to their unique communication system, involving the ''waggle dance'' to {{3}} information about food sources. The findings have implications for optimizing human crowd management strategies, particularly in {{4}} populated urban areas.', NULL, NULL, NULL, E'1.despite, 2.manage, 3.relay, 4.densely', NULL, NULL),
  ('c4ac152f-ac96-5143-9751-3442066827ad'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'WRITE_ESSAY', E'WRITE_ESSAY', E'WRITING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'c4ac152f-ac96-5143-9751-3442066827ad'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Read and Write', E'Some people believe that the ability to read and write is more important today than in the past. Do you agree or disagree? Support your idea with examples.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 200, 300),
  ('c4ad3519-6f1a-5427-91aa-41269d95e80d'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'SELECT_MISSING_WORD', E'SELECT_MISSING_WORD', E'LISTENING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'c4ad3519-6f1a-5427-91aa-41269d95e80d'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Stress', E'Management requires a great deal of energy and effort more than most people care to make. One factor that affects managers and inhibits their capacity to provide leadership is stress. Stress has lots of causes, work overload, criticism from workers, and can have negative health effects, including loss of sleep. It''s a fact: managers have to deal with stress. Some handle it by making time to be by themselves. Most have some favorite place or pastime, a beach to walk on, maybe a stream to fish in or a game to play with the kids. It''s important to have some form of rest and relaxation, creating art, working with your hands, gardening, playing sports. The list goes on. Rest doesn''t always mean inactivity. For some people exercise ...\n\nAt the end of the recording the lost word or group of words has been replaced by a beep. Select the correct option to complete the recording.', '8e7aeef0-2f39-58d2-840a-53bbf664c51e'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'is rest', NULL, NULL),
  ('c4ad8ab4-f36f-5f5b-88f3-d1fe292b2e19'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DRAG_AND_DROP', E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DRAG_AND_DROP', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'c4ad8ab4-f36f-5f5b-88f3-d1fe292b2e19'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Atoms', E'For about 100 years most people believed John Dalton''s idea that atoms were the smallest particles that all matter was made of. However, this idea was soon to be {{1}} . Some scientists who were studying atomic models discovered that atoms were not the smallest particles that {{2}} , and that atoms had different parts with very {{3}} characteristics.', NULL, NULL, NULL, E'1.challenged, 2.existed, 3.distinct', NULL, NULL),
