  ('c64bfe43-247b-5689-b3e9-6c58dae25454'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'REPEAT_SENTENCE', E'REPEAT_SENTENCE', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'c64bfe43-247b-5689-b3e9-6c58dae25454'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'RS', NULL, '70ec52a4-f66e-53e3-bbb9-aedc8f9041e5'::uuid, NULL, E'This course belongs to the academic degree curriculum of communication postgraduates.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('c6540718-252b-5804-8b6a-379f32cafc6a'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'RESPOND_TO_A_SITUATION', E'RESPOND_TO_A_SITUATION', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'c6540718-252b-5804-8b6a-379f32cafc6a'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Dietary Restrictions', E'You''ve organized a dinner with your friends at your place. However, when they arrive, you notice they''ve brought food without considering dietary restrictions or allergies of others. You need to remind them to be mindful of everyone''s dietary needs for a successful and inclusive gathering. What would you say to your friends?', '0fd83ebc-ecde-5528-abb1-e87ff385a627'::uuid, NULL, E'Hey everyone, thanks for coming to the dinner. However I noticed some of the dishes might not be suitable for everyone due to dietary restrictions or allergies. Let''s make sure we''re mindful of everyone''s needs next time we gather. Maybe we can create a list of dishes beforehand or ask each other about dietary preferences to ensure everyone can enjoy the food. Thanks for understanding and making our gatherings more inclusive!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('c6594e38-9aa2-5a10-8fff-d0f9d4d68ebe'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'LISTENING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'c6594e38-9aa2-5a10-8fff-d0f9d4d68ebe'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'WFD', NULL, 'aef9d42c-b181-59fb-bba7-9ac96eeb8fef'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'Many governments found that it was difficult to reduce poverty in our society.', NULL, NULL),
  ('c65a614d-c457-5006-8433-a2dccb5e9f18'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DROPDOWN', E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DROPDOWN', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'c65a614d-c457-5006-8433-a2dccb5e9f18'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Foreign Policy', E'The foreign policy of a state, it is often argued, begins and ends with the border. No doubt an exaggeration, this aphorism nevertheless has an {{1}} of truth. A state''s relation with its neighbors, at least in the {{2}} years, are greatly influenced by its frontier policy, especially when there are no {{3}} borders. Empire builders in the past sought to extend imperial frontiers for a variety of reasons; subjugation of kings and princes to gain their {{4}} (as well as handsome tributes or the coffers of the state), and, security of the core of the empire from external attacks by establishing a string of buffer states in areas {{5}} the frontiers. The history of British empire in India was no different. It is important to note in this connection that the concept of international boundaries (between two sovereign states), demarcated and {{6}} , was yet to emerge in India under Mughal rule.', NULL, NULL, NULL, E'1.element, 2.formative, 3.settled, 4.allegiance, 5.adjoining, 6.delineated', NULL, NULL),
  ('c66772b8-c491-5c50-88dd-69775335f367'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'REPEAT_SENTENCE', E'REPEAT_SENTENCE', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'c66772b8-c491-5c50-88dd-69775335f367'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'RS', NULL, 'cc8aa04c-3d34-598e-9cc1-cd13de331417'::uuid, NULL, E'New timetables will be posted on the student noticeboard.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('c66eed45-0aca-5446-8a82-ea89729babfa'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'MC_READING_SINGLE', E'MC_READING_SINGLE', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'c66eed45-0aca-5446-8a82-ea89729babfa'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Quantum Mechanics', E'Quantum mechanics is a highly successful theory: it supplies methods for accurately calculating the results of diverse experiments, especially with minute particles. The predictions of quantum mechanics, however, give only the probability of an event, not a deterministic statement of whether or not the event will occur. Because of this probabilism, Einstein remained strongly dissatisfied with the theory throughout his life, though he did not maintain that quantum mechanics is wrong. Rather, he held that it is incomplete: in quantum mechanics the motion of a particle must be described in terms of probabilities, he argued, only because some parameters that determine the motion have not been specified. If these hypothetical "hidden parameters" were known, a fully deterministic trajectory could be defined. Significantly, this hidden-parameter quantum theory leads to experimental predictions different from those of traditional quantum mechanics. Einstein''s ideas have been tested by experiments performed since his death, and as most of these experiments support traditional quantum mechanics, Einstein''s approach is almost certainly erroneous.\n\nThe author regards the idea that traditional quantum mechanics is incomplete with', NULL, NULL, NULL, E'skepticism', NULL, NULL),
  ('c673d9ad-eef1-5c25-8b62-7c2919b5ca0b'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DRAG_AND_DROP', E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DRAG_AND_DROP', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'c673d9ad-eef1-5c25-8b62-7c2919b5ca0b'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Feeding Animals', E'Throughout history across many cultures, sometimes with no {{1}} reason, humans have fed animals of every imaginable stripe in every imaginable way. Some researchers think the {{2}} to give food to other animals may drive {{3}} as much as the human desire to eat them does. But the fact is, almost nothing about humans feeding animals is fully understood.', NULL, NULL, NULL, E'1.apparent, 2.desire, 3.domestication', NULL, NULL);
