  ('c68890ae-1978-5ebd-ac4a-ebb7a32850b6'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'READ_ALOUD', E'READ_ALOUD', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'c68890ae-1978-5ebd-ac4a-ebb7a32850b6'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Art', E'The canvas came alive with vibrant strokes of color. The painting captured fleeting moments frozen in time, evoking a myriad of feelings within its viewers. Artistic expression transcended words, allowing the soul to speak through strokes and shades. In this masterpiece, the artist poured their heart onto the canvas, inviting others to glimpse their inner world.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('c6898a84-351e-5461-b3e7-43a66282bdda'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'REPEAT_SENTENCE', E'REPEAT_SENTENCE', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'c6898a84-351e-5461-b3e7-43a66282bdda'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'RS', NULL, '1ab114ba-4b59-5ceb-be3e-a817a7eb487e'::uuid, NULL, E'The current and conventional method has many disadvantages including the side effects.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('c6950047-ec94-5602-80dc-bd8999e1d3fc'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DROPDOWN', E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DROPDOWN', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'c6950047-ec94-5602-80dc-bd8999e1d3fc'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Effective Management', E'Effective management involves four primary functions and related skill sets: planning, organizing, leading, and controlling. Although there’s a logical sequence to the functions, in practice the four functions are often performed in a dynamic manner. For example, a manager would need to develop or {{1}} a departmental or organizational plan prior to executing on it just as you would reference a map prior to {{2}} on a road trip. The proverb ‘if you fail to prepare you are preparing to fail’ {{3}} the importance of this function. However, just as when road or airport closures or other factors might cause you to change your original route, unanticipated internal or external factors might cause a manager to revisit and revise the original plan, requiring a change in the other functions and {{4}} tasks. Thus, achieving organizational goals – arriving at your intended destination – requires ongoing management of the process and an understanding of the interrelationship of the four functions.', NULL, NULL, NULL, E'1.reference, 2.embarking, 3.underscores, 4.associated', NULL, NULL),
  ('c698d980-f4c0-577c-9b1e-4c77dac22019'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'LISTENING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'c698d980-f4c0-577c-9b1e-4c77dac22019'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'WFD', NULL, 'dfffd959-5f46-5bde-9c42-c7e8ee7f6d67'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'This book discusses cultural impacts on our actions significantly.', NULL, NULL),
