  ('c7e5e10f-897b-5889-b703-64289c62afc9'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'READ_ALOUD', E'READ_ALOUD', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'c7e5e10f-897b-5889-b703-64289c62afc9'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Alien Life', E'Relatively soon, some prominent astrobiologists say, we will most likely have either found compelling evidence for extraterrestrial life or banished its possible existence to the ever shrinking edges of the cosmos beyond the rapidly expanding reach of our observations. Such answers could come by the end of this century from any of a number of initiatives ardently seeking alien life.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('c7f12adb-c3fb-5d4c-aa13-e2f4eddd7e10'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DRAG_AND_DROP', E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DRAG_AND_DROP', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'c7f12adb-c3fb-5d4c-aa13-e2f4eddd7e10'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Durkheim', E'Durkheim found humanistic studies uninteresting, {{1}} his attention from psychology and philosophy to ethics and eventually, sociology. He graduated with a degree in philosophy in 1882. Durkheim''s views could not get him a major academic appointment in Paris, so from 1882 to 1887 he taught philosophy at several provincial schools. In 1885 he {{3}} Germany, where he studied sociology for two years. Durkheim'' s period in Germany {{4}} the publication of numerous articles on German social science and philosophy, which {{2}} recognition in France, earning him a teaching appointment at the University of Bordeaux in 1887.', NULL, NULL, NULL, E'1.turning, 2.left for, 3.resulted in, 4.gained', NULL, NULL),
  ('c7f26895-1d21-50c1-9720-339baa127ba1'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'READ_ALOUD', E'READ_ALOUD', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'c7f26895-1d21-50c1-9720-339baa127ba1'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Co-evolutionary Relationship', E'The co-evolutionary relationship between cows and grass is an underappreciated wonder, also the key to understanding just about everything about modern meat. For the grasses, which have evolved to withstand the grazing of ruminants, the cow maintains and expands their habitat by preventing trees and shrubs from gaining a foothold and hogging the sunlight; the animal also spreads grass seed, plants it with his hooves, and then fertilizes it with his manure.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('c7f8a70e-aecc-5f0f-b1c1-4731f97e76f6'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'READ_ALOUD', E'READ_ALOUD', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'c7f8a70e-aecc-5f0f-b1c1-4731f97e76f6'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Female Undergraduates', E'The most obvious change is that 46% of college undergraduates are now women. When I went there, it was only the third year that women had been admitted, and then seemingly grudgingly: about 70% of students were male, and if there was a woman tutor she must have been a male impersonator.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('c7fa8b4f-f4f1-547b-bdeb-bc8b6353f5f6'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DRAG_AND_DROP', E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DRAG_AND_DROP', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'c7fa8b4f-f4f1-547b-bdeb-bc8b6353f5f6'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'E-Learning', E'E-Learning is the new way forward. We believe {{1}} in E-Learning. Our innovative approach opens up new {{2}} for busy professionals that simply did not previously exist — the {{3}} to combine a prestigious Masters programme with a demanding professional and personal {{4}} . Our small virtual classrooms facilitate intensive {{5}} and collaboration among professionals from all over the world.', NULL, NULL, NULL, E'1.passionately, 2.opportunities, 3.chance, 4.life, 5.interaction', NULL, NULL),
  ('c8055e80-d18f-5846-84b8-f1dd70e6495f'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'RE_ORDER_PARAGRAPHS', E'RE_ORDER_PARAGRAPHS', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'c8055e80-d18f-5846-84b8-f1dd70e6495f'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Smuggling Business', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, E'3, 1, 4, 5, 2', NULL, NULL),
  ('c80829ae-d7a5-5fc4-b846-b40042925877'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'READ_ALOUD', E'READ_ALOUD', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'c80829ae-d7a5-5fc4-b846-b40042925877'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Sportsmanship and Atheletes', E'Sportsmanship is an understanding of and commitment to fair play, ethical behavior and integrity, and general goodwill toward an opponent. It is an affirmation that an athlete is disciplined enough to have perspective, maintain poise and do what is best for his or her teammates. Being able to make appropriate behavioral choices in a pressure situation will often reveal a player’s character.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('c808372f-ec5b-557c-a9f5-618f2e5a2a64'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DRAG_AND_DROP', E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DRAG_AND_DROP', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'c808372f-ec5b-557c-a9f5-618f2e5a2a64'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Sharing Dreams', E'Sharing dreams may serve a {{1}} . A study finds that describing the content of our dreams or nightmares – whether boring or truly bizarre – may function to {{2}} people and groups together, and that listening and responding to the strange content of dreams can increase {{3}} . It even proposes that dream-sharing helped the process of human self-domestication, where people evolved greater self-control and less aggressive {{4}} .', NULL, NULL, NULL, E'1.purpose, 2.bond, 3.empathy, 4.tendencies', NULL, NULL),
  ('c8114b37-42ea-595f-8eb9-7330fac4d7dd'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'ANSWER_SHORT_QUESTION', E'ANSWER_SHORT_QUESTION', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'c8114b37-42ea-595f-8eb9-7330fac4d7dd'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'ASQ', E'How do we describe people who have or express great love of their country?', '4e48273f-97ef-57c1-9780-be93e422f0fa'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'Patriotic / patriot / nationalist', NULL, NULL),
  ('c81c426b-c403-5851-9e60-983a216b8d3c'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'ANSWER_SHORT_QUESTION', E'ANSWER_SHORT_QUESTION', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'c81c426b-c403-5851-9e60-983a216b8d3c'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'ASQ', E'What is the term for a set of rules or guidelines that govern the structure and use of a language?', '9f597dd1-ebb1-5b5d-b120-1a3ee57f2981'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'Grammar', NULL, NULL),
  ('c81e0edf-3d19-56e3-a345-f42113972b7d'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DROPDOWN', E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DROPDOWN', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'c81e0edf-3d19-56e3-a345-f42113972b7d'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Urban Ethnobotany', E'Urban ethnobotany, an emerging field at the intersection of anthropology and botany, explores the dynamic relationship between city-dwelling humans and plant life. This discipline sheds light on how urban communities, while often seen as {{1}} from nature, continue to engage with plants for medicinal, nutritional, and cultural {{2}} . The cities are surprisingly rich in plant biodiversity, with community gardens, potted rooftops, and even spontaneous vegetation in cracks and crevices contributing to an urban green infrastructure. This urban flora is not merely decorative but plays a vital role in the well-being of city residents, offering spaces for {{3}} , sources of fresh food, and connections to cultural heritage through traditional herbal remedies and cuisines. The study of urban ethnobotany highlights the innovative ways in {{4}} citizens integrate plant life into their daily routines, challenging the notion of cities as spaces devoid of nature.', NULL, NULL, NULL, E'1.detached, 2.purposes, 3.relaxation, 4.which', NULL, NULL),
  ('c8233aff-3aed-52cf-8671-de640fb8164a'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'SUMMARIZE_WRITTEN_TEXT', E'SUMMARIZE_WRITTEN_TEXT', E'WRITING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'c8233aff-3aed-52cf-8671-de640fb8164a'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Ethics', E'Ethics is a set of moral obligations that define right and wrong in our practices and decisions. Many professions have a formalized system of ethical practices that help guide professionals in the field. For example, doctors commonly take the Hippocratic Oath, which, among other things, states that doctors "do no harm" to their patients. Engineers follow an ethical guide that states that they "hold paramount the safety, health, and welfare of the public." Within these professions, as well as within science, the principles become so ingrained that practitioners rarely have to think about adhering to the ethic – it''s part of the way they practice. And a breach of ethics is considered very serious, punishable at least within the profession (by revocation of a license, for example) and sometimes by the law as well.\nScientific ethics calls for honesty and integrity in all stages of scientific practice, from reporting results regardless to properly attributing collaborators. This system of ethics guides the practice of science, from data collection to publication and beyond. As in other professions, the scientific ethics is deeply integrated into the way scientists work, and they are aware that the reliability of their work and scientific knowledge in general depends upon adhering to that ethic. Many of the ethical principles in science relate to the production of unbiased scientific knowledge, which is critical when others try to build upon or extend research findings. The open publication of data, peer review, replication, and collaboration required by the scientific ethic all help to keep science moving forward by validating research findings and confirming or raising questions about results.', NULL, NULL, E'Ethics is a set of moral obligations that define right and wrong in our practices and decisions, and many professions have a formalized system of ethical practices, whereas scientific ethics calls for honesty and integrity in all stages of scientific practice, which guides the practice of science and is deeply integrated into the way scientists work, where many of the ethical principles in science relate to the production of unbiased scientific knowledge.', NULL, 5, 75),
  ('c8273848-2aa7-55c3-b6b2-ac56575eddf4'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'LISTENING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'c8273848-2aa7-55c3-b6b2-ac56575eddf4'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'WFD', NULL, 'd24689d5-0d10-59a4-bb9a-97fa28b22d42'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'Good nutrition is crucial to the general health and vitality.', NULL, NULL),
  ('c82b7dba-2b0b-51f7-8353-a9d1e77c588c'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'REPEAT_SENTENCE', E'REPEAT_SENTENCE', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'c82b7dba-2b0b-51f7-8353-a9d1e77c588c'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'RS', NULL, 'b98fd725-8469-5f1e-b538-b30becc5145d'::uuid, NULL, E'On behalf of our department, thank you for your participation.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('c82d7f3c-e425-5571-bf4e-00909aeabc8c'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'ANSWER_SHORT_QUESTION', E'ANSWER_SHORT_QUESTION', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'c82d7f3c-e425-5571-bf4e-00909aeabc8c'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'ASQ', E'Who was the ancient Greek philosopher who taught Alexander the Great?', '473441cb-37ea-5341-ac46-aa77f2d634ec'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'Aristotle', NULL, NULL),
  ('c83f06ef-bbb7-5f66-822e-929556903e69'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DROPDOWN', E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DROPDOWN', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'c83f06ef-bbb7-5f66-822e-929556903e69'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Albert Einstein', E'Albert Einstein''s theories, particularly his theories of relativity, have been subject to a wide spectrum of critical reception and analysis over the past century. Initially, these theories {{1}} with skepticism and awe, as they challenged the long-held Newtonian view of the universe. Einstein''s propositions, especially the concept of spacetime and the relativistic effects of gravity, were groundbreaking and led to heated debates in the scientific community. Over the years, his theories {{2}} substantial empirical support, notably through the confirmation of the bending of light by gravity during a solar eclipse. The intellectual journey of Einstein''s theories illustrates how radical ideas, {{3}} rigorously tested and validated, can shift the paradigm of an entire field. Today, Einstein''s contributions are not only recognized as foundational in physics but also as a symbol of human intellect''s capacity to {{4}} the mysteries of the universe.', NULL, NULL, NULL, E'1.were met, 2.gained, 3.once, 4.unravel', NULL, NULL),
  ('c840a154-4b3e-5837-853d-00478d356ccf'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'RE_TELL_LECTURE', E'RE_TELL_LECTURE', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'c840a154-4b3e-5837-853d-00478d356ccf'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Happiness', NULL, '95a83c28-dfcc-5d5e-98e6-3d5b3f355741'::uuid, NULL, E'There was a time when the subject of happiness was the business of philosophers, as part of their discussion of what makes for the good life. Then, much later, psychologists and sociologists got in on the act, and now, it seems, so has the government. I understand that governments should have the welfare and well-being of those it governs at heart from the purely practical point of view of keeping people quiet, at home enjoying their gadgets and comfort, rather than on the streets rioting. But surely it''s not something you can legislate for. Today there are numerous journals on the topic and it is even included in the curriculum at some universities and colleges. Surveys are done, statistics compiled, graphs drawn, yet all they seem to "prove" is what most people have conduced themselves from personal experience.\nAn obvious example would be that having a lot of money doesn''t necessarily make you happy. We all wish to be happy and have ideas about what it is we think would make us so. But we also know or suspect that it''s not that easy. Most of us learn that it is a by-product of something else, usually being totally absorbed or involved in some task or pastime, and can only be reached that way. These activities, of course, must be worthwhile in themselves.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('c84ae659-d1cf-5e46-90a9-35a209ce0ee0'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'REPEAT_SENTENCE', E'REPEAT_SENTENCE', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'c84ae659-d1cf-5e46-90a9-35a209ce0ee0'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'RS', NULL, '7e911683-4e9b-5bf2-bba8-6199c001fea1'::uuid, NULL, E'Fear of essay writing stems from not learning it properly.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('c85092ad-d15d-51a9-9ee3-9a48832e99d9'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'READ_ALOUD', E'READ_ALOUD', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'c85092ad-d15d-51a9-9ee3-9a48832e99d9'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Tesla & Edison', E'Tesla actually worked for Edison early in his career. Edison offered to pay him the modern equivalent of a million dollars to fix the problems he was having with his DC generators and motors. Tesla fixed Edison''s machines and when he asked for the money he was promised, Edison laughed him off and had this to say, "Tesla, you don''t understand our American humor."', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('c857c3e7-a671-5af4-81d3-1cbc979a7b2b'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'LISTENING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'c857c3e7-a671-5af4-81d3-1cbc979a7b2b'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'WFD', NULL, '3e5f1c0d-8b89-53a2-835e-fcf08f9708a2'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'The communities are demanding equal rights and justice.', NULL, NULL),
  ('c85a5be5-babc-5eeb-9b2f-7a7ea19217e4'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'SUMMARIZE_WRITTEN_TEXT', E'SUMMARIZE_WRITTEN_TEXT', E'WRITING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'c85a5be5-babc-5eeb-9b2f-7a7ea19217e4'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Metaverse', E'The concept of the metaverse is rapidly gaining traction in the world of technology, promising to revolutionize the way we interact with digital spaces and each other. It represents a new era of connectivity and immersion, where physical and digital boundaries blur. In essence, the metaverse is a virtual, interconnected universe where users can engage in various activities, interact with others, and create their own digital presence. It encompasses virtual reality (VR), augmented reality (AR), and the internet, seamlessly blending these technologies into a unified experience.\nOne of the most exciting aspects of the metaverse is its potential to transform the way we work, socialize, learn, and entertain ourselves. Imagine attending a virtual meeting in a lifelike conference room, exploring distant places in an immersive travel experience, or attending a concert with friends from around the world — all from the comfort of your home. Businesses are already exploring the possibilities of the metaverse, from virtual showrooms for products to interactive training simulations for employees. It has the potential to disrupt traditional industries and create new opportunities for innovation and entrepreneurship.\nHowever, with the promise of the metaverse come challenges, including issues of privacy, security, and digital inequality. As this digital realm expands, it''s crucial to ensure that ethical and equitable standards are established and maintained. The metaverse is not just a concept; it''s becoming a tangible reality. Tech giants and startups alike are investing heavily in its development. As it continues to evolve, it will be exciting to see how the metaverse shapes our future, offering new possibilities for creativity, collaboration, and connection in the digital age.', NULL, NULL, E'Metaverse represents a new era of connectivity and immersion, and one of the most exciting aspects of the metaverse is its potential to transform the way we work, socialize, learn, and entertain ourselves; with the promise of the metaverse come challenges, so it''s crucial to ensure that ethical and equitable standards are established and maintained.', NULL, 5, 75),
