  ('c8e29998-0a30-5e60-bb9d-1c2e12310839'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'READ_ALOUD', E'READ_ALOUD', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'c8e29998-0a30-5e60-bb9d-1c2e12310839'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Space Lab', E'We''ve outfitted it with the space lab built by our European partners and used it before the era of the space station to do scientific research. We used it as part of our partnership with the Russians, which is still continuing, first as part of the space station. And now, of course, we''re using it to build the new international space station, which is a huge international partnership.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
