  ('cc256b40-4d50-57c8-9e33-e1e22aca9804'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'RE_TELL_LECTURE', E'RE_TELL_LECTURE', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'cc256b40-4d50-57c8-9e33-e1e22aca9804'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Gas Giants', NULL, '93a3426a-321c-52d9-a313-6ede95ce494b'::uuid, NULL, E'So there are two theories for how the gas giants formed. One is the same theory I showed you just now core accretion, right. And the other is called disk instability and one of our colleagues at DTM has done a lot of work on that and so it''s unclear exactly how they formed but you''re right what we''re trying to do the reason we''re trying to get the higher and higher pressure in the lab is because we are trying to understand more about the pressure inside the gas giants. It''s thought that the gas giants also have a metallic core, but maybe the metallic core not made of iron. Hydrogen, for example becomes metallic at a certain pressure. So it''s very possible that the insides of these planets could have metallic cores, could have hydrogen cores, could have rocky portions we''re not sure. But the higher pressure we can get in the lab, the closer we can get understanding the interiors of the gas giants and the exoplanet that are so big.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('cc291a9c-6a89-5166-882b-e8f77da3db09'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'ANSWER_SHORT_QUESTION', E'ANSWER_SHORT_QUESTION', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'cc291a9c-6a89-5166-882b-e8f77da3db09'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'ASQ', E'What is the term for the distance from the center of a circle to any point on its circumference?', '969a2429-334b-5277-a3a0-30f4a2375b2c'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'Radius', NULL, NULL),
  ('cc2ee973-f534-5017-9d84-c2ab0f1130b7'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DRAG_AND_DROP', E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DRAG_AND_DROP', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'cc2ee973-f534-5017-9d84-c2ab0f1130b7'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Entrepreneurs', E'Entrepreneurs seek the best opportunities for production and {{1}} all the other resources in order to carry them out. An entrepreneur {{2}} needs and takes the necessary actions to initiate the {{3}} by which they will be {{4}} . This often means {{5}} and taking risks.', NULL, NULL, NULL, E'1.coordinate, 2.visualizes, 3.process, 4.met, 5.innovating', NULL, NULL),
  ('cc31bb6c-5c41-5206-8cf1-0cf1b1a80006'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'MC_READING_MULTIPLE', E'MC_READING_MULTIPLE', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'cc31bb6c-5c41-5206-8cf1-0cf1b1a80006'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'MCM-R', E'When does a hobby or pastime, or whatever you want to call what you do in your leisure time for rest and relaxation, cease to be a hobby or a pastime and become something a bit more serious, such as something you realize can be turned into financial gain, or an obsession that can mess up your life as much as any other addiction? The whole point of them, of course, is that they are done out of personal interest and for pleasure and enjoyment, not for financial gain.\nMost people''s hobbies turn out to be easy and stress-free pastimes such as collecting things, making things, sports, playing a musical instrument, reading, and so on. And - so it is claimed - they are good for you, too. Pursuing a hobby can have calming and helpful beneficial effects. For a start, it can take your mind off your problems, and the more interests you have, the more you enjoy life.\nOne way in which the subject becomes a little bit serious is when you are applying for a job and writing out your curriculum vitae, or resume. There''s invariably a section which asks what your outside interests are, and because getting a job is a serious business, and you want to impress your prospective employers, you might find yourself claiming that you like nothing better at weekends than being flown by helicopter to the top of the Alps and then making your way home by snowboard and hang-glider. Perhaps people find themselves doing this because they feel that applying for a job and corning across well at interview is a test of character and being an aficionado of extreme sports is a lot cooler than stamp collecting.\nBut why turn what is supposed to be calming and relaxing into a cause for anxiety?\n\nWhich of the following statements are true about hobbies and pastimes, according to the text?', NULL, NULL, NULL, E'They are not pursued for economic profit.\nMost people''s hobbies are simple and undemanding.', NULL, NULL),
  ('cc3518f9-c35f-5233-91b9-0f368b1ab2d5'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'WRITE_ESSAY', E'WRITE_ESSAY', E'WRITING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'cc3518f9-c35f-5233-91b9-0f368b1ab2d5'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Popular Culture', E'Many universities offer degree courses in popular culture, such as popular music and video gaming. Do you think it is appropriate and give reasons to support your idea.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 200, 300),
  ('cc36edef-ee3e-55e6-8d09-5c4ec9b09bf4'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'RE_TELL_LECTURE', E'RE_TELL_LECTURE', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'cc36edef-ee3e-55e6-8d09-5c4ec9b09bf4'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Deep Ocean', NULL, '67a09bae-6e20-52dc-90f9-96087c62ccef'::uuid, NULL, E'Today, I''m thrilled to share insights into the mysterious and largely unexplored deep ocean. This vast and enigmatic part of our planet holds secrets that scientists are only beginning to understand. The deep ocean is home to some of the most unusual and fascinating creatures. These species have adapted to extreme conditions of darkness, cold, and high pressure. For instance, the anglerfish, with its bioluminescent lure, is a testament to the unique adaptations required for survival in such an environment. Furthermore, the deep sea plays a crucial role in our planet''s health. It''s a major carbon sink, helping to regulate the Earth''s climate. The deep-sea ecosystems also contribute to the cycling of nutrients, essential for supporting life both in the ocean and on land. In conclusion, the deep ocean is not just a place of darkness and mystery; it''s a vital part of our world, with profound implications for environmental science and biology. As we continue to explore these depths, we unlock more of Earth''s hidden wonders.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('cc395451-68e0-55c4-a4fb-9821bb6c712f'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'LISTENING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'cc395451-68e0-55c4-a4fb-9821bb6c712f'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'WFD', NULL, 'd5da64a2-2acc-59f3-9ad2-84d139a252f1'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'Visual aids can be really helpful when you are revising.', NULL, NULL),
  ('cc3b5dbb-ae00-5494-99fa-6a2390549d1a'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'READ_ALOUD', E'READ_ALOUD', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'cc3b5dbb-ae00-5494-99fa-6a2390549d1a'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Homesick', E'Everyone at some point can feel worried or anxious, homesick or isolated because they don''t just fit in. This often happens when you change your location or when changes happen to you, and the truth is that this happens to lots of people; and it''s a normal part of life. It''s been recognized that around one third of students will experience poor mental health during their studies.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('cc40d428-4423-5651-be00-67ec3ea5104e'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'READ_ALOUD', E'READ_ALOUD', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'cc40d428-4423-5651-be00-67ec3ea5104e'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Liquid Metals', E'Liquid metals hold the potential to revolutionize the chemical industry and address its environmental impact. By testing a new technique, researchers aim to replace the energy-intensive chemical engineering processes that have been in use since the early 20th century. This innovative approach offers a promising solution to "greening" the industry by reducing its carbon footprint and minimizing resource consumption.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('cc4140d7-c476-5deb-9d14-9f189bfa6c8d'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'LISTENING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'cc4140d7-c476-5deb-9d14-9f189bfa6c8d'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'WFD', NULL, '6b5bf7f3-fc10-51fe-a33b-7c6b5ada36d2'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'This is the third and the final lecture in this series.', NULL, NULL),
  ('cc4465ce-2b09-5826-aa65-87b44cca91f0'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'SUMMARIZE_WRITTEN_TEXT', E'SUMMARIZE_WRITTEN_TEXT', E'WRITING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'cc4465ce-2b09-5826-aa65-87b44cca91f0'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Demise of the Universe', E'It is remarkable how often the origin of things is tied to the very same phenomena that ultimately lead to their demise — a fact that is especially evident when we ponder cosmic endings, from the end of the Earth to the end of the universe. For instance, planetary scientists increasingly suspect that comets and ice-laden meteorites crashing into the primordial Earth probably provided most of the planet’s water. Organic molecules have been detected in comets, and researchers simulated those cosmic crash landings by using a gas gun to fire metal projectiles into blocks of ice containing some of the same chemicals that make up comets. The shock wave and heat generated by the impact created molecules that formed amino acids, the building blocks of proteins.\nYet the very same objects that gave this planet life could also spell its demise. Astronomers predict that a comet or asteroid large enough to cause global devastation will smash into the Earth about every 100 million years or so. Fortunately, if such a comet or asteroid were to arrive sooner than expected, we are constructing observational systems to discover and track near-Earth objects, conceivably providing us with sufficient time to pre-empt catastrophe. Other cosmic smash-ups, however, cannot be averted, no matter how much advance warning we have. The inexorable tug of gravity that enabled the formation of the Milky Way has also put us on a collision course with our neighboring galaxy, Andromeda. Recent observations confirm that Andromeda is heading straight toward us at about 60 miles per second, and will traverse the 2.5 million light-year distance currently separating our galaxies in about four billion years.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 5, 75),
  ('cc49d905-02bb-5d85-b11b-11d26152267a'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'WRITE_ESSAY', E'WRITE_ESSAY', E'WRITING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'cc49d905-02bb-5d85-b11b-11d26152267a'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Online Meeting', E'Researchers say more and more business meetings are held online. Do you think it is advantageous or disadvantageous?', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 200, 300),
  ('cc4c7525-8327-58bf-8ebb-36c4edaf9ba8'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'ANSWER_SHORT_QUESTION', E'ANSWER_SHORT_QUESTION', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'cc4c7525-8327-58bf-8ebb-36c4edaf9ba8'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'ASQ', E'What is the magazine that is dedicated to academic news?', '8e53be2a-5bda-5cbe-9494-7e98a5581f31'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'Journal / Academic journal', NULL, NULL),
  ('cc5140c3-15c3-5942-9140-ed5bd7c74eab'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DROPDOWN', E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DROPDOWN', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'cc5140c3-15c3-5942-9140-ed5bd7c74eab'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Truancy', E'In reality, however, the {{1}} of truancy and non-attendance are diverse and multifaceted. There are as many causes of non-attendance as there are non-attenders. Each child has her own {{2}} story, and whilst there may often be certain identifiable factors in common, each non-attending child demands and {{3}} an individual response, tailored to meet her individual needs. This applies {{4}} to the 14-year-old who fails to attend school because a parent is terminally ill, the overweight 11-year-old who fails to attend because he is {{5}} about changing for PE in front of peers, the 15-year-old who is ''bored'' by lessons, and to the seven-year-old who is teased in the playground because she does not wear the latest designer-label clothes.', NULL, NULL, NULL, E'1.triggers, 2.unique, 3.deserves, 4.equally, 5.embarrassed', NULL, NULL),
  ('cc646cfe-ef18-5bdc-be1d-ee220fd5c550'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'REPEAT_SENTENCE', E'REPEAT_SENTENCE', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'cc646cfe-ef18-5bdc-be1d-ee220fd5c550'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'RS', NULL, '26d75671-de66-5b7c-ae9f-ef6d74abb484'::uuid, NULL, E'The manager has to check the product quality every now and then.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('cc68230d-231a-50de-a3a9-adb08968162b'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DRAG_AND_DROP', E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DRAG_AND_DROP', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'cc68230d-231a-50de-a3a9-adb08968162b'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Shakespeare''s Work', E'Shakespeare produced most of his {{1}} between 1589 and 1613. His early plays were comedies and histories - {{2}} he raised to the peak of sophistication and artistry by the end of the 16th century. He then wrote tragedies until about 1608, including Hamlet, King Lear, Othello, and Macbeth, considered some of the finest {{3}} in the English language. In his last phase, he wrote tragicomedies, also known as romances, and {{4}} with other playwrights.', NULL, NULL, NULL, E'1.work, 2.genres, 3.examples, 4.collaborated', NULL, NULL),
  ('cc6d1c34-bb1b-5f56-b76f-e3f0805b5c54'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DRAG_AND_DROP', E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DRAG_AND_DROP', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'cc6d1c34-bb1b-5f56-b76f-e3f0805b5c54'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'White Paper', E'Let us then suppose the mind to be, as we say, white paper, {{1}} of all characters, without any ideas: - How comes it to be furnished? Whence comes it by that vast store which the busy and {{2}} fancy of man has painted on it with an almost endless variety? Whence has it all the materials of reason and knowledge? To this I answer, in one word, from experience. In that, all our knowledge is {{3}} ; and from that it ultimately {{4}} itself.', NULL, NULL, NULL, E'1.void, 2.boundless, 3.founded, 4.derives', NULL, NULL),
  ('cc6fbe55-d971-5e5f-b72b-8421d3f3d429'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DRAG_AND_DROP', E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DRAG_AND_DROP', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'cc6fbe55-d971-5e5f-b72b-8421d3f3d429'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Amazon', E'The Amazon is an ecological {{1}} . It accounts for more than half of Earth’s remaining tropical forests. Roughly 17 percent of the world’s river water flows through here. It also {{2}} about one fourth of all land-dwelling species. That includes its flowers: More types of flowers {{3}} in the Amazon than there are stars {{4}} to the naked eye in the night sky.', NULL, NULL, NULL, E'1.marvel, 2.houses, 3.bloom, 4.visible', NULL, NULL),
  ('cc764d3e-60a3-5548-8dab-b0419faed51b'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'LISTENING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'cc764d3e-60a3-5548-8dab-b0419faed51b'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'WFD', NULL, '3fff716b-0f97-5a56-b17f-b2abead07bc2'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'These mentors are here to help train students in engineering science.', NULL, NULL),
