  ('d09ba934-387c-56d4-96fa-4484cfd459e7'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DRAG_AND_DROP', E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DRAG_AND_DROP', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'd09ba934-387c-56d4-96fa-4484cfd459e7'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Coral Reefs', E'More than 80 percent of global warming is absorbed by the ocean, which has a massive capacity to store and {{1}} heat. Elevated sea-surface temperatures are causing long-term {{2}} to coral reefs: corals are dying. Many reports {{3}} that up to 90 percent of coral reefs could disappear if the global warming reaches 1.5oC. Higher carbon dioxide levels can {{4}} the chemistry of the ocean, making it more acidic for corals to grow.', NULL, NULL, NULL, E'1.release, 2.damage, 3.project, 4.transform', NULL, NULL),
  ('d09e0c8e-76d0-5f31-8df5-e1f065ba9c1b'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DRAG_AND_DROP', E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DRAG_AND_DROP', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'd09e0c8e-76d0-5f31-8df5-e1f065ba9c1b'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Egyptian Music', E'Music was as important to the ancient Egyptians as it is in our modern society. Although it is thought that music played a {{1}} throughout the history of Egypt, those that study the Egyptian writings have discovered that music {{2}} to become more important in what is called the ''pharaonic'' {{3}} of their history. This was the time when the Egyptian dynasties of the pharaohs were {{4}} and music was found in many parts of everyday Egyptian life.', NULL, NULL, NULL, E'1.role, 2.seemed, 3.period, 4.established', NULL, NULL),
  ('d09efe4e-e55a-569a-8e6e-ab43ab901358'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'RESPOND_TO_A_SITUATION', E'RESPOND_TO_A_SITUATION', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'd09efe4e-e55a-569a-8e6e-ab43ab901358'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'A Spa Day', E'You book a spa day based on glowing reviews and a wide range of services listed online. When you arrive, half the services are unavailable, and the facilities are not as advertised. How do you address this with the spa manager?', '73060bb0-4a5a-56c8-ba09-f0be315dcebc'::uuid, NULL, E'It was quite a letdown to see many services aren''t available and the facilities aren''t as great as I expected. I was looking forward to the full experience. To make up for this gap between what was advertised and what''s provided, could we maybe work out a partial refund or perhaps a voucher for a future visit when all services are back? I think that''d be a fair way to ensure I still get the relaxing experience I was excited about.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
