  ('d1c50708-514d-5d07-811a-6af0102be876'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'REPEAT_SENTENCE', E'REPEAT_SENTENCE', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'd1c50708-514d-5d07-811a-6af0102be876'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'RS', NULL, 'a9459071-a551-541b-8351-50bd71f183f5'::uuid, NULL, E'The lecture on child psychology has been postponed until Friday.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('d1c8bc6c-d9e1-5356-be16-41d6b44c537c'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DRAG_AND_DROP', E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DRAG_AND_DROP', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'd1c8bc6c-d9e1-5356-be16-41d6b44c537c'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Making Choices', E'Making choices can be {{1}} for some students. Providing clear, direct language about options helps to {{2}} instruction. For example, when my students were focusing on learning vocabulary related to weather, I gave them this choice: “You can write a weather report or create vocabulary flash cards.” Both assignments would {{3}} the goal of mastering unfamiliar vocabulary while {{4}} students to choose a task that suited their learning interests.', NULL, NULL, NULL, E'1.overwhelming, 2.clarify, 3.accomplish, 4.allowing', NULL, NULL),
  ('d1ccdc3f-953c-5c48-a1ab-c3faaa6d6eca'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'SUMMARIZE_WRITTEN_TEXT', E'SUMMARIZE_WRITTEN_TEXT', E'WRITING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'd1ccdc3f-953c-5c48-a1ab-c3faaa6d6eca'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Lost City of Atlantis', E'For centuries, the legend of Atlantis has captivated the imaginations of historians, archaeologists, and enthusiasts alike. This mythical city, believed to have vanished beneath the waves, has remained an enduring mystery. However, recent research has shed new light on the enigma of Atlantis.\nThe story of Atlantis, first recounted by the ancient Greek philosopher Plato in his dialogues "Timaeus" and "Critias," describes an advanced civilization that existed around 9,000 years before his time. According to Plato, Atlantis was a powerful and technologically advanced island nation, but it was ultimately engulfed by the sea in a cataclysmic event.\nFor centuries, scholars debated whether Atlantis was a mere allegory or a real place. The absence of concrete evidence fueled skepticism. However, advances in underwater archaeology and geology have allowed researchers to reexamine the possibility of Atlantis''s existence.\nOne intriguing theory is that Atlantis was located in the Mediterranean, near what is now the island of Santorini. Around 1600 BCE, the eruption of the Santorini volcano caused massive tsunamis and devastated the Minoan civilization on the island of Crete. Some believe this event may have inspired the Atlantis legend.\nAnother hypothesis places Atlantis in the Azores, a group of islands in the Atlantic Ocean. Geological surveys have revealed submerged structures and unusual stone formations on the seafloor, sparking excitement among those who hope to find conclusive evidence.\nWhile the mystery of Atlantis has not been definitively solved, these recent discoveries and ongoing research efforts bring us closer to understanding the ancient legend. Whether Atlantis is a historical reality or a captivating myth, its allure continues to inspire exploration and intrigue in the realms of history and archaeology.', NULL, NULL, E'The legendary city of Atlantis, first mentioned by Plato as an advanced civilization submerged by the sea, remains an enigmatic mystery, but recent advancements in underwater archaeology and geology have reignited interest, with theories proposing locations like the Mediterranean near Santorini or the Atlantic''s Azores, drawing us closer to unraveling this ancient enigma.', NULL, 5, 75),
  ('d1d1543e-ed34-5610-a1f5-ddf2b9cefa59'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'SELECT_MISSING_WORD', E'SELECT_MISSING_WORD', E'LISTENING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'd1d1543e-ed34-5610-a1f5-ddf2b9cefa59'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Man-made Disease', E'In the early days of the settlement of Australia, enterprising settlers unwisely introduced the European rabbit. This rabbit had no natural enemies in the antipodes, so that it multiplied with that promiscuous abandon characteristic of rabbits. It overran a whole continent. It caused devastation by burrowing, and by devouring the herbage, which might have maintained millions of sheep and cattle. Scientists discovered that this particular variety of rabbit, and apparently no other animal most susceptible to a fatal virus disease, myxomatosis. By infecting animals and letting them loose in the burrows, local epidemics of this disease could be created. Later, it was found that there was a type of mosquito which acted as the carrier of this disease and pass it on to the rabbits. So while the rest of the world was trying to get rid of mosquitoes, Australia was encouraging this one. It effectively spread the disease all over the continent and drastically reduced the rabbit population. It later became apparent that rabbits were developing a degree of resistance to this disease, so that the rabbit population was unlikely to be completely exterminated. There were hopes, however, that the problem of the rabbit would become...\n\nAt the end of the recording the lost word or group of words has been replaced by a beep. Select the correct option to complete the recording.', '1e7c02c2-f60a-5f92-a65a-30d20bd098ad'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'manageable', NULL, NULL),
  ('d1d457f2-bacb-5cff-8502-95af0b554005'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'LISTENING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'd1d457f2-bacb-5cff-8502-95af0b554005'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'WFD', NULL, '86150924-e4e2-5941-95de-15202d02039d'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'Some of the current curriculum reforms intend to improve equity.', NULL, NULL),
  ('d1d4a77d-7e2c-5084-8263-a59601099e14'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'READ_ALOUD', E'READ_ALOUD', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'd1d4a77d-7e2c-5084-8263-a59601099e14'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Space Exploration', E'Space exploration has captivated human imagination for centuries, offering glimpses into the mysteries of the universe and inspiring scientific innovation. However, space exploration also raises ethical questions about its cost, safety, and impact on Earth''s environment. As we continue to explore space, it is important to balance our curiosity with responsible practices that prioritize safety and sustainability.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
