  ('d1e054d7-8ed0-59a9-a8fd-ab2d55eaffff'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'LISTENING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'd1e054d7-8ed0-59a9-a8fd-ab2d55eaffff'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'WFD', NULL, '2c5c8dd9-102f-5ff2-bcd0-32fb9daee695'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'We are now living in a more and more diverse society.', NULL, NULL),
  ('d1e99033-df27-535a-ae81-08cb8a367a58'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DROPDOWN', E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DROPDOWN', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'd1e99033-df27-535a-ae81-08cb8a367a58'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Strengthening Worker Power', E'Yet, our research shows that there is another important {{1}} for strengthening worker power: making it easier for them to find new, better-paying jobs. Policymakers have the tools to empower workers to find new jobs even when market conditions aren’t {{2}} in their favor. Here are some measures the government could consider. Antitrust laws and enforcement have traditionally focused on increasing competition for products or services such as oil, health care or telecommunications. But it’s important that our labor markets are sufficiently competitive, too. In a competitive labor market, employers must compete with one another for workers through pay, benefits or working conditions. Research shows that when jobs are {{3}} among a small number of employers, workers are more likely to earn lower wages. Policymakers could start by more closely {{4}} corporate mergers for signs they could decrease competition for workers. Regulators should keep a close eye on combined companies that compete for the same workers in a specific labor market.', NULL, NULL, NULL, E'1.avenue, 2.tilted, 3.concentrated, 4.scrutinizing', NULL, NULL),
  ('d1f5267a-bc53-5cda-976f-bea2525dcc88'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'READ_ALOUD', E'READ_ALOUD', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'd1f5267a-bc53-5cda-976f-bea2525dcc88'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Letter Writing', E'While far fewer people these days write letters and therefore have less use for stamps, there are still a few categories of stamp which attract collectors. Stamps in common use for an indefinite period - until the price goes up - are called "definitive" issues, while a more collectible type of stamp is the "commemorative" issue, honoring people, events and anniversaries.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('d1f6c560-c34d-5dcd-ad27-c8095440acb5'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DRAG_AND_DROP', E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DRAG_AND_DROP', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'd1f6c560-c34d-5dcd-ad27-c8095440acb5'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Academic Argument', E'An academic argument {{1}} a claim and supports that claim with evidence. The goal of an argument is to convince readers that the writer’s position is reasonable, {{2}} , and worthy of consideration. Therefore, an argumentative thesis statement needs to be not only clear and focused, but also {{3}} , assertive, and reasoned. Additionally, an argumentative thesis must be able to be supported with evidence.', NULL, NULL, NULL, E'1.asserts, 2.valid, 3.debatable', NULL, NULL),
  ('d1f6ea0c-793c-5833-b8a0-ec7657b8b47e'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'ANSWER_SHORT_QUESTION', E'ANSWER_SHORT_QUESTION', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'd1f6ea0c-793c-5833-b8a0-ec7657b8b47e'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'ASQ', E'We call a person used to using the right hand a right-hander, and what do we call a person if the left hand?', '2bf6ab5a-1b5b-5f60-b732-364f4100b62b'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'Left-hander', NULL, NULL),
  ('d1f71b00-b879-5e35-b5e7-92121055e3cd'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DRAG_AND_DROP', E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DRAG_AND_DROP', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'd1f71b00-b879-5e35-b5e7-92121055e3cd'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Brands', E'A brand consists of all the features that {{1}} the goods and services of one seller from another: name, term, design, style, symbols, customer touch points, etc. Together, all {{2}} of the brand work as a psychological trigger or {{3}} that causes an association to all other thoughts one has had about this brand.', NULL, NULL, NULL, E'1.distinguish, 2.elements, 3.stimulus', NULL, NULL),
  ('d1fcb2a7-e6d6-57ee-a925-22a7fde24e0a'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'ANSWER_SHORT_QUESTION', E'ANSWER_SHORT_QUESTION', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'd1fcb2a7-e6d6-57ee-a925-22a7fde24e0a'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'ASQ', E'Which country was divided into East and West during the Cold War?', 'a342d0ef-ca86-5d2d-b859-bc40ed6f3428'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'Germany', NULL, NULL),
  ('d1fe7beb-c491-5f66-abf9-b2e7b662c55e'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'SUMMARIZE_WRITTEN_TEXT', E'SUMMARIZE_WRITTEN_TEXT', E'WRITING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'd1fe7beb-c491-5f66-abf9-b2e7b662c55e'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Kinesiology', E'Kinesiology is a scientific field that studies the movement of the human body and its impact on health and overall well-being. Studying the science of body mechanics can serve as the foundation for a wide array of careers in sports, medicine and more. Kinesiology studies the mechanics of the human body in much the same way that auto mechanics study the different parts of vehicles. Just as a flat tire or a blown fuse can affect the entire functioning of a car, things like poor joint mobility or muscle endurance can have an effect on a person’s overall mental and physical health.\nBy understanding the intricate functioning of the body, kinesiology provides the ‘big picture’ of how different body functions work together to produce a range of movement. As a field of study, kinesiology explores how the science of movement can impact people on physical, psychological and even sociological levels.\nMany colleges and universities offer kinesiology as a major, as its wide range of applications have made it an increasingly popular field of study. According to Niche, some of the top kinesiology degrees in the United States are offered by schools like Rice University, the University of Southern California and the University of Michigan Ann Arbor. Schools like Eastern Oregon University, American Public University System and Concordia University: Chicago now offer great options for earning an online bachelor’s degree in kinesiology.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 5, 75),
  ('d200bdd7-afa4-5602-a556-a503042c43d5'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'REPEAT_SENTENCE', E'REPEAT_SENTENCE', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'd200bdd7-afa4-5602-a556-a503042c43d5'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'RS', NULL, '7a967b80-571e-5e12-ac7b-6faf40a64a0e'::uuid, NULL, E'Usually, but not always, reviews provide an unbiased source of information.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
