  ('d87f1020-2150-5afb-a958-75c8f02a35db'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DROPDOWN', E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DROPDOWN', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'd87f1020-2150-5afb-a958-75c8f02a35db'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Geography of Scotland', E'The geography of Scotland is varied and dramatic. From its rocky high mountains to its deep valleys, rivers, lochs and diverse coastline, Scotland attracts visitors from around the world to revel in the {{1}} beauty of this beautiful country.\nScotland''s coastline {{2}} for over 11,000 km, and includes a wide range of features, from white sand beaches in the Hebrides, to deep sea lochs reaching far inland, sheltered pebble enclaves and wide open expanses of sand in Aberdeenshire. This exceptionally diverse and beautiful coastline offers something for everyone. Wherever your self-catering base, the coast will always be an {{3}} target for a day trip — whether you decide to indulge {{4}} water-sports, bird watching, whale spotting or even some ''wild swimming'', Scotland''s coast is sure to delight.\nScotland''s islands are prolific and varied, with exposed Atlantic coasts and sheltered leeward coves. Each of Scotland''s islands is home to many different species of flora and {{5}} , as well as varied rock formations and features.', NULL, NULL, NULL, E'1.majestic, 2.runs, 3.achievable, 4.in, 5.fauna', NULL, NULL),
  ('d8895562-d908-57a4-af5c-99c3bd802f11'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'ANSWER_SHORT_QUESTION', E'ANSWER_SHORT_QUESTION', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'd8895562-d908-57a4-af5c-99c3bd802f11'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'ASQ', E'What is the term for someone who works in science, conducting research and experiments?', 'd4a41335-fd3f-530a-bbcf-ed35d17c4429'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'Scientist', NULL, NULL),
  ('d88b21d1-e6a7-511b-953d-bd6ef3405845'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'ANSWER_SHORT_QUESTION', E'ANSWER_SHORT_QUESTION', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'd88b21d1-e6a7-511b-953d-bd6ef3405845'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'ASQ', E'How many days does it take for a full moon to occur?', '172fe976-7f7a-5bf6-b42e-c09483e9553e'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'Thirty', NULL, NULL),
  ('d891b4ff-2750-51df-ba24-e43d187ecb39'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'LISTENING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'd891b4ff-2750-51df-ba24-e43d187ecb39'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'WFD', NULL, '3e0d9368-ff6b-506b-8e35-408a5f8df565'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'Mixtures are defined as the compound of chemically separate parts.', NULL, NULL),
  ('d89326bc-c26c-5185-8b12-b3a35a3cba02'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'RE_TELL_LECTURE', E'RE_TELL_LECTURE', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'd89326bc-c26c-5185-8b12-b3a35a3cba02'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Jackson Pollock', NULL, '991f6009-ce7b-54b5-9fed-9a14bbdadb3d'::uuid, NULL, E'The group of artists who are considered Abstract Expressionists includes Barnett Newman with his existential zips, Willem de Kooning, famous for his travestied women, Helen Frankenthaler, who created soak-stains, and others. But perhaps the most famous, influential, and head-scratching one was Jackson Pollock. Most of his paintings are immediately recognizable. They feature tangled messes of lines of paint bouncing around in every direction on the canvas. And sure, these fields of chaos are big and impressive, but what’s so great about them? Didn’t he just drip the paint at random? Can’t anyone do that? Well, the answer to these questions is both yes and no. While Pollock implemented a technique anyone is technically capable of regardless of artistic training, only he could have made his paintings. This paradox relates to his work’s roots in the Surrealist automatic drawings of André Masson and others. These Surrealists supposedly drew directly from the unconscious to reveal truths hidden within their minds. Occasionally, instead of picturing something and then drawing it, they let their hands move automatically and would later tease out familiar figures that appeared in the scribbles.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('d8954f19-700a-5fec-859d-528705471645'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'ANSWER_SHORT_QUESTION', E'ANSWER_SHORT_QUESTION', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'd8954f19-700a-5fec-859d-528705471645'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'ASQ', E'Which kind of tool will a person without legs use if he wants to go out?', 'cad2510f-01f5-5b81-b680-a65335ce0059'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'Wheelchair', NULL, NULL),
  ('d8981d54-12a0-5feb-ac09-80c90f9323ef'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'REPEAT_SENTENCE', E'REPEAT_SENTENCE', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'd8981d54-12a0-5feb-ac09-80c90f9323ef'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'RS', NULL, '052b383b-7711-5177-900d-b18349b91f23'::uuid, NULL, E'Personally, I opt for a strategic approach by choosing judicial review.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('d898637d-9d27-555c-9fbe-0aa908cff9bc'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'LISTENING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'd898637d-9d27-555c-9fbe-0aa908cff9bc'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'WFD', NULL, '3d55ec5c-ec9d-5a3c-bc19-4ab453b4739a'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'The seeds need to be completely immersed in water.', NULL, NULL),
  ('d8af5c41-fe9d-5efc-9578-e6b85399a58d'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'READ_ALOUD', E'READ_ALOUD', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'd8af5c41-fe9d-5efc-9578-e6b85399a58d'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Examination', E'The department determines whether or not the candidate has passed the examination. In cases where an appearance for the final public oral examination would constitute a substantial financial hardship for the candidate, the director of graduate studies may recommend to the dean of the Graduate School that the examination be waived.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('d8bade4b-1e40-5157-b456-e44f23f3e96c'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'RE_ORDER_PARAGRAPHS', E'RE_ORDER_PARAGRAPHS', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'd8bade4b-1e40-5157-b456-e44f23f3e96c'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Celestial Bodies', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, E'1, 4, 2, 3', NULL, NULL),
  ('d8c23979-2d26-55a8-8de7-67eb763cd9c3'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DRAG_AND_DROP', E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DRAG_AND_DROP', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'd8c23979-2d26-55a8-8de7-67eb763cd9c3'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Electronics', E'Electronics come in all shapes and sizes -- but there''s been a limit on their flexibility. Now, researchers say they''ve created electronics that can be shaped in {{1}} any way, including bent, {{2}} and even tightly coiled. They published their results in the Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences.\nSilicon is the principal ingredient in electronics, and it''s inflexible and brittle. To {{3}} this constraint, the researchers first developed one-dimensional, single-crystal silicon electronics, which they reported in 2005. The crystals could be stretched without losing their properties. Then last summer they {{4}} that they could build tiny circuits that were connected by tiny metal bridges. The final product could be bent and placed over a curved surface.', NULL, NULL, NULL, E'1.virtually, 2.stretched, 3.overcome, 4.demonstrated', NULL, NULL),
  ('d8c491c9-258f-5b84-8e88-1db5b9b78b2e'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'LISTENING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'd8c491c9-258f-5b84-8e88-1db5b9b78b2e'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'WFD', NULL, '73fcda8e-b82c-5880-9f63-f1b24c14e41d'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'You will be tested via continuous assessment and examinations.', NULL, NULL),
  ('d8ce07d5-60ae-5aeb-8dad-65c8975cd531'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'REPEAT_SENTENCE', E'REPEAT_SENTENCE', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'd8ce07d5-60ae-5aeb-8dad-65c8975cd531'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'RS', NULL, 'cc53d728-ee4e-5d30-80f1-5c60b24d183b'::uuid, NULL, E'We are constantly looking for ways to bring industry and agriculture closer together.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('d8d5789f-7265-5cb4-95e1-6348eb6b6ad3'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'ANSWER_SHORT_QUESTION', E'ANSWER_SHORT_QUESTION', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'd8d5789f-7265-5cb4-95e1-6348eb6b6ad3'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'ASQ', E'What is the opposite of southeast?', '82a0f8ad-a4e3-5d0a-9f32-a4b592108062'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'North west', NULL, NULL),
  ('d8da30b7-aacc-5772-84ed-df9f5410419d'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DRAG_AND_DROP', E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DRAG_AND_DROP', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'd8da30b7-aacc-5772-84ed-df9f5410419d'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Coral Reefs', E'Coral reefs, the rainforests of the sea, are biodiversity hotspots critical to marine {{1}} . They provide habitat, food, and breeding grounds for countless species. Yet, they face {{2}} from overfishing, pollution, and climate change. Conservationists are {{3}} innovative methods, like coral gardening and genetic research, to protect and {{4}} these underwater worlds. Their survival is imperative for {{5}} the ocean''s health and the livelihoods that depend on it.', NULL, NULL, NULL, E'1.life, 2.threats, 3.employing, 4.restore, 5.maintaining', NULL, NULL),
  ('d8da44a0-208a-54f4-b6b4-6ce8c3a02d3e'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'ANSWER_SHORT_QUESTION', E'ANSWER_SHORT_QUESTION', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'd8da44a0-208a-54f4-b6b4-6ce8c3a02d3e'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'ASQ', E'What is the opposite of "young"?', '121a8ba3-a7a6-5375-bfd9-b09ba5d55428'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'Old', NULL, NULL),
  ('d8edddba-2e65-5ec1-b26c-b9aa1d3b353d'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DROPDOWN', E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DROPDOWN', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'd8edddba-2e65-5ec1-b26c-b9aa1d3b353d'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Love of Beauty', E'The love of beauty is an essential part of all healthy human nature. It is a moral {{1}} . The absence of it is not an assured ground of condemnation, but the {{2}} of it is an invariable sign of goodness of heart. In proportion to the degree in which it is felt will probably be the degree in which nobleness and beauty of character will be {{3}} . Natural beauty is an all-pervading presence. The universe is its temple. It unfolds into the numberless flowers of spring. It waves in the branches of trees and the green blades of grass. It {{4}} from the hues of the shell and the precious stone. And not only these minute objects but the oceans, the mountains, the clouds, the stars, the rising and the setting sun — all {{5}} with beauty.', NULL, NULL, NULL, E'1.quality, 2.presence, 3.attained, 4.gleams, 5.overflow', NULL, NULL),
  ('d8eeca4d-0b6e-56f0-9e3b-cc841c6cf3e1'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'RE_TELL_LECTURE', E'RE_TELL_LECTURE', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'd8eeca4d-0b6e-56f0-9e3b-cc841c6cf3e1'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Moral Outrage', NULL, '8845fc22-544c-5a09-8a40-a64456a08972'::uuid, NULL, E'And there are many benefits of moral outrage, but there are also many costs. So the benefits can fall into two broad categories. The first category of benefit is social benefits. So when we express outrage about some kind of wrongdoing, that teaches others that that kind of behavior is not going to be tolerated, and it can motivate other people to behave morally so that they can avoid getting shamed or punished for breaking the rules. The other kind of benefit that moral outrage brings out is personal. Moral outrage broadcasts to the rest of your social group that you are the kind of person who is not likely to break the rules. So these two benefits of expressing outrage have to be balanced against the costs of outrage.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('d8ef4f0a-7aa5-51c4-9047-4d99d5931ae0'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'REPEAT_SENTENCE', E'REPEAT_SENTENCE', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'd8ef4f0a-7aa5-51c4-9047-4d99d5931ae0'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'RS', NULL, '8e69288d-27b6-54f2-8b41-8441f51c4920'::uuid, NULL, E'New legislation on the sale of drugs will be introduced next year.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('d8f02230-717a-5699-a3b9-5c0c246e97e7'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'READ_ALOUD', E'READ_ALOUD', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'd8f02230-717a-5699-a3b9-5c0c246e97e7'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Noise', E'Prolonged exposure to loud noise alters how the brain processes speech, potentially increasing the difficulty in distinguishing speech sounds, according to neuroscientists. Exposure to intensely loud sounds leads to permanent damage of the hair cells, which act as sound receivers in the ear. Once damaged, the hair cells do not grow back, leading to noise-induced hearing loss.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
