  ('d9649120-9765-5ef3-b5bf-ba27da1c65cc'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'LISTENING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'd9649120-9765-5ef3-b5bf-ba27da1c65cc'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'WFD', NULL, 'dc63800a-99e4-571f-a139-94420dfe3aae'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'Sugar is something that has carbon, oxygen, and hydrogen in it.', NULL, NULL),
  ('d968aeb5-c04f-5724-b345-28345dddfcc6'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'ANSWER_SHORT_QUESTION', E'ANSWER_SHORT_QUESTION', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'd968aeb5-c04f-5724-b345-28345dddfcc6'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'ASQ', E'What do you call a person that can''t hear?', 'ff2ed0be-4eea-54a1-9cad-fcb1c63cc67b'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'Deaf', NULL, NULL),
  ('d969fb83-3314-530e-977b-daad56e590bd'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DROPDOWN', E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DROPDOWN', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'd969fb83-3314-530e-977b-daad56e590bd'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Tutankhamun', E'In 1922, the world witnessed one of the most significant archaeological discoveries of the 20th century - the unearthing of King Tutankhamun''s tomb in the Valley of the Kings, Egypt. This event marked a {{1}} moment in our understanding of ancient Egyptian civilization. The young pharaoh, Tutankhamun, who {{2}} during the 18th dynasty, had been somewhat obscure until British archaeologist Howard Carter''s remarkable discovery. Carter''s quest for Tutankhamun''s tomb was fueled by years of meticulous research and {{3}} . When he finally came upon the nearly intact tomb, it was a historical triumph. The tomb''s contents, {{4}} for over 3,000 years, were astonishing. They included the iconic gold mask of Tutankhamun, a {{5}} of gold artifacts, and beautifully preserved wall paintings depicting the young king''s life and journey to the afterlife. This discovery offered unprecedented insights into the art, culture, and daily life of ancient Egypt.', NULL, NULL, NULL, E'1.pivotal, 2.reigned, 3.exploration, 4.preserved, 5.plethora', NULL, NULL),
  ('d96cc55c-f41f-5c5c-8f4f-2a669146589f'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'ANSWER_SHORT_QUESTION', E'ANSWER_SHORT_QUESTION', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'd96cc55c-f41f-5c5c-8f4f-2a669146589f'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'ASQ', E'What do we call animals without a backbone?', '399b822e-959b-58a5-8e67-37a355900b31'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'Invertebrates', NULL, NULL),
  ('d971cd3d-b608-573e-8d9b-fd071507ba6d'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DROPDOWN', E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DROPDOWN', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'd971cd3d-b608-573e-8d9b-fd071507ba6d'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Good Schools', E'A big rise in state schools rated among the best institutions in the country is revealed in the latest edition of the Good Schools Guide. Middle-class parents facing financial pressures in the {{1}} are increasingly looking beyond the private sector to educate their children. The 23 year-old Good Schools Guide — a {{2}} reference book for fee-paying families set on the best private school — has increased the number of state schools in this year''s edition to 251, pushing the figure to more than a quarter of its 1 ,000 entries for the first time. {{3}} why the guide has more than doubled the number of schools it features outside the private sector in only five years, Sue Fieldman, regional editor, told the Financial Times: "The parents we speak to want more information on the state {{4}} and the best it has to offer. "', NULL, NULL, NULL, E'1.downturn, 2.popular, 3.Explaining, 4.sector', NULL, NULL),
  ('d97a6428-17c2-5c6a-ab0b-fb5fe74cfb94'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'WRITE_ESSAY', E'WRITE_ESSAY', E'WRITING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'd97a6428-17c2-5c6a-ab0b-fb5fe74cfb94'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Children Advertisement', E'Nowadays, there are many television advertisements aimed at children. Should television advertisements be controlled or not?', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 200, 300),
  ('d97d5632-da41-5c75-95ec-25758aa32041'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'READ_ALOUD', E'READ_ALOUD', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'd97d5632-da41-5c75-95ec-25758aa32041'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Ed Tech', E'Since then education technology (edtech) has repeated the cycle of hype and flop, even as computers have reshaped almost every other part of life. One reason is the conservatism of teachers and their unions. But another is that the brain-stretching potential of edtech has remained unproven.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('d9897ad2-a42e-52d2-89a8-c1ba7179c8dc'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'SUMMARIZE_WRITTEN_TEXT', E'SUMMARIZE_WRITTEN_TEXT', E'WRITING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'd9897ad2-a42e-52d2-89a8-c1ba7179c8dc'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Writing System', E'The origins of writing are largely unclear. Writing systems were created independently all over the world. The earliest we know of were developed in the Middle East around 5,000 years ago. But other scripts were invented in India, Egypt, China and Central America. It has been suggested that some of these systems may have influenced others, but this has not been proved. These forms of writing look completely different, follow different rules and are often read in completely different ways. But they all perform the same basic function. They are all a visual means of recording language. Knowledge of some early scripts invented in certain regions was picked up by peoples living in surrounding areas. They would then adopt and adapt them to their own needs and language. Chinese, for example, was adopted in Japan and Korea, though it had to be altered to apply to the languages spoken there. Methods of recording information have varied over time and place. Not all sophisticated societies have developed writing systems and not all methods of recording information require writing. The Inca empire of South America was at its height in the sixteenth century AD and held power over a huge area that stretched from modern Equador and Peru, to areas of Bolivia and Chile. It was a complex civilisation, but did not develop a writing system.', NULL, NULL, E'While writing systems were created independently all over the world, some of these systems may have influenced others and they all perform the same basic function as being a visual means of recording language, as knowledge of some early scripts was picked up and adopted by people in surrounding areas to meet their own needs and language, although not all sophisticated societies have developed writing systems, such as the Inca empire of South America.', NULL, 5, 75),
  ('d98be352-5b74-58d7-8bc9-458a712175fc'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'REPEAT_SENTENCE', E'REPEAT_SENTENCE', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'd98be352-5b74-58d7-8bc9-458a712175fc'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'RS', NULL, '3820062a-48e5-5eea-86bc-9b70fdc0a7fc'::uuid, NULL, E'Your assignment next week will closely resemble last week''s task.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('d9911b02-1521-5f11-bb21-fb2765a50a5e'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'READ_ALOUD', E'READ_ALOUD', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'd9911b02-1521-5f11-bb21-fb2765a50a5e'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Films', E'Films can be compelling when used well. They have the power to change people’s perspectives and outlook on life. When we consider it in education, it has become one of the ideal teaching methods for various reasons. It helps to motivate learners to be more productive and look on a positive side of life.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('d991a07b-5421-541f-8c30-d5ed1399f44d'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'READ_ALOUD', E'READ_ALOUD', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'd991a07b-5421-541f-8c30-d5ed1399f44d'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Stratosphere', E'The stratosphere is the next layer up from Earth’s surface. Temperatures in the stratosphere increase with altitude. A high concentration of ozone, a molecule composed of three atoms of oxygen, makes up the ozone layer of the stratosphere. This ozone absorbs some of the incoming solar radiation, shielding life on Earth from potentially harmful ultraviolet light.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('d99449cd-d75d-55b5-a915-1521ea0aa9b2'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'READ_ALOUD', E'READ_ALOUD', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'd99449cd-d75d-55b5-a915-1521ea0aa9b2'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Studying Abroad', E'Studying abroad is a very popular option for students who come from a wealthy family. Most people believe that overseas experience provides a deeper understanding of cultures and develops communication skills. While this may be true, not all of these new experiences are useful for finding a job. Employers tend to value interpersonal skills and industry knowledge more than cultural background.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('d9951358-5565-513d-b2f8-1a0c8103d7c5'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'RESPOND_TO_A_SITUATION', E'RESPOND_TO_A_SITUATION', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'd9951358-5565-513d-b2f8-1a0c8103d7c5'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Sports Club', E'Your friend invited you to join a sports club. You are interested in the sports but you cannot join because of your family and your job, and because you need to travel. What do you say to your friend?', '3bdf247b-b6d2-520d-a332-3f95a7e1a24e'::uuid, NULL, E'Hey friend, I want to talk to you about something.\nWe seem to have a little issue with joining the sports club you recommended.\nIt''s like I’m interested in the sports there, but I can’t sign up due to my family matters, work duties and frequent trips.\nAnd I''d like to know what you think.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('d99a8e5a-3dd7-59f9-9396-ece82ba0dba9'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DRAG_AND_DROP', E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DRAG_AND_DROP', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'd99a8e5a-3dd7-59f9-9396-ece82ba0dba9'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Light Exposure', E'Multiple factors can {{1}} to different mental health conditions, but in the largest study of its kind, researchers suggest limited light exposure during the day or high levels of exposure at night may be {{2}} . Limited light exposure during the day or being exposed to high levels of light at night may be {{3}} with certain mental health conditions.', NULL, NULL, NULL, E'1.contribute, 2.involved, 3.linked', NULL, NULL),
  ('d9a6ec4b-e4ee-5c3b-8a73-7caaadc37e9a'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'RE_TELL_LECTURE', E'RE_TELL_LECTURE', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'd9a6ec4b-e4ee-5c3b-8a73-7caaadc37e9a'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Renewable Energy', NULL, '12ae0802-3d06-519a-adcb-cdcd336febc1'::uuid, NULL, E'In this lecture, I am thrilled to discuss the evolution of renewable energy and its critical role in shaping a sustainable future. Our journey towards renewable energy sources marks a significant shift in how we approach environmental sustainability and energy consumption. Renewable energy, derived from natural processes that are constantly replenished, includes solar, wind, hydroelectric, and geothermal power. Unlike fossil fuels, these energy sources emit little to no greenhouse gases, making them crucial in combating climate change. For example, solar panels convert sunlight into electricity without pollution, offering a clean alternative to traditional energy sources. The shift to renewable energy is not just an environmental imperative but also an economic opportunity. The renewable energy sector is rapidly growing, creating jobs, and driving technological innovation. It''s a pathway to a more sustainable economy and energy independence. The evolution of renewable energy represents a pivotal moment in our history. It''s about transitioning to cleaner, more sustainable ways of living and securing a healthier planet for future generations.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('d9aba30e-ace9-5ea8-944c-97df0c52d4ea'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'LISTENING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'd9aba30e-ace9-5ea8-944c-97df0c52d4ea'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'WFD', NULL, '6773631c-3665-51ca-abee-7c1ed076dcbf'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'Democracy has continuously ensured more stable resources from the government.', NULL, NULL),
  ('d9b29349-2605-56b2-bd8a-06d6b0bec334'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'REPEAT_SENTENCE', E'REPEAT_SENTENCE', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'd9b29349-2605-56b2-bd8a-06d6b0bec334'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'RS', NULL, '50ebf279-f9f0-53e9-b319-72a3de4f5948'::uuid, NULL, E'There are no scheduled classes during the final exam weeks.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('d9b7f860-11f9-568a-9dce-28bb0a5bb177'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'ANSWER_SHORT_QUESTION', E'ANSWER_SHORT_QUESTION', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'd9b7f860-11f9-568a-9dce-28bb0a5bb177'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'ASQ', E'What is the term for a person who designs, builds, or maintains engines, machines, or public works?', 'c68c1f0a-885a-5739-b3d6-49b6f4ad0c56'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'Engineer', NULL, NULL),
  ('d9bcf9e3-1a02-5c24-a8cc-d6607db57082'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'ANSWER_SHORT_QUESTION', E'ANSWER_SHORT_QUESTION', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'd9bcf9e3-1a02-5c24-a8cc-d6607db57082'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'ASQ', E'Who is trained to treat people who are ill in a hospital?', '5b95c87a-7237-5f25-801d-5801d56e37c1'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'Doctor / physician', NULL, NULL),
  ('d9bdd4cb-075e-5d20-b46f-e9463cd0d9da'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'RE_ORDER_PARAGRAPHS', E'RE_ORDER_PARAGRAPHS', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'd9bdd4cb-075e-5d20-b46f-e9463cd0d9da'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Livestock', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, E'3, 4, 1, 2', NULL, NULL),
  ('d9c299f9-7197-5fa5-9133-2baa9ee9ffb9'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'MC_LISTENING_MULTIPLE', E'MC_LISTENING_MULTIPLE', E'LISTENING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'd9c299f9-7197-5fa5-9133-2baa9ee9ffb9'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Biology', E'Class biology is considered one of the natural sciences. It is the science of life and life''s processes. And like life science is better understood by observing it then by trying to create a precise definition. Over the next fifteen weeks, we will be observing the science of biology. In many ways, biology is the most demanding of all sciences. This is partly because living systems are so complex. Biology is also a multi disciplinary science. It requires knowledge of chemistry, physics, and mathematics. And of all the sciences, biology is the most linked to the social sciences and humanities. The word science comes from a latin verb, meaning to know science is a way of knowing. It emerges from our curiosity about ourselves and our world. Striving to understand is one of our basic drives who are scientists. Scientists are people who ask questions about nature and who believe that these questions can be answered. Scientists are explorers who are passionate about discovery. This course has something for all of you to discover. If you''re a biology major or a premedical student, you''ll discover ways to become a better scientist. If you''re a physical science or engineering major, you''ll discover in biology many applications for what you''ve learned in your other science courses.\n\nAccording to the professor, why is biology the most demanding of all sciences?', '2c11d269-563d-50ef-b981-7505977dc996'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'Biology studies complex living systems.\nBiology requires knowledge of other sciences.', NULL, NULL),
  ('d9c698cc-fa71-5cb5-84d0-0f628de64201'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DROPDOWN', E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DROPDOWN', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'd9c698cc-fa71-5cb5-84d0-0f628de64201'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Origin of Species', E'In The Origin of Species, Darwin provided abundant evidence that life on Earth has evolved over time, and he proposed natural selection as the primary mechanism for that change. He observed that individuals {{5}} in their inherited traits and that selection acts on such differences, leading to {{3}} change. Although Darwin realized that variation in heritable traits is a prerequisite for {{4}} , he did not know precisely how organisms pass heritable traits to their offspring. Just {{6}} years after Darwin published The Origin of Species, Gregor Mendel wrote a groundbreaking paper on inheritance in pea plants. {{1}} that paper, Mendel proposed a model of inheritance in which organisms transmit discrete heritable units (now called genes) to their offspring. {{7}} Darwin did not know about genes, Mendel’s paper set the stage {{2}} understanding the genetic differences on which evolution is based.', NULL, NULL, NULL, E'1.differ, 2.evolutionary, 3.evolution, 4.a few, 5.In, 6.Although, 7.for', NULL, NULL),
  ('d9ce3a8d-a0a2-5863-8da3-866010045de7'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DROPDOWN', E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DROPDOWN', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'd9ce3a8d-a0a2-5863-8da3-866010045de7'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Prostate Cancer', E'Men who want to reduce their risk of prostate cancer may benefit {{1}} doing more aerobic exercise, according to a new study. Researchers found that improving cardiorespiratory fitness by 3% over a year was linked to a 35% lower chance of {{2}} the disease. Cardiorespiratory fitness is the ability of the heart and lungs to supply oxygen to the muscles during physical activity. Activities that {{3}} this fitness level include jogging, cycling, swimming, hiking, and dancing. The study’s co-author, Dr Kate Bolam, said that such activities should challenge the cardiovascular system and {{4}} both the lower and upper body. Prostate cancer is the most common cancer in men, affecting about one in eight men in the UK. The study, published in the British Journal of Sports Medicine, adds to the evidence that physical activity may play a role in preventing or delaying the disease. However, experts {{5}} that more research is needed to confirm the causal link and the optimal type and amount of exercise.', NULL, NULL, NULL, E'1.from, 2.developing, 3.boost, 4.involve, 5.cautioned', NULL, NULL),
  ('d9dc211d-8fac-51a4-9fc4-bd4df182fcb3'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'WRITE_ESSAY', E'WRITE_ESSAY', E'WRITING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'd9dc211d-8fac-51a4-9fc4-bd4df182fcb3'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'National Happiness Index', E'"National happiness index" has better performance than economic increase in a nation’s development. Do you agree and how to measure "national happiness"?', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 200, 300),
  ('d9dd54d4-b64e-52fe-8dc8-b36f7a5419df'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'LISTENING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'd9dd54d4-b64e-52fe-8dc8-b36f7a5419df'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'WFD', NULL, '3d933243-8779-5d05-bff0-e8499d22ec81'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'The lecture will take place in the main hall.', NULL, NULL),
  ('d9e5d40b-22ad-506f-afea-555e42ba6b02'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'READ_ALOUD', E'READ_ALOUD', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'd9e5d40b-22ad-506f-afea-555e42ba6b02'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Garden', E'The lush green of the grass contrasts with the bright colors of the flowers. The scent of lavender and rosemary mingle in the air, as the gentle rustle of branches in the wind create a soothing atmosphere. This is my garden, my sanctuary, where I can escape from the stresses of daily life and connect with nature.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('d9eb365d-9e3c-56eb-a215-bc97afa20a7d'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'REPEAT_SENTENCE', E'REPEAT_SENTENCE', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'd9eb365d-9e3c-56eb-a215-bc97afa20a7d'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'RS', NULL, '9fb426cc-ffc0-517f-abdd-8b490acf28dd'::uuid, NULL, E'The professor will talk about the summary in the lecture.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('da019755-900d-5203-97a8-2349b7291248'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DROPDOWN', E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DROPDOWN', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'da019755-900d-5203-97a8-2349b7291248'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Population', E'Population composition is changing at every level of society. Births increase in one nation and decrease in another. Some families {{1}} childbirth while others start bringing children into their folds early. Population changes can be due to random external {{2}} ,like an epidemic, or shifts in other social institutions, as described above. But regardless of why and how it happens, population trends have a {{3}} interrelated impact on all other aspects of society. For example, because we are experiencing an increase in our {{4}} population as baby boomers begin to retire, this will in turn change the way many of our social institutions are organized. For instance, there is an increased demand for housing in warmer climates, a massive shift in the need for elder care and assisted living facilities, and growing awareness of elder abuse. There is concern about labor {{5}} as boomers retire, not to mention the knowledge gap as the most senior and accomplished leaders in different sectors start to leave. Further, as this large generation leaves the workforce, the loss of tax income and pressure on pension and retirement plans means that the financial stability of the country is threatened.', NULL, NULL, NULL, E'1.delay, 2.forces, 3.tremendous, 4.senior, 5.shortages', NULL, NULL),
  ('da03753f-932f-5234-90f6-22120c2b53e4'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'REPEAT_SENTENCE', E'REPEAT_SENTENCE', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'da03753f-932f-5234-90f6-22120c2b53e4'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'RS', NULL, '029b065f-58df-50a5-b966-9073f3145d00'::uuid, NULL, E'Course office will post exam scores during the following week.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('da0b0537-43b3-53fe-9650-c4bd322cf96a'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'WRITE_ESSAY', E'WRITE_ESSAY', E'WRITING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'da0b0537-43b3-53fe-9650-c4bd322cf96a'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Travel for Education', E'Some believe the value of travel is highly overrated. ''One brilliant scholar never leaves the home bases.'' To what extent do you agree that travel is not a necessary component of a quality education?', NULL, NULL, E'Traveling is often considered a luxury, but it can be much more than that. While some believe that the value of travel is overrated and unnecessary for education, I strongly believe that traveling is a necessary and enriching part of education. In this essay, I will explain why traveling is important for personal growth, cultural understanding, and academic success.\nTraveling is an essential part of personal growth. When we travel, we step out of our comfort zones and challenge ourselves to adapt to new environments. This helps us to develop independence, self-confidence, and problem-solving skills. For instance, when I traveled to a foreign country alone for the first time, I had to navigate unfamiliar streets, communicate with locals who spoke a different language, and find my way around without relying on anyone else. This experience not only taught me how to be more self-sufficient but also gave me a sense of accomplishment.\nTraveling is also important for cultural understanding. When we travel to different parts of the world, we are exposed to diverse cultures and ways of life. This exposure helps us to become more open-minded and empathetic towards others. For example, when I traveled to a rural village in Africa, I learned about the challenges that people face in their daily lives and gained a deeper appreciation for the resources and opportunities that I have in my own life. This experience allowed me to see the world from a different perspective and become more culturally aware.\nIn conclusion, traveling is an essential part of education that should not be overlooked. It provides opportunities for personal growth, cultural understanding, and academic success.', NULL, 200, 300),
  ('da0b730a-ab7c-54e5-84bf-4c9099a588ae'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'RE_ORDER_PARAGRAPHS', E'RE_ORDER_PARAGRAPHS', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'da0b730a-ab7c-54e5-84bf-4c9099a588ae'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'IQ', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, E'2, 4, 3, 1', NULL, NULL),
  ('da0ed325-a43b-53d6-8e8b-7d5e8553cce1'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'READ_ALOUD', E'READ_ALOUD', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'da0ed325-a43b-53d6-8e8b-7d5e8553cce1'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Amusement Ride', E'"Thompson recognized and exploited all the ingredients of a successful amusement ride," writes Judith A. Adams in The American amusement Park Industry. "His coasters combined an appearance of danger with actual safety, thrilled riders with exhilarating speed, and allowed the public to intimately experience the Industrial Revolution''s new technologies of gears, steel, and dazzling electric lights."', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('da170ad4-5921-5db3-a11a-d33c57f50668'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'LISTENING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'da170ad4-5921-5db3-a11a-d33c57f50668'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'WFD', NULL, '30e551f5-7ef3-5b55-9cab-ddf2d0aad108'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'Every four years, people vote for a new president.', NULL, NULL),
  ('da19bcd2-1a31-5d55-8096-90fd7a55e503'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DROPDOWN', E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DROPDOWN', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'da19bcd2-1a31-5d55-8096-90fd7a55e503'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Foreign Students English', E'Federal Education Minister Julie Bishop says she has seen no evidence that international students are graduating from Australian universities with poor English skills. Research by Monash University academic Bob Birrell has found a third of international students are graduating {{1}} a competent level of English. But Ms. Bishop says Australian universities only enroll international students once they have achieved international standards of language {{2}} ."This has been an extraordinary attack by Professor Birrell on our universities,’’ she said. "International students must meet international {{3}} in the English language in order to get a place at a university in Australia, and they can''t get into university {{4}} reaching that international standard." University of Canberra vice-chancellor Roger Dean also says international students are required to sit an English test before being admitted to nearly all Australian universities. "There are, of course, intercultural difficulties as well as language difficulties," he said. "There are, of course, also many Australian students who don''t speak such {{5}} good English either." "So we''re trying to push the standard even higher than present, but it''s a very useful one already." Ms. Bishop says Australia''s university system has high standards. "I''ve seen no evidence to suggest that students are not able to complete their courses because they''re failing in English yet they''re being passed by the universities," she said. "I''ve not seen any {{6}} to back that up." "International education is one of our largest exports, it''s our fourth largest export, and it''s in the interest of our universities to maintain very high standards because their {{7}} is at stake."', NULL, NULL, NULL, E'1.without, 2.proficiency, 3.benchmarks, 4.without, 5.fantastically, 6.evidence, 7.recognition', NULL, NULL),
  ('da2035b2-f5e4-5874-a6cd-69e8749b447c'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'LISTENING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'da2035b2-f5e4-5874-a6cd-69e8749b447c'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'WFD', NULL, 'e51425f2-84a4-5d31-a771-34ee44d993e4'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'History courses can improve our ability to think critically.', NULL, NULL),
