  ('db073f64-fdc5-535a-b76d-5d751a512d5f'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'ANSWER_SHORT_QUESTION', E'ANSWER_SHORT_QUESTION', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'db073f64-fdc5-535a-b76d-5d751a512d5f'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'ASQ', E'What do we call a material that helps to insulate fire?', '47f677a0-cc99-5fcb-9e8a-a722b24f96b0'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'Fireproof material', NULL, NULL),
  ('db086d02-d6e0-5388-b072-b2fd3b7a78d7'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'WRITE_ESSAY', E'WRITE_ESSAY', E'WRITING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'db086d02-d6e0-5388-b072-b2fd3b7a78d7'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Getting Married', E'It is argued that getting married before finishing studying or getting established in a good job is foolish. To what extent do you agree or disagree?', NULL, NULL, E'In the modern era, the question of whether one should get married before completing their education or achieving stability in their career has sparked debates and garnered considerable attention. While some contend that such a decision is unwise, I firmly believe that marrying early, even before finishing studies or establishing a secure job, can lead to fulfilling and enriching life experiences.\nFirstly, the idea that education and career should precede marriage overlooks the potential benefits of companionship and shared growth. Early marriage allows couples to support and motivate each other as they pursue their individual aspirations. For example, partners can provide emotional encouragement during educational challenges or job transitions, ultimately enhancing their personal development.\nSecondly, marrying for love and companionship rather than financial stability or academic achievement can lead to stronger and more resilient relationships. Couples who grow together from a young age tend to build deeper emotional connections, forming a solid foundation for their future lives together. Such emotional bonds often transcend the challenges posed by financial hardships or academic pressures.\nIn conclusion, I firmly disagree with the notion that getting married before completing education or establishing a career is foolish. Early marriage can foster mutual support, personal growth, and stronger emotional connections. By choosing love and companionship over strict adherence to societal timelines, individuals can embark on a journey of shared experiences that enrich their lives in profound ways. Rather than dismissing the possibility of early marriage, we should recognize its potential for creating meaningful and lasting relationships.', NULL, 200, 300),
  ('db0a73b7-aaeb-555d-8a52-fbbf4d25a309'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'REPEAT_SENTENCE', E'REPEAT_SENTENCE', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'db0a73b7-aaeb-555d-8a52-fbbf4d25a309'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'RS', NULL, '1ded5a3f-fe8c-5345-9490-92eb3d305c4d'::uuid, NULL, E'The hypothesis needs to be tested in a more rigorous way.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('db0c46f9-ac78-5149-a492-28a30dfd761e'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'READ_ALOUD', E'READ_ALOUD', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'db0c46f9-ac78-5149-a492-28a30dfd761e'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Effects of Alcohol', E'The evidence for the harmful effects of alcohol on brain health is compelling, but now experts have pinpointed three key time periods in life when the effects of alcohol are likely to be at their greatest.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('db0e43e9-ec97-577c-99a1-bc45ccef1fce'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'RE_ORDER_PARAGRAPHS', E'RE_ORDER_PARAGRAPHS', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'db0e43e9-ec97-577c-99a1-bc45ccef1fce'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Physical Activity', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, E'4, 2, 1, 3', NULL, NULL),
  ('db0f0714-42a2-53aa-b1a0-48498c463c6e'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DROPDOWN', E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DROPDOWN', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'db0f0714-42a2-53aa-b1a0-48498c463c6e'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Counterfeit Wines', E'Here are two {{1}} unrelated facts. One: from the late 1940s through 1963, we tested atomic bombs in the atmosphere. Two: wine lovers are sometimes duped into {{2}} exorbitant amounts for fake vintage bottles that weren''t from the year they were supposedly grown.\nBut Graham Jones at Australia''s University of Adelaide thought he could use bomb information against counterfeit wines. Carbon dating works by comparing the amount of carbon 14, which is a less common and less stable form of carbon, to the more abundant carbon 12.\nFor {{3}} of years, the ratio between the two has been the same. But those two decades of atomic bomb tests increased the C-14 in the atmosphere. And as growing grapes absorb carbon dioxide, they take in trace amounts of the heavier carbon isotope—which eventually show up in the wine.\nThe {{4}} team checked C-14 levels in 20 Australian red wines with vintages from 1958 to 1997. They compared the wine''s C-14 to C-14 in {{5}} samples from the same years, and found a direct match—C-14 levels could give away the vintage year for each wine.\nSo beware of wine scammers. Because even at the atomic level, in vino veritas.', NULL, NULL, NULL, E'1.seemingly, 2.spending, 3.thousands, 4.research, 5.atmospheric', NULL, NULL),
  ('db15a713-4d82-5ff0-a041-1f0061355d02'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'REPEAT_SENTENCE', E'REPEAT_SENTENCE', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'db15a713-4d82-5ff0-a041-1f0061355d02'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'RS', NULL, '4ce9d9f6-ba8e-56c7-ae9f-6cd366d9803d'::uuid, NULL, E'I won''t be able to attend the lecture because I have a doctor appointment.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('db1dcd6d-6f03-5443-80a4-9a89d06abb4b'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'ANSWER_SHORT_QUESTION', E'ANSWER_SHORT_QUESTION', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'db1dcd6d-6f03-5443-80a4-9a89d06abb4b'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'ASQ', E'What do we call the study of living things?', 'ac10ead2-22aa-52cf-966c-4822894b85f7'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'Biology', NULL, NULL),
  ('db21dcae-1dfd-5826-bf34-19f36bb66c5e'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'RE_ORDER_PARAGRAPHS', E'RE_ORDER_PARAGRAPHS', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'db21dcae-1dfd-5826-bf34-19f36bb66c5e'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Protein(蛋白质)', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, E'1, 2, 4, 3', NULL, NULL),
  ('db24c228-eb65-594e-a43c-2c0c2c24b375'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'LISTENING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'db24c228-eb65-594e-a43c-2c0c2c24b375'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'WFD', NULL, '0756dde9-772e-5913-af2e-9028825597a9'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'Solar energy''s untapped potential for use holds incredibly vast possibilities.', NULL, NULL),
  ('db2818b1-8245-5708-b952-1ebaa759e244'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'RE_TELL_LECTURE', E'RE_TELL_LECTURE', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'db2818b1-8245-5708-b952-1ebaa759e244'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Cloud Formation', NULL, '75b57e16-54aa-51f4-ace0-9ff1a08d2423'::uuid, NULL, E'Absolutely. There''s a lot of interest in what forms those clouds. Why are those clouds there, why do they stick around? At the center of every cloud drop is a particle. You can''t grow a cloud drop without having a particle there for the water to condense on. The key questions that people have not directly addressed until very recently is what actually forms those clouds. And so the ones that you''re looking at over the ocean, it turns out sea salt is a very effective nucleator for forming clouds, so there''s a really good chance that those are loaded with sea salt. But as you go inland you start to have pollution come from all different kinds of sources, and so different sources form clouds more effectively than others. And we''re trying to unravel which sources are actually contributing to the clouds. The clouds are incredibly important players in climate change in that they reflect the light back to space, and so they''re keeping things much, much cooler than they would be if they weren''t there. They also play a huge role in regional weather. So we''re actually starting to see shifts where having more pollution input into the clouds is affecting weather patterns, and in particular it''s actually reducing the amount of precipitation, so we''re starting to see drought in areas with super high levels of air pollution.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('db2adb91-f0cd-51c5-b079-a7d0d38f28cc'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'LISTENING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'db2adb91-f0cd-51c5-b079-a7d0d38f28cc'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'WFD', NULL, 'c46479e7-575b-5b8c-a020-ca019ef30b01'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'State governments should provide additional support for health and welfare.', NULL, NULL),
  ('db3164dc-8df2-5779-b466-3d33cafced73'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'ANSWER_SHORT_QUESTION', E'ANSWER_SHORT_QUESTION', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'db3164dc-8df2-5779-b466-3d33cafced73'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'ASQ', E'How often is a centennial celebrated?', '81eb3bf5-711e-5f5b-b76e-65bd6a187efb'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'One hundred years', NULL, NULL),
  ('db357ec9-2643-5fcf-9286-af73a57e35ff'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'LISTENING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'db357ec9-2643-5fcf-9286-af73a57e35ff'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'WFD', NULL, '629f7630-582b-558a-ae32-9362c1341d31'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'There are more jobs in services than manufacturing.', NULL, NULL),
  ('db36bb2f-84ac-5b4b-8ff0-6651aaaa0f0a'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'SUMMARIZE_WRITTEN_TEXT', E'SUMMARIZE_WRITTEN_TEXT', E'WRITING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'db36bb2f-84ac-5b4b-8ff0-6651aaaa0f0a'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Telemedicine in Rural India', E'In the heart of rural India, a technological revolution is unfolding, one that promises to reshape the landscape of healthcare delivery. Telemedicine has emerged as a beacon of hope in areas traditionally plagued by healthcare access challenges. Historically, India''s rural populations have grappled with limited access to healthcare facilities. The reasons are manifold: geographic isolation, inadequate healthcare infrastructure, and a scarcity of medical professionals. However, the advent of telemedicine is turning the tide. By leveraging the power of digital technology, medical expertise is being transported beyond urban centers, reaching the most remote villages.\nOne of the most compelling aspects of this technological marvel is its ability to provide timely medical consultations. Patients in remote areas can now connect with doctors and specialists hundreds of miles away, receiving diagnoses and medical advice without the need for extensive travel. This not only saves time but also reduces the financial burden on families who would otherwise incur significant travel expenses. Furthermore, telemedicine is playing a pivotal role in managing chronic diseases and providing preventive care. Regular virtual check-ups and monitoring have made it easier for patients to manage conditions like diabetes and hypertension, which require consistent medical attention. This is particularly important in India, where the prevalence of chronic diseases is on the rise.\nThe impact of telemedicine extends beyond patient care. It''s also a tool for empowering local healthcare workers. Through virtual training and support, these workers are upskilled, enabling them to provide better care in their communities.\nIn conclusion, telemedicine is not just a technological advancement; it''s a transformative force in rural India, bringing quality healthcare to the doorsteps of those who need it most. Its continued integration into India''s healthcare system promises to bridge the urban-rural divide, heralding a new era of health equity and accessibility.', NULL, NULL, E'Telemedicine is transforming healthcare in rural India by enabling remote medical consultations and diagnoses, significantly reducing travel time and costs for patients, managing chronic diseases more effectively, and enhancing the capabilities of local healthcare workers, thus bridging the gap between urban and rural healthcare accessibility.', NULL, 5, 75),
  ('db375838-e2f7-5775-8935-c94087ca1f22'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'MC_READING_SINGLE', E'MC_READING_SINGLE', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'db375838-e2f7-5775-8935-c94087ca1f22'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'MCS-R', E'Historically, a cornerstone of classical empiricism has been the notion that every true generalization must be confirmable by specific observations. In classical empiricism, the truth of "All balls are red," for example, is assessed by inspecting balls; any observation of a non red ball refutes unequivocally the proposed generalization. For W. V. O. Quine, however, this constitutes an overly "narrow" conception of empiricism. "All balls are red," he maintains, forms one strand within an entire web of statements (our knowledge); individual observations can be referred only to this web as a whole. As new observations are collected, he explains, they must be integrated into the web. Problems occur only if a contradiction develops between a new observation, say, "That ball is blue," and the preexisting statements. In that case, he argues, any statement or combination of statements (not merely the "offending" generalization, as in classical empiricism) can be altered to achieve the fundamental requirement, a system free of contradictions, even if, in some cases, the alteration consists of labeling the new observation a "hallucination.\n\nThe author of the passage is primarily concerned with presenting', NULL, NULL, NULL, E'an account of Quine''s counterproposal to one of the traditional assumptions of classical empiricism', NULL, NULL),
  ('db37a960-0807-593a-b879-cc6daa55150a'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'WRITE_ESSAY', E'WRITE_ESSAY', E'WRITING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'db37a960-0807-593a-b879-cc6daa55150a'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Digital Security', E'What is your opinion on the balance between privacy and security in the digital age?', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 200, 300),
  ('db3f32b6-3453-5d5b-aa57-8dca5a20018f'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'READ_ALOUD', E'READ_ALOUD', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'db3f32b6-3453-5d5b-aa57-8dca5a20018f'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Graduate Admission School', E'Since our graduate admission school is not centralized, each of the university‘s 6 schools and colleges admits students to its own programs. For information about specific program degrees, graduate applications, graduate admission requirements and procedures, graduate scholarships and the status of your application, visit the individual school websites.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
