  ('df30c180-ff66-5c79-90c3-20b38534c548'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'READ_ALOUD', E'READ_ALOUD', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'df30c180-ff66-5c79-90c3-20b38534c548'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Soft Drink', E'The main production of soft drink was started in 1830''s. Since then, from those experimental beginning, there was an evolution until in 1781 when the world''s first cola-flavored beverage was introduced. These drinks were called soft drinks, only to separate them from hard alcoholic drinks. Today, soft drink is more favorite refreshment drink than tea, coffee, juice, etc.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
