  ('e40aba94-0848-505d-a046-56385b9a8efa'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'ANSWER_SHORT_QUESTION', E'ANSWER_SHORT_QUESTION', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'e40aba94-0848-505d-a046-56385b9a8efa'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'ASQ', E'What do we call the process of choosing a person for a position especially for a political position by voting?', 'bea8eef8-e015-5f6c-ad80-a45420dfd5ed'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'Election', NULL, NULL),
  ('e40d5c3a-f20b-5585-8fbd-5be152440b3c'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'WRITE_ESSAY', E'WRITE_ESSAY', E'WRITING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'e40d5c3a-f20b-5585-8fbd-5be152440b3c'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Enjoyable Things', E'People should sometimes do things that they do not enjoy doing, such as learning a new language. Do you agree or disagree with the statement?', NULL, NULL, E'Learning a new language or doing something that you don''t enjoy can be challenging, but it can also be a rewarding experience. While some may argue that it''s not worth doing something that you don''t enjoy, I believe that there are many benefits to stepping outside of your comfort zone and trying new things.\nOne benefit of doing things that you don''t enjoy is personal growth. When you challenge yourself to learn a new skill or try something new, you are pushing yourself out of your comfort zone. This can help you to develop resilience, perseverance, and a growth mindset. Additionally, it can help you to build confidence in yourself and your abilities.\nAnother benefit of doing things that you don''t enjoy is the opportunity for new experiences. When you try something new, you open yourself up to new opportunities and possibilities. You may discover a new passion or interest that you never knew existed. Additionally, it can help you to develop a more well-rounded perspective on life and the world around you.\nIn conclusion, while it may be tempting to stick to the things that you enjoy, there are many benefits to doing things that you don''t enjoy. By stepping outside of your comfort zone and trying new things, you can experience personal growth, build confidence, and open yourself up to new opportunities. So the next time you''re faced with the opportunity to try something new, take a chance and see where it takes you.', NULL, 200, 300),
  ('e4137ef5-7000-5cd1-a315-709635e6f1db'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DRAG_AND_DROP', E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DRAG_AND_DROP', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'e4137ef5-7000-5cd1-a315-709635e6f1db'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Asteroid Observations', E'Radar and telescope observations of Psyche have revealed that the asteroid likely contains iron and trace {{1}} of nickel and other metals, all of {{2}} are abundant in the solar system. But the asteroid’s density suggests it isn’t made of solid metal. Psyche also appears to contain some rocky material and silicate, or the material {{3}} in glass and sand.', NULL, NULL, NULL, E'1.amounts, 2.which, 3.detected', NULL, NULL),
