  ('e487866e-37a2-5275-871f-3be3444358ec'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DRAG_AND_DROP', E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DRAG_AND_DROP', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'e487866e-37a2-5275-871f-3be3444358ec'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Kathryn Mewes', E'Kathryn Mewes does not meet bohemian, hippy parents in her line of work. Typically one, or both, of the parents she sees work in the City of London. "Professionals seek professionals," she says. Originally a nanny, Mewes is now a parenting consultant, advising couples privately on changing their child''s behaviour, {{1}} doing corporate seminars for working parents. Her clients find they are unprepared for the chaos and unpredictability that having a child can entail. "Parents are getting older, they have been in control their {{2}} and been successful. Suddenly a baby turns up and life turns on its head." Nicknamed the "Three-Day Nanny" {{3}} her pledge to fix behavioural problems in children under the age of 12 within three days, she is filming a new Channel 4 television series demonstrating her techniques. The {{4}} of the parenting consultant - distinct from that of a nanny - has developed, she says, as people are used to buying in expertise, such as personal trainers or, in her case, parenting advice.', NULL, NULL, NULL, E'1.as well as, 2.whole lives, 3.because of, 4.role', NULL, NULL),
  ('e493a3ce-eae2-5582-8953-6913807d13eb'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DRAG_AND_DROP', E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DRAG_AND_DROP', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'e493a3ce-eae2-5582-8953-6913807d13eb'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Investment', E'One city will start to attract the {{1}} of public or private investment. This could be due to {{2}} advantage or political decisions. This, in turn, will {{3}} further investment due to the multiplier effect and {{4}} rural-to-urban migration. The investment in this city will be at the {{5}} of other cities.', NULL, NULL, NULL, E'1.majority, 2.natural, 3.stimulate, 4.significant, 5.expense', NULL, NULL),
  ('e493ed31-8d66-5784-89f0-a0911c1d7be7'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'SELECT_MISSING_WORD', E'SELECT_MISSING_WORD', E'LISTENING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'e493ed31-8d66-5784-89f0-a0911c1d7be7'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Pyramid', E'The Pyramids in Cairo are my favourite buildings in the whole world. I knew all about them when I was very young. They have always fascinated me. They really are one of the world’s wonders. People still don’t know how they were built. I think they are probably the greatest architectural achievement ever. Even the tallest buildings today are easy to build. The Pyramids were almost impossible to build, but they did it. Two things fascinate me about The Pyramids – their beautiful shape and their mystery. I love looking at photos of The Pyramids. When I visited Egypt, their beauty blew me away. And the great thing was I also felt their mystery. The Pyramids are full of hidden secrets, history and ...\n\nAt the end of the recording the lost word or group of words has been replaced by a beep. Select the correct option to complete the recording.', 'b12834c4-b966-5730-8cf6-eb2241f4fc77'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'mysteries', NULL, NULL),
  ('e4996fdb-ac16-570a-9506-f229f956ac92'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DROPDOWN', E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DROPDOWN', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'e4996fdb-ac16-570a-9506-f229f956ac92'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Noisy Studying', E'Some students say that they need complete quiet to read and study. Others study best in a crowded, noisy room because the noise actually {{1}} them concentrate. Some students like quiet music playing; others {{2}} not. The point is, you should know the level of noise that is optimal for your own studying. However, one general rule for all students is that the television seems to be more of a distraction than music or other background noise, so {{3}} the TV off when you are reading or studying. {{4}} , don''t let yourself become distracted by computer games, email, or Internet surfing.', NULL, NULL, NULL, E'1.helps, 2.do, 3.leave, 4.Also', NULL, NULL),
  ('e4a4f703-4f19-5e8f-9ba0-1be0fcfc8ca0'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'LISTENING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'e4a4f703-4f19-5e8f-9ba0-1be0fcfc8ca0'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'WFD', NULL, 'cb8436e3-4efe-592b-b632-a11e4e46cb4a'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'Make sure you''re not late; class starts exactly on time.', NULL, NULL),
  ('e4a6df9f-e019-54cd-861e-ffaa06406953'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DRAG_AND_DROP', E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DRAG_AND_DROP', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'e4a6df9f-e019-54cd-861e-ffaa06406953'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Theme Parks Closure', E'Not all theme parks succeed when they are built. Some theme parks may start, but close in the first few days due to {{1}} business, poor management or an {{2}} to respond to market changes. Closure of theme park happens even at popular ones if visitors are {{3}} with their inconsistent service quality or unchanged aging attractions.', NULL, NULL, NULL, E'1.declining, 2.inability, 3.disappointed', NULL, NULL),
