  ('e64ac7e4-3a4d-5d5b-b8f8-268b58804ab9'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DRAG_AND_DROP', E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DRAG_AND_DROP', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'e64ac7e4-3a4d-5d5b-b8f8-268b58804ab9'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Higher Education Shift', E'After centuries of inequality in UK higher education benefiting men, there has been a {{1}} over the past three decades. A lower proportion of entrants to UK higher education institutions are male than ever before and they {{2}} up less than one-half of the total. Other developed countries have {{3}} a similar shift. Male {{4}} is not seen only in the figures for entry but also in non-continuation (drop-out) rates and degree performance statistics.', NULL, NULL, NULL, E'1.reversal, 2.make, 3.undergone, 4.underachievement', NULL, NULL),
  ('e64c125a-50e8-58e7-bb29-bb8f9bd2de34'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'REPEAT_SENTENCE', E'REPEAT_SENTENCE', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'e64c125a-50e8-58e7-bb29-bb8f9bd2de34'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'RS', NULL, '9a12eb92-3d1e-59b7-a330-9e205205d28d'::uuid, NULL, E'There is no requirement for attendance in this research course.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('e64d4535-d5f2-556e-8621-9ef256e29c01'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'RESPOND_TO_A_SITUATION', E'RESPOND_TO_A_SITUATION', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'e64d4535-d5f2-556e-8621-9ef256e29c01'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'A Communal Garden', E'You manage a communal garden, and during your latest visit, you notice several plants have been trampled, and gardening tools are scattered everywhere. You need to address the community to encourage care and shared responsibility for the garden''s upkeep. What would you say to the community members?', 'eea113d7-d161-5488-9f26-4ab955f08e25'::uuid, NULL, E'I''ve noticed our beloved garden has faced some neglect recently, with damaged plants and tools left out. Let''s work together to maintain our shared space. I propose a rotating schedule for gardening duties and a designated area for tool storage. This way, we ensure our garden thrives and remains a place of joy for everyone. Your cooperation and respect for this shared treasure are greatly appreciated. Let''s keep our garden beautiful together.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
