  ('eaa6ffa1-c5e6-5d8e-9e91-84e96572c643'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DRAG_AND_DROP', E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DRAG_AND_DROP', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'eaa6ffa1-c5e6-5d8e-9e91-84e96572c643'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Shanghai International Studies University', E'Upholding the motto of “Integrity, Vision and Academic Excellence”, Shanghai International Studies University (SISU) is an internationally recognized, {{3}} academic institution distinctive for its multidisciplinary and multicultural nature, committed to preparing innovative professionals and future global leaders for a wide range of international expertise to address the critical challenges of our times. Drawing on our strengths in multi-language programs and multi-disciplinary resources, while responding to national and regional strategies, we operate more than 70 research institutes and centers serving as academic think tanks to provide advisory services on language policies, diplomatic strategies and global public {{1}} of China. These academic entities have contributed landmark research and are also dedicated to promoting the development of social sciences in China.\nWe have now established partnerships with more than 330 {{4}} and institutions from 56 countries and regions, and have {{2}} close connection with international organizations, including the United Nations and the European Union.', NULL, NULL, NULL, E'1.prestigious, 2.opinion, 3.universities, 4.maintained', NULL, NULL),
  ('eaaec491-e8d5-52d1-a71d-cb0d5b74872f'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'LISTENING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'eaaec491-e8d5-52d1-a71d-cb0d5b74872f'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'WFD', NULL, 'c14d53bb-06ed-51fc-8593-1523cb4dba60'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'Our company is planning to recruit many new employees worldwide.', NULL, NULL),
  ('eab1deca-2fa1-525a-8398-9909fe1ff910'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DROPDOWN', E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DROPDOWN', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'eab1deca-2fa1-525a-8398-9909fe1ff910'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Moon Landing', E'A team of Indian scientists has achieved a historic {{1}} by successfully landing a spacecraft at the lunar south pole, where no one has ever gone before. The Chandrayaan-3 mission, launched in July 2023, was the first to reach the unexplored {{2}} that is believed to contain reservoirs of frozen water. The mission, which cost only $75m, showed the world that India is a major player in space exploration and that a moon lander can be constructed at a {{3}} of the cost of other countries. The lander detected sulphur on the surface of the moon and showed that lunar soil is a good insulator. The scientists, including several senior female researchers, {{4}} their achievement at the control room in India, inspiring millions of young people across the country and beyond.', NULL, NULL, NULL, E'1.feat, 2.region, 3.fraction, 4.celebrated', NULL, NULL),
  ('eab32af0-a2b9-59d2-8a24-ba2f905b59af'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'READ_ALOUD', E'READ_ALOUD', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'eab32af0-a2b9-59d2-8a24-ba2f905b59af'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Venture Capitals', E'Venture capitals and public funding authorities need to carefully consider the incentive issues of entrepreneurs when providing support. In allocating resources to potentially competing innovators, there is a trade-off between the risk of innovation failure and rent dissipation: diverse investment lowers the risk of having no successful innovation but also reduces the expected profit from the post-innovation market.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('eab38100-a981-5c57-8c7f-69e5cd339518'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'ANSWER_SHORT_QUESTION', E'ANSWER_SHORT_QUESTION', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'eab38100-a981-5c57-8c7f-69e5cd339518'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'ASQ', E'What do we call the theory that emphasizes the role of reinforcement and punishment in shaping behavior?', '4e6555f5-4f0a-57bc-9eee-68a0f7e438f0'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'Behaviorism', NULL, NULL),
  ('eab6817c-ea6d-5d4c-9993-3f205a21619c'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DROPDOWN', E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DROPDOWN', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'eab6817c-ea6d-5d4c-9993-3f205a21619c'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Marketing Information', E'To help encourage a better reception to what the organization is learning from marketing information, it may be useful to review the original problem the research is trying to solve. Remind team members that the goal of using marketing information is to gain new customer {{1}} that will help make the organization more effective. With this in mind, marketers should think about how the research results can help them better understand customers and translate this understanding into {{2}} to the marketing mix to better address customers’ needs. By {{3}} research results around a deeper or broader understanding of the customer, it can help {{4}} resistance and make people feel more informed and empowered to make a good marketing decision.', NULL, NULL, NULL, E'1.insights, 2.adjustments, 3.framing, 4.defuse', NULL, NULL),
  ('eac14a65-6835-56d5-80ac-397389f495d0'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'MC_READING_MULTIPLE', E'MC_READING_MULTIPLE', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'eac14a65-6835-56d5-80ac-397389f495d0'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Dark Soil', E'To find it, you have to go digging in rainforests, and to the untrained eye, it does not seem special at all - just a thick layer of dark earth that would not look out of place in many gardens. But these fertile, dark soils are in fact very special. Because despite the lushness of tropical rainforests, the soils beneath them are usually very poor and thin. Even more surprising is where this dark soil comes from.\n''You might expect this precious fertile resource to be found in the deep jungle, far from human settlements or farmers,'' says James Fraser, who has been hunting for it in Africa''s rainforests, ''But I go looking for dark earth round the edge of villages and ancient towns, and in traditionally farmed areas. It''s usually there. And the older and larger the settlement, the more dark earth there is.''\nSuch findings are overturning some long-held ideas. Jungle farmers are usually blamed not just for cutting down trees but also for exhausting the soils. And yet the discovery of these rich soils - first in South America and now in Africa, too - suggest that, whether by chance or design, many people living in rainforests farmed in a way that enhanced rather than destroyed soils. In fact, it is becoming clear that part of what we think of as lush pure rainforest is actually long-abandoned farmland, enriched by the waste created by ancient humans.\n\nWhat is significant about the ''dark soil'' that the writer is referring to?', NULL, NULL, NULL, E'It has resulted from agricultural activity.\nIt is being found near where humans have lived.', NULL, NULL),
  ('eac75436-1afa-59e7-b963-550d79b57b73'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'LISTENING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'eac75436-1afa-59e7-b963-550d79b57b73'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'WFD', NULL, '3ffefc0a-e832-5e77-9335-20ff83bf82a5'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'I went to the University of Bristol where I studied chemistry.', NULL, NULL),
  ('eac81217-598c-5681-8775-8005114535d2'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'ANSWER_SHORT_QUESTION', E'ANSWER_SHORT_QUESTION', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'eac81217-598c-5681-8775-8005114535d2'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'ASQ', E'What type of gas do we breathe out?', '1cdf3912-dab0-51d9-bb84-a8074b88b983'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'Carbon dioxide', NULL, NULL),
