  ('eb101bea-b990-507a-aefc-bbdfbb272f2f'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'REPEAT_SENTENCE', E'REPEAT_SENTENCE', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'eb101bea-b990-507a-aefc-bbdfbb272f2f'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'RS', NULL, 'f49ddb7e-3264-5650-867a-54c4a6d44f47'::uuid, NULL, E'The artist used an apartment as his studio.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('eb13927c-4ef2-5e20-ae2b-98a2853d9fe6'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'WRITE_ESSAY', E'WRITE_ESSAY', E'WRITING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'eb13927c-4ef2-5e20-ae2b-98a2853d9fe6'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Neighbors', E'Neighbors are the people who live near us. A good neighbor should have some specific qualities. What is your advice? List some types.', NULL, NULL, E'Neighbors are an essential part of our lives, and a good neighbor can make all the difference in creating a harmonious living environment. In this essay, I will discuss the qualities that make a good neighbor and why they are essential for a positive and peaceful community.\nOne of the essential qualities of a good neighbor is kindness and consideration for others'' well-being. A good neighbor is someone who is willing to lend a helping hand, whether it''s offering to watch a pet while someone is away or helping with yard work. These small acts of kindness can go a long way in building trust and creating a sense of community among neighbors.\nAnother crucial quality of a good neighbor is respect for personal space and privacy. A good neighbor understands the importance of boundaries and does not overstep them. They are mindful of noise levels and do not engage in loud or disruptive behavior that could disturb their neighbors. Respecting personal space and privacy creates a comfortable living environment where everyone feels safe and secure.\nIn conclusion, being a good neighbor is about being mindful of others and making an effort to create a positive living environment. Kindness, consideration for others'' well-being, respect for personal space and privacy are just a few of the qualities that make a good neighbor. By embodying these qualities, we can create a sense of community and foster positive relationships with those who live near us. Let us all strive to be good neighbors and build strong, supportive communities.', NULL, 200, 300),
  ('eb155b10-78bd-51d8-9a7f-8fdb6121a667'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'ANSWER_SHORT_QUESTION', E'ANSWER_SHORT_QUESTION', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'eb155b10-78bd-51d8-9a7f-8fdb6121a667'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'ASQ', E'What do we call the industry connected with getting valuable minerals from the ground?', 'd100be58-2c2c-5a06-96e8-3b8344b23f7e'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'Mining', NULL, NULL),
