  ('edcaf185-5463-5853-8df7-75ddcca41fd3'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DRAG_AND_DROP', E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DRAG_AND_DROP', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'edcaf185-5463-5853-8df7-75ddcca41fd3'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Haute Couture', E'To be called a "haute couture" house, a business must belong to the Syndical Chamber of Haute Couture in Paris, which is {{1}} by the French Department of Industry. Members must {{2}} 15 or more people and present their collections twice a year. Each {{3}} must include at least 35 separate outfits for day and evening wear.', NULL, NULL, NULL, E'1.regulated, 2.employ, 3.presentation', NULL, NULL),
  ('edce3d34-f498-57da-b313-66201063d549'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'REPEAT_SENTENCE', E'REPEAT_SENTENCE', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'edce3d34-f498-57da-b313-66201063d549'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'RS', NULL, '92697a10-5cf3-5f49-b79c-d8a2be51fff2'::uuid, NULL, E'Companies primarily exist to earn money and create profits for themselves.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('edcfb171-e848-5c9b-98af-de0d223dae76'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DROPDOWN', E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DROPDOWN', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'edcfb171-e848-5c9b-98af-de0d223dae76'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Penicillin', E'The initial use of penicillin was {{1}} , as it helped cure serious infections and was later used for prevention as well. Over time, drug resistance has {{2}} . However, it is not {{3}} , because many other types of medicine have since been invented to combat resistant bacteria.', NULL, NULL, NULL, E'1.groundbreaking, 2.occurred, 3.disastrous', NULL, NULL),
  ('edd16b1e-4ea6-522c-b891-79be2e8e4f53'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'RE_TELL_LECTURE', E'RE_TELL_LECTURE', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'edd16b1e-4ea6-522c-b891-79be2e8e4f53'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Skyscrapers and Environment', NULL, '64b64598-ce37-56d6-b5e4-60c48a5e59e1'::uuid, NULL, E'In the late 1960''s, many people in North America turned their attention to environmental problems, and new steel-and-glass skyscrapers were widely criticized. Ecologists pointed out that a cluster of tall buildings in a city often overburdens public transportation and parking lot capacities.\nSkyscrapers are also lavish consumers, and wasters, of electric power. In one recent year, the addition of 17 million square feet of skyscraper1 office space in New York City raised the peak daily demand for electricity by 120, 000 kilowatts-enough to supply the entire city of Albany, New York, for a day.\nGlass-walled skyscrapers can be especially wasteful. The heat loss (or gain)through a wall of half-inch plate glass is more than ten times that through a typical masonry6 wall filled with insulation board. To lessen8 the strain on heating and air-conditioning equipment, builders of skyscrapers have begun to use double-glazed panels of glass, and reflective glasses coated with silver or gold mirror films that reduce glare as well as heat gain. However, mirror-walled skyscrapers raise the temperature of the surrounding air and affect neighboring buildings.\nSkyscrapers put a severe strain on a city''s sanitation facilities, too. If fully occupied, the two World Trade Center towers in New York City would alone generate 2.25 million gallons of raw sewage each year-as much as a city the size of Stanford, Connecticut , which has a population of more than 109, 000.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('eddc11eb-089f-56e1-95a3-682bcb528980'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DROPDOWN', E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DROPDOWN', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'eddc11eb-089f-56e1-95a3-682bcb528980'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Austria', E'Since Austria sits at a high elevation and spends a quarter of the year under {{1}} , it should come as no surprise that heating is a matter of considerable importance in the {{2}} . What may be surprising, however, is that Vienna—a grand imperial city of music, art, and history—actually boasts a museum {{3}} specifically to heating systems.', NULL, NULL, NULL, E'1.snow, 2.country, 3.dedicated', NULL, NULL),
  ('eddc9c6e-75c2-5999-ab65-68ae25a11315'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'LISTENING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'eddc9c6e-75c2-5999-ab65-68ae25a11315'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'WFD', NULL, '3359e69c-f63d-5737-8e44-0d7817b3d58d'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'You should meet me in the lecture theater room.', NULL, NULL),
  ('eddd888d-a9bc-589e-b60f-0d4fc9640c71'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'READ_ALOUD', E'READ_ALOUD', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'eddd888d-a9bc-589e-b60f-0d4fc9640c71'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Medical Cannabis', E'According to a peer-reviewed study, medical cannabis led to "a statistically significant improvement" in quality of life, employment status, and in the reduction of the number of medications in those with Tourette''s Syndrome, in addition to improving comorbidities.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('eded510b-9c14-5448-8791-91e5efe4a509'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'REPEAT_SENTENCE', E'REPEAT_SENTENCE', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'eded510b-9c14-5448-8791-91e5efe4a509'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'RS', NULL, '47a11508-126a-5a84-96c7-3a8f814d3870'::uuid, NULL, E'He has a good collection of art.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('edef0496-2bd7-5d8a-8529-d6d9bf0aad02'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'SUMMARIZE_WRITTEN_TEXT', E'SUMMARIZE_WRITTEN_TEXT', E'WRITING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'edef0496-2bd7-5d8a-8529-d6d9bf0aad02'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Power of Mindfulness', E'Mindfulness, the practice of being fully present and engaged in the moment, has gained significant traction in the field of psychology as a powerful tool for enhancing mental health. Rooted in ancient meditation practices, mindfulness involves a non-judgmental awareness of one’s thoughts, feelings, bodily sensations, and surrounding environment.\nResearch in psychology and neuroscience has shown that mindfulness can have a profound impact on mental well-being. Regular mindfulness practice is associated with reductions in symptoms of anxiety and depression. It helps individuals break free from negative thought patterns, reducing the rumination and worry that often accompany these conditions.\nMindfulness also plays a crucial role in stress reduction. By fostering a calm and attentive state of mind, mindfulness practices like meditation can lower stress hormones and promote relaxation. This state of mental calmness can improve sleep quality, enhance concentration, and boost overall emotional resilience.\nIn therapy, mindfulness-based interventions, such as Mindfulness-Based Stress Reduction (MBSR) and Mindfulness-Based Cognitive Therapy (MBCT), have been effective in treating various mental health issues. These therapeutic approaches combine mindfulness techniques with elements of cognitive therapy to help individuals understand and manage their thoughts and emotions more effectively.\nFurthermore, mindfulness can improve physical health, which is closely linked to mental health. Studies have shown that it can lower blood pressure, reduce chronic pain, and improve the immune system, further contributing to mental and emotional well-being.\nIn conclusion, mindfulness offers a versatile and accessible approach to mental health, suitable for a wide range of individuals. Its benefits in reducing anxiety, depression, and stress, and enhancing overall well-being, make it an invaluable practice in the journey towards mental and emotional health.', NULL, NULL, E'Mindfulness, a practice of focused, non-judgmental awareness, significantly enhances mental health by reducing anxiety, depression, and stress, improving sleep and concentration, and is effectively integrated into therapeutic approaches, benefiting overall emotional and physical well-being.', NULL, 5, 75),
  ('edef76df-a6f9-5de3-bad1-bc44a15fb518'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'LISTENING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'edef76df-a6f9-5de3-bad1-bc44a15fb518'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'WFD', NULL, '999dcd97-ecac-542f-8dbd-92fa4d6569d5'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'The rising of the sea level indicates climate change.', NULL, NULL),
