  ('f0bbf70c-5c26-5dd0-9a05-d8f7779270bf'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'READ_ALOUD', E'READ_ALOUD', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'f0bbf70c-5c26-5dd0-9a05-d8f7779270bf'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Attendance to Theater', E'Experts discuss the significance of attending the theater as a civic occasion, associated with the political and cultural achievements of Athens. Through archeology and analyses of contemporary art forms such as decoration on pottery, a picture is built up of ancient Greek theater.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('f0bc12fb-e82a-5a5d-b101-ec8725c43d01'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'REPEAT_SENTENCE', E'REPEAT_SENTENCE', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'f0bc12fb-e82a-5a5d-b101-ec8725c43d01'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'RS', NULL, '87b24dca-d130-59f3-b0bd-9e2298d9289f'::uuid, NULL, E'It''s surprising, some people like watching TV ads because they''re fun.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('f0bf1484-659e-5c46-9d6b-9eb417ee1ce4'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'LISTENING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'f0bf1484-659e-5c46-9d6b-9eb417ee1ce4'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'WFD', NULL, '06d01a94-ef63-5c35-b4ab-6d4ef6e2d50e'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'Students are required to use research methods for this project.', NULL, NULL),
  ('f0c79815-4fe8-5071-8c8c-aa28382d4f5d'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'READ_ALOUD', E'READ_ALOUD', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'f0c79815-4fe8-5071-8c8c-aa28382d4f5d'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Recurring Dream', E'Every time I close my eyes, a recurring dream haunts me without fail. I find myself in a mysterious forest, where towering trees rustle with every whisper of the wind. I walk along an endless path, desperately searching for an exit that eludes me. Each time I wake, a sense of unease and confusion lingers.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('f0d12024-e0f5-579b-bf0c-969e10b842d3'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DROPDOWN', E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DROPDOWN', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'f0d12024-e0f5-579b-bf0c-969e10b842d3'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Growing Pains', E'The term “growing pains” is often used to refer to {{1}} or aching limbs in children. According to a 2007 review, it is the most common cause of bone or muscle pain in adolescents. Some studies estimate it affects more than one-third of kids. Yet for all this, there is no clear {{2}} of what growing pains are, or what causes them. In fact, they may not be related to growth at all. A recent analysis of studies about growing pains notes that the {{3}} majority of papers – 93 per cent – make no mention of how the symptoms of bone or muscle pain are related to growth. “Kids and teens are being told they have growing pains, but that is inaccurate based on our findings,” says Mary O’Keeffe at the Institute for Musculoskeletal Health at the University of Sydney in Australia. “If a health professional is giving a diagnosis, it needs to be based on {{4}} evidence. They need to be sure that growing is the cause, but we don’t know this,” says O’Keeffe.', NULL, NULL, NULL, E'1.sore, 2.definition, 3.vast, 4.sound', NULL, NULL),
  ('f0d2c9b0-b280-5f24-9784-84dd4a0562c9'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'REPEAT_SENTENCE', E'REPEAT_SENTENCE', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'f0d2c9b0-b280-5f24-9784-84dd4a0562c9'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'RS', NULL, '8a72aaba-358e-5813-94c2-e84b90c95385'::uuid, NULL, E'Company software has changed a lot in the last year.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('f0d5b19a-6f7d-549d-ab4c-e7fb7599757f'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'MC_READING_SINGLE', E'MC_READING_SINGLE', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'f0d5b19a-6f7d-549d-ab4c-e7fb7599757f'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'MCS-R', E'When literary periods are defined on the basis of men''s writing, women''s writing must be forcibly assimilated into an irrelevant grid: a Renaissance that is not a renaissance for women, a Romantic period in which women played very little part, a modernism with which women conflict. Simultaneously, the history of women''s writing has been suppressed, leaving large, mysterious gaps in accounts of the development of various genres. Feminist criticism is beginning to correct this situation. Margaret Anne Doody, for example, suggests that during ''the period between the death of Richardson and the appearance of the novels of Scott and Austen,'' which has ''been regarded as a dead period,'' late-eighteenth-century women writers actually developed ''the paradigm for women''s fiction of the nineteenth century—something hardly less than the paradigm of the nineteenth-century novel itself.'' Feminist critics have also pointed out that the twentieth-century writer Virginia Woolf belonged to a tradition other than modernism and that this tradition surfaces in her work precisely where criticism has hitherto found obscurities, evasions, implausibilities, and imperfections.\n\nIt can be inferred from the passage that the author views the division of literature into periods based on men''s writing as an approach that', NULL, NULL, NULL, E'obscures women''s contributions to literature', NULL, NULL),
  ('f0d63e1c-b2a8-5fc6-b908-c63512841e2e'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'WRITE_ESSAY', E'WRITE_ESSAY', E'WRITING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'f0d63e1c-b2a8-5fc6-b908-c63512841e2e'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Automobiles', E'Some people think that the automobile has improved modern life. Others think that the automobile has caused serious problems. What’s your opinion about it?', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 200, 300),
  ('f0e901e0-1671-5c57-b871-adbf89b35d8c'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'REPEAT_SENTENCE', E'REPEAT_SENTENCE', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'f0e901e0-1671-5c57-b871-adbf89b35d8c'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'RS', NULL, '91d41667-11bf-5ee9-a42f-70c09ff63bae'::uuid, NULL, E'At all times, students are expected to adhere to laboratory safety rules.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('f0ed4345-f356-54b1-a195-8792948be6cd'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DROPDOWN', E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DROPDOWN', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'f0ed4345-f356-54b1-a195-8792948be6cd'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Project Management', E'While there are many project management techniques and tools, there are considerable {{1}} in applying these methods to different projects. For example, a large, complex, multiyear construction project is very different from a 12-month ISO 9001 quality management system implementation or a three-month process improvement and machinery upgrade project. While the basic principles apply in all situations, the project management methodology must be {{2}} to fit the benefit-to-cost ratio for each situation. Managers often fail to use project planning tools and techniques appropriate to the anticipated outcomes of the project and the resources available. Aspiring project managers may utilize a wide {{3}} of project management tutorials and other resources, including college-based, association-based, and consultant-sponsored classes and courses. The Project Management Institute offers certification as a Project Management Professional (PMP) to those who pass a rigorous exam and {{4}} their proficiency by planning and managing a successful project.', NULL, NULL, NULL, E'1.differences, 2.scaled, 3.range, 4.demonstrate', NULL, NULL),
  ('f0f24c28-7ae0-5f3e-b9d6-744e309dea36'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'REPEAT_SENTENCE', E'REPEAT_SENTENCE', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'f0f24c28-7ae0-5f3e-b9d6-744e309dea36'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'RS', NULL, '0c9bc1e9-6919-58dc-938f-f34081066807'::uuid, NULL, E'Social robots can show different facial expressions and emotions.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
