  ('f2923dec-a490-5352-a715-09903106c89b'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DRAG_AND_DROP', E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DRAG_AND_DROP', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'f2923dec-a490-5352-a715-09903106c89b'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Cholera', E'Cholera is an acute diarrhoeal infection {{1}} by eating or drinking food or water. Cholera remains a global threat to public health and is an {{2}} of inequity and lack of social development. Cholera is an extremely serious disease and takes between 12 hours and 5 days for a person to show symptoms after {{3}} contaminated food or water. Cholera affects both children and adults and can kill within hours if {{4}} .', NULL, NULL, NULL, E'1.caused, 2.indicator, 3.consuming, 4.untreated', NULL, NULL),
  ('f29514cf-e8f1-59b9-8aed-652b42fbc013'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'LISTENING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'f29514cf-e8f1-59b9-8aed-652b42fbc013'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'WFD', NULL, '211c3443-5bc8-5440-9157-44523f301610'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'Our community has dedicated themselves to delivering public services for months.', NULL, NULL),
  ('f2981cdb-0c92-59de-83e4-29ce732639ae'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DROPDOWN', E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DROPDOWN', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'f2981cdb-0c92-59de-83e4-29ce732639ae'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Roman Kingdom', E'In the wake of the fall of the Roman Kingdom in 509 BC, a new era dawned with the establishment of the Roman Republic. Unlike the monarchic rule it replaced, the Republic was characterized by a complex but more democratic {{1}} . Power was vested in the hands of the Senate, a body of elected officials, and two consuls who were elected annually. This system aimed to prevent the {{2}} of power in a single individual, a lesson learned from the downfall of the monarchy. The Roman Republic''s military and political strategies played a crucial role in its expansion. By {{3}} citizenship to conquered peoples and forging strategic alliances, Rome steadily expanded its influence across the Italian peninsula. This expansion, {{4}} with the Republic''s innovative legal and political systems, laid the groundwork for what would become one of the largest empires in history. As noted in Livy''s historical accounts, the Republic''s rise was as much due to its military prowess as it was to its political and social innovations. The Roman Republic era, a crucible of political thought and military strategy, set the {{5}} for the later transformation into the Roman Empire.', NULL, NULL, NULL, E'1.framework, 2.concentration, 3.granting, 4.coupled, 5.stage', NULL, NULL),
  ('f29c6554-51fb-52b1-86d6-94f083ef5a10'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'READ_ALOUD', E'READ_ALOUD', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'f29c6554-51fb-52b1-86d6-94f083ef5a10'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Man-made Light', E'Have you ever pictured a world without light? Just think how much we rely on man-made light sources in our lives. Without engineers, we wouldn''t be able to live the way we do. No street lights, no TV, no computer display, no house lights. Engineers design and build all these things, and they also design, build and run the electricity systems that power all these light sources.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
