  ('f3fd8bcb-bd17-5b77-8f8d-0cf8e4862b95'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'READ_ALOUD', E'READ_ALOUD', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'f3fd8bcb-bd17-5b77-8f8d-0cf8e4862b95'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Flash Floods', E'Many floods take hours to come into full effect so they provide people with time to evacuate safely while salvaging as many of their valuable possessions as they can. Sometimes, however, floods generate in minutes and give little warning to their formation. These are known as flash floods, and can be extremely dangerous. Flash floods are the top one weather-related cause of death in the United States.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
