  ('f662f143-ff40-5d40-8ec8-93f860269d99'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DRAG_AND_DROP', E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DRAG_AND_DROP', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'f662f143-ff40-5d40-8ec8-93f860269d99'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'EI Nino', E'EI Nino usually lasts for about 18 months. The 1982-83 EI Nino brought the most {{1}} weather in modern history. Its effect was worldwide and it left more than 2,000 people dead and caused over eight billion pounds'' {{2}} of damage. The 1990 EI Nino will {{3}} , but they are still not {{4}} sure what leads to it or what affects how strong it will be.', NULL, NULL, NULL, E'1.destructive, 2.worth, 3.strike, 4.completely', NULL, NULL),
  ('f664e705-cf41-5f64-a307-fedc870e7b05'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DROPDOWN', E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DROPDOWN', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'f664e705-cf41-5f64-a307-fedc870e7b05'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Exams Looming', E'It''s that time again! Exams looming, essays or reports outstanding and you wonder where the years have gone already. You start {{1}} how you''re going to cope with it all. A limited amount of anxiety can help you to be more motivated and more {{3}} . It can help you to plan your work and to think more clearly and {{4}} about it. In other words, it can help you stay on top of things. Sit down at your desk and make a start on writing down all the things you have to do to {{5}} for the exams.', NULL, NULL, NULL, E'1.wondering, 2.purposeful, 3.logically, 4.prepare', NULL, NULL),
  ('f66b8917-9bab-5945-998d-ca28864d0602'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'RE_ORDER_PARAGRAPHS', E'RE_ORDER_PARAGRAPHS', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'f66b8917-9bab-5945-998d-ca28864d0602'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Unprecedented', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, E'4, 1, 3, 5, 2', NULL, NULL),
  ('f66f4f9c-a7fa-5fd1-99f0-fcb95ce63306'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DROPDOWN', E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DROPDOWN', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'f66f4f9c-a7fa-5fd1-99f0-fcb95ce63306'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Penicillin', E'Penicillin, discovered by Alexander Fleming in 1928, marked a revolution in medical science. Before {{1}} , many common infections were often fatal. Fleming, a Scottish biologist, found that a certain type of mold could kill bacteria. This led to the development of penicillin, the world''s first antibiotic. It was mass-produced in the 1940s, particularly during World War II, saving countless lives from infections that were once considered {{2}} . Penicillin''s discovery was a key moment in the history of medicine, opening the door to the development of other antibiotics. It {{3}} healthcare, making surgeries safer and treating bacterial infections much more effective. Today, penicillin and its derivatives continue to be vital tools in {{4}} bacterial infections, highlighting the importance of scientific research and discovery in improving human health.', NULL, NULL, NULL, E'1.its discovery, 2.deadly, 3.transformed, 4.fighting', NULL, NULL),
  ('f6716b6a-fe82-5adb-ba8a-2dc0aaf197f8'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'ANSWER_SHORT_QUESTION', E'ANSWER_SHORT_QUESTION', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'f6716b6a-fe82-5adb-ba8a-2dc0aaf197f8'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'ASQ', E'what are the organs of the body that we can breathe with?', '4c22b3f1-fdc6-5daa-8517-68d9033699cb'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'Lungs / Noses', NULL, NULL),
  ('f6739189-c235-5791-aa54-6b3ce7a4cf76'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'SUMMARIZE_WRITTEN_TEXT', E'SUMMARIZE_WRITTEN_TEXT', E'WRITING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'f6739189-c235-5791-aa54-6b3ce7a4cf76'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Impact of Movies', E'Movies have always held a special place in our society, shaping our culture, influencing our perceptions, and entertaining us for over a century. The impact of movies on society is undeniable, and it encompasses various aspects of our lives.\nFirst and foremost, movies are a powerful medium for storytelling. They have the ability to transport us to different worlds, eras, and situations, allowing us to experience emotions and adventures vicariously. Through compelling narratives, movies can evoke empathy, inspire, and provoke thought. They often reflect the values, fears, and aspirations of the society in which they are made, making them a mirror to our collective consciousness.\nMoreover, movies are instrumental in shaping public opinion. They can shed light on important social issues, challenge prevailing norms, and promote dialogue and discussion. Films like "12 Years a Slave" and "Schindler''s List" have played significant roles in raising awareness about historical injustices, while documentaries like "An Inconvenient Truth" have drawn attention to urgent environmental concerns.\nFurthermore, movies are a form of entertainment that brings people together. The shared experience of watching a movie in a theater or discussing a film with friends and family creates a sense of community. It provides common ground for people from diverse backgrounds to connect and bond over a shared interest.\nIn addition to their social impact, movies also contribute significantly to the economy. The film industry generates billions of dollars annually, providing jobs to countless individuals both on and off-screen. This economic impact extends beyond the production of movies to include tourism, merchandising, and various related industries.\nIn conclusion, movies are not just a source of entertainment; they are a powerful force that shapes our society in multifaceted ways. They influence our culture, beliefs, and values while also serving as a catalyst for social change and economic growth. The impact of movies on society is profound, and their significance in our lives cannot be overstated.', NULL, NULL, E'Movies are a transformative force in society, serving as a mirror to our collective consciousness, promoting social change, fostering community, and driving economic growth, highlighting their profound and multifaceted impact on our culture, values, and everyday lives.', NULL, 5, 75),
  ('f6794bc8-2373-57db-a0de-c8585107daff'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'ANSWER_SHORT_QUESTION', E'ANSWER_SHORT_QUESTION', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'f6794bc8-2373-57db-a0de-c8585107daff'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'ASQ', E'What do we call molten rock that is expelled by a volcano during an eruption?', '06113a11-a1ad-5305-b737-c4e3f53e14fe'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'Lava', NULL, NULL),
  ('f67a1d37-8879-5696-8c2b-1e5c7a36daa0'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'RE_TELL_LECTURE', E'RE_TELL_LECTURE', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'f67a1d37-8879-5696-8c2b-1e5c7a36daa0'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Food Quantification', NULL, '4282c7b0-7bab-5605-8919-46c36304fe12'::uuid, NULL, E'I''m a dietitian and I work in clinical weight-loss recently. Accurately estimating portion size is critical in research or real-world settings. For example, if you''re trying to watch your weight and you''re out to dinner and you''re presented with a bowl of food, there''s no really good way to actually estimate how much you''re eating unless you''re gonna whip some scales out of your bag. So we wanted to find a more objective way for people to quantify what they''re eating when they''re out and about. I came up with a more hands-on approach. We got people to measure the dimensions of the food using the width of their fingers and remembering back to primary school maths. We use the geometric volume formulas to estimate the weight of the food. To show you how this works, I''ve ordered a piece of lasagna. And that''s my box, a glass of wine and that''s my cylinder. And I''m feeling pretty healthy, so I order some watermelon for dessert. And that''s my wedge. So this was I know it''s seven by five, by four fingers. In the future, I see this method be incorporated into smartphone applications. So you put your finger, it''s in along with your height and your weight. And the app will do all of the calculations for you. And then you''ve got a more accurate way to estimate the portion size.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('f67e6533-e20d-5943-8756-27fd5823893b'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'RE_ORDER_PARAGRAPHS', E'RE_ORDER_PARAGRAPHS', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'f67e6533-e20d-5943-8756-27fd5823893b'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Mimesis', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, E'2, 1, 4, 3', NULL, NULL),
  ('f67fa0c9-6cbf-5f55-828e-7c2a30260d6a'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DRAG_AND_DROP', E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DRAG_AND_DROP', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'f67fa0c9-6cbf-5f55-828e-7c2a30260d6a'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Impressionist Painters', E'Early impressionist painters were considered {{1}} in their time because they broke many of the rules of the picture-making that had been set by earlier {{3}} . They found many of their {{2}} in life around them rather than in history, which was then the accepted {{4}} of subject matter for paintings.', NULL, NULL, NULL, E'1.radical, 2.generations, 3.subjects, 4.source', NULL, NULL),
  ('f68655af-7f1a-5f34-91fa-2ef6587009d8'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DROPDOWN', E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DROPDOWN', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'f68655af-7f1a-5f34-91fa-2ef6587009d8'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Selfies', E'To better understand selfies and how people form their identities online, the researchers combed through 2.5 million selfie posts {{1}} Instagram to determine what kinds of identity statements people make by taking and sharing the photos. Nearly 52 percent of all selfies {{2}} into the appearance category: pictures of people showing off their make-up, clothes, lips, etc. {{3}} , an overwhelming 57 percent of selfies on Instagram were posted by the 18-35-year-old crowd, something the researchers say isn''t too surprising {{4}} the demographics of the social media platform. The under-18 age group posted about 30 percent of selfies.', NULL, NULL, NULL, E'1.on, 2.fell, 3.Overall, 4.considering', NULL, NULL),
  ('f68aac87-83a3-5bb9-a365-e9de143bc703'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'READ_ALOUD', E'READ_ALOUD', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'f68aac87-83a3-5bb9-a365-e9de143bc703'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Tickling', E'One of the strangest things about tickling is that it’s pretty much impossible for a person to tickle himself or herself. The reason you can’t tickle yourself is that when you move a part of your own body, a part of your brain monitors the movement and anticipates the sensations that it will cause.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('f68d3b63-b302-58db-868f-be6000d4fcea'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DRAG_AND_DROP', E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DRAG_AND_DROP', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'f68d3b63-b302-58db-868f-be6000d4fcea'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Blockchain System', E'Integration of blockchain systems into industrial applications show promise in increasing security, trust, and {{1}} along the value-chain during product and process tracking. However, current solutions suffer performance {{2}} , or often disregard legacy devices still in operation. We {{3}} a blockchain system built upon an IoT architecture that is secure, modular, easily scalable, and deployable for fast certification of manufacturing data, {{4}} with current industrial landscapes.', NULL, NULL, NULL, E'1.transparency, 2.deficiencies, 3.propose, 4.compatible', NULL, NULL),
