  ('fa609a7d-b062-5885-b004-0ac9877cae08'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'ANSWER_SHORT_QUESTION', E'ANSWER_SHORT_QUESTION', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'fa609a7d-b062-5885-b004-0ac9877cae08'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'ASQ', E'What do you call a device, operated by the foot, for controlling the speed of cars?', 'e7e8caad-79d4-5d80-842c-e088a1c1a8b4'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'Accelerator', NULL, NULL),
  ('fa65e865-c2f6-53fd-9693-89a2f40db221'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'WRITE_ESSAY', E'WRITE_ESSAY', E'WRITING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'fa65e865-c2f6-53fd-9693-89a2f40db221'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Inventions', E'In our technological world, the number of new inventions has been evolving daily. Please describe a new invention and determine whether it has a beneficial or detrimental impact on society.', NULL, NULL, E'In our technological world, the number of new inventions has been evolving on a daily basis. One of the most recent technological inventions that has gained widespread attention is driverless cars. While some people argue that driverless cars have detrimental impacts on society, I believe that this new invention has more beneficial impacts than detrimental ones.\nFirstly, driverless cars have the potential to reduce the number of traffic accidents caused by human error. Driverless cars are equipped with advanced sensors and software that can detect and respond to potential hazards on the road more quickly and accurately than human drivers. This could potentially save countless lives and reduce the economic and social costs associated with traffic accidents.\nSecondly, driverless cars have the potential to increase mobility and accessibility for people who are unable to drive due to age, disability, or other reasons. Many people who are unable to drive rely on public transportation or the assistance of family and friends to get around. Driverless cars could provide a safe and convenient alternative for these individuals, allowing them to travel independently and access services and opportunities that were previously unavailable to them. This could potentially improve their quality of life and reduce social isolation.\nIn conclusion, while some people argue that driverless cars have detrimental impacts on society, I believe that this new invention has more beneficial impacts than detrimental ones. Driverless cars have the potential to reduce the number of traffic accidents caused by human error and increase mobility and accessibility for people who are unable to drive.', NULL, 200, 300),
  ('fa66d31b-d5a1-5017-b476-46b18011aca0'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'REPEAT_SENTENCE', E'REPEAT_SENTENCE', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'fa66d31b-d5a1-5017-b476-46b18011aca0'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'RS', NULL, 'e8c343c8-4e36-536a-8aba-fa1938380b85'::uuid, NULL, E'The date of the invention of the first clock was disputed among historians.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('fa6a09a4-9a73-52a8-95d7-75a6e177d8db'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'LISTENING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'fa6a09a4-9a73-52a8-95d7-75a6e177d8db'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'WFD', NULL, '50786a9a-ba59-50f3-b431-3cc1c03050c7'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'When launching a product, investigating and marketing are very crucial.', NULL, NULL),
