  ('fac64494-ba19-58d1-b0d7-1d878a6f8195'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'LISTENING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'fac64494-ba19-58d1-b0d7-1d878a6f8195'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'WFD', NULL, '0f37ea9a-08cd-5e90-b610-4b49f9c6046b'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'He was made president of the football club.', NULL, NULL),
  ('fac8f2c9-fcf8-5a1f-928b-3a51b841f526'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'SELECT_MISSING_WORD', E'SELECT_MISSING_WORD', E'LISTENING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'fac8f2c9-fcf8-5a1f-928b-3a51b841f526'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'SMW', E'Quality of life is important to all of us. It''s something we all try to improve. I''m just wondering how easy it is to improve your quality of life. The biggest things that affect how happy you are are your job, house, holidays, and friends. Of course, there are others. It''s quITe difficult to change these things. If you don''t like your job, IT can be difficult to find a better one. My job really affects my quality of life. If it''s really stressful, my quality of life goes down. You also need somewhere nice to live. That can be difficult to change. It''s important to find a home that feels like home. Holidays can add a lot to your happiness, but we don''t have lots of those. And then there are friends. They really improve.\n\nAt the end of the recording the lost word or group of words has been replaced by a beep. Select the correct option to complete the recording.', 'dcebf550-2e3f-5d45-8280-11735e081b93'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'quality of life', NULL, NULL),
  ('facbe432-acd6-53c7-bc83-0e338f45f55a'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DROPDOWN', E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DROPDOWN', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'facbe432-acd6-53c7-bc83-0e338f45f55a'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Great Listeners', E'Dogs make great listeners. And that may be because man and man''s best friend use analogous brain regions to process voices.\nResearchers {{2}} almost 200 sound samples, including human and canine {{3}} , as well as environmental noises and silence. They played these clips to 22 people and 11 dogs while the subjects'' brains were {{4}} functional MRI scans.\nHuman brains tuned in most to vocal sounds. Dog brains were most sensitive to environmental noises. But they still had a lot in common. A dedicated brain area reacted {{6}} to the vocalizations of their own species. And that area also {{7}} to the voices of the other species. Meanwhile, a different brain region noted emotion in a voice, with a strong response to cheery sounds like laughter and a weaker reaction to unhappy noises like canine whining. The study is in the journal Current Biology.\nSeems that thousands of years of domestication have made our furry friends sensitive to the same vocal cues we are. You can confide in Fido.', NULL, NULL, NULL, E'1.collected, 2.vocalizations, 3.undergoing, 4.strongly, 5.responded', NULL, NULL),
  ('facc2e16-03c5-5334-87e4-c213200791e0'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'LISTENING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'facc2e16-03c5-5334-87e4-c213200791e0'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'WFD', NULL, 'cc1fe737-6c47-586b-8085-7765834c8e4f'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'Being bilingual does not necessarily mean having the ability to analyze the languages.', NULL, NULL),
  ('facc9bf2-c8e0-5ab3-ad36-6bef604c6305'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DROPDOWN', E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DROPDOWN', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'facc9bf2-c8e0-5ab3-ad36-6bef604c6305'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Good Looks in Votes', E'It is tempting to try to prove that good looks win votes, and many academics have tried. The {{1}} is that beauty is in the eye of the {{2}} , and you cannot behold a politician''s face without a veil of extraneous prejudice getting in the way. Does George Bush possess a disarming grin, or a facetious {{3}} ? It''s hard to find anyone who can look at the president without assessing him politically as well as {{4}} .', NULL, NULL, NULL, E'1.difficulty, 2.beholder, 3.smirk, 4.physically', NULL, NULL),
  ('fadde7d9-7675-5144-879e-6b048253dd29'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'READ_ALOUD', E'READ_ALOUD', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'fadde7d9-7675-5144-879e-6b048253dd29'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Building Blocks', E'While life on Earth is relatively new, geologically speaking, the ingredients that combined to form it might be much older than once thought. The simplest amino acid, carbamic acid, could have formed alongside stars or planets within interstellar ices. The findings could be used to train deep space instruments like the James Webb Space Telescope to search for prebiotic molecules in distant, star-forming regions of the universe.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('faf0122a-c9c4-503c-9020-02a470dfbf7c'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'READ_ALOUD', E'READ_ALOUD', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'faf0122a-c9c4-503c-9020-02a470dfbf7c'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Linguistic Morality', E'In multi-lingual countries, code-mixing, the use of more than one variety in the same utterance or sentence and code-switching, the use of different languages or varieties between sentences is common and natural. Despite its frequency, or perhaps because of it, some scholars and self-appointed guardians of linguistic morality, view both code-mixing and code-switching as a sign of linguistic deficiency.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('faf807d6-9e4c-59c1-846c-a6aafed430c9'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'READ_ALOUD', E'READ_ALOUD', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'faf807d6-9e4c-59c1-846c-a6aafed430c9'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Dengue and Vaccine', E'In 2022, Europe saw more cases of locally acquired dengue than in the whole of the previous decade. The rise marks both a public health threat and a corresponding market opportunity for dengue vaccines and treatments; news that should spur the pharmaceutical industry to boost investment into the neglected disease.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('fb0a0ad9-f176-5299-b765-73cd9b97ed2a'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'RE_ORDER_PARAGRAPHS', E'RE_ORDER_PARAGRAPHS', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'fb0a0ad9-f176-5299-b765-73cd9b97ed2a'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Human Necessity', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, E'2, 1, 4, 3', NULL, NULL),
  ('fb0b4272-ac71-56bb-8af9-8b435cd2c1cd'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DRAG_AND_DROP', E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DRAG_AND_DROP', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'fb0b4272-ac71-56bb-8af9-8b435cd2c1cd'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Bright Nights', E'Over millions of years we have {{1}} to organize our psychological processes according to altering states of light and darkness. However, our nights have changed enormously in just a century and a half {{2}} to the widespread use of electric light. Now, in most built up areas, the night is no longer dark. Light has {{3}} humans, whose eyes are {{4}} to daylight, to colonize the night by getting rid of darkness.', NULL, NULL, NULL, E'1.evolved, 2.thanks, 3.allowed, 4.adapted', NULL, NULL),
  ('fb0c8f94-8168-59ee-aa0c-f4064999b6ae'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'REPEAT_SENTENCE', E'REPEAT_SENTENCE', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'fb0c8f94-8168-59ee-aa0c-f4064999b6ae'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'RS', NULL, '849a2e3c-c152-5572-b20e-1ebeeefba504'::uuid, NULL, E'The small island''s economy is largely dependent upon tourism.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('fb1d73a0-d219-5098-bc57-10eae191ce46'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'LISTENING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'fb1d73a0-d219-5098-bc57-10eae191ce46'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'WFD', NULL, '7aef6618-4764-584b-8abb-41c280f2e366'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'Business research has different branches using different research methods.', NULL, NULL),
  ('fb21d191-c6bf-5b41-8785-ca8d4e33ba06'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'WRITE_ESSAY', E'WRITE_ESSAY', E'WRITING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'fb21d191-c6bf-5b41-8785-ca8d4e33ba06'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Space Travel', E'Space travel is fantastic these days, but there are many issues, such as environmental problems that we should be focusing on. What are your views on the allocation of public funding?', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 200, 300),
  ('fb22a751-f420-5930-aa0d-038e808f1653'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DRAG_AND_DROP', E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DRAG_AND_DROP', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'fb22a751-f420-5930-aa0d-038e808f1653'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Concept of Genius', E'The concept of genius is traditionally {{1}} with extraordinary creativity and achievement, often manifested at a young age. While early bloomers like Mozart and Orson Welles are {{2}} examples, the narrative of genius is more nuanced, {{3}} a wide spectrum of creative expression. There are also late bloomers, who have discovered or developed their talents later in life, often after {{4}} various obstacles and challenges.', NULL, NULL, NULL, E'1.associated, 2.celebrated, 3.encompassing, 4.overcoming', NULL, NULL),
  ('fb359365-d0dd-560d-8a48-1aa72fb81872'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'RE_TELL_LECTURE', E'RE_TELL_LECTURE', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'fb359365-d0dd-560d-8a48-1aa72fb81872'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Phenology', NULL, '3ecccacd-e6d1-55b2-8e70-b5014895c960'::uuid, NULL, E'Take a look outside a window. What is the season where you are? How do you know? Most likely, you looked at a tree or plant and noticed details about its leaves and assessed the qualities of sunlight streaming outside. Observing the timing of biological events in relation to changes in season and climate is called “phenology”. When you notice the daffodil buds are poking through the snow and think spring is on its way, you’re using phenology. When you see leaves turn from green to red, and watch migrating birds fly past, and realize that summer is over, autumn is here, you’re using phenology. Literally meaning, “the science of appearance”, phenology comes from the Greek words “pheno,” to show or appear, and “logos,” to study. Humans have relied on phenology since the time of hunters and gatherers. We’ve watched changes in seasons to know when to plant and harvest food and when to track migrating animals. Scientists observe and document seasonal changes in nature and look for patterns in the timing of seasonal events. Timing of these natural signs has remained consistent until recently. Increasing global temperature is causing rhythms of nature to shift. Bud burst, the day when a tree or plant’s leaf or flower buds open, is occurring earlier in the year for some species. For every one degree Celsius rise in temperature, bud burst happens five days earlier than usual. Differences in timing affect not only plants, but the insects and birds that depend on the plants for food.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('fb3a5a2a-a4fb-5656-af4e-e564dbb925e8'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DROPDOWN', E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DROPDOWN', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'fb3a5a2a-a4fb-5656-af4e-e564dbb925e8'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Airline Changes', E'Members of American Airlines'' loyalty program will have to spend more to {{1}} elite frequent flyer status next year, part of a slew of changes the carrier announced Thursday. Starting in March, AAdvantage members will need to earn 40,000 so-called Loyalty Points to earn Gold status, up from 30,000 in the current earning year. Gold is the lowest elite {{2}} of American''s program, and it comes with perks like free upgrades - when those seats are available. The airline will also get rid of MileSAAver and AAnytime awards, two categories to {{3}} frequent flyer miles for tickets, at set minimum rates. Instead, American will feature its “Web Specials,” with mile requirements that will fluctuate based on demand.', NULL, NULL, NULL, E'1.earn, 2.tier, 3.redeem', NULL, NULL),
  ('fb4639ea-5e55-590f-968b-2ccdb80bcd96'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'ANSWER_SHORT_QUESTION', E'ANSWER_SHORT_QUESTION', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'fb4639ea-5e55-590f-968b-2ccdb80bcd96'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'ASQ', E'What does water become at zero degrees Celsius or below?', 'e02c3715-ee33-52c4-84ec-d4f139ef0c7e'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'Ice', NULL, NULL),
  ('fb4930e0-745c-5914-893f-00fab5c8a945'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'REPEAT_SENTENCE', E'REPEAT_SENTENCE', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'fb4930e0-745c-5914-893f-00fab5c8a945'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'RS', NULL, 'bc378413-ac32-5b62-9571-7c8a01fde658'::uuid, NULL, E'My favorite place in my hometown is the main park located downtown.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('fb5057b6-e6fe-51e4-a9f6-e5d4fa25f94e'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'REPEAT_SENTENCE', E'REPEAT_SENTENCE', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'fb5057b6-e6fe-51e4-a9f6-e5d4fa25f94e'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'RS', NULL, 'df12f46d-060a-5efc-a82e-040c19628dfe'::uuid, NULL, E'The college provides an advice service to support students with financial, emotional, and other issues.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('fb509432-8537-5824-b9ef-8768c0b3ff5e'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'ANSWER_SHORT_QUESTION', E'ANSWER_SHORT_QUESTION', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'fb509432-8537-5824-b9ef-8768c0b3ff5e'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'ASQ', E'What is the name for a structure consisting of a roof supported by columns or piers, usually attached to a building as a porch?', 'adae907e-ab85-5242-a894-e3ec161fdac2'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'Portico', NULL, NULL),
  ('fb52eeb9-912e-5a88-af15-ee38cf3ca72a'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'REPEAT_SENTENCE', E'REPEAT_SENTENCE', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'fb52eeb9-912e-5a88-af15-ee38cf3ca72a'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'RS', NULL, 'd84f27d1-974a-5344-903b-600cbfb02c80'::uuid, NULL, E'The current statistical evidence indicates the need of further research.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('fb55d34a-c93d-5106-a8d3-ac80b865e435'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'RE_TELL_LECTURE', E'RE_TELL_LECTURE', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'fb55d34a-c93d-5106-a8d3-ac80b865e435'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Adult Development', NULL, '88b72cc9-dd4c-5f40-9ad1-0fa830e5b491'::uuid, NULL, E'We know that more than half of Americans are married or are living with or dating their future partner by 30. We know that the brain caps off its second and last growth spurt in your 20s as it rewires itself for adulthood, which means that whatever it is you want to change about yourself, now is the time to change it. We know that personality changes more during your 20s than at any other time in life, and we know that female fertility peaks at age 28, and things get tricky after age 35. So your 20s are the time to educate yourself about your body and your options. So when we think about child development, we all know that the first five years are a critical period for language and attachment in the brain. It’s a time when your ordinary, day-to-day life has an inordinate impact on who you will become. But what we hear less about is that there’s such a thing as adult development, and our 20s are that critical period of adult development. But this isn’t what twenty somethings are hearing. Newspapers talk about the changing timetable of adulthood. Researchers call the 20s an extended adolescence. Journalists coin silly nick names for twenty somethings like “twixters”and “kidults.” It’s true! As a culture, we have trivialized what is actually the defining decade of adulthood.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('fb56104f-6632-56ad-b398-904f7090e60b'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'REPEAT_SENTENCE', E'REPEAT_SENTENCE', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'fb56104f-6632-56ad-b398-904f7090e60b'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'RS', NULL, '65e047b2-5812-5c39-a3d8-135fb4957fad'::uuid, NULL, E'Services are rapidly growing in parts of the global economy.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('fb5685de-04e1-5e6d-81a4-0599cd17b608'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'WRITE_ESSAY', E'WRITE_ESSAY', E'WRITING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'fb5685de-04e1-5e6d-81a4-0599cd17b608'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Working Women', E'More and more women are managing to combine raising a family and following a career. Some people believe this is a challenge for women. Please give your suggestions about this challenge on a personal level and a national level.', NULL, NULL, E'In recent years, an increasing number of women have successfully balanced the responsibilities of raising a family while pursuing a career. However, some people argue that this dual role poses significant challenges for women. In this essay, we will explore suggestions to address this challenge on both personal and national levels.\nOn a personal level, women can adopt several strategies to navigate the challenges of combining family and career. Firstly, effective time management is crucial. Women can prioritize tasks, set realistic goals, and establish a structured routine to ensure they allocate time and energy to both family and work responsibilities. Secondly, seeking support from their partner, family members, and friends is essential. By sharing household chores, childcare duties, and seeking emotional support, women can reduce the burden and create a more balanced environment.\nAt a national level, governments and society can implement policies and initiatives to support women in balancing family and career. Firstly, affordable and accessible childcare services should be provided to ensure that women have reliable options for their children''s care while they pursue their careers. Additionally, parental leave policies should be extended and made more flexible to allow women to take time off work without jeopardizing their career progression.\nIn conclusion, while combining family and career remains a challenge for women, there are strategies that can be adopted on both personal and national levels to address this issue. By adopting these suggestions, we can empower women to successfully navigate the challenges of balancing family and career, ultimately leading to a more equitable society.', NULL, 200, 300),
