  ('fbb03299-487f-54b5-aa03-2fc2f7ebb25c'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'REPEAT_SENTENCE', E'REPEAT_SENTENCE', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'fbb03299-487f-54b5-aa03-2fc2f7ebb25c'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'RS', NULL, '3b1fe402-5eb3-576b-842a-0b551a1ae4ed'::uuid, NULL, E'Australia is the first AIDS-free country in the world.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('fbb44b04-78f6-59e6-8183-f176cade75ba'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'LISTENING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'fbb44b04-78f6-59e6-8183-f176cade75ba'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'WFD', NULL, '004c99b9-ac3d-59e6-b75a-3c5b9574e673'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'During the study period, you must work hard to keep up.', NULL, NULL),
  ('fbcca67b-729a-59dc-9843-d5f3752538f4'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'RE_TELL_LECTURE', E'RE_TELL_LECTURE', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'fbcca67b-729a-59dc-9843-d5f3752538f4'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Hibernation', NULL, '54d38a79-d6d7-5c9e-b117-48f7720c2a14'::uuid, NULL, E'The behaviors inherent in hibernation, like going five weeks without sleep, or dropping to near-freezing body temperatures would be potentially fatal to non-hibernating species like us. To find out how hibernators are able to do this, researchers turned their attention to those animal’s genomes. So far, they’ve discovered that hibernation is controlled by genes that turn off and on in unique patterns throughout the year, fine-tuning the hibernator’s physiology and behavior. For example, ground squirrel, bear and dwarf lemur studies have revealed that these animals are able to turn on the genes that control fat metabolism precisely when they need to use their fat stores as fuel to survive long periods of fasting. And the genes in question are present in all mammals, which means that researchers could study hibernating mammals to see how their unique control of physiology might help humans. Understanding how hibernators deal with reduced blood flow could lead to better treatments for protecting the brain during a stroke. Figuring out how these animals avoid muscle deterioration might improve the lives of bedridden patients. And studying how hibernating animals control their weight with ease could illuminate the relationship between metabolism and weight gain in humans.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('fbd32283-7ea4-5277-b5c9-6bd954b006b9'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'REPEAT_SENTENCE', E'REPEAT_SENTENCE', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'fbd32283-7ea4-5277-b5c9-6bd954b006b9'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'RS', NULL, '36aae33d-2c66-56a1-b86d-312606bb6ce1'::uuid, NULL, E'Without doubt, his primary motive was economic.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('fbd5e110-1207-5966-9a76-2e5a8c9296b3'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DRAG_AND_DROP', E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DRAG_AND_DROP', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'fbd5e110-1207-5966-9a76-2e5a8c9296b3'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Nomenclature', E'The new systematic nomenclature was so {{1}} that many chemists preferred to {{2}} to the older trivial names that were at least shorter. At least, that is the ostensible reason. Actually, tradition seems to carry more weight than {{3}} with some scientists.', NULL, NULL, NULL, E'1.cumbersome, 2.revert, 3.system', NULL, NULL),
  ('fbddf858-96a7-5611-bb5f-74636b0c0f58'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'RE_TELL_LECTURE', E'RE_TELL_LECTURE', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'fbddf858-96a7-5611-bb5f-74636b0c0f58'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Frogs', NULL, '5bd40945-fc68-5d61-90dd-ab8573305360'::uuid, NULL, E'If you liked the colorful animals we just saw, you''re going to love these next animals: frogs. You might not normally think of frogs as being colorful, but these frogs definitely are. They are the dart-poison frogs of Central and South America. Look at their striking colors, often yellow with black stripes or deep blue with black spots. Beyond being nice to look at, these markings have a purpose. They warn predators that these frogs are poisonous. When threatened, these frogs secrete a substance through their skin that would easily kill whatever animal might try to eat them. Their bright colors communicate this, and so most animals tend not to hunt them. Now, speaking of hunting, for centuries these frogs were sought after by hunters. As you might think, the hunters didn''t want to eat the frogs, but rather, they captured them for their poison. They would add the poison to the tips of their hunting arrows. Of course, nowadays most hunters use guns. These days, dart-poison frogs are of less interest to hunters than to medical researchers. Researchers believe that they can make new heart medicine from the poison, because it acts as a stimulant on the body''s nervous system. Researchers think they could use it to stimulate a weak heart. There is, however, a problem with doing research on these frogs. Those that are caught in the wild will produce their poison until they die. However, those that are born in captivity, like the ones you see here, will not produce any poison at all.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('fbe15796-d5d8-5039-a857-3d4a5654fd61'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'WRITE_ESSAY', E'WRITE_ESSAY', E'WRITING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'fbe15796-d5d8-5039-a857-3d4a5654fd61'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Agriculture', E'Despite the great progress in agriculture humans have achieved, there are still people who starve to death. Is there anything we can do to address the problem? Please give some possible solutions.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 200, 300),
  ('fbe22d94-3082-5aea-9f24-f0dc09eba0ca'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'ANSWER_SHORT_QUESTION', E'ANSWER_SHORT_QUESTION', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'fbe22d94-3082-5aea-9f24-f0dc09eba0ca'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'ASQ', E'What key mineral makes sea water different from fresh water?', 'b38e67fa-56ac-5883-8bdb-afd8710339a1'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'Salt', NULL, NULL),
  ('fbec715e-1285-5729-b68e-4225a88236ec'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'READ_ALOUD', E'READ_ALOUD', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'fbec715e-1285-5729-b68e-4225a88236ec'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Wine’s True Origins', E'Early farmers, the revised story goes, migrated from western Asia toward Iberia and brought table vines with them. Along the way the farmers crossbred the table vines with local wild grapevines. The earliest crossbreeding probably happened in what is now Israel and Turkey, creating muscat grapes, which are high in sugar—good for eating and fermenting.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('fbecaa57-7af6-5399-a118-8f7d67d3b71d'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'LISTENING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'fbecaa57-7af6-5399-a118-8f7d67d3b71d'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'WFD', NULL, 'ca3687d1-682d-57bd-a37d-678bc24e39a2'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'Gravity is the force that causes mutual attraction between objects.', NULL, NULL),
  ('fbf596e5-b049-554c-bb4c-8af6f645248b'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'READ_ALOUD', E'READ_ALOUD', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'fbf596e5-b049-554c-bb4c-8af6f645248b'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Bubbles', E'People love bubbles, they love to blow them, pop them and fit inside them. Bubbles aren''t just for entertainment; they are the crisp effervescence in our sodas and sparkling water, and some doctors are even using microscopic bubbles to deliver medicine more effectively. Whether for entertainment or scientific study, scientists have been turning their attention to why bubbles pop.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('fbf59b12-6b38-58f8-8ae6-78ae0d63f6ec'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'REPEAT_SENTENCE', E'REPEAT_SENTENCE', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'fbf59b12-6b38-58f8-8ae6-78ae0d63f6ec'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'RS', NULL, '2313f51c-bb70-5251-9631-2412d975d9b1'::uuid, NULL, E'Discover the campus in your first week of the semester for orientation.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('fc03e2d8-5c68-5b24-b688-6e8c8803a433'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DRAG_AND_DROP', E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DRAG_AND_DROP', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'fc03e2d8-5c68-5b24-b688-6e8c8803a433'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Human Population', E'In only 11 years, the worldwide human population has {{1}} by another one billion. For comparison, it took humans roughly 300,000 years since we first {{2}} to reach the first billion. The challenge of this phenomenon is providing a gold standard to each and every one of human beings in a {{3}} manner.', NULL, NULL, NULL, E'1.swelled, 2.evolved, 3.sustainable', NULL, NULL),
  ('fc05f6d1-bd5c-502c-bb8c-d93729a1856e'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'LISTENING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'fc05f6d1-bd5c-502c-bb8c-d93729a1856e'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'WFD', NULL, '235dc553-8306-5415-86ab-11d749f7dd8c'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'Those events are not yet fully understood.', NULL, NULL),
  ('fc11feec-fed3-503c-9262-9c8e6dc44465'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'ANSWER_SHORT_QUESTION', E'ANSWER_SHORT_QUESTION', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'fc11feec-fed3-503c-9262-9c8e6dc44465'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'ASQ', E'What do we describe an event which happens once every year?', 'd309a16e-5e23-5e99-a682-3c42a734ad6d'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'Annual', NULL, NULL),
  ('fc1522be-4b7d-5308-a4c5-5c6861aaf118'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DRAG_AND_DROP', E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DRAG_AND_DROP', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'fc1522be-4b7d-5308-a4c5-5c6861aaf118'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Colorful Poison Frogs', E'Colorful poison frogs in the Amazon owe their great {{1}} to ancestors that leapt into the region from the Andes Mountains several times during the last 10 million years, a new study from The University of Texas at Austin suggests. This is the first study to show that the Andes have been a {{2}} source of diversity for the Amazon basin, one of the largest {{3}} of biological diversity on Earth. The finding runs {{4}} to the idea that Amazonian diversity is the result of evolution only within the {{5}} forest itself. "Basically, the Amazon basin is a melting pot for South American frogs," says graduate student Juan Santos, lead author of the study. "Poison frogs there have come from multiple places of origin, notably the Andes Mountains, over many millions of years. We have shown that you cannot understand Amazonian biodiversity by looking only in the basin. Adjacent regions have played a major role."', NULL, NULL, NULL, E'1.diversity, 2.major, 3.reservoirs, 4.counter, 5.tropical', NULL, NULL),
  ('fc15fc34-df8f-5d0f-87db-f67560335532'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'RE_TELL_LECTURE', E'RE_TELL_LECTURE', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'fc15fc34-df8f-5d0f-87db-f67560335532'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Endowment Effect', NULL, '9ba3c4b8-cdd6-50ba-bf23-4b38a249ea6a'::uuid, NULL, E'Light up the world, after witnessing the violent rage shown by babies whenever deprived of an item they considered their own, Jean Piaget, a founding father of child psychology, observed something profound about human nature. Our sense of ownership emerges incredibly early. Why are we so clingy? There''s a well-established phenomenon in psychology known as the endowment effect. Although feelings of ownership emerge early in life, culture also plays a part. For example, it was recently discovered that Hadza people of northern Tanzania who are isolated from modern culture don''t exhibit the endowment effect. That''s possibly because they live in an egalitarian society where almost everything is shared. At the other extreme, sometimes our attachment to our things can go too far. Part of the cause of hoarding disorder is an exaggerated sense of responsibility and protectiveness toward one''s belongings. That''s why people with this condition find it so difficult to throw anything away.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('fc17f360-28cf-555e-898a-584fadaba1e9'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'SUMMARIZE_WRITTEN_TEXT', E'SUMMARIZE_WRITTEN_TEXT', E'WRITING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'fc17f360-28cf-555e-898a-584fadaba1e9'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Walrus Counting', E'Huge, blubbery and a bit grumpy. Walruses are easy enough to spot. But thanks to their remote Arctic location, they''re hard to count, and we don''t know how many of these giant beasts there are. Now, using satellite images, the plan is to locate every Atlantic and Laptev Sea Walrus, and scientists say this is essential, because climate change means these animals are under threat.\nToday, though, the most advanced imaging satellites can see details down to just 30 centimetres. And this has transformed our view of the natural world.\nEven at that resolution, counting walruses is still a challenge. So the scouts in East Molesey have been drafted in to help. The first job, scouring through a search area of 25,000 square kilometres, to find any images that have a walrus in.\nIt''s quite hard because there is like, rusty barrels and rocks that look really similar. It''s kind of a challenge as well because they''re all hidden, and you have to try and search for them. But the project is going to need a lot more people to help with the count. The future is uncertain for this icon of the Arctic. Their icy home is changing faster than anywhere else on the planet. But now with satellite technology and the help of the public, we should finally find out how many walruses there are, and see how they fare in the years to come.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 5, 75),
  ('fc192b7f-1ede-5119-b4da-ced5be4469ea'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'REPEAT_SENTENCE', E'REPEAT_SENTENCE', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'fc192b7f-1ede-5119-b4da-ced5be4469ea'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'RS', NULL, 'e8a176d4-a672-5f3c-a869-7908e8e1d61b'::uuid, NULL, E'We are committed to attracting the very best students regardless of their financial circumstances.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('fc1bacab-3dd3-54bd-8f11-6077693149de'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DROPDOWN', E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DROPDOWN', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'fc1bacab-3dd3-54bd-8f11-6077693149de'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Competent Skills', E'The skills you will develop on this course will help you become more confident and competent in managing written and social aspects in your current career. It will {{1}} you for further study in your area of interest.\nWe plan to provide you with the opportunity to hear about the work of professors who have been involved in the past. We have had confirmation that they will give talks on their subjects {{2}} to your group, and help you to clarify potential future directions you might take in your study and career.\nThere are also dedicated careers services available at the University, {{3}} you will be entitled to use.\nThe assessments for the first part of the program are designed to develop key study skills and to provide you with the opportunity to brush up on skills you haven''t used for a long time, or feel you do not have.\nThis will include some written work essays, as well as group work (short presentations) and you will be taught how to do these. {{4}} of the assessment for each module will be explained in your first session.', NULL, NULL, NULL, E'1.prepare, 2.especially, 3.which, 4.Details', NULL, NULL),
  ('fc274724-c212-5620-af25-eb657627b4ab'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DRAG_AND_DROP', E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DRAG_AND_DROP', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'fc274724-c212-5620-af25-eb657627b4ab'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Gun Violence', E'Exposure to gun violence makes adolescents twice as {{1}} to perpetrate serious violence in the next two years, according to a University of Michigan {{2}} . Researchers found there is a {{3}} cause and effect {{4}} between exposure and perpetration of violence. Jeffrey B. Bingenheimer, a doctoral student in health behaviour and health education, analysed five years of data from adolescents living in 78 neighbourhoods in Chicago. Bingenheimer is lead author on a paper in this week''s journal Science.', NULL, NULL, NULL, E'1.likely, 2.study, 3.substantial, 4.relationship', NULL, NULL),
  ('fc2aeea9-ec96-5246-8067-2d4d8a20170f'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'ANSWER_SHORT_QUESTION', E'ANSWER_SHORT_QUESTION', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'fc2aeea9-ec96-5246-8067-2d4d8a20170f'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'ASQ', E'What do we call a person looking for a job?', 'f7da0e2e-4413-53bf-8f65-bbb0981cd59c'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'Job hunter / job seeker', NULL, NULL),
  ('fc2e80d3-c429-53b9-9a8c-667c8496049c'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DROPDOWN', E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DROPDOWN', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'fc2e80d3-c429-53b9-9a8c-667c8496049c'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Crime Prevention', E'Crime prevention has a long history in Australia, and in other parts of the world. In all societies, people have tried to {{1}} themselves and those close to them from assaults and other abuses. Every time someone locks the door to their house or their car, they practice {{2}} prevention. Most parents want their children to learn to be law abiding and not spend extended periods of their lives in prison. In this country, at least, most {{3}} . Only a small minority of young people become recidivist offenders. In a functioning society, crime prevention is part of everyday life. While prevention can be all-pervasive at the grassroots, {{4}} is oddly neglected in mass media and political discourses. When politicians, talkback radio hosts and newspaper editorialists pontificate about crime and {{5}} remedies, it is comparatively rare for them to mention prevention. Overwhelmingly, emphasis is on policing, sentencing and other ''law and order'' responses.', NULL, NULL, NULL, E'1.protect, 2.a form of, 3.succeed, 4.it, 5.possible', NULL, NULL),
  ('fc3666f3-8e2e-56b1-9f96-a0eef5c66af6'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'ANSWER_SHORT_QUESTION', E'ANSWER_SHORT_QUESTION', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'fc3666f3-8e2e-56b1-9f96-a0eef5c66af6'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'ASQ', E'What do we call the money paid for carrying goods?', '64f29437-9aee-5bc8-ac45-6bfd728dc408'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'Freight', NULL, NULL),
  ('fc387d39-669f-5f2b-9f75-af1e886eeeac'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'RESPOND_TO_A_SITUATION', E'RESPOND_TO_A_SITUATION', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'fc387d39-669f-5f2b-9f75-af1e886eeeac'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Book Club', E'You''ve organized a weekly book club meeting with your friends, and everyone''s excited to discuss the latest read. However, upon arrival, you notice some attendees haven''t finished the book and are unable to participate fully in the discussion. You need to remind everyone of the importance of reading the assigned material. What would you say to your friends?', '0a6302d5-4707-5753-8e1d-935d905015ee'::uuid, NULL, E'Hey everyone, thanks for joining our book club meeting! Just a friendly reminder, it''s important to read the assigned book before our discussions to get the most out of our meetings. That way, we can all actively participate and share our thoughts and insights. If you haven''t finished the book yet, no worries! Let''s try to catch up before our next meeting so we can all have a meaningful discussion together. Happy reading!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('fc38f78b-0fd7-599b-83d7-2d673c16a64e'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'REPEAT_SENTENCE', E'REPEAT_SENTENCE', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'fc38f78b-0fd7-599b-83d7-2d673c16a64e'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'RS', NULL, 'c03ba0e7-7018-506a-ba90-3f73e5bb945d'::uuid, NULL, E'There have been many complaints from members of the public.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('fc4078c3-e048-5db8-8bae-3f99c0602ede'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'REPEAT_SENTENCE', E'REPEAT_SENTENCE', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'fc4078c3-e048-5db8-8bae-3f99c0602ede'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'RS', NULL, '480c4d1a-f4bc-50f8-a7a1-086f6c444302'::uuid, NULL, E'For the past three years they have been leading totally separate lives.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('fc416dc1-de19-5cc3-b4de-d549f03b7895'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'REPEAT_SENTENCE', E'REPEAT_SENTENCE', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'fc416dc1-de19-5cc3-b4de-d549f03b7895'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'RS', NULL, 'f0bbc679-4fad-5a23-ac87-e25b62913e10'::uuid, NULL, E'The economics department studies the production and distribution of goods and services.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('fc61c3c2-982e-5f87-855a-71630ecbe7ad'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'LISTENING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'fc61c3c2-982e-5f87-855a-71630ecbe7ad'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'WFD', NULL, '641e23e2-26e4-522d-b4f6-990f56b87703'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'Most software companies also offer technical support for their products.', NULL, NULL),
  ('fc6286a8-b1e1-5eba-bc76-5f5cfc1a0ac5'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'LISTENING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'fc6286a8-b1e1-5eba-bc76-5f5cfc1a0ac5'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'WFD', NULL, 'a2d88e95-c490-5994-80a9-eaf9df1e2107'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'There are excellent facilities for sport and recreation in our campus.', NULL, NULL),
  ('fc638634-d206-5ab5-9845-fdba82705f4e'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'LISTENING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'fc638634-d206-5ab5-9845-fdba82705f4e'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'WFD', NULL, '50c80447-f3b6-5530-af28-50927b8d6a67'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'Please remain seated after finishing your exam.', NULL, NULL),
  ('fc6532db-89fd-5e32-b6a0-ff061015ba93'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'REPEAT_SENTENCE', E'REPEAT_SENTENCE', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'fc6532db-89fd-5e32-b6a0-ff061015ba93'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'RS', NULL, '57a27bb1-dedb-50a2-bc19-429a388f76bf'::uuid, NULL, E'The shopping center incorporates a library and a bank.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('fc6827d4-01a3-56a9-9cb3-4ce6b11c25d5'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'MC_LISTENING_SINGLE', E'MC_LISTENING_SINGLE', E'LISTENING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'fc6827d4-01a3-56a9-9cb3-4ce6b11c25d5'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'MCS-L', E'Randall Jarrell, the great American critic and poet, once defined the novel as, "an extended piece of prose fiction with something wrong with it". Now, nothing is perfect and you don''t have to look very hard to find something wrong- or perhaps just something you don''t like - about any work of fiction you care to name. Where, we might ask, does the editor come into this? And is it beneficial to an author to have an editor who is also a novelist? You would think that being a writer themselves, familiar with the process of writing a novel and its demands, they would be able to get inside the head of the author, and be sympathetic and understanding of what needs to be done. This is not an unreasonable assumption to make. However, is it not possible that there is an opposite side to this? Editors might, from their experience as writers, possibly unconsciously, try to make over the submitted novel as they themselves would have written it. The ideal, one supposes, is for the editor to see the book through the author''s eyes, but if they apply their own creative talent to the job they might end up seeing it too much through their own eyes and, in this way, take no account of the author''s original intentions.\n\nIn the speaker''s opinion, which of the following is true of editors who are also novelists?', 'f3232c2e-e9a7-5c17-a340-71551c7f58f6'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'They may try to re-shape the novelist''s work in their own way.', NULL, NULL),
  ('fc6a7ab6-f882-521e-b006-c550597da3c3'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'REPEAT_SENTENCE', E'REPEAT_SENTENCE', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'fc6a7ab6-f882-521e-b006-c550597da3c3'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'RS', NULL, '32361452-f745-5124-89ed-5c8c8705653f'::uuid, NULL, E'There is a lot of sugar in many fast foods.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('fc6ed90a-6d58-542c-a8e3-6bb6efd2ad80'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'ANSWER_SHORT_QUESTION', E'ANSWER_SHORT_QUESTION', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'fc6ed90a-6d58-542c-a8e3-6bb6efd2ad80'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'ASQ', E'When we say someone is doing the B.A. in history or literature in the university, what does B.A. stand for?', '3fbca820-80ca-5517-81a4-c1c991c21a23'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'Bachelor of arts', NULL, NULL),
  ('fc716509-eedb-5caf-9473-a590cdcc95b9'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'ANSWER_SHORT_QUESTION', E'ANSWER_SHORT_QUESTION', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'fc716509-eedb-5caf-9473-a590cdcc95b9'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'ASQ', E'What do we call a coastal building which warns sailors against dangerous coasts?', '17ab9304-16fd-5d32-a28b-8de4151b79b9'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'Lighthouse', NULL, NULL),
  ('fc73b796-32b3-5db8-a3aa-089779be6d19'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'SUMMARIZE_WRITTEN_TEXT', E'SUMMARIZE_WRITTEN_TEXT', E'WRITING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'fc73b796-32b3-5db8-a3aa-089779be6d19'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Food Drying', E'Fruits and vegetables are the most commonly consumed super or functional foods, yet their high moisture content (over 80%) makes them especially susceptible to bacteria that cause spoiling. Keeping fresh is the best way to preserve the nutritional value of fruits and vegetables, but most storage methods necessitate low temperatures, which are difficult to maintain throughout the distribution chain. In contract, drying is an effective post-harvest management strategy. To improve their shelf life and increase food security, approximately one-fifth of the world''s fresh produce are dried. Dried fruits and vegetables make healthy eating more practical and can help close the gap between recommended and actual fruit consumption. By lowering water activity, dehydration keeps fruits and vegetables healthy and safe, prolonging their shelf life much beyond that of fresh produce. Drying used to be as simple as lying the product out on mats, rooftops, or drying floors in the sun, using solar radiation and convective air. Heat is transferred to the fruit or vegetable raw material through convection from the ambient air and radiation from the sun on its surface during sun drying. Since foods to be dried are exposed and climatic changes can occur, the method is highly unsanitary and volatile. Mechanized solar dryers such as tray, carbinet and tunnel dryers have been designed to overcome the challenges of damage, dust, pest infestation and unexpected rainfall encountered in open air drying. In addition, the use of electromagnetic waves in the drying of fruits and vegetables is rapidly increasing. The process involves the use of indirect electroplate heating and vegetal products are dried in less time and at lower temperatures.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 5, 75),
  ('fc830ab6-afe2-5c69-8246-5875f18c09ad'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'READ_ALOUD', E'READ_ALOUD', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'fc830ab6-afe2-5c69-8246-5875f18c09ad'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Counting Seals', E'Counting seals is harder than it may appear. Surveys typically assess numbers at seal breeding beaches, but these figures are skewed because most male fur seals at South Georgia don''t usually breed until they are ten-years old, and then only for two to three years. That means some 80% of the male population is missing from surveys, and how researchers account for this can overstate the overall count.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('fc86160a-be9a-5e22-95a0-83ddf7a42bd9'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'SELECT_MISSING_WORD', E'SELECT_MISSING_WORD', E'LISTENING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'fc86160a-be9a-5e22-95a0-83ddf7a42bd9'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Study of Humanities', E'It''s been suggested that we get rid of the study of humanities altogether. Some say studying subjects like history, philosophy, politics, literature, anthropology, and so on, has no intrinsic value and why should we waste time and energy on courses of study that won''t lead directly to a cut and dried career. They say that what the world needs now is specialists, not generalists. Well, I have to say, I couldn''t disagree more. Of course we want to produce well-informed, literate, highly functioning citizens who make solid contributions to society. That''s an idea that still holds sway - but that''s not the reason that I believe studying the humanities is valuable. People who study a breadth of topics, and who have a diverse range of interests, are actually better problem solvers. This broad education means they can approach an issue - - - .\n\nAt the end of the recording the lost word or group of words has been replaced by a beep. Select the correct option to complete the recording.', 'd5aa7035-70e1-5b53-ac71-0b7b9b080649'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'from a number of angles', NULL, NULL),
  ('fc872a7c-a044-5237-9509-7b50fdba6436'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'LISTENING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'fc872a7c-a044-5237-9509-7b50fdba6436'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'WFD', NULL, '7e966ccb-a169-5894-a173-b1f6226def8e'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'The student advisor was aware that the lecture today has been canceled.', NULL, NULL),
  ('fc87d422-9ae9-5a7e-b43b-e81fbcb8ce03'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'RESPOND_TO_A_SITUATION', E'RESPOND_TO_A_SITUATION', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'fc87d422-9ae9-5a7e-b43b-e81fbcb8ce03'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'A Mess Bike', E'You''ve lent your bicycle to a friend for a few days, but when they return it, you notice it''s covered in mud, the tires are deflated, and there are scratches on the frame. You''re disappointed with the lack of care and want to remind your friend. What would you say to your friend?', 'c7805f9a-4a1b-5f6d-9991-4b2c6957e608'::uuid, NULL, E'Can we talk a bit about bike? I noticed my bike''s pretty messed up after you borrowed it. It''s all good, but next time, could you be a bit more careful? It''s essential to take care of borrowed stuff. Maybe we could chat about setting some ground rules for borrowing things in the future, like making sure it''s returned in the same condition. Let''s make sure we''re on the same page next time. Appreciate it, man!', NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('fc8b6d27-078c-5f2d-97b5-90f5082a0077'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'WRITE_ESSAY', E'WRITE_ESSAY', E'WRITING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'fc8b6d27-078c-5f2d-97b5-90f5082a0077'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Exercise and Study', E'Students should spend the same amount of time doing exercises as they allocate to studying. Do you agree or disagree with it?', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 200, 300),
  ('fc91cabd-fee0-5981-b548-2c1637473a1e'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'LISTENING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'fc91cabd-fee0-5981-b548-2c1637473a1e'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'WFD', NULL, '88b1d3c9-9c34-5d45-897a-7031b0b885db'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'These topics have been discussed by different seminar groups.', NULL, NULL),
  ('fc98defd-52ba-5130-a6d5-0a110f7fb158'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'ANSWER_SHORT_QUESTION', E'ANSWER_SHORT_QUESTION', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'fc98defd-52ba-5130-a6d5-0a110f7fb158'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'ASQ', E'What device is used for breathing?', '70c9ad1b-c3bc-5ae6-a218-020a3ac72fd2'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'Ventilator', NULL, NULL),
  ('fc997d3a-56ca-54d3-9f84-a3bccf93342b'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'REPEAT_SENTENCE', E'REPEAT_SENTENCE', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'fc997d3a-56ca-54d3-9f84-a3bccf93342b'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'RS', NULL, '2b2e3a84-0ca3-50d4-b74b-15eb3cebb600'::uuid, NULL, E'The bus for the airport will arrive soon.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('fca3ef04-da27-5a92-a794-985d0ee25110'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'SUMMARIZE_WRITTEN_TEXT', E'SUMMARIZE_WRITTEN_TEXT', E'WRITING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'fca3ef04-da27-5a92-a794-985d0ee25110'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Climate and Food', E'When major crops wither, it can have knock-on effects across the ocean and show up on your grocery bill. Inflation has been climbing in the United States at the highest rate in 40 years, up 9.1 percent over the past 12 months, much of it the result of spiking food and energy prices. The surge has been egged on by the pandemic-beleaguered supply chain and by Russia''s invasion of Ukraine. But climate change is becoming a driver of inflation, too. Experts are warning that heat, flooding, drought, wildfires and other disasters have been wreaking economic havoc, with worse to come.\n"If we wish to control inflation, we must address climate change now," David A. Super, a professor of law and economics at Georgetown, wrote in The Hill. Beyond crops, the changing climate has driven up the price of lumber as well as insurance premiums.\n"Heatflation" might already have something to do with escalating food costs around the world. A heat wave in India this spring devastated wheat plants, leading it to ban exports. In the United States last year, searing heat and drought in the Great Plains scorched the wheat crop and also enabled wheat-munching grasshopper populations to flourish. The grain''s price nearly doubled to $10.17 a bushel, its highest level since 2008. Extreme temperatures endanger livestock, too: The heat wave that struck much of the country in June caused thousands of cattle to die of heat stress in Kansas.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 5, 75),
  ('fcae1de8-1336-52f7-aa00-a04ff8c453f8'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'SUMMARIZE_WRITTEN_TEXT', E'SUMMARIZE_WRITTEN_TEXT', E'WRITING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'fcae1de8-1336-52f7-aa00-a04ff8c453f8'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Benefits of Physical Activities', E'Promoting active lifestyles can help us address some of the important challenges facing the UK today. Increasing physical activity has the potential to improve the physical and mental health of the nation, reduce all-cause mortality and improve life expectancy. It can also save money by significantly easing the burden of chronic disease on the health and social care services. Increasing cycling and walking will reduce transport costs, save money and help the environment. Fewer car journeys can reduce traffic, congestion and pollution, improving the health of communities.\nOther potential benefits linked to physical activity in children and young people include the acquisition of social skills through active play (leadership, teamwork and co-operation), better concentration in school and displacement of anti-social and criminal behaviour. The importance of physical activity for health was identified over 50 years ago. During the 1950s, comparisons of bus drivers with more physically active bus conductors and office-based telephonists with more physically active postmendemonstrated lower rates of coronary heart disease and smaller uniform sizes in the more physically active occupations.\nThis research led the way for further investigation, and evidence now clearly shows the importance of physical activity in preventing ill health. It is important for us to be active throughout our lives. Physical activity is central to a baby’s normal growth and development. This continues through school, and into adulthood and older years. Being physically active can bring substantial benefits and there is consistent evidence of a dose–response relationship, i.e. the greater the volume of physical activity undertaken, the greater the health benefits that are obtained.', NULL, NULL, E'While increasing physical activity has the potential to not only improve the physical and mental health of the nation but also save money, other potential benefits linked to physical activity in children and young people include the acquisition of social skills, better concentration in school and displacement of anti-social and criminal behaviour, which suggests that promoting active lifestyles can help us address some of the important challenges facing the UK today.', NULL, 5, 75),
  ('fcb382c8-45cc-5bb2-a679-9b11c1a1fa41'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'LISTENING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'fcb382c8-45cc-5bb2-a679-9b11c1a1fa41'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'WFD', NULL, '8a672cc2-f8bc-5230-8d00-4ab6cf2ccb8f'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'There is a lecture going on just in front of the room.', NULL, NULL),
  ('fcb5aa9a-49e1-5078-a4df-879f9b9839b6'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'ANSWER_SHORT_QUESTION', E'ANSWER_SHORT_QUESTION', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'fcb5aa9a-49e1-5078-a4df-879f9b9839b6'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'ASQ', E'Which section of a train timetable will tell you what time your train leaves?', '1a4b3340-e459-5a80-aeb7-6e84532db718'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'Departure', NULL, NULL),
  ('fcb9ccdc-65ec-540d-97de-abe8235d6478'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'REPEAT_SENTENCE', E'REPEAT_SENTENCE', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'fcb9ccdc-65ec-540d-97de-abe8235d6478'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'RS', NULL, '829e6f3e-8fba-5231-98ec-d7fd3dae3942'::uuid, NULL, E'The restaurant is located next to the theater.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('fcba12ef-2b42-581f-b8ba-26013f38db05'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DROPDOWN', E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DROPDOWN', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'fcba12ef-2b42-581f-b8ba-26013f38db05'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Classical Music', E'Away from the rumble of Shanghai''s highways and the cacophony of the shopping districts, stroll down side streets filled with rows of tall brick {{1}} . In the early evening or on a weekend morning, you''ll hear the {{2}} of classical music drifting from a piano, played by a 10-year old or a grandmother in her seventies. Wander down another alley toward concrete {{3}} and you''ll hear Beethoven or Mozart flowing from a violin, or perhaps a cello, accordion or flute. In China, classical music is {{4}} as mightily as the 1812 Overture. Commanding YI00-200 (512.50425) per hour, private music teachers in Shanghai can readily earn more than five times the average per capita monthly income.', NULL, NULL, NULL, E'1.houses, 2.sound, 3.skyscrapers, 4.booming', NULL, NULL),
  ('fcc0f8c1-ff9b-52f1-9a31-4a7f0bd4aabe'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'REPEAT_SENTENCE', E'REPEAT_SENTENCE', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'fcc0f8c1-ff9b-52f1-9a31-4a7f0bd4aabe'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'RS', NULL, '69fff94a-1efa-593b-a9a0-610c005d6dbc'::uuid, NULL, E'The results of the study underscored the discoveries from early detection.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('fcc5a95a-ebfa-5407-a35e-d72fe102c411'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DRAG_AND_DROP', E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DRAG_AND_DROP', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'fcc5a95a-ebfa-5407-a35e-d72fe102c411'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Asking for Leave', E'My son is {{1}} to attend school. On the {{2}} night I found he was {{3}} and now I think it is better for him not to go to school so that we can avoid infection. I believe after some rest he will become {{4}} and will successfully pass his exam. And I am {{5}} to help him catch up on the missed lessons.', NULL, NULL, NULL, E'1.unable, 2.previous, 3.sick, 4.well, 5.happy', NULL, NULL),
  ('fcc719a1-aa3d-531e-bb96-e3bf74c42dfd'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'LISTENING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'fcc719a1-aa3d-531e-bb96-e3bf74c42dfd'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'WFD', NULL, '9617c31c-046d-5e3c-8bb3-dfc271d4bdf3'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'My time spent in the library has been very productive.', NULL, NULL),
  ('fcc7c228-8fde-5ece-8f52-80fbcf506a53'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'WRITE_ESSAY', E'WRITE_ESSAY', E'WRITING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'fcc7c228-8fde-5ece-8f52-80fbcf506a53'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'High Salary', E'Some famous entertainers earn millions of dollars every year. Few people think they deserve such high salaries. What is your opinion?', NULL, NULL, E'The salaries of famous entertainers have been a topic of controversy for many years. While some people believe that they deserve their high salaries, I believe that these salaries are unjustified for two reasons.\nFirstly, the salaries of famous entertainers are often much higher than those of essential workers such as teachers and healthcare professionals. These essential workers provide crucial services to society and are often underpaid and undervalued. In contrast, famous entertainers are often paid exorbitant salaries for providing entertainment that is not essential to society. This is an unfair distribution of resources that perpetuates inequality and devalues the contributions of essential workers.\nSecondly, some famous entertainers engage in controversial or negative behavior that may make their high salaries seem unjustified. This behavior can range from drug use and criminal activity to offensive remarks and actions. When famous entertainers engage in such behavior, it sends a message that such behavior is acceptable or even admirable. This can have harmful effects on society, particularly on young people who may look up to these entertainers as role models.\nIn conclusion, while some people may argue that famous entertainers deserve their high salaries, I believe that these salaries are unjustified. They perpetuate inequality by undervaluing the contributions of essential workers, and they can have harmful effects on society by normalizing controversial or negative behavior. As such, we should reevaluate our priorities as a society and ensure that we are compensating individuals based on their true value to society, rather than on their popularity or fame.', NULL, 200, 300),
  ('fcce2698-0047-59f6-ba3c-b65d4ab00cc8'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'READ_ALOUD', E'READ_ALOUD', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'fcce2698-0047-59f6-ba3c-b65d4ab00cc8'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Alexander Fleming', E'The legendary Alexander Fleming, who famously discovered penicillin, once said ''never to neglect an extraordinary appearance or happening.'' And the path of science often leads to just that. New research is turning the page in our understanding of harmful bacteria and how they turn on certain genes, causing disease in our bodies.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('fcd2fe16-90b8-5004-927c-7d7e247bf96e'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'LISTENING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'fcd2fe16-90b8-5004-927c-7d7e247bf96e'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'WFD', NULL, '8b396b5d-aa4d-571a-9160-19979b195bce'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'Speed measures the rate at which someone or something moves.', NULL, NULL),
  ('fcd38770-ce25-5d17-822e-7413475d5871'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'LISTENING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'fcd38770-ce25-5d17-822e-7413475d5871'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'WFD', NULL, '9aba647d-7dd8-5f29-86b1-9ab8dd4c7b8c'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'Most schools have a wide selection of these books in their libraries.', NULL, NULL),
  ('fcdc29bf-b265-540c-a0bd-21bd374c5652'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'READ_ALOUD', E'READ_ALOUD', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'fcdc29bf-b265-540c-a0bd-21bd374c5652'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Analysts', E'Analysts were impressed by the improvement in margins reported across all regions, apart from the United Kingdom, and said that this reflected a clear effort to improve profitability across the business. Although the turnaround is still in its early stages and the valuation looks full, given the challenge of turning around such a large and complex business, this is certainly an impressive start.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('fce2b556-f4b7-5da1-9f45-1fdeb90410b7'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'LISTENING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'fce2b556-f4b7-5da1-9f45-1fdeb90410b7'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'WFD', NULL, '9f06d271-590c-56d6-8dcc-dcb90fab809d'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'Complete equality within our society remains unrealized to this day.', NULL, NULL),
  ('fce4e812-62fa-5f0a-a0eb-d5d6bd88c598'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'READ_ALOUD', E'READ_ALOUD', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'fce4e812-62fa-5f0a-a0eb-d5d6bd88c598'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Succulent Plants', E'Most succulent plants are found in regions where there is little rainfall, dry air, plenty of sunshine, porous soils and high temperatures during part of the year. These conditions have caused changes in plant structures, which have resulted in greatly increased thickness of stems, leaves and sometimes roots, enabling them to store moisture from the infrequent rains.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
