  ('fdbb2002-61ec-5347-b2b2-bb5d69bba56c'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'READ_ALOUD', E'READ_ALOUD', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'fdbb2002-61ec-5347-b2b2-bb5d69bba56c'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Babylon', E'Outside the biblical tradition, Babylon intrigued Greek and Roman writers, who added to the rich store of legends that have come down to the present day. Popular tales of Babylon’s fantastic structures may also be products of legends and confusion. Yet to historians and archaeologists, Babylon is a real bricks-and-mortar place at the center of the vibrant Mesopotamian culture.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
