  ('fe02881d-74f2-595c-b098-5c50728d3e69'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'WRITE_ESSAY', E'WRITE_ESSAY', E'WRITING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'fe02881d-74f2-595c-b098-5c50728d3e69'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Salary', E'When you look for a job, some people think salary is more important while others think work condition is more important. Which one do you agree with?', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 200, 300),
  ('fe050140-8683-56cc-8313-3a952eafe931'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DRAG_AND_DROP', E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DRAG_AND_DROP', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'fe050140-8683-56cc-8313-3a952eafe931'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Sociology', E'Sociology is, in very basic terms, the study of human societies. In this respect, it is usually {{1}} as one of the social sciences (along with {{2}} like psychology) and was {{3}} as a subject in the late 18th century (through the work of people like the French writer Auguste Comte). However, the subject has only really gained {{5}} as an academic subject in the 20th century through the work of writers such as Emile Durkheim, Max Weber and Talcott Parsons (names that will be visited throughout this course). One name that you may have heard of-Karl Marx (the founder of modern Communism)-has probably done more to stimulate people’s interest in the subject than anyone else, even though he lived and wrote (1818-1884) in a period before sociology became fully established as an academic discipline. Sociology therefore, has a reasonably long history of development, (150-200 years) {{6}} in Britain it has only been in the last 30-40 years that sociology as an examined subject in the education system has achieved a level of importance equivalent to, or above, most of the other subjects it is possible to study.', NULL, NULL, NULL, E'1.classed, 2.subjects, 3.established, 4.acceptance, 5.although', NULL, NULL),
  ('fe085a0e-a540-50d7-bcea-629a33b0d1dd'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DRAG_AND_DROP', E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DRAG_AND_DROP', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'fe085a0e-a540-50d7-bcea-629a33b0d1dd'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Cheating', E'Although not written about extensively, a few individuals have considered the concept and act of cheating in {{1}} as well as contemporary culture. Barton Bowyer writes that cheating "is the advantageous distortion of perceived reality. The advantage falls to the cheater because the cheated person {{2}} what is assumed to be the real world". The cheater is taking advantage of a person, a situation, or {{3}} . Cheating also involves the "distortion of perceived reality" or what others call "deception". Deception can involve hiding the "true" reality or "showing" reality in a way intended to deceive others.', NULL, NULL, NULL, E'1.history, 2.misperceives, 3.both', NULL, NULL),
  ('fe0c846a-e145-591a-bcd6-32b624ea15d7'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DRAG_AND_DROP', E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DRAG_AND_DROP', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'fe0c846a-e145-591a-bcd6-32b624ea15d7'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Renewable Energy', E'Recently, due to concerns over pollution and the possibility that some sources of fuel might eventually run out or become {{1}} to obtain, there has been much greater support for renewable sources of power, such as wind or solar energy.\nRenewable energy sources {{2}} 25 percent of the electricity we use. unlike {{3}} fuels, they tend not to produce any waste or significantly add to global warming by producing gases.', NULL, NULL, NULL, E'1.uneconomic, 2.provide, 3.fossil', NULL, NULL),
  ('fe0cdef2-1458-5912-a4ea-373ff3055cbe'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'READ_ALOUD', E'READ_ALOUD', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'fe0cdef2-1458-5912-a4ea-373ff3055cbe'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'The Reptiles’ Cold Tolerance', E'After the coldest night in south Florida in a decade, lizards were dropping out of palm trees, landing legs up. The scientists who raced to investigate the fallen reptiles have now found that, despite such graceless falls, some of these tropical, cold-blooded creatures are actually more resilient to cold than previously thought.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('fe1c5dcb-de01-5a55-811e-ebaef018a827'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'REPEAT_SENTENCE', E'REPEAT_SENTENCE', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'fe1c5dcb-de01-5a55-811e-ebaef018a827'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'RS', NULL, 'abd5176b-4a7d-5b53-9f84-78277b1a43cd'::uuid, NULL, E'In the top left corner is the Grinding Shop, where the tools were sharpened and finished.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('fe224d05-15ab-5398-9aea-f748bd1cb0a5'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'RE_TELL_LECTURE', E'RE_TELL_LECTURE', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'fe224d05-15ab-5398-9aea-f748bd1cb0a5'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'IT Department', NULL, 'c8ad57d0-4d04-5625-9948-01be9d56397a'::uuid, NULL, E'And our survey, over 100 CEOs who had recently been through an acquisition or merger were asked which areas of their activities needed the most effort. As you can see, the most frequent response to this question was that information technology requires the most integration effort. According to 58 percent of those we surveyed, IT was the most time consuming and needed the most work. This is understandable as many of the IT issues are extremely complex and the consequences of any change in IT can have a significant impact. The key is how quickly and effectively IT integration can be achieved and there has to be a clear understanding of the consequences there maybe of not getting it right. The two other areas requiring significant attention, sales, marketing and business development on the one hand and financial management on the other, both were selected by forty nine percent of the respondents.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('fe278ca5-f9f8-5cee-9955-40ee6cc86cb0'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'ANSWER_SHORT_QUESTION', E'ANSWER_SHORT_QUESTION', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'fe278ca5-f9f8-5cee-9955-40ee6cc86cb0'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'ASQ', E'What do we use to launch a space shuttle?', '6534a53d-3f6d-5d11-9f06-f53e0423a801'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'Rocket / Booster', NULL, NULL),
  ('fe2d9ff2-aab7-5892-9658-01fe336f9c0c'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'REPEAT_SENTENCE', E'REPEAT_SENTENCE', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'fe2d9ff2-aab7-5892-9658-01fe336f9c0c'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'RS', NULL, '905538c0-aedd-541a-abdd-cb21d6b87e00'::uuid, NULL, E'You need to work harder to achieve your professional goals.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('fe2dea11-5642-54c5-9c20-24c9c1c60ed1'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'LISTENING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'fe2dea11-5642-54c5-9c20-24c9c1c60ed1'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'WFD', NULL, 'deda3dcb-f98e-548c-962c-e6ddc9a83580'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'A good scientific paper should have clear arguments.', NULL, NULL),
  ('fe2e1e2a-c6b7-5176-9bbd-9c4b97046a55'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'REPEAT_SENTENCE', E'REPEAT_SENTENCE', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'fe2e1e2a-c6b7-5176-9bbd-9c4b97046a55'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'RS', NULL, 'a15fb3f3-127e-534c-8cae-7019c93d6e77'::uuid, NULL, E'I have to get up early for an interview tomorrow.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('fe35be1e-b216-5d26-a9da-7e6262e4c663'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'ANSWER_SHORT_QUESTION', E'ANSWER_SHORT_QUESTION', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'fe35be1e-b216-5d26-a9da-7e6262e4c663'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'ASQ', E'What is the term for a group of cells in an organism that are similar in structure and function?', '6f601904-172a-53a8-ad07-bf8b02455176'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'Tissue', NULL, NULL),
  ('fe3b0f39-d085-50de-9ba2-d17dfb56a5f4'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'RE_TELL_LECTURE', E'RE_TELL_LECTURE', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'fe3b0f39-d085-50de-9ba2-d17dfb56a5f4'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Cultural Traditions', NULL, '643195d2-01e8-5d80-9dad-38808c459ebf'::uuid, NULL, E'In the tapestry of human history, cultural traditions form the vibrant threads that bind us to our heritage. These customs are a gateway to understanding the diverse ways in which societies celebrate, mourn, and mark the passage of time. For instance, festivals around the world are not just spectacles of joy; they are profound expressions of communal identity and continuity. In parallel, traditional cuisines offer more than a feast for the senses - they are historical records on a plate. They tell stories of migration, trade, and innovation, shaping a nation''s palate while reflecting its ecological and economic narrative. As university students, we stand to enrich our minds and souls by exploring these customs. Let us embrace cultural traditions as a means to foster global understanding and to weave the social fabric that connects us all.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('fe3b4da0-d0a7-5b83-968b-a90608ece347'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'WRITE_ESSAY', E'WRITE_ESSAY', E'WRITING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'fe3b4da0-d0a7-5b83-968b-a90608ece347'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Computer', E'Some people say that computers have made life easier and more convenient. Other people say that computers have made life more complex and stressful. Do you agree with that?', NULL, NULL, E'The debate over whether computers have made life easier or more complex has been ongoing for years. While some people believe that computers have made life more stressful, I believe that computers have made life easier and more convenient. This essay will argue that computers have revolutionized the way we live, work, and communicate, making life more efficient and productive.\nComputers have made communication easier and more convenient, allowing people to connect with others across the world in real-time. With the advent of email, social media, and instant messaging, people can now communicate with friends, family, and colleagues regardless of distance or time zone. Additionally, video conferencing software has made remote work and collaboration more feasible, allowing people to work from anywhere in the world.\nComputers have increased efficiency and productivity in the workplace, making tasks easier and faster to accomplish. With the use of computers and software programs, tasks that once took hours or even days to complete can now be done in minutes. Additionally, computers have made it possible to store and retrieve vast amounts of information quickly and easily, making research and data analysis more efficient.\nIn conclusion, I believe that computers have made life easier and more convenient. While some may argue that computers have made life more complex and stressful, they have revolutionized the way we live, work, and communicate.', NULL, 200, 300),
  ('fe425ff5-6bc7-56bd-b6ea-f5f02c5874c6'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'LISTENING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'fe425ff5-6bc7-56bd-b6ea-f5f02c5874c6'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'WFD', NULL, 'ffbd42df-4874-5973-a81b-c48381e4d2bc'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'The reading list will be available before the course begins.', NULL, NULL),
  ('fe45d5fc-f800-5967-ac60-2947873decbb'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'LISTENING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'fe45d5fc-f800-5967-ac60-2947873decbb'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'WFD', NULL, 'cf47a06f-edd2-57ac-976f-ca16d2ba5378'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'The reason for the decline of enrollment is unclear.', NULL, NULL),
  ('fe549cc2-3588-5b43-bb24-a696945834a8'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'READ_ALOUD', E'READ_ALOUD', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'fe549cc2-3588-5b43-bb24-a696945834a8'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Tortoises', E'Tortoises, a group of reptiles belonging to the Testudinidae family, are intriguing creatures with unique biological characteristics. These chelonians have evolved over millions of years, adapting to various ecosystems around the world. Their most distinctive feature is their shell, which consists of an upper carapace and a lower plastron, providing exceptional protection against predators and environmental challenges.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('fe564292-80bf-5664-b57f-ea14607a116d'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'RE_TELL_LECTURE', E'RE_TELL_LECTURE', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'fe564292-80bf-5664-b57f-ea14607a116d'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Photography', NULL, 'e9a7655d-89b0-58a6-85b9-53ed3bdf8723'::uuid, NULL, E'Photography, since its inception, has not just been about creating images; it''s a powerful tool that chronicles our world and experiences. The journey of photography began in the early 19th century with the daguerreotype, a process that created a single, unique image. This invention revolutionized the way we document life, making it possible to preserve moments in time forever. Since then, photography has undergone tremendous changes, from the introduction of color and digital photography to today''s advanced smartphone cameras. Photography has played a crucial role in historical documentation, giving us visual insights into past events and cultures. Iconic photographs have the power to evoke emotions, provoke thought, and sometimes even spur social change. They serve as windows into times and places that words alone cannot fully capture. Moreover, the digital era has democratized photography, making it more accessible and allowing people from all over the world to share their perspectives and stories. The rise of social media has further amplified this, transforming how we communicate and view the world. In conclusion, the evolution of photography reflects the evolution of human expression and connection. It reminds us of the power of a single image to capture the complexities of life and history.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('fe567588-1360-5d0d-abae-b49a37f8b0e5'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'RE_ORDER_PARAGRAPHS', E'RE_ORDER_PARAGRAPHS', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'fe567588-1360-5d0d-abae-b49a37f8b0e5'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Immune System', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, E'2, 3, 1, 4', NULL, NULL),
  ('fe59eac8-c160-5ca0-b93e-6526f871c161'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'LISTENING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'fe59eac8-c160-5ca0-b93e-6526f871c161'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'WFD', NULL, 'f0c49e93-f119-5c47-ba2c-6364e471fa44'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'The student graduation is a ceremony that''s known by many.', NULL, NULL),
  ('fe5b7795-0e39-5b1b-ad7b-66708d8197fa'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'LISTENING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'fe5b7795-0e39-5b1b-ad7b-66708d8197fa'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'WFD', NULL, '93045a11-4da1-5f75-a50f-79ddb86d4a4b'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'Most homebuyers receive a loan from the bank.', NULL, NULL),
  ('fe606f85-1d78-5df3-b810-2cb9d0df1afa'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'RE_TELL_LECTURE', E'RE_TELL_LECTURE', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'fe606f85-1d78-5df3-b810-2cb9d0df1afa'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Tesla', NULL, '076165c6-bfdb-5f95-944d-e97361f098cb'::uuid, NULL, E'Today, I am eager to talk about Nikola Tesla, a visionary inventor whose innovations went far beyond his time and continue to influence our lives today. Tesla''s story is not just about his inventions; it''s about his extraordinary imagination and perseverance in the face of adversity. Nikola Tesla, often overshadowed by his contemporaries, was a prolific inventor and a brilliant mind. He is best known for his development of the alternating current (AC) electrical system, which is still the standard for global power distribution. This system enabled the efficient transmission of electricity over long distances, revolutionizing the way we use energy. Tesla''s contributions weren''t limited to electricity. He had a hand in the creation of radio, wireless communication, and even concepts that laid the groundwork for modern-day robotics. His foresight in these fields showed a man thinking far ahead of his time. Nikola Tesla''s legacy is a testament to the power of innovative thinking and relentless pursuit of scientific discovery. He reminds us that the ideas and creations of one individual can change the course of history.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('fe666557-f542-5a73-898d-19c0cf29d46a'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DROPDOWN', E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DROPDOWN', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'fe666557-f542-5a73-898d-19c0cf29d46a'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Language Extinct', E'At the moment, there are between six and seven thousand languages in the world. According to linguists, fifty percent of these are in danger {{1}} extinct. The speed of language loss has accelerated over the past few decades because businesses that need to communicate with a range of people from other cultures {{2}} to employ more widely used languages, such as English, Chinese, or Spanish. This attitude is understandable, but it means that many local languages are dying out before anyone {{3}} the opportunity to study them. According to linguists, some of these languages could reveal a great {{4}} of useful information about language learning and cognitive development. In addition, a local language that has been built on the local culture contains words and phrases that express that culture; lose the language and you arguably may lose the culture, too. And finally, historians will {{5}} that a language contains evidence of a region''s history and should, for that reason alone, be preserved.', NULL, NULL, NULL, E'1.of becoming, 2.prefer, 3.has had, 4.deal, 5.argue', NULL, NULL),
  ('fe6a8ccc-bf77-516e-856f-17ece4b1949a'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DROPDOWN', E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DROPDOWN', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'fe6a8ccc-bf77-516e-856f-17ece4b1949a'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Automated Laboratories', E'Automated laboratories are capable of conducting thousands of experiments at a pace far {{1}} human capabilities, operating continuously without the need for rest. This unprecedented efficiency has the potential to significantly {{2}} the pace of scientific discovery. In various fields of study, self-driving labs have already demonstrated their utility. They have been instrumental in the discovery of new materials, optimization of chemical reactions, and testing of potential drug candidates. The ability to automate these processes not only enhances productivity but also mitigates the {{3}} of human error. However, the proliferation of self-driving labs is not without its challenges. Ensuring the quality and reproducibility of results, {{4}} and explaining findings, and striking a balance between human oversight and autonomy are all pressing concerns. As these labs become {{5}} prevalent and sophisticated, they necessitate the development of new ethical and legal frameworks.', NULL, NULL, NULL, E'1.exceeding, 2.accelerate, 3.risk, 4.interpreting, 5.increasingly', NULL, NULL),
  ('fe715158-4ab7-531b-a4cc-2fd0875a4bb6'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'RE_ORDER_PARAGRAPHS', E'RE_ORDER_PARAGRAPHS', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'fe715158-4ab7-531b-a4cc-2fd0875a4bb6'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Rock Music', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, E'1, 2, 4, 3', NULL, NULL),
  ('fe715849-20ee-5fbc-80b3-48eb44ffd15d'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'SUMMARIZE_WRITTEN_TEXT', E'SUMMARIZE_WRITTEN_TEXT', E'WRITING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'fe715849-20ee-5fbc-80b3-48eb44ffd15d'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Travellng Solo', E'Traveling solo is for many still a scary concept. However, the benefits to traveling by yourself are numerous. You make your own plans, eat whatever you want, stay longer or leave sooner, talk to the people you like, etc. But there is more: traveling solo can have a positive impact on your personality as well. You can grow as a person, learn more about yourself and return a happier person. Traveling alone means having the ultimate freedom to do whatever you want (within the boundaries of the law of course). Who has never had an argument with his/her traveling partner because you have different opinions on how to fill in your travel itinerary? Traveling solo means doing whatever you want, whether you want to plan everything out or set out spontaneously.\nGo find yourself'', we have all heard the cliché, but how can you actually do it? We should rephrase the statement from ''go find yourself'' to ''go discover your independence'' because that is what you are actually doing. The feeling of accomplishment derived from successfully completing your first solo trip is hard to match. You will discover how you behave and react in unpredictable situations abroad and your confidence will get a definite boost!\nNo matter what you do on a solo trip, it will feel adventurous. You step out your comfort zone, travel to a place you maybe have never been before, meet new people that will leave lasting memories, and so much more. Things that would never happen within the same confines of your home happen on a daily basis when you decide to travel solo.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 5, 75),
  ('fe75bb04-9c01-587c-9978-135c6fa7f8a5'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'LISTENING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'fe75bb04-9c01-587c-9978-135c6fa7f8a5'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'WFD', NULL, 'e9289c48-0506-515e-b606-7bd1a605a7fd'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'Near the campus bookstore, students can conveniently find a pharmacy.', NULL, NULL),
  ('fe7c389a-5b3f-510a-9fad-6b7e8a5753e5'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'LISTENING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'fe7c389a-5b3f-510a-9fad-6b7e8a5753e5'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'WFD', NULL, '964f86c4-a7a2-5172-a84a-5ab547c4c875'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'The university provides free accommodation for its students.', NULL, NULL),
  ('fe7edc59-4e5c-5780-8af7-13b610622c69'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'READ_ALOUD', E'READ_ALOUD', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'fe7edc59-4e5c-5780-8af7-13b610622c69'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Recycled Plastics', E'When researchers analyzed pellets made from recycled plastic gathered in 13 countries, they discovered numerous harmful substances, such as pesticides and pharmaceuticals. As a result, the scientists concluded that recycled plastics are unsuitable for many applications and pose a challenge to the establishment of a circular economy.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('fe808e15-b71d-596a-8695-6fb15b5941b5'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DRAG_AND_DROP', E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DRAG_AND_DROP', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'fe808e15-b71d-596a-8695-6fb15b5941b5'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'World Factory', E'In China''s modern day economic history the Open Door Policy refers to the new policy {{1}} by Deng Xiaoping in December 1978 to open the door to foreign businesses that wanted to set up in China. Special Economic Zones (SEZ) were set up in 1980 in his {{2}} that in order to modernize China''s industry and {{3}} its economy, it needed to welcome foreign direct investment. Chinese economic policy then {{4}} to encouraging and supporting foreign trade & investment. It is the turning point in China economic fortune that {{5}} started China on the path to becoming ''The World''s Factory''.', NULL, NULL, NULL, E'1.announced, 2.belief, 3.boost, 4.shifted, 5.truly', NULL, NULL),
  ('fe80cab9-bc1e-5a1b-b88e-cf36f51afe50'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'REPEAT_SENTENCE', E'REPEAT_SENTENCE', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'fe80cab9-bc1e-5a1b-b88e-cf36f51afe50'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'RS', NULL, '6b483aea-3ff2-5778-9a7b-0a1030398a12'::uuid, NULL, E'The data infer that further research is needed.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('fe875765-9dd1-5be9-9c0a-b276d6be0cec'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'RE_TELL_LECTURE', E'RE_TELL_LECTURE', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'fe875765-9dd1-5be9-9c0a-b276d6be0cec'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Earth History', NULL, 'a58f2794-328e-54c9-b606-7d046e0bbb35'::uuid, NULL, E'Unlike the Moon — our dead, rocky companion — the Earth is alive, pulsing with creative and destructive forces that power its geological metabolism. Lunar rocks brought back by the Apollo astronauts all date back to about the age of the Solar System. Moon rocks are forever. Earth rocks, on the other hand, face the perils of a living lithosphere. All will suffer ruination, through some combination of mutilation, compression, folding, tearing, scorching and baking. Thus, the volumes of Earth history are incomplete and disheveled. The library is vast and magnificent — but decrepit. And it was this tattered complexity in the rock record that obscured its meaning until relatively recently. Nature provided no card catalog for geologists — this would have to be invented. Five thousand years after the Sumerians learned to record their thoughts on clay tablets, the Earth’s volumes remained inscrutable to humans. We were geologically illiterate, unaware of the antiquity of our own planet and ignorant of our connection to deep time. It wasn’t until the turn of the 19th century that our blinders were removed.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('fe8e5c65-b0b5-5640-bd18-5f3c48cd1991'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'READ_ALOUD', E'READ_ALOUD', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'fe8e5c65-b0b5-5640-bd18-5f3c48cd1991'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Blood Sugar', E'Most of the food you eat is broken down into sugar and released into your bloodstream. When your blood sugar goes up, it signals your pancreas to release insulin. When there isn’t enough insulin or cells stop responding to insulin, too much blood sugar stays in your bloodstream. Over time, that can cause serious health problems, such as diabetes.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('fe92a700-9a31-5968-89ff-b515ba033d03'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'READ_ALOUD', E'READ_ALOUD', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'fe92a700-9a31-5968-89ff-b515ba033d03'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'US Student Debt', E'The numbers on U.S. student debt, after all, are truly staggering. The average 2015 U.S. university graduate who took out loans to help pay for tuition enters the workforce with thirty-five thousand dollars in student debt. In the U.S., total student debt exceeds one point one five trillion dollars — dwarfing, for instance, the nation''s credit card debt.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('fe92e2f5-3a41-5a41-8411-ee17d5b97bce'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'ANSWER_SHORT_QUESTION', E'ANSWER_SHORT_QUESTION', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'fe92e2f5-3a41-5a41-8411-ee17d5b97bce'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'ASQ', E'What do you call a person who is suspected by the police?', 'acd17f67-5e4d-53b8-8012-2db9e55adc38'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'Suspect', NULL, NULL),
  ('fe96af5c-4936-5636-9fbf-48c816f79ec4'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DROPDOWN', E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DROPDOWN', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'fe96af5c-4936-5636-9fbf-48c816f79ec4'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Important Corollary', E'An important corollary of this focus on language as the window to legal epistemology is the central role of {{1}} to law and other sociocultural processes. In particular, the {{2}} that people hold about how language works combine with {{3}} structuring to create powerful, often unconscious effects. In recent years, {{4}} anthropologists have made much progress in developing more precisely analytic {{5}} for tracking those effects.', NULL, NULL, NULL, E'1.discourse, 2.ideas, 3.linguistic, 4.linguistic, 5.tools', NULL, NULL),
  ('fe9d0ef0-dd41-59a4-b589-fce8440e9670'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'LISTENING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'fe9d0ef0-dd41-59a4-b589-fce8440e9670'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'WFD', NULL, '5394cf3e-af43-5cf7-9060-60e1112a7d72'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'Behind the barn, you''ll find a flat cart pulled by mules.', NULL, NULL),
  ('fea42dfd-b75f-5b0a-a157-78b25d019f55'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DROPDOWN', E'FILL_IN_THE_BLANKS_DROPDOWN', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'fea42dfd-b75f-5b0a-a157-78b25d019f55'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Vikings', E'The Vikings were brave people who loved to sail the seas. They traveled far from their homes in Scandinavia, going to places as distant as North America and the Mediterranean Sea. They sailed in longships, {{1}} were long, narrow boats that moved fast and could {{2}} big waves. On a Viking longship, you would see things needed for their trips. They had oars and sails to move the ship, and special stones to find their way when the sun wasn’t visible. The Vikings also took weapons for protection and food like dried fish and grains for eating. In a Viking village, everyone had important work. The men went on voyages, {{3}} in battles, and caught fish. The women took care of the home, {{4}} crops, and made clothes. They also {{5}} after the children and taught them about Viking traditions. Every person, young or old, had a role in keeping their community strong.', NULL, NULL, NULL, E'1.which, 2.handle, 3.fought, 4.grew, 5.looked', NULL, NULL),
  ('fea4d84d-75a9-5e23-b7f3-784914033d7d'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'ANSWER_SHORT_QUESTION', E'ANSWER_SHORT_QUESTION', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'fea4d84d-75a9-5e23-b7f3-784914033d7d'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'ASQ', E'This work is due for submission, one month from the fifteenth of June. On what date is it to be submitted?', 'df998e56-a392-59ed-9515-bbf2bc3f762f'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'Fifteenth of July', NULL, NULL),
  ('fea57248-5ebc-56f6-ba53-d50f92750dc9'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'LISTENING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'fea57248-5ebc-56f6-ba53-d50f92750dc9'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'WFD', NULL, '1434d972-833d-5741-9ecf-7edaf78f3a25'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'Marketing is a very important activity for many new businesses.', NULL, NULL),
  ('feaa94f4-dddc-5047-9355-c5e0700ebe98'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'MC_LISTENING_SINGLE', E'MC_LISTENING_SINGLE', E'LISTENING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'feaa94f4-dddc-5047-9355-c5e0700ebe98'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Blood Donation', E'Now the average adult has about five liters of blood flowing inside his body. Blood is the fluid of life growth and health. It transports oxygen from the lungs to body tissue and carbon dioxide from body tissue to the lungs. It transports nourishment from digestion and hormones from glands throughout the body. It transports disease, finding substances to tissues and waste to the kidneys. Blood is alive because it contains living cells. Red blood cells and white blood cells are responsible for nourishing and cleansing the body. Since the cells are alive, they need nourishment. Vitamins and minerals keep the blood healthy blood cells have a definite life cycle, just as all living organisms do. Approximately fifty five percent of blood is plasma. A strong colored clear liquid liquid plasma carries the solid cells and platelets when the human body loses a little bit of blood through a minor wound. The blate let''s help the blood clot so that the bleeding stops. You would bleed to death without the platelets. Your body is always making new blood inside your bones. When the human body loses a lot of blood through a major wound, that blood has to be replaced through a blood transfusion from other people. But everybody''s blood is not the same. There are four different blood types plus your body has rh factors which make it even more unique. Blood received through a transfusion must match your own. Sometimes patients donate their own blood when they are scheduled to have major surgery so that they will have a perfect match. It is called an autologous blood donation.\n\nAccording to the professor, what was the main reason that patients donated their own blood?', '4c9f3f5e-d64a-5d28-87bf-759bdbcffa16'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'To have a perfect blood match for transfusions', NULL, NULL),
  ('feac4317-9736-59c9-bb20-7664121c4c68'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'RE_ORDER_PARAGRAPHS', E'RE_ORDER_PARAGRAPHS', E'READING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'feac4317-9736-59c9-bb20-7664121c4c68'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Technology and Work', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, E'1, 2, 3, 4', NULL, NULL),
  ('feac7e6b-ea8b-532a-bde3-f5cfd63df6fd'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'REPEAT_SENTENCE', E'REPEAT_SENTENCE', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'feac7e6b-ea8b-532a-bde3-f5cfd63df6fd'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'RS', NULL, '47672d82-7395-5b9f-b1f7-f3b204a7aef5'::uuid, NULL, E'Science''s solutions often outweigh the problems they can bring to society.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('feacd2b6-ca5c-5423-9643-49581bad967b'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'LISTENING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'feacd2b6-ca5c-5423-9643-49581bad967b'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'WFD', NULL, '8b9a7846-83a1-54ec-8954-76afd21b6330'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'It is important to allocate your time wisely when revising.', NULL, NULL),
  ('feb02f4a-12e3-5e12-a57b-06914a9f1357'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'REPEAT_SENTENCE', E'REPEAT_SENTENCE', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'feb02f4a-12e3-5e12-a57b-06914a9f1357'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'RS', NULL, 'e9c6d9a1-9995-5326-99de-e2b75e88cd9c'::uuid, NULL, E'Unfortunately, the two most interesting economics electives clash on my timetable.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('feb5b32c-6048-5e87-ac9d-e7f82269532f'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'MC_LISTENING_SINGLE', E'MC_LISTENING_SINGLE', E'LISTENING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'feb5b32c-6048-5e87-ac9d-e7f82269532f'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Friendship & Money', E'There''s a complicated dance we all do when it comes to friendships and money. Having friends means going out, doing activities together - in short, spending money. All of my friends are from different backgrounds and make different salaries and have different values when it comes to saving and spending money, so I still don''t know what the proper etiquette is when the bill comes. I haven''t yet mastered the dance. And to make matters worse, since I moved to New York City, a lot of these insecurities have been turbocharged because this city is home to some super rich people. It''s all very confusing, made nearly incomprehensible because we just don''t talk about this kind of thing - I mean, not really.\n\nWhy does the speaker feel that things are getting worse after she moved to New York City?', '33159b12-37a8-510d-a8a5-c416eb50a84a'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'People there always avoid talking about the issue.', NULL, NULL),
  ('febe432f-8ccd-5804-ac50-f3f31b09f98a'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'LISTENING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'febe432f-8ccd-5804-ac50-f3f31b09f98a'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'WFD', NULL, '0dd824b7-2516-5d55-85c5-4536d5efc439'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'The university library has most of the necessary books.', NULL, NULL),
  ('fec4e043-0199-59e4-b9e8-a6da8e48ffb2'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'WRITE_FROM_DICTATION', E'LISTENING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'fec4e043-0199-59e4-b9e8-a6da8e48ffb2'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'WFD', NULL, '2f1737fe-1a49-53a5-a1b3-441aa7180a7e'::uuid, NULL, NULL, E'The theme park is very popular among local people and tourists.', NULL, NULL),
  ('fec633bc-2f83-5dbb-a91e-48889814a7da'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'RESPOND_TO_A_SITUATION', E'RESPOND_TO_A_SITUATION', E'SPEAKING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'fec633bc-2f83-5dbb-a91e-48889814a7da'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Wellness Program', E'You''re organizing a company-wide wellness program, and your team proposes implementing a mandatory daily yoga session for all employees. However, you realize that not everyone may be interested in or able to participate in yoga. You need to gently guide the discussion towards alternative wellness activities that accommodate different preferences and abilities. What would you say to your team?', '959fb58d-8c58-5cad-a8d0-085acde06f7d'::uuid, NULL, E'Hey team, I appreciate the suggestion for the wellness program. However, let''s consider offering a variety of activities to cater to everyone''s interests and abilities. How about incorporating options like walking or jogging groups, meditation sessions, or even desk stretches? This way, we can ensure that everyone can participate in activities that resonate with them and contribute to their overall well-being. Let''s make our wellness program inclusive and enjoyable for all.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
  ('fec87f96-5a38-5192-aac9-5625dede9573'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'SUMMARIZE_WRITTEN_TEXT', E'SUMMARIZE_WRITTEN_TEXT', E'WRITING', E'SHARED', NULL, E'APPROVED', 'fec87f96-5a38-5192-aac9-5625dede9573'::uuid, 1, NULL, TRUE, 0, NULL, E'Herbal Medicine', E'In recent years, there has been a resurgence of interest in ancient herbal medicine, an age-old practice that dates back centuries in various cultures and regions. This revival is not only shedding light on historical remedies but also offering new insights into modern healthcare.\nHistorically, different nations and tribes have cultivated a wealth of herbal knowledge passed down through generations. These herbal remedies were often rooted in the local environment and shaped by cultural traditions. However, with the advent of modern medicine, many of these traditional practices were overshadowed and forgotten.\nRecent research has rekindled interest in these age-old herbal remedies. Scientists and herbalists are delving into historical texts, collaborating with indigenous communities, and conducting studies to rediscover the medicinal properties of these plants. What they have found is a treasure trove of potential treatments for various ailments.\nOne remarkable example is the use of Artemisia annua, or sweet wormwood, in treating malaria. This plant has been used for centuries in traditional Chinese medicine. In the modern era, scientists have identified the active compound artemisinin, which is now a cornerstone in the fight against malaria.\nThis renaissance of ancient herbal medicine is not limited to a single culture or region. It extends to indigenous tribes in various parts of the world, revealing the potential for sustainable and culturally relevant healthcare solutions.\nIn conclusion, the revival of ancient herbal medicine offers a bridge between history and modern science, showcasing the valuable insights and remedies that traditional cultures have passed down for generations. This reconnection with the past holds promise for enriching our understanding of healthcare and exploring new avenues for treatment in the 21st century.', NULL, NULL, E'In recent years, there has been a global resurgence of interest in ancient herbal medicine, not only uncovering historically forgotten treatments but also offering fresh perspectives in modern healthcare; this revival involves studying historical texts, collaborating with indigenous communities, and rediscovering the medicinal properties of plants, such as the successful use of Artemisia annua in treating malaria, demonstrating the immense potential of combining ancient wisdom with contemporary science.', NULL, 5, 75),
