  ('edd503ee-054d-5a66-ad36-484080ece16e'::uuid, '0d5774b6-1703-59be-9077-389aa9a3daa5'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'maintained', FALSE, 6, NULL, NULL),
  ('72d21bfd-a3ee-5768-a69b-1c4cba043966'::uuid, '0d58f279-058b-52a3-a607-64205846f482'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'At the turn of the 19th century, however, only a relatively small sector of the British economy had been directly affected by the Industrial Revolution.', FALSE, 0, NULL, NULL),
  ('7ee616ec-8f71-5820-945f-9b136ba49df6'::uuid, '0d58f279-058b-52a3-a607-64205846f482'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'For each of the three major countries of western Europe - Britain, France, and Germany - the closing decades of the 18th century were years of increasing economic prosperity, and the pace of economic development in Britain far outdid that of the others.', FALSE, 1, NULL, NULL),
  ('ffb20e62-9e44-5f17-9ea4-c439308f549f'::uuid, '0d58f279-058b-52a3-a607-64205846f482'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'It would be a mistake to call the other two countries underdeveloped - in terms of cultural achievement, especially literature, art, and philosophy, they outstripped Britain - but they lagged behind in terms of economic development.', FALSE, 2, NULL, NULL),
  ('bb0d1196-9788-533e-8443-b2fa7bb093a3'::uuid, '0d58f279-058b-52a3-a607-64205846f482'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'Even two decades later, the picture was little different, except that cotton had become the country’s leading manufacturing industry. It was not until the middle of the century that it could be properly described as an industrial society.', FALSE, 3, NULL, NULL),
  ('346f589d-89fb-5ee3-aafa-9271e38db939'::uuid, '0d6bc592-b566-5a39-b7d7-1d6ee161a755'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'The fledgling plants were often yellowed and failing, and Simard found that those trees were missing the resources that exist within a diverse community of plants.', FALSE, 0, NULL, NULL),
  ('55a8618a-810b-58e5-843a-aa0b80a7b7ce'::uuid, '0d6bc592-b566-5a39-b7d7-1d6ee161a755'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'Simard was born in the Monashee Mountains of British Columbia in 1960.', FALSE, 1, NULL, NULL),
  ('d12bb1c7-e010-5260-a0e5-cc8df5476dfd'::uuid, '0d6bc592-b566-5a39-b7d7-1d6ee161a755'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'Her job was to check on seedlings the firm had planted in those areas to restart the forest.', FALSE, 2, NULL, NULL),
  ('96e68fec-17b1-54c9-8f5a-af8663e502e0'::uuid, '0d6bc592-b566-5a39-b7d7-1d6ee161a755'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'In her first stab at a career, she also joined a commercial logging company that clear-cut with large machinery.', FALSE, 3, NULL, NULL),
  ('6b06e91c-2c74-5524-b496-cb2ae0c39d85'::uuid, '0d6bc592-b566-5a39-b7d7-1d6ee161a755'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'Her family of loggers selectively cut trees and dragged them out with horses, leaving plenty still standing.', FALSE, 4, NULL, NULL),
  ('486000df-d4ab-5038-9d06-3698cfa8a3dc'::uuid, '0d74e2ae-dc84-5d8c-bbbe-b6fd39df8781'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'The extent of the loss was, however, largely a matter of expert guessing. Last week a well-rounded study was published.', FALSE, 0, NULL, NULL),
  ('f4baf36b-d18a-5a6e-a3f6-0771dcaaa714'::uuid, '0d74e2ae-dc84-5d8c-bbbe-b6fd39df8781'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'Educators are seriously concerned about the high rate of dropouts among the doctor of philosophy candidates and the consequent loss of talent to a nation in need of PhDs.', FALSE, 1, NULL, NULL),
  ('5fdff7bb-03a1-5163-a80e-cd01ea0e80c1'::uuid, '0d74e2ae-dc84-5d8c-bbbe-b6fd39df8781'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'Some have placed the dropouts loss as high as 50 percent.', FALSE, 2, NULL, NULL),
