  ('30bdc84d-a265-5218-bfce-765cd7d0105a'::uuid, '10af448d-2aa1-59b0-aaa3-e4327141e2bc'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'Few communities have the chance to create something brand-new on a significant piece of land — and even fewer can develop that land in a way that confronts climate change, generates jobs, and attracts investment.', FALSE, 0, NULL, NULL),
  ('ab7b6455-dac3-533b-a1db-40c5fca3befd'::uuid, '10af448d-2aa1-59b0-aaa3-e4327141e2bc'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'Land is scarce in many parts of our fast-urbanizing world.', FALSE, 1, NULL, NULL),
  ('23ffd341-ac75-5825-b732-e5b3f6a28dbf'::uuid, '10af448d-2aa1-59b0-aaa3-e4327141e2bc'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'In those regions, the transition away from coal offers the prospect of re-purposing post-mining land — fueling both economic opportunities and clean energy.', FALSE, 2, NULL, NULL),
  ('ad84c9ae-d423-509e-a3b4-9354fcb5b58c'::uuid, '10af448d-2aa1-59b0-aaa3-e4327141e2bc'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'But that opportunity is now presenting itself in Bosnia, Greece, Poland, Serbia and soon in the very large coal-producing and consuming economies in South and East Asia.', FALSE, 3, NULL, NULL),
  ('fb7d5099-d0e8-5960-a142-227b993f0180'::uuid, '10b57dc9-77c8-5fc4-b0f3-412ace50dacd'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'Initially, all methods showed similar immediate retention rates.', FALSE, 0, NULL, NULL),
  ('0342b02a-d866-5ba6-87fa-57a3a94c6397'::uuid, '10b57dc9-77c8-5fc4-b0f3-412ace50dacd'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'After one week, however, the interactive method demonstrated significantly higher retention, suggesting its superiority for long-term memory retention.', FALSE, 1, NULL, NULL),
  ('6161318c-81d1-5ad8-aa4b-bc5a2b26f1e8'::uuid, '10b57dc9-77c8-5fc4-b0f3-412ace50dacd'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'One experiment was conducted to evaluate the effectiveness of different learning techniques on memory retention.', FALSE, 2, NULL, NULL),
  ('32a0643f-d61f-57dd-aef9-b36e92511625'::uuid, '10b57dc9-77c8-5fc4-b0f3-412ace50dacd'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'In this experiment, participants were taught using visual aids, auditory lectures, and interactive methods.', FALSE, 3, NULL, NULL),
  ('53a5cc8b-fa65-5419-840c-dc58a88a2757'::uuid, '10cfee80-3abd-527e-b00d-aec9fc743a21'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'To gain awareness of what we’re feeling, we need to cultivate an observer’s stance so that we can clean the fridge in our dorm room the night before the final exam, and therefore, we’re more likely to overcome procrastination.', FALSE, 0, NULL, NULL),
  ('991fe43b-2dae-57df-91f3-1058ea597e3f'::uuid, '10cfee80-3abd-527e-b00d-aec9fc743a21'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'By cultivating an observer’s stance, we could have a greater awareness of our tendencies and motivations, and we’re more likely to overcome avoidance motives.', FALSE, 1, NULL, NULL),
  ('3f4e4376-bc35-5521-94e8-81354c8c3d20'::uuid, '10cfee80-3abd-527e-b00d-aec9fc743a21'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'To overcome procrastination, we should ask ourselves whether we have checked our email and whether we are doing the task on the low-important item on our list.', FALSE, 2, NULL, NULL),
  ('c65b8ceb-e09f-5246-8f5e-0e7fe5d02b4a'::uuid, '10cfee80-3abd-527e-b00d-aec9fc743a21'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'To overcome procrastination, we should gain awareness of our approach motives or avoidance motives when doing things, which means that we need to cultivate an observer’s stance to examine ourselves.', TRUE, 3, NULL, NULL),
