  ('10a2b337-d656-5c3f-8bca-f491da3364d9'::uuid, '16741a61-d276-5117-8087-a7195b8cf498'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'criteria', TRUE, 19, 4, NULL),
  ('c9f17015-a151-5431-86cc-9a3ccc5a6306'::uuid, '1692eb0e-d1ea-5266-90a9-4713c434b317'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'The brain controls not only mental processes but also regulates vital functions like heartbeat and breathing.', FALSE, 0, NULL, NULL),
  ('3adc915f-67c2-5c80-b531-70123d1774aa'::uuid, '1692eb0e-d1ea-5266-90a9-4713c434b317'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'The human brain is an incredibly complex organ, consisting of over 100 billion neurons.', FALSE, 1, NULL, NULL),
  ('4e3cfbd5-ec0a-5741-b2dc-79d37a40dfb7'::uuid, '1692eb0e-d1ea-5266-90a9-4713c434b317'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'These neurons communicate through intricate networks, forming the basis of our thoughts, emotions, and behaviors.', FALSE, 2, NULL, NULL),
  ('f064da6c-5630-5d87-9974-15fe50bf0be8'::uuid, '1692eb0e-d1ea-5266-90a9-4713c434b317'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'Therefore, understanding the brain is a major focus of modern science, as it holds the key to unlocking mysteries of neurological and psychological conditions.', FALSE, 3, NULL, NULL),
  ('56f71490-a94e-591c-b7df-47bd8605b93e'::uuid, '16bc6b8f-460a-5cb8-a3b6-d685c52487da'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'According to the giant impact hypothesis, our moon formed as the result of the last of a series of "giant impact" mergers between planetary embryos that eventually formed the Earth.', FALSE, 0, NULL, NULL),
  ('8c15b53c-a1e9-5013-bb8d-430ea9fe9745'::uuid, '16bc6b8f-460a-5cb8-a3b6-d685c52487da'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'In this last collision, one embryo was nearly Earth-sized and the other approximately Mars-sized.', FALSE, 1, NULL, NULL),
  ('1035976f-1dc2-53fb-8614-498d87c84ff2'::uuid, '16bc6b8f-460a-5cb8-a3b6-d685c52487da'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'The precursors to the current four rock planets – Mercury, Venus, Earth and Mars – appear to have been dozens of smaller bodies known as "planetary embryos".', FALSE, 2, NULL, NULL),
  ('9feb200a-91fb-5223-921e-6cc77f06a8c6'::uuid, '16bc6b8f-460a-5cb8-a3b6-d685c52487da'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'For more than 30 years, the prevailing view of the formation of our moon has been the "giant impact hypothesis".', FALSE, 3, NULL, NULL),
  ('81f9c88b-d8e0-59dd-97fb-424f5fe3cd0f'::uuid, '16bda75f-adfe-5e07-922b-34a51b292286'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'Their ability to detect electrical impulses helps them locate prey even in murky waters.', FALSE, 0, NULL, NULL),
  ('b3221d93-de83-56ee-aec9-3dc88fc52a9a'::uuid, '16bda75f-adfe-5e07-922b-34a51b292286'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'Great white sharks are apex predators, known for their efficient hunting strategies.', FALSE, 1, NULL, NULL),
  ('9e33ec8a-30f1-51ab-ac49-a4823f50b382'::uuid, '16bda75f-adfe-5e07-922b-34a51b292286'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'Nevertheless, overfishing and habitat destruction are threatening their populations.', FALSE, 2, NULL, NULL),
  ('bd718412-d6f9-5da5-aea6-18cc540941f6'::uuid, '16bda75f-adfe-5e07-922b-34a51b292286'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'These human activities disrupt the delicate balance of marine ecosystems, posing a risk not only to great white sharks but also to the overall health of oceanic food chains.', FALSE, 3, NULL, NULL),
  ('1dc1024c-bc15-58aa-a2e0-f2613cf69940'::uuid, '16e16e4a-1c0a-51bb-b1b2-9ddb49c5e247'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'Anthropologists have disagreed for some time regarding when and how fire was first used in prehistoric times. Recent findings have now managed to finally persuade them that it was used before they thought and the principle use of fire was for cooking rather than any other purpose.', FALSE, 0, NULL, NULL),
  ('c78bee14-354b-5561-a66a-1c8c3c9f9646'::uuid, '16e16e4a-1c0a-51bb-b1b2-9ddb49c5e247'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'Scientists believe they are now nearer to finding an answer to the question of when humans first started to use fire, and it is much earlier than had been thought. Nevertheless, there is still some disagreement among researchers around what early humans actually used the fire for.', TRUE, 1, NULL, NULL),
  ('2ab01b91-74a6-5bf6-8f89-39989ae009f7'::uuid, '16e16e4a-1c0a-51bb-b1b2-9ddb49c5e247'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'There has been much discussion by anthropologists about when humans started to use fires. As a result of a recent discovery it is thought that they started to make fires 300,000 years ago, but the reason they made them is still not clear.', FALSE, 2, NULL, NULL),
  ('d6919744-bbe8-52a3-817f-e438856b0382'::uuid, '16e16e4a-1c0a-51bb-b1b2-9ddb49c5e247'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'Recent findings have convinced the anthropological community that previous conclusions from research done over many decades was correct in estimating when early humans started to use fire although this research was incorrect in its findings about what fire was used for.', FALSE, 3, NULL, NULL),
  ('72cfd830-0377-5e2a-8c89-1bb884a02cfd'::uuid, '16e43b79-8f62-5524-a1a0-612ab2b4ccad'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'peak', FALSE, 0, 0, NULL),
