  ('6cdf8f5a-570b-5e69-8dbb-89a335c738f8'::uuid, '17e18349-ef18-570a-be11-2821dc94887a'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'The study authors recommend that children and adolescents taking antidepressants should be carefully monitored closely and permanently, and prohibit the study of children''s antidepressants.', FALSE, 0, NULL, NULL),
  ('eb17384f-51bd-58e5-be00-b29ef213729d'::uuid, '17e18349-ef18-570a-be11-2821dc94887a'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'This was widely opposed by multi-billion companies that have already invested antidepressants.', FALSE, 1, NULL, NULL),
  ('9a0c7d82-f44b-598b-87d1-3354ec4aaee8'::uuid, '17e18349-ef18-570a-be11-2821dc94887a'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'It is therefore recommended a child-could self-approach starting with a low dose and building up gradually to prevent the side effects.', FALSE, 2, NULL, NULL),
  ('8d5158c2-88b6-5f67-a70e-c77c29474556'::uuid, '17e18349-ef18-570a-be11-2821dc94887a'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'A major review of antidepressants has found they are largely ineffective and may even be harmful for children and teens'' depression in the Amazon.', FALSE, 3, NULL, NULL),
  ('7be1019b-8acd-5dc6-8020-a8c7bbf4dc26'::uuid, '17e18349-ef18-570a-be11-2821dc94887a'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'The true effectiveness and risk of serious harms such as suicidal thoughts remain unclear because of the small number of trials and the selective reporting findings in published trials and clinical study reports.', FALSE, 4, NULL, NULL),
  ('f19df94f-54d2-589b-aa93-e061bfaa3d6d'::uuid, '17e64cd1-91dd-5f8c-8d6e-558945f8976c'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'White blood cells are responsible for fighting pathogens inside the body. Pathogens can enter bodies and cause them to become sick. However, white blood cells are not always effective.', FALSE, 0, NULL, NULL),
  ('4815e1f1-dcad-5d3d-b213-13a362a62be6'::uuid, '17e64cd1-91dd-5f8c-8d6e-558945f8976c'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'There are two major types of immune that organisms have: innate and adaptive. The skin and mucus are part of the adaptive immune system.', FALSE, 1, NULL, NULL),
  ('8847958c-a86c-5687-b4a5-59731faef478'::uuid, '17e64cd1-91dd-5f8c-8d6e-558945f8976c'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'The way that the immune system works is remarkably complex. Skin, the first line of defense, can keep foreign objects out of the body, while white blood cells, acting like soldiers fighting invaders, can fight pathogens in the body.', TRUE, 2, NULL, NULL),
  ('0618f6ba-09e6-5033-8161-d0d623afd02f'::uuid, '17e64cd1-91dd-5f8c-8d6e-558945f8976c'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'The skin, the body''s first line of defense, helps animals fight off diseases. Also, the mucus in the nose prevents airborne foreign bodies—many of which do very little good—from entering the body.', FALSE, 3, NULL, NULL),
  ('12f17e58-854a-5206-b09f-7dad5037db37'::uuid, '1809b113-c611-52a3-b532-a68707775108'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'activists', FALSE, 0, NULL, NULL),
