  ('8c3e1abb-469a-5c06-9185-fdf75065b8b2'::uuid, '3fc7809a-08f8-5174-9078-fd6a33303b1a'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'To purchase a home', TRUE, 3, NULL, NULL),
  ('0bf5c80d-bc41-563d-932c-53551cba6226'::uuid, '3fe8ba98-cb46-5a1e-b1ac-9956aa8aafdb'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'The lecture about phonics method is discussed by going into details on individual learning methods. A student who learns to read with the phonics method might have a smaller vocabulary than normal.', FALSE, 0, NULL, NULL),
  ('447a0406-0fa3-569a-9872-54198820b958'::uuid, '3fe8ba98-cb46-5a1e-b1ac-9956aa8aafdb'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'By using flashcards properly, the students learn the letters and which sounds each one makes. Teachers, first, teach their students the alphabet and then teach the students how letters can blend together.', FALSE, 1, NULL, NULL),
  ('a28b3b5b-763f-5a75-bc63-7f0eeaf1478e'::uuid, '3fe8ba98-cb46-5a1e-b1ac-9956aa8aafdb'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'The professor would focus on two of four methods of teaching reading: phonics and look-and-say. The phonics method renders students the ability to teach him or herself new words, while the look-and-say methods may use flashcards.', TRUE, 2, NULL, NULL),
  ('b400b93c-3abd-57ce-adf8-060e73d7d081'::uuid, '3fe8ba98-cb46-5a1e-b1ac-9956aa8aafdb'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'Everyone needs to know how to read and there are four primary ways to teach reading. Specifically, students do not learn the alphabet with the phonics method because it teaches students new word slowly.', FALSE, 3, NULL, NULL),
  ('317447af-dbfe-50ef-b216-ae871d22d486'::uuid, '3ff88fb8-f07d-54e7-95a3-f7d45c3fd6a2'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'By the beginning of World War II, many towns and cities had built airports, and there were numerous qualified pilots available.', FALSE, 0, NULL, NULL),
  ('e4005f84-f8ae-5f7c-a779-947355548707'::uuid, '3ff88fb8-f07d-54e7-95a3-f7d45c3fd6a2'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'During the 1920s and 1930s great progress was made in the field of aviation, including the first transatlantic flight of Alcock and Brown in 1919, Charles Lindbergh''s solo transatlantic flight in 1927, and Charles Kingsford Smith''s transpacific flight the following year.', FALSE, 1, NULL, NULL),
  ('90c8e1b1-095f-5f18-9573-b00999566918'::uuid, '3ff88fb8-f07d-54e7-95a3-f7d45c3fd6a2'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'One of the most successful designs of this period was the Douglas DC-1, which became the first airliner to be profitable carrying passengers exclusively, starting the modern era of passenger airline service.', FALSE, 2, NULL, NULL),
  ('87005a27-3c08-5354-8451-7ce902db25f4'::uuid, '3ff88fb8-f07d-54e7-95a3-f7d45c3fd6a2'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'The war brought many innovations to aviation, including the first jet aircraft and the first liquid-fueled rockets.', FALSE, 3, NULL, NULL),
  ('c6f16706-adbb-5211-8cdc-45a07550040e'::uuid, '400047af-a744-5320-8a23-639fd5843804'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'Julia Bocking''s Literacy and Dads (LADS) project aims to increase the number of fathers participating as literacy helpers in K-1 school reading programs at Queanbeyan Primary Schools.', FALSE, 0, NULL, NULL),
  ('4d66023f-542d-54ab-8f55-a1e2dab8f7e5'::uuid, '400047af-a744-5320-8a23-639fd5843804'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'A University of Canberra student has launched the nation’s first father-led literacy project, to encourage fathers to become more involved in their children’s literacy.', FALSE, 1, NULL, NULL),
