  ('0b5ac30d-f28b-513c-9454-4917d8fb1e64'::uuid, '50380f95-d77e-5d2a-8c01-982c3c606995'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'knowledge', TRUE, 5, NULL, 2),
  ('1b4cfc32-f59f-50b3-9a4e-16d85b718659'::uuid, '50380f95-d77e-5d2a-8c01-982c3c606995'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'involves', TRUE, 6, NULL, 3),
  ('e8e09b2b-04b1-5385-a517-3bdeea2d5fa3'::uuid, '506570ae-bbd9-51d6-aa90-58caf23ef78a'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'The Repeat Photography Project was born.', FALSE, 0, NULL, NULL),
  ('ba98c952-39e8-5cf1-a9e0-7b4b5080fc00'::uuid, '506570ae-bbd9-51d6-aa90-58caf23ef78a'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'It was a light bulb moment: Why not use the old photos to create a timeline of the morphing glaciers, and add new photos every year?', FALSE, 1, NULL, NULL),
  ('6c795bfe-a535-5090-b1ac-b1db02f92f53'::uuid, '506570ae-bbd9-51d6-aa90-58caf23ef78a'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'Over the years, countless photos of the majestic park have been snapped, and many of those have become part of the park''s official archive, spanning over a century.', FALSE, 2, NULL, NULL),
  ('ef4f4381-17f2-5c8a-8bf6-deca797c56c7'::uuid, '506570ae-bbd9-51d6-aa90-58caf23ef78a'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'In 1997 Lisa McKeon, a physical scientist with the United States Geological Survey who works in the park, came across a pair of historic photographs depicting the glaciers she studies.', FALSE, 3, NULL, NULL),
  ('7a6654c3-0f60-52ad-a48d-ad0007b0d8d5'::uuid, '5082c135-5dd0-5aae-841f-67ad8d840de7'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'People are now living under great stress, so we are facing severe mental illness that can cost us a lot. To solve this problem, it is suggested that we have a strong relationship with others, and try our best not to fear or hate ourselves when we are feeling unwell.', FALSE, 0, NULL, NULL),
  ('bb8c3525-ef20-5985-8d68-499929721406'::uuid, '5082c135-5dd0-5aae-841f-67ad8d840de7'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'There is no need that we should feel well all the time: we can feel disappointed or upset sometimes. We need to find the right relationship with our illness so that it does not cause us too much concern. So we don’t necessarily fear or hate it when we feel unwell.', TRUE, 1, NULL, NULL),
  ('dd3bb42e-788a-5cda-9cd2-c497718e1fce'::uuid, '5082c135-5dd0-5aae-841f-67ad8d840de7'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'A freakish and pitiable possibility is that when we are feeling unwell, we are more likely to get deranged. Then, our mind allows us to be more worried and afraid. How bad this situation is largely depends on whether we can reach a more authentic kind of sanity or not.', FALSE, 2, NULL, NULL),
  ('b747c9b9-3e8b-5a28-bba2-664e8cfd7d19'::uuid, '5082c135-5dd0-5aae-841f-67ad8d840de7'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'The idea that we should at all costs and at all times be well alleviates our mental illness. Although we can feel deranged occasionally, this is not a normal state. Feeling ill is not proper, useful or dignified, so it implies that we need to rely on a right relationship to deal with it.', FALSE, 3, NULL, NULL),
  ('2dd86050-3f9f-5f6e-88ee-5a6fd253f767'::uuid, '509090cb-5357-5ad1-b4b3-0eea9c9807b6'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'A cup is a small, typically cylindrical vessel used for drinking liquids such as water, tea, or coffee.', FALSE, 0, NULL, NULL),
  ('d8c978d9-bc1b-54b7-8d96-dd765bf186dd'::uuid, '509090cb-5357-5ad1-b4b3-0eea9c9807b6'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'Its design includes a handle on one side to hold it comfortably.', FALSE, 1, NULL, NULL),
  ('a201a58b-bf56-5264-a0ee-72df6ad8190a'::uuid, '509090cb-5357-5ad1-b4b3-0eea9c9807b6'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'Therefore, the choice of cup material is often determined by the beverage it''s intended for.', FALSE, 2, NULL, NULL),
  ('b2ddd730-d39d-515a-9c3d-c91b35d30cf6'::uuid, '509090cb-5357-5ad1-b4b3-0eea9c9807b6'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'The material of a cup can vary from ceramic, glass, plastic, to metal, each affecting the taste and temperature retention of the drink.', FALSE, 3, NULL, NULL),
