  ('1f849c58-5245-5ed9-badb-94d40ba175b7'::uuid, '632569b5-abf5-56ce-b859-fda5c1da08a4'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'few', TRUE, 4, NULL, 0),
  ('71986833-ac2d-5cf7-9fb9-15f047915fda'::uuid, '632569b5-abf5-56ce-b859-fda5c1da08a4'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'shelves', TRUE, 5, NULL, 2),
  ('68f60382-db5b-5910-b0a5-b89e8c1af366'::uuid, '632eeffa-1dc8-50a5-9726-3c33fa01e985'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'The major difference that not a lot of school children in England can relate to is that school kids in Australia would sometimes walk and go to school barefoot.', FALSE, 0, NULL, NULL),
  ('c748f3ac-668b-57b5-8f29-605fc39b6844'::uuid, '632eeffa-1dc8-50a5-9726-3c33fa01e985'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'In Australia, school uniforms really started to become a thing in the 1920''s.', FALSE, 1, NULL, NULL),
  ('9fb4ad48-84c1-5863-9c60-ee130c6b23cc'::uuid, '632eeffa-1dc8-50a5-9726-3c33fa01e985'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'These first uniforms very closely reflected those of the school uniforms in England.', FALSE, 2, NULL, NULL),
  ('20a63f0d-26b2-5192-bf22-9c0dfe7ba784'::uuid, '632eeffa-1dc8-50a5-9726-3c33fa01e985'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'After the Second World War, however, the style of the Australian school uniforms became much more casual.', FALSE, 3, NULL, NULL),
  ('74fd9a6c-4455-5be7-988a-5666791963f9'::uuid, '632f8df0-9bc5-555b-8de7-10d978d5e808'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'The favorite patterns for trousers were strong plaids, stripes and checks. The loose straight cut came in about the 1860s, and front creases in the 1880s. By the turn of the century, they had become the common way to dress.', FALSE, 0, NULL, NULL),
  ('04dda4d4-b6e5-5759-bd6a-cb534bd5be01'::uuid, '632f8df0-9bc5-555b-8de7-10d978d5e808'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'It was Ceorge "Beau" Brummell, the champion of simple English style, who started a trend for wearing tight black trousers in the early 1800s.', FALSE, 1, NULL, NULL),
  ('0edd0c23-9775-51f1-aaf7-876ccab9249c'::uuid, '632f8df0-9bc5-555b-8de7-10d978d5e808'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'Jackets didn’t become fashionable for casual wear until the 1850s. The jacket was derived from the short jacket worn by boys and working men, and in the age of mass-production and ready-made suits, its simple style was easier to produce than the tailored coat.', FALSE, 2, NULL, NULL),
  ('8741304a-e438-57a3-9b13-9e9a33b77597'::uuid, '632f8df0-9bc5-555b-8de7-10d978d5e808'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'By 1817, trousers were shoe-length. Popular with the king, they became accepted as standard daywear by 1825, and were worn with a waistcoat and, by day, a frock coat, but with a tailcoat in the evening.', FALSE, 3, NULL, NULL),
  ('dd31d40a-3fe4-5b42-ae82-3c87484eb9eb'::uuid, '63508252-d281-516d-8a64-5b3a6ebe0691'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'The response of the Arctic to climate change will have an unprecedented impact on how the Arctic ecosystem operates.', FALSE, 0, NULL, NULL),
  ('3fd240e1-1658-5cc0-895d-665ee79f4ef9'::uuid, '63508252-d281-516d-8a64-5b3a6ebe0691'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'With the Arctic the fastest-warming region on the planet, climate change is already altering key components of the Arctic environment.', FALSE, 1, NULL, NULL),
  ('9f5e88cf-c957-5f53-9c37-1a57fd820884'::uuid, '63508252-d281-516d-8a64-5b3a6ebe0691'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'Some of the clearest signs of change are the thinning and retreat of sea ice and the migration of species into the Arctic that normally live at lower latitudes.', FALSE, 2, NULL, NULL),
  ('c191f454-f4c8-5bfc-a7b2-39d26b551017'::uuid, '63508252-d281-516d-8a64-5b3a6ebe0691'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'This is likely to affect the UK''s climate and economy, with anticipated impacts on industries like tourism and fisheries.', FALSE, 3, NULL, NULL),
  ('e6168612-1969-5317-9ee8-fe7d7d86d6c3'::uuid, '636912b6-77a2-55dc-ad3e-89803718db58'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'On the one hand, genetically modified crops can offer higher yields, improved nutritional content, and resistance to pests and diseases.', FALSE, 0, NULL, NULL),
  ('a6910fed-5f99-5d80-bec7-17928d4087e6'::uuid, '636912b6-77a2-55dc-ad3e-89803718db58'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'This makes it capable of addressing food security challenges.', FALSE, 1, NULL, NULL),
  ('b5246224-8998-5b21-8476-1e8b3e21a0a8'::uuid, '636912b6-77a2-55dc-ad3e-89803718db58'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'Genetic modification of crops has been a subject of intense debate.', FALSE, 2, NULL, NULL),
