  ('d6eca918-e2d9-5ec1-9d3d-7ce4a634e7f7'::uuid, '70d358a5-e189-5db0-b63e-8a6c435a944b'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'The body''s way of trying to protect skin from burning is by producing melanin.', FALSE, 0, NULL, NULL),
  ('1f7e7d05-6791-5baf-91c8-35475e12b693'::uuid, '70d358a5-e189-5db0-b63e-8a6c435a944b'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'Most cases of skin cancer are linked to exposure to ultraviolet radiation.', FALSE, 1, NULL, NULL),
  ('f363758f-067f-5341-a61f-0a094c59a985'::uuid, '70d358a5-e189-5db0-b63e-8a6c435a944b'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'The vaccine could help people boost their defenses against skin cancer.', FALSE, 2, NULL, NULL),
  ('38bef178-dcce-51a7-b1bb-c2c96ae116bf'::uuid, '70d358a5-e189-5db0-b63e-8a6c435a944b'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'Skin cancer is the most common cancer in the United States, and Melanoma is the least deadly form of skin cancer.', TRUE, 3, NULL, NULL),
  ('37340a54-a134-58bc-b34c-c3a4202fe587'::uuid, '70d358a5-e189-5db0-b63e-8a6c435a944b'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'Ultraviolet radiation from the sun certainly causes skin cancer.', TRUE, 4, NULL, NULL),
  ('61dc3c7a-8e1f-5176-ba8f-61fc25c90059'::uuid, '70e631f9-5f98-5b4c-a3af-eff6ba1f7448'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'Whether buildings are beautiful or not does not have any influence on people'' lives. Beauty is a clear definition which everyone knows.', FALSE, 0, NULL, NULL),
  ('445edda4-c406-543c-b43e-62af1a0fc413'::uuid, '70e631f9-5f98-5b4c-a3af-eff6ba1f7448'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'London is a modern city, where there is no ugly buildings. All the supermarkets and streets are very beautiful, because everyone who lives there knows what ''beautiful'' is.', FALSE, 1, NULL, NULL),
  ('92703908-ce3a-5010-bfd2-cd16850bd5a7'::uuid, '70e631f9-5f98-5b4c-a3af-eff6ba1f7448'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'Ugly buildings can impact people who live around them, even for hundreds of year. Beautiful is a very hard thing to define, as no one really knows what beautiful is.', TRUE, 2, NULL, NULL),
  ('fa21f10a-5374-542c-9efa-a10698d3f2f9'::uuid, '70e631f9-5f98-5b4c-a3af-eff6ba1f7448'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'Ugly buildings have absolutely no impact on people''s daily lives, and the concept of beauty in architecture is a clear and universally understood definition.', FALSE, 3, NULL, NULL),
  ('c656975d-5986-5a7d-b5dc-ba7905bf9739'::uuid, '71018514-60d0-5b06-85a4-2f867e9a205b'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'This cycle is vital for sustaining life on Earth, but it is being disrupted by climate change, affecting weather patterns and water availability.', FALSE, 0, NULL, NULL),
  ('ad184ac3-e146-52fb-a542-62d0da578716'::uuid, '71018514-60d0-5b06-85a4-2f867e9a205b'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'This water vapor condenses into clouds, which travel across the globe.', FALSE, 1, NULL, NULL),
  ('0148b30e-d837-5794-a9c0-b245c85caa50'::uuid, '71018514-60d0-5b06-85a4-2f867e9a205b'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'The sun''s heat causes water from oceans, lakes, and rivers to evaporate into the air.', FALSE, 2, NULL, NULL),
  ('d060b6ea-ca98-5f32-860b-988af7ffac9b'::uuid, '71018514-60d0-5b06-85a4-2f867e9a205b'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'When these clouds become heavy enough, precipitation occurs in the form of rain or snow, replenishing water in the earth''s ecosystems.', FALSE, 3, NULL, NULL),
  ('9a410c6e-7812-52b3-a7e3-c607b7ebcdb0'::uuid, '714305a7-a4b5-5d5d-b829-0bb195031860'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'Towards the end of the 19th century, Latin American poetry began to gain popularity.', FALSE, 0, NULL, NULL),
  ('9c83cc82-2560-5d7d-9f3f-ac73b35cdcb8'::uuid, '714305a7-a4b5-5d5d-b829-0bb195031860'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'By the start of the 20th century, several important writers that would set the stage for the Latin American Boom had begun publishing work.', FALSE, 1, NULL, NULL),
  ('23c3aac6-f991-5b80-b681-970c9f3a4697'::uuid, '714305a7-a4b5-5d5d-b829-0bb195031860'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'Before the arrival of European colonists, literary activity among Latin America’s indigenous populations consisted mostly of oral storytelling traditions.', FALSE, 2, NULL, NULL),
  ('a0399a42-9128-5ded-a546-a5bf6156d6b9'::uuid, '714305a7-a4b5-5d5d-b829-0bb195031860'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'By the start of the 19th century, writers were beginning to generate works considered the foundational literary texts of Latin America.', FALSE, 3, NULL, NULL),
  ('153a11af-ae20-5f69-8f62-1b4621c2b113'::uuid, '714305a7-a4b5-5d5d-b829-0bb195031860'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'Later, the European arrivals began to produce texts describing their experiences in the region and the process of colonization.', FALSE, 4, NULL, NULL),
