  ('3fe7a053-4280-5d23-95f9-a9ca915dba82'::uuid, '86579571-9d74-54cd-a4f7-2ba3419d3afd'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'On the other hand, literary criticism offers deeper analysis and contextual understanding of texts.', FALSE, 0, NULL, NULL),
  ('edcb9e56-904d-557c-9156-e94fe1c7974b'::uuid, '86579571-9d74-54cd-a4f7-2ba3419d3afd'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'On the one hand, reviews in newspapers, magazines, and online platforms guide readers'' choices and can influence a book’s popularity.', FALSE, 1, NULL, NULL),
  ('52463a0f-9e34-55c5-a52a-39a95a98cfc3'::uuid, '86579571-9d74-54cd-a4f7-2ba3419d3afd'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'Thus, both reviews and criticism play vital roles in the dialogue surrounding books and literature.', FALSE, 2, NULL, NULL),
  ('b5cb2120-258e-5138-a0f4-08998d4d1dd7'::uuid, '86579571-9d74-54cd-a4f7-2ba3419d3afd'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'The role of book reviews and literary criticism is significant in the literary world.', FALSE, 3, NULL, NULL),
  ('82ed5614-3e4b-5a33-8053-9a98766b51b4'::uuid, '865fa41e-9735-5e86-86cb-4ad92b1a3c5c'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'The Norwegian Government is doing its best to keep the oil industry under control. A new law limits exploration to an area south of the southern end of the long coastline; production limits have been laid down (though these have already been raised); and oil companies have not been allowed to employ more than a limited number of foreign workers.', FALSE, 0, NULL, NULL),
  ('c3b99761-30f1-516e-9b46-925a3391256a'::uuid, '865fa41e-9735-5e86-86cb-4ad92b1a3c5c'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'But the oil industry has a way of getting over such problems, and few people believe that the Government will be able to hold things back for long.', FALSE, 1, NULL, NULL),
  ('dfd83201-f53f-561b-9908-e66fa36a2e56'::uuid, '865fa41e-9735-5e86-86cb-4ad92b1a3c5c'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'Ever since the war, the Government has been carrying out a program of development in the area north of the Arctic Circle. During the past few years this program has had a great deal of success: Tromso has been built up into a local capital with a university, a large hospital and a healthy industry.', FALSE, 2, NULL, NULL),
  ('0d4a5354-fc3b-5e12-821a-1b8259c08c72'::uuid, '865fa41e-9735-5e86-86cb-4ad92b1a3c5c'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'As one Norwegian politician said last week: "We will soon be changed beyond all recognition."', FALSE, 3, NULL, NULL),
