  ('318988b7-322b-5a57-a684-2a5faa2bbdf3'::uuid, 'a1642198-3695-536e-9410-5a1a448c4f7e'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'resign', TRUE, 6, NULL, 2),
  ('6b9db855-794f-5c72-8610-5db38142363f'::uuid, 'a1642198-3695-536e-9410-5a1a448c4f7e'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'repeat', FALSE, 7, NULL, NULL),
  ('2d1f7c34-3acf-5c9a-af08-17f0833a2f4d'::uuid, 'a173e0a5-d595-5f69-ae3d-a122a1b8b137'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'A young man has at last plucked up courage to invite a dazzling young lady out to dinner. She has accepted his invitation and he is overjoyed.', FALSE, 0, NULL, NULL),
  ('d84e4b53-842f-5503-b365-cfeb977d98d4'::uuid, 'a173e0a5-d595-5f69-ae3d-a122a1b8b137'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'When they get to the restaurant, he discovers that this ethereal creature is on a diet. She mustn''t eat this and she mustn''t that.', FALSE, 1, NULL, NULL),
  ('caa01852-fee0-5fe5-8b46-6bb6570eee21'::uuid, 'a173e0a5-d595-5f69-ae3d-a122a1b8b137'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'Here''s a familiar version of the boy-meets-girl situation.', FALSE, 2, NULL, NULL),
  ('84a1605e-f8ad-5aee-887b-b75640aca341'::uuid, 'a173e0a5-d595-5f69-ae3d-a122a1b8b137'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'He is determined to take her to the best restaurant in town, even if it means that he will have to live on memories and hopes during the month to come.', FALSE, 3, NULL, NULL),
  ('d228c652-3bb6-55bc-8b6f-e2e1df05e192'::uuid, 'a173e0a5-d595-5f69-ae3d-a122a1b8b137'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'Oh, but of course, she doesn''t want to spoil his enjoyment. Let him by all means eat as much fattening food as he wants: it''s the surest way to an early grave. They spend a truly memorable evening together and never see each other again.', FALSE, 4, NULL, NULL),
  ('a06b4057-0365-5b0c-8668-3c289c04b63d'::uuid, 'a18fb68b-eecd-5014-b426-d69c18fa3f4d'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'Once you develop a good study routine, the whole act of studying becomes easier too.', FALSE, 0, NULL, NULL),
  ('ddc00ecb-14a6-5ab4-96f4-3a1a9da80549'::uuid, 'a18fb68b-eecd-5014-b426-d69c18fa3f4d'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'For example, by reading a lot, not only do you learn tons of new things, but you also expand your vocabulary.', FALSE, 1, NULL, NULL),
  ('9e39dffa-f89d-518d-ac6b-813054237e8f'::uuid, 'a18fb68b-eecd-5014-b426-d69c18fa3f4d'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'We often talk about how brains are kind of like muscles: they can be trained.', FALSE, 2, NULL, NULL),
  ('0c5b8626-1cd4-51af-b5e3-c988e134aab0'::uuid, 'a18fb68b-eecd-5014-b426-d69c18fa3f4d'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'It’s the same with studying.', FALSE, 3, NULL, NULL),
  ('ca32fbe5-6e30-5517-93ba-1f738f32a818'::uuid, 'a1bf27fc-ea7d-5fc5-8781-f605a37f1c72'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'While the west side''s view wasn''t quite so impressive, the engineers generously chalked that up to centuries of dirt and grime.', FALSE, 0, NULL, NULL),
  ('aa622b34-6604-51c4-a0ab-cb1d7fcc43e5'::uuid, 'a1bf27fc-ea7d-5fc5-8781-f605a37f1c72'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'The question was this: did the railway''s creator, Isambard Kingdom Brunel, really have the tunnel carved in such a way that when the sun rose on his birthday—April 9th—it would be flooded with light?', FALSE, 1, NULL, NULL),
  ('94b7d0ee-055a-5c86-b817-f6f0f5027a09'::uuid, 'a1bf27fc-ea7d-5fc5-8781-f605a37f1c72'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'"When you look from the east portal, the cutting provides a lovely V-shape," communications manager Paul Gentleman told the Guardian.', FALSE, 2, NULL, NULL),
  ('03d426af-275c-5ac9-8c7e-c2ad7ee6a6b7'::uuid, 'a1bf27fc-ea7d-5fc5-8781-f605a37f1c72'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'Ever since the completion of the Great Western Railway, in the 1840s, intrigue has swirled around the Box Tunnel, a long, steep bypass near Bath, England.', FALSE, 3, NULL, NULL),
  ('d24dbf13-3238-5a74-a077-9b4cf78e52f0'::uuid, 'a1bf27fc-ea7d-5fc5-8781-f605a37f1c72'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'This past Sunday, April 9th, the railway''s current engineers decided to test the rumor once and for all. They weren''t disappointed.', FALSE, 4, NULL, NULL),
  ('336d7b85-831c-54ef-b6d7-94057a459826'::uuid, 'a1dd411c-37bb-5144-9b73-9b26d93af60e'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'part', FALSE, 0, NULL, NULL),
  ('1074db7f-3e7e-5c3c-a99b-2e49c512e3b3'::uuid, 'a1dd411c-37bb-5144-9b73-9b26d93af60e'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'provoke', TRUE, 1, NULL, 4),
