  ('4766833b-ecc7-5ed3-ac19-89b762cee8c3'::uuid, 'b473b304-1989-5268-9908-e3a137f5d100'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'binge', FALSE, 23, 5, NULL),
  ('8ec1d527-a8dc-5b69-a9e4-16cf4a8930a0'::uuid, 'b4952292-0afd-5898-9779-3dd664c080bb'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'Avocados, though often considered vegetables, are technically fruits.', FALSE, 0, NULL, NULL),
  ('61683fb5-4e2e-5861-a50c-c20f58935268'::uuid, 'b4952292-0afd-5898-9779-3dd664c080bb'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'They are unique for their high healthy fat content, particularly beneficial for heart health.', FALSE, 1, NULL, NULL),
  ('482f2017-5c16-5252-b17b-facb7a337da7'::uuid, 'b4952292-0afd-5898-9779-3dd664c080bb'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'However, their high-calorie content means they should be eaten in moderation as part of a balanced diet.', FALSE, 2, NULL, NULL),
  ('6423be2b-e579-543b-940a-94ed167fe751'::uuid, 'b4952292-0afd-5898-9779-3dd664c080bb'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'Avocados are also versatile in culinary uses, from salads to spreads.', FALSE, 3, NULL, NULL),
  ('4a6d86b6-cfaa-52fd-92ad-08eeb81096f2'::uuid, 'b496b115-a7ad-50d8-953c-9fabdb2eb887'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'In the mid-15th century, Johannes Gutenberg invented the printing press, revolutionizing the spread of information.', FALSE, 0, NULL, NULL),
  ('294af5b4-0d47-553d-b820-9c2cb5f165b1'::uuid, 'b496b115-a7ad-50d8-953c-9fabdb2eb887'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'This invention allowed for the mass production of books, significantly reducing their cost and increasing availability.', FALSE, 1, NULL, NULL),
  ('3bb41fd0-63d8-5596-9802-6f42fcd211b1'::uuid, 'b496b115-a7ad-50d8-953c-9fabdb2eb887'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'As a result, literacy rates began to rise.', FALSE, 2, NULL, NULL),
  ('b6291a3f-8a03-5cb1-b4a5-516242cdd587'::uuid, 'b496b115-a7ad-50d8-953c-9fabdb2eb887'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'Besides, knowledge also became more accessible to the general population.', FALSE, 3, NULL, NULL),
  ('7130129d-5e9e-5f8a-8efa-a6b24e927dcd'::uuid, 'b504973e-5225-58e7-92ef-5d7e1480e165'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'In so doing, they discover that these once remote worlds are themselves earth-like in character.', FALSE, 0, NULL, NULL),
  ('067a2464-ec7e-59ea-8904-0e0dc62f531d'::uuid, 'b504973e-5225-58e7-92ef-5d7e1480e165'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'During this period of scientific revolution, a new literary genre arose, namely that of the scientific cosmic voyage.', FALSE, 1, NULL, NULL),
  ('1f601a84-0914-5c00-bebd-73d44d7b86b5'::uuid, 'b504973e-5225-58e7-92ef-5d7e1480e165'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'Scientists and writers alike constructed fantastical tales in which fictional characters journey to the moon, sun, and planets.', FALSE, 2, NULL, NULL),
  ('c4119aef-b3d4-50f7-adf1-a9b38c57e1f8'::uuid, 'b504973e-5225-58e7-92ef-5d7e1480e165'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'The expanding influence of Copernicanism through the seventeenth century transformed not only the natural philosophic leanings of astronomers but also the store of conceptual material accessible to writers of fiction.', FALSE, 3, NULL, NULL),
  ('767356ea-e76d-54f3-ab8e-5859ab836561'::uuid, 'b504973e-5225-58e7-92ef-5d7e1480e165'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'Descriptions of these planetary bodies as terrestrial in kind demonstrate the seventeenth century intellectual shift from the Aristotelian to the Copernican framework.', FALSE, 4, NULL, NULL),
  ('bc576d9b-4fce-5939-8fc5-54bae5bd830d'::uuid, 'b507d3bd-4617-5cf5-a9a0-9fbf3131af4b'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'Unlike baking soda which extends the leavening process, baking powder can accelerate the process.', TRUE, 0, NULL, NULL),
  ('3ac10d48-f1f1-54e3-a568-f6fd5b157779'::uuid, 'b507d3bd-4617-5cf5-a9a0-9fbf3131af4b'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'Baking powder is different from baking soda in that the former combines the latter with two acids.', FALSE, 1, NULL, NULL),
  ('6827c32c-9482-5665-b2ee-928d8dd26bcc'::uuid, 'b507d3bd-4617-5cf5-a9a0-9fbf3131af4b'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'Upon contacting with yogurt, baking soda immediately releases carbon dioxide bubbles, causing the baked goods to change.', FALSE, 2, NULL, NULL),
  ('8bde8622-7221-5084-aefe-26a1aadf70a6'::uuid, 'b507d3bd-4617-5cf5-a9a0-9fbf3131af4b'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'Temperature and moisture are necessary for the sodium aluminum sulfate to react with the sodium bicarbonate.', FALSE, 3, NULL, NULL),
