  ('4f305c47-7c2a-520f-867a-3204d7897775'::uuid, 'b87bd199-ad1f-5e55-b015-5ae3d2ecc162'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'clouds', FALSE, 6, NULL, NULL),
  ('2282f078-ef79-56e2-9e39-8b75a624536c'::uuid, 'b87bd199-ad1f-5e55-b015-5ae3d2ecc162'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'planting', TRUE, 7, NULL, 2),
  ('615e8561-9625-5b7e-a5c2-05f7e9d2e7fe'::uuid, 'b8806d44-522e-5290-b2f4-138248f7683c'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'Intriguingly, they also communicate through seismic signals, detecting vibrations through their feet.', FALSE, 0, NULL, NULL),
  ('9b2846ea-89b5-578a-ac0b-7e2c9c6afcf7'::uuid, 'b8806d44-522e-5290-b2f4-138248f7683c'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'Consequently, conservation efforts must consider the importance of communication spaces for elephants.', FALSE, 1, NULL, NULL),
  ('ab43b21f-648c-50f8-b4c1-5ac292cbfd00'::uuid, 'b8806d44-522e-5290-b2f4-138248f7683c'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'Although these communication methods are well-adapted for long-range interaction, human activities like deforestation are disrupting their habitats.', FALSE, 2, NULL, NULL),
  ('6df9bc9a-3fba-5c2a-84b0-7142c7c226ff'::uuid, 'b8806d44-522e-5290-b2f4-138248f7683c'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'They use a range of vocalizations and body movements to communicate.', FALSE, 3, NULL, NULL),
  ('16f47b75-16ee-5aaf-99ad-c08714e343aa'::uuid, 'b8806d44-522e-5290-b2f4-138248f7683c'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'African elephants are known for their advanced communication skills.', FALSE, 4, NULL, NULL),
  ('63e4db72-9296-55ac-a18d-0be4ceb8bf2b'::uuid, 'b89288b0-2725-5733-8f9c-0ab4e2c2ce28'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'When you feel that your partner doesn’t care about you or respect you, you may simply write down your feelings to let him or her know. This can handle your conflicts in a peaceful way, because both parties will not feel so overwhelmed.', FALSE, 0, NULL, NULL),
  ('f2533125-05f1-58cd-ba81-4c2023cb1c4e'::uuid, 'b89288b0-2725-5733-8f9c-0ab4e2c2ce28'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'People raised by caregivers instead of their parents tend to avoid communication with their partners. In this case, their partners are encouraged to communicate with them more actively to let them feel safe and finally become willing to communicate.', FALSE, 1, NULL, NULL),
  ('139447a5-9fcc-54db-8581-2b598bbbc2f6'::uuid, 'b89288b0-2725-5733-8f9c-0ab4e2c2ce28'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'Different people have different communication styles, so you need to understand your partner’s style. You can even write down your feelings if you have difficulties when communicating verbally. Communication also needs compromise, so make sure you are patient when seeking for the best way to communicate with her or him.', TRUE, 2, NULL, NULL),
  ('b179d2d4-af70-5a24-9419-e916e71cf24d'::uuid, 'b89288b0-2725-5733-8f9c-0ab4e2c2ce28'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'Some people struggle with verbal communication, because they lack the confidence to communicate with others, especially with their partners. To solve this issue, they are suggested to communicate less frequently to reduce the stress caused by communication.', FALSE, 3, NULL, NULL),
  ('9aff53d3-e47c-5f36-a0d7-40d3b39e15e6'::uuid, 'b8b291d3-623b-51c5-baa2-925808ae7da0'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'If you ever swallow a razor blade, don’t panic.', FALSE, 0, NULL, NULL),
  ('69661f81-b884-57de-9915-d38db11578fc'::uuid, 'b8b291d3-623b-51c5-baa2-925808ae7da0'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'The human body is more capable than you think.', FALSE, 1, NULL, NULL),
  ('99cce334-048a-5f88-b9c4-0f20eec85f44'::uuid, 'b8b291d3-623b-51c5-baa2-925808ae7da0'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'Acids are ranked on a scale from 0 to 14 — the lower the pH level, the stronger the acid.', FALSE, 2, NULL, NULL),
  ('90705181-143e-56e7-b2f1-04698153ba74'::uuid, 'b8b291d3-623b-51c5-baa2-925808ae7da0'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'That’s just one of many fun facts about the human body you never learned in school.', FALSE, 3, NULL, NULL),
  ('b4e8c5db-a773-5484-9f8c-54db526cb86d'::uuid, 'b8b291d3-623b-51c5-baa2-925808ae7da0'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'Human stomach acid is typically 1.0 to 2.0, meaning that it has an incredibly strong pH.', FALSE, 4, NULL, NULL),
  ('56e388b7-26c1-57ed-96f9-168d15426f9a'::uuid, 'b8e9fb96-e49b-5818-82c4-71123e45b069'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'But in Scotland three banks are still allowed to issue banknotes.', FALSE, 0, NULL, NULL),
  ('dfc1c1e2-db68-5ab6-aaa1-34b403790ef0'::uuid, 'b8e9fb96-e49b-5818-82c4-71123e45b069'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'The first Scottish bank to do this was the Bank of Scotland.', FALSE, 1, NULL, NULL),
  ('a12841b2-8444-59b6-8fb4-0ca941e51d0f'::uuid, 'b8e9fb96-e49b-5818-82c4-71123e45b069'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'To face growth of trade it was deemed necessary to remedy this lack of an adequate currency.', FALSE, 2, NULL, NULL),
  ('b8e63e44-eb86-5f03-afc9-8b953435ef71'::uuid, 'b8e9fb96-e49b-5818-82c4-71123e45b069'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'In most countries it is only the government, through their central banks, who are permitted to issue currency.', FALSE, 3, NULL, NULL),
  ('9aeede1d-b452-52e4-af67-4182cb3d5f2b'::uuid, 'b8e9fb96-e49b-5818-82c4-71123e45b069'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'When this bank was founded in 1695, Scots coinage was in short supply and of uncertain value, compared with English, Dutch, Flemish or French coin.', FALSE, 4, NULL, NULL),
  ('a83fb978-404c-59e7-bbc2-6818ee444e9b'::uuid, 'b8fbd340-dbcc-5a87-9ba2-82bbef2db86c'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'Global cooling has taken place on Earth in the past and the Little Ice Age lasted from around 1300 to 1800. Some scientists think changes in Earth’s orbit make the temperature drop, and a lack of sunspots might affect temperatures on Earth.', TRUE, 0, NULL, NULL),
  ('57f44305-a6b1-561c-bfa7-96762b9ec864'::uuid, 'b8fbd340-dbcc-5a87-9ba2-82bbef2db86c'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'The temperatures in the Northern and Southern hemispheres decreased during the Little Ice Age. There was less rain in summer during this period, which resulted in a lack of food.', FALSE, 1, NULL, NULL),
  ('c97a02c2-e7f0-5484-82d7-88631c6ceec6'::uuid, 'b8fbd340-dbcc-5a87-9ba2-82bbef2db86c'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'Global cooling will occur soon due to sunspots, which will further result in the average temperatures on Earth dropping. As a result, the ice pack in the Arctic Ocean will grow larger and move south.', FALSE, 2, NULL, NULL),
  ('91dbceec-a889-54cc-9aec-a943c843dc1b'::uuid, 'b9034e86-06c9-575b-98a1-acb7b2596183'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'original', TRUE, 0, 0, NULL),
