  ('7bcec2d5-742e-574b-a006-c148d511cf4d'::uuid, 'de4eaad6-41cc-505d-87e5-d699d40e6646'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'A conversation at close range as well as a rock band at close range could contribute to hearing loss. However, long term exposure to jet engineer made people get used to noise and wouldn’t cause hearing loss as rock band does.', FALSE, 1, NULL, NULL),
  ('75fe1cd9-87e3-568a-b3e2-36c716a1fcaf'::uuid, 'de4eaad6-41cc-505d-87e5-d699d40e6646'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'The danger zone of hearing loss are discussed, ranging from 30 decibels to 100 decibels. All this noise can damage the delicate hearing cells.  As a result,  a person with hearing loss can''t hear voice.', FALSE, 2, NULL, NULL),
  ('13033a4f-e661-5734-96b7-3493a047684f'::uuid, 'de4eaad6-41cc-505d-87e5-d699d40e6646'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'Loss of hearing are caused by exposure to noise over a long window of time. At 90 decibels level,  people have risk of hearing loss begin. Lots of everyday life can damage your hearing, for examples, long term exposure to rock bands and jet engines.', TRUE, 3, NULL, NULL),
