  ('18fb459f-c46f-5092-9fe7-2c1ab5be5e12'::uuid, 'e6a63c3e-17ce-509b-9169-d6923fedf6fb'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'To launch oneself on a great career, a person needs to be very ambitious and insightful. Even in the calm and easy circumstance, he or she has to pay attention to even the slightest variation in the market, which changes fast in the modern era.', FALSE, 0, NULL, NULL),
  ('008f8781-11aa-5c42-a515-67b0fb84ec6d'::uuid, 'e6a63c3e-17ce-509b-9169-d6923fedf6fb'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'What is haunting inhabitants of democracies is dissatisfaction of political inequality. The Americans will not feel melancholy until all the prerogatives of birth and fortune have been abolished. They will feel safer and happier when everything is more or less level.', FALSE, 1, NULL, NULL),
  ('ea95f10e-1d64-5c13-9ce4-1b78875f049b'::uuid, 'e6a63c3e-17ce-509b-9169-d6923fedf6fb'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'In the midst of their prosperity, every profession is open to every American. People do not have to envy each other, and they believe a completely equal society is no more a delusion. But people with higher expectations tend to feel more disappointed with life.', FALSE, 2, NULL, NULL),
  ('ddf3d2fd-e863-5020-affc-fdb5163a364f'::uuid, 'e6a63c3e-17ce-509b-9169-d6923fedf6fb'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'By analyzing political equality and envy and expectations and dissatisfaction, De Tocqueville mentioned that when everyone is living in a basically equal environment, even the slightest inequality will be noticed. This is the reason that the Americans are often restless even in a cozy circumstance.', TRUE, 3, NULL, NULL),
  ('a5764d3e-faa8-581b-ab09-cf2dbb5e974c'::uuid, 'e6abf6bf-6616-5a91-bd4c-d7cb21141c4f'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'It is still possible to hold a party because the variant is not as infectious as the others.', FALSE, 0, NULL, NULL),
  ('3fb94972-d67a-52ee-8ab5-c0b694e5146b'::uuid, 'e6abf6bf-6616-5a91-bd4c-d7cb21141c4f'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'Much can be done to protect people, so it is relatively safe to take a holiday.', TRUE, 1, NULL, NULL),
  ('7e2a3036-303f-55cc-ad9a-582a71ade80d'::uuid, 'e6abf6bf-6616-5a91-bd4c-d7cb21141c4f'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'It is recommended that people should stay at home and avoid going outside.', FALSE, 2, NULL, NULL),
  ('74fc49af-68bc-5a85-88e8-3725f9ee6c6b'::uuid, 'e6abf6bf-6616-5a91-bd4c-d7cb21141c4f'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'She is not sure whether people should go out and reunion with their friend.', FALSE, 3, NULL, NULL),
