  ('5499f496-4a01-5dbd-b60b-c29836d2e5f5'::uuid, 'eb05d9cb-f343-53fc-9058-2849a004a4d4'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'more', TRUE, 7, NULL, 3),
  ('2f7e3eed-9999-5541-8041-1c08c207a348'::uuid, 'eb2d572c-2f6a-55b1-aabe-df81970fcff1'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'Additionally, social media allows for targeted advertising and direct communication with consumers.', FALSE, 0, NULL, NULL),
  ('611f7ee2-6d83-5005-b01e-3385f1fd1cb8'::uuid, 'eb2d572c-2f6a-55b1-aabe-df81970fcff1'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'The advent of digital marketing has largely transformed traditional sales methods.', FALSE, 1, NULL, NULL),
  ('bfd4d569-4a5a-5603-a94f-060c95456ffd'::uuid, 'eb2d572c-2f6a-55b1-aabe-df81970fcff1'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'For instance, online platforms provide new channels for reaching and engaging customers.', FALSE, 2, NULL, NULL),
  ('ddfca8bb-ebf7-5c1d-b3f1-889ddcaa9efa'::uuid, 'eb2d572c-2f6a-55b1-aabe-df81970fcff1'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'However, the digital landscape also brings challenges like increased competition and the need for tech-savvy sales strategies.', FALSE, 3, NULL, NULL),
  ('93c88ac3-0dbc-5521-8fb5-3b5d11de6cc1'::uuid, 'eb5550f7-6236-5380-9e1d-46d1a84215df'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'The construction methods and the city''s role in the region’s trade networks are not fully understood.', FALSE, 0, NULL, NULL),
  ('31f1afb5-f5e4-575e-8c61-b760827991e6'::uuid, 'eb5550f7-6236-5380-9e1d-46d1a84215df'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'Built in the 11th century, it was the capital of the Kingdom of Zimbabwe during the country’s Late Iron Age.', FALSE, 1, NULL, NULL),
  ('f1970077-0470-5b5e-a312-dcc9e8afc6f0'::uuid, 'eb5550f7-6236-5380-9e1d-46d1a84215df'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'The Great Zimbabwe is an ancient city in the southeastern hills of Zimbabwe.', FALSE, 2, NULL, NULL),
  ('fcaa1e55-f7a7-54d9-8deb-b76d3769a80b'::uuid, 'eb5550f7-6236-5380-9e1d-46d1a84215df'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'Furthermore, the reasons for its eventual abandonment remain a mystery.', FALSE, 3, NULL, NULL),
  ('04d32f03-0581-5208-8a7b-209243132020'::uuid, 'eb5af1a9-c2bd-5e7e-b97e-069f604b4860'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'They only write about institutions.', FALSE, 0, NULL, NULL),
  ('3d129f5c-34fa-59be-8d03-58602fd6950d'::uuid, 'eb5af1a9-c2bd-5e7e-b97e-069f604b4860'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'They tend to focus on only one aspect of political systems.', TRUE, 1, NULL, NULL),
  ('3682464a-72bf-5b0d-a6cb-7c54042c4f51'::uuid, 'eb5af1a9-c2bd-5e7e-b97e-069f604b4860'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'Being university-based forces them to specialize.', TRUE, 2, NULL, NULL),
  ('b3e13050-b64e-5f17-aab0-05d76e75c5e0'::uuid, 'eb5af1a9-c2bd-5e7e-b97e-069f604b4860'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'They ask largely irrelevant questions.', FALSE, 3, NULL, NULL),
  ('01c3d913-d0c9-5304-860f-bfb6010b6389'::uuid, 'eb5af1a9-c2bd-5e7e-b97e-069f604b4860'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'They follow the example of 19th century writers.', FALSE, 4, NULL, NULL),
  ('2123129b-ac01-5ce4-8e05-465499ea1a6b'::uuid, 'eb6303e9-b112-5eb7-a9ba-9386905e88c6'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'The speaker talks about the use of memory in Proust''s novel In Search of Lost Time and how memories are usually brought about by the taste or smell of something, in this case, a biscuit dipped in tea. So, it is the senses that provoke memories that can take us back to our childhood.', FALSE, 0, NULL, NULL),
  ('e37bdce7-14dd-5e31-b696-2826d70c50fa'::uuid, 'eb6303e9-b112-5eb7-a9ba-9386905e88c6'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'Using the writer Proust as an example, the speaker tells us how long-term memory works before going on to talk about short-term memory. Distant memories are usually involuntary and are brought to mind by something that stimulates one of the senses. Short-term memory also requires sensory input, but it lasts only a fraction of a second.', FALSE, 1, NULL, NULL),
  ('bb7ad1d9-6ca9-5981-9ac4-86edb97f4058'::uuid, 'eb6303e9-b112-5eb7-a9ba-9386905e88c6'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'What we experience is processed by the brain into memories in three stages. First, there is the sensory input, which is momentary. This is then stored in the short-term memory. If this experience is important or meaningful to us, we will reinforce the memory, possibly by repetition, and it will then be stored in the long-term memory.', TRUE, 2, NULL, NULL),
  ('7f1246e9-b95d-522e-8190-c290240c9171'::uuid, 'eb6c8a33-416b-5369-b4c9-3049ec9a5310'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'spotted', TRUE, 0, 0, NULL),
